# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A `svc-ai-litellm` gateway is the single model entrypoint.** It exposes one OpenAI-compatible `/v1` endpoint and routes to backends via its `model_list`. No consumer addresses a provider directly."
msgstr "**A ya `svc-ai-litellm` Njia ya kuingia ni njia pekee ya kuingia.** Inaunganisha moja kwa moja OpenAI `/v1` njia na njia za kurudi nyuma kupitia `model_list`. Hakuna mtumiaji anayewasiliana moja kwa moja na mtoa huduma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A `svc-ai-lmstudio` role is added as a routable backend, x86/GPU node only.** It deploys LM Studio in headless server mode (`lms server`, OpenAI-compatible API) and registers behind the gateway. LM Studio has no arm64 Linux server build, so it MUST be pinned to an x86 (typically GPU) node via placement constraint and MUST NOT be scheduled onto the Raspberry Pi / arm64 agent nodes of [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md). LM Studio ships primarily as a desktop GUI; the role MUST use its headless/server mode, and the README MUST document the container caveat (GPU passthrough, licensing/model-download constraints)."
msgstr "**A ya `svc-ai-lmstudio` Inachukuliwa kama backend ya kawaida, x86GP . . ..** Inatumia LM Studio Mfumo wa Uendeshaji wa Serverless (`lms server`, OpenAI-Contributors API) Nyuma yake ni Kamishna wa TRA Mhe. CCM haina mkono64 Linux server kujenga, hivyo ni lazima pinned kwa x86 (Kwa kawaida GPU) node kupitia uwekaji kikwazo na LAZIMA kuwa uliopangwa kwenye Raspberry Pi / mkono64 Wafanyakazi wa nodes [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md). LM Studio meli hasa kama desktop GUI; jukumu LA LAZIMA kutumia hali yake ya kichwa / server, na README LA LA LAZIMA hati pango la chombo (GPU kupita, leseni / model-download vikwazo)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A blocked mode is NEVER a reason to silently switch to another.** If a mode cannot run (the swarm NFS wedge below, a wedged daemon, a missing host capability), STOP the whole sweep, report the blocker together with the exact recovery command, and wait for it to be cleared. You MUST NOT fall back to a `modes=compose`-only (or any reduced) sweep to look productive: it hides the unmet swarm parity and never satisfies the compose-AND-swarm gate. Resume the full sweep only once the blocker is gone."
msgstr "**Njia iliyozuiliwa kamwe sio sababu ya kubadili kimya kwa mwingine.** Kama njia haiwezi (Kundi la NFS lilianguka chini, daemon ya mvua, uwezo wa jeshi kukosa), Kuacha kufagia nzima, kuripoti blocker pamoja na amri halisi ya kufufua, na kusubiri kwa kuwa kufutwa. Huwezi kurudi nyuma kwa A `modes=compose`Kuwa (au kwa kiwango kidogo.) Kufagia kuangalia uzalishaji: Inaficha usawa wa kundi la unmet na kamwe haifurahii lango la kuandika-AND-swarm. Resume kufagia kamili mara tu blocker ni gone."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A change in `services.hugo.source_version`** invalidates the clone, which invalidates `COPY ./services/repository/` in the Dockerfile, which triggers a fresh `hugo` build on the next deploy."
msgstr "**Mabadiliko katika `services.hugo.source_version`** Na kwa upande wake, Mbunge wa Jimbo la Ludewa Mhe. `COPY ./services/repository/` katika chumba cha baridi, ambayo hufunika ngozi `hugo` Kuendeleza mwelekeo wa mbele."

