# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A request stays inside the deployment while a local model can serve it.** A prompt can carry a credential, so locality is its own rank above price rather than a consequence of local models happening to be free. `services.litellm.router_remote_fallback` defaults to `false`: while any local route is deployed, a request no local model can take is refused with its reason instead of reaching a third party, and the refusal names the switch that would allow it. With no local route deployed the rule does not apply, because there would be nothing to hold the request on."
msgstr "**Ombi hukaa ndani ya kupelekwa wakati mfano wa ndani unaweza kutumika.** Haraka inaweza kubeba credential, hivyo eneo ni cheo chake mwenyewe juu ya bei badala ya matokeo ya mifano ya ndani yanayotokea kuwa bure. `services.litellm.router_remote_fallback` Kushindwa kufanya `false`: Wakati njia yoyote ya mitaa inatumiwa, ombi hakuna mfano wa ndani unaoweza kuchukua linakataliwa kwa sababu yake badala ya kufikia mtu wa tatu, na majina ya kukataa kubadili ambayo yataruhusu. Kwa kuwa hakuna njia ya ndani iliyotumiwa kanuni hiyo haitumiki, kwa sababu hakutakuwa na chochote cha kushikilia ombi hilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A role may narrow the pool.** `meta/services.yml.<primary_entity> .architectures` lists what the role can run on, next to `modes`, because both state a capability rather than a testing preference. The row draws from the intersection of the run's pool with the declarations of the role and of every role the deploy planner brings up for that variant, because the deploy pulls those in too; an empty intersection aborts the matrix."
msgstr "**Kazi inaweza kupunguza pengo.** `meta/services.yml.<primary_entity> .architectures` kueleza ni hatua gani zinaweza kuchukuliwa, baada ya `modes`, Kwa sababu zote mbili zina uwezo badala ya upendeleo wa kupima. Mstari huchota kutoka kwa makutano ya bwawa la kukimbia na matangazo ya jukumu na ya kila jukumu ambalo mpangaji wa kupeleka huleta kwa lahaja hiyo, kwa sababu kupelekwa huvuta wale pia; makutano matupu hutoa tumbo."

