msgid "**Adapter in front of the sidecar:** The ``gitea-mcp`` sidecar runs as compose service ``giteamcpupstream`` on the role’s own network only, so nothing but the adapter reaches it. It answers ``initialize`` and ``tools/list`` to any caller because it holds no credential of its own and expects each client to supply a Gitea token per request, which makes it unsafe to expose directly. The adapter is what authenticates: a client presents the ``mcp_bearer`` credential and is refused with 401 otherwise, and the adapter presents the minted Gitea token upstream via ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY``."
msgstr "**Sehemu nyingi za kukaa Sidecar:** Kwa kuwa ``gitea-mcp`` Sidecar anaendesha kama huduma ya kutengeneza ``giteamcpupstream`` kwenye mtandao wa mhusika mwenyewe, kwa hivyo hakuna chochote isipokuwa adapta inaifikia. Majibu yake ``initialize`` Aidha, na ``tools/list`` kwa simu yoyote kwa sababu haina uaminifu wake mwenyewe na inatarajia kila mteja kutoa Gitea tia saini kwa maombi, ambayo inafanya kuwa salama kufichua moja kwa moja. adapter ni nini inathibitisha: mteja anatoa ``mcp_bearer`` Imani na kukataliwa 401 kinyume na hayo, na badala yake awaombe wananchi Gitea Bonyeza juu kupitia ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY``..."

