# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agent dashboards are public behind proxy + Keycloak OIDC.** `web-app-hermes` and `web-app-openclaw` follow the standard `web-app-*` contract: own canonical domain, reverse-proxy routing, SSO enforced via [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). Hermes uses its native self-hosted OIDC support. OpenClaw's native OIDC is unverified upstream: if absent, the dashboard sits behind the platform's standard auth-proxy pattern (SSO enforced at the proxy, OpenClaw's own token auth staying internal-only). No unauthenticated public surface either way."
msgstr "**Wakala wa Dashibodi ni umma nyuma ya wakala + Keycloak ya OIDC.** `web-app-hermes` Aidha, na `web-app-openclaw` Kufuata kiwango cha `web-app-*` mkataba: mwenyewe uwanja wa kisheria, reverse-proxy routing, SSO kutekelezwa kupitia [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). Hermes hutumia msaada wake wa asili wa OIDC. OIDC ya asili ya OpenClaw haijathibitishwa: ikiwa haipo, dashibodi inakaa nyuma ya muundo wa kawaida wa jukwaa auth-proxy (Na kwa upande wake, Dk. OpenClawHome »Unlabelled » Jinsi ya kuishi ndani ya nyumba pekee)· Hakuna sehemu yoyote ya umma iliyotengwa kwa njia yoyote ile."

