# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Alert rules live in the role that owns the metric.** A role ships its Prometheus rules in *templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2*. The new *alert_rule_roles* lookup includes them only for roles that Prometheus actually scrapes, so a rules file needs no activation check of its own. It must start at the *groups:* item level. OpenBao's seal alert is the first rule to use it."
msgstr "**Sheria za tahadhari huishi katika jukumu ambalo linamiliki metriki.** Meli ya kubeba mizigo yake Prometheus Kanuni katika *templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2*• mpya ya *alert_rule_roles* Ni kwa ajili ya majukumu tu ambayo Prometheus Kwa kweli hupiga, hivyo faili ya sheria inahitaji hakuna ukaguzi wa uanzishaji wake mwenyewe. Ni lazima kuanza katika *Vikundi:* kiwango cha juu. Ufunguzi wazi Tahadhari ya kufungwa kwa Bao ni kanuni ya kwanza ya kuitumia."

