# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**An agent can be provisioned with its own platform user account.** Creating an agent employee optionally provisions a dedicated identity through the platform's existing user mechanism (the `users` lookup, LDAP via [`svc-db-openldap`](../../roles/svc-db-openldap/), SSO via [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/)); no new account system is built. The account is a **non-privileged standard user** by default (never administrator/service-account-with-mutating-tools). When enabled, the agent authenticates as its own user: OIDC login to its dashboard, a distinct mailbox/identity, and MCP calls made with `auth_subject: user` ([025](025-mcp-role-integration.md)) scoped to that account rather than a shared service account. The account is opt-in per agent; its password/token lives in the role's `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` block, never in README or env. An agent MUST also be deployable against an existing account (no forced account creation)."
msgstr "**Wakala anaweza kutolewa na akaunti yake ya mtumiaji wa jukwaa.** Kujenga mfanyakazi wa wakala kwa hiari hutoa utambulisho wa kujitolea kupitia utaratibu wa mtumiaji wa jukwaa uliopo (Kwa kuwa `users` Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi [`svc-db-openldap`](../../roles/svc-db-openldap/), Kwa njia ya [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/))Hakuna mfumo mpya wa akaunti umeundwa. Akaunti ni ya **Mtumiaji wa kawaida** Kwa default (Kamwe msimamizi / huduma ya akaunti-na-mutating-tools)Wakati kuwezeshwa, wakala inathibitisha kama mtumiaji wake mwenyewe: OIDC kuingia kwenye dashibodi yake, sanduku la barua / utambulisho tofauti, na wito wa MCP uliofanywa na `auth_subject: user` ([025](025-mcp-role-integration.md)) Imewekwa kwenye akaunti hii badala ya akaunti iliyoshirikiwa. Akaunti ni kuchagua-katika kwa wakala; password yake /token maisha katika jukumu la `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` Kamwe, kamwe, kamwe katika kusoma au env. Lazima pia kuwa na akaunti ya sasa (Hakuna haja ya kuunda akaunti)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**An engine inside its consumer's project** — matrix with its own postgres, for instance — is started service by service rather than as a whole project, because bringing the project up would start the consumer and the chain refuses to replay while one runs. The discriminator is the dump's volume name against its project name: equal for the central engines (`postgres` in project `postgres`), different for a per-app one (`matrix_database` in project `matrix`)."
msgstr "**Ndani ya mradi wa wateja** matrix na postgres yake mwenyewe, kwa mfano - ni kuanza huduma kwa huduma badala ya mradi mzima, kwa sababu kuleta mradi juu kuanza watumiaji na mnyororo anakataa kucheza wakati mmoja anaendesha. discriminator ni jina la kiasi cha dump dhidi ya jina lake la mradi: sawa kwa injini kuu. (`postgres` Katika Mradi `postgres`), Tofauti kwa ajili ya programu moja (`matrix_database` Katika Mradi `matrix`)..."

