# translation-rejected: **Uamuzi ni wa makusudi, si wa kawaida.** Inafuata
# index ya mstari katika utaratibu wa ugunduzi wa kimataifa na nambari ya
# kufagia, kwa hivyo kurudia kurudia kurudia kufagia huzaa kukimbia. Mfumo
# wenyewe wa ukusanyaji mapato unasisitizwa na `INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SEED`,
# ambayo CI inaweka kwenye kitambulisho cha kukimbia, kwa hivyo meza ya
# mpango, kazi ya kugundua na kila kizuizi cha kukimbia moja hukubaliana bila
# kupitisha hali kati yao.
msgid "**Assignment is deterministic, never random.** It follows the row's index in the global discovery order and the sweep number, so re-running a sweep reproduces the run. Discovery order itself is stabilised by `INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SEED`, which CI sets to the run id, so the plan table, the discover job and every chunk block of one run agree without passing state between them."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Assignment reads the row's position like an odometer.** The distro is the low digit and the filesystem the high one, so consecutive rows walk every pairing instead of a diagonal through it. Turning both on the position directly covers only `n` of the `n x m` pairs whenever the two pools are the same length, and the sweep number does not unlock it, because it shifts both by the same amount."
msgstr "**Inasoma nafasi ya mstari kama odometer.** Distro ni digit ya chini na mfumo wa faili wa juu, safu za mfululizo zinatembea kila jozi badala ya diagonal kupitia hiyo. Kugeuza wote kwenye nafasi moja kwa moja inashughulikia tu `n` Kwa upande wa `n x m` jozi kila wakati mabwawa mawili ni urefu sawa, na idadi sweep haina kufungua, kwa sababu ni zamu wote kwa kiasi sawa."

