# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI deploys only the variants a change reaches.** An image bump in a provider no longer redeploys the variants of its consumers that switch that provider off. The diff-derived whitelist, used by the weekly update PRs, Dependabot and every other diff-driven run, narrows each affected role to the variants whose round closure still reaches a changed role, emitted as *role#0,2* selection tokens. A changed role and a role reached only through *run_after* keep every variant. A pinned token naming a role that discovery does not return now warns instead of aborting the run; role names are still checked against *roles/* before the run starts."
msgstr "**GCS inachukua tu anuwai ya mabadiliko kufikia.** bump picha katika mtoa huduma tena redeploys tofauti ya watumiaji wake kwamba kubadili mtoa huduma hiyo mbali. Whitelist iliyosababishwa, inayotumiwa na sasisho la kila wiki PRs, Dependabot na kila kukimbia nyingine inayosababishwa, hupunguza kila jukumu lililoathirika kwa anuwai ambazo kufungwa kwa pande zote bado hufikia jukumu lililobadilika, iliyotolewa kama *Wajibu wa #0,2* Uchaguzi wa ishara. mabadiliko na jukumu ambalo limetolewa kwa njia ya *run_after* Weka kila aina ya tofauti. ishara pinned naming jukumu kwamba ugunduzi haurudi sasa anaonya badala ya kutoa mimba kukimbia; majina ya jukumu bado kuchunguzwa dhidi ya *Majukumu /* kabla ya kuanza kwa mchezo."

