# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI runner-split.** The deploy-matrix discovery ([axes.py](../../../utils/github/variant/axes.py), wired via [output_apps.sh](../../../scripts/github/resolve/output_apps.sh)) gives every variant its own matrix entry (runner): a 5-variant role becomes five rows `0`…`4`, each carrying the deploy mode and tor state the sweep rotation assigned it. Each runner receives its variant through the `variant` env (consumed by `--variant`). Which rows a given run deploys is decided by the chunker ([chunks.py](../../../cli/meta/ci/chunks.py)), not by bundling."
msgstr "**Kucheza mchezo Split.** Ugunduzi wa Mitrix ([axes.py](../../../utils/github/variant/axes.py), Kwa kupitia [output_apps.sh](../../../scripts/github/resolve/output_apps.sh)) Kila moja ya tofauti zake mwenyewe matrix (Mchezaji)A: ya ya 5Next articleMkataba waendelea kuwa nguzo tano `0`... ... ... ...`4`, Kila moja ya njia hizo ni kwa ajili ya kuuza na kuuza. Kila mchezaji anapata tofauti zake kupitia `variant` ya (Kwa matumizi ya `--variant`). . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . ([chunks.py](../../../cli/meta/ci/chunks.py))Sio kwa kubagua."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI runs a real Tor E2E** (`torsocks curl` against the minted onion) with retry logic; unit tests remain the merge-blocking base."
msgstr "**Yanga yatwaa ubingwa wa Real2ya ya ya** (`torsocks curl` Juu ya Onion) Kwa mantiki ya retry; vipimo vya kitengo bado msingi wa kuunganisha-kuzuia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI selects, resumes and proves.** A fourth deploy chunk stops a short priority chunk stranding budget, a manual run can set the chunk size the formula would derive, and a retrigger can override the chunk gate. Retriggering works by role and by what never got a verdict, resumes behind the green window rather than the deployed one, retires suites the source run already passed, and cancels the run before retriggering its failed roles. Each role's README instructions are replayed on its smallest deploy row, in the mode its *services.yml* declares. Distro images build concurrently on one runner, the matrix job folds into the image job, and the deploy chunks no longer wait on the DNS test."
msgstr "**Chagua, kurudia na kuthibitisha.** Sehemu ya nne ya kupeleka inaacha bajeti fupi ya kuzingatia, kukimbia kwa mwongozo kunaweza kuweka ukubwa wa chunk ambayo formula itapata, na retrigger anaweza kuvuka lango la chunk. Retriggering kazi kwa jukumu na kwa nini kamwe got hukumu, res nyuma ya dirisha kijani badala ya kutumika moja, anastaafu suites chanzo kukimbia tayari kupita, na kufuta kukimbia kabla ya retriggering majukumu yake kushindwa. Maagizo ya kila jukumu la README yanarekebishwa kwenye safu yake ndogo ya kupeleka, katika hali yake *services.yml* kutangaza. Picha za Distro zinajenga wakati huo huo kwenye mkimbiaji mmoja, kazi ya matrix inakua katika kazi ya picha, na chunks za kupeleka hazisubiri tena kwenye mtihani wa DNS."

