# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cleanup between rounds.** Before each non-first iteration the wrapper runs [entity.sh](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/entity.sh) for **every** app in the previous round's include set. The next round therefore boots from an empty host, which guarantees cross-round state coherence: nothing the previous round deployed (whether it stays in the current round's closure or falls out) can leak into round R, so variants are free to disagree on which deps they pull in. The final round is followed by no purge so the last state remains available for inspection or follow-up specs."
msgstr "**Kuunganisha kati ya mzunguko.** Kila kabla ya kupanda mbegu ya kwanza ya mbegu [entity.sh](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/entity.sh) Kwa ajili ya **Kila mmoja kila mmoja** App katika raundi iliyopita ni pamoja na kuweka. Duru ijayo kwa hiyo boots kutoka jeshi tupu, ambayo inahakikisha ushirikiano wa hali ya msalaba: hakuna mzunguko uliopita uliotumika (ikiwa ni pamoja na kufungwa kwa mzunguko wa sasa au kuanguka) Inaweza kuvuja katika mzunguko wa R, kwa hivyo anuwai ni huru kutokubaliana juu ya ni nini kinachoingia. Duru ya mwisho inafuatiwa na hakuna purge hivyo hali ya mwisho bado inapatikana kwa ajili ya ukaguzi au kufuatilia specs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
