# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Configurable remote models:** The published remote models are the ``litellm.remote_models`` list in ``meta/services.yml``, each entry an ``alias``, the LiteLLM ``model`` string and its ``provider``, plus an optional ``context`` in tokens. An inventory replaces the list through ``applications.svc-ai-litellm.services.litellm.remote_models``, and a provider without a key slot aborts the deploy."
msgstr "**Mifano ya Remote:** Orodha ya majina yaliyopendekezwa ni pamoja na ``litellm.remote_models`` Orodha ya ``meta/services.yml``, Kila kuingia ``alias``, Kwa hiyo, ``model`` ya Muungano na yake ``provider``, Zaidi ya hayo, uchaguzi ``context`` kwa hisani ya RaiaMwema Orodha inabadilisha orodha kupitia ``applications.svc-ai-litellm.services.litellm.remote_models``, na mtoa huduma bila slot muhimu hutoa utoaji wa kupeleka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Configurable remote models:** The published remote models are the `litellm.remote_models` list in `meta/services.yml`, each entry an `alias`, the LiteLLM `model` string and its `provider`, plus an optional `context` in tokens. An inventory replaces the list through `applications.svc-ai-litellm.services.litellm.remote_models`, and a provider without a key slot aborts the deploy."
