# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Control is raw device access plus agent code execution; no robotics middleware is mandated.** Hermes drives the hardware by executing code directly against the granted devices (GPIO/I2C/SPI/serial/video libraries), consistent with its self-exploration. This is the deliberate choice over a ROS2/middleware abstraction: the embodied device is already the trust boundary (there is no microVM here), so the agent runs code on the device itself. A middleware layer MAY be added later per robot but is not required by this role."
msgstr "**Udhibiti ni upatikanaji wa kifaa ghafi pamoja na utekelezaji wa msimbo wa wakala; hakuna middleware ya roboti ina mamlaka.** Hermes anatoa vifaa kwa kutekeleza kanuni moja kwa moja dhidi ya vifaa vilivyopewa (GPIO/I2C/SPI/serial/video Maktaba ya Maktaba), sambamba na uchunguzi wake. Huu ni uamuzi wa busara juu ya2/middleware abstraction: kifaa kilichojumuishwa tayari mipaka ya uaminifu (Hakuna cha microchip hapa)Kwa hivyo, wakala anaendesha msimbo kwenye kifaa yenyewe. Safu ya katikati inaweza kuongezwa baadaye kwa roboti lakini haihitajiki na jukumu hili."

