# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**De-dup / loop prevention.** With any future bidirectional bridge, an event mirrored A→B must not echo back B→A. v1 (one-way) sidesteps this, but the record↔event id mapping table introduced in v1 MUST be designed so a future reverse path can detect \"already mirrored\"."
msgstr "**Kuzuia / kuzuia loop.** Na daraja lolote la baadaye la bidirectional, tukio lililoonekana A →B haipaswi kurudi nyuma B → A.1 (Njia moja) Kwa upande huu, lakini meza ya ramani ya rekodi iliyowekwa katika v1 Lazima iwe iliyoundwa ili njia ya nyuma ya baadaye inaweza kugundua \"Tayari macho\"..."

