# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Declared context windows:** A model entry carrying ``context`` publishes it as ``model_info.max_input_tokens``, and an Ollama entry also runs with that window as ``num_ctx`` instead of the server’s default, so a caller’s prompt is not silently truncated."
msgstr "**Maelezo ya Windows:** Mfano wa kuingia ``context`` kuchapisha kama ``model_info.max_input_tokens``, Aidha, mwaka Ollama Aidha, barabara hiyo inajengwa kwa kuzingatia ``num_ctx`` Badala ya default ya seva, kwa hivyo haraka ya simu haipatikani kimya."

