msgstr "**Maelezo ya Windows:** Mfano wa kuingia `context` kuchapisha kama `model_info.max_input_tokens`, Aidha, mwaka Ollama Aidha, barabara hiyo inajengwa kwa kuzingatia `num_ctx` Badala ya default ya seva, kwa hivyo haraka ya simu haipatikani kimya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Declared hardware access:** Every device the agent may drive is listed by the operator and bound into the container; an empty list is refused rather than silently treated as deny-all-but-deployable."
msgstr "**Upatikanaji wa vifaa:** Kila kifaa wakala anaweza kuendesha ni waliotajwa na operator na kufungwa ndani ya chombo; orodha tupu ni kukataliwa badala ya kimya kutibiwa kama kukataa-wote lakini-kutumwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dedicated device only.** Full access is permitted solely on a node whose only tenant is this agent. Forbidden on any shared cluster node (Decision #12)."
msgstr "**Mashine ya kufua tu.** Ufikiaji kamili unaruhusiwa tu kwenye node ambayo mpangaji pekee ni wakala huyu. Kuondolewa kwenye sehemu yoyote iliyoshirikiwa (Uamuzi wa #12)..."

