# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy iteration.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) re-derives the same plan via `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (the planner is a pure function shared between init and deploy) and runs one deploy per folder. **Every round deploys its full variant-aware include set.** Round R starts from a clean host (the previous round's include is purged before round R begins, see point 5), so every dep that round R needs MUST be redeployed."
msgstr "**matumizi ya iteration.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) utekelezaji wa mpango huo kupitia `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (Mpango ni kazi safi iliyoshirikiwa kati ya init na kupeleka) Weka safu moja kwa kila safu. **Kila upande una sehemu yake ya kujifunza.** Mzunguko wa R huanza kutoka kwa mwenyeji safi (Mzunguko uliopita ni pamoja na kutakaswa kabla ya mzunguko wa R kuanza, angalia hatua 5)Kwa hiyo, kila sehemu ambayo R inahitaji kubadilishwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy on an Encrypted Server** You SHOULD install Infinito.Nexus on an encrypted server to prevent hosting providers from accessing end-user data. For a practical guide on setting up an encrypted server, refer to the [Hetzner Arch LUKS repository](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Learn more about [disk encryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Tumia kwenye Server Iliyohifadhiwa** Unaweza kuweka Infinito.Nexus kwenye seva iliyofichwa ili kuzuia watoa huduma wa mwenyeji kupata data ya mtumiaji wa mwisho. Kwa mwongozo wa vitendo juu ya kuanzisha seva iliyosimbwa, rejea kwa [Hetzner Arch LUKS Hifadhi](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐... (Jifunze zaidi kuhusu [Mfumo wa encryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) juu ya Wikipedia.)"

