# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao keeps Vault’s metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, so an alert on ``== 0`` fires permanently. Use ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 while sealed); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` corroborates."
msgstr "**Usiwe na tahadhari ``vault_core_unsealed``...** OpenBao inaweka jina la meta ya Vault, na hutoa node yenye afya isiyo na maji ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, Kwa hivyo, tahadhari juu ya ``== 0`` Moto wa milele. Matumizi ya matumizi ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 Wakati wa kufunga); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` ya corroborates."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on `vault_core_unsealed`.** OpenBao keeps Vault's metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, so an alert on `== 0` fires permanently. Use `/v1/sys/health` (503 while sealed); `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` corroborates."
msgstr "**Usiwe na tahadhari `vault_core_unsealed`...** OpenBao inaweka jina la meta ya Vault, na hutoa node yenye afya isiyo na maji `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, Kwa hivyo, tahadhari juu ya `== 0` Moto wa milele. Matumizi ya matumizi `/v1/sys/health` (503 Wakati wa kufunga); `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` ya corroborates."

