# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Enable state defaults to off; deliberately-wired integrations auto-enable with their partner.** `enabled` is optional and defaults to `false` unless `required: true` is set. An addon that bridges a service MUST derive its effective enablement from that service's `enabled` flag (never a duplicated group-membership expression), so a deliberately-wired cross-role integration activates automatically whenever its partner role is co-deployed (`services.<target>.enabled` is true) and stays off otherwise. Any credential an addon needs is declared in `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` and read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` (Decision 4): auto-generated where possible, or supplied through the same credentials mechanism's manual-entry path where the operator must enter the secret. There is no separate opt-in exception: auto-enable-with-partner holds, and an operator-entered credential resolves through `credentials` like any other. This auto-enable-with-partner rule is distinct from update-automation-discovered addons (Decision 10), which are added hard-off."
msgstr "**Kuwezesha hali default mbali; makusudi-wired ushirikiano auto-kuwezeshwa na mpenzi wao.** `enabled` Ni chaguo la hiari na la kushindwa `false` Isipokuwa kama `required: true` kuwa imewekwa. addon kwamba daraja huduma lazima kupata uwezo wake ufanisi kutoka huduma hiyo `enabled` Bendera ya Volta ya Bendera (Kamwe si maneno ya kundi la duplicate), hivyo ushirikiano wa msalaba unaoendeshwa kwa makusudi huwezesha moja kwa moja kila wakati jukumu la mpenzi wake linashirikiana (`services.<target>.enabled` Ni kweli kuwa) kuondoka kwa njia nyingine. Mahitaji yoyote ya nyongeza yanatangazwa katika `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` Kusoma kupitia `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` (Uamuzi wa uamuzi 4): auto-kuzalishwa ambapo inawezekana, au hutolewa kwa njia ya mwongozo wa kuingia kwa utaratibu huo ambapo operator lazima kuingia siri. Hakuna tofauti kuchagua-katika ubaguzi: auto-kuwezeshwa-na-mshirika ana, na operator-entered credential maamuzi kupitia `credentials` kama nyingine yoyote. Kanuni hii ya auto-kuwezeshwa na mpenzi ni tofauti na update-automation-discovered addons (Uamuzi wa uamuzi 10)ambazo zinazidi kuwa ngumu."

