# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The ``role_id``/``secret_id`` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in ``.applied.json``, then ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` re-pins to this run’s values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. ``custom-secret-id`` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers ``500`` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Kila moja ya njia hizi huzunguka AppRole.** Kwa kuwa ``role_id``Kwa hivyo``secret_id`` Kukimbia sio wale wanaoendesha kesi. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` Inajaribu jozi ya hesabu, inarudi kwenye jozi iliyorekodiwa katika ``.applied.json``, Hivyo basi, kwa ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` Rejea maadili ya kukimbia hii na kuharibu siri ya zamani. Rekodi imeandikwa mwisho, hivyo kukimbia kwamba kufariki partway majani ya kizazi uliopita intact. ``custom-secret-id`` Ilikuwa ni **Sio ya** Idempotent - kuandika upya majibu ya siri ``500`` - Kwa hiyo kubadilishana ni imefungwa juu ya thamani ya kuwa iliyopita."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The `role_id`/`secret_id` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. `tasks/01_init.yml` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in `.applied.json`, then `tasks/06_rotate.yml` re-pins to this run's values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. `custom-secret-id` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers `500` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Kila moja ya njia hizi huzunguka AppRole.** Kwa kuwa `role_id`Kwa hivyo`secret_id` Kukimbia sio wale wanaoendesha kesi. `tasks/01_init.yml` Inajaribu jozi ya hesabu, inarudi kwenye jozi iliyorekodiwa katika `.applied.json`, Hivyo basi, kwa `tasks/06_rotate.yml` Rejea maadili ya kukimbia hii na kuharibu siri ya zamani. Rekodi imeandikwa mwisho, hivyo kukimbia kwamba kufariki partway majani ya kizazi uliopita intact. `custom-secret-id` Ilikuwa ni **Sio ya** Idempotent - kuandika upya majibu ya siri `500` - Kwa hiyo kubadilishana ni imefungwa juu ya thamani ya kuwa iliyopita."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every mounted volume is discarded**, not only the backed-up ones. A volume declared `backup: false` claims to be disposable; a drill that spares it never tests the claim. If its service cannot rebuild it, the health gate goes red — that is the finding, not a false alarm. The single exception is the data directory of an engine whose dump is about to be replayed: it carries the database and its role, which the deploy creates and the container does not, so wiping it would leave `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` with nothing to connect to and the drill would fail at itself instead of at a defect."
msgstr "**Kila kipande cha mkate kilichokatwa**Sio tu wale wanaounga mkono. Kiasi kilichotangazwa `backup: false` Kudai kuwa ni matumizi; kuchimba ambayo inazuia kamwe kuchunguza madai. Ikiwa huduma yake haiwezi kuijenga upya, lango la afya huenda nyekundu - hiyo ni kutafuta, sio kengele ya uongo. Isipokuwa moja ni saraka ya data ya injini ambayo dumping inakaribia kuchezwa tena: inabeba database na jukumu lake, ambalo kupeleka huunda na chombo haifanyi, kwa hivyo kuifuta itaondoka. `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` Hakuna kitu cha kuunganisha na drill itakuwa kushindwa yenyewe badala ya kasoro."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every ref:** Role data, categories, bundles, files and TODO markers for the deployed working tree, any branch, tag or commit of core, and every branch or tag of its forks."
msgstr "**Kila moja ya ref:** Data ya jukumu, makundi, vifungo, faili na alama za TODO kwa mti wa kazi uliotumika, tawi lolote, tag au kujitolea kwa msingi, na kila tawi au tag ya ngome zake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every release:** The latest commit is the default, each release tag is selectable and built on demand."
msgstr "**Kila la heri:** Kujitolea ya hivi karibuni ni default, kila tag ya kutolewa ni kuchaguliwa na kujengwa kwa mahitaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-format
msgid "**Every token pins every axis.** `role#variant@mode+tor|clearnet%distro/filesystem` carries all six, and none is left to the rotation. A run whose rows the rotation is still free to move is not a verification run: the combination that comes back is not the one the question was asked about, and a green row then proves nothing about the red one it was supposed to answer."
msgstr "**Kila moja ya nguzo za nguzo hukatwa.** `role#variant@mode+tor|clearnet%distro/filesystem` Wote ni sita, na hakuna mtu aliyeachwa kwenye mzunguko. kukimbia ambaye safu mzunguko bado ni huru kusonga si kukimbia uhakiki: mchanganyiko kwamba kuja nyuma si moja swali aliuliza kuhusu, na safu ya kijani kisha kuthibitisha chochote kuhusu moja nyekundu ilikuwa wanatakiwa kujibu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Example browser integration**: direct access to the original LittleJS example browser."
msgstr "**Mfano wa Ushirikiano wa browser**• Upatikanaji wa moja kwa moja wa awali LittleJS Mfano wa browser."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**Mfano:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Exception** — names a concrete trip-wire (bug, pitfall, deliberate non-idiomatic choice). Must name the surprise; restating what the next line does is NOT an exception."
msgstr "**Isipokuwa** - Majina ya safari halisi (Bubble, pitfall, uchaguzi wa makusudi usio na maadili). Lazima jina mshangao; restating nini mstari wa pili haina ubaguzi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Exclusionary Behavior:** Do not engage in behaviors or comments that might exclude or isolate community members."
msgstr "**Tabia ya kipekee:** Usishiriki katika tabia au maoni ambayo yanaweza kuwatenga au kuwatenga wanachama wa jamii."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Executable Setup:** Sets proper permissions on the main script."
msgstr "**Ufungaji kamili:** Weka nyaraka sahihi kwa maandishi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Exit the Container:** After completing your user management tasks, exit the Docker container shell by typing `exit`."
msgstr "**Kuhamisha chombo:** Baada ya kukamilisha kazi zako za usimamizi wa mtumiaji, kuondoka shell ya chombo cha Docker kwa kuandika `exit`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Explicit model list:** the aliases come from the inventory, so the agent offers exactly what the gateway serves."
msgstr "**Orodha ya modeli:** Aliases kuja kutoka hesabu, hivyo wakala inatoa hasa nini lango mtumishi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Explicit models:** `ANTHROPIC_MODEL` and `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL` name gateway aliases, because the vendor's own model ids do not exist there."
msgstr "**Mifano ya gharama:** `ANTHROPIC_MODEL` Aidha, na `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL` Jina la lango liliases, kwa sababu ids ya mfano wa muuzaji mwenyewe haipo huko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Explicit models:** ``ANTHROPIC_MODEL`` and ``ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL`` name gateway aliases, because the vendor’s own model ids do not exist there."
msgstr "**Mifano ya gharama:** ``ANTHROPIC_MODEL`` Aidha, na ``ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL`` Jina la lango liliases, kwa sababu ids ya mfano wa muuzaji mwenyewe haipo huko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Explicit, documented opt-in.** Privileged mode is off by default and the README states exactly what the agent can reach."
msgstr "**Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi.** mode Privileged ni mbali na default na README inaeleza hasa nini wakala anaweza kufikia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Exporter `PENPOT_PUBLIC_URI`** is shared from the single role env file (the external HTTPS base URL). Penpot upstream also supports an internal `http://frontend:8080` value; the shared-env contract renders one file for all containers, which the upstream image tolerates."
msgstr "**Usafirishaji wa nje `PENPOT_PUBLIC_URI`** Inashirikiwa kutoka kwa faili moja ya env (URL ya msingi ya HTTPS). Aidha, Mfuko wa Penpot pia unaunga mkono `http://frontend:8080` thamani; mkataba wa pamoja-env hutoa faili moja kwa vyombo vyote, ambayo picha ya upstream inavumilia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Exporter ``PENPOT_PUBLIC_URI``** is shared from the single role env file (the external HTTPS base URL). Penpot upstream also supports an internal ``http://frontend:8080`` value; the shared-env contract renders one file for all containers, which the upstream image tolerates."
msgstr "**Usafirishaji wa nje ``PENPOT_PUBLIC_URI``** Inashirikiwa kutoka kwa faili moja ya env (URL ya msingi ya HTTPS). Aidha, Mfuko wa Penpot pia unaunga mkono ``http://frontend:8080`` thamani; mkataba wa pamoja-env hutoa faili moja kwa vyombo vyote, ambayo picha ya upstream inavumilia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensible Architecture:** Leverage a wide range of extensions and customization options to tailor the wiki experience to your needs."
msgstr "**Usanifu wa ajabu:** Tumia aina mbalimbali za upanuzi na chaguzi za usanifu ili kuunda uzoefu wa wiki kwa mahitaji yako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensible Architecture:** Optional Redis, OpenSearch, and plugin-based IAM integrations."
msgstr "**Usanifu wa ajabu:** Chaguzi za RedisOpenSearch, na ushirikiano wa IAM wa msingi wa Plugin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensible Design:** Acts as a base layer for more specific development stacks (e.g., web, Python, embedded)."
msgstr "**Ubunifu wa hali ya juu:** Kazi kama msingi safu kwa ajili ya maendeleo maalum stacks (Kwa mfano, wavuti, Python, iliyounganishwa)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensible Plugin Framework:** Easily manage and configure hundreds of Nextcloud plugins using the OCC command line tool."
msgstr "**Mfumo mkubwa wa Plugin:** Kusimamia na kusimamia mamia ya Nextcloud Plugins kutumia zana ya amri ya OCC."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensions & Applications:** Extend functionality with hundreds of available XWiki extensions and macros."
msgstr "**Matumizi na matumizi:** Kupanua utendaji na mamia ya inapatikana XWiki Kuongeza na macros."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensive Community and Ecosystem:** Benefit from a massive community with frequent updates, security patches, and a wide range of third-party tools that continuously enhance the platform."
msgstr "**Jamii na Mazingira:** Faida kutoka kwa jamii kubwa na sasisho za mara kwa mara, patches za usalama, na zana mbalimbali za tatu ambazo zinaendelea kuimarisha jukwaa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Extensive Plugin Support:** Enhance your forum with a wide range of plugins and integrations for additional functionality."
msgstr "**Msaada mkubwa wa Plugin:** Kuboresha jukwaa lako na Plugins nyingi na ushirikiano kwa utendaji wa ziada."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External Link Handling**"
msgstr "**Viungo vya nje**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External Link Handling**   Automatically sets `target=\"_blank\"` and `rel=\"noopener\"` on links pointing outside your primary domain to improve security and user experience."
msgstr "**Viungo vya nje** Mipango ya moja kwa moja `target=\"_blank\"` Aidha, na `rel=\"noopener\"` kwenye viungo vinavyoonyesha nje ya kikoa chako cha msingi ili kuboresha usalama na uzoefu wa mtumiaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External PostgreSQL Database:** Configures Pretix to use a centralized PostgreSQL service."
msgstr "**Nje ya Nje PostgreSQL Database:** Takwimu za Pretix Kwa matumizi ya centralized PostgreSQL huduma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External database:** Persist Joomla content in the project's central RDBMS through the standard role-meta wiring."
msgstr "**Database ya Nje:** Endelea kuwa Joomla Maudhui katika RDBMS kuu ya mradi kupitia wiring ya kawaida ya jukumu-meta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External database:** Persist Joomla content in the project’s central RDBMS through the standard role-meta wiring."
msgstr "**Database ya Nje:** Endelea kuwa Joomla Maudhui katika RDBMS kuu ya mradi kupitia wiring ya kawaida ya jukumu-meta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External deps:** an AT Protocol PDS (read/write of calendar records), the AT Protocol relay/firehose for aggregation, and optionally Meilisearch."
msgstr "**Viwango vya nje:** Protokali ya AT PDS (Kusoma / Kuandika kumbukumbu za kalenda), Protokali ya AT Pro relay / moto kwa Meiion, na Meilisearch chaguo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External drift monitoring.** Addon freshness is checked by opt-in external tests under `tests/external/update/addons/`. These tests are warn-only, emit GitHub Actions warning annotations, and are excluded from `make test` in the same way as Docker image and repository-ref external update checks."
msgstr "**Ufuatiliaji wa drift.** Kuongeza freshness checked na opt-in nje vipimo chini `tests/external/update/addons/`. Majaribio haya ni ya kuonya tu, hutoa Hatua za GitHub kuonya annotations, na ni kutengwa kutoka `make test` Kwa njia sawa na picha ya Docker na ukaguzi wa nje-ref."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External/central PostgreSQL and Redis:** rails ``database.yml``, ``resque.yml``, ``cable.yml`` and the workhorse config are pre-rendered by Ansible and mounted read-only."
msgstr "**ya nje / ya kati PostgreSQL Aidha, na Redis:** Barabara ya ``database.yml``, Kwa hivyo, ``resque.yml``, Kwa hivyo, ``cable.yml`` Hivyo basi, ni vyema ukaweka utaratibu wa kusoma na kuandika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External/central PostgreSQL and Redis:** rails `database.yml`, `resque.yml`, `cable.yml` and the workhorse config are pre-rendered by Ansible and mounted read-only."
msgstr "**ya nje / ya kati PostgreSQL Aidha, na Redis:** Barabara ya `database.yml`, Kwa hivyo, `resque.yml`, Kwa hivyo, `cable.yml` Hivyo basi, ni vyema ukaweka utaratibu wa kusoma na kuandika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fail-closed on drift:** A tool contract whose hash no longer matches its pinned ``schema_sha256`` refuses to start."
msgstr "**Kushindwa kwa drift:** Mkataba wa chombo ambao hash tena inafanana na pinned yake ``schema_sha256`` kukataa kuanza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fail-closed on drift:** A tool contract whose hash no longer matches its pinned `schema_sha256` refuses to start."
msgstr "**Kushindwa kwa drift:** Mkataba wa chombo ambao hash tena inafanana na pinned yake `schema_sha256` kukataa kuanza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fails gracefully** with an optional debug message if the Git repository is unreachable."
msgstr "**Kushindwa kwa ukarimu** Kwa mujibu wa taarifa ya Tume ya Uchaguzi, ikiwa Git Uhifadhi ni usiowezekana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notification**"
msgstr "**Kushindwa kutambua**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notification**   Triggers service on failure."
msgstr "**Kushindwa kutambua** Huduma ya triggers juu ya kushindwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notification:** Integrated with ``sys-ctl-alm-compose`` for alerting on failures."
msgstr "**Kushindwa kutambua:** Kuunganishwa na ``sys-ctl-alm-compose`` Tahadhari juu ya kushindwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notification:** Integrated with `sys-ctl-alm-compose` for alerting on failures."
msgstr "**Kushindwa kutambua:** Kuunganishwa na `sys-ctl-alm-compose` Tahadhari juu ya kushindwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notifications:** Leverages **sys-ctl-alm-telegram** to push alerts when the script exits with an error."
msgstr "**Kushindwa kutambua:** Kuwa **sys-ctl-alm-telegram** Ni wakati wa kuwasilisha nyaraka za uwongo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fast Access**: Automatic cache management ensures lightning-fast load times."
msgstr "**Upatikanaji wa haraka**: Usimamizi wa cache moja kwa moja kuhakikisha nyakati za mzigo wa umeme-haraka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Faster gates.** Per-host setup runs once per host instead of once per application, a role's volumes are answered from its own file instead of a whole-tree build, the Keycloak RBAC root group resolves once rather than once per app, the Playwright fixture copy the tree copy already made is dropped, logout helpers wait for a control instead of sleeping, and the OIDC login helper stops waiting out probes that cannot match. Onion timeouts scale by tor flavor instead of a flat multiplier, and every Playwright timeout has one source."
msgstr "**Milango ya haraka zaidi.** Mpangilio wa mwenyeji wa Per-host huendesha mara moja kwa mwenyeji badala ya mara moja kwa kila maombi, kiasi cha jukumu kinajibiwa kutoka kwa faili yake mwenyewe badala ya kujenga mti mzima, Keycloak Kundi la mizizi la RBAC linatatua mara moja badala ya mara moja kwa programu, nakala ya marekebisho ya Playwright ya mti tayari umepigwa, wasaidizi wa vifaa wakisubiri udhibiti badala ya kulala, na msaidizi wa kuingia wa OIDC anaacha kusubiri uchunguzi ambao hauwezi kufanana. Onion timeouts mizani na ladha tor badala ya multiplier gorofa, na kila wakati Playwright ina chanzo kimoja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Feature:** Describe a capability."
msgstr "**Kipengele cha:** Eleza uwezo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Features:**"
msgstr "**Features:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Federated Chess Matches:** Challenge and play with others across the Fediverse."
msgstr "**Kulipwa Chess Wachezaji:** Kushindana na kucheza na wengine kote Fediverse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Federated Communication:** Designed to operate within a federated network, enabling seamless sharing and interconnection with other PeerTube instances."
msgstr "**Mawasiliano ya moja kwa moja:** Iliyoundwa ili kufanya kazi ndani ya mtandao wa kulishwa, kuwezesha kugawana seamlessly na kuunganishwa na wengine PeerTube matukio."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Federated Social Network:** Connects with other BookWyrm instances and ActivityPub platforms."
msgstr "**Mtandao wa kijamii:** Kuunganisha na wengine BookWyrm Matukio na majukwaa ya ActivityPub."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Federated User Lookup:** Invitee search resolves through the Keycloak admin Web API, so any user federated from OpenLDAP into Keycloak becomes findable inside OpenTalk."
msgstr "**Kulipwa User Kuangalia kwa:** Kutafuta ufumbuzi kupitia Keycloak Mtandao wa admin APIKwa hivyo, mtumiaji yeyote aliyesajiliwa OpenLDAP Ndani ya Keycloak kuwa ndani ya OpenTalk..."

