# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flowise 3.1.4** is reconciled through the authenticated `/api/v1/custom-mcp-servers` routes with a scoped identity limited to `tools:create`, `tools:view`, `tools:update` and `tools:delete`. It registers only Streamable HTTP providers: its SSE fallback cannot complete a connection at this pin, so an SSE provider is reported incompatible rather than claimed as registered. The role builds its own image from the pinned npm package, because the published `flowiseai/flowise` tags `3.1.3`, `3.1.4` and `latest` all ship the `flowise` package at version 3.1.2, which serves none of the required routes. Internal connectivity is never solved by globally disabling SSRF protection for all flow authors."
msgstr "**Uhamiaji 3.1.4** Kuunganishwa kwa njia ya kuthibitishwa `/api/v1/custom-mcp-servers` Barabara zilizo na utambulisho wa kipekee `tools:create`, Kwa hivyo, `tools:view`, Kwa hivyo, `tools:update` Aidha, na `tools:delete`. Inajiandikisha watoaji wa HTTP tu: kurudi kwake kwa SSE haiwezi kukamilisha uunganisho kwenye pini hii, kwa hivyo mtoa huduma wa SSE anaripotiwa kuwa hailingani badala ya kudai kama iliyosajiliwa. Jukumu hujenga picha yake mwenyewe kutoka mfuko pinned npm, kwa sababu kuchapishwa `flowiseai/flowise` Maelezo ya mchezo `3.1.3`, Kwa hivyo, `3.1.4` Aidha, na `latest` Meli zote `flowise` Orodha ya matoleo 3.1.2, ambazo hazikidhi mahitaji ya barabara. Uunganisho wa ndani haujawahi kutatuliwa na ulinzi wa kimataifa wa kuzuia SSRF kwa waandishi wote wa mtiririko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flowise cross-agent supervisor is Phase 2, deferred.** The supervisor (Flowise as MCP client delegating to Hermes' MCP-server mode v0.6.0+ and OpenClaw's MCP-server, chaining cross-agent pipelines) is a separate later slice, not the first implementation. Rationale: it depends on the young hermes MCP-server mode and adds a second orchestration tier. The first slice ships each agent standalone; the supervisor design below is retained as the Phase 2 target. Single-agent use MUST always work without Flowise."
msgstr "**Mkurugenzi wa Halmashauri ya Wilaya ya Ludewa Mhe. 2^ Au “msiachwe nyuma.”** Msimamizi wa (Flowise Kama mteja wa MCP anakataa Hermes 'MCP-server mode v0.6.0+ na ya OpenClawMCP-server, kuunganisha mabomba ya waya) Hii ni hatua ya pili, sio hatua ya kwanza. Rationale: inategemea hali ya vijana wa hermes MCP-server na huongeza kiwango cha pili cha orchestration. Meli ya kwanza ya kila wakala wa kawaida; muundo wa msimamizi chini unahifadhiwa kama Awamu 2 malengo. Matumizi ya kawaida lazima yafanyike bila Flowise..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flowise's published images do not contain the version their tag claims:** `3.1.3`, `3.1.4` and `latest` all ship `flowise` 3.1.2, because upstream's Dockerfile runs an unpinned `npm install -g flowise` whose layer the release CI reuses. The role builds from an explicit npm pin and verifies the served route set."
msgstr "**Picha zilizochapishwa za Flowise hazina toleo la madai yao ya tag:** `3.1.3`, Kwa hivyo, `3.1.4` Aidha, na `latest` Meli zote `flowise` 3.1.2, Kwa sababu Dockerfile ya Upstream inaendesha Unpinned `npm install -g flowise` Ni nani aliye na uwezo wa kutoa sadaka? Jukumu linajengwa kutoka kwa pini ya wazi ya npm na inathibitisha njia iliyowekwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flowise's role-local LiteLLM is refactored into the shared role.** The role-local LiteLLM config and container in `web-app-flowise` (`templates/litellm.config.yaml.j2`, its compose service, related env) are removed; Flowise consumes `svc-ai-litellm` instead. No duplicated LiteLLM deployment remains. Flowise stays green after the refactor."
msgstr "**Kazi ya Flowise ya ndani ya LiteLLM imejumuishwa katika jukumu la pamoja.** Home » Unlabelled » UCHAMBUZI WA KITABU NA KITABU » `web-app-flowise` (`templates/litellm.config.yaml.j2`, Huduma yake ya kuandika, kuhusiana na env) Wao huondolewa, na majani huondolewa. `svc-ai-litellm` Badala yake. Hakuna usajili wa kadi ya mkopo. Rangi ya kijani ni kijani baada ya kupanda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
