# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Game Visibility:** Matches and moves can appear in social timelines."
msgstr "**Mchezo uwezekano:** Mechi na hatua zinaweza kuonekana katika nyakati za kijamii."

# translated-by: libretranslate
