# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway backend:** The LiteLLM Gateway publishes those aliases, which are the names Ollama serves too, so the same model name routes to whichever local backend a deployment runs."
msgstr "**Mlango wa nyuma:** Kwa kuwa LiteLLM Gateway majina hayo, ambayo ni majina ya Ollama Pia hutumikia, kwa hivyo jina la mfano lina njia za kila mahali nyuma ya kupelekwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway credentials:** Without Keycloak, access is gated by the LiteLLM UI username and password that the LiteLLM Gateway provisions. That pair keeps working alongside SSO as a break-glass login."
msgstr "**Vyeti vya ITIL:** Bila ya Keycloak, upatikanaji ni lango kwa jina la mtumiaji wa LiteLLM UI na nenosiri ambalo LiteLLM Gateway utekelezaji. Wawili hao wanaendelea kufanya kazi pamoja na SSO kama login ya kuvunja-glass."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway token:** A generated gateway token guards the Control UI and the API, and the Control UI accepts the canonical domain as its only allowed origin."
msgstr "**Mlango wa kuingia:** Mlango wa mlango uliotengenezwa unalinda udhibiti wa UI na API, na Udhibiti UI inakubali uwanja wa kanuni kama asili yake pekee kuruhusiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway-backed:** `ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL` and `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` point the agent at the platform gateway."
msgstr "**Msaada wa Gateway:** `ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL` Aidha, na `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` Bonyeza kiungo kwenye lango la jukwaa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
