msgstr "**Msaada wa Gateway:** ``ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL`` Aidha, na ``ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN`` Bonyeza kiungo kwenye lango la jukwaa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway-backed:** one provider entry, no vendor credentials on the machine."
msgstr "**Msaada wa Gateway:** Kuingia kwa mtoa huduma, hakuna sifa za muuzaji kwenye mashine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway-routed models:** With the LiteLLM Gateway deployed, the agent's model base URL points at that gateway and authenticates with a per-consumer virtual key."
msgstr "**Mifano ya njia za mkato:** Kwa kuwa LiteLLM Gateway Imetumiwa, URL ya mfano wa wakala wa URL inaonyesha kwenye lango hilo na inathibitisha na ufunguo wa kawaida wa watumiaji."

