msgid "**Host:** `_acme-challenge.DOMAIN_PRIMARY`"
msgstr "**Mtumiaji:** `_acme-challenge.DOMAIN_PRIMARY`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**How it works:**"
msgstr "**Jinsi ya kufanya kazi:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**How much each factor counts is a number in `services.yml`, between 0 and 1.** `services.litellm.router_weights` carries one weight per factor: `locality`, `cost` and `speed`. Each factor is scaled to 0..1 *inside the candidate set* before its weight applies, because the raw units do not compare - a per-token price is a millionth of a cent and a rate is tens of tokens per second. A factor whose value is identical across the set scores every route 1 and therefore decides nothing, rather than ranking on a rounding artefact."
msgstr "**Kiasi gani kila kipengele ni idadi katika `services.yml`, Kati ya 0 Aidha, na 1...** `services.litellm.router_weights` Kuchukua uzito mmoja kwa sababu: `locality`, Kwa hivyo, `cost` Aidha, na `speed`. Kila kipengele kinagawanywa kwa 0...1 *ndani ya chama cha mgombea aliyependekezwa* Kabla ya uzito wake inatumika, kwa sababu vitengo vya ghafi havifanani - bei ya wastani ni milioni ya asilimia na kiwango ni makumi ya ishara kwa sekunde. Sababu ambayo thamani yake ni sawa katika alama zilizowekwa kila njia 1 Kwa hivyo, hakuna kitu cha kuchagua, badala ya kuweka kwenye karatasi."

