msgid "**Isolation is gVisor on top of in-app sandboxing; Firecracker is out of reach on this engine.** Each agent app runs under `runtime: runsc`, a userspace guest kernel that intercepts syscalls before they reach the host, so untrusted model-generated code stays kernel-isolated even if the app's own sandbox is bypassed. No custom VMM, jailer wiring, or bespoke rootfs pipeline. E2B/Beam noted as alternatives in the role README but not adopted."
msgstr "**Isolation ni gVisor juu ya sandboxing ndani ya programu; Firecracker ni nje ya kufikia kwenye injini hii.** Kila mtumiaji wa app hii ana `runtime: runsc`, kernel ya mgeni wa mtumiaji ambayo inazuia syscalls kabla ya kufikia mwenyeji, msimbo usioaminika wa mfano unabakia kernel-isolated hata kama sanduku la mchanga la programu limepitishwa. Hakuna desturi VMM, waya wa jela, au bomba la bespoke rootfs. ya ya ya2B / Beam inajulikana kama mbadala katika jukumu la README lakini haijapitishwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Isolation:** Every agent runs in its own container or single-replica service under the isolating runtime, with its own volume, its own network whose only other member is the broker, and its own bearer key; an agent that would start under ``runc`` is stopped and refused."
msgstr "**Uhusiano:** Kila wakala anaendesha katika chombo chake mwenyewe au huduma ya replica moja chini ya kukimbia kwa kutenganisha, na kiasi chake mwenyewe, mtandao wake mwenyewe ambao mwanachama mwingine tu ni broker, na ufunguo wake wa kubeba; wakala ambaye angeanza chini ``runc`` Alidharauliwa na kukataliwa."

