# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak sign-in:** With Keycloak in the deployment, the role sets ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` and the LiteLLM Gateway reads the platform’s OIDC endpoints from ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` and ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Sign in at ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` carries the administrator’s username. LiteLLM serves SSO for up to five accounts in ``litellm_usertable`` and refuses beyond that without ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."
msgstr "**Keycloak Sign-in:** Pamoja na Keycloak Katika utekelezaji wa majukumu hayo, Kamati ya ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` Na kwa kuwa LiteLLM Gateway Angalia matokeo ya OIDC ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, Kwa hivyo, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, Kwa hivyo, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, Kwa hivyo, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` Aidha, na ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Kuingia kwenye ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` Tumia jina la mtumiaji. Akaunti ya SSO hadi akaunti tano katika ``litellm_usertable`` Kukataa kufanya hivyo bila ``LITELLM_LICENSE``..."

