# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP client contract:** With an MCP server deployed alongside it, the role declares the MCP client side of the platform contract as an internal streamable-HTTP client with a read-only tool policy. The deploy registers every discovered provider in the instance-level `/api/v1/custom-mcp-servers` registry under an `infinito:` name, stores the bearer as an encrypted `CUSTOM_HEADERS` `authConfig`, authorizes each entry and compares the discovered tools against the provider's declared allowlist. `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` pins the deployment to URL-based MCP servers, so no flow can spawn a local stdio command. Reaching an MCP server whose URL resolves inside the container network requires `HTTP_SECURITY_CHECK=false` plus an `HTTP_DENY_LIST` that keeps loopback and the cloud-metadata addresses denied; both are rendered only while MCP servers are discovered, and the deploy proves the list is live by pointing a throwaway entry at each denied address. One managed Agentflow fixture calls a single named tool with fixed arguments and is executed on every deploy. Wiring a provider into a flow of your own stays an operator step."
msgstr "**Mkataba wa Wateja wa MCP:** Kwa seva ya MCP iliyotumiwa pamoja nayo, jukumu hilo linatangaza upande wa mteja wa MCP wa mkataba wa jukwaa kama mteja wa ndani-HTTP na sera ya chombo cha kusoma tu. Kujiandikisha kwa kila mtoa huduma aliyegunduliwa katika ngazi ya mfano `/api/v1/custom-mcp-servers` Usajili chini ya `infinito:` Jina la kikoa ni sawa na jina la kikoa. `CUSTOM_HEADERS` `authConfig`, inaruhusu kila kuingia na kulinganisha zana zilizogunduliwa dhidi ya ruhusu ya mtoa huduma iliyotangazwa. `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` Pins kupelekwa kwa seva za MCP za URL, kwa hivyo hakuna mtiririko unaoweza kutoa amri ya stdio ya ndani. Kufikia seva ya MCP ambayo URL inatatua ndani ya mtandao wa chombo inahitaji `HTTP_SECURITY_CHECK=false` Zaidi ya `HTTP_DENY_LIST` Hiyo inaweka kitanzi na anwani za data za wingu zinakataliwa; zote zinatolewa tu wakati seva za MCP zinagunduliwa, na kupelekwa kunathibitisha orodha hiyo inaishi kwa kuashiria kuingia kwa kutupa kwa kila anwani iliyokataliwa. Moja kusimamiwa Agentflow fixture wito moja aitwaye chombo na hoja fasta na ni kutekelezwa juu ya kila kupeleka. Kutafuta mtoa huduma katika mtiririko wa anakaa yako mwenyewe hatua operator."

