# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server contract:** Fronts GitLab's built-in MCP server with the repository-owned adapter. Clients reach `/mcp` on the `gitlabmcp` sidecar; the adapter alone talks to `/api/v4/mcp` upstream, so only the contracted tools are reachable."
msgstr "**Mkataba wa MCP:** Mbele ya GitLabSeva ya MCP iliyojengwa na adapta inayomilikiwa na repository. Wateja wanapata `/mcp` Juu ya `gitlabmcp` Mheshimiwa Spika, kwa hiyo, naomba tu nizungumzie `/api/v4/mcp` ya juu, kwa hivyo tu zana zilizosainiwa zinaweza kupatikana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server contract:** Fronts GitLab’s built-in MCP server with the repository-owned adapter. Clients reach ``/mcp`` on the ``gitlabmcp`` sidecar; the adapter alone talks to ``/api/v4/mcp`` upstream, so only the contracted tools are reachable."
msgstr "**Mkataba wa MCP:** Mbele ya GitLabSeva ya MCP iliyojengwa na adapta inayomilikiwa na repository. Wateja wanapata ``/mcp`` Juu ya ``gitlabmcp`` Mheshimiwa Spika, kwa hiyo, naomba tu nizungumzie ``/api/v4/mcp`` ya juu, kwa hivyo tu zana zilizosainiwa zinaweza kupatikana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server surface:** Serve the ``mcp-server`` plugin’s streamable-HTTP endpoint on the container network, guarded by an administrator API token and limited to the read-only tool default."
