# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP state is a variant axis.** Roles that gain an MCP surface MUST express the enabled/disabled split through `meta/variants.yml` so CI matrix runs cover both states."
msgstr "**Hali ya MCP ni mhimili tofauti.** Majukumu ambayo hupata uso wa MCP LA LAZIMA kuonyesha mgawanyiko uliowezeshwa / uliogawanyika kupitia `meta/variants.yml` Kwa hiyo, Kamati Kuu ya CCM inasimamia mambo yote mawili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP surface is the native `mcp_server` integration under the [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) contract.** The role's `meta/services.yml` declares `mcp` with `direction: server`, `implementation: native`, `transport: streamable_http`, served under the role's canonical origin per 025. No third-party MCP add-on is used when the native integration covers the need."
msgstr "**MCP ni mmea wa asili `mcp_server` Ushirikiano chini ya [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) Mkataba wa.** Wajibu wa `meta/services.yml` Alisema kuwa `mcp` Pamoja na `direction: server`, Kwa hivyo, `implementation: native`, Kwa hivyo, `transport: streamable_http`, kuwa chini ya uongozi wa kamati ya utendaji kwa 025Hakuna nyongeza ya chama cha tatu cha MCP inatumiwa wakati ujumuishaji wa asili unahusisha haja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MTU Configuration:** Deploys a template-based script to set the MTU on all defined internet interfaces."
msgstr "**Ufungaji:** Tumia script ya msingi ya template kuweka MTU kwenye interfaces zote za mtandao zinazofafanuliwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Machine identity:** AppRole is configured independently of human login, so services and automation use their own identities and short-lived tokens instead of a shared administrator token."
msgstr "**Utambulisho wa mashine:** AppRole imeundwa kwa kujitegemea kwa kuingia kwa binadamu, kwa hivyo huduma na automatisering hutumia utambulisho wao wenyewe na ishara za muda mfupi badala ya ishara ya msimamizi wa pamoja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Made Snipe-IT admin bootstrap idempotent** and treated known *users_groups* duplicate constraint errors as non-fatal while keeping strict failure handling for other cases"
msgstr "**Jinsi ya kufanya hivyo katika Outlook** Kuwa na ufahamu *users_groups* makosa ya kuzuia duplicate kama yasiyo ya kawaida wakati wa kuweka utunzaji mkali wa kushindwa kwa kesi nyingine"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Magento (Adobe Commerce Open Source)** is a powerful, extensible e-commerce platform built with PHP. It supports multi-store setups, advanced catalog management, promotions, checkout flows, and a rich extension ecosystem."
msgstr "**Magento (Kituo cha Biashara cha Adobe Open)** Ni jukwaa la nguvu la e-biashara lililojengwa na PHP. Inasaidia mipangilio ya duka nyingi, usimamizi wa juu wa catalog, matangazo, mtiririko wa checkout, na mazingira ya upanuzi wa tajiri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mail-to-ticket:** When ``web-app-mailu`` is present, the ``helpdesk`` mailbox is auto-provisioned and Zammad polls it to create tickets from incoming mail."
msgstr "**Akaunti ya barua pepe:** Wakati ambapo wakati ``web-app-mailu`` Kwa sasa, ``helpdesk`` Simu ya mkononi ni auto-provisioned na Zammad Bonyeza ili kuunda tiketi kutoka kwa barua zinazoingia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mail-to-ticket:** When `web-app-mailu` is present, the `helpdesk` mailbox is auto-provisioned and Zammad polls it to create tickets from incoming mail."
msgstr "**Akaunti ya barua pepe:** Wakati ambapo wakati `web-app-mailu` Kwa sasa, `helpdesk` Simu ya mkononi ni auto-provisioned na Zammad Bonyeza ili kuunda tiketi kutoka kwa barua zinazoingia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mailu-backed delivery** (with authentication tokens), or"
msgstr "**Uwasilishaji wa Mailu-backed** (Kwa mujibu wa uthibitisho), Kwa hivyo, au"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Maintenance & Administration Tools:** Built-in CLI and web-app-based tools to clear caches, manage the database, and monitor application health."
msgstr "**Vyombo vya Usimamizi na Usimamizi:** Kujengwa katika CLI na zana za mtandao wa programu ili kufuta caches, kusimamia database, na kufuatilia afya ya maombi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Maintenance & Cleanup:** Reduced Let’s Encrypt renewal frequency to avoid rate limits, removed deprecated logs and variables, applied broad refactorings, and merged the Matomo autosetup feature."
msgstr "**Uhifadhi na usafi:** Kupunguza Hebu Kuficha mzunguko wa upya ili kuepuka mipaka ya kiwango, kuondolewa magogo yaliyotengwa na vigezo, kutumika refactorings pana, na ilijiunga na mipaka ya kiwango. Matomo Muonekano wa autosetup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Major Changes**"
msgstr "**Mabadiliko makubwa**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manage Inventories Securely** Your inventories for running Infinito.Nexus MUST be managed in a separate repository and secured with tools such as [Ansible Vault](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encryption) 🔒. Sensitive credentials MUST NEVER be stored in plaintext; use a password file to secure these details."
msgstr "**Kusimamia Inventories kwa usalama** Ndoto zako za kugombea Infinito.Nexus lazima kusimamiwa katika hifadhi tofauti na kuhifadhiwa na zana kama vile [Hitilafu mbaya](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encryption) 🔒. Hati za siri hazipaswi kuhifadhiwa kwa maandishi wazi; tumia faili ya nenosiri ili kupata maelezo haya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Managed credentials:** The gateway master key and the admin UI password are generated and kept as role credentials, and the admin UI username is the platform administrator name."
msgstr "**Vyeti vya kuthibitishwa:** Mlango mkuu wa lango na nenosiri la admin UI linazalishwa na kuwekwa kama sifa za jukumu, na jina la mtumiaji wa admin UI ni jina la msimamizi wa jukwaa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manager Defaults:** Deploys custom timeouts via ``timeouts.conf``."
msgstr "**Usimamizi wa default:** Tumia muda wa kawaida kupitia ``timeouts.conf``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manager Defaults:** Deploys custom timeouts via `timeouts.conf`."
msgstr "**Usimamizi wa default:** Tumia muda wa kawaida kupitia `timeouts.conf`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manager-pinned** central on-disk state stays node-local (never on NFS) in swarm."
msgstr "**Meneja wa Mradi** Hali ya ndani ya DCI yaendelea kuwa ya node-local (Sijawahi kuwa mwanachama wa NSSF) ndani ya nguruwe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manager-pinned, stateful:** Single instance per cluster; bypasses swarm task lifecycle so its volume cannot end up on a worker."
msgstr "**Mheshimiwa Mwenyekiti, Mheshimiwa Waziri:** Mfano mmoja kwa kila kikundi; huvuka mzunguko wa kazi ya kundi ili kiasi chake hakiwezi kuishia kwa mfanyakazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manual Update and Log Access**: Provides guidance for viewing logs, accessing containers, and performing manual updates."
msgstr "**Mwongozo wa update na upatikanaji wa kuingia**Inatoa mwongozo kwa magogo ya kutazama, kupata vyombo, na kufanya sasisho za mwongozo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MariaDB data** stays local on the manager node via [svc-db-mariadb](../svc-db-mariadb/) pinning. NFS for the DB data directory is intentionally out of scope for v1 (locking / `fsync` semantics). See 023's Future Extensions."
msgstr "**Data ya MariaDB** katika eneo la Halmashauri ya Wilaya ya Singida kupitia [svc-db-mariadb](../svc-db-mariadb/) ya kupiga. NFS kwa saraka ya data ya DB ni kwa makusudi nje ya upeo wa v1 (Ufungaji / `fsync` semantics ya)Kwa hivyo angalia 023ya siku za usoni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MariaDB data** stays local on the manager node via `svc-db-mariadb <../svc-db-mariadb/>`__ pinning. NFS for the DB data directory is intentionally out of scope for v1 (locking / ``fsync`` semantics). See 023’s Future Extensions."
msgstr "**Data ya MariaDB** katika eneo la Halmashauri ya Wilaya ya Singida kupitia `svc-db-mariadb <../svc-db-mariadb/>`__ ya kupiga. NFS kwa saraka ya data ya DB ni kwa makusudi nje ya upeo wa v1 (Ufungaji / ``fsync`` semantics ya). Kwa hivyo angalia 023kuongezeka kwa siku za usoni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Marker role:** Carries no tasks; selects which ``svc-swarm-node`` member runs the manager-init flow."
msgstr "**Majukumu ya Marker:** Hakuna haja ya kuchagua; ``svc-swarm-node`` Mkurugenzi Mtendaji wa Halmashauri ya Wilaya ya Chunya Mhe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Marker role:** Carries no tasks; selects which `svc-swarm-node` member runs the manager-init flow."
msgstr "**Majukumu ya Marker:** Hakuna haja ya kuchagua; `svc-swarm-node` Mkurugenzi Mtendaji wa Halmashauri ya Wilaya ya Chunya Mhe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Marketing & Automation:** Create email campaigns, marketing automation workflows, and social media management integrated with CRM data."
msgstr "**Usimamizi wa masoko na automatisering:** Unda kampeni za barua pepe, kazi za automatisering za masoko, na usimamizi wa vyombo vya habari vya kijamii umeunganishwa na data ya CRM."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Matomo Analytics & Global CSS:** Built-in support for analytics and unified styling."
msgstr "**Matomo Analytics & Global CSS:** Msaada uliojengwa kwa ajili ya analytics na styling umoja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Matomo and Prometheus aware:** Toggles tracker and metrics integration based on the presence of the corresponding application roles."
msgstr "**Kwa hiyo, na Prometheus Ufahamu:** Toggles tracker na metrics ushirikiano msingi juu ya uwepo wa majukumu sambamba maombi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Matomo integration is safer:** it now fails fast on empty tokens and consistently uses the hydrated users.administrator.tokens value for API calls."
msgstr "**Ushirikiano wa Matomo ni salama zaidi:** Sasa inashindwa haraka kwenye ishara tupu na mara kwa mara hutumia hydrated users.administrator.tokens Thamani ya API ya simu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Matrix**: `#public:infinito.nexus` for general community discussion."
msgstr "**Matrix ya Matrix**: `#public:infinito.nexus` kwa ajili ya majadiliano ya jamii kwa ujumla."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Meeting Recordings:** A dedicated recorder consumes recording jobs from the RabbitMQ queue and stores MP4 archives in MinIO."
msgstr "**Mkutano wa Kumbukumbu:** Mwandishi wa habari aliyejitolea hutumia kazi za kurekodi kutoka kwa RabbitMQ Orodha ya bidhaa na maduka ya MP4 Nyaraka katika MinIO..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Metrics via `unauthenticated_metrics_access = true`** on the internal listener, scraped on the internal container port over the role-local docker network only — never through the proxy, never public."
msgstr "**Shughuli kupitia `unauthenticated_metrics_access = true`** kwenye msikilizaji wa ndani, iliyopigwa kwenye bandari ya ndani ya chombo juu ya mtandao wa docker wa ndani tu - kamwe kupitia wakala, kamwe umma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Migrated compose files** from *docker-compose.yml* to *compose.yml*, including override and CA override variants, and unified compose-related configuration keys"
msgstr "**Kuhamisha files** Kutoka kwa *docker-compose.yml* Kwa kuwa *compose.yml*, ikiwa ni pamoja na anuwai za override na CA override, na funguo za usanidi zinazohusiana na umoja"

