# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MinIO** is an S3-compatible object storage service for files, media, backups, and AI artifacts, self-hosted for performance and control."
msgstr "**Mihogo** Kuwa S3Huduma ya kuhifadhi kitu sawa kwa faili, vyombo vya habari, backups, na mabaki ya AI, iliyohifadhiwa kwa utendaji na udhibiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mini-QR** is a lightweight, self-hosted web application for generating QR codes instantly and privately."
msgstr "**Mini-QR** Ni programu nyepesi, ya kujitegemea ya kuunda nambari za QR mara moja na kwa faragha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mini-QR** is a lightweight, self-hosted web application for generating QR codes instantly and privately.   It provides a minimal and elegant interface to convert any text, URL, or message into a QR code directly in your browser, without external tracking or dependencies."
msgstr "**Mini-QR** Ni programu nyepesi, ya kujitegemea ya kuunda nambari za QR mara moja na kwa faragha. Inatoa interface ndogo na ya kifahari kubadilisha maandishi yoyote, URL, au ujumbe katika msimbo wa QR moja kwa moja kwenye kivinjari chako, bila kufuatilia nje au utegemezi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal NGINX Setup:** Clean and optimized default configurations."
msgstr "**Ufungaji wa NGINX:** Mipangilio ya default na optimized."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal Setup:** No unnecessary dependencies are installed."
msgstr "**Ufungaji mdogo:** Hakuna mahitaji yasiyo ya lazima yamefanywa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal footprint:** Does not enable services or autostart entries beyond what the package itself provides."
msgstr "**Miguu ya chini:** Hairuhusu huduma au viingilio vya autostart zaidi ya mfuko yenyewe hutoa."

