msgid "**Minimal scope** (client-only, no server configuration)"
msgstr "**Kiwango cha chini** (server ya kawaida, hakuna server)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mirror failover:** A repository that declares a mirror is served through a guarded location: a 5xx from its primary remote re-runs the same path against the sibling repository, while a 404 is passed straight back."
msgstr "**Picha ya skrini:** Hifadhi ambayo inatangaza kioo hutumiwa kupitia eneo lililohifadhiwa: 5xx kutoka kwa kijijini chake cha msingi kinaendesha njia sawa dhidi ya hifadhi ya ndugu, wakati 404 Inarudi moja kwa moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Image-level mutation (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) and their synonyms (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) still route through `ask`, so the operator reviews them before they execute."
msgstr "**Kupunguza:** Mabadiliko ya kiwango cha picha (`run`, Kwa hivyo, `build`, Kwa hivyo, `push`, Kwa hivyo, `login`) na mahusiano yao. (`docker container run`, Kwa hivyo, `docker image build`, Kwa hivyo, `docker buildx build`, Kwa hivyo, `docker image push`) Bado njia ya kupitia `ask`, Kwa hiyo, mwendeshaji anakagua kabla ya kutekeleza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Targets still cannot bypass `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, or the `deny` list. A malicious target that called `rm -rf .` would be stopped by the `rm -rf*` deny rule."
msgstr "**Kupunguza:** Malengo bado hayawezi kufikiwa `allowWrite`, Kwa hivyo, `allowedDomains`, au ya `deny` Orodha ya. Mradi huo ambao uliitwa `rm -rf .` itakuwa imefungwa na `rm -rf*` Kukataa utawala."

# translation-refused: libretranslate stutter
# nocheck: url
# translation-rejected: **Kupunguza:** `docker run*` Kwa upande wake Balozi wa
# `ask`, Kwa hiyo, Kamati inawaangalia (Kwa kuzingatia dhana 5). ya ya ya ya
