# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `sandbox.enabled: true` with `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` refuses to start when the backend is unavailable. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` rejects the `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` tool parameter, so there is no per-call escape."
msgstr "**Kupunguza:** `sandbox.enabled: true` Pamoja na `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` Kukataa kuanza wakati nyuma haipatikani. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` Wakataa kuwa `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` Chombo cha parameter, kwa hivyo hakuna kutoroka kwa simu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-aware:** absent optional sources are skipped, not failed, so the same role works in both self-signed and Let's Encrypt setups."
msgstr "**Kuwa na ufahamu:** Vyanzo visivyo vya hiari vimeruka, sio kushindwa, kwa hivyo jukumu hilo hilo hufanya kazi katika vipengele vyote viwili vya kujitegemea na Hebu Turuhusu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-aware:** absent optional sources are skipped, not failed, so the same role works in both self-signed and Let’s Encrypt setups."
msgstr "**Kuwa na ufahamu:** Vyanzo visivyo vya hiari vimeruka, sio kushindwa, kwa hivyo jukumu hilo hilo hufanya kazi katika vipengele vyote viwili vya kujitegemea na Hebu Turuhusu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-selection trigger:** Membership in ``svc-swarm-node`` resolves ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` for every web-app role on that host."
msgstr "**Uchaguzi wa mode:** Ushiriki katika ``svc-swarm-node`` Uamuzi wa ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` Kwa kila jukumu la programu ya wavuti kwenye mwenyeji huu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-selection trigger:** Membership in `svc-swarm-node` resolves `DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm` for every web-app role on that host."
msgstr "**Uchaguzi wa mode:** Ushiriki katika `svc-swarm-node` Uamuzi wa `DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm` Kwa kila jukumu la programu ya wavuti kwenye mwenyeji huu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Model and context:** ``agents.model`` names the gateway alias every agent runs on and defaults to the gateway’s chat model, so agents can run on a larger model than Open WebUI’s default. The context window of that alias comes from the model’s ``context`` in the inventory and is written into the agent config as Hermes ``model.context_length`` and OpenClaw ``contextWindow``. An agent prompt runs to tens of thousands of tokens, so a CPU-only local model spends minutes per turn on it; point ``agents.model`` at a remote model for interactive use. Hermes refuses a window below 64000 tokens and answers HTTP 500 on every prompt, so a platform whose minimum the selected alias misses is not offered at all: it is left out of ``/v1/models`` and answers 404, and the deploy says which platform it dropped and why. The rest of the broker keeps working, which is what makes a small model and OpenClaw a valid pairing. An alias that declares no window is reported instead of filtered, because an agent that does not know its window runs."
msgstr "**Mfano na muktadha:** ``agents.model`` majina ya lango alias kila wakala anaendesha juu na defaults kwa njia ya lango chat mfano, hivyo mawakala wanaweza kukimbia juu ya mfano mkubwa kuliko Open WebUIya kushindwa. Muonekano wa dirisha hilo la Alias linatokana na mtindo wa ``context`` katika hesabu na imeandikwa katika config wakala kama Hermes ``model.context_length`` Aidha, na OpenClaw ``contextWindow``. Wakala wa haraka anaendesha kwa makumi ya maelfu ya ishara, kwa hivyo mfano wa ndani wa CPU tu hutumia dakika kwa kugeuka juu yake. ``agents.model`` kwa kutumia mfumo wa kielektroniki kwa ajili ya matumizi. Lowassa akataa kuachia ngazi 64000 Vidokezo na Majibu ya HTTP 500 juu ya kila haraka, hivyo jukwaa ambalo angalau alias kuchaguliwa amekosa si zinazotolewa wakati wote: ni kushoto nje ya ``/v1/models`` Majibu ya 404, na kupelekwa anasema jukwaa gani imeshuka na kwa nini. Kwa upande mwingine, kampuni hiyo inafanya kazi, ambayo inafanya kazi ndogo na OpenClaw Kuwa na jozi sahihi. Alias ambayo inatangaza hakuna dirisha limeripotiwa badala ya kuchuja, kwa sababu wakala ambaye hajui anaendesha dirisha lake."

