# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Model gateway key:** With the LiteLLM Gateway deployed, that gateway provisions a per-consumer virtual key aliased to this application."
msgstr "**Mwongozo wa Mwongozo wa Mwongozo:** Kwa kuwa LiteLLM Gateway Iliyotumiwa, lango hilo linatoa ufunguo wa kila mtumiaji wa kawaida uliotumiwa kwenye programu hii."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Model relay:** Agents call ``http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1`` with their own key; the broker forwards the call to LiteLLM with the broker’s virtual key, sets the OpenAI ``user`` field to the owner and logs a JSON ``relay`` event with owner, platform, path and upstream status."
msgstr "**Uwasilishaji wa Model:** Wafanyakazi wa simu ``http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1`` kwa ufunguo wao mwenyewe; broker anawasilisha wito wa LiteLLM na ufunguo wa broker wa kawaida, anaweka OpenAI ``user`` Home »Unlabelled » Waziri Mkuu akutana na JSON ``relay`` tukio na mmiliki, jukwaa, njia na hali ya juu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Model relay:** Agents call `http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1` with their own key; the broker forwards the call to LiteLLM with the broker's virtual key, sets the OpenAI `user` field to the owner and logs a JSON `relay` event with owner, platform, path and upstream status."
msgstr "**Uwasilishaji wa Model:** Wafanyakazi wa simu `http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1` kwa ufunguo wao wenyewe; broker anawasilisha wito wa LiteLLM na ufunguo wa broker wa kawaida, anaweka OpenAI `user` Home »Unlabelled » Waziri Mkuu akutana na JSON `relay` tukio na mmiliki, jukwaa, njia na hali ya juu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Models go through the [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway.** Each agent's BYO-model config points only at the `svc-ai-litellm` `/v1` + a model alias; it never addresses a provider directly. The Pis run no large models locally; heavy inference is routed to a GPU/external backend by the gateway."
msgstr "**Mifano inajitokeza kupitia [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) ya lango.** Kila moja ya vipengele vya muundo wa BYO-mpangilio tu katika `svc-ai-litellm` `/v1` + mfano alias; kamwe anwani mtoa huduma moja kwa moja. Pis kukimbia hakuna mifano kubwa ndani ya nchi; inference nzito ni njia ya nyuma GPU / nje ya mlango."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Models via the [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway; higher-level tools via [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) MCP.** Embodiment changes the host boundary, not the model or tool planes: inference still goes through the gateway, and non-hardware tools still come via MCP."
msgstr "**Mifano kupitia [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) - - - - -; - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) ya MCP.** Embodiment hubadilisha mpaka wa mwenyeji, sio ndege za mfano au chombo: tofauti bado inakwenda kupitia lango, na zana zisizo za ngumu bado huja kupitia MCP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modern Dashboard:** Enjoy a sleek, user-friendly interface for managing campaigns and analyzing performance."
msgstr "**kisasa ya kisasa Dashboard:** Kufurahia sleek, user-kirafiki interface kwa kusimamia kampeni na kuchambua utendaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modern Forum Experience:** Engage in interactive, real-time discussions with a responsive, mobile-friendly design."
msgstr "**Uzoefu wa kisasa wa Forum:** Kushiriki katika mazungumzo ya maingiliano, ya muda halisi na muundo wa msikivu, wa kirafiki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modern and Scalable:** A robust Symfony-based framework optimized for commerce innovation."
msgstr "**ya kisasa na ya kisasa:** Mfumo imara wa Symfony ulioboreshwa kwa uvumbuzi wa biashara."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modern search:** OpenSearch out of the box (single-node)."
msgstr "**Utafutaji wa kisasa:** Kufungua nje ya sanduku (Umoja wa Mataifa)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modern, Responsive Web Interface:** Access an intuitive and adaptive UI for effortless browsing, administration, and content management."
msgstr "**Mtandao wa kisasa wa interface:** Kupata UI intuitive na adaptive kwa ajili ya kuvinjari effortless, utawala, na usimamizi wa maudhui."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modular Design:** Easily integrates with other WireGuard roles or network configuration roles."
msgstr "**Muundo wa muundo:** Inaunganisha kwa urahisi na majukumu mengine ya WireGuard au majukumu ya usanidi wa mtandao."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modular Integration:** Integrates with common routines and roles to further enhance system security."
msgstr "**Muundo wa Muungano:** Integrates na utaratibu wa kawaida na majukumu ya kuboresha usalama wa mfumo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modular Role Composition:** Leverages central roles for database and NGINX, ensuring consistency across deployments 🔄"
msgstr "**Muundo wa Muungano:** majukumu ya msingi ya database na NGINX, kuhakikisha uthabiti katika kupelekwa 🔄"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modular Role Composition:** Uses shared roles for DB, proxy and monitoring to keep your stack consistent 🔄"
msgstr "**Muundo wa Muungano:** Tumia majukumu ya pamoja ya DB, wakala na ufuatiliaji ili kuweka stack yako thabiti 🔄"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modular Scalability** 📈 Grow from small teams to global enterprises by composing only the services you need."
msgstr "**Kiwango cha ubadilishaji** 📈 Kukua kutoka kwa timu ndogo hadi makampuni ya kimataifa kwa kuunda tu huduma unayohitaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Modular includes**: headers, locations, and global snippets are factored for easy extension."
msgstr "**Mabadiliko hayo ni pamoja na**Viongozi, maeneo, na snippets za kimataifa zinahusishwa kwa upanuzi rahisi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Module fetch fails (`go.mod` resolution)**: Hugo modules pull from `proxy.golang.org`. Network egress to that host must be allowed by the local firewall / proxy."
msgstr "**Mfumo wa uendeshaji umeshindwa (`go.mod` Uamuzi wa)**Hugo `proxy.golang.org`. Uendelezaji wa mtandao kwa mwenyeji huo lazima uruhusiwe na wakala wa firewall / wakala wa ndani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Module**"
msgstr "**Mfumo wa**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Monitoring and dashboard entries:** Registers the hub with the metrics and dashboard services when those are part of the deployment."
msgstr "**Ufuatiliaji na kuingia kwa dashibodi:** Inajiandikisha kitovu na metrics na huduma za dashibodi wakati hizo ni sehemu ya kupelekwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Monitoring**   You can follow logs in real time with `journalctl -f`."
msgstr "**Ufuatiliaji wa Ufuatiliaji** Unaweza kufuatilia kwa muda halisi `journalctl -f`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
