msgstr "**Ufuatiliaji wa Ufuatiliaji** Unaweza kufuatilia kwa muda halisi ``journalctl -f``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Monitoring, Alerting & Analytics** 📊 Built-in system, application, and security monitoring with multi-channel notifications."
msgstr "**Ufuatiliaji, Tahadhari & Analytics** 📊 Mfumo wa kujengwa, matumizi, na ufuatiliaji wa usalama na taarifa mbalimbali za vyombo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Monitoring:** Prometheus scrapes `/v1/sys/metrics` on the role-local network. A sealed node is detected from `/v1/sys/health`, which answers 503 while sealed and 200 once unsealed."
msgstr "**Ufuatiliaji:** Prometheus hupigwa `/v1/sys/metrics` kwenye mtandao wa kijamii. Mwili wa marehemu ukitambuliwa kutoka `/v1/sys/health`, ambayo majibu yake 503 wakati na wakati. 200 mara moja bila kuchelewa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Monitoring:** Prometheus scrapes ``/v1/sys/metrics`` on the role-local network. A sealed node is detected from ``/v1/sys/health``, which answers 503 while sealed and 200 once unsealed."
msgstr "**Ufuatiliaji:** Prometheus hupigwa ``/v1/sys/metrics`` kwenye mtandao wa kijamii. Mwili wa marehemu ukitambuliwa kutoka ``/v1/sys/health``, ambayo majibu yake 503 wakati na wakati. 200 mara moja bila kuchelewa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**More reliable Git configuration:** Git setup now works consistently for workstation users without broken or implicit dependencies."
msgstr "**Kuaminika zaidi Git Ufungaji:** Mpangilio wa Git sasa unafanya kazi mara kwa mara kwa watumiaji wa kituo cha kazi bila utegemezi uliovunjika au usiofaa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**More reliable installs and deploys:** Fewer Docker and OS-specific failures (especially on CentOS Stream), cleaner container builds, and stable Python/Ansible execution across CI and local environments."
msgstr "**Vifaa vya kuaminika zaidi na vifaa:** Docker na makosa maalum ya OS (Juu ya CentOS Stream), Chombo safi hujenga, na utekelezaji thabiti wa Python / uwajibikaji katika CI na mazingira ya ndani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**More reliable workstation setups:** A dedicated *workstation user* ensures deployments and integration tests run consistently."
msgstr "**Vituo vya kazi vya kuaminika zaidi:** Kikundi cha kujitolea *Mtumiaji wa Workstation* kuhakikisha kuwa shughuli za ukaguzi na ukaguzi zinakwenda kwa kasi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**More robust Mailu configuration:** Optional user roles are handled safely, avoiding configuration and runtime errors."
msgstr "**imara zaidi Mailu Ufungaji:** Majukumu ya mtumiaji wa hiari yanashughulikiwa salama, kuepuka makosa ya usanidi na wakati wa kukimbia."

