# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Nested Docker state does not survive a teardown locally, but does in CI.** `INFINITO_DOCKER_VOLUME` is the named volume `docker` ([default.env](../../../../default.env)) and a host path (`/mnt/docker`) on GitHub. `compose down -v` removes a named volume and cannot remove a bind mount, so every workspace track starts on a clean inner daemon locally while CI carries the previous track's containers into the next one. Defects that need a container, network, or bind source to outlive a teardown cannot reproduce under act."
msgstr "**Nchi ya Nested Docker haiishi uharibifu wa ndani, lakini inafanya katika CI.** `INFINITO_DOCKER_VOLUME` Ni jina la kitengo `docker` ([default.env](../../../../default.env)) na njia ya utumbo mpana. (`/mnt/docker`) kwenye mtandao wa GitHub. `compose down -v` Inaondoa kiasi kilichoitwa na haiwezi kuondoa mlima wa kumfunga, kwa hivyo kila wimbo wa nafasi ya kazi huanza kwenye daemon safi ya ndani ya nchi wakati CI hubeba vyombo vya kufuatilia vya awali katika moja ijayo. Uharibifu ambao unahitaji chombo, mtandao, au kumfunga chanzo ili kuondokana na uharibifu hauwezi kuzaa chini ya kitendo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
