# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Never commit your API token to a public repository. Always keep it secure!**"
msgstr "**Kamwe usitoe ahadi zako API kutoa taarifa kwa umma. Daima kuwa salama!**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Never disable.** Required by almost every app."
msgstr "**Kamwe usidharau.** Inahitaji karibu kila app."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Never dispatch again while the watch is armed.** `entry-manual-steer.yml` declares the branch's concurrency group with `cancel-in-progress`, so a second dispatch cancels the run being triaged. The loop then triages a cancelled run and reports every unfinished row as a failure, which is a phantom: those rows never reached a verdict."
msgstr "**Kamwe usiweke tena wakati wa baridi.** `entry-manual-steer.yml` Alisema kwa kushirikiana na kundi la `cancel-in-progress`, Kwa hivyo, toleo la pili linaondoa kukimbia. kitanzi kisha triages kufutwa kukimbia na ripoti kila mstari unfinished kama kushindwa, ambayo ni phantom: safu hizo kamwe kufikiwa hukumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Never enable buffering for true WebSocket connections!**   Use `proxy_buffering off;` (as in `ws_generic.conf.j2`) or connections may fail."
msgstr "**Kamwe kuruhusu buffering kwa uhusiano wa kweli wa WebSocket!** Matumizi ya matumizi `proxy_buffering off;` (Kama ilivyo katika `ws_generic.conf.j2`) Uhusiano unaweza kushindwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**New CLI capability:** Automatic resolution of *run_after* dependencies with safe cycle detection simplifies role analysis and automation."
msgstr "**Uwezo mpya wa CLI:** Uamuzi wa moja kwa moja *run_after* dependencies na salama mzunguko kugundua simplifies jukumu uchambuzi na automatisering."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**New and reshaped roles.** *sys-svc-nss* is split out of *sys-hostname*, *web-svc-mirror* serves frontend assets as a privacy proxy, PeerTube becomes clearnet-only, and roles that could not run were deleted rather than repaired. CLI tools install via pip instead of pkgmgr."
msgstr "**majukumu mapya na ya kudumu.** *sys-svc-nss* Imegawanywa kutoka *sys-hostname*Kwa hivyo, *web-svc-mirror* Tumia mali ya mbele kama wakala wa faragha, PeerTube Kwa hiyo, ni rahisi sana kufanya kazi, na kazi ambazo haziwezi kukimbia zilifutwa badala ya kukarabatiwa. Vifaa vya CLI kufunga kupitia pip badala ya pkgmgr."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**New lint contracts.** Port variables must resolve through lookups, scheduler services must declare *replicas: 1*, and volume-owning stack roles must declare their backup policy. *role_path* is forbidden in shell and command bodies. Deployment-mode defaults, container-inspection resolvers, asynchronous-task rationales and health-check declarations are validated centrally. Hadolint directives and documented *nocheck* exceptions are recognized instead of producing false positives."
msgstr "**mikataba mipya.** Vigezo vya bandari lazima kutatua kupitia kuangalia, huduma za ratiba lazima zitangaza *Majibu ya: 1*, na majukumu mengi ya kumiliki stack lazima kutangaza sera yao ya kuhifadhi. *role_path* Ni marufuku katika vyombo vya ulinzi na usalama. Vikwazo vya Deployment-mode, utatuzi wa uingizaji wa chombo, sababu za uchunguzi wa asynchronous na matangazo ya ukaguzi wa afya yanathibitishwa katikati. Mwongozo wa kina na ulioandikwa *Hakuna ukaguzi* Watu wengine wanatambuliwa badala ya kutengeneza faida za uongo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Nextcloud minted a new app password on every run and revoked none.** The name was fixed and managed, so each run that found the stored password rejected added another valid token to the account while every previous one kept full access. The mint is now preceded by a listing and the revocation of every token carrying that name."
msgstr "**NextCloud ilitumia nywila mpya ya programu kwenye kila kukimbia na kufuta hakuna.** Jina liliwekwa na kusimamiwa, hivyo kila kukimbia ambayo iligundua nywila iliyohifadhiwa kukataliwa aliongeza ishara nyingine halali kwenye akaunti wakati kila mmoja uliopita alikuwa na upatikanaji kamili. Jina lake la kuzaliwa ni la zamani, na jina lake ni la milele."

