msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, the backend command (in `templates/compose.yml.j2`) imports the internal CA into a writable `cacerts` copy and points the JVM at it via `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. The shared `with-ca-trust.sh` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot's server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with `PKIX path building failed`. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework's CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**OIDC JVM ya uaminifu (Kujiandikisha kwa TLS):** Wakati ambapo wakati `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, Amri ya nyuma (Ndani ya `templates/compose.yml.j2`) Kuingiza ndani ya ndani ya karatasi `cacerts` Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi kupitia `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`• Kushiriki kwa pamoja `with-ca-trust.sh` Hatua ya kuingia inahusisha OS/NSS/env ya mapato ya ndani, lakini siyo ya Serikali ya CCM, hivyo PenpotUjumbe wa OIDC / mtumiajiinfo Keycloak Kushindwa kwa `PKIX path building failed`. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . (Ni hakuna-op katika uzalishaji, ambapo halisi CA-signed certs ni tayari kuaminiwa) Na njia CA ni ngumucoded kwa sababu mfumo wa CA-override re-serialises amri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when ``TLS_MODE == self_signed``, the backend command (in ``templates/compose.yml.j2``) imports the internal CA into a writable ``cacerts`` copy and points the JVM at it via ``JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS``. The shared ``with-ca-trust.sh`` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot’s server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with ``PKIX path building failed``. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework’s CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**OIDC JVM ya uaminifu (Kujiandikisha kwa TLS):** Wakati ambapo wakati ``TLS_MODE == self_signed``, Amri ya nyuma (Ndani ya ``templates/compose.yml.j2``) Kuingiza ndani ya ndani ya karatasi ``cacerts`` Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi kupitia ``JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS``• Kushiriki kwa pamoja ``with-ca-trust.sh`` Hatua ya kuingia inahusisha OS/NSS/env ya mapato ya ndani, lakini siyo ya Serikali ya CCM, hivyo PenpotIshara ya upande wa seva ya OIDC / mtumiajiinfo inaita Keycloak Kushindwa kwa ``PKIX path building failed``. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . (Ni hakuna-op katika uzalishaji, ambapo halisi CA-signed certs ni tayari kuaminiwa) Na njia CA ni ngumucoded kwa sababu mfumo wa CA-override re-serialises amri."

