# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Once-per-play idempotency:** Wraps the dispatch in ``when: run_once_update is not defined`` and writes the flag via ``tasks/utils/once/flag.yml``, so repeated invocations within one play are no-ops."
msgstr "**Kiwango cha kucheza:** Kuweka nyaraka katika ``when: run_once_update is not defined`` Bendera ya Volta ya Juu ``tasks/utils/once/flag.yml``, Kwa hivyo, maombi ya mara kwa mara ndani ya mchezo mmoja sio chaguo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Once-per-play idempotency:** Wraps the dispatch in `when: run_once_update is not defined` and writes the flag via `tasks/utils/once/flag.yml`, so repeated invocations within one play are no-ops."
msgstr "**Kiwango cha kucheza:** Kuweka nyaraka katika `when: run_once_update is not defined` Bendera ya Volta ya Juu `tasks/utils/once/flag.yml`, Kwa hivyo, maombi ya mara kwa mara ndani ya mchezo mmoja sio chaguo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**One CI chain instead of four workflows.** The deploy workflows collapse into a single chunk chain gated by one validation job, with every variant getting its own row and rotating distro, filesystem and tor axes. Selection tokens pin deploy axes, retriggers reproduce the exact selection of the source run in every mode, and the regular line resumes where the source stopped. Fork code no longer runs with the base repository token, workflow tokens are scoped to the jobs that need them, superseded runs are force-cancelled, and a mid-run budget SIGKILL is counted as skipped rather than green. Apt call sites are bounded so a stalled mirror cannot burn a job budget."
msgstr "**Kwa mfano, safu moja ya CI badala ya kazi nne.** Kazi za kupeleka zinaanguka katika mnyororo mmoja wa chunk uliofunguliwa na kazi moja ya kuthibitisha, na kila lahaja inapata mstari wake mwenyewe na distro ya kupokezana, mfumo wa faili na axes ya tor. Ishara za Uchaguzi zinatuma axes, retriggers huzaa uteuzi halisi wa chanzo kinachoendeshwa katika kila hali, na mstari wa kawaida unapoanza ambapo chanzo kiliacha. Msimbo wa Fork hauendesha tena na ishara ya msingi ya kuhifadhi, ishara za kazi zinawekwa kwa kazi ambazo zinawahitaji, anaendesha zilizosimamiwa ni za nguvu, na bajeti ya katikati ya SIGKILL inahesabiwa kama imeruka badala ya kijani. Tovuti za simu za Apt zimefungwa kwa hivyo kioo kilichokwama hakiwezi kuchoma bajeti ya kazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**One contract, three flavors.** ``laya`` serves multilingual checkpoints and preloads them at start; ``torch`` runs the GLiFormer checkpoint as published; ``onnx`` exports an int8 graph at build time and needs roughly a quarter of the memory. Every flavor answers the same ``POST /v1/systemone``, so the gateway does not know which one it asked."
msgstr "**Mkataba mmoja, magoli matatu.** ``laya`` Tumia vituo vya ukaguzi vya lugha mbalimbali na uziweke mapema; ``torch`` Inaendesha GLiFormer checkpoint kama iliyochapishwa; ``onnx`` Uwekezaji wa ndani8 Picha wakati wa kujenga wakati na inahitaji karibu robo ya kumbukumbu. Kila la heri kwa majibu yako ``POST /v1/systemone``, Kwa hiyo, njia ya lango haijui ni nani aliyeuliza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**One contract, three flavors.** `laya` serves multilingual checkpoints and preloads them at start; `torch` runs the GLiFormer checkpoint as published; `onnx` exports an int8 graph at build time and needs roughly a quarter of the memory. Every flavor answers the same `POST /v1/systemone`, so the gateway does not know which one it asked."
msgstr "**Mkataba mmoja, magoli matatu.** `laya` Tumia vituo vya ukaguzi vya lugha mbalimbali na uziweke mapema; `torch` Inaendesha GLiFormer checkpoint kama iliyochapishwa; `onnx` Uwekezaji wa ndani8 Picha wakati wa kujenga wakati na inahitaji karibu robo ya kumbukumbu. Kila la heri kwa majibu yako `POST /v1/systemone`, Kwa hiyo, njia ya lango haijui ni nani aliyeuliza."

