msgid "**One premise, one place:** A second shared desktop prerequisite is added here rather than in every ``dsk-*`` role."
msgstr "**Sehemu moja, sehemu moja:** Mahitaji ya pili ya desktop yaliyoshirikiwa yanaongezwa hapa badala ya kila ``dsk-*`` majukumu yake."

