# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**One-line Script Injection**"
msgstr "**Uwasilishaji wa script moja**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**One-line Script Injection**   Collapses your JavaScript into a single line and injects it via `sub_filter` for minimal footprint and maximal compatibility."
msgstr "**Uwasilishaji wa script moja** Inaondoa JavaScript kwenye mstari mmoja na kuiingiza kupitia `sub_filter` Kwa kiwango cha chini cha miguu na uwiano wa maximal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Onion opt-in, not a port.** A category-keyed map of booleans naming which of the entity's own categories get a `HiddenServicePort` on the node onion. It declares no numbers: the port is read from `local` when the category is declared there and from `public` otherwise, matching what `container_ports` publishes. Collision detection ignores it."
msgstr "**Kwa upande mwingine, chagua, sio bandari.** Ramani ya kikundi-keyed ya booleans naming ambayo ya makundi ya chombo mwenyewe kupata `HiddenServicePort` Juu ya Node Onion Hakuna nambari: bandari inasoma kutoka `local` wakati wa kutangaza na kutoka `public` Kwa upande mwingine, pamoja na mambo ambayo `container_ports` kuchapisha. Utambuzi wa ugonjwa hupuuza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Onions, firewall and name resolution.** *svc-net-firewall* owns the packet filter as one nftables table per role. Tor carries mail to a .onion in both deploy modes, rejects forged sources on the guarded ports, and binds its dnsmasq listeners statically so a failed re-enumeration can no longer drop every one of them. The deployment declares its own address space once, the egress range moved out of the Docker pool, and the container resolver follows the live bridge instead of a guessed address. Every host-bound port requires an explicit onion decision. See [svc-net-firewall](roles/svc-net-firewall/README.md)."
msgstr "**Onions, firewall na jina la azimio.** *svc-net-firewall* Inamiliki kichujio cha pakiti kama meza moja ya nftables kwa jukumu. Tor hubeba barua kwa .onion katika njia zote mbili za kupeleka, inakataa vyanzo vya kughushi kwenye bandari zilizohifadhiwa, na hufunga wasikilizaji wake wa dnsmasq kwa utulivu ili urekebishaji ulioshindwa hauwezi kuacha kila mmoja wao. Kupelekwa inatangaza nafasi yake ya anwani mara moja, safu ya egress ilitoka kwenye bwawa la Docker, na msuluhishi wa chombo ifuatavyo daraja la kuishi badala ya anwani ya kubahatisha. Kila bandari ya mwenyeji inahitaji uamuzi wa wazi. See ya [svc-net-firewall](roles/svc-net-firewall/README.md)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Only bridging addons add a service block.** A `<target>:` service block is added to the row role ONLY for addons that declare a `bridges:` dependency (per Decision 3), i.e. the in-repo cross-role integrations; a plain addon with no cross-role dependency adds no service block. Each bridging addon's `<target>:` block carries the standard dynamic `enabled`/`shared` flags with matching true/false `meta/variants.yml` coverage, and (for web-facing pairs) a co-deploy Playwright spec. Across the in-repo ✅ set this is a bounded, mechanical expansion scoped to the bridging integrations, accepted as part of Decision 15's full scope."
msgstr "**Kuunganisha tu addons huongeza kizuizi cha huduma.** A ya `<target>:` Kizuizi cha huduma kinaongezwa kwa jukumu la mstari tu kwa nyongeza zinazotangaza `bridges:` utegemezi wa utegemezi (Kwa uamuzi 3), yaani ushirikiano wa msalaba-repo; nyongeza wazi na utegemezi usio na msalaba huongeza hakuna kizuizi cha huduma. Kila la heri kwa Watanzania `<target>:` Mfumo wa Reli ya Standard Dynamic `enabled`Kwa hivyo`shared` Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi `meta/variants.yml` taarifa, na (kwa ajili ya kuunganisha mtandao) Mchezaji wa Playwright. Ndani ya Repo ✅ kuweka hii ni amefungwa, mitambo upanuzi wigo kwa bridging ushirikiano, kukubalika kama sehemu ya Uamuzi 15kamili ya eneo hilo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Only the first start serves nothing.** The env is authoritative again on every start, so what `TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS` carries is the state the container comes back with. Before any group exists that is a disabled entry, which is the safe direction: no access rather than every administrator. Once the provisioning task has created the group, its id lives in the token store, `vars/main.yml` reads it back on the next deploy, and the filter renders the entry enabled with its exact group grant. From then on a bare container restart restores a served, correctly scoped connection without a deploy."
msgstr "**Mwanzo wa kwanza tu hausaidii chochote.** Kwa mara nyingine tena katika kila hatua ya mwanzo, ni `TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS` Ni nchi ambayo chombo hicho kinarudi. Kabla ya kikundi chochote kuwepo kwamba ni kuingia walemavu, ambayo ni mwelekeo salama: hakuna upatikanaji badala ya kila msimamizi. Mara baada ya kukamilika kwa mradi huo, mradi huo utakamilika. `vars/main.yml` Inasoma nyuma kwenye kupeleka ijayo, na chujio kinatoa kuingia kuwezeshwa na ruzuku yake halisi ya kikundi. Kutoka wakati huo kwenye chombo cha wazi kinarejesha uunganisho uliotumiwa, uliotengwa vizuri bila kupelekwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Only the first start serves nothing.** The env is authoritative again on every start, so what ``TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS`` carries is the state the container comes back with. Before any group exists that is a disabled entry, which is the safe direction: no access rather than every administrator. Once the provisioning task has created the group, its id lives in the token store, ``vars/main.yml`` reads it back on the next deploy, and the filter renders the entry enabled with its exact group grant. From then on a bare container restart restores a served, correctly scoped connection without a deploy."
msgstr "**Mwanzo wa kwanza tu hausaidii chochote.** Kwa mara nyingine tena katika kila hatua ya mwanzo, ni ``TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS`` Ni nchi ambayo chombo hicho kinarudi. Kabla ya kikundi chochote kuwepo kwamba ni kuingia walemavu, ambayo ni mwelekeo salama: hakuna upatikanaji badala ya kila msimamizi. Mara baada ya kukamilika kwa mradi huo, mradi huo utakamilika. ``vars/main.yml`` Inasoma nyuma kwenye kupeleka ijayo, na chujio kinatoa kuingia kuwezeshwa na ruzuku yake halisi ya kikundi. Kutoka wakati huo kwenye chombo cha wazi kinarejesha uunganisho uliotumiwa, uliotengwa vizuri bila kupelekwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Open Identities:** Use your existing Fediverse account; no new silo account needed."
msgstr "**Ufafanuzi wa wazi:** Tumia akaunti yako ya sasa ya Fediverse; hakuna akaunti mpya ya silo inahitajika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Open Source**: fully auditable and modifiable for custom integrations."
msgstr "**Chanzo cha wazi**: ukaguzi kamili na ufanisi kwa ushirikiano wa desturi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Open WebUI** provides a clean, fast chat interface for working with local AI models (e.g., via Ollama). It delivers a ChatGPT-like experience on your own infrastructure to keep prompts and data private."
msgstr "**Mtandao wa Open** Inatoa interface safi, ya haraka ya kuzungumza kwa kufanya kazi na mifano ya ndani ya AI (Kwa mfano, kupitia Ollama). Inatoa uzoefu kama ChatGPT kwenye miundombinu yako mwenyewe ili kuweka prompts na data binafsi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
