# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Opening an adapter provider's network to its clients collides with the sidecar isolation invariant.** A provider that declares the `mcp_client` overlay puts its own containers on it. The same declaration on an adapter provider would give its sidecar a second interface, and [`isolation.sh`](../../../roles/test-e2e-cli/files/shared/mcp/isolation.sh) rejects anything but exactly one, because a sidecar holding the provider's credential must reach that provider only."
msgstr "**Kufungua mtandao wa mtoa huduma kwa wateja wake hugongana na invariant ya kutengwa kwa sidecar.** Mpokeaji ambaye anasema kuwa `mcp_client` Kwa upande mwingine, mmea huweka vyombo vyake mwenyewe juu yake. Azimio hilo juu ya mtoa adapta litatoa interface yake ya pili, na [`isolation.sh`](../../../roles/test-e2e-cli/files/shared/mcp/isolation.sh) Anakataa chochote isipokuwa moja, kwa sababu gari la upande linaloshikilia imani ya mtoa huduma lazima lifikie mtoaji huyo tu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Operating a deployment.** New make targets reach a single deployed application: *compose-app-exec*, *compose-app-logs* and *compose-app-restart*. Diagnostics collect the logs an application writes to a file, including from busybox containers. Health probes use a fast start cadence with a window that outlasts a real boot, so a slow starter is no longer reaped. The CSP health check accepts a status code a vhost declares instead of dropping the vhost, and gives onion vhosts a navigation budget Tor can meet."
msgstr "**utekelezaji wa Operesheni Tokomeza.** Malengo mapya ya kufanya yanafikia matumizi moja yaliyotumiwa: *Utekelezaji wa Programu-jalizi*Kwa hivyo, *Fomu ya Maombi* Aidha, na *Mwanzo wa Maombi*Diagnostics kukusanya magogo maombi anaandika kwa faili, ikiwa ni pamoja na kutoka vyombo busybox. Uchunguzi wa afya hutumia cadence ya kuanza haraka na dirisha ambalo linaondoa boot halisi, kwa hivyo starter polepole haipatikani tena. Uchunguzi wa afya wa CSP unakubali msimbo wa hali ambayo vhost inatangaza badala ya kuacha vhost, na inatoa vion vhosts bajeti ya urambazaji Tor inaweza kukutana."

