# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Paths that look wrong and are not.** Policies mount at `/openbao/policies/`, because OpenBao parses *every* file under `-config` as server configuration. Storage is `/openbao/file`, not `/openbao/data`: the image pre-chowns only `/openbao/{config,logs,file}` for the non-root `openbao` user, so a volume elsewhere lands root-owned and raft cannot write. `command:` is just `server` — the entrypoint appends `-config` itself, and passing it duplicates the flag."
msgstr "**Njia ambazo zinaonekana kuwa mbaya na sio.** Siasa za kupanda juu `/openbao/policies/`, Kwa sababu OpenBao Kulinganisha *Kila mmoja kila mmoja* Orodha ya chini `-config` Jinsi ya kufanya server Configuration. Uhifadhi wa `/openbao/file`, Hapana, si ya `/openbao/data`: Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi `/openbao/{config,logs,file}` Kwa wale wasio na `openbao` mtumiaji, hivyo kiasi mahali pengine ardhi mizizi inayomilikiwa na panya haiwezi kuandika. `command:` Ni tu ya `server` Maelekezo ya kuingia `-config` Kwa upande mwingine, na kwa upande mwingine, bendera ya nchi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Paths that look wrong and are not.** Policies mount at ``/openbao/policies/``, because OpenBao parses *every* file under ``-config`` as server configuration. Storage is ``/openbao/file``, not ``/openbao/data``: the image pre-chowns only ``/openbao/{config,logs,file}`` for the non-root ``openbao`` user, so a volume elsewhere lands root-owned and raft cannot write. ``command:`` is just ``server`` — the entrypoint appends ``-config`` itself, and passing it duplicates the flag."
msgstr "**Njia ambazo zinaonekana kuwa mbaya na sio.** Siasa za kupanda juu ``/openbao/policies/``, Kwa sababu OpenBao Kulinganisha *Kila mmoja kila mmoja* Orodha ya chini ``-config`` Jinsi ya kufanya server Configuration. Uhifadhi wa ``/openbao/file``, Hapana, si ya ``/openbao/data``: Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi ``/openbao/{config,logs,file}`` Kwa wale wasio na ``openbao`` mtumiaji, hivyo kiasi mahali pengine ardhi mizizi inayomilikiwa na panya haiwezi kuandika. ``command:`` Ni tu ya ``server`` Maelekezo ya kuingia ``-config`` Kwa upande mwingine, na kwa upande mwingine, bendera ya nchi."

