# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pretix Installation:** Deploys Pretix in a dedicated Docker container."
msgstr "**Ufungaji:** Wafanyakazi Pretix Ndani ya chombo cha Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Priority first, never mixed.** Priority rows sort to the head of the list and the split forces a chunk boundary at the priority/regular seam, so a chunk is either all priority or all regular. The seam chunk stays short rather than being topped up with regular rows -- that is what guarantees every priority row is done before the first regular one starts. Priority is never subject to the sweep offset: it leads every sweep."
msgstr "**Kwanza kabisa, kamwe kuchanganya.** Vikwazo vya kipaumbele vinafanana na mkuu wa orodha na vikosi vya mgawanyiko mpaka wa chunk katika kipaumbele / bahari ya kawaida, kwa hivyo chunk yote ni kipaumbele au mara kwa mara. chunk seam anakaa mfupi badala ya kuwa juu na safu ya mara kwa mara - hiyo ni nini dhamana kila mstari kipaumbele ni kufanyika kabla ya kwanza ya kawaida kuanza. Preity ni kamwe chini ya sweep offset: inaongoza kila sweep."

