# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Qdrant ran with no authentication at all.** Its environment set the HTTP port and disabled telemetry, so every container reaching its network held full read, write and delete access to every collection, and the surface's read-only promise rested entirely on the adapter's contract naming only GET routes. The engine now declares `read_only_api_key`, the adapter presents it, and a write route is refused by the engine rather than only by the adapter."
msgstr "**Nyerere hakuwa na uthibitisho wowote.** Mazingira yake huweka bandari ya HTTP na simu ya walemavu, kwa hivyo kila chombo kilichofikia mtandao wake kilishikilia kusoma kamili, kuandika na kufuta ufikiaji wa kila mkusanyiko, na ahadi ya uso tu ilipumzika kabisa kwenye mkataba wa adapta naming tu njia za GET. Kwa sasa injini hiyo inatangaza `read_only_api_key`, adapta inatoa, na njia ya kuandika ni kukataliwa na injini badala ya tu kwa adapta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Queue clock.** GitHub cancels a job that sat queued for ``INFINITO_CI_QUEUE_HOURS``. With ``INFINITO_CI_CONCURRENCY`` runners free and every job assumed to burn its full ``timeout-minutes``, a chunk drains in waves, and the last wave that still starts inside the queue window is ``floor(queue_hours / job_timeout)``. A chunk therefore holds at most ``concurrency * waves`` jobs. Assuming every job runs to its timeout is deliberately pessimistic -- no job can outlast it -- so the drain estimate can only overshoot, never undershoot."
msgstr "**Saa ya ukombozi.** GitHub inafuta kazi ambayo imewekwa ``INFINITO_CI_QUEUE_HOURS``. Kwa pamoja ``INFINITO_CI_CONCURRENCY`` Wakimbiaji huru na kila kazi ilichukuliwa kuchoma kamili yake ``timeout-minutes``, mashimo ya chunk katika mawimbi, na wimbi la mwisho ambalo bado linaanza ndani ya dirisha la foleni ni ``floor(queue_hours / job_timeout)``. Kwa hiyo, kwa kiasi kikubwa, ``concurrency * waves`` ajira. Kufikiri kila kazi inakwenda kwa muda wake ni kwa makusudi pessimistic - hakuna kazi inaweza outlast - hivyo makisio ya kukimbia inaweza tu overshoot, kamwe chini yashoot."

