# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Raspberry Pi is a real deploy target.** Agent images MUST publish an `arm64` manifest so a Pi-class node can pull them, and the agents MUST schedule across at least two labelled worker nodes. This is arch coverage, not arch exclusivity: the same images keep running on the amd64 nodes that CI and the lab use, so the requirement is that every architecture a node may have is published, never that a deploy is pinned to one."
msgstr "**Raspberry Pi ni lengo halisi la kupeleka.** Waandishi wa habari watakiwa kutoa taarifa `arm64` kuonyesha hivyo darasa la Pi inaweza kuvuta yao, na mawakala lazima ratiba katika angalau nodes mbili za wafanyakazi zilizowekwa. Hii ni chanjo ya arch, si exclusivity arch: picha sawa zinaendelea mbio juu ya amd64 nodes kwamba CI na maabara matumizi, hivyo mahitaji ni kwamba kila usanifu node inaweza kuwa kuchapishwa, kamwe kwamba kupeleka ni pinned kwa moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
