# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Restore verified against real dumps.** The *recover* CLI replays a generation's database and cluster dumps, reads the generation's own layout instead of guessing it, and places each dump by the engine the backup observed rather than by name alone. The *svc-bkp-volume-2-local* drill now empties every volume it claims to test, fails on a database that was never dumped, and stops the backup timers before it goes destructive. Baudolo is pinned per host, its contract read from baudolo itself."
msgstr "**Kurudishwa kwa kuthibitishwa dhidi ya dumps halisi.** Kwa kuwa *Kufufua upya* CLI inabadilisha database ya kizazi na dumps za nguzo, inasoma mpangilio wa kizazi mwenyewe badala ya kuikisia, na inaweka kila dump kwa injini nakala iliyozingatiwa badala ya jina peke yake. Kwa kuwa *svc-bkp-volume-2-local* drill sasa empties kila kiasi ni madai ya mtihani, inashindwa kwenye database ambayo ilikuwa kamwe kutupwa, na kuacha timers salama kabla ya kwenda uharibifu. Baudolo ni pinned kwa kila mwenyeji, mkataba wake kusoma kutoka baudolo yenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Restricted engine access:** The broker reaches the container engine only through a filtered unix socket in a volume shared with the socket proxy, which publishes no port and runs with ``network_mode: none`` in compose. The proxy admits only the container, service, task, network, volume and image calls the broker makes, and refuses every other method and path, including exec and delete. It filters methods and paths, not request bodies: ``volumes/create`` stays open for the per-agent volume, so the isolation holds against a compromised agent, which reaches no socket at all, not against a compromised broker."
msgstr "**Upatikanaji wa injini:** Broker anafikia injini ya chombo tu kupitia tundu lililochujwa la Unix katika kiasi kilichoshirikiwa na wakala wa soketi, ambayo huchapisha hakuna bandari na inaendesha na ``network_mode: none`` ya kutunga. Wakala anakubali tu chombo, huduma, kazi, mtandao, kiasi na picha wito broker hufanya, na anakataa kila njia nyingine na njia, ikiwa ni pamoja na exec na kufuta. Huchuja njia na njia, sio kuomba miili: ``volumes/create`` anakaa wazi kwa kiasi cha haraka, kwa hivyo kutengwa ina dhidi ya wakala aliyeathirika, ambayo hufikia hakuna socket kabisa, sio dhidi ya broker aliyeathirika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Restricted engine access:** The broker reaches the container engine only through a filtered unix socket in a volume shared with the socket proxy, which publishes no port and runs with `network_mode: none` in compose. The proxy admits only the container, service, task, network, volume and image calls the broker makes, and refuses every other method and path, including exec and delete. It filters methods and paths, not request bodies: `volumes/create` stays open for the per-agent volume, so the isolation holds against a compromised agent, which reaches no socket at all, not against a compromised broker."
msgstr "**Upatikanaji wa injini:** Broker anafikia injini ya chombo tu kupitia tundu lililochujwa la Unix katika kiasi kilichoshirikiwa na wakala wa soketi, ambayo huchapisha hakuna bandari na inaendesha na `network_mode: none` ya kutunga. Wakala anakubali tu chombo, huduma, kazi, mtandao, kiasi na picha wito broker hufanya, na anakataa kila njia nyingine na njia, ikiwa ni pamoja na exec na kufuta. Huchuja njia na njia, sio kuomba miili: `volumes/create` anakaa wazi kwa kiasi cha haraka, kwa hivyo kutengwa ina dhidi ya wakala aliyeathirika, ambayo hufikia hakuna socket kabisa, sio dhidi ya broker aliyeathirika."

