# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Revalidation required:** [ADR 0003 - One MCP surface per provider, and a disposition for every role](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) holds the exhaustive per-role audit and the standing contract, and supersedes this document where this document assumes an empty baseline, treats metadata as enforcement, or marks client provisioning and end-to-end authorization complete. The remaining work is tracked in [035 - MCP Proxy Expansion and Application Interconnection](035-mcp-proxy-expansion.md). Checked items below describe the original implementation slice and MUST NOT be read as proof that the stricter identity, revocation, transport, restart, proxy, and real-tool-call criteria in requirement 035 are complete."
msgstr "**Ukarabati unahitajika:** [ADR ya 0003 - Uso mmoja wa MCP kwa mtoa huduma, na tabia kwa kila jukumu](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) Anashikilia ukaguzi wa jumla na mkataba wa kusimama, na kusimamia hati hii ambapo hati hii inachukua msingi mtupu, inachukua metadata kama utekelezaji, au alama ya utoaji wa mteja na mwisho wa idhini kamili. Kazi iliyoendelea inaendelea katika [035 MCP Proxy Upanuzi na Uunganisho wa Maombi](035-mcp-proxy-expansion.md). Vitu vilivyokaguliwa hapa chini vinaelezea kipande cha utekelezaji wa awali na haipaswi kusomwa kama ushahidi kwamba utambulisho mkali, uondoaji, usafiri, kuanzisha tena, wakala, na vigezo vya simu halisi katika mahitaji. 035 kuwa kamili."

