# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a ``configuration.yaml`` with ``default_config``, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in ``trusted_proxies``. In swarm the hub joins the proxy’s own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub’s, and trusting only the hub’s subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
msgstr "**Uhakikisho wa uaminifu:** Nyongeza ya A ``configuration.yaml`` Pamoja na ``default_config``, Kwa hivyo, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, na mradi wote wa kuaminika-proxy CIDRs waliotajwa katika ``trusted_proxies``. Katika kundi kitovu hujiunga na overlay ya wakala mwenyewe, hivyo ombi la mbele linafika kutoka kwenye mtandao huo badala ya kutoka kwenye kitovu, na kuamini tu subnet ya kitovu hufanya. Home Assistant Jibu kila ombi lililopendekezwa na HTTP 400..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a `configuration.yaml` with `default_config`, `use_x_forwarded_for`, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in `trusted_proxies`. In swarm the hub joins the proxy's own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub's, and trusting only the hub's subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
