# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Safe Cleanup:** Ensures that no unused certificates are left behind."
msgstr "**Usalama wa kusafisha:** Kuhakikisha kuwa hakuna vyeti visivyotumika vimeachwa nyuma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Safe Defaults:** Best-effort cleanup without breaking running services."
msgstr "**Ukosefu wa usalama:** Huduma bora ya kusafisha bila kuvunja huduma za uendeshaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Safe Execution:** Includes validation for missing services and Docker availability."
msgstr "**Utekelezaji salama:** Ni pamoja na uthibitisho wa huduma za kukosa na upatikanaji wa Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Safe with untrusted forks:** Trees are read as data only (safe YAML, Babel catalogs); refs and paths are validated before git sees them."
msgstr "**Kuwa salama na salama bila kupoteza uzito:** Watu wanaandika kama data tu (Hifadhi ya YAML, catalogs Babel); Njia ya kwanza ni kuangalia mkojo na mkojo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sales & Service CRM:** Accounts, Contacts, Leads, Opportunities, Cases, Campaigns and more 📊"
msgstr "**Mauzo na Huduma CRM:** Akaunti, Mawasiliano, Huongoza, Fursa, Kesi, Kampeni na zaidi 📊"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sandbox** (precedence 3): everything else runs under `allowWrite` / `denyRead` / `allowedDomains`. Writes outside `allowWrite` fail with `EROFS`; reads from `~/.ssh`, `~/.gnupg`, `~/.aws`, etc. are denied; outbound connections to anything not in `allowedDomains` fail."
msgstr "**Sandbox** (Kabla ya 3): Kila kitu kingine chini ya `allowWrite` Kwa hivyo `denyRead` Kwa hivyo `allowedDomains`. Kuandika nje ya `allowWrite` Kushindwa kwa `EROFS`; Kusoma kutoka kwa `~/.ssh`, Kwa hivyo, `~/.gnupg`, Kwa hivyo, `~/.aws`; `allowedDomains` kushindwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalability and Performance:** Efficiently manage video transcoding, live streaming, and storage through containerized microservices."
msgstr "**Ufanisi na ufanisi:** Kwa ufanisi kusimamia transcoding ya video, Streaming ya moja kwa moja, na kuhifadhi kwa njia ya microservices ya vyombo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Architecture:** Benefit from a multi-service, Docker-based setup that supports high user loads and seamless background processing."
msgstr "**Usanifu wa usanifu:** Faida kutoka kwa huduma nyingi, kuanzisha Docker-msingi ambayo inasaidia mizigo ya mtumiaji wa juu na usindikaji wa background usio na mshono."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Architecture:** Designed to handle increasing user loads and message volumes with high performance."
msgstr "**Usanifu wa usanifu:** Iliyoundwa ili kushughulikia mizigo ya mtumiaji na kiasi cha ujumbe na utendaji wa juu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Architecture:** Efficiently handle increasing workloads while maintaining high performance."
msgstr "**Usanifu wa usanifu:** Kwa ufanisi kushughulikia kuongezeka kwa mzigo wa kazi wakati wa kudumisha utendaji wa juu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Architecture:** Utilize a Docker-based deployment that adapts easily to increasing traffic and community size."
msgstr "**Usanifu wa usanifu:** Tumia kupelekwa kwa Docker ambayo inabadilisha kwa urahisi kuongeza trafiki na ukubwa wa jamii."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Leverage Docker for a portable and scalable installation that adapts as your user base grows."
msgstr "**Matumizi mabaya:** Leverage Docker kwa ufungaji portable na scalable kwamba adapts kama msingi wako mtumiaji kukua."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Use Docker to ensure your analytics platform can grow with your traffic demands."
msgstr "**Matumizi mabaya:** Tumia Docker ili kuhakikisha jukwaa lako la uchambuzi linaweza kukua na mahitaji yako ya trafiki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Use Docker to ensure your event platform grows seamlessly with your community’s needs."
msgstr "**Matumizi mabaya:** Tumia Docker ili kuhakikisha jukwaa lako la tukio linakua kwa usawa na mahitaji ya jamii yako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Utilize Docker for a portable and scalable setup that adapts as your community grows."
msgstr "**Matumizi mabaya:** Tumia Docker kwa usanidi wa portable na unaoweza kubadilika kama jamii yako inakua."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Service Architecture:** Leverage the robust orchestration of multiple services to power your Funkwhale instance."
msgstr "**Usanifu wa Huduma:** Tumia orchestration imara ya huduma nyingi kwa nguvu yako Funkwhale kwa mfano."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable and Customizable:** Easily tailor settings and scale your Keycloak instance to meet growing demands."
