# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Schedule-coordinated:** the systemd unit is part of the global manipulation group, so it never races backup/cleanup/repair jobs on the same host."
msgstr "**Ratiba iliyopangwa:** Kitengo cha mfumo ni sehemu ya kikundi cha uharibifu wa ulimwengu, kwa hivyo haijawahi rangi backup/cleanup/repair nafasi za kazi katika Halmashauri hiyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scheduled Execution:** Integrates with a systemd timer for periodic health sweeps."
msgstr "**Utekelezaji uliopangwa:** Integrates na timer systemd kwa sweeps afya ya mara kwa mara."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scheduled Execution:** Runs daily (or as configured) based on `SYS_SCHEDULE_CLEANUP_DOCKER`."
msgstr "**Utekelezaji uliopangwa:** Kuendesha kila siku (Au kama ilivyo dhahabu,) Kwa msingi wa `SYS_SCHEDULE_CLEANUP_DOCKER`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
