# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Integration:** Easily integrates with other automation roles for a complete system setup."
msgstr "**Ushirikiano wa usawa:** Inaunganisha kwa urahisi na majukumu mengine ya automatisering kwa kuanzisha mfumo kamili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Integration:** Provides a stable and secure browsing setup as part of broader system automation workflows."
msgstr "**Ushirikiano wa usawa:** Inatoa usanidi thabiti na salama wa kuvinjari kama sehemu ya kazi kubwa ya mfumo wa automatisering."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless NGINX Reload:** Reloads the NGINX service automatically after successful renewals."
msgstr "**Upakuaji wa NGINX:** Inapakia huduma ya NGINX moja kwa moja baada ya upyaji wa mafanikio."

