# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-registration** is *on* when OIDC is enabled and *off* otherwise — also derived from the ``sso`` service flag. Penpot routes first-time OIDC logins through the registration path (a disabled flag makes the callback fail with ``?error=registration-disabled`` for not-yet-provisioned users), so registration must stay on wherever OIDC is. Native admin is bootstrapped and LDAP self-provisions without it. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renders ``enable-registration`` / ``disable-registration`` accordingly."
msgstr "**Uwasilishaji wa kujitegemea** Ilikuwa ni *Juu ya* Wakati wa operesheni ya OIDC na *Kuacha mbali* Aidha, kwa mujibu wa ``sso`` Bendera ya Volta ya Juu Njia za Penpot mara ya kwanza OIDC huingia kupitia njia ya usajili (Bendera ya walemavu hufanya wito kushindwa ``?error=registration-disabled`` kwa watumiaji wasio na), Kwa hivyo, usajili lazima uendelee popote ulipo OIDC. Usimamizi wa asili ni bootstrapped na LDAP kujitegemea bila hiyo. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` Watoa huduma ``enable-registration`` Kwa hivyo ``disable-registration`` Kwa hivyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-registration** is *on* when OIDC is enabled and *off* otherwise — also derived from the `sso` service flag. Penpot routes first-time OIDC logins through the registration path (a disabled flag makes the callback fail with `?error=registration-disabled` for not-yet-provisioned users), so registration must stay on wherever OIDC is. Native admin is bootstrapped and LDAP self-provisions without it. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renders `enable-registration` / `disable-registration` accordingly."
msgstr "**Uwasilishaji wa kujitegemea** Ilikuwa ni *Juu ya* Wakati wa operesheni ya OIDC na *Kuacha mbali* Aidha, kwa mujibu wa `sso` Bendera ya Volta ya Juu Njia za Penpot mara ya kwanza OIDC huingia kupitia njia ya usajili (Bendera ya walemavu hufanya wito kushindwa `?error=registration-disabled` kwa watumiaji wasio na), Kwa hivyo, usajili lazima uendelee popote ulipo OIDC. Usimamizi wa asili ni bootstrapped na LDAP kujitegemea bila hiyo. `PENPOT_FLAGS` Watoa huduma `enable-registration` Kwa hivyo `disable-registration` Kwa hivyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sentinel `__ALL__` in the `whitelist` input** (case-insensitive). The diff logic MUST be skipped and an empty whitelist MUST be emitted, which deploys everything in the workflow's scope. This is the explicit opt-out from diff narrowing for manual dispatch."
msgstr "**Sentinel ya `__ALL__` Katika `whitelist` Mapato ya** (Uchunguzi wa kesi). Mchanganyiko wa mantiki lazima uchukuliwe na orodha tupu ya whitelist lazima iondolewe, ambayo inachukua kila kitu katika wigo wa kazi. Hii ni kuchagua wazi kutoka kusambaza nyembamba kwa ajili ya dispatch mwongozo."

