msgstr "**Mfano wa pamoja:** Chombo kimoja kinahudumia kila mtumiaji ambaye hubeba bendera ya huduma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Shared-service auto-include** from each role's `meta/services.yml.<entity>.<service>` block, when both `enabled` AND `shared` pass `is_explicit_truth` in [registry.py](../../../utils/roles/applications/services/registry.py): the literal `True` or the dynamic form `\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`. A literal `false` (as baked by a variant override) does NOT qualify."
msgstr "**Huduma ya Auto-Company** kutoka kila sehemu ya `meta/services.yml.<entity>.<service>` Kwa upande mwingine, wakati wote wawili `enabled` Na kwa kuwa `shared` Njia ya kupita `is_explicit_truth` Ndani ya [registry.py](../../../utils/roles/applications/services/registry.py)• Kuwa halisi `True` au mfumo wa uendeshaji `\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`. Moja kwa moja `false` (Kama ilivyo katika riwaya nyingine) Haina sifa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Shell loops are FORBIDDEN. ⛔** You MUST NOT use `for`, `while`, `until`, or any other shell loop construct in any Bash tool call. Reason: shell control structures fall outside the sandbox auto-allow heuristic and trigger approval prompts even when every subcommand would individually auto-allow."
msgstr "**Vipande vya Shell vimeondolewa. ⛔** Sio lazima kutumia `for`, Kwa hivyo, `while`, Kwa hivyo, `until`, au nyingine yoyote shell kitanzi kujenga katika yoyote Bash chombo wito. Sababu: miundo ya udhibiti wa shell kuanguka nje ya sanduku la sandbox auto-kuruhusu heuristic na kusababisha kibali huchochea hata wakati kila amri ndogo itakuwa binafsi auto-allow."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Simple Configuration:** Minimal setup with clear, maintainable templates."
