# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Simpler deploy experience:** The deploy command is more predictable and faster because testing is no longer mixed into deploy runs."
msgstr "**Rahisi kutumia uzoefu:** Amri ya kupeleka ni ya kutabirika zaidi na ya haraka kwa sababu upimaji haujachanganywa tena katika uendeshaji wa kupeleka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Simplified Setup:** Minimizes manual installation steps for environments where fakeroot is required."
msgstr "**Ufungaji rahisi:** Kupunguza hatua za ufungaji wa mwongozo kwa mazingira ambapo bandia inahitajika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Simplified Variable Management:** Preconfigured templates minimize manual intervention."
msgstr "**Mfumo wa Usimamizi wa Rahisi:** Templates zilizosimamiwa hupunguza kuingilia kati kwa mwongozo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single Container:** No database server, no cache, no worker, no object store. SQLite in one volume."
msgstr "**Chombo cha pekee:** Hakuna seva ya database, hakuna cache, hakuna mfanyakazi, hakuna duka la kitu. Weka katika kiasi kimoja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single Domain and Wildcard Support:** Handles both individual domains and wildcard domains (`*.example.com`)."
msgstr "**Domain moja na Msaada wa Wildcard:** Inashughulikia vikoa vya kibinafsi na vikoa vya wildcard (`*.example.com`)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single Domain and Wildcard Support:** Handles both individual domains and wildcard domains (``*.example.com``)."
msgstr "**Domain moja na Msaada wa Wildcard:** Inashughulikia vikoa vya kibinafsi na vikoa vya wildcard (``*.example.com``)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single Sign-On (SSO) / OpenID Connect (OIDC):** Seamless integration with external identity providers for centralized authentication."
msgstr "**Ujumbe wa moja kwa moja (Kwa hivyo) Mtandao wa Open (OIDC):** Ushirikiano usio na usawa na watoa utambulisho wa nje kwa uthibitisho wa kati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single Sign-On:** Frontend and controller share one Keycloak client and realm."
msgstr "**Ujumbe wa moja kwa moja:** Mdhibiti na Mkaguzi Mkuu wa Hesabu wa Hesabu za Serikali Keycloak wateja na wa uhakika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single Sign-On:** Users authenticate once via Keycloak and reuse the session across the platform."
msgstr "**Ujumbe wa moja kwa moja:** Watumiaji huthibitisha mara moja kupitia Keycloak Tumia muda wako wote kwenye jukwaa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single key, per-app subdomains:** one hidden service serves every app at `<app>.<node>.onion`, Host-routed by OpenResty."
msgstr "**Moja muhimu, kwa subdomains ya programu:** Moja ya huduma za bure kwa kila App `<app>.<node>.onion`, Kwa njia ya OpenResty..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single key, per-app subdomains:** one hidden service serves every app at ``<app>.<node>.onion``, Host-routed by OpenResty."
msgstr "**Moja muhimu, kwa subdomains ya programu:** Moja ya huduma za bure kwa kila App ``<app>.<node>.onion``, Kwa njia ya OpenResty..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single logic for all roles**"
msgstr "**Single mantiki kwa ajili ya majukumu yote**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single points of truth, enforced by lint.** The new *sys-lint* role pins the GitHub-release lint tools. Every mount target has one spot in *meta/volumes.yml* and container paths are derived from it, *default.env* is the enforced source of the primary domain, *container_backup* is rejected where no volume exists, and role credentials live at *meta/secrets.yml*. Linters no longer read gitignored build output, comments are checked in every file rather than only changed ones, and every shipped script requires a mirrored unit test."
msgstr "**Moja ya pointi ya ukweli, kutekelezwa na lint.** Mpya ya *sys-lint* Tumia zana za sauti za GitHub. Kila mlima una sehemu yake. *meta/volumes.yml* njia ya utumbo. *default.env* Je, ni chanzo cha msingi cha utawala, *container_backup* ni kukataliwa ambapo hakuna kiasi kuna na majukumu ya sifa kuishi katika *meta/secrets.yml*Linters hawasomi tena pato la kujenga, maoni yanazingatiwa katika kila faili badala ya kubadilishwa tu, na kila script iliyosafirishwa inahitaji mtihani wa kitengo cha kioo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single sign-on across protocols and domains.** Keycloak imports a SAML client for every app that asks for one; SuiteCRM authenticates against it via SAML instead of a proxy, and Shopware provisions its admin through AdminOpenAuth with the front and back channel split. Sessions are shared across app domains, the issuer is pinned to the canonical OIDC URL, each consumer's redirect scheme resolves on its own side, and the logout sweep runs where the visitor is looking. Directory users are read through one lookup so seeding cannot diverge."
msgstr "**Ishara moja juu ya itifaki na vikoa.** Keycloak inaagiza mteja wa SAML kwa kila programu inayouliza moja; SuiteCRM inathibitisha dhidi yake kupitia SAML badala ya wakala, na Shopware Kusimamia utawala wake kupitia AdminOpenAuth na mgawanyiko wa mbele na nyuma. Sessions zinashirikiwa katika vikoa vya programu, mtoaji huwekwa kwenye URL ya OIDC ya canonical, mpango wa kila mtumiaji unatatua kwa upande wake mwenyewe, na sweep ya logout inaendesha ambapo mgeni anaangalia. Watumiaji wa Directory ni kusoma kwa njia ya kuangalia moja hivyo seeding haiwezi tofauti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single sign-on:** When Keycloak is deployed, an OAuth2 proxy sits in front of the gateway and admits only members of the administrator group of this application."
msgstr "**Ujumbe wa moja kwa moja:** Wakati ambapo wakati Keycloak Inatumiwa, au2 Wakala anakaa mbele ya lango na anakubali wanachama tu wa kikundi cha msimamizi wa programu hii."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-Site path**: the claim MUST contain `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<role>` entries. The highest-privilege role across all matches wins (`administrator > editor > author > contributor > subscriber`). When no entry matches, the user's role is set to `subscriber` as a deterministic fallback."
msgstr "**Njia ya pekee**“Madai ya lazima yawe `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<role>` kuingia. Nafasi ya juu katika michezo yote ya kushinda (`administrator > editor > author > contributor > subscriber`). Wakati hakuna mechi za kuingia, jukumu la mtumiaji linawekwa `subscriber` Ni kama kuanguka kwa makusudi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-container deployment** via Docker Compose."
msgstr "**Usajili wa Single** Kwa kupitia Docker Compose..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-manager bootstrap:** Initialises the cluster on the manager with the configured advertise address; idempotent on re-runs."
msgstr "**Usimamizi wa bootstrap:** Kwanza, safisha mikono yako vizuri, tumia cream ya greasi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-owner model:** One privileged identity, gated by ``req.session.loggedIn``."
msgstr "**Mfumo wa Usajili wa Single:** Moja ya sifa za kipekee, zilizoainishwa na ``req.session.loggedIn``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-owner model:** One privileged identity, gated by `req.session.loggedIn`."
