# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Speed is measured at deploy time, not declared, and only for a model that has no rate yet.** A rate is a property of this machine under this load, not of the model, so no catalogue carries one and a hand-written number in `services.yml` would be a guess that rots. After the gateway is warm, [measure_speed.py](../../roles/svc-ai-litellm/files/python/measure_speed.py) asks it which models it serves and sends one warm-up request plus `services.litellm.router_speed_samples` (12) measured requests to each unranked one, taking their median as output tokens per second. The warm-up is discarded at every setting, including a one-sample run: a rate that still carries the model load time ranks a small model below a larger one, and the router then routes on that inversion."
msgstr "**Kasi inapimwa wakati wa kupeleka, sio kutangazwa, na tu kwa mfano ambao hauna kiwango bado.** Kiwango ni mali ya mashine hii chini ya mzigo huu, si ya mfano, hivyo hakuna katalogi hubeba moja na nambari iliyoandikwa kwa mkono `services.yml` Hii ni dhana ambayo inaumiza. Baada ya kupanda, mbegu ni imara. [measure_speed.py](../../roles/svc-ai-litellm/files/python/measure_speed.py) Waulize ni mifano gani ambayo hutumika na kutuma ombi moja la joto `services.litellm.router_speed_samples` (12) Kupimwa maombi kwa kila moja unranked moja, kuchukua median yao kama ishara pato kwa pili. Joto hutupwa katika kila mpangilio, ikiwa ni pamoja na kukimbia moja kwa moja: kiwango ambacho bado hubeba wakati wa mzigo wa mfano ni mfano mdogo chini ya moja kubwa, na router kisha njia kwenye inversion hiyo."

