# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm and proxy operation.** Convergence gates read one budget sized for a real stack, print every task row when a stack fails to converge, and give up on a terminal task; the deployment mode a stack was deployed with is resolved instead of assumed. OpenResty reloads a vhost, lua or redirect config instead of redeploying the task. GitLab ships its config trees as swarm configs rather than host binds, and role templates expand through a lookup instead of inline Jinja."
msgstr "**Operesheni ya wakala na wakala.** malango Convergence kusoma moja ya bajeti ukubwa kwa stack halisi, kuchapisha kila safu ya kazi wakati stack inashindwa kuunganisha, na kuacha juu ya kazi ya terminal; hali ya kupelekwa stack ilikuwa imewekwa na ni kutatuliwa badala ya kudhani. OpenResty upya vhost, lua au redirect config badala ya redeploying kazi. GitLab meli miti yake config kama configs kundi badala ya kumfunga mwenyeji, na templates jukumu kupanua kupitia kuangalia badala ya inline Jinja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm default runtime:** ``docker stack deploy`` drops the per-service ``runtime:`` key, so a swarm worker carries the sandbox as its daemon-wide ``default-runtime`` instead. The stack host keeps the shared kernel for the platform’s own services."
msgstr "**Mfumo wa default:** ``docker stack deploy`` Kupunguza matumizi ya huduma ``runtime:`` muhimu, hivyo mfanyakazi wa kundi hubeba sandbox kama daemon yake ``default-runtime`` Badala yake. Mwenyeji wa stack anaendelea kernel iliyoshirikiwa kwa huduma za jukwaa mwenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm default runtime:** `docker stack deploy` drops the per-service `runtime:` key, so a swarm worker carries the sandbox as its daemon-wide `default-runtime` instead. The stack host keeps the shared kernel for the platform's own services."
msgstr "**Mfumo wa default:** `docker stack deploy` Kupunguza matumizi ya huduma `runtime:` muhimu, hivyo mfanyakazi wa kundi hubeba sandbox kama daemon yake `default-runtime` Badala yake. Mwenyeji wa stack anaendelea kernel iliyoshirikiwa kwa huduma za jukwaa mwenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm deploys no longer abort on a network that already exists.** Some networks are created before their application's stack, as Prometheus does for every application it scrapes. Those networks now carry the stack label, so the application's own deploy uses the existing network instead of failing with \"network with name <entity> already exists\"."
msgstr "**WhatsApp haina tena utoaji mimba kwenye mtandao ambao tayari upo.** Baadhi ya mitandao huundwa kabla ya stack ya maombi yao, kama Prometheus kwa ajili ya kila maombi ambayo yanajitokeza. Mitandao hiyo sasa hubeba lebo ya stack, kwa hivyo matumizi ya programu hutumia mtandao uliopo badala ya kushindwa na \"Mtandao wa Jina <entity> Tayari kuna\"..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm parity via node-default runtime.** `docker stack deploy` ignores the compose `runtime:` key. The isolating runtime is therefore installed and set as the daemon-wide default on placement-labelled agent nodes; the agent services are pinned there via placement constraint, and every other service is kept off those nodes by the inverse constraint, because a node-wide default runtime applies to whatever is scheduled on it. Compose mode uses the compose `runtime:` key directly on the same image. Both modes MUST reach a running isolated agent, and the deploy MUST refuse to label a node whose daemon still defaults to the shared kernel. A dedicated provisioning role (`svc-virt-kata`) installs the runtime, re-renders the daemon configuration, and labels the node."
msgstr "**Kuingiliana kwa kutumia node-default runtime.** `docker stack deploy` Kuacha kuandika `runtime:` muhimu. Runtime ya isolating imewekwa na imewekwa kama chaguo la daemon kote kwenye nodes za wakala wa uwekaji; huduma za wakala zinawekwa hapo kupitia kizuizi cha uwekaji, na huduma zingine zote zinahifadhiwa kwenye nodes hizo kwa kizuizi cha kinyume, kwa sababu runtime ya default ya kila wakati inatumika kwa chochote kilichopangwa. Jinsi ya kutumia script `runtime:` Moja kwa moja kwenye picha. Njia zote mbili LAZIMA kufikia wakala wa pekee, na kupeleka LAZIMA kukataa kuweka node ambayo daemon bado inashindwa kwa kernel iliyoshirikiwa. Jukumu la kutoa (`svc-virt-kata`) Kisha, safisha nywele zako vizuri, tumia cream ya greasi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm, measured rather than assumed.** The deploy waits for its own update instead of guessing after it, refuses to call a stack converged while it is still updating, survives a task that failed and came back, reports what converged rather than only what did not, and says why the convergence probe refused. Placement is constrained to a role's declared platform arch, redis and memcached sidecars get a deploy block, and a run-once service no longer strands the stack deploy waiting for a replica it never has. The rescue dump captures the contents of the state volumes. In the test lab, workers are labelled kata-capable only when the app is sandboxed, NFS detaches before the node containers die, and the sandbox tier gets a second node."
msgstr "**Kwa mfano, badala ya kuwa na wasiwasi.** kupeleka kusubiri kwa update yake mwenyewe badala ya kubahatisha baada yake, anakataa wito stack converged wakati bado ni survive, anaishi kazi ambayo alishindwa na kurudi, ripoti nini converged badala ya tu nini si, na anasema kwa nini convergence uchunguzi alikataa. Uwekaji wa nafasi umezuiwa kwa arch ya jukwaa la jukumu lililotangazwa, sidecars zilizowekwa na memcached hupata kizuizi cha kupeleka, na huduma ya mara moja haipo tena safu ya kupeleka ikisubiri nakala ambayo haijawahi. Shughuli za uokoaji zinachukua yaliyomo ya kiasi cha serikali. Katika maabara ya mtihani, wafanyakazi wanawekwa kata-uwezo tu wakati programu ni sandboxed, NFS vikosi kabla ya vyombo node kufa, na sandbox tier anapata node ya pili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm:** single replica, ``placement: manager``, ``nfs: false`` on the raft volume, ``service_update_order = stop-first``. Raft’s BoltDB store is mmap + ``fsync`` based, so it must stay node-local and must never have two tasks writing one directory."
msgstr "**Kwa mfano:** Majibu ya moja kwa moja, ``placement: manager``, Kwa hivyo, ``nfs: false`` juu ya kiwango cha riba, ``service_update_order = stop-first``. Duka la BoltDB la Raft ni mmap + ``fsync`` msingi, hivyo ni lazima kukaa node-local na lazima kamwe kuwa na kazi mbili kuandika saraka moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm:** single replica, `placement: manager`, `nfs: false` on the raft volume, `service_update_order = stop-first`. Raft's BoltDB store is mmap + `fsync` based, so it must stay node-local and must never have two tasks writing one directory."
msgstr "**Kwa mfano:** Majibu ya moja kwa moja, `placement: manager`, Kwa hivyo, `nfs: false` juu ya kiwango cha riba, `service_update_order = stop-first`. Duka la BoltDB la Raft ni mmap + `fsync` msingi, hivyo ni lazima kukaa node-local na lazima kamwe kuwa na kazi mbili kuandika saraka moja."

