# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**The consumers must be down.** `--empty` pre-cleans the schema in one psql session and replays in the next; a booting consumer recreates the schema in between and the dump's own `CREATE TABLE` then fails. The replay checks the consumer's compose project and refuses while anything of it runs."
msgstr "**Watumiaji wanapaswa kuwa chini.** `--empty` Kabla ya kusafisha schema katika kikao kimoja cha psql na replays katika ijayo; mtumiaji wa booting hurekebisha schema kati na dump mwenyewe `CREATE TABLE` baada ya kushindwa. Replay inakagua mradi wa mwandishi wa watumiaji na kukataa wakati chochote kinaendesha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**The consumers must be down.** ``--empty`` pre-cleans the schema in one psql session and replays in the next; a booting consumer recreates the schema in between and the dump’s own ``CREATE TABLE`` then fails. The replay checks the consumer’s compose project and refuses while anything of it runs."
msgstr "**Watumiaji wanapaswa kuwa chini.** ``--empty`` Kabla ya kusafisha schema katika kikao kimoja cha psql na replays katika ijayo; mtumiaji wa booting anaunda schema kati na dump mwenyewe ``CREATE TABLE`` baada ya kushindwa. Replay inakagua mradi wa mwandishi wa watumiaji na kukataa wakati chochote kinaendesha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**The decision is deterministic, and a learned decision model is out of scope.** Among the routes that survive the filter, each is scored on the factors of decision 9 and the highest scorer wins, with the alias breaking a tie. The same request therefore returns the same model twice. No inference runs, nothing is downloaded, and the CI rows mean the same thing as production."
msgstr "**Uamuzi ni wa kuamua, na mfano wa uamuzi wa kujifunza ni nje ya upeo.** Miongoni mwa njia ambazo zinaishi filter, kila moja imefungwa juu ya mambo ya uamuzi 9 Na ushindi wa juu zaidi, na alias kuvunja tie. Kwa hiyo ombi hilo linarudia mfano huo mara mbili. Hakuna inference anaendesha, hakuna kitu ni kupakuliwa, na safu CI maana kitu sawa na uzalishaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**The deploy can create a role-internal administrator.** On an instance with no users at all there is no OIDC administrator to borrow an API key from, so [`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) creates the `openwebui-api-bot` declared in [`meta/users.yml`](./meta/users.yml), whose password the platform generates with every other user's. It is deliberately not an OIDC identity: Open WebUI ships `OAUTH_MERGE_ACCOUNTS_BY_EMAIL` disabled and refuses an OIDC login whose email a local account already holds, so seeding a person's address would lock them out of their own login. On an instance that already has an administrator no account is created."
msgstr "**Utekelezaji unaweza kuunda msimamizi wa ndani.** Kwa mfano, hakuna watumiaji kabisa hakuna msimamizi wa OIDC kukopa API ya msingi, hivyo [`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) Kuwa mbunifu. `openwebui-api-bot` Imetangazwa katika [`meta/users.yml`](./meta/users.yml), ambayo password jukwaa inazalisha na kila mtumiaji mwingine. Ni kwa makusudi sio utambulisho wa OIDC: Meli za Open WebUI `OAUTH_MERGE_ACCOUNTS_BY_EMAIL` walemavu na kukataa kuingia kwa OIDC ambayo barua pepe ya akaunti ya ndani tayari inashikilia, kwa hivyo kuona anwani ya mtu itawazuia kuingia kwao. Katika hali ambayo tayari ina msimamizi hakuna akaunti imeundwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**The deploy can create a role-internal administrator.** On an instance with no users at all there is no OIDC administrator to borrow an API key from, so ```tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` <./tasks/utils/mcp.yml>`__ creates the ``openwebui-api-bot`` declared in ```meta/users.yml`` <./meta/users.yml>`__, whose password the platform generates with every other user’s. It is deliberately not an OIDC identity: Open WebUI ships ``OAUTH_MERGE_ACCOUNTS_BY_EMAIL`` disabled and refuses an OIDC login whose email a local account already holds, so seeding a person’s address would lock them out of their own login. On an instance that already has an administrator no account is created."
msgstr "**Utekelezaji unaweza kuunda msimamizi wa ndani.** Kwa mfano, hakuna watumiaji kabisa hakuna msimamizi wa OIDC kukopa API ya msingi, hivyo ```tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` <./tasks/utils/mcp.yml>`__ creates the ``openwebui-api-bot`` declared in ```meta/users.yml`` <./meta/users.yml>`__, whose password the platform generates with every other user’s. It is deliberately not an OIDC identity: Open WebUI ships ``OAUTH_MERGE_ACCOUNTS_BY_EMAIL`` walemavu na kukataa kuingia kwa OIDC ambayo barua pepe ya akaunti ya ndani tayari inashikilia, kwa hivyo kuona anwani ya mtu itawazuia kuingia kwao. Katika hali ambayo tayari ina msimamizi hakuna akaunti imeundwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**The engine is read, not guessed.** It comes from the service key in the consuming role's `meta/services.yml`, the same value that fed the backup seed, resolved through `utils/recovery/databases.py`. A dump whose engine no role claims aborts the run instead of being replayed with an assumption."
msgstr "**Injini ya utafutaji ni kusoma, si kufikiri.** Hii ni kutokana na umuhimu wa huduma katika uzalishaji wa `meta/services.yml`, thamani sawa ambayo ililisha mbegu ya Backup, iliyotatuliwa kupitia `utils/recovery/databases.py`. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . a dump ambayo injini yake haina jukumu la kutoa mimba badala ya kuwa replayed na dhana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**The engine is read, not guessed.** It comes from the service key in the consuming role’s ``meta/services.yml``, the same value that fed the backup seed, resolved through ``utils/recovery/databases.py``. A dump whose engine no role claims aborts the run instead of being replayed with an assumption."
msgstr "**Injini ya utafutaji ni kusoma, si kufikiri.** Inakuja kutoka kwa ufunguo wa huduma katika jukumu la kuteketeza ``meta/services.yml``, thamani sawa ambayo ililisha mbegu ya Backup, iliyotatuliwa kupitia ``utils/recovery/databases.py``. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . a dump ambayo injini yake haina jukumu la kutoa mimba badala ya kuwa replayed na dhana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**The file's content IS the value of `applications.<app>.<topic>`. There is NO wrapping key matching the filename.**"
msgstr "**Maudhui ya faili ni thamani ya `applications.<app>.<topic>`. Hakuna kitu kinacholingana na jina la faili.**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**The gateway is authenticated with per-consumer virtual keys.** LiteLLM virtual keys are issued per consumer (OpenWebUI, Flowise, and each 032 agent); a master key is admin-only. This gives per-consumer rate limiting and revocation. The gateway MUST NOT be reachable unauthenticated even on the internal overlay. Keys live in each consumer role's `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` block."
msgstr "**Mlango wa lango unathibitishwa na funguo za kawaida za mteja.** Vipengele vya Virtual vya LiteLLM vinatolewa kwa watumiaji (ya ufunguzi, FlowiseNa kwa kila mmoja 032 Wakala wa Agent); Msingi wa msingi ni usimamizi tu. Hii inasababisha kupungua kwa kasi na kupungua kwa kasi. Mlango wa lango haipaswi kufikiwa hata kwa njia ya ndani. Watu wanaishi katika kila jukumu la mtumiaji `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` kuzuia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**The head leads unless an operator says otherwise.** Chunk 0 starts at the top of the ranking. The list is ordered coverage-first, so its head is what a run most needs proven, and a sweep that cannot afford the whole list leaves the tail behind rather than sliding a window over it."
msgstr "**Kichwa huongoza isipokuwa operator anasema vinginevyo.** Chunk ya 0 kuanza katika ngazi ya juu. Orodha imeamriwa chanjo ya kwanza, kwa hivyo kichwa chake ni nini mahitaji ya kukimbia yaliyothibitishwa, na sweep ambayo haiwezi kumudu orodha nzima inaacha mkia nyuma badala ya kufungua dirisha juu yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**The hook ships as a mounted Python file, not a derived image.** LiteLLM's `proxy_server.py` resolves a custom handler through `get_instance_fn(value, config_file_path)`, which loads `module.instance` out of the directory holding `config.yaml`. A `.py` file rendered next to it is therefore imported at proxy start with no image change, and `services.litellm.image` stays on its pin. [`probe_auth.py`](../../roles/svc-ai-litellm/files/python/probe_auth.py) is the precedent for a Python file the role ships and the container runs."
msgstr "**Meli za ndoano kama faili ya Python iliyopanda, sio picha inayotokana.** Ujumbe wa Mhe. `proxy_server.py` Kutoa ushauri wa kitaalamu kupitia `get_instance_fn(value, config_file_path)`, ambayo inazalisha `module.instance` nje ya Ofisi ya Mkurugenzi Mtendaji `config.yaml`. A. Kuwa `.py` Faili iliyotolewa karibu nayo kwa hiyo iliingizwa katika wakala kuanza na hakuna mabadiliko ya picha, na `services.litellm.image` Weka kwenye pini yako. [`probe_auth.py`](../../roles/svc-ai-litellm/files/python/probe_auth.py) Ni mfano wa faili ya Python meli za jukumu na chombo kinaendesha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**The integration matrix is a generated artifact with a sanctioned generator.** The generator lives under `cli/build/docs/integration_matrix/` and runs through `make integration-matrix`; `docs/` holds only the rendered page. It MUST satisfy the repo lints: its `EDGES` data moves into a sibling data module so the entrypoint stays under the 500-line limit, it uses the shared project-root helper instead of a local `__file__` upward walk, and it carries no self-path literal or `requirement NNN` token. The generated `027-integration-matrix.md` carries a `generated-artifact / not-a-requirement` head marker so the requirements-completeness/archival lint skips it. Dead upstream URLs in `EDGES` are fixed or dropped on regeneration."
msgstr "**matrix ushirikiano ni artifact yanayotokana na jenereta vikwazo.** Jenereta huishi chini ya `cli/build/docs/integration_matrix/` Na kwa kupitia `make integration-matrix`; `docs/` Chagua tu ukurasa ulioonyeshwa. Ni lazima kuwa na uhuru wa kuchagua: `EDGES` data hatua katika moduli sibling data hivyo entrypoint anakaa chini ya 500-line kikomo, inatumia pamoja mradi-root msaada badala ya eneo `__file__` kwenda juu, na haina njia ya kujitegemea halisi au `requirement NNN` kuwa. Uzalishaji wa `027-integration-matrix.md` Kuwa na A `generated-artifact / not-a-requirement` Kichwa alama hivyo mahitaji-ukamilifu / lint ya kijeshi kuruka ni. URL ya juu ya URL `EDGES` Kuondolewa au kuondolewa kwenye udongo."

