# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Unified schema, native mechanism preserved.** Every addon entry uses one schema across all roles. The app-native term is retained only as the `mechanism` field (`addon`, `plugin`, `mu_plugin`, `extension`, `module`, `bridge`). Tasks keep using the upstream installer for that mechanism; only the *declaration* is unified. App-specific runtime configuration is carried under an opaque `config:` mapping that only the owning role's tasks interpret, so the surrounding schema stays uniform while each addon keeps its full per-addon payload. Each `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` is therefore the single source for both the declaration and the runtime config: where a role previously split the enable/disable declaration from a per-addon config payload (e.g. Nextcloud's `vars/plugins/`), both move into that addon's `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` file and the superseded per-addon config files are deleted by the migration."
msgstr "**Mfumo wa umoja, mfumo wa asili uliohifadhiwa.** Kila kuingia kwa addon hutumia mpangilio mmoja katika majukumu yote. Neno la asili linahifadhiwa tu kama ifuatavyo; `mechanism` uwanja wa (`addon`, Kwa hivyo, `plugin`, Kwa hivyo, `mu_plugin`, Kwa hivyo, `extension`, Kwa hivyo, `module`, Kwa hivyo, `bridge`). Kazi zinaendelea kutumia installer ya upstream kwa utaratibu huo; tu *Taarifa ya* ya Muungano. Mpangilio maalum wa Runtime unafanywa chini ya opaque `config:` ramani kwamba kazi ya kumiliki tu kutafsiri, hivyo schema inayozunguka anakaa sare wakati kila addon inaweka mzigo wake kamili wa malipo ya kila siku. Kila mmoja kila mmoja `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` Kwa hiyo ni chanzo kimoja cha tangazo na usanidi wa wakati wa kukimbia: ambapo jukumu hapo awali liligawanya tamko la kuwezesha / lisilowezekana kutoka kwa mzigo wa malipo ya kila-addon (Mtandao wa NextCloud `vars/plugins/`)Pande zote mbili zinaunga mkono hatua hiyo ya `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` Faili na faili supersed per-addon config zinafutwa na uhamiaji."

