# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**``external.sh`` — real job-pickup smoke test (optional).** Uses ``RUNNER_API_TOKEN`` to confirm the runners registered and are online via the GitHub API, dispatches a smoke workflow, and polls it to completion. Skipped automatically when no token is present."
msgstr "**``external.sh`` Jaribio la kweli la kuvuta sigara (Uchaguzi wa hiari)...** Matumizi ya ``RUNNER_API_TOKEN`` kuthibitisha wapiganaji waliosajiliwa na ni mtandaoni kupitia GitHub API, hutuma kazi ya moshi, na kupiga kura kwa kukamilika. Skipped moja kwa moja wakati hakuna ishara ni sasa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**``images/``** opts into NFS (``nfs: true`` in the ``compose_volumes`` call from ``templates/compose.yml.j2``). The volume is shared across all swarm nodes so the MediaWiki application service can be rescheduled freely."
msgstr "**``images/``** Kuingia kwa NFS (``nfs: true`` Katika ``compose_volumes`` Wito kutoka kwa ``templates/compose.yml.j2``). . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . MediaWiki Huduma ya maombi inaweza kubadilishwa kwa uhuru."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**``local.sh`` — fully local, no external GitHub.** Checks the runner containers are healthy and the DooD socket works, then ``container cp``\\ s the repo into a runner, **builds the Infinito image locally**, and deploys ``web-app-dashboard`` (all other services disabled) inside a **sealed, throwaway Docker daemon** that shares the runner’s network namespace. The sandbox is torn down on exit, so the host stack is never touched and **no GitHub/GHCR access is required**. On the async test pass the heavy deploy is skipped (it is validated once on the sync pass)."
msgstr "**``local.sh`` Kwa ujumla, sio nje ya GitHub.** Angalia vyombo vya mkimbiaji ni salama na kazi ya soketi ya DooD, kisha ``container cp``Kuingia kwenye akaunti, **Kujenga picha ya Infinito ndani ya nchi**Kwa hiyo, nashauri ``web-app-dashboard`` (Huduma nyingine zote zilizopunguzwa) Ndani ya A **Kuondolewa kwa Docker Daemon** Hii ni pamoja na jina la mtumiaji wa router. Kwa upande mwingine, mmea huu umeharibiwa, kwa hiyo mmea hauwezi kukaushwa. **Hakuna upatikanaji wa GitHub / GHCR unahitajika**Katika jaribio la async, silaha nzito imeondolewa (Imethibitishwa mara moja juu ya kupita kwa sync)..."

