msgstr "**``web-app-keycloak``Sehemu ya SSO-proxy Sidecar** *(Uchaguzi wa hiari)* Kulinda tovuti na OAuth2..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`administrative_surface` (5):** `web-app-fusiondirectory`, `web-app-lam`, `web-app-pgadmin`, `web-app-phpldapadmin`, `web-app-phpmyadmin`. These UIs expose identity or database administration rather than a bounded application-domain API and are never represented by a shared service-account tool surface."
msgstr "**`administrative_surface` (5):** `web-app-fusiondirectory`, Kwa hivyo, `web-app-lam`, Kwa hivyo, `web-app-pgadmin`, Kwa hivyo, `web-app-phpldapadmin`, Kwa hivyo, `web-app-phpmyadmin`. UIs hizi zinafunua utambulisho au utawala wa database badala ya kikoa cha maombi. API Na kamwe huwakilishwa na uso wa chombo cha uwajibikaji wa huduma ya pamoja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`algorithm:` defaults to `plain`** when the field is omitted."
msgstr "**`algorithm:` Kushindwa kufanya `plain`** wakati ambapo ardhi imeharibiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`allowed_consumers` creates no network edge.** A client reaches a provider only when the provider declares a `kind: mcp_client` consumer in `meta/networks.yml`, or when the client happens to declare that provider for an unrelated reason. Four of twenty providers declared the opening; the other sixteen admitted consumers they could not serve, four of them enabled. Deploying Hermes failed at its own probe with `All connection attempts failed` against `http://prometheusmcp:8080/mcp`, because `hermes` joins `[gitlab, hermes, homeassistant, litellm, moodle]` while `prometheusmcp` joins `[prometheus]` alone."
msgstr "**`allowed_consumers` Hakuna haja ya kuwa na network edge.** Mteja anafikia mtoa huduma tu wakati mtoaji anatangaza `kind: mcp_client` Watumiaji katika `meta/networks.yml`, au wakati mteja hutokea kutangaza mtoa huduma huyo kwa sababu zisizohusiana. Watoa huduma wanne kati ya ishirini walitangaza ufunguzi; wengine kumi na sita walikiri watumiaji hawakuweza kutumikia, wanne wao waliwezeshwa. Kufukuza Hermes kushindwa katika uchunguzi wake mwenyewe `All connection attempts failed` dhidi ya `http://prometheusmcp:8080/mcp`, Kwa sababu `hermes` Kujiunga na `[gitlab, hermes, homeassistant, litellm, moodle]` Wakati akiwa `prometheusmcp` Kujiunga na `[prometheus]` pekee yake."

