# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**filesystem** -- which kind the row's docker data root runs on. The two read the row's position like an odometer: the distro is the low digit and the filesystem the high one, so consecutive rows walk every pairing rather than a diagonal through it. Turning both on the position directly would cover only ``n`` of the ``n x m`` pairs whenever the two pools happen to be the same length, and no sweep would unlock it, because the sweep shifts both by the same amount."
msgstr "**Mfumo wa faili** - ambayo aina ya docker data mizizi unaendelea. Wawili hao walisoma msimamo wa mstari kama odometer: distro ni tarakimu ya chini na mfumo wa faili wa juu, safu za mfululizo zinatembea kila jozi badala ya diagonal kupitia hiyo. Kugeuza wote juu ya nafasi moja kwa moja itakuwa tu kufunika ``n`` Kwa upande wa ``n x m`` jozi kila wakati mabwawa mawili kutokea kuwa urefu sawa, na hakuna sweep bila kufungua ni, kwa sababu sweep shifts wote kwa kiasi sawa."

