# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A block device (remote path under ``/dev/``) is recovered on the host over ssh (the host must carry the repo checkout), then the restored backup tree is rsync-pulled. An image file is rsync-pulled and recovered locally. Either way the result is a local backup root the caller then recovers from."
msgstr "Mfumo wa block (Barabara ya chini ``/dev/``) Kulipwa kwa mwenyeji juu ya Ssh (Mchezaji lazima awe na repo Checkout)Baada ya hapo, mbegu za mbegu zilizohifadhiwa zitahifadhiwa. Faili ya picha ni rsync-pulled na kurejeshwa ndani. Kwa njia yoyote matokeo ni mizizi ya chelezo ya ndani, mpiga simu kisha anapona."

# translated-by: libretranslate
