# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A capability neither catalogued nor declared counts as absent, and a limit neither catalogued nor declared is not enforced."
msgstr "Uwezo ambao haukuorodheshwa au kutangazwa makosa kama hayapo, na kikomo kisichoandikwa wala kutangazwa hakitimika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A change is incompatible with prior inventories, on-disk role-meta layout, deploy CLI, or stored runtime state."
msgstr "Mabadiliko hayalingani na wavumbuzi wa awali, mpangilio wa ngazi ya juu, kupeleka CLI, au hali ya kukimbia iliyohifadhiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A changed source becomes an empty entry, a removed source disappears."
msgstr "Chanzo kilichobadilishwa huwa kuingia tupu, chanzo kilichoondolewa hupotea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A classic personal access token MAY be used as a fallback for unrelated automation, but it MUST NOT be used here because user-bound credentials expand the blast radius and require manual rotation."
msgstr "Alama ya kawaida ya ufikiaji wa kibinafsi inaweza kutumika kama kurudi kwa automatisering isiyohusiana, lakini haipaswi kutumika hapa kwa sababu sifa za mtumiaji zinapanua radius ya mlipuko na zinahitaji mzunguko wa mwongozo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A clean `down && up` is required after the change: `make compose-up` alone recreates the bridge but compose then re-attaches existing containers with dynamic IPs instead of the static `default.env` ones, which breaks CoreDNS."
msgstr "Kuwa safi `down && up` Hii ni baada ya mabadiliko: `make compose-up` peke yake inajenga daraja lakini kutunga tena vyombo zilizopo na IPs nguvu badala ya tuli `default.env` Kwa wale ambao wana shida ya figo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A client declares what it can present instead of what it serves:"
msgstr "Mteja anatangaza kile anachoweza kutoa badala ya kile anachotumikia:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A client role discovers enabled shared server roles through the lookup, resolves the per-server credential, then connects server-to-server to each `/mcp` endpoint over Streamable HTTP. No candidate list is hard-coded and no browser-side fetch is involved."
msgstr "Jukumu la mteja linagundua majukumu ya seva ya pamoja kupitia uchunguzi, hutatua uaminifu wa seva, kisha huunganisha seva-kwa-server kwa kila mmoja. `/mcp` Bonyeza juu ya HTTP Streamable. Hakuna orodha ya mgombea ni ngumu-coded na hakuna uingizaji wa upande wa kivinjari unahusika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A client-only block MUST NOT declare an `endpoint`."
msgstr "Akaunti ya mteja pekee haipaswi kutangaza `endpoint`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A closing bracket that moves in front of a protected span takes the full stop behind it with it, which leaves the sentence running on."
msgstr "Bracket ya kufunga ambayo inakwenda mbele ya muda uliohifadhiwa inachukua kuacha kamili nyuma yake, ambayo inaacha sentensi inayoendelea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A cluster row states the cluster marker where a single-database row names a database, so :func:`credentials_of` would file every instance under the same key and keep only the first. Cluster credentials are therefore keyed by instance."
msgstr "Mstari wa nguzo unasema alama ya nguzo ambapo mstari wa data moja unataja database, kwa hivyo :func:`credentials_of` Utaweka kila kesi chini ya ufunguo mmoja na kuweka tu ya kwanza. Kwa hiyo, sifa za msingi zinawekwa kwa mfano."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A cold server answers its opening requests well above its steady rate, and the pair measured first used to inherit that and win every sweep. Repeating a pair back to back does not help, because all of its runs then sit inside the same opening window. The grid is therefore walked once per pass and the passes are what repeat, so the bonus lands on one run of one pair and the median drops it. The recorded spread says whether the winner is a real difference or the noise the whole grid sits in."
msgstr "Seva ya baridi hujibu maombi yake ya ufunguzi vizuri juu ya kiwango chake cha kutosha, na jozi lililopimwa kwanza lilitumiwa kurithi hiyo na kushinda kila sweep. Kurudia jozi nyuma haina kusaidia, kwa sababu wote wa anaendesha yake kisha kukaa ndani ya dirisha moja ufunguzi. gridi ni kwa hiyo kutembea mara moja kwa kupita na hupita ni nini kurudia, hivyo nchi bonus juu ya kukimbia moja ya jozi moja na median matone yake. Uenezi uliorekodiwa unasema kama mshindi ni tofauti halisi au kelele ambayo gridi nzima inakaa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A colon suffix on `<source>` is classified by shape:"
msgstr "Waziri wa Mambo ya Ndani `<source>` Imewekwa kwa sura:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A complete digital learning environment for schools, academies, and universities."
msgstr "Mazingira kamili ya kujifunza digital kwa shule, vyuo vikuu, na vyuo vikuu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A computed fallback defined in `_compute(short_key, resolved, variables)`."
msgstr "Ya marekebisho yaliyoainishwa katika `_compute(short_key, resolved, variables)`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A concrete end-to-end illustration of how the pieces compose. Nothing here is a new mechanism; it maps onto the decisions above."
msgstr "Mfano halisi wa mwisho-kwa-mwisho wa jinsi vipande vinavyotengeneza. Hakuna kitu hapa ni mfumo mpya; ni ramani kwenye maamuzi hapo juu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A condition that makes the replay unprovable."
msgstr "Ni hali ambayo inamfanya ashindwe kucheza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A confirmed hit is cached on disk. The probe stays on the upstream registry: it exists to prove the declared pin is still pullable from where the deploy pulls it, which a mirrored copy cannot answer for."
msgstr "Hit kuthibitishwa ni cached juu ya disk. Uchunguzi unakaa kwenye Usajili wa Upstream: ipo ili kuthibitisha pini iliyotangazwa bado inaweza kuvuta kutoka ambapo kupeleka huchota, ambayo nakala iliyoonekana haiwezi kujibu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A constant hides the role id the substring rule looks for, so every SPOT of this kind MUST be listed here or the roles referencing it silently drop their provider from the static closure."
msgstr "Mara kwa mara huficha jukumu la utawala wa kuimarisha unatafuta, kwa hivyo kila SPOT ya aina hii lazima iorodheshwa hapa au majukumu ya kuifanya iwe kimya kuacha mtoa huduma wao kutoka kufungwa kwa tuli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A consumer is a deployed role whose merged config enables a shared database of the provider's engine; a role with a dedicated database brings its own volume and is no consumer of the provider. A provider without a consumer holds only the databases its engine creates for itself, so no databases.csv row names it and baudolo records its volume undumped."
msgstr "Mtumiaji ni jukumu lililotumika ambalo config iliunganishwa inawezesha database ya pamoja ya injini ya mtoa huduma; jukumu na database iliyojitolea huleta kiasi chake mwenyewe na sio mtumiaji wa mtoa huduma. Mtoa huduma bila mtumiaji ana databases tu injini yake inajenga yenyewe, hivyo hakuna databases.csv Jina la safu ni na baudolo hurekodi kiasi chake kisichotarajiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A consumer reaches it as ``http://searxng:8080/search?q=<query>`` once it declares ``searxng`` in its own ``meta/services.yml`` with ``enabled`` and ``shared`` set. ``web-app-openwebui`` ships that flag and sends ``WEB_SEARCH_ENGINE=searxng`` with it."
msgstr "Mtumiaji anafikia kama ``http://searxng:8080/search?q=<query>`` Mara baada ya kutangaza ``searxng`` Kwa upande wake mwenyewe ``meta/services.yml`` Pamoja na ``enabled`` Aidha, na ``shared`` kuwa. ``web-app-openwebui`` meli hiyo ambayo imebeba bendera hiyo na ``WEB_SEARCH_ENGINE=searxng`` pamoja na hayo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A consumer reaches it as ``http://tika:9998`` once it declares ``tika`` in its own ``meta/services.yml`` with ``enabled`` and ``shared`` set, which is what attaches the consumer to this role’s network. ``web-app-openwebui`` ships that flag and sends ``CONTENT_EXTRACTION_ENGINE=tika`` with it."
msgstr "Mtumiaji anafikia kama ``http://tika:9998`` Mara baada ya kutangaza ``tika`` Kwa upande wake mwenyewe ``meta/services.yml`` Pamoja na ``enabled`` Aidha, na ``shared`` Kuweka, ambayo ni nini kinachounganisha mtumiaji kwenye mtandao wa jukumu hili. ``web-app-openwebui`` meli hiyo ambayo imebeba bendera hiyo na ``CONTENT_EXTRACTION_ENGINE=tika`` pamoja na hayo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A consumer reaches it as `http://searxng:8080/search?q=<query>` once it declares `searxng` in its own `meta/services.yml` with `enabled` and `shared` set. `web-app-openwebui` ships that flag and sends `WEB_SEARCH_ENGINE=searxng` with it."
msgstr "Mtumiaji anafikia kama `http://searxng:8080/search?q=<query>` Mara baada ya kutangaza `searxng` Kwa upande wake mwenyewe `meta/services.yml` Pamoja na `enabled` Aidha, na `shared` kuwa. `web-app-openwebui` meli hiyo ambayo imebeba bendera hiyo na `WEB_SEARCH_ENGINE=searxng` pamoja na hayo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A consumer reaches it as `http://tika:9998` once it declares `tika` in its own `meta/services.yml` with `enabled` and `shared` set, which is what attaches the consumer to this role's network. `web-app-openwebui` ships that flag and sends `CONTENT_EXTRACTION_ENGINE=tika` with it."
msgstr "Mtumiaji anafikia kama `http://tika:9998` Mara baada ya kutangaza `tika` Kwa upande wake mwenyewe `meta/services.yml` Pamoja na `enabled` Aidha, na `shared` Kuweka, ambayo ni nini kinachounganisha mtumiaji kwenye mtandao wa jukumu hili. `web-app-openwebui` meli hiyo ambayo imebeba bendera hiyo na `CONTENT_EXTRACTION_ENGINE=tika` pamoja na hayo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A consumer selecting `auto` receives a completion"
msgstr "Mtumiaji kuchagua `auto` Kupata kukamilika"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A consumer user named `<entity>` is restricted to keys matching `<entity>:*`."
msgstr "Mtumiaji mmoja aitwaye `<entity>` Kufungwa kwa funguo zinazolingana `<entity>:*`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A consuming role MAY override a shared service's config field in its own ``meta/services.yml`` ``services.<key>`` block. When it does not, the value falls back to the *provider* role's native declaration — the role whose entity name is ``<key>`` (e.g. ``svc-net-tor`` for ``tor``). This keeps provider defaults (e.g. ``tor.exclusive`` / ``tor.primary``) in one place while every consumer stays free to override the field per app."
msgstr "Jukumu la kuteketeza linaweza kuzidi uwanja wa usanidi wa huduma ya pamoja katika yake mwenyewe ``meta/services.yml`` ``services.<key>`` kuzuia. Ikiwa sio, thamani inarudi nyuma *Mtoa huduma* Asili ya jina - nafasi ambayo jina lake ni ``<key>`` (ya g. ``svc-net-tor`` Kwa ajili ya ``tor``). Hii ina maana kwamba mtoa huduma default (ya g. ``tor.exclusive`` Kwa hivyo ``tor.primary``) Katika sehemu moja wakati kila mtumiaji anakaa huru override shamba kwa programu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A container resolves through the runtime's embedded server on 127.0.0.11, which forwards to whatever the network was created with, so ``inspect`` on the container shows the address but never the forwarder behind it."
msgstr "Chombo kinatatua kupitia seva iliyoingia ya runtime kwenye 127.0.0.11, ambayo yamechanganya ubunifu ndani yake na yaweza kuwa ya kweli ``inspect`` Kwenye chombo huonyesha anwani lakini sio mbele nyuma yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A content publishing and distribution ecosystem for creators and media organizations."
msgstr "Maudhui ya kuchapisha na usambazaji wa mazingira kwa waumbaji na mashirika ya vyombo vya habari."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A cyber-resilient sovereign infrastructure foundation for high-assurance environments."
msgstr "Msingi wa miundombinu ya uhuru wa mtandao kwa mazingira ya msaada wa juu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A declaration names exactly one probe and any number of prefixes, either as one string or as a list. This module owns that grammar: the aliases, the validation and the timing arithmetic that decides what a composed probe inherits."
msgstr "Majina ya tamko hasa uchunguzi mmoja na idadi yoyote ya prefixes, ama kama kamba moja au kama orodha. Moduli hii inamiliki sarufi hiyo: aliases, uhalali na hesabu ya muda ambayo huamua nini uchunguzi unaojumuisha unarithi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A declaration wins over the catalog, and an uncatalogued route claims nothing"
msgstr "Azimio linashinda juu ya catalog, na njia uncatalogued anadai chochote"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A declared `traits.speed` still wins, because a declaration is the operator overriding the measurement and the next deploy must not overwrite it back."
msgstr "Taarifa ya `traits.speed` bado kushinda, kwa sababu tamko ni operator overriding kipimo na kupelekwa ijayo lazima si overwrite yake nyuma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "A declared value that is a ``{start, end}`` mapping renders as ``start-end`` on both sides, so a relay range needs no special term."
msgstr "Thamani ya hisa ambayo ni ``{start, end}`` kufanya kazi kama ``start-end`` Kwa upande wa pande zote mbili, aina mbalimbali za relay hazihitaji muda maalum."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A dedicated bot/service identity instead of administrator credentials, and read/search tools separated from post/channel management."
msgstr "Utambulisho wa bot / huduma badala ya sifa za msimamizi, na kusoma / kutafuta zana zilizotenganishwa na usimamizi wa posta / kituo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A dedicated disk mounted straight onto `/var/lib/docker` needs no special layout: baudolo carves its snapshot **inside** the subject, as `<data root>/.baudolo-<tag>`, so source and destination are always on the same filesystem. Placing it beside the subject would fail with `EXDEV` exactly on that layout, since the parent directory then belongs to a different filesystem."
msgstr "Disk moja kwa moja imewekwa kwenye `/var/lib/docker` Hakuna mpangilio maalum: baudolo carves snapshot yake **Ndani ya ndani** Kuhusu suala hilo, kama `<data root>/.baudolo-<tag>`, Hivyo chanzo na hatima ni daima juu ya mfumo huo wa faili. Kuweka kando suala hili kutashindwa `EXDEV` Hasa kwenye mpangilio huo, kwani saraka ya mzazi kisha ni ya mfumo tofauti wa faili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A dedicated disk mounted straight onto ``/var/lib/docker`` needs no special layout: baudolo carves its snapshot **inside** the subject, as ``<data root>/.baudolo-<tag>``, so source and destination are always on the same filesystem. Placing it beside the subject would fail with ``EXDEV`` exactly on that layout, since the parent directory then belongs to a different filesystem."
msgstr "Disk moja kwa moja imewekwa kwenye ``/var/lib/docker`` Hakuna mpangilio maalum: baudolo carves snapshot yake **Ndani ya ndani** Kuhusu suala hilo, kama ``<data root>/.baudolo-<tag>``, Hivyo chanzo na hatima ni daima juu ya mfumo huo wa faili. Kuweka kando suala hili kutashindwa ``EXDEV`` Hasa kwenye mpangilio huo, kwani saraka ya mzazi kisha ni ya mfumo tofauti wa faili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A dedicated network per agent whose only other member is the broker."
msgstr "Mtandao wa kujitolea kwa wakala ambaye tu mwanachama mwingine ni broker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A dedicated volume per user and platform holds the agent's state; it survives a stop."
msgstr "Kiasi cha kujitolea kwa mtumiaji na jukwaa linashikilia hali ya wakala; inaishi kuacha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A demanded capability must be proven, while a disqualifier needs explicit evidence"
msgstr "Uwezo unaohitajika lazima uthibitishwe, wakati disqualifier inahitaji ushahidi wazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A deploy job is titled ``<mode glyph><tor glyph><distro glyph><filesystem glyph><architecture glyph><display name> <variant>`` with an optional trailing ⭐ for a priority row. The middle is resolved through the display-name codec rather than matched as a raw role id: job names carry display names, so a regex over ``web-app-…`` silently matched nothing and every failure went unreported."
msgstr "Nafasi ya kazi ni jina ``<mode glyph><tor glyph><distro glyph><filesystem glyph><architecture glyph><display name> <variant>`` na uchaguzi wa hiari kwa mstari wa kipaumbele. Katikati imetatuliwa kupitia msimbo wa jina la kuonyesha badala ya kufanana kama ID ya jukumu ghafi: majina ya kazi hubeba majina ya kuonyesha, hivyo regex juu ya ``web-app-…`` Kwa kimya hakulingana na chochote na kila kushindwa hakuripotiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A deploy job title carries the whole row it deployed -- role, variant, mode, onion state, distro, filesystem, architecture -- and :mod:`utils.github.variant.selection` is the grammar that writes it back down."
msgstr "Jina la kazi la kupeleka hubeba mstari wote uliotumika - jukumu, lahaja, mode, hali ya onion, distro, filesystem, usanifu - na :mod:`utils.github.variant.selection` Hii ni sarufi ambayo inaandika nyuma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A deploy with zero or more than one manager fails at inventory-validation time, never at runtime."
msgstr "Kupelekwa kwa sifuri au zaidi ya meneja mmoja inashindwa wakati wa hesabu, kamwe wakati wa kukimbia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A deployed host may correct or extend any of this from its inventory under `applications.svc-cache-package.repos` and `.upstreams`; the dev stack has no inventory and uses the declarations unchanged."
msgstr "Mwenyeji aliyetumiwa anaweza kurekebisha au kupanua yoyote ya haya kutoka kwa hesabu yake chini `applications.svc-cache-package.repos` Aidha, na `.upstreams`; stack ya kubuni haina hesabu na hutumia matangazo yasiyobadilika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A deployment that keeps the shipped `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` serves names under `infinito.localhost`. Those exist in no zone, so a task that reaches the deployment's own domain from the host depends on the `myhostname` NSS module, which maps any `*.localhost` name to loopback per RFC 6761."
msgstr "Hatua ambazo zinaendelea kuchukuliwa `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` Andika majina ya chini `infinito.localhost`. Wale wapo katika eneo hakuna, hivyo kazi inayofikia uwanja wa kupelekwa kutoka kwa mwenyeji inategemea `myhostname` NSS mfumo wa kompyuta, ambayo ina ramani yoyote `*.localhost` Jina la kikoa kwa RFC 6761..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A deployment that keeps the shipped ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` serves names under ``infinito.localhost``. Those exist in no zone, so a task that reaches the deployment’s own domain from the host depends on the ``myhostname`` NSS module, which maps any ``*.localhost`` name to loopback per RFC 6761."
msgstr "Hatua ambazo zinaendelea kuchukuliwa ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` Andika majina ya chini ``infinito.localhost``. Wale wapo katika eneo hakuna, hivyo kazi inayofikia uwanja wa kupelekwa kutoka kwa mwenyeji inategemea ``myhostname`` NSS mfumo wa kompyuta, ambayo ina ramani yoyote ``*.localhost`` Jina la kikoa kwa RFC 6761..."

