msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A docs `README.md` MUST describe the audience, subject area, or boundary of the documentation in that directory when that context helps readers."
msgstr "Ya docs `README.md` Lazima kuelezea watazamaji, eneo la somo, au mipaka ya nyaraka katika saraka hiyo wakati muktadha huo unawasaidia wasomaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A docs `README.md` MUST explain what kind of documentation lives in that directory and what scope that documentation covers. It MUST help readers understand the subject area and boundary of the folder without replacing the documentation pages themselves."
msgstr "Ya docs `README.md` Lazima kueleza aina gani ya nyaraka anaishi katika saraka hiyo na ni upeo gani kwamba nyaraka inashughulikia. Inapaswa kuwasaidia wasomaji kuelewa eneo la somo na mipaka ya folda bila kubadilisha kurasa za nyaraka wenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A docs `README.md` MUST stay short and scope-focused."
msgstr "Ya docs `README.md` Inapaswa kuwa fupi na yenye malengo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A failing pre-state snapshot aborts the deploy (no `suppress_flush`): no update proceeds without a successful backup of the state it is about to change. `svc-bkp-local-2-device` is never started at deploy time (no device present); it stays plug-triggered via its `.mount` unit."
msgstr "Image caption Picha ya kabla ya serikali kushindwa kutoa mimba (Hakuna cha `suppress_flush`): Hakuna update inaendelea bila salama ya mafanikio ya serikali ni karibu kubadilika. `svc-bkp-local-2-device` Hajawahi kuanza kutumia muda (Hakuna mfumo wa sasa); `.mount` Muungano."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A failure whose root cause is container runtime state (config, plugin, user binding, env) is by definition reproducible-there and does NOT qualify for the post-deploy-state exception."
msgstr "Kushindwa ambayo chanzo chake ni hali ya kukimbia chombo (config, Plugin, mtumiaji kufunga, env) Ni kwa ufafanuzi reproducible-po na haina kufuzu kwa ubaguzi wa baada ya hali ya kazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A fallback MUST stay inside the permitted set, and a run whose whole permitted set is unservable MUST fail rather than leave it. The job title and the artifact name carry the kind the matrix assigned; the step summary carries the effective one."
msgstr "Kuanguka lazima kukaa ndani ya seti inaruhusiwa, na kukimbia ambaye seti nzima inaruhusiwa ni lazima kushindwa badala ya kuondoka. Kichwa cha kazi na jina la bandia hubeba aina ya matrix iliyotolewa; muhtasari wa hatua hubeba ufanisi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A fallback is reported, never silent. The job title and artifact name carry the kind the matrix *assigned*, while [docker_dataroot.sh](../../scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/docker_dataroot.sh) writes the *effective* filesystem and the reason into the step summary. When a run has to prove a filesystem-dependent path, read the summary rather than the title, or name the kind on the run to make it a demand. The snapshot mode of `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` is the case that matters: it only engages on btrfs and zfs."
msgstr "Kuna msemo unaosema, never silent. Jina la kazi na jina la bandia hubeba aina ya matrix *Waliochaguliwa*Hata hivyo, wakati [docker_dataroot.sh](../../scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/docker_dataroot.sh) Aliandika kuwa *Ufanisi wa ufanisi* Mfumo wa faili na sababu katika muhtasari wa hatua. Wakati kukimbia inahitaji kuthibitisha njia ya kutegemea mfumo wa faili, soma muhtasari badala ya kichwa, au jina la aina kwenye kukimbia ili kuifanya iwe mahitaji. Njia ya snapshot ya `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` Hii ina maana kwamba ni muhimu tu kwa ajili ya kulisha na kulisha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A federated and community-driven platform for discussion, media sharing, and social networking."
msgstr "Jukwaa linalotolewa na jamii kwa majadiliano, kugawana vyombo vya habari, na mitandao ya kijamii."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A filesystem row states the kind the matrix *assigned*. A deploy may fall back from it when the host kernel cannot serve it (``scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/resolve.sh``) and the title does not record that, so read that axis as a preference ranking and prove the kind separately before pinning it."
msgstr "Mstari wa filesystem unasema aina ya matrix *Waliochaguliwa*Kuhamishwa kunaweza kuanguka kutoka kwake wakati kernel ya mwenyeji haiwezi kutumika (``scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/resolve.sh``) Na cheo hakirekodi kwamba, hivyo kusoma kwamba mhimili kama cheo upendeleo na kuthibitisha aina tofauti kabla pinning yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A final `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` run has completed with the spec passing against the freshly provisioned stack. Inner-loop passes alone do NOT satisfy this gate."
msgstr "Mwisho wa `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` Kwa upande mwingine, ni juu ya kupanda mbegu katika chafu. Njia pekee ya kuingia ndani haiwezi kukidhi lango hili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A flag is ``true`` only when the addon is both ``enabled`` AND ``required``. Optional addons (``required: false``) are intentionally skipped by the spec suite — they are a variant axis, not a guaranteed surface — so their gate flag is ``false`` even when enabled."
msgstr "Bendera ya Volta ya Juu ``true`` Ni wakati huo tu ambapo pande zote mbili ``enabled`` Na kwa kuwa ``required``. Chaguo la addons (``required: false``) Wao kwa makusudi wameruka na suti ya spec - wao ni mhimili wa lahaja, si uso wa uhakika - hivyo bendera yao ya lango ni ``false`` hata kama imeruhusiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A fork PR triggers a `pull_request_target` run that builds and mirrors any new images needed by the fork, authenticating to GHCR with the per-job `GITHUB_TOKEN`."
msgstr "Kwa upande mwingine, PR husababisha `pull_request_target` kukimbia kwamba hujenga na vioo picha yoyote mpya zinazohitajika na fork, kuthibitisha kwa GHCR na kwa kazi `GITHUB_TOKEN`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A fourth variant was built first and then withdrawn: `tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_limit.py` caps a role at three, on the stated ground that variants exercise dynamic-flag polarities rather than enumerate features, and the `# nocheck: variant-limit` escape would have been a suppression bought to keep a design that fits in three anyway."
msgstr "Sehemu ya nne ilibadilishwa kwanza na kisha kuondolewa: `tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_limit.py` caps jukumu katika tatu, juu ya ardhi alisema kwamba variants zoezi polarities nguvu badala ya enumerate makala, na `# nocheck: variant-limit` Kutoroka ingekuwa ukandamizaji kununuliwa kuweka kubuni ambayo inafaa katika tatu anyway."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A fragment can only ever be stricter than the host already is. In nftables an ``accept`` terminates its own base chain and nothing more: the packet still traverses every other chain at that hook, and a ``drop`` in any of them wins. A rule that has to overrule a policy someone else set, such as the ``DROP`` docker installs on forwarded packets, does not belong in a fragment at all; it belongs in the chain that carries that policy."
msgstr "Kipande kinaweza kuwa kali zaidi kuliko mwenyeji tayari. Katika kipindi cha mwaka ``accept`` Inamaliza mnyororo wake wa msingi na hakuna zaidi: pakiti bado inazunguka kila mnyororo mwingine kwenye ndoano hiyo, na ``drop`` Katika kila moja wao kushinda. Sheria ambayo inasimamia sera ya mtu mwingine iliyowekwa, kama vile ``DROP`` Docker hufunga pakiti za mbele, sio sehemu ya kipande kabisa; ni katika mnyororo unaobeba sera hiyo."

