# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A handler MAY import stdlib, [parser.py](../parser.py), [runtime.py](../runtime.py), and any repo module whose own import closure is stdlib-only. The whole closure MUST import and run on the bare bootstrap python, before any dependency is installed. `utils.cache.files` and [yaml_bootstrap.py](../../yaml_bootstrap.py) qualify; `utils.cache.yaml` does not, because it imports PyYAML. Read SPOT files with `utils.cache.files.read_text` plus `utils.yaml_bootstrap.load_block` or a stdlib line parse. `load_block` accepts block mappings, block lists and string scalars only, and raises `BootstrapYamlError` on everything else, so a SPOT file read this way MUST stay inside that subset. [test_bare_bootstrap.py](../../../tests/integration/meta/env/test_bare_bootstrap.py) enforces this by running the generator with every non-stdlib import blocked."
msgstr "Kwa mfano, mtu anaweza kuingia katika hali ya utulivu. [parser.py](../parser.py), Kwa hivyo, [runtime.py](../runtime.py), na moduli yoyote ya repo ambayo kufungwa kwa kuingiza mwenyewe ni stdlib-tu. Kufungwa kwa yote lazima kuagiza na kukimbia kwenye kichupo cha bootstrap, kabla ya utegemezi wowote imewekwa. `utils.cache.files` Aidha, na [yaml_bootstrap.py](../../yaml_bootstrap.py) sifa za kitaaluma; `utils.cache.yaml` Si, kwa sababu inazalisha pyYAML. Soma faili za Spoti na `utils.cache.files.read_text` Zaidi ya `utils.yaml_bootstrap.load_block` Au hata katika soko la hisa. `load_block` Inakubali ramani za kuzuia, orodha za kuzuia na scalars za kamba tu, na huongeza `BootstrapYamlError` Juu ya kila kitu kingine, hivyo faili ya SPOT kusoma njia hii lazima kukaa ndani ya subset hiyo. [test_bare_bootstrap.py](../../../tests/integration/meta/env/test_bare_bootstrap.py) Inatekeleza hili kwa kuendesha jenereta na kila uingizaji wa non-stdlib imefungwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
