# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A jeff that cannot be reached rejects the request. It is not routed around, because the caller named an alias precisely so it would not have to know which model answered, and substituting a different decider would make that answer mean something else."
msgstr "Jeff ambayo haiwezi kufikiwa inakataa ombi hilo. Haijaelekezwa kote, kwa sababu mpiga simu aitwaye alias hasa hivyo ingekuwa si kuwa na kujua ambayo mfano akajibu, na substituting mwamuzi tofauti kufanya jibu hilo maana kitu kingine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A job URL narrows the download to that job's app; a bare run URL pulls every `role-runtimes-*` artifact in the run."
msgstr "URL ya kazi hupunguza kupakua kwenye programu ya kazi hiyo; URL ya kukimbia wazi huvuta kila `role-runtimes-*` Artificial katika njia ya utumbo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A job counts as failed when it never finished, when the module reported ``failed``, or when a command returned a non-zero ``rc``. What distinguishes a real failure from an idempotent no-op differs per API and lives in different keys: modules put it in ``msg`` (cloudflare answers \"An identical record already exists\"), commands put it in ``stdout`` (``ollama pull`` prints \"up to date\" and exits non-zero). Both are searched, so a caller passes the tolerated phrasing and does not have to know which key carries it."
msgstr "Kazi inahesabu kama kushindwa wakati haijawahi kumaliza, wakati moduli iliripoti ``failed``, Au ikiwa wanachama wavivu wa ibada moja ya uchawi ... ``rc``. Nini tofauti ya kushindwa halisi kutoka idempotent no-op inatofautiana kwa API Na kuishi katika funguo mbalimbali: modules kuweka katika ``msg`` (Majibu ya Cloudflare \"Rekodi ya sasa ni sawa na\"), Amri hizo ziliwekwa katika ``stdout`` (``ollama pull`` Magazeti ya \"Hadi kufikia tarehe\" Kuondolewa kwa sifuri)Wote ni searched, hivyo wito hupita phrasing kuvumilia na haina haja ya kujua ambayo muhimu hubeba yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A job title states its whole combination, which lets `--failed` replay the mode, onion state and distribution, and makes a plan table row comparable to the job it predicts."
msgstr "Jina la kazi linaeleza mchanganyiko wake wote, ambayo inaruhusu `--failed` Replay mode, hali ya onion na usambazaji, na hufanya safu ya meza ya mpango sawa na kazi inayotabiri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A job's green conclusion is **NOT** evidence for a specific change. Before citing a run as proof, you MUST locate the line in that job's log where the change executed: a Playwright spec's `✓` (a leading `-` means the spec was skipped), the env var inside the container, or the command text of an `if:`-gated step. If the string is absent, report the run as silent on the change, not as supporting it."
msgstr "Mwisho wa kazi ni **Sio ya** ushahidi wa mabadiliko fulani. Kabla ya kuelezea kukimbia kama ushahidi, unapaswa kupata mstari katika logi ya kazi hiyo ambapo mabadiliko yaliyofanywa: spec ya Playwright `✓` (Kiongozi wa `-` Hii inamaanisha kuwa ndege hiyo ilianguka), var ndani ya chombo, au maandishi ya amri ya `if:`Hatua ya kuchukua. Ikiwa kamba haipo, ripoti kukimbia kama kimya juu ya mabadiliko, sio kama kuunga mkono."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A key that some environment declares per run therefore MUST be written by a dedicated handler through `eb.set`. The exporting shell still wins for its own run, because [load.sh](../../scripts/meta/env/load.sh) preserves non-empty caller values when it sources `.env`; the file keeps the derived default. `INFINITO_RUNNING_ON_GITHUB` and `INFINITO_CACHE_STACK` are written this way. Note the consequence: for those keys `.env` and the running shell can legitimately disagree, and `.env` is not the authority."
msgstr "Kitu muhimu ambacho baadhi ya mazingira hutangaza kwa kukimbia kwa hivyo lazima iandikwe na msimamizi aliyejitolea kupitia `eb.set`“Uwekezaji wa mafuta bado una faida zake, kwa sababu [load.sh](../../scripts/meta/env/load.sh) Inahifadhi thamani ya simu zisizo za simu wakati vyanzo `.env`; Faili inaendelea default inayotokana. `INFINITO_RUNNING_ON_GITHUB` Aidha, na `INFINITO_CACHE_STACK` imeandikwa kwa njia hii. Kumbuka: kwa ajili ya vifaa hivi `.env` Kwa upande mwingine, njia ya utumbo inaweza kutofautiana, na `.env` Sio mamlaka ya umma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A key's comment is the most recent contiguous block of `# ...` lines directly above the `KEY=...` line, joined with single spaces. Section headers (`# --- ... ---`) are treated as separators: they reset the pending comment so the next key starts fresh, instead of inheriting the heading line as its own documentation."
msgstr "Maoni ya muhimu ni block ya hivi karibuni ya contiguous `# ...` Moja kwa moja juu ya `KEY=...` Muungano, pamoja na maeneo ya Muungano. Sehemu ya kichwa (`# --- ... ---`) Wanachukuliwa kama separators: wanabadilisha maoni yaliyosubiri ili ufunguo unaofuata uanze safi, badala ya kurithi mstari wa kichwa kama nyaraka zake mwenyewe."

