# licha ya kuwepo kwa familia yake. `context` Inaweka nyumba yako ya sasa
# kwenye kuingia, chakula `AI_MODEL_CONTEXTS` Aidha, na `num_ctx`, na kufungua
# mlango wa kutokea kwa tukio hilo.
msgid "A model entry MAY still carry a `traits` mapping (`vision`, `tools`, `max_output`, `cost`), and it wins over the catalog. That is for what the catalog does not know: `openrouter/auto`, the mock, and a local tag such as `ollama/qwen2.5:0.5b` that is absent although its family is present. `context` keeps its existing home on the entry, feeds `AI_MODEL_CONTEXTS` and `num_ctx`, and outranks the catalogued window."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A model that already carries a rate is not measured at all. Re-measuring everything on every deploy would send traffic whose result the tolerance below discards anyway, and that traffic is the entire live surface of this step: it is what can hang, what can fail the deploy, and what the deploy waits for. `services.litellm.router_speed_remeasure` discards the stored numbers once, for the case where the hardware under them changed."
msgstr "Mfano ambao tayari hubeba kiwango haujapimwa kabisa. Kupima tena kila kitu kwenye kila kupeleka kunaweza kutuma trafiki ambayo matokeo yake uvumilivu chini huacha hata hivyo, na trafiki hiyo ni uso wote wa moja kwa moja wa hatua hii: ni nini kinachoweza hutegemea, ni nini kinachoweza kushindwa kupeleka, na kile kinachosubiri kupelekwa. `services.litellm.router_speed_remeasure` Inaondoa nambari zilizohifadhiwa mara moja, kwa kesi ambapo vifaa vilivyo chini yao vimebadilika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A model that already carries a rate sends no request, and the remeasure switch sends them again"
msgstr "Mfano ambao tayari hubeba kiwango hutuma ombi, na kubadili remeasure hutuma tena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A model that serves agents declares its context window in tokens: `context` on an `AI_LOCAL_MODELS` entry or on a `services.litellm.remote_models` entry. LiteLLM sends it to Ollama as `num_ctx` and publishes it as `model_info.max_input_tokens`, and the broker writes it into the agent config as Hermes `model.context_length` and OpenClaw `contextWindow`. Without it Ollama truncates the agent's prompt to its own default window and the agents assume windows of their own."
msgstr "Mfano ambao hutumikia mawakala hutangaza dirisha lake la muktadha katika ishara: `context` Juu ya `AI_LOCAL_MODELS` Kuingia au kuingia kwenye A `services.litellm.remote_models` kuingia. Magufuli afanya hivyo Ollama Kama vile `num_ctx` Kuchapisha kama `model_info.max_input_tokens`, na broker anaandika katika wakala config kama Hermes `model.context_length` Aidha, na OpenClaw `contextWindow`. Bila ya hivyo Ollama Inaondoa haraka ya wakala kwenye dirisha lake la default na mawakala huchukua madirisha yao wenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A module MAY read tool-specific environment overrides (e.g. `ACTIONLINT_VERSION`, `RUFF_PIP_SPEC`) at call time."
msgstr "Moduli inaweza kusoma mazingira maalum ya chombo (ya g. `ACTIONLINT_VERSION`, Kwa hivyo, `RUFF_PIP_SPEC`) wakati wa simu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A module name MUST match the lowercase snake_case of the tool it installs:"
msgstr "Jina la moduli lazima lifanane na kiwango cha chini snake_case Kwa kutumia chombo ambacho kinatengeneza:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A monitored declared addon whose pinned ``version`` is behind the candidate's ``latest`` becomes a :class:`VersionSuggestion`."
msgstr "Akamatwa kwa kumchoma kisu mwenzake ``version`` Nyuma ya mgombea ``latest`` Kuwa A :class:`VersionSuggestion`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A name is skipped. Every other protected span ends in a delimiter, so a letter right behind it can only be the text the boundary was lost from, but a name ends in a word character and an agglutinative language suffixes it: ``Baserow`` is found inside the Bengali ``Baserowo`` and the punctuation would land inside the word."
msgstr "Jina lake limehifadhiwa. Kila muda mwingine uliohifadhiwa unaishia katika delimiter, kwa hivyo barua iliyo nyuma yake inaweza tu kuwa maandishi ambayo mpaka ulipotea, lakini jina linaishia katika tabia ya neno na lugha ya agglutinative inaisukuma: ``Baserow`` Ndani ya Bengali ``Baserowo`` Neno la siri linaingia ndani yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A name with more than one URL is a conflict the caller decides about; this function reports rather than resolves it."
msgstr "Jina lililo na URL zaidi ya moja ni mgogoro ambao mpiga simu anaamua; ripoti hii ya kazi badala ya kutatua."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A new addon surfaced by a catalog adapter that is not yet declared."
msgstr "A addon mpya inakabiliwa na adapta ya catalog ambayo bado haijatangazwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A new app MUST:"
msgstr "Programu mpya inahitaji:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A new helper MUST live in the subfolder that matches its responsibility. New responsibilities MAY motivate a new subfolder, but MUST NOT flatten back into the top level."
msgstr "Msaidizi mpya lazima aishi katika sehemu ndogo inayolingana na wajibu wake. Majukumu mapya yanaweza kuhamasisha subfolder mpya, lakini haipaswi kurudi kwenye ngazi ya juu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A new key MUST be placed in `RESOLUTION_ORDER` after every key it depends on, and the administrator key table MUST be updated to document the new field."
msgstr "Kuna haja ya kuweka msingi mpya katika `RESOLUTION_ORDER` Baada ya kila ufunguo inategemea, na meza muhimu ya msimamizi lazima isasishwa ili kuandika uwanja mpya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A new role `svc-ai-agent-broker` runs the broker and a restricted container-API proxy."
msgstr "Jukumu jipya `svc-ai-agent-broker` Inakua kwa kasi na kwa kasi ya kasi,API ya pro."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A new shared service MUST:"
msgstr "Huduma mpya ya pamoja lazima:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A no-variant `mode=reinstall` as the reaction to a failed variant or a code change. Only rows 1 and 4 omit `variant=`. To retry one failing variant, pin it with row 2; never restart the whole matrix to retry a single variant."
msgstr "Hakuna njia ya mkato `mode=reinstall` Kama majibu ya tofauti kushindwa au mabadiliko ya kodi. Ni tu kwa ajili ya 1 Aidha, na 4 Kuondoa `variant=`. Ili kurekebisha tofauti moja ya kushindwa, pin kwa mstari 2; Kamwe usianzishe tena matrix nzima ili kurekebisha tofauti moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A number is that many rows; anything else is a selection token (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`) and the start is the first regular row it names. Resuming at a role beats counting rows by hand: the ranking shifts whenever a variant is added, so the index that meant 'carry on behind nextcloud' yesterday means something else today, while the token still says it."
msgstr "Idadi ni kwamba safu nyingi; kitu kingine chochote ni ishara ya uteuzi (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`) Na mwanzo ni mstari wa kwanza wa kawaida unaotaja majina. Resuming katika jukumu beats kuhesabu safu kwa mkono: cheo zamu wakati lahaja ni aliongeza, hivyo index kwamba maana 'carry nyuma ya nextcloud' jana ina maana kitu kingine leo, wakati ishara bado anasema ni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A parsed README: everything before the first H2, then its H2 blocks."
msgstr "Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi. ....................................................................2, Kwa upande wake H2 wa vitalu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A path is yielded iff it survives both the in-process skip-dir pruning of :func:`iter_project_files` and the ``.gitignore`` match."
msgstr "Njia ni kutolewa iff ni kuishi wote wawili katika mchakato kuruka-dir kupogoa :func:`iter_project_files` Na kwa kuwa ``.gitignore`` mchezo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A per-tool module MAY import from `utils.cache` (for `PROJECT_ROOT`) and from stdlib."
msgstr "Moduli ya pertool inaweza kuagiza kutoka `utils.cache` (Kwa ajili ya `PROJECT_ROOT`) kwa hisani ya RaiaMwema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A per-tool module MUST NOT import another per-tool module. Shared logic flows through `utils.install.primitives`, `utils.install.pip`, `utils.install.npm`, `utils.install.github_release`, and `utils.install.system_pkg` only."
msgstr "Moduli ya kila-tool haipaswi kuingiza moduli nyingine ya kila-tool. mantiki ya pamoja kupitia `utils.install.primitives`, Kwa hivyo, `utils.install.pip`, Kwa hivyo, `utils.install.npm`, Kwa hivyo, `utils.install.github_release`, Aidha, na `utils.install.system_pkg` ya pekee."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A persona scenario MUST fail loudly when its contracted journey cannot execute end-to-end. A silent `test.skip(...)` on runtime detection of \"no logout button\", \"no authenticated surface\", or \"no admin UI marker\" is FORBIDDEN. Silent skips hide real regressions (broken OIDC mapping, removed logout button, misconfigured oauth2-proxy, drifted UI selectors) behind a green deploy."
msgstr "Hali ya mtu lazima kushindwa kwa sauti wakati safari yake ya mkataba haiwezi kutekeleza mwisho-kwa-mwisho. Kuwa kimya `test.skip(...)` Wakati wa kutafuta ufumbuzi \"Hakuna kifungo cha logi\"Kwa hivyo, \"Hakuna eneo la uhakika\"Kwa hivyo, au \"Hakuna ada ya usajili\" Kuwa tayari. Home » Unlabelled » Wabunge wapinga mabadiliko ya kweli (kuvunjwa OIDC ramani, kuondolewa kifungo logout, misconfigured oauth2-proxy, iliyotokana na kuchagua) Nyuma ya sanduku la kijani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A persona scenario that only logs in and logs out is NOT enough. After the auth chain settles (or directly on the role surface when no auth is required), every persona MUST drive a real, app-specific interaction so the spec proves the role is responsive to user input, not just reachable."
msgstr "Hali ya mtu ambayo inaingia tu na kuingia nje haitoshi. Baada ya mauzo ya hisa (au moja kwa moja kwenye uso wa sehemu wakati hakuna auth inahitajika), Kila mtu lazima kuendesha mwingiliano halisi, programu maalum ili spec kuthibitisha jukumu ni msikivu kwa pembejeo mtumiaji, si tu kufikia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A personal digital sovereignty stack for individuals controlling their own data."
msgstr "Uhuru wa kibinafsi wa digital kwa watu wanaodhibiti data zao wenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A pin MUST be a quoted string, never an unquoted number. `\"\"` tracks the app default."
msgstr "Pin lazima iwe kamba iliyonukuliwa, kamwe idadi isiyojulikana. `\"\"` Tumia programu ya default."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A pin the Docker updater (`image` + `version`) and the repository updater (`repository` + `ref`) do not reach names its upstream next to itself:"
msgstr "Maelezo ya mchezo Docker update (`image` + + + + + + `version`) Kuwa updated (`repository` + + + + + + `ref`) Usiweke jina la kikoa karibu na seva yako:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A platform may refuse a window it considers too small. Hermes requires 64000 tokens and answers `HTTP 500` with \"below the minimum 64,000 required by Hermes Agent\" for anything less, so `web-app-hermes` declares `services.hermes.min_context` and the broker withholds any platform whose minimum the selected model misses: it is absent from `/v1/models` and answers 404, while every other platform keeps serving. Refusing the whole deploy instead would block a pairing that works, since OpenClaw declares no minimum and the broker pulls Hermes into its closure either way. A model that declares no window at all is reported rather than withheld: an agent that does not know its window runs."
msgstr "Jukwaa linaweza kukataa dirisha ambalo linaona ni ndogo sana. Hermes inahitaji 64000 Maswali na majibu `HTTP 500` Pamoja na \"Chini ya kiwango 64,000 inapohitajika kwa Hermes Agent\" Kwa vyovyote vile, kwa `web-app-hermes` Alisema kuwa `services.hermes.min_context` na broker anazuia jukwaa lolote ambalo mtindo wa chini wa kuchaguliwa hupoteza: haipo `/v1/models` Majibu ya 404, Hata hivyo, wakati kila jukwaa linaendelea kutumika. Kukataa matumizi yote badala yake kutazuia jozi ambayo inafanya kazi, tangu OpenClaw Hakuna kiwango cha chini na broker huchota Hermes katika kufungwa kwake kwa njia yoyote. Mfano ambao hautangaza dirisha hata kidogo unaripotiwa badala ya kushikiliwa: wakala ambaye hajui anaendesha dirisha lake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A plug-and-go backup of the local backup tree to an external block device (typically a swappable USB drive). The transfer is hard-link deduplicated against the previous snapshot, so each plug-in yields a complete, browsable point-in-time copy without doubling disk usage."
msgstr "Backup ya kuziba-na-go ya mti wa Backup wa ndani kwa kifaa cha kuzuia nje (Moja ya adapta USB drive). uhamisho ni ngumu-link deduplicated dhidi ya snapshot ya awali, hivyo kila plug-in mavuno kamili, browsable uhakika-katika-wakati nakala bila mara mbili disk matumizi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A plugin MAY ship an appstore release that lags the pinned Nextcloud server major. In that case OCC emits the marker string `is not compatible with this version of the server` and exits non-zero. The pipeline MUST treat this as a non-fatal condition:"
msgstr "Plugin inaweza meli toleo la appstore ambalo lags pinned Nextcloud server ya juu. Katika kesi hiyo, OCC hutoa kamba ya alama `is not compatible with this version of the server` Kwa upande mwingine, hakuna sifuri. Bomba la mafuta linapaswa kutibu hii kama hali isiyo ya kawaida:"

# translation-refused: libretranslate stutter
# nocheck: url
# translation-rejected: Plugin ya kuingia inaweza kuwekwa `mandatory: true`.
# Hii inverts uvumilivu juu: wakati Plugin ni `enabled` kwa ajili ya
# utekelezaji wa mradi huo, lakini matokeo yake siyo `runnable` (Hailingani na
# ukubwa wa seva ya pinned, au haipatikani kwenye duka), Kwa hivyo, [01wa wa
