# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A prefix does something on the way past -- sending a smoke mail is the only one so far -- and deliberately cannot decide liveness. That separation is what lets a probe stay the single verdict."
msgstr "Prefix hufanya kitu kwenye njia iliyopita - kutuma barua ya moshi ni moja tu hadi sasa - na kwa makusudi hawezi kuamua uzima. Kutengana ni nini kinachoruhusu uchunguzi kubaki hukumu moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A prefix mask leaves a contiguous run of low bits free, so per octet the addresses span exactly ``network_address`` to ``broadcast_address``. The cross product of those four ranges is the network, which makes the octet decomposition exact for any prefix length, aligned or not."
msgstr "Mask prefix majani mbio contiguous ya bits chini bure, hivyo kwa octet anwani span hasa ``network_address`` Kwa kuwa ``broadcast_address``. Bidhaa ya msalaba ya aina hizo nne ni mtandao, ambayo inafanya octet decomposition halisi kwa urefu wowote wa prefix, iliyowekwa au la."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A priority entry may pin axes (``web-app-zammad#1@compose+tor``), and the pin rides along into the retrigger: the entry never ran, so the run holds no evidence that the axes it named were the wrong ones. Only the name in front of the axis suffix is resolved against the statuses."
msgstr "Kuingia kwa kipaumbele inaweza pin axes (``web-app-zammad#1@compose+tor``), Na kwa upande mwingine, ni vigumu sana kuosha vidonge kutoka kwenye vidonge, lakini hakuna njia ya mkato. Tu jina mbele ya mhimili suffix ni kutatuliwa dhidi ya hali."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A priority role can fall behind the discovery budget cut in every mode, so the run holds no job for it and :func:`failed_roles` cannot see it — it is neither green nor red, it simply never ran. Carrying it into the retrigger is the only way it ever gets deployed."
msgstr "Wajibu wa kipaumbele unaweza kuanguka nyuma ya bajeti ya ugunduzi kukatwa katika kila hali, hivyo kukimbia haina kazi kwa ajili yake na :func:`failed_roles` Haiwezi kuona - sio kijani au nyekundu, haijawahi kukimbia. Kuingia kwenye akaunti ni njia pekee ya kuingia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A privacy-first foundation for enterprises running AI locally and keeping sensitive data on-prem."
msgstr "Msingi wa faragha wa kwanza kwa makampuni yanayoendesha AI ndani ya nchi na kuweka data nyeti juu ya-prem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A professional collaboration and identity management stack for modern organizations."
msgstr "Ushirikiano wa kitaaluma na usimamizi wa utambulisho stack kwa mashirika ya kisasa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A prompt above the server's state limit is truncated rather than rejected as a routing failure"
msgstr "Haraka juu ya kikomo cha hali ya seva ni truncated badala ya kukataliwa kama kushindwa routing"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A prose deprecation value is not read as a date"
msgstr "Thamani ya deprecation si kusoma kama tarehe"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A provider writes its credential to the token store during its own role run, and each client resolves the providers it may reach from that store. This role runs at the end of the server stage, after every provider has written and before the end-to-end tests read the converged state."
msgstr "Mtoa huduma anaandika uaminifu wake kwa duka la ishara wakati wa jukumu lake mwenyewe kukimbia, na kila mteja anaamua watoa inaweza kufikia kutoka duka hilo. Jukumu hili linaendesha mwishoni mwa hatua ya seva, baada ya kila mtoa huduma kuandika na kabla ya vipimo vya mwisho hadi mwisho kusoma hali ya kuunganisha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A proxy repo that holds a cached copy serves it when its remote is unreachable, regardless of `metadataMaxAge` (measured). `autoBlock` is therefore off: while a remote is auto-blocked Nexus answers `404 Remote Auto Blocked` instead of falling back to that cached copy. The mirror repos below only come into play when nothing is cached either."
msgstr "Na kwa upande mwingine, ikiwa ni pamoja na nakala ya wakala ambayo ina nakala ya cached inaihudumia wakati eneo lake ni la mbali, bila kujali. `metadataMaxAge` (Kiwango cha)... `autoBlock` Kwa hiyo ni mbali: wakati kijijini ni auto-blocked Nexus majibu `404 Remote Auto Blocked` Badala ya kurudi nyuma kwa nakala hii iliyohifadhiwa. Picha ya chini inaonyeshwa tu wakati hakuna kitu kilichohifadhiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A question MUST NOT modify files, code, or state. Only explicit commands MAY."
msgstr "Swali haipaswi kubadilisha faili, msimbo, au hali. Amri ya wazi tu inaweza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A question is answered when its CI row is green **and** the local lane cleared it, or when one lane was deliberately out of scope and the report says which. Anything else is open, however green the run looks."
msgstr "Swali linajibiwa wakati safu yake ya CI ni kijani **Aidha, na** Lane ya ndani iliiondoa, au wakati lane moja ilikuwa nje ya wigo kwa makusudi na ripoti inasema nini. Kila kitu kingine ni wazi, lakini kijani inaonekana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A random bearer key per agent, known only to the broker, used in both directions."
msgstr "Muhimu wa kubeba random kwa wakala, inayojulikana tu kwa broker, kutumika katika pande zote mbili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A rapid deployment stack for startups building software products and services."
msgstr "Haraka kupelekwa stack kwa startups kujenga bidhaa na huduma za programu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A record MUST NOT be written for a choice that a reader can recover from the code alone, such as a helper's signature or a local refactoring."
msgstr "Rekodi haipaswi kuandikwa kwa chaguo ambalo msomaji anaweza kupona kutoka kwa msimbo pekee, kama saini ya msaidizi au usaidizi wa ndani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A record MUST be numbered in the order it was accepted, and its number MUST NOT be reused."
msgstr "Rekodi lazima kuhesabiwa kwa utaratibu ulikubaliwa, na idadi yake haipaswi kutumika tena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A record MUST cover a decision whose reversal would be expensive: a contract between components, a data or naming shape other code depends on, or a rule that governs a whole subsystem."
msgstr "Rekodi LA LAZIMA ifikie uamuzi ambao mabadiliko yake yatakuwa ya gharama kubwa: mkataba kati ya vipengele, data au muundo wa jina la msimbo mwingine unategemea, au utawala unaotawala mfumo mzima."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A record MUST describe the decision as it stands today, including the alternatives that were weighed and why they lost, so a later reader can tell a deliberate constraint from an accident."
msgstr "Rekodi LAZIMA ieleze uamuzi kama ilivyo leo, ikiwa ni pamoja na njia mbadala ambazo zilipimwa na kwa nini zilipotea, hivyo msomaji wa baadaye anaweza kuelezea kizuizi cha makusudi kutoka kwa ajali."

# translation-refused: libretranslate stutter
# nocheck: url
# translation-rejected: Kuokoa vioo snapshot katika saraka ya lengo la kuishi
# (``rsync -a --delete``), Kwa hiyo, hali ya sasa ya lengo itapotea bila wavu.
# Kwa hiyo mtiririko huo kwanza anaendesha huduma ya Backup ya jukumu
# (``systemctl start`` Kuhusu Muungano wa), ambayo hutumia mantiki ya kawaida
# ya kuhifadhi nakala kwa data ya kuishi kabla ya chochote kilichoandikwa.
# Majukumu ya subclass :class:`DirectoryRecovery`, ya ya ya ``unit_pattern``
# Meli ya mizigo ``files/python/recover.py`` Bonyeza hapa (kutekelezwa kwa
