# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role aggregated to its id loses what actually broke: the retrigger then redeploys every variant of it, in whatever mode and onion state the sweep rotation happens to pick, and the combination that failed may not be among them. Each failed job therefore contributes its own ``role#variant@mode+tor`` token (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`), so the priority line replays that job and nothing else."
msgstr "Jukumu lililojumuishwa kwenye kitambulisho chake hupoteza kile kilichovunjika: retrigger kisha redeploys kila lahaja yake, katika hali yoyote na onion hali mzunguko wa kufagia hutokea kuchagua, na mchanganyiko ambao haukufanikiwa unaweza kuwa kati yao. Kila kazi iliyoshindwa ina mchango wake ``role#variant@mode+tor`` Ishara ya (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`), Kwa hiyo, mstari wa kipaumbele unarudia kazi hiyo na hakuna kingine."

