msgstr "Jukumu linaweza kuvutwa katika hesabu kupitia njia yoyote kati ya njia tatu na wanatunga, bila kuwatenga wengine:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role declares `meta/mcp.yml` when it actually serves or consumes MCP. The file is a capability descriptor, not a service entry: no single role provides MCP, so the service registry cannot pair provider and consumer, and the `mcp_consumer` flag in `meta/services.yml` does it instead. Vocabulary lives in [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py); the hard lint is [`test_mcp_schema.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_schema.py)."
msgstr "Jukumu la kutangaza `meta/mcp.yml` Kwa kweli, ikiwa ni pamoja na matumizi ya MCP. Faili ni msimamizi wa uwezo, sio kuingia kwa huduma: hakuna jukumu moja hutoa MCP, hivyo Usajili wa huduma hauwezi kutoa mtoa huduma na mtumiaji, na `mcp_consumer` Bendera ya `meta/services.yml` badala ya kufanya hivyo. Maisha ya kijasiri katika [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py); Sauti kubwa ni [`test_mcp_schema.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_schema.py)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role declares it twice and the two may differ: the ``README.md`` heading is what a reader sees, ``galaxy_info.name`` what the metadata carries. The heading wins where both exist, because the documentation is built from it."
msgstr "Jukumu linatangaza mara mbili na mbili zinaweza kutofautiana: ``README.md`` Kwa mtazamo wa msomaji, ``galaxy_info.name`` Jinsi ya kutumia metadata. Kichwa mafanikio ambapo wote wapo, kwa sababu nyaraka ni kujengwa kutoka kwake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role directory name is never an English phrase, so it is protected wherever it appears. A title is a single word often enough that the two readings collide: ``Unbound`` is a DNS resolver and an adjective, ``Shell`` a role and a common noun. Measured over the catalogs, the capital separates them: of 47932 capitalised occurrences the translator altered 22 percent, among them ``(Unbound, etc.)`` turning into ``(Ungebunden, etc.)``, while the 40698 lowercase ones it altered in 40 percent of cases and those readings were the common noun the text meant (``shell extensions``, ``user-driven documentation``)."
msgstr "Jina la saraka ya jukumu sio maneno ya Kiingereza, kwa hivyo inalindwa popote inaonekana. Kichwa ni neno moja mara nyingi kutosha kwamba masomo mawili kugongana: ``Unbound`` Ni mtawala wa DNS na mvumbuzi, ``Shell`` Ni jina la kawaida na la kawaida. Kwa mujibu wa takwimu hizo, mji mkuu wa nchi hiyo utakuwa na 47932 Mabadiliko ya hali ya hewa yabadilika 22 Asilimia, kati yao ``(Unbound, etc.)`` Kugeuka kuwa ``(Ungebunden, etc.)``, Wakati wa 40698 ya chini ambayo ilibadilishwa katika 40 Asilimia ya kesi na masomo hayo yalikuwa neno la kawaida ambalo maandishi hayo yalimaanisha (``shell extensions``, Kwa hivyo, ``user-driven documentation``)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role id is the machine handle (``web-app-nextcloud``); the display name is what a human reads off a GitHub Actions job or run title (``网络应用·Nextcloud``). The category path renders as the ``hanzi`` labels ``meta/categories.yml`` declares, run together into one block, then a ``·``, then the role's own ``README.md`` heading or the part of the id the categories do not already carry."
msgstr "Alama ya utambulisho ni kazi ya mashine (``web-app-nextcloud``); Jina la kuonyesha ni nini mwanadamu anasoma kazi ya GitHub Actions au jina la kukimbia (``网络应用·Nextcloud``). . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . ``hanzi`` Majina ya ``meta/categories.yml`` kwa pamoja kuingia katika kundi moja, kisha ``·``, Kwa hiyo, jukumu la ``README.md`` Kuongoza au sehemu ya id makundi si tayari kubeba."

