# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role offers at most two modes in practice — swarm needs its own stack, host needs the absence of one — so a row flips between its two modes on consecutive sweeps. Tor turns on `sweep // 2` so it does not flip in lockstep: a row walks all four mode/tor combinations over four sweeps instead of only two. Distro and filesystem read the position like an odometer, the distro as the low digit, so consecutive rows walk every pairing of the two pools rather than a diagonal through it. Turning both on the position directly would cover only as many pairings as the pools are long whenever they happen to be the same length, and no sweep would unlock that, because the sweep shifts both by the same amount. The architecture rotates on the position directly rather than as a third odometer digit. Two values are coprime with both five distros and the fifteen distro/filesystem positions, so walking it fastest still reaches every pairing, while making it the slowest digit would hand a role with few rows one architecture forever - and the point of the axis is that a role's own variants split over both. Priority rows skip the mode/tor rotation entirely and take the whole cross-product at once; their distro, filesystem and architecture walk on across those combinations, so one priority role proves several distributions in one sweep."
msgstr "Jukumu hutoa katika njia nyingi mbili katika mazoezi - nzige wanahitaji stack yake mwenyewe, mwenyeji anahitaji kutokuwepo kwa moja - kwa hivyo mstari hupiga kati ya njia zake mbili kwenye sweeps mfululizo. Kugeuka kuwa `sweep // 2` Hivyo haina flip katika lockstep: mstari anatembea wote mode /tor mchanganyiko juu ya sweeps nne badala ya mbili tu. Distro na mfumo wa faili kusoma nafasi kama odometer, distro kama tarakimu ya chini, hivyo safu mfululizo kutembea kila jozi ya mabwawa mawili badala ya diagonal kupitia hiyo. Kugeuka wote juu ya nafasi moja kwa moja ingekuwa kufunika tu jozi nyingi kama mabwawa ni muda mrefu wakati wowote kutokea kuwa urefu sawa, na hakuna sweep bila kufungua kwamba, kwa sababu sweep shifts wote kwa kiasi sawa. Usanifu unazunguka kwenye nafasi moja kwa moja badala ya kama tarakimu ya tatu. Thamani mbili ni coprime na distros zote tano na nafasi za distro / faili kumi na tano, hivyo kutembea kwa kasi bado kufikia kila jozi, wakati kuifanya digit polepole ingekuwa mkono jukumu na safu chache usanifu mmoja milele - na hatua ya mhimili ni kwamba tofauti ya jukumu yenyewe mgawanyiko juu ya wote wawili. Safu za kipaumbele zinaruka mzunguko wa mode /tor kabisa na kuchukua bidhaa nzima ya msalaba mara moja; distro yao, mfumo wa faili na usanifu kutembea kwenye mchanganyiko huo, kwa hivyo jukumu moja la kipaumbele linathibitisha usambazaji kadhaa katika sweep moja."

