# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role that declares no users contributes none, so the result follows the deployment rather than everything the repository could ever deploy. Two roles sharing a user must agree on its policy: the account is one thing, so silently picking one declaration would hand the other role a password its application rejects."
msgstr "Jukumu ambalo linatangaza hakuna mtumiaji anayechangia, kwa hivyo matokeo hufuata kupelekwa badala ya kila kitu ambacho mmiliki anaweza kupeleka. Majukumu mawili ya kugawana mtumiaji lazima kukubaliana juu ya sera yake: akaunti ni jambo moja, hivyo kimya kuokota tamko moja itakuwa mkono jukumu jingine password maombi yake anakataa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role that declares none takes the run's whole pool, which is what spreads both architectures evenly over its variants: every row of the catalogue advances the same rotation, so a role's consecutive rows alternate rather than repeating one architecture."
msgstr "Jukumu ambalo linatangaza hakuna inachukua pool nzima ya kukimbia, ambayo ni kile kinachoenea usanifu wote kwa njia sawa juu ya tofauti zake: kila mstari wa orodha unaendelea mzunguko huo, kwa hivyo safu za jukumu zinabadilika badala ya kurudia usanifu mmoja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role that hands ``sys-pip-install`` a bare package name follows whatever pip resolves; one that pins ``name==version`` freezes it, and nothing thaws it again. The docker updater keeps image tags current and dependabot reads ``pyproject.toml``; neither sees a version inside an Ansible task variable, so a pin set once ages silently."
msgstr "Kazi ambayo mikono ``sys-pip-install`` Jina la mfuko wazi linafuata chochote cha pip; moja ambayo pins ``name==version`` Acha baridi, na hakuna kitu kinachozuia tena. Docker updater anaendelea vitambulisho picha sasa na dependabot kusoma ``pyproject.toml``; Wala kuona toleo ndani ya kazi Ansible variable, hivyo pin kuweka mara moja umri kimya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role that only one architecture can run declares it on its primary service entity, next to `modes`:"
msgstr "Jukumu ambalo usanifu mmoja tu unaweza kukimbia linatangaza kwenye chombo chake cha huduma ya msingi, karibu na `modes`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role usually owns one capability:"
msgstr "Kwa kawaida, jukumu lina uwezo wa:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role whose own asserts need something the dependency closure does not supply (a served model, a second backend) carries them here, because ``--include`` filters the generated inventory to the ids it is given literally: a provider pulled in as a dependency runs, but never joins ``group_names``, so a flag gated on that stays false and the deploy the README documents stops on the assert."
msgstr "Jukumu ambalo madai yake mwenyewe yanahitaji kitu ambacho kufungwa kwa utegemezi haitoi (Mfano wa Mfano, Njia ya pili) kuwafikisha hapa, kwa sababu ``--include`` filters hesabu yanayotokana na ids ni kupewa literally: mtoa huduma vunjwa katika kama utegemezi anaendesha, lakini kamwe kujiunga ``group_names``, hivyo bendera imefungwa juu ya kwamba anakaa uongo na kupeleka nyaraka README kuacha juu ya madai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role whose upstream images are amd64-only must say so in `meta/services.yml`, or half its rows fail on the image pull. That failure is loud and names the role, which is the intended way to discover the gap."
msgstr "Jukumu ambalo picha zake za juu zinahifadhiwa64Ni lazima kusema hivyo katika `meta/services.yml`, au nusu ya safu yake inashindwa kwenye kuvuta picha. Kushindwa huko ni kubwa na kutaja jukumu, ambayo ni njia ya lengo la kugundua pengo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role with few rows would never leave its first architecture, and per-role spread is the point of the axis."
msgstr "Jukumu na safu chache hazitaacha usanifu wake wa kwanza, na kuenea kwa kila rangi ni hatua ya mhimili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role's `meta/services.yml` MAY contain (per-service-entity):"
msgstr "Wajibu wa `meta/services.yml` Inaweza kuwa (Ufuatiliaji wa Huduma):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role's author is declared in ``galaxy_info.author`` and rendered without a link, so nothing here feeds the README generator any more. What remains backs the ``credits-attribution`` lint: it reads the linked mentions already present in prose and holds them to one link per person."
msgstr "Mwandishi wa makala hii ameelezwa katika ``galaxy_info.author`` Na kutolewa bila kiungo, hivyo hakuna kitu hapa chakula jenereta README tena. Nini kinaendelea nyuma ya ``credits-attribution`` Lint: Inasoma maelezo yaliyounganishwa tayari katika prose na inawashikilia kwenye kiungo kimoja kwa mtu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role's entry for its own entity is skipped: a role does not bond to itself, and those entries carry unrelated topics such as users or domains."
msgstr "Kuingia kwa jukumu kwa chombo chake mwenyewe kunaruka: jukumu halihusiani yenyewe, na maingilio hayo hubeba mada zisizohusiana kama vile watumiaji au vikoa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role's lifecycle value sits on a single linear axis from `planned` (no code yet) to `eol` (end of life). A subset of stages is the **tested** envelope: roles in those stages MUST be exercised by the project's automated test suite on every change, and a failing test blocks the release. Stages outside that envelope MAY ship without automated coverage."
msgstr "Thamani ya maisha ya jukumu iko kwenye mhimili mmoja wa mstari kutoka `planned` (Hakuna kodi ya) Kwa kuwa `eol` (Mwisho wa maisha)Sehemu ya hatua ni **Majaribio ya majaribio** Majukumu katika hatua hizo LAZIMA yafanyike na Suite ya mtihani wa automatiska wa mradi juu ya kila mabadiliko, na jaribio la kushindwa linazuia kutolewa. Hatua nje ya bahasha hiyo inaweza meli bila chanjo ya automatiska."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A role's task that reads its own service flag therefore picks up the runtime-resolved value, even when the inventory carried a Jinja string for that flag: the conditional evaluates against the play's actual `group_names`, which reflects which other application groups the host joined."
msgstr "Kazi ya jukumu ambayo inasoma bendera yake ya huduma kwa hiyo inachukua thamani ya muda mrefu, hata wakati hesabu ilibeba kamba ya Jinja kwa bendera hiyo: hali ya tathmini dhidi ya mchezo halisi. `group_names`, ambayo inaonyesha ni makundi mengine ya maombi ambayo mwenyeji alijiunga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A round deploys a provider once, so the role that pulls it in is the only place that can say how lean it has to be. A variant entry may therefore carry any application config topic under the service it depends on::"
msgstr "Mzunguko hupeleka mtoa huduma mara moja, kwa hivyo jukumu ambalo huvuta ni mahali pekee ambayo inaweza kusema jinsi inavyotegemea. Kuingia kwa lahaja kunaweza kubeba mada yoyote ya kusanidi programu chini ya huduma inategemea:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A round picks one variant per role, and that choice decides two things no single role's `meta/services.yml` can state on its own: which providers the role still pulls in, and how lean those providers have to be (:mod:`utils.roles.applications.topics`). Both are resolved here, so the matrix planner's include set, the inventory bake and the CI selection read one answer instead of three."
msgstr "Mzunguko unachukua lahaja moja kwa jukumu, na uchaguzi huo unaamua mambo mawili hakuna jukumu moja. `meta/services.yml` Inaweza kusema peke yake: ambayo inatoa jukumu bado linaingia, na jinsi watoa huduma hao wanapaswa kuwa (:mod:`utils.roles.applications.topics`). Zote mbili zimetatuliwa hapa, kwa hivyo mpangaji wa matrix ni pamoja na kuweka, uokaji wa hesabu na uteuzi wa CI husoma jibu moja badala ya tatu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A row several tokens name is emitted once per token, which is the whole point of the axes: ``role#1@compose+tor role#1@swarm+tor`` is one variant that failed in two modes, and it has to come back as two deploys. Two tokens narrowing a row the same way collapse into one, so a duplicate in the input cannot become two jobs racing for one artifact name."
msgstr "Alama kadhaa za ishara hutolewa mara moja kwa ishara, ambayo ni hatua nzima ya axes: ``role#1@compose+tor role#1@swarm+tor`` Ni tofauti moja ambayo imeshindwa kwa njia mbili, na inapaswa kurudi kama vituo viwili. Ishara mbili zinazopunguza mstari kwa njia sawa kuanguka katika moja, hivyo duplicate katika pembejeo haiwezi kuwa kazi mbili zinazoshindana kwa jina moja la bandia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A row the priority line claims is never the answer. ``regular`` is discovered without the priority line (see the retrigger's ``_ranking``), so it still holds rows the run will hand to that line instead (:func:`cli.meta.ci.matrix.candidates`): a variant-less pin takes its whole role, a pinned one takes those variants. Naming such a row would emit an offset that resolves against nothing once the run applies the priority line, and abort the discovery of every chunk."
msgstr "Jibu ni kwamba madai ya msingi kamwe si jibu. ``regular`` Inatambuliwa bila mstari wa kwanza (Angalia huyu jamaa alivyoumbuka ``_ranking``), Kwa hiyo, bado inashikilia safu ya kukimbia itashikilia mstari huo badala ya (:func:`cli.meta.ci.matrix.candidates`)Pin isiyo na tofauti inachukua jukumu lake lote, pinned moja inachukua tofauti hizo. Kutaja mstari kama huo utatoa mwanzo ambao unatatua dhidi ya chochote mara moja kukimbia inatumika mstari wa kipaumbele, na kutoa mimba ugunduzi wa kila chunk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A row's position is its index in the uncapped discovery order, not its index inside a chunk, so slicing the list into chunks never changes what a row is assigned. A priority row, which deploys several mode/tor combinations at once, walks the distro and filesystem rotations across those combinations rather than repeating one pair."
msgstr "Msimamo wa mstari ni index yake katika utaratibu wa ugunduzi usiopigwa, si index yake ndani ya chunk, hivyo slicing orodha katika chunks kamwe mabadiliko nini mstari ni kupewa. Mstari wa kipaumbele, ambayo inachukua mchanganyiko kadhaa wa mode /tor mara moja, anatembea mzunguko wa distro na mfumo wa faili katika mchanganyiko huo badala ya kurudia jozi moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A run that names a kind to chase a filesystem-dependent path could go green on a different one."
msgstr "Kukimbia kwamba majina aina ya kufuata njia filesystem-dependent inaweza kwenda kijani juu ya moja tofauti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A run that permits two or more kinds is a preference, not a demand. The matrix has already narrowed each row to one kind out of that pool, so falling back to another kind the run allowed stays inside what the operator asked for, while failing the row does not. A run whose whole permitted pool is unservable fails rather than leaving the pool."
msgstr "Kukimbia ambayo inaruhusu aina mbili au zaidi ni upendeleo, si mahitaji. matrix tayari nyembamba kila mstari kwa aina moja nje ya bwawa hilo, hivyo kuanguka nyuma kwa aina nyingine kukimbia kuruhusiwa kukaa ndani ya kile operator aliuliza, wakati kushindwa mstari haina. kukimbia ambao pool nzima kuruhusiwa ni kushindwa kushindwa badala ya kuondoka bwawa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A run the source carries itself is left alone, because an aligned block in a code sample means its spacing."
msgstr "Kukimbia chanzo hubeba yenyewe ni kushoto peke yake, kwa sababu block iliyowekwa katika sampuli code inamaanisha spacing yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A run-wide choice cannot cover them. Five distributions and three filesystems are fifteen combinations, and a sweep that fixes one pair for all of its rows would need fifteen sweeps to say anything about the rest, while reporting green the whole time."
msgstr "Uchaguzi wa aina yoyote hauwezi kuwahusisha. Usambazaji wa tano na mifumo mitatu ya faili ni mchanganyiko wa kumi na tano, na sweep kwamba fixes jozi moja kwa safu zake zote itahitaji sweeps kumi na tano kusema chochote kuhusu wengine, wakati taarifa ya kijani wakati wote."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A same-size swapfile helps absorb memory spikes on Linux. On Windows and macOS, you SHOULD keep enough free disk space available for virtual memory and local caches."
msgstr "Toleo la ukubwa sawa husaidia kunyonya spikes za kumbukumbu kwenye Linux. Kwenye Windows na MacOS, unapaswa kuweka nafasi ya kutosha ya disk bure inapatikana kwa kumbukumbu ya kawaida na kashe za ndani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A sample whose install failed is recorded as ``None`` and ranks worse than any duration, so an outage counts fully rather than being dropped."
msgstr "Mfano wa mtu ambaye hakufanikiwa ni kama inavyoonekana. ``None`` Hali ni mbaya zaidi kuliko wakati mwingine wowote, na ni mbaya zaidi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A scheduled differential backup of the NFS export onto the local backup directory. Each run stores a discrete snapshot under `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-nfs-to-local/<generation>/files/`, hard-linked against the previous generation via rsync `--link-dest`."
msgstr "Backup iliyopangwa tofauti ya usafirishaji wa NFS kwenye saraka ya hifadhi ya ndani. Kila moja ya maduka ya picha ya discrete chini `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-nfs-to-local/<generation>/files/`, Kuunganishwa kwa nguvu dhidi ya kizazi cha zamani kupitia rsync `--link-dest`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A scheduled differential backup of the NFS export onto the local backup directory. Each run stores a discrete snapshot under ``<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-nfs-to-local/<generation>/files/``, hard-linked against the previous generation via rsync ``--link-dest``."
msgstr "Backup iliyopangwa tofauti ya usafirishaji wa NFS kwenye saraka ya hifadhi ya ndani. Kila moja ya maduka ya picha ya discrete chini ``<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-nfs-to-local/<generation>/files/``, Kuunganishwa kwa nguvu dhidi ya kizazi cha zamani kupitia rsync ``--link-dest``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A scheduled pull-style backup that replicates the backup trees of one or more remote provider hosts onto this host via SSH + rsync. The receiving side is the trust anchor: each retrieval is a discrete snapshot, hard-linked against the previous one, with a retry loop guarding against transient network failures."
msgstr "Backup iliyopangwa ya mtindo wa kuvuta ambayo inaiga miti ya chelezo ya majeshi moja au zaidi ya mtoa huduma wa kijijini kwenye mwenyeji huu kupitia SSH + rsync. Upande wa kupokea ni nanga ya uaminifu: kila retrieval ni snapshot ya discrete, iliyounganishwa ngumu dhidi ya moja ya awali, na kitanzi cha retry kinacholinda dhidi ya kushindwa kwa mtandao wa muda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A scheduled workflow (`cron-*.yml`) drops the `Category:` schema: its `name:` MUST read as one short sentence saying what the run does, because the Actions list shows scheduled runs next to each other with no PR or branch to tell them apart."
msgstr "Kazi iliyopangwa (`cron-*.yml`) Kuacha ya `Category:` Tag: yake `name:` Lazima kusoma kama sentensi moja fupi kusema nini kukimbia hufanya, kwa sababu orodha ya vitendo inaonyesha mipango anaendesha karibu na kila mmoja bila PR au tawi kuwaambia mbali."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A scheduled, deduplicating backup of every Docker container's data on this host to a local backup directory. File payloads are captured with rsync hard-link snapshots; databases register themselves into a central seed file so each backup run also dumps a consistent SQL snapshot via [baudolo](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/backup-docker-to-local)."
msgstr "Backup iliyopangwa, deduplicating ya data ya kila chombo cha Docker kwenye mwenyeji huu kwenye saraka ya chelezo ya ndani. Mzigo wa malipo ya faili unachukuliwa na picha za rsync ngumu-link; database zinajiandikisha wenyewe katika faili ya mbegu ya kati ili kila backup kukimbia pia hupiga picha thabiti ya SQL kupitia [Kibali](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/backup-docker-to-local)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A scheduled, deduplicating backup of every Docker container’s data on this host to a local backup directory. File payloads are captured with rsync hard-link snapshots; databases register themselves into a central seed file so each backup run also dumps a consistent SQL snapshot via `baudolo <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/backup-docker-to-local>`__."
msgstr "Backup iliyopangwa, deduplicating ya data ya kila chombo cha Docker kwenye mwenyeji huu kwenye saraka ya chelezo ya ndani. Mzigo wa malipo ya faili unachukuliwa na picha za rsync ngumu-link; database zinajiandikisha wenyewe katika faili ya mbegu ya kati ili kila backup kukimbia pia hupiga picha thabiti ya SQL kupitia `baudolo <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/backup-docker-to-local>`__..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A scheduled, deduplicating backup of the host's generated secret material to the local backup directory: the Infinito.Nexus secrets and tokens, the self-signed root CA, the Let's Encrypt account + certificates, the ACME DNS credentials, and the node identity (ssh host keys + machine-id). None of this lives in a docker volume, the NFS export or the operator inventory, so it is the gap the volume/nfs backup roles do not cover."
msgstr "Backup iliyopangwa, deduplicating ya vifaa vya siri vilivyozalishwa na mwenyeji kwenye saraka ya Backup ya ndani: Infinito.Nexus siri na ishara, mizizi ya kujitegemea CA, Let's Encrypt akaunti + vyeti, ACME DNS sifa, na utambulisho node (Ssh mwenyeji funguo + mashine-id). Hakuna hii haiishi katika kiasi cha docker, usafirishaji wa NFS au hesabu ya operator, kwa hivyo ni pengo la majukumu ya chelezo ya kiasi / nfs hayafunika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A scheduled, deduplicating backup of the host’s generated secret material to the local backup directory: the Infinito.Nexus secrets and tokens, the self-signed root CA, the Let’s Encrypt account + certificates, the ACME DNS credentials, and the node identity (ssh host keys + machine-id). None of this lives in a docker volume, the NFS export or the operator inventory, so it is the gap the volume/nfs backup roles do not cover."
msgstr "Backup iliyopangwa, deduplicating ya vifaa vya siri vilivyozalishwa na mwenyeji kwenye saraka ya Backup ya ndani: Infinito.Nexus siri na ishara, mizizi ya kujitegemea CA, Let's Encrypt akaunti + vyeti, ACME DNS sifa, na utambulisho node (Ssh mwenyeji funguo + mashine-id). Hakuna hii haiishi katika kiasi cha docker, usafirishaji wa NFS au hesabu ya operator, kwa hivyo ni pengo la majukumu ya chelezo ya kiasi / nfs hayafunika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A script in this directory MUST work across every distro variant that the runner image is built for (currently Debian, Ubuntu, Arch, Fedora, CentOS). Tool availability differs across these variants, so a script SHOULD branch on `command -v <tool>` rather than on distro IDs."
msgstr "Script katika saraka hii lazima kazi katika kila lahaja distro kwamba picha ya mkimbiaji ni kujengwa kwa (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch, Fedora, CentOS). Upatikanaji wa zana hutofautiana katika anuwai hizi, kwa hivyo tawi la maandiko lililotakiwa kwenye `command -v <tool>` Badala ya kuwa na mawazo ya kipuuzi."

# translation-refused: libretranslate stutter
# nocheck: url
# translation-rejected: Kitabu hiki kimetayarishwa kwa kuzingatia yafuatayo:-
# (kuona kuona kuona [compose.yml](../../compose.yml)) LAZIMA kuweka yake git
# executable bit, kwa sababu Docker bind-mounts kuhifadhi ruhusa ya faili
# mwenyeji na mpiga simu wa ndani (Imeandaliwa, Dockerd, sehemu ya kuingia)
