msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A second tag next to every image, which the registry cleanup then has to protect as children of the plain tag. Pushing by digest gives the same manifest list without it."
msgstr "Tag ya pili karibu na kila picha, ambayo Usajili safi kisha ina kulinda kama watoto wa tag wazi. Ni wazi kuwa Qur’ani Tukufu imeyanukuu maneno ya Qur’ani Tukufu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A secret denylist such as `grep -v 'password|token|key'` does **NOT** count as protection: it is case-sensitive, and secrets also travel inside URL paths. Local deploys run with `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS` disabled, so `no_log` does not mask these tasks."
msgstr "Kwa mujibu wa msemaji wa Ikulu, kama `grep -v 'password|token|key'` Kufanya hivyo **Sio ya** Fikiria kama ulinzi: ni nyeti, na siri pia zinasafiri ndani ya njia za URL. Watendaji wa Vijiji wakishirikiana na `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS` walemavu, hivyo `no_log` Haipunguzi majukumu haya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A selection token names a role and MAY narrow the axes that role's rows would otherwise be assigned: which variants run, which deploy mode, whether the row goes behind the node onion, which distribution it deploys on, which filesystem its docker data root runs on and which CPU architecture it lands on. What a token leaves open stays open, exactly as an unpinned run leaves it: the priority line covers every mode and onion state the row can take, and the sweep rotation picks the distro, the filesystem and the architecture on both lines."
msgstr "Ishara ya uteuzi inataja jukumu na inaweza kupunguza axes ambazo safu za jukumu zitapewa vinginevyo: ni tofauti gani zinazoendesha, ambazo zinatuma mode, ikiwa mstari unaendelea nyuma ya node onion, ambayo usambazaji wake unapeleka, ambayo inaweka mizizi yake ya data ya docker inaendesha na ambayo usanifu wa CPU unazunguka. Nini ishara majani ya wazi anakaa wazi, hasa kama kukimbia unpinned majani yake: mstari wa kipaumbele inashughulikia kila hali na onion hali mstari unaweza kuchukua, na mzunguko sweep inachukua distro, mfumo wa faili na usanifu kwenye mistari yote miwili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A selection token names a row that has to exist *on this branch* (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`). Nothing else in the chain can tell the operator that early: the matrix builder raises on the first bad token, one per chunk job, so a stale list costs one full CI round per entry and reports the second problem only after the first is fixed. Every problem is collected here instead, and the exit code gates the run."
msgstr "Chagua jina la safu ambayo inapaswa kuwepo *Juu ya tawi hili* (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`). Hakuna kitu kingine katika mnyororo kinaweza kumwambia mwendeshaji kwamba mapema: wajenzi wa tumbo huongeza ishara ya kwanza mbaya, moja kwa kila kazi ya chunk, kwa hivyo orodha ya stale ina gharama ya mzunguko mmoja kamili wa CI kwa kuingia na inaripoti shida ya pili tu baada ya kwanza imewekwa. Kila tatizo linakusanywa hapa badala yake, na msimbo wa kuondoka unafungua."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A server that loses its way answers ``Cloud`` with ``Cloud Cloud Cloud``. Every other rule passes it: the spans survive, the markup count survives, it is no echo, and ``truncated`` only watches the short side."
msgstr "Mtu ambaye amepoteza majibu yake ``Cloud`` Pamoja na ``Cloud Cloud Cloud``. Kila kanuni nyingine hupita: spans kuishi, hesabu markup kuishi, ni hakuna echo, na ``truncated`` Angalia tu upande wa kulia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A service is a reusable dependency that an application enables via `services.<service_key>`."
msgstr "Huduma ni utegemezi unaoweza kurejeshwa ambao programu inawezesha kupitia `services.<service_key>`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A service key is group-conditional when some role declares it with a Jinja ``enabled`` expression rather than a literal, i.e. the shape ``tests/integration/roles/meta/services/test_dynamic_flags.py`` enforces. Those keys are the ones a test deploy may drop without changing what the role under test is: their providers are co-deployed only because a host happens to be in the provider's group."
msgstr "Funguo la huduma ni la kikundi wakati jukumu fulani linatangaza na Jinja ``enabled`` maneno badala ya maneno halisi, yaani sura ``tests/integration/roles/meta/services/test_dynamic_flags.py`` utekelezaji. Funguo hizo ni zile ambazo kupelekwa kwa mtihani kunaweza kushuka bila kubadilisha jukumu lililo chini ya mtihani ni: watoa huduma wao wanashirikiana tu kwa sababu mwenyeji hutokea kuwa katika kikundi cha mtoa huduma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A service that spells its probe out instead of picking a flavor."
msgstr "Huduma ambayo inaelezea uchunguzi wake badala ya kuokota ladha."

