# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A single paragraph (one or two sentences) immediately below the H1. It MUST explain what kind of commands live in the directory. It MUST NOT name the sub-commands explicitly. It MUST stand on its own when extracted by the CLI help system, which collapses multi-line paragraphs into a single line."
msgstr "Kifungu kimoja (sentensi moja au mbili) Chini ya H1. Ni lazima kueleza ni aina gani ya amri kuishi katika saraka. Haihitaji majina ya viongozi wa chini. Lazima kusimama peke yake wakati hutolewa na mfumo wa msaada wa CLI, ambao unaanguka aya nyingi za mstari katika mstari mmoja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A single volume"
msgstr "Ukubwa mmoja"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A single wildcard replaces 15+ per-shape entries (`* make *`, `docker *`, `gh api *`, `grep *`, `head *`, `tail *`, `tee *`, `wc *`, `echo *`, `pkill *`, `* > /tmp/*`, `*=* python* *`, `gh issue *`, `gh run *`, `make *`) that existed purely as workarounds for the sandbox auto-allow heuristic declining on env-prefixes, redirects, pipes, and quoted args. With `Bash(*)` the allowlist no longer rots as new command shapes emerge; the gating responsibility moves entirely to `ask` (mutating verbs) and `deny` (structurally unsafe shapes)."
msgstr "Kadi moja ya wildcard 15+ Per-shape entries (`* make *`, Kwa hivyo, `docker *`, Kwa hivyo, `gh api *`, Kwa hivyo, `grep *`, Kwa hivyo, `head *`, Kwa hivyo, `tail *`, Kwa hivyo, `tee *`, Kwa hivyo, `wc *`, Kwa hivyo, `echo *`, Kwa hivyo, `pkill *`, Kwa hivyo, `* > /tmp/*`, Kwa hivyo, `*=* python* *`, Kwa hivyo, `gh issue *`, Kwa hivyo, `gh run *`, Kwa hivyo, `make *`) Hiyo ilikuwa tu kama workarounds kwa sandbox auto-allow heuristic kupungua juu ya env-prefixes, redirects, mabomba, na alinukuliwa args. Pamoja na `Bash(*)` ruhusu haipatikani tena kama maumbo mapya ya amri yanaibuka; jukumu la gating linakwenda kabisa `ask` (Kubadilisha vitenzi) Aidha, na `deny` (Miundo isiyo salama)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A single-element list holding the expanded spec list, so the caller receives the list itself rather than its first element."
msgstr "Orodha moja iliyo na orodha ya spec iliyopanuliwa, kwa hivyo mwombaji hupokea orodha yenyewe badala ya kipengele chake cha kwanza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A single-node lab cannot answer the multi-node criteria: replica scaling, placement across two `kata-capable` Raspberry-Pi-class nodes, and the compose-plus-swarm end-to-end pass all need the cluster the requirement describes. The arm64 half of the placement criterion is proven by the image check above; the two-node half is not."
msgstr "Lab moja ya node haiwezi kujibu vigezo mbalimbali: scaling ya replica, uwekaji katika mbili `kata-capable` Raspberry-Pi-class nodes, na kutunga-plus-swarm mwisho-kwa-mwisho kupita wote haja ya nguzo mahitaji anaelezea. Mkono wa64 Nusu ya kipimo cha uwekaji imethibitishwa na ukaguzi wa picha hapo juu; nusu ya node mbili sio."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A small Express middleware (``files/sso/header_auth.js``, mounted into ``server.js`` at build time by ``files/sso/patch_server.js``) reads only those nginx-overwritten ``X-Forwarded-*`` headers and flips ``req.session.loggedIn = true``, so the existing ``isAuthenticated`` gate on ``/admin`` opens for the proxied owner."
msgstr "Programu ndogo ya Express (``files/sso/header_auth.js``· Kuingia kwenye ``server.js`` Kujenga wakati ``files/sso/patch_server.js``) Soma tu maandishi ya nginx ``X-Forwarded-*`` kichwa na flips ``req.session.loggedIn = true``, Kwa hiyo, kwa sasa ``isAuthenticated`` Mlango wa mlango ``/admin`` Fungua kwa mmiliki aliyependekezwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A small Express middleware (`files/sso/header_auth.js`, mounted into `server.js` at build time by `files/sso/patch_server.js`) reads only those nginx-overwritten `X-Forwarded-*` headers and flips `req.session.loggedIn = true`, so the existing `isAuthenticated` gate on `/admin` opens for the proxied owner."
msgstr "Programu ndogo ya Express (`files/sso/header_auth.js`· Kuingia kwenye `server.js` Kujenga wakati `files/sso/patch_server.js`) Soma tu maandishi ya nginx `X-Forwarded-*` kichwa na flips `req.session.loggedIn = true`, Kwa hiyo, kwa sasa `isAuthenticated` Mlango wa mlango `/admin` Fungua kwa mmiliki aliyependekezwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A source not starting with ``/`` is a remote ``[user@]host:/path`` (rsync pulls it)."
msgstr "Chanzo ambacho hakijaanza na ``/`` Kuwa remote ``[user@]host:/path`` (Rsync hufanya hivyo)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A static-analysis pass (added in [tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_env_keys_used.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_env_keys_used.py)) surfaced multiple roles that **declared** the `BIBER_*` env keys but never read them in the spec; the env file was prepared, the spec was never written. The most prominent example is `web-app-joomla`: it ships an OIDC variant (`plg_system_keycloak`) and an LDAP variant (core LDAP auth plugin) per [006 - Service-gated Playwright tests](README.md#archive), but the Playwright spec only exercises the admin login. A non-admin biber landing-page assertion is missing and would catch RBAC group-mapping drift introduced by 004."
msgstr "Uchunguzi wa static (Aliongeza kuwa katika [tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_env_keys_used.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_env_keys_used.py)) imeainisha majukumu mbalimbali ambayo **Imetangazwa kuwa** Kwa kuwa `BIBER_*` Ingia funguo lakini kamwe kusoma yao katika specifikationer; faili env alikuwa tayari, spec ilikuwa kamwe imeandikwa. Mfano mkubwa ni `web-app-joomla`: Inatumia mfumo wa OIDC (`plg_system_keycloak`) Kwa upande mwingine, kuna tofauti (Msingi wa LDAP auth Plugin) Kwa upande wa [006 Majaribio ya Playwright](README.md#archive), Lakini spec ya Playwright hufanya tu admin login. Madai yasiyo yaadmin biber ya kutua haipo na inaweza kukamata drift ya kikundi cha RBAC iliyoletwa na 004..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A stopped agent is started again on the next request with its volume re-attached. An agent serving a request is never stopped, and the idle time is re-read under the agent's lock before the stop. When a caller has lost the `agent-user` group, the broker refuses the request and stops that caller's running agent."
msgstr "Wakala wa kusimamishwa huanza tena kwenye ombi linalofuata na kiasi chake kilichowekwa tena. wakala kuwahudumia ombi ni kamwe kusimamishwa, na muda wavivu ni kusoma tena chini ya kufuli wakala kabla ya kuacha. Wakati simu inapopoteza `agent-user` Kundi, broker anakataa ombi na kuacha kwamba wakala wa kuendesha simu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A structured secret in the prompt forces the same restriction even when the switch is on. Only unambiguous shapes count (PEM headers, `sk-`, `ghp_`, `github_pat_`, `AKIA`, `xox[bapsr]-`, `AIza`); a pattern like `password=` would match prose and teach callers to click past the refusal. This is a second lock and not the guarantee, because any such pattern has false negatives. The guarantee is that this restriction is a filter applied before any ranking: a restricted request has no remote candidate left to rank, whatever weight locality carries in decision 9."
msgstr "Siri ya muundo katika nguvu za haraka kizuizi sawa hata wakati kubadili ni juu. tu bila mpangilio wa hesabu (Wakuu wa Mikoa, `sk-`, Kwa hivyo, `ghp_`, Kwa hivyo, `github_pat_`, Kwa hivyo, `AKIA`, Kwa hivyo, `xox[bapsr]-`, Kwa hivyo, `AIza`); Muundo kama `password=` Itakuwa mechi prose na kufundisha wapiga simu kwa kubonyeza nyuma kukataa. Hii ni kufuli ya pili na sio dhamana, kwa sababu muundo wowote huo una hasi za uongo. Dhamana ni kwamba kizuizi hiki ni kichujio kilichotumiwa kabla ya cheo chochote: ombi lililozuiliwa halina mgombea wa kijijini aliyeachwa kwa cheo, chochote cha uzito hubeba uamuzi 9..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A subclass of str to represent vault-encrypted strings."
msgstr "A subclass ya str kuwakilisha vault-encrypted strings."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A suite is turned off only when every job of it came back green; one that failed, was cancelled or never ran at all keeps it on the retrigger, so a retrigger spends its runners on what is not yet proven."
msgstr "Nyumba inageuzwa tu wakati kila kazi yake ilirudi kijani; moja ambayo ilishindwa, ilifutwa au haijawahi kukimbia kabisa inaiweka kwenye retrigger, hivyo retrigger hutumia wakimbiaji wake kwa kile ambacho bado hakijathibitishwa."

