# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A token naming a role the discovery query does not return at all is reported too, but as a warning, whether or not it pins axes: the diff-derived whitelist legitimately names roles the envelope filters out, and it pins the variants a change reaches. Role names themselves are checked against `roles/` before the run starts (scripts/github/resolve/effective_whitelist.sh), so a typo is caught there rather than swallowed here."
msgstr "Ishara ya kutaja jukumu la ugunduzi wa swala hairudi hata kidogo inaripotiwa pia, lakini kama onyo, ikiwa inapiga axes: orodha ya rangi nyeupe iliyosababishwa kihalali ina majukumu ya bahasha ya nje, na inaonyesha anuwai mabadiliko yanafikia. Majina ya wahusika wenyewe yatafutwa `roles/` Kabla ya kuanza kwa (scripts/github/resolve/effective_whitelist.sh), Kwa hiyo, kuna aina fulani ya wadudu, badala ya kuingizwa hapa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A token that narrows nothing beyond the role name is answered by existence: it asks for the role in whatever axes the rotation picks, so any discovered row satisfies it. Rows are keyed by ``(name, variant)`` and a variant is an int, so looking such a token up variant-first can only miss, which reported every collapsed priority entry as matching nothing and left a role that really had no row indistinguishable from one with a full set."
msgstr "Ishara ambayo hupunguza chochote zaidi ya jina la jukumu inajibiwa kwa kuwepo: inauliza jukumu katika chochote kinachochagua mzunguko, kwa hivyo mstari wowote uliogunduliwa unairidhisha. Roketi hizo zimetengenezwa kwa ``(name, variant)`` Na lahaja ni int, hivyo kuangalia kama ishara ya juu lahaja ya kwanza inaweza tu miss, ambayo taarifa kila kuanguka kipaumbele kuingia kama vinavyolingana na kitu na kushoto jukumu kwamba kweli hakuwa na mstari indistinguishable kutoka moja na seti kamili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A token with no directory under ``roles/`` encodes to itself: it is a sentinel like ``__ALL__``, or a role the tree does not hold, and neither has a heading or a category to read."
msgstr "Orodha ya majina bila ya usajili ``roles/`` Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi. .................................................................... ``__ALL__``, au jukumu ambalo mti haushiki, na hauna kichwa au kikundi cha kusoma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A tools-only server never has to stream, so every response is a plain JSON body and no SSE session state exists to get wrong."
msgstr "Seva ya zana pekee haipaswi kutiririka, kwa hivyo kila jibu ni mwili wazi wa JSON na hakuna hali ya kikao cha SSE iko ili kupata makosa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A translation identical to its source changed nothing and so damaged nothing, except when the source is a sentence: the server answers with its input when it fails, and the client seeds every entry with the source, so an echoed sentence is a failure that would otherwise count as translated and never be retried."
msgstr "Tafsiri inayolingana na chanzo chake haikubadilisha chochote na iliharibiwa chochote, isipokuwa wakati chanzo ni sentensi: seva inajibu kwa pembejeo yake inaposhindwa, na mteja anapanda kila kuingia na chanzo, kwa hivyo sentensi iliyorudiwa ni kushindwa ambayo vinginevyo itahesabu kama kutafsiriwa na kamwe kurejeshwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A translation that was turned down, kept so the catalog shows why."
msgstr "Tafsiri ambayo ilikataliwa, ilihifadhiwa hivyo orodha inaonyesha kwa nini."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A typical OIDC-consuming role wires the values into its environment template, for example [env.j2](../../../../roles/web-app-mastodon/templates/env.j2):"
msgstr "Jukumu la kawaida la OIDC linaunganisha maadili katika template yake ya mazingira, kwa mfano. [env.j2](../../../../roles/web-app-mastodon/templates/env.j2):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A user definition that declares no password falls back to ``{{ 42 | strong_password }}``. That is a template, not a value: it is re-rendered at every use site, so the task that creates an account and the task that later authenticates as it read two different secrets. Inventory creation is where the value gets decided once, next to the role credentials that are already generated there."
msgstr "Ufafanuzi wa mtumiaji ambao unasema hakuna nenosiri linarudi nyuma ``{{ 42 | strong_password }}``. Hiyo ni template, si thamani: ni re-rendered katika kila matumizi ya tovuti, hivyo kazi ambayo inajenga akaunti na kazi kwamba baadaye inathibitisha kama ni kusoma siri mbili tofauti. Uumbaji wa uvumbuzi ni ambapo thamani huamuliwa mara moja, karibu na sifa za jukumu ambazo tayari zimezalishwa huko."

