# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A variant that dictates a provider's config does not deploy that provider as the provider declares it, so nothing about that run states what the provider does on its own. Callers that reason about coverage need to know which pairs those are before they credit one role's deploy to another."
msgstr "Tofauti ambayo inaamuru config ya mtoa huduma haitoi mtoa huduma huyo kama mtoa huduma anatangaza, hivyo hakuna chochote kuhusu hiyo inayoendeshwa inasema nini mtoa huduma anafanya peke yake. Callers kwamba sababu kuhusu chanjo haja ya kujua ni jozi gani hizo ni kabla ya wao mikopo jukumu moja kupeleka kwa mwingine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A verification run wants the combination that reaches a verdict soonest, and the axes differ by minutes: an onion row waits for circuits the clearnet row never builds, and swarm brings a cluster up before the first service starts. The combination that answers the question fastest is therefore not the one the sweep rotation happens to draw."
msgstr "Jaribio la uhakiki linataka mchanganyiko unaofikia uamuzi haraka zaidi, na axes hutofautiana kwa dakika: mstari wa onion unasubiri mzunguko wa safu ya wazi kamwe hujenga, na kundi huleta nguzo kabla ya huduma ya kwanza kuanza. Mchanganyiko unaojibu swali la haraka kwa hivyo sio moja ya mzunguko wa kufagia unafanyika kuteka."

