# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Add a post-deploy assert that the GPU actually reached the container, once `feature/store-i18n` is merged. The role already selects the path by itself: `services.s1.gpu` states the intent and `tasks/00_core.yml` ANDs it with `/dev/nvidia0` and `/usr/bin/nvidia-container-runtime`, so a host without the toolkit builds the CPU image whatever the flag says. What is missing is the check that the device arrived, in the shape of `web-svc-libretranslate/tasks/utils/assert_gpu.yml`: ask the served container how many CUDA devices it counts rather than trusting the two stats. The `runtime: nvidia` line itself comes from `sys-svc-container/templates/resource.yml.j2` on that branch. Upstream measures `Router(preload=True)` at 32.8 ms on GPU against 193 to 464 ms on CPU."
msgstr "Kuongeza baada ya kazi kudai kwamba GPU kweli kufikiwa chombo, mara moja `feature/store-i18n` ya kuunganishwa. Sehemu ya kwanza ni kuchagua njia yenyewe: `services.s1.gpu` Alisema lengo na `tasks/00_core.yml` Pamoja na hayo `/dev/nvidia0` Aidha, na `/usr/bin/nvidia-container-runtime`, Kwa hivyo mwenyeji bila chombo hujenga picha ya CPU chochote bendera inasema. Nini ni kukosa kuangalia kwamba kifaa alifika, katika sura ya `web-svc-libretranslate/tasks/utils/assert_gpu.yml`: Waulize chombo kilichotumiwa ni vifaa ngapi vya CUDA vinavyohesabu badala ya kuamini stats mbili. Kwa kuwa `runtime: nvidia` Mstari wenyewe unatoka `sys-svc-container/templates/resource.yml.j2` kwenye ofisi hiyo. Hatua za Juu `Router(preload=True)` Wakati wa 32.8 wa GPU dhidi ya 193 Kwa kuwa 464 ya CPU."

