# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a Jinja expression to stand as a mapping key under `roles/*/meta/`. Ansible renders the values of an `include_vars` payload and leaves the keys as written, so the consumer receives the source text. Marker goes on or directly above the line."
msgstr "Inaruhusu neno la Jinja kusimama kama ufunguo wa ramani chini `roles/*/meta/`· Kuainisha thamani ya mwaka `include_vars` Malipo na majani funguo kama ilivyoandikwa, hivyo mtumiaji anapokea maandishi ya chanzo. Bonyeza juu au chini ya mstari."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `*.sh.j2` to exist. Default path: ship the script as a plain `.sh` under `files/shell/` and pass its values as `ExecStart` arguments or `Environment=` entries, because shellcheck, the repository's `.sh` guards and every test skip a Jinja template, so nothing reads what actually runs on the host. Reserved for a script whose shape is generated, not just its values. Place the marker BELOW the shebang, never above it, and prefer the Jinja comment form so it does not reach the rendered script."
msgstr "Kuwezesha A `*.sh.j2` kuwa hai. Njia rahisi ya kufanya hivyo ni kupitia barua pepe. `.sh` Chini ya `files/shell/` kutekeleza majukumu yake kama `ExecStart` Majadiliano au `Environment=` Kwa mfano, kwa sababu shellcheck, kuhifadhi `.sh` Walinzi na kila mtihani kuruka template Jinja, hivyo hakuna kusoma nini hasa anaendesha juu ya jeshi. Imehifadhiwa kwa script ambayo sura yake inazalishwa, sio tu maadili yake. Weka alama chini ya shebang, kamwe juu yake, na wanapendelea fomu ya maoni ya Jinja hivyo haina kufikia script iliyotolewa."

