# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `container exec` / `container inspect` target that does not route through the `container_address` lookup. Reserved for a container ID already resolved at `delegate_to` runtime (`*_LOCAL_CID`), where the lookup would return a manager-only subshell, and for deliberate bare-name partner probes gated on compose co-location."
msgstr "Kuwezesha A `container exec` Kwa hivyo `container inspect` malengo ambayo hayakutekelezwa kupitia `container_address` ya macho. Imehifadhiwa kwa ajili ya kitambulisho cha chombo tayari kimefungwa `delegate_to` Muda wa kukimbia (`*_LOCAL_CID`), ambapo lookup ingerudi subshell meneja tu, na kwa makusudi wazi jina mpenzi uchunguzi gated juu ya kuandika ushirikiano eneo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `container_address`-derived target to be reached from a `command: argv:` list, which runs no shell to evaluate the swarm `$(...)` fragment. Reserved for roles pinned to compose via `compose_mode_force`, where the lookup can only ever yield a bare name."
msgstr "Kuwezesha A `container_address`Lengo ni kufikia lengo la `command: argv:` Orodha, ambayo haina shell ya kuchunguza wadudu `$(...)` sehemu ya kugawanyika. Imehifadhiwa kwa ajili ya majukumu pinned kwa kutunga kupitia `compose_mode_force`, Katika kesi hii, jina la kikoa linaweza kuwa na jina tu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `loop_var` to take the name of a variable declared in `group_vars/**` or in a role's `vars`/`defaults`. Inside the loop that name carries the item, so every lookup, template and nested include reading it sees the item instead, and ansible only warns. Reserved for a loop whose body reads the name as the item on purpose, typically because the item IS that value: state which meaning the body relies on."
msgstr "Kuwezesha A `loop_var` Ili kupata jina la tofauti iliyotangazwa katika `group_vars/**` au katika nafasi ya `vars`Kwa hivyo`defaults`. Ndani ya kitanzi kwamba jina hubeba kitu, hivyo kila kuangalia, template na kiota ni pamoja na kusoma ni anaona kitu badala, na ansible tu anaonya. Imehifadhiwa kwa kitanzi ambacho mwili wake unasoma jina kama bidhaa kwa madhumuni, kwa kawaida kwa sababu bidhaa hiyo ni thamani: hali ambayo inamaanisha mwili hutegemea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `roles/*/meta/services.yml` `min_storage` to exceed the measured compressed size of its own `image:`/`version:` by more than 1 GB. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same comment line naming what occupies the space. Reserved for services whose data volume genuinely dominates the footprint; the default path is to lower the value, because an over-declared budget makes a host look too small and prunes a cache the deploy did not need to lose."
msgstr "Kuwezesha A `roles/*/meta/services.yml` `min_storage` Ili kuongeza ukubwa wa nywele zake `image:`Kwa hivyo`version:` Kwa zaidi ya 1 B. Lazima kuwa pamoja na A `Reason:` Kwenye mstari huo huo wa maoni unataja kile kinachochukua nafasi. Iliyohifadhiwa kwa huduma ambazo kiasi cha data kinatawala kwa kweli nyayo; njia ya default ni kupunguza thamani, kwa sababu bajeti iliyotangazwa zaidi hufanya mwenyeji aonekane mdogo sana na kupogoa cache ambayo kupelekwa hakuhitaji kupoteza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `roles/*/meta/services.yml` entry whose image ships no `HEALTHCHECK` to declare none either. Default path: add `healthcheck:` to the entry, because a container without a probe counts as healthy the moment its process starts — which is how a service that came back empty passes a restore drill. Reserved for containers nothing can probe: a one-shot process that exits, or an image with neither a port nor a shell."
msgstr "Kuwezesha A `roles/*/meta/services.yml` ambaye picha zake hazihusiani `HEALTHCHECK` kutangaza hakuna. Njia ya mkato: Ongeza `healthcheck:` kuingia, kwa sababu chombo bila uchunguzi makosa kama afya wakati mchakato wake kuanza - ambayo ni jinsi huduma kwamba alikuja nyuma tupu hupita drill kurejesha. Kuhifadhiwa kwa vyombo hakuna kitu kinachoweza kuchunguza: mchakato wa risasi moja unaotoka, au picha isiyo na bandari wala shell."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Allows a `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` `services.<key>` entry to reference a service key that is NOT declared as a top-level entry in `meta/services.yml`. Reserved for resolver-only matrix hooks (typically on invokable infrastructure roles) whose variant entries pin the round's companion topology via service-key flags the resolver maps to provider roles, with no real consumer contract in the base meta."
msgstr "Kuwezesha A `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` `services.<key>` Kuingia kwa kumbukumbu muhimu ya huduma ambayo haijatangazwa kama kuingia kwa ngazi ya juu `meta/services.yml`. Haki miliki ya picha resolver-only matrix hooks (Kwa kawaida, majukumu ya miundombinu ya Invokable) ambayo lahaja entries pin topology ya rafiki wa pande zote kupitia bendera ya huduma-kifungu ramani ya kutatua majukumu ya mtoa huduma, na hakuna mkataba wa watumiaji halisi katika meta msingi."

