# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Amended after implementation: the deployed Hermes version serves a bearer API rather than a browser dashboard, so its native-OIDC support cannot be used. It is gated at the auth proxy instead, like OpenClaw and Flowise, admitting the role's `administrator` and `mcp` groups. Holding `API_SERVER_KEY` alone was the whole boundary before, which put every MCP provider Hermes is admitted to behind one shared deployment secret. The cost of the proxy is deliberate: an OpenAI-compatible client presenting only a bearer no longer reaches Hermes through its public vhost, and has to come from inside the container network."
msgstr "Baada ya utekelezaji: Toleo la Hermes lililotumika hutumika mtoaji API Badala ya dashibodi ya kivinjari, hivyo msaada wake wa asili-OIDC hauwezi kutumika. Kwa upande wake, Mbunge wa Jimbo la Ludewa Mhe. OpenClaw Aidha, na FlowiseKwa kutambua jukumu la `administrator` Aidha, na `mcp` makundi. Kushikilia Holding `API_SERVER_KEY` Mpaka wote ulikuwa kabla, ambayo kuweka kila mtoa huduma wa MCP Hermes ni alikiri nyuma ya siri moja ya kupelekwa pamoja. Gharama ya wakala ni ya makusudi: mteja wa OpenAI anayewasilisha tu mpokeaji hafiki tena Hermes kupitia vhost yake ya umma, na anapaswa kutoka ndani ya mtandao wa chombo."

