# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh extension` subcommand. `install` and `upgrade` pull remote code that then runs in-process under the operator's GitHub credentials on every subsequent `gh` invocation; `remove`/`list`/`search`/`exec` are blocked alongside to keep the namespace simple. Extensions belong to a deliberate operator decision, not an agent."
msgstr "Yoyote ya `gh extension` chini ya uongozi. `install` Aidha, na `upgrade` kuvuta msimbo wa kijijini kwamba kisha anaendesha katika mchakato chini ya sifa ya operator GitHub juu ya kila baadaye `gh` katika maombi. `remove`Kwa hivyo`list`Kwa hivyo`search`Kwa hivyo`exec` Imefungwa pamoja na kuweka nafasi ya jina rahisi. Hatua za ziada ni uamuzi wa mwendeshaji wa makusudi, sio wakala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh gpg-key` subcommand. `add` installs a persistent commit-signing identity an attacker could use to impersonate the operator on signed commits; `delete` can lock the operator out of signed-commit policies; `list` leaks the key-fingerprint inventory. Out-of-band key management only."
msgstr "Yoyote ya `gh gpg-key` chini ya uongozi. `add` Inasanidi utambulisho unaoendelea wa ishara ya kujitolea mshambuliaji anaweza kutumia ili operatore operator juu ya ahadi zilizosainiwa; `delete` inaweza kufunga operator nje ya sera zilizosainiwa; `list` Weka orodha ya key-fingerprint. Usimamizi wa nje wa kichwa tu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh secret` subcommand. `set`/`remove` mutate CI secrets under the operator's identity; `list` leaks secret names, the exact same risk class as the `gh api * /actions/secrets*` deny (\"Even GETs leak secret names\"). Out-of-band secret management only."
msgstr "Yoyote ya `gh secret` chini ya uongozi. `set`Kwa hivyo`remove` Kubadilisha siri za CI chini ya utambulisho wa operator; `list` Majina ya siri, darasa la hatari sawa na `gh api * /actions/secrets*` Kukanusha uwongo (\"Hata kupata majina ya siri\"). Usimamizi wa siri wa nje ya ndoa tu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh ssh-key` subcommand. `add` is a persistent auth backdoor giving shell-equivalent push access until revoked; `delete` can lock the operator out; `list` leaks the key-fingerprint inventory. Out-of-band key management only."
msgstr "Yoyote ya `gh ssh-key` chini ya uongozi. `add` Je, ni kuendelea auth nyuma kutoa shell-sawa kushinikiza upatikanaji mpaka kufutwa; `delete` Unaweza kufunga operator nje; `list` Weka orodha ya key-fingerprint. Usimamizi wa nje wa kichwa tu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh variable` subcommand. Mirror of the `gh secret *` rule for Actions variables. Variables are unencrypted secrets-lite; even `list` exposes their values directly, so the entire namespace is blocked and managed out-of-band."
msgstr "Yoyote ya `gh variable` chini ya uongozi. Mirror ya `gh secret *` Sheria ya Mabadiliko ya Tabianchi. Tofauti ni ya siri; hata `list` Inafichua maadili yao moja kwa moja, kwa hivyo jina lote limezuiwa na kusimamiwa nje ya ndoa."

