# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Anything else gets `return 404`, and finding that out was worth the deploy. With `mcp.enabled` false, Baserow's canonical vhost still answered `401 Endpoint not found.` on `/mcp/<key>/sse`, because the image mounts the MCP app on the ASGI root unconditionally and the flag only governs whether an endpoint record is provisioned. A refused credential is still a surface, which is what the disabled-state assertion says and why it failed. The same routing has a sharper edge while MCP is *on*: the adapter narrows fourteen upstream tools to four, and a publicly routed native path walks straight past it to all fourteen for anyone holding the endpoint key. `web-app-homeassistant` had the same shape, an `exposure: internal` surface reachable on its public vhost. Both now 404 there and stay reachable on the container network, which is what `internal` was always supposed to mean."
msgstr "Kitu kingine chochote ni `return 404`, Kwa hiyo, na kutafuta hiyo ilikuwa thamani ya kupeleka. Pamoja na `mcp.enabled` ya uongo. BaserowBarua ya Papa Francisko bado inajibiwa `401 Endpoint not found.` Juu ya `/mcp/<key>/sse`, kwa sababu picha inachukua programu ya MCP kwenye mizizi ya ASGI bila masharti na bendera inatawala tu ikiwa rekodi ya mwisho imewekwa. Kukataa imani bado ni uso, ambayo ni nini madai ya hali ya walemavu inasema na kwa nini alishindwa. Mfumo huu una nguvu zaidi wakati MCP *Juu ya*: adapta hupunguza zana kumi na nne za upstream kwa nne, na njia ya asili iliyoelekezwa kwa umma inakwenda moja kwa moja hadi kumi na nne kwa mtu yeyote aliye na ufunguo wa mwisho. `web-app-homeassistant` Alikuwa na sura ile ile, na `exposure: internal` Kuenea kwa uso kwenye uso wake wa umma. Kwa sasa wawili hao 404 kuwa na uwezo wa kuingia kwenye mtandao wa intaneti, jambo ambalo `internal` Daima alikuwa na maana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Anything else — restating code, section banners, \"Note that …\", step narration outside sequential test specs, untracked TODO/FIXME — **DELETE before the edit lands**. Applies to every language and file kind under version control. When in doubt, delete."
msgstr "Chochote kingine - kuweka msimbo, bendera ya sehemu, \"Kumbuka kwamba ...\"Maelezo ya hatua nje ya specifikationer sequential mtihani, untracked TODO /FIXME - **Kabla ya kupanda mbegu za mazao**Tumia kila lugha na aina ya faili chini ya udhibiti wa toleo. Wakati unaruhusu bila shaka."

