# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a consumer of the Infinito.Nexus LLM gateway, I want to send a prompt to one alias and have a fast typed decision pick the model that can actually serve it, so that I neither hard-code a model per call site nor pay a large model to answer a question a small one handles."
msgstr "Kama mtumiaji wa Infinito.Nexus lango la LLM, nataka kutuma haraka kwa alias moja na kuwa na uamuzi wa haraka wa aina ya kuchagua mfano ambao unaweza kutumika kwa kweli, ili mimi si vigumu-code mfano kwa kila tovuti ya simu wala kulipa mfano mkubwa wa kujibu swali ndogo moja inashughulikia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a contributor maintaining the per-role Playwright suite, I want every role whose `meta/services.yml` declares `ldap.enabled` (literal `true` or the dynamic `\"{{ 'svc-db-openldap' in group_names }}\"` form) to ship a Playwright scenario that exercises the LDAP-bind login path end-to-end, so that the LDAP variant of the role's authentication stack is verified independently from its OIDC counterpart."
msgstr "Kama mchangiaji anayedumisha Suite ya kila aina ya Playwright, nataka kila jukumu ambalo `meta/services.yml` Alisema kuwa `ldap.enabled` (Moja kwa moja `true` au kuwa na nguvu `\"{{ 'svc-db-openldap' in group_names }}\"` Fomu ya fomu) meli hali Playwright kwamba mazoezi LDAP-bind login njia ya mwisho-kwa-mwisho, hivyo kwamba lahaja LDAP ya jukumu hilo uthibitisho stack ni kuthibitishwa huru kutoka kwa mwenzake OIDC."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a contributor maintaining the per-role Playwright suite, I want every role whose login flow is RBAC-gated (OIDC and/or LDAP) to also exercise the canonical non-admin user `biber` end-to-end, so that the RBAC plumbing from [004 - Generic RBAC role auto-provisioning](README.md#archive) is verified per role rather than only on the privileged-admin path."
msgstr "Kama mchangiaji anayedumisha Suite ya Playwright, nataka kila jukumu ambalo mtiririko wake wa kuingia ni RBAC-gated (OIDC na / au LDAP) Pia kutumia mtumiaji wa canonical non-admin `biber` Mwisho wa siku, kwa hivyo RBAC inaanza kutoka [004 Jukumu la RBAC auto-provisioning](README.md#archive) Inathibitishwa kwa jukumu badala ya tu kwenye njia ya uongozi wa upendeleo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a contributor to Infinito.Nexus, I want every role that ships application-level extensions to declare them through one unified `meta/addons/` contract (one file per addon), instead of today's per-app spelling (`addons`, `plugins`, `extensions`, `modules`, `mu_plugins`) scattered across `meta/services.yml`, `vars/main.yml`, and `tasks/`, so that addons are discoverable, lintable, and testable with a single schema, and so that any addon that bridges into another role declares that dependency explicitly through a service flag in `meta/services.yml`."
msgstr "Kama mchangiaji wa Infinito.Nexus, Nataka kila jukumu kwamba meli ngazi ya maombi upanuzi kutangaza yao kwa njia moja umoja `meta/addons/` Mkataba wa Mkataba (Faili moja kwa moja kwa addon), Badala ya maneno ya leo (`addons`, Kwa hivyo, `plugins`, Kwa hivyo, `extensions`, Kwa hivyo, `modules`, Kwa hivyo, `mu_plugins`) Kusambazwa kwa `meta/services.yml`, Kwa hivyo, `vars/main.yml`, Aidha, na `tasks/`, ili viongezaji viweze kugunduliwa, vionekane, na viweze kupimwa kwa schema moja, na hivyo kwamba nyongeza yoyote inayoingia katika jukumu lingine inatangaza kwamba utegemezi wazi kupitia bendera ya huduma katika `meta/services.yml`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a contributor, I want a requirements template so that new requirements are consistent and machine-readable."
msgstr "Kama mchangiaji, nataka template ya mahitaji ili mahitaji mapya ni thabiti na ya kusomwa kwa mashine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a developer, I want to run the Infinito.Nexus CI on a dedicated server so that the deploy + test cycle is no longer bound by local hardware restrictions."
msgstr "Kama mwanaharakati, napenda kuongoza Infinito.Nexus CI kwenye seva iliyojitolea ili kupeleka mzunguko wa mtihani + haufungwa tena na vikwazo vya vifaa vya ndani."

