# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want [Checkmk](https://github.com/Checkmk/checkmk) integrated as a `web-app-checkmk` role with Keycloak SSO (via the oauth2-proxy gate) and native LDAP user management so that operators can run the open-source Checkmk monitoring server behind the platform's central Single Sign-On, validated end-to-end with Playwright personas."
msgstr "Kama msimamizi wa jukwaa Infinito.Nexus“Tunahitaji [Checkmk](https://github.com/Checkmk/checkmk) Kuunganisha kama A `web-app-checkmk` Wajibu wa pamoja Keycloak Kwa hivyo (kwa hisani ya RaiaMwema2Mlango wa mlango) na usimamizi wa mtumiaji wa LDAP ili waendeshaji waweze kuendesha chanzo cha wazi Checkmk Ufuatiliaji wa seva nyuma ya Sign-On kuu ya jukwaa, kuthibitishwa mwisho-kwa-mwisho na Playwright personas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want [Jellyfin](https://jellyfin.org) integrated as a `web-app-jellyfin` role with Keycloak-backed Single Sign-On so that users can stream the media server behind the platform's central identity, validated end-to-end with Playwright personas."
msgstr "Kama msimamizi wa jukwaa Infinito.Nexus“Tunahitaji [Jellyfin](https://jellyfin.org) Kuunganisha kama A `web-app-jellyfin` Wajibu wa pamoja KeycloakKuungwa mkono Single Sign-On ili watumiaji wanaweza mkondo wa seva ya vyombo vya habari nyuma ya utambulisho wa kati wa jukwaa, kuthibitishwa mwisho hadi mwisho na watu wa Playwright."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want [Semaphore UI](https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore) integrated as a `web-app-semaphore` role with OpenID Connect (Keycloak) SSO and optional LDAP login so that operators can run Ansible / Terraform / OpenTofu / Bash automation from a web UI behind the platform's central Single Sign-On, reusing the central database, and validated end-to-end with Playwright personas."
msgstr "Kama msimamizi wa jukwaa Infinito.Nexus“Tunahitaji [Semaphore UI](https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore) Kuunganisha kama A `web-app-semaphore` Msaada wa OpenID Connect (Keycloak) SSO na hiari LDAP login ili waendeshaji wanaweza kukimbia Ansible / Terraform / OpenTofu / Bash automatisering kutoka mtandao UI nyuma ya ishara kuu ya jukwaa, kutumia database kuu, na kuthibitishwa mwisho-kwa-mwisho na Playwright personas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want a `svc-ai-robot` role that turns one dedicated machine into an embodied platform for Hermes, giving the agent scoped-to-full host access so it can explore its own hardware and act in the physical world, so that Hermes can \"come to life\" on a robot while this power stays confined to a dedicated, segmented device and never leaks onto shared infrastructure."
msgstr "Kama msimamizi wa jukwaa Infinito.Nexus, Tunahitaji A `svc-ai-robot` jukumu ambalo linageuza mashine moja ya kujitolea katika jukwaa la pamoja la Hermes, kutoa upatikanaji wa mwenyeji wa wakala uliowekwa-kwa kamili ili iweze kuchunguza vifaa vyake na kutenda katika ulimwengu wa kimwili, ili Hermes iweze \"Kuingia kwenye maisha\" kwenye robot wakati nguvu hii inakaa kwenye kifaa kilichojitolea, kilichogawanyika na kamwe huvuja kwenye miundombinu ya pamoja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want a `web-app-homeassistant` role that deploys [Home Assistant](https://www.home-assistant.io/) and exposes its native MCP server, so that agent employees (Hermes on a Pi, [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md)) and other MCP clients can control home devices as scoped MCP tools without any host access, making the \"isolated home assistant\" scenario concrete."
msgstr "Kama msimamizi wa jukwaa Infinito.Nexus, Tunahitaji A `web-app-homeassistant` Jukumu ambalo linatekelezwa [Home Assistant](https://www.home-assistant.io/) na kufungua seva ya asili ya MCP, hivyo wafanyakazi wa wakala (Maua juu ya nguruwe, [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md)) na wateja wengine wa MCP wanaweza kudhibiti vifaa vya nyumbani kama zana za MCP zilizopanuliwa bila upatikanaji wowote wa mwenyeji, na kufanya \"Msaidizi wa nyumbani\" hali halisi."

