# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want every role with a documented Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface to expose or consume MCP through the platform's standard service, identity, proxy, and test contracts so that AI clients can use application data and actions safely without one-off per-role wiring."
msgstr "Kama msimamizi wa jukwaa Infinito.Nexus, Tunahitaji kila jukumu na Itifaki ya Mazingira ya Mfano (MCP) uso kwa kufungua au kutumia MCP kwa njia ya huduma ya kawaida ya jukwaa, utambulisho, wakala, na mikataba ya mtihani ili wateja wa AI waweze kutumia data ya maombi na vitendo salama bila wiring moja kwa moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want every role with an `application_id` to have an explicit, evidence-based MCP disposition and every suitable application to expose a narrowly curated MCP surface to Open WebUI, Flowise, n8n, and other approved clients so that applications can be connected without turning shared administrator credentials, raw infrastructure APIs, or arbitrary network access into agent tools."
msgstr "Kama msimamizi wa jukwaa Infinito.Nexus, Nataka kila mmoja atimize wajibu wake `application_id` kuwa na tabia ya wazi, ya msingi wa ushahidi wa MCP na kila programu inayofaa ya kufichua uso mdogo wa MCP Open WebUIKwa hivyo, Flowiseya ya ya8n, na wateja wengine walioidhinishwa ili programu zinaweza kushikamana bila kugeuza sifa za msimamizi wa pamoja, API za miundombinu, au ufikiaji wa mtandao wa kiholela katika zana za wakala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want the `web-app-matrix` role to gain a second deployment flavor that delegates the heavy lifting to the upstream [matrix-docker-ansible-deploy](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD) playbook, so that the full Matrix ecosystem — Synapse, Element, every supported bridge, Jitsi-backed video conferencing, ma1sd / Dimension / hookshot / etcetera — is available without the role re-implementing each service from scratch. The existing role-internal compose stack stays selectable as the `compose` flavor for one cycle, marked deprecated."
msgstr "Kama msimamizi wa jukwaa Infinito.Nexus, Tunahitaji kuwa na `web-app-matrix` jukumu la kupata ladha ya pili ya kupelekwa ambayo wajumbe kuinua nzito kwa upstream [matrix-docker-ansible-deploy](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (ya ya) Kitabu cha mchezo, kwa hiyo, Matrix mazingira - Synapse, Element, kila daraja mkono, Jitsi-backed video mkutano, ma1sd / Dimension / hookshot / nketera - inapatikana bila jukumu la kurejesha kila huduma kutoka mwanzo. Uendelezaji wa muundo wa ndani unaendelea kuchaguliwa kama `compose` Kwa ajili ya mzunguko mmoja, alama deprecated."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want to deploy self-hostable AI agent platforms (Hermes Agent, OpenClaw) as kernel-isolated, scalable \"employees\" across my nodes, coordinated by a Flowise supervisor over MCP and routed to models through the [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway, so that I run a fleet of isolated agents with cross-agent pipelines and kernel-level isolation, without bespoke per-agent wiring."
msgstr "Kama msimamizi wa jukwaa Infinito.Nexus, Nataka kutumia majukwaa ya wakala wa AI (Hermes AgentKwa hivyo, OpenClaw) Kama vile kernel-isolated, scalable \"employees\" Kwa upande wangu, kwa mujibu wa A Flowise Usimamizi wa MCP na kupelekwa kwa mifano kupitia [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) lango, ili mimi kukimbia meli ya mawakala wa pekee na mabomba ya kuvuka-agent na kutengwa kwa kiwango cha kernel, bila bespoke kwa waya wa haraka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator, I want Infinito.Nexus to support multi-node Docker Swarm deployments with NFS-backed shared volumes, so that services can be rescheduled across nodes without losing persistent data, scaled horizontally, and updated with rolling updates — gaining high availability without introducing Kubernetes complexity."
msgstr "Kama kiongozi wa chama, napenda Infinito.Nexus Msaada wa Multinode Docker Swarm kupelekwa na kiasi cha pamoja cha NFS kinachoungwa mkono, ili huduma zinaweza kupangwa tena kwenye nodes bila kupoteza data inayoendelea, iliyopimwa kwa usawa, na iliyosasishwa na sasisho zinazozunguka - kupata upatikanaji wa juu bila kuanzisha utata wa Kubernetes."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As a platform user with agent access, I want Open WebUI to start my own Hermes or OpenClaw agent the first time I address it, isolated from every other user's agent, so that I work with a personal agent without an administrator provisioning one for me, while administrators decide through RBAC who may use agents at all."
msgstr "Kama mtumiaji wa jukwaa na upatikanaji wa wakala, nataka Open WebUI kuanza kutumia dawa zangu au OpenClaw wakala mara ya kwanza mimi kushughulikia, kutengwa na kila wakala wa mtumiaji mwingine, ili mimi kazi na wakala binafsi bila msimamizi kutoa moja kwangu, wakati watendaji kuamua kupitia RBAC ambao wanaweza kutumia mawakala wakati wote."

