# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "At boot, ``files/mcp-api-token.groovy`` runs from ``init.groovy.d`` and mints an API token named ``infinito-mcp`` for the administrator account, writing the plain value to ``/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token``. ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` then reads that value out of the container, persists it through ``sys-token-store``, and hard-fails the deploy when the controller rejects it. ``MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS`` picks the token up from the store and the client roles build the header via the ``mcp_authorization`` filter."
msgstr "Kwa hisani ya RaiaMwema, ``files/mcp-api-token.groovy`` Kuendesha kutoka ``init.groovy.d`` Na kwa kipindi hicho Bw. API Majina ya walioitwa ``infinito-mcp`` kwa akaunti ya msimamizi, kuandika thamani ya wazi ``/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token``... ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` Baada ya kusoma maelezo hayo, endelea kusoma ``sys-token-store``, Ni vigumu sana kufanya hivyo, wakati mtu anakataa. ``MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS`` Huchukua ishara kutoka kwenye duka na majukumu ya mteja hujenga kichwa kupitia ``mcp_authorization`` ya filter."

