# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Baserow ships a native MCP server in the OSS backend, mounted on the ASGI root ahead of Django. Clients do not reach it. The role runs it as the *upstream* of a [`svc-ai-mcp-adapter`](../svc-ai-mcp-adapter/README.md) sidecar (`classification: adapter_server`), and the sidecar is the only MCP surface a consumer is given."
msgstr "Baserow meli ya asili ya MCP server katika nyuma ya OSS, iliyowekwa kwenye mizizi ya ASGI mbele ya Django. Wateja hawapatikani. Jukumu hili linachukuliwa kama *Juu ya* Moja ya A [`svc-ai-mcp-adapter`](../svc-ai-mcp-adapter/README.md) Upande wa nyuma (`classification: adapter_server`), na sidecar ni uso pekee wa MCP ambao mtumiaji hupewa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Baserow ships a native MCP server in the OSS backend, mounted on the ASGI root ahead of Django. Clients do not reach it. The role runs it as the *upstream* of a ```svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` <../svc-ai-mcp-adapter/README.md>`__ sidecar (``classification: adapter_server``), and the sidecar is the only MCP surface a consumer is given."
msgstr "Baserow meli ya asili ya MCP server katika nyuma ya OSS, iliyowekwa kwenye mizizi ya ASGI mbele ya Django. Wateja hawapatikani. Jukumu hili linachukuliwa kama *Juu ya* Moja ya A ```svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` <../svc-ai-mcp-adapter/README.md>`__ sidecar (``classification: adapter_server``), na sidecar ni uso pekee wa MCP ambao mtumiaji hupewa."

