# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Because no stack service exists, the swarm test gates that poll ``docker service ls`` (``converge``, ``seed``, ``drain``, ``assert``) skip themselves via the ``workload: node-local`` declaration (``scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/utils/_context.sh`` maps ``node-local`` to ``HAS_SWARM_SERVICE=false``); the deploy itself, the registry distribution chain and the CLI e2e suite run in full."
msgstr "Kwa sababu hakuna huduma ya stack ipo, milango ya mtihani wa wadudu ambayo ``docker service ls`` (``converge``, Kwa hivyo, ``seed``, Kwa hivyo, ``drain``, Kwa hivyo, ``assert``) mwenyewe kupitia kwa ``workload: node-local`` Taarifa ya (``scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/utils/_context.sh`` Ramani ya ramani ``node-local`` Kwa kuwa ``HAS_SWARM_SERVICE=false``); kupeleka yenyewe, mlolongo wa usambazaji wa Usajili na CLI e2suite . . .."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Because no stack service exists, the swarm test gates that poll `docker service ls` (`converge`, `seed`, `drain`, `assert`) skip themselves via the `workload: node-local` declaration (`scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/utils/_context.sh` maps `node-local` to `HAS_SWARM_SERVICE=false`); the deploy itself, the registry distribution chain and the CLI e2e suite run in full."
msgstr "Kwa sababu hakuna huduma ya stack ipo, milango ya mtihani wa wadudu ambayo `docker service ls` (`converge`, Kwa hivyo, `seed`, Kwa hivyo, `drain`, Kwa hivyo, `assert`) mwenyewe kupitia kwa `workload: node-local` Taarifa ya (`scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/utils/_context.sh` Ramani ya ramani `node-local` Kwa kuwa `HAS_SWARM_SERVICE=false`); kupeleka yenyewe, mlolongo wa usambazaji wa Usajili na CLI e2suite . . .."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Because that grant is irreversible once the container starts, the checks run inside the agent role before it deploys, not afterwards in this role: the agent is a shared service, so the service loader brings it up in the constructor stage while ``svc-ai`` roles only run at the following step. A check placed here would sit behind the deployment it exists to prevent."
msgstr "Kwa sababu ruzuku hiyo haiwezi kurudiwa mara tu chombo kinaanza, hundi zinaendesha ndani ya jukumu la wakala kabla ya kupeleka, sio baadaye katika jukumu hili: wakala ni huduma ya pamoja, kwa hivyo mzigo wa huduma huleta katika hatua ya ujenzi wakati ``svc-ai`` Kazi tu inachukua hatua inayofuata. Ukaguzi uliowekwa hapa utakaa nyuma ya kupelekwa kwake ili kuzuia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Because that grant is irreversible once the container starts, the checks run inside the agent role before it deploys, not afterwards in this role: the agent is a shared service, so the service loader brings it up in the constructor stage while `svc-ai` roles only run at the following step. A check placed here would sit behind the deployment it exists to prevent."
msgstr "Kwa sababu ruzuku hiyo haiwezi kurudiwa mara tu chombo kinaanza, hundi zinaendesha ndani ya jukumu la wakala kabla ya kupeleka, sio baadaye katika jukumu hili: wakala ni huduma ya pamoja, kwa hivyo mzigo wa huduma huleta katika hatua ya ujenzi wakati `svc-ai` Kazi tu inachukua hatua inayofuata. Ukaguzi uliowekwa hapa utakaa nyuma ya kupelekwa kwake ili kuzuia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Because the lookup emits ``$(...)`` shell syntax, callers MUST use the ``ansible.builtin.shell`` module (not ``command``) for the surrounding ``container exec`` invocation. A companion lint rule enforces this."
msgstr "Kwa sababu ya kuangalia ``$(...)`` syntax ya shell, callers lazima kutumia ``ansible.builtin.shell`` Moduli ya moduli (Sio ya ``command``) Kwa upande wa ``container exec`` ya maombi. Sheria ya vyama vya ushirika inasimamia hili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Because the pins use the same `(repository, ref)` shape as every other `meta/services.yml`, the existing `update-repository-refs` CI job discovers them on its own: it resolves the newest semver tag of each repository via `git ls-remote --tags` and opens a pull request with the bump. Upgrading a linter is therefore a reviewed commit, not a surprise."
msgstr "Kwa sababu watu hutumia njia sawa `(repository, ref)` Kuwa kama kila mtu mwingine `meta/services.yml`, Kwa kuwa sasa `update-repository-refs` Kazi ya CI inawapata peke yake: inatatua tag mpya ya semver ya kila hazina kupitia `git ls-remote --tags` Na kisha kuomba kwa ajili ya bure. Kuinua linter kwa hiyo ni ahadi iliyopitiwa, sio mshangao."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Because the pins use the same ``(repository, ref)`` shape as every other ``meta/services.yml``, the existing ``update-repository-refs`` CI job discovers them on its own: it resolves the newest semver tag of each repository via ``git ls-remote --tags`` and opens a pull request with the bump. Upgrading a linter is therefore a reviewed commit, not a surprise."
msgstr "Kwa sababu watu hutumia njia sawa ``(repository, ref)`` Kuwa kama kila mtu mwingine ``meta/services.yml``, Kwa kuwa sasa ``update-repository-refs`` Kazi ya CI inawapata peke yake: inatatua tag mpya ya semver ya kila hazina kupitia ``git ls-remote --tags`` Na kisha kuomba kwa ajili ya bure. Kuinua linter kwa hiyo ni ahadi iliyopitiwa, sio mshangao."

