# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "Before every redeploy you MUST fully resolve the failure and reach at least **95% confidence that your fix actually fixes it**. That confidence MUST come from in-container inspection (`make compose-exec` / `make compose-inner-run`): reproduce the failure, walk the fix path, and confirm the corrected behaviour. Never redeploy on a guess."
msgstr "Kabla ya kila reeploy lazima kikamilifu kutatua kushindwa na kufikia angalau **95Asilimia ya uaminifu kwamba fix yako kweli kurekebisha ni**Imani hii inapaswa kuja kutoka kwa ukaguzi wa ndani (`make compose-exec` Kwa hivyo `make compose-inner-run`): kuzaliana kushindwa, kutembea njia ya kurekebisha, na kuthibitisha tabia iliyorekebishwa. Kamwe usirudi nyuma kwa kufikiri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "Before every redeploy you MUST fully resolve the failure in swarm and reach at least **95% confidence that your fix actually fixes it**. That confidence MUST come from inspecting the live cluster in-container: reproduce the failure, walk the fix path, and confirm the corrected behaviour on the running services. Never redeploy on a guess — a swarm redeploy costs tens of minutes."
msgstr "Kabla ya kila reeploy lazima kikamilifu kutatua kushindwa katika kundi na kufikia angalau **95Asilimia ya uaminifu kwamba fix yako kweli kurekebisha ni**Imani hiyo LAZIMA ije kutoka kwa kukagua nguzo ya kuishi: kuzaliana kushindwa, kutembea njia ya kurekebisha, na kuthibitisha tabia iliyorekebishwa kwenye huduma za uendeshaji. Kamwe usirudi nyuma kwenye nadhani - redeploy ya wingi inagharimu makumi ya dakika."

