# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Best-effort: the puppeteer browser is not downloaded here (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) so ``install-lint`` stays sandbox-safe. mmdc only needs a browser to RENDER, which ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` provisions on demand (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) right before it renders. That browser ships as a zip, so ``unzip`` is ensured here (puppeteer's extractor needs it, else it leaves an empty version dir and mmdc reports the browser missing). A failed install warns instead of aborting ``install-lint``, so sandboxes without npm/browser access still get the rest of the lint toolchain."
msgstr "Njia bora zaidi: Kivinjari cha puppeteer hakipakuliwa hapa (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) Hivyo basi kwa ``install-lint`` Hifadhi ya sandbox. mmdc inahitaji tu kivinjari kwa RENDER, ambayo ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` Mahitaji ya juu (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) kabla ya kufanya malipo. Ndege kama hiyo aina ya zip. ``unzip`` kuhakikisha kuwa hapa (Extractor ya puppeteer inahitaji, vinginevyo inaacha toleo tupu dir na mmdc ripoti browser missing)· Kushindwa kutoa mimba badala ya kutoa mimba ``install-lint``, hivyo sandboxes bila npm / browser upatikanaji bado kupata mapumziko ya toolchain lint."

