# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both flavors cap the state and the option count and answer HTTP 422 above them, so the gateway truncates the prompt to ``services.litellm.router.state_chars`` before asking. The ``laya`` flavor shares a fixed token budget across the options of one question, so accuracy falls off well before its own cap; the deployments here put a handful of model aliases to it, far below where that matters."
msgstr "Wote hupunguza hali na kuhesabu chaguo na kujibu HTTP 422 Wao ni juu ya njia ya utumbo, ``services.litellm.router.state_chars`` kabla ya kuuliza. Kwa kuwa ``laya`` ladha inashiriki bajeti fasta ishara katika chaguzi za swali moja, hivyo usahihi huanguka mbali vizuri kabla ya cap yake mwenyewe; kupelekwa hapa kuweka wachache wa mfano aliases yake, mbali chini ambapo mambo hayo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both flavors cap the state and the option count and answer HTTP 422 above them, so the gateway truncates the prompt to `services.litellm.router.state_chars` before asking. The `laya` flavor shares a fixed token budget across the options of one question, so accuracy falls off well before its own cap; the deployments here put a handful of model aliases to it, far below where that matters."
msgstr "Wote hupunguza hali na kuhesabu chaguo na kujibu HTTP 422 Wao ni juu ya njia ya utumbo, `services.litellm.router.state_chars` kabla ya kuuliza. Kwa kuwa `laya` ladha inashiriki bajeti fasta ishara katika chaguzi za swali moja, hivyo usahihi huanguka mbali vizuri kabla ya cap yake mwenyewe; kupelekwa hapa kuweka wachache wa mfano aliases yake, mbali chini ambapo mambo hayo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both halves are required: ``tor.enabled`` is the dependency edge, not the port forward, so a client picking the Tor transport from that flag alone dials a port with no HiddenServicePort and no host publish."
msgstr "Sehemu zote mbili zinahitajika: ``tor.enabled`` Ni makali ya utegemezi, si bandari mbele, hivyo mteja kuokota Tor usafiri kutoka bendera hiyo peke yake anapiga bandari na hakuna Huduma ya Siri na hakuna mwenyeji kuchapisha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both helpers degrade gracefully:"
msgstr "Wote wawili wanajisikia vibaya:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both journeys are covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, which targets the ``openid-connect/auth`` href explicitly, opens ``/admin``, and signs out at ``/admin/ui/logout``; a second scenario drives the biber-to-administrator mail round-trip across two browser contexts. The path back to the generic personas is a distinguishable login control on Mailu’s SSO page."
msgstr "Pande zote mbili zinakabiliwa na vikwazo katika ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, ambayo malengo yake ni ``openid-connect/auth`` Kwa maneno mengine, kufungua ``/admin``, na kutoa ushahidi wa ``/admin/ui/logout``; hali ya pili inatoa barua ya mzunguko wa barua ya biber-to-administrator katika mazingira mawili ya kivinjari. Njia ya kurudi kwa personas ya kawaida ni udhibiti wa kuingia wa kutofautisha MailuUkurasa wa SSO."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both journeys are covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``: the master-realm super administrator drives the admin console, and the normal-realm administrator and biber each drive the realm account console including sign-out. The path back to the generic personas is an app-shaped surface behind the shared auth chain, which the identity provider by definition does not have."
msgstr "Pande zote mbili zinakabiliwa na vikwazo katika ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``: msimamizi mkuu wa master-realm anatoa console admin, na msimamizi wa kawaida-realm na biber kila gari console ya akaunti ya eneo ikiwa ni pamoja na kuingia. Njia ya kurudi kwa personas ya kawaida ni uso wa umbo la programu nyuma ya mnyororo wa auth iliyoshirikiwa, ambayo mtoa huduma wa utambulisho kwa ufafanuzi hana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both journeys are covered bespoke in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which targets the `openid-connect/auth` href explicitly, opens `/admin`, and signs out at `/admin/ui/logout`; a second scenario drives the biber-to-administrator mail round-trip across two browser contexts. The path back to the generic personas is a distinguishable login control on Mailu's SSO page."
msgstr "Pande zote mbili zinakabiliwa na vikwazo katika `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, ambayo malengo yake ni `openid-connect/auth` Kwa maneno mengine, kufungua `/admin`, na kutoa ushahidi wa `/admin/ui/logout`; hali ya pili inatoa barua ya mzunguko wa barua ya biber-to-administrator katika mazingira mawili ya kivinjari. Njia ya kurudi kwa personas ya kawaida ni udhibiti wa kuingia wa kutofautisha MailuUkurasa wa SSO."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both journeys are covered bespoke in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`: the master-realm super administrator drives the admin console, and the normal-realm administrator and biber each drive the realm account console including sign-out. The path back to the generic personas is an app-shaped surface behind the shared auth chain, which the identity provider by definition does not have."
msgstr "Pande zote mbili zinakabiliwa na vikwazo katika `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`: msimamizi mkuu wa master-realm anatoa console admin, na msimamizi wa kawaida-realm na biber kila gari console ya akaunti ya eneo ikiwa ni pamoja na kuingia. Njia ya kurudi kwa personas ya kawaida ni uso wa umbo la programu nyuma ya mnyororo wa auth iliyoshirikiwa, ambayo mtoa huduma wa utambulisho kwa ufafanuzi hana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both layers are process-wide in-process caches. They intentionally do NOT track on-disk file mtimes; CLI tools are short-lived and the assumption \"the on-disk file does not change while my process runs\" holds. The single exception is `utils.cache.yaml.dump_yaml`, which writes through and evicts the cached entry for the path it just wrote so a tool that edits a file mid-run sees the new content on the next read."
msgstr "Sehemu zote mbili ni michakato ya ndani ya mchakato. Wao kwa makusudi hawafuati mti wa faili; zana za CLI ni za muda mfupi na dhana. \"Faili ya diski haibadilika wakati mchakato wangu unaendelea\" kuwa. pekee yake ni kuwa `utils.cache.yaml.dump_yaml`, ambayo anaandika kupitia na entrys kuingia kwa cached kwa njia yeye tu aliandika hivyo chombo kwamba hariri faili katikati ya kukimbia anaona maudhui mapya juu ya kusoma ijayo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both need the same facts about a role: whether it ships its own container stack, and which deploy modes it supports. Keeping the logic here means the two callers never drift."
msgstr "Wote wanahitaji ukweli sawa kuhusu jukumu: ikiwa meli stack yake ya chombo, na ambayo inapeleka modes inasaidia. Kuweka mantiki hapa ina maana kwamba wote wawili wito kamwe drift."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both on the position"
msgstr "Wote wawili katika nafasi"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both paths elevate privileges via `sudo` when not run as root, and the script verifies `bwrap` and `socat` on `PATH` before it exits. macOS uses `sandbox-exec` from the base system and does not need this target."
msgstr "Njia zote mbili zinaongeza upendeleo kupitia `sudo` Kama huna cha kuandika basi kachukue kopo ukachambe. `bwrap` Aidha, na `socat` Juu ya `PATH` kabla ya kuondoka. Matumizi ya MacOS `sandbox-exec` Mfumo wa msingi na hauhitajiki."

