# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both sides pass `primary_apps` (not the round closure) as the BFS seed and the variant-merged services map for that round, so the reachability walk sees the same topology the inventory baked."
msgstr "Pande zote mbili zinapita `primary_apps` (Sio ya kufungwa kwa mzunguko) Kama mbegu ya BFS na ramani ya huduma za aina tofauti kwa pande zote, hivyo kutembea kwa ufanisi unaona topolojia sawa ya hesabu iliyooka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both sources carry the same pinned collections, so the only thing separating them is how long they take and whether they answer at all. A single slow day says nothing: galaxy.ansible.com degrades and recovers, and a git clone can stall on one runner. The default is therefore retuned only when a rolling window of daily samples shows one source durably behind the other."
msgstr "Vyanzo vyote viwili hubeba makusanyo sawa, kwa hivyo kitu pekee kinachotenganisha ni muda gani huchukua na ikiwa hujibu kabisa. Siku moja ya mapumziko ya siku ya mapumziko haina maana: galaxy.ansible.com Degrades na kupona, na clone ya git inaweza kusimama kwenye mchezaji mmoja. default ni hivyo retuned tu wakati dirisha rolling ya sampuli za kila siku inaonyesha chanzo kimoja kwa muda mrefu nyuma ya nyingine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "Both targets (Debian changelog and the RPM ``%changelog`` section) are fully regenerated on every run from the kept entries plus an archived-releases notice that points at the documentation site and lists the archived versions and dates as plain text. The notice is folded into the body of the oldest kept entry (not appended after the last entry), because free text after the final entry is not valid changelog data and makes the native parsers warn. Because the package files are regenerated, they cannot drift from the CHANGELOG.md SPOT."
msgstr "Malengo yote mawili (Mabadiliko ya Debian na RPM ``%changelog`` Sehemu ya) ni kikamilifu upya juu ya kila kukimbia kutoka entries naendelea pamoja na taarifa archived-releases kwamba pointi katika tovuti nyaraka na orodha ya matoleo archived na tarehe kama maandishi wazi. Taarifa hiyo imejumuishwa katika mwili wa kuingia kwa zamani zaidi (Haikubaliki baada ya kuingia kwa mwisho)Kwa sababu maandishi ya bure baada ya kuingia kwa mwisho sio data halali ya mabadiliko na hufanya parsers ya asili kuonya. Kwa sababu faili za mfuko zinazalishwa tena, haziwezi kuondokana na CHANGELOG.md ya Spoti."

