# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cap torch's intra-op threads on the CPU path. `meta/services.yml` limits the container to `cpus: \"2.0\"`, but torch sizes its thread pool from the host's core count, so a 16-core runner spawns 16 threads for 2 cores. laya reads `LAYA_THREADS` (`serve.py`, `_apply_thread_limit`) and upstream says to keep it at or below the physical core count; `templates/env.j2` does not set it. Costs latency, breaks nothing, so no test catches it."
msgstr "Cap torch's intra-op threads kwenye njia ya CPU. `meta/services.yml` kupunguza msongamano wa magari kwa `cpus: \"2.0\"`, Na kwa upande wake Mbunge wa Jimbo la Ludewa Mhe. 16Wachezaji wa Runner Up 16 Mavazi kwa ajili ya 2 ya msingi. Ladha ya kusoma `LAYA_THREADS` (`serve.py`, Kwa hivyo, `_apply_thread_limit`) Kwa upande mwingine, ni lazima iwe chini au chini ya kiwango cha msingi. `templates/env.j2` Haikuwekwa hivyo. Gharama latency, mapumziko kitu, hivyo hakuna mtihani upatikanaji wake."

