msgstr "Watumiaji hawawezi kusoma orodha ya seva moja kwa moja. [`lookup('mcp_servers')`](../../../../../plugins/lookup/mcp_servers.py) Inaunganisha makutano ya wateja waliokubaliwa na mtoa huduma, kutatuliwa kwa `derive_allowed_consumers` Ndani ya [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py), Pamoja na wito wa wateja `supported_transports` Aidha, na `supported_auths`, kutatua kila mtoa huduma alitangaza uaminifu, na anarudi:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a Gitea personal access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is issued against the administrator account and kept in `sys-token-store`. Its `auth_subject` is `administrator`, so MCP calls run with administrator rights rather than as the requesting user."
msgstr "Wateja wanapokea A Gitea binafsi kama ilivyo ada ya `Authorization: Bearer <token>`- Taarifa hiyo imetolewa dhidi ya akaunti ya msimamizi na kuwekwa katika `sys-token-store`. yake `auth_subject` Ilikuwa ni `administrator`, Kwa hiyo, MCP inaita na haki za msimamizi badala ya kama mtumiaji anayeomba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a Gitea personal access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is issued against the administrator account and kept in ``sys-token-store``. Its ``auth_subject`` is ``administrator``, so MCP calls run with administrator rights rather than as the requesting user."
msgstr "Wateja wanapokea A Gitea binafsi kama ilivyo ada ya ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``- Taarifa hiyo imetolewa dhidi ya akaunti ya msimamizi na kuwekwa katika ``sys-token-store``. yake ``auth_subject`` Ilikuwa ni ``administrator``, Kwa hiyo, MCP inaita na haki za msimamizi badala ya kama mtumiaji anayeomba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in `sys-token-store` under the `administrator` user, not in the role's `credentials:` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Wateja wanawasilisha ishara ya upatikanaji wa muda mrefu kama `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . `sys-token-store` Chini ya `administrator` Mheshimiwa Mwenyekiti, si katika nafasi ya `credentials:` kuzuia. Maombi yasiyo ya lazima yanajibiwa kwa 404: Msaidizi wa nyumbani haonyeshi mwisho wa mwisho."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in ``sys-token-store`` under the ``administrator`` user, not in the role’s ``credentials:`` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Wateja wanawasilisha ishara ya upatikanaji wa muda mrefu kama ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . ``sys-token-store`` Chini ya ``administrator`` Mheshimiwa Mwenyekiti, si katika nafasi ya ``credentials:`` kuzuia. Maombi yasiyo ya lazima yanajibiwa kwa 404: Msaidizi wa nyumbani haonyeshi mwisho wa mwisho."

