# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Consumers that must name a model (`web-app-moodle`, `web-app-matrix`) read `LITELLM_CHAT_MODEL`, which picks the first non-embedding preload model of `svc-ai-ollama` and mirrors the branch order of the gateway's own `config.yaml.j2`. The consumer resolves that branch from `lookup('deployment').inventory`, every group the round's inventory populates, read from the play-wide `groups` magic var. `.running` is wrong here: a targeted `apps=` round sets it to the whitelist, and `svc-ai-ollama` is pulled in as a dependency rather than named on the command line, so both backend branches fall through to the `openrouter/auto` vendor default. The gateway then answers `Invalid model name passed in model=openrouter/auto` with HTTP 400 and no consumer can complete a prompt. `.groups` is wrong for the mirror-image reason: it carries `group_names`, which is host-scoped, so on a multi-host round a worker that hosts neither the gateway nor a backend resolves an empty model while the manager resolves the right one."
msgstr "Watumiaji ambao wanapaswa kutaja mfano (`web-app-moodle`, Kwa hivyo, `web-app-matrix`) Kusoma kusoma `LITELLM_CHAT_MODEL`, ambayo inachukua mfano wa kwanza wa preload `svc-ai-ollama` na kuona amri ya tawi ya mlango mwenyewe `config.yaml.j2`· Serikali inatekeleza ahadi hiyo kutoka kwa `lookup('deployment').inventory`, kila kikundi cha hesabu ya mzunguko populates, kusoma kutoka kwa kucheza `groups` Mchawi wa ajira tunaye wenyewe `.running` Kuna makosa hapa: malengo `apps=` Na kwa upande wake, Bi. `svc-ai-ollama` Inachukuliwa kama utegemezi badala ya jina la mstari wa amri, hivyo matawi yote ya nyuma yanaanguka kwa njia ya `openrouter/auto` Bidhaa ya default. Mlango wa nyuma wa majibu `Invalid model name passed in model=openrouter/auto` Kuwa na HTTP 400 Hakuna mtu anayeweza kufanya haraka. `.groups` Ni makosa kwa sababu ya picha ya kioo: hubeba `group_names`, ambayo ni mwenyeji-scoped, hivyo juu ya pande mbalimbali mwenyeji mfanyakazi kwamba majeshi wala lango wala backend kutatua mfano tupu wakati meneja anatatua moja ya haki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Consumers that take an explicit domain or read one from the environment fall back here rather than repeating the literal, so changing the CI/dev default is a one-line edit in ``default.env`` instead of a hunt through the tree."
msgstr "Watumiaji ambao huchukua kikoa wazi au kusoma moja kutoka kwa mazingira huanguka hapa badala ya kurudia halisi, kwa hivyo kubadilisha default ya CI /dev ni hariri ya mstari mmoja. ``default.env`` badala ya kwenda kwenye mti."

