# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Designed for Arch Linux systems, this role leverages the ``pacman`` module to install Git. It uses a fact (``run_once_dev_git``) to control task execution, ensuring that the Git installation is performed only once per run."
msgstr "Iliyoundwa kwa mifumo ya Arch Linux, jukumu hili linaongeza ``pacman`` Module kwa ajili ya ufungaji GitHutumia ukweli (``run_once_dev_git``) kuhakikisha utekelezaji wa majukumu yake, kuhakikisha kuwa Git Ufungaji unafanywa mara moja tu kwa kukimbia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Designed for Arch Linux systems, this role leverages the `pacman` module to install Git. It uses a fact (`run_once_dev_git`) to control task execution, ensuring that the Git installation is performed only once per run."
msgstr "Iliyoundwa kwa mifumo ya Arch Linux, jukumu hili linaongeza `pacman` Module kwa ajili ya ufungaji GitHutumia ukweli (`run_once_dev_git`) kuhakikisha utekelezaji wa majukumu yake, kuhakikisha kuwa Git Ufungaji unafanywa mara moja tu kwa kukimbia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Designed for Archlinux systems, this role handles issuing certificates per domain and optionally cleans up redundant certificates if wildcard certificates are used. It intelligently decides whether to issue a standard or wildcard certificate based on the domain structure and your configuration."
msgstr "Iliyoundwa kwa mifumo ya Archlinux, jukumu hili linashughulikia kutoa vyeti kwa kila uwanja na kwa hiari husafisha vyeti visivyo ikiwa vyeti vya wildcard hutumiwa. Inaamua kwa busara ikiwa kutoa cheti cha kawaida au cha wildcard kulingana na muundo wa kikoa na usanidi wako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Designed for Archlinux systems, this role periodically checks whether web resources (JavaScript, fonts, images, etc.) are blocked by CSP headers. It integrates Python and Node.js tooling and installs a systemd service with timer support."
msgstr "Iliyoundwa kwa mifumo ya Archlinux, jukumu hili linaangalia mara kwa mara ikiwa rasilimali za wavuti (JavaScript, fonts, picha, nk.) Wanaongozwa na viongozi wa CSP. Inaunganisha Python na Node.js Kuandaa na kufunga huduma ya mfumo kwa msaada wa wakati."

