# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Document extraction (``svc-ai-tika``), web search (``svc-ai-searxng``) and the code interpreter (``svc-ai-jupyter``) are wired but off by default. Deploying those roles is not enough: each is a ``services.<name>`` flag on this role, and only that flag both attaches Open WebUI to the provider’s network and renders the matching environment block. Turning all three on adds 3.5 GB of memory limit to the closure that every role reaches through Open WebUI, which is more than the variant budget in ``tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_resource_budget.py`` has left, so the choice stays with the operator:"
msgstr "Nyaraka za uchimbaji (``svc-ai-tika``), Kutafuta mtandao (``svc-ai-searxng``) Mtafsiri wa Kanuni (``svc-ai-jupyter``) Wao ni kuondolewa lakini kwa default. Kutumikia majukumu haya si ya kutosha: kila mmoja ni ``services.<name>`` Bendera ya nchi hii, na bendera zote mbili Open WebUI Kwa mtandao wa mtoa huduma na hufanya kizuizi cha mazingira kinacholingana. Tatu juu ya kuongeza 3.5 GB ya kikomo cha kumbukumbu kwa kufungwa ambayo kila jukumu linafikia Open WebUIambayo ni zaidi ya bajeti katika ``tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_resource_budget.py`` Kwa upande mwingine, chaguo ni pamoja na operator:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Document extraction (`svc-ai-tika`), web search (`svc-ai-searxng`) and the code interpreter (`svc-ai-jupyter`) are wired but off by default. Deploying those roles is not enough: each is a `services.<name>` flag on this role, and only that flag both attaches Open WebUI to the provider's network and renders the matching environment block. Turning all three on adds 3.5 GB of memory limit to the closure that every role reaches through Open WebUI, which is more than the variant budget in `tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_resource_budget.py` has left, so the choice stays with the operator:"
msgstr "Nyaraka za uchimbaji (`svc-ai-tika`), Kutafuta mtandao (`svc-ai-searxng`) Mtafsiri wa Kanuni (`svc-ai-jupyter`) Wao ni kuondolewa lakini kwa default. Kutumikia majukumu haya si ya kutosha: kila mmoja ni `services.<name>` Bendera ya nchi hii, na bendera zote mbili Open WebUI Kwa mtandao wa mtoa huduma na hufanya kizuizi cha mazingira kinacholingana. Tatu juu ya kuongeza 3.5 GB ya kikomo cha kumbukumbu kwa kufungwa ambayo kila jukumu linafikia Open WebUIambayo ni zaidi ya bajeti katika `tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_resource_budget.py` Kwa upande mwingine, chaguo ni pamoja na operator:"

