# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Drive that whole sequence on compose, then re-run it on swarm before claiming any criterion done. Use `lookup('container_address', ...)` from the first init task rather than retro-fitting it — a compose-only `container exec <name>` works locally and then fails on every swarm task, which is the expensive way to discover Decision #11."
msgstr "Weka utaratibu wote juu ya kutunga, kisha uirudishe kwenye rundo kabla ya kudai kipimo chochote. Matumizi ya matumizi `lookup('container_address', ...)` Kwanza kabisa, badala ya kufanya kazi kwa bidii. `container exec <name>` Kazi ndani ya nchi na kisha inashindwa kwenye kila kazi ya nzige, ambayo ni njia ya gharama kubwa ya kugundua Uamuzi #11..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Drives `baudolo-snapshot`, the launcher that decides per run whether baudolo may capture the volumes from a filesystem snapshot instead of copying the live tree. That decision reads mountinfo, inode numbers and `btrfs subvolume list`, so it cannot be answered by a unit test — it needs a filesystem that really exists."
msgstr "Kuendesha gari `baudolo-snapshot`, launcher kwamba anaamua kwa kukimbia kama baudolo inaweza kukamata kiasi kutoka kwa snapshot filesystem badala ya kuiga mti kuishi. Uamuzi huo unaeleza kuwa, idadi ya wajumbe na `btrfs subvolume list`, Kwa hivyo haiwezi kujibiwa na mtihani wa kitengo - inahitaji mfumo wa faili ambao upo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
