msgid "Dropped the ci compose profile and its --profile ci arg, the run-once guard on web-opt-rdr-domains, the slim pkgmgr base image variant, requirement-file references from runtime code, and the inline XML payload duplication in web-app-xwiki"
msgstr "Iliondoa wasifu wa kuandika wa ci na yake -profile ci arg, walinzi wa mara moja web-opt-rdr-domains, tofauti ndogo ya picha ya pkgmgr, marejeleo ya faili ya mahitaji kutoka kwa msimbo wa runtime, na inline XML payload duplication katika web-app-xwiki"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Dropping the axes does not mean forgiving them. A row is proven only when *every* job it had was green: one red or aborted combination un-proves it, however many green siblings it has. Only a priority row can have several, since it deploys its whole cross-product at once while a regular row gets one combination per sweep -- and letting a green compose job carry a red swarm one would walk the regular line past a combination nobody fixed."
msgstr "Bila toba hakutakuwa na msamaha. Ni ushahidi tu kwamba wakati *Kila mmoja kila mmoja* Kazi ilikuwa ya kijani: mchanganyiko mmoja wa rangi nyekundu au isiyotolewa haifai, hata hivyo ndugu wengi wa kijani wana. Mstari wa kipaumbele tu unaweza kuwa na kadhaa, kwa kuwa inachukua bidhaa yake yote ya msalaba mara moja wakati mstari wa kawaida unapata mchanganyiko mmoja kwa sweep - na kuruhusu kazi ya kuandika kijani kubeba kundi la rangi moja ingetembea mstari wa kawaida nyuma ya mchanganyiko hakuna mtu aliyeweka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Drops or truncates the backing database."
msgstr "Inaondoa au kufuta database ya msaada."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Drops the per-entity default Docker network when `compose.sh` left it behind with the wrong / empty `com.docker.compose.network` label (typical between matrix-deploy rounds). Skips removal when the network still has active container endpoints, so shared-service networks (svc-db-mariadb, svc-db-postgres, …) stay in place while their provider container is up. The global `docker network prune -f` sweep that catches orphans whose names do NOT match the entity is run once by the orchestrator [apps.sh](../apps.sh) after the entity loop. Idempotent."
msgstr "Inaondoa mtandao wa default wa Docker wakati `compose.sh` Kuiacha nyuma na makosa / tupu `com.docker.compose.network` Lebo ya studio (Tofauti kati ya mzunguko wa kazi ya matrix). Ruka kuondolewa wakati mtandao bado una vituo vya vyombo vya kazi, mitandao ya huduma ya pamoja (svc-db-mariadbKwa hivyo, svc-db-postgres...) Kukaa katika nafasi wakati mtoa huduma wako ni juu. Kimataifa ya `docker network prune -f` sweep kwamba upatikanaji wa watoto yatima ambao majina yao hayalingani na chombo ni kukimbia mara moja na orchestrator [apps.sh](../apps.sh) Baada ya zoezi la usajili. uwajibikaji."

