# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each Raspberry Pi joins the swarm as an agent node labelled `kata-capable` with the isolating runtime as its daemon-wide default (Decision #3, applied per node). Flowise and the gateway run on a manager node. Swarm distributes agent replicas across the Pis; adding a Pi adds agent capacity with no code change. The Pis do **not** run large models locally: agents speak only the gateway `/v1`, which routes light work to a small local `svc-ai-ollama` and heavy work to a GPU or external backend. All node-run images MUST be `arm64`."
msgstr "Kila Raspberry Pi inajiunga na kundi kama wakala node lebo `kata-capable` Kwa mfano, wakati wa kupanda mbegu, wakati wa kupanda. (Uamuzi wa #3, Matumizi ya node).Kutembea na lango linaendesha kwenye node ya meneja. Swarm kusambaza wakala replicas katika Pis; kuongeza Pi anaongeza wakala uwezo na hakuna mabadiliko code. Miguu ya kufanya **Sio ya** Tumia mifano mikubwa ndani ya nchi: mawakala huzungumza tu lango `/v1`, Njia ambayo mwanga hufanya kazi kwa eneo ndogo `svc-ai-ollama` Kazi ngumu kwa GPU au nyuma ya nje. Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi zinapaswa kuwa `arm64`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each Recoverer parses and validates its own colon-encoded ``source`` and builds the role's ``files/python/recover.py`` invocation. Colon segments are classified by shape: an ABSOLUTE path is the restore destination (replacing a --target flag); for device a RELATIVE segment is the on-device snapshot subpath and an all-digit ``YYYYMMDDHHMMSS`` segment is the generation to restore. No colon means the derived standard-layout target and the newest generation. The uniform console command ``<type> <source> <target>`` dispatches to one Recoverer via :data:`RECOVERERS`."
msgstr "Kila mkusanyaji hupima na kuthibitisha koloni yake mwenyewe ``source`` na kutengeneza nafasi ya ``files/python/recover.py`` ya maombi. Sehemu za Colon zimeainishwa kwa sura: njia ya ABSOLUTE ni marudio ya kurejesha (Bendera ya Volta ya Juu); Kwa upande mwingine, mmea ni mmea wa mapambo na mapambo. ``YYYYMMDDHHMMSS`` Sehemu ni kizazi cha kurejesha. Hakuna koloni inamaanisha lengo la kawaida la kuweka na kizazi kipya. Amri ya console ``<type> <source> <target>`` Kutoa huduma kwa mteja mmoja kupitia :data:`RECOVERERS`..."

