# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Each `test()` runs in its own isolated browser context. Specs MUST NOT share session state between tests. Running biber and administrator as two separate `test()` blocks already gives that isolation by default. When a single scenario needs more than one identity at once (peer-to-peer messaging, RBAC promotion observed by the admin, …), it MUST open a fresh `browser.newContext({ ignoreHTTPSErrors: true })` per identity and close them in `finally`."
msgstr "Kila mmoja kila mmoja `test()` Inaendeshwa katika mazingira yake ya kipekee ya browser. Specs haipaswi kushiriki hali ya kikao kati ya majaribio. Kuendesha biber na mtawala kama mbili tofauti `test()` Kwa upande mwingine, vifungo tayari vinatoa kutengwa kwa default. Kama mtu anahitaji kitu zaidi ya kimoja kwa wakati mmoja (Ujumbe wa rika-kwa-peer, kukuza RBAC iliyozingatiwa na admin, ...)Unahitaji kufungua mpya `browser.newContext({ ignoreHTTPSErrors: true })` kwa ajili ya kuwatambulisha na kuwafikisha katika `finally`..."

