msgid "Each invocation carries a unique risk profile depending on flags. `docker run` can mount host paths (`-v /:/host`), expose privileged capabilities (`--privileged`, `--cap-add`), bypass the sandbox via the Docker daemon's root privileges, and pull arbitrary images from any reachable registry. Middle-wildcard false positives (e.g. a container name containing \" run\") land here as harmless extra prompts, an acceptable trade-off against per-synonym enumeration."
msgstr "Kila ombi hubeba profile ya hatari ya kipekee kulingana na bendera. `docker run` Unaweza kuweka njia ya mwenyeji (`-v /:/host`), kuonyesha uwezo wa kipekee (`--privileged`, Kwa hivyo, `--cap-add`), kupita sanduku la mchanga kupitia upendeleo wa mizizi ya Docker daemon, na kuvuta picha za kiholela kutoka kwa Usajili wowote unaoweza kupatikana. Kati-wildcard uongo chanya (C. Jina la chombo kilicho na \" Kuendesha\") ardhi hapa kama harmless extra prompts, kukubalika biashara-off dhidi per-synonym enumeration."

