# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each role group must contain the default host."
msgstr "Kila kundi la jukumu lazima liwe na mwenyeji wa default."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each role in that closure is then narrowed to the variants that actually reach a seed: variant `i` of a role is kept only when round `i`'s closure — walked on the same variant-merged services maps [the matrix planner](../../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/planner.py) builds its rounds from, and therefore variant-aware at every generation of the chain — contains one of the seeds. A role whose variants do not all qualify enters the whitelist as a `role#0,2` selection token, so an image bump in a provider no longer redeploys the variants that switch that provider off. This applies to every auto-derived whitelist — the weekly update PRs, Dependabot, and any other diff-driven run — because they all resolve through this one path."
msgstr "Kila jukumu katika kufungwa hiyo ni kisha nyembamba kwa variants kwamba kweli kufikia mbegu: lahaja `i` Ni muhimu tu wakati wa mzunguko `i`Kufungwa - kutembea kwenye ramani za huduma za aina hiyo [Mpango wa matrix](../../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/planner.py) Kwa hiyo, ni wajibu kwake kujenga juu ya msingi wa ujuzi wake wa kila kitu. Jukumu ambalo tofauti zake hazistahili kuingia kwenye orodha nyeupe kama `role#0,2` ishara ya uteuzi, hivyo bump picha katika mtoa huduma tena redeploys variants kwamba kubadili kwamba mtoa huduma mbali. Hii inatumika kwa kila orodha ya whitelist auto-kutokana - kila wiki update PRs, Dependabot, na nyingine yoyote inayoendeshwa kukimbia - kwa sababu wote kutatua njia hii moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each row is a migration target. The \"Bridges\" column is the cross-role dependency this requirement makes explicit. \"Today's location\" is where the declaration lives before migration."
msgstr "Kila mstari ni lengo la uhamiaji. Kwa kuwa \"Bridges\" Nguzo ni utegemezi wa msalaba-role mahitaji haya hufanya wazi. \"Eneo la leo\" Hii ndiyo hali halisi ya maisha kabla ya uhamiaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each row recomputes the role's embedded (forward) service deps from that variant's merged ``services`` map, so toggling a sidecar off in a variant drops it from the variant's ``embeds``/``weight``. The consumer (reverse) side is the variant-independent role-level graph: who else in the catalog embeds this role does not change with the role's own variant selection."
msgstr "Kila mstari unakamilisha jukumu la (Kuendeleza mbele) Huduma ya Deps kutoka kwa lahaja hiyo iliunganishwa ``services`` ramani, hivyo kwaggling sidecar mbali katika lahaja matone ni kutoka lahaja ya ``embeds``Kwa hivyo``weight``. Mtumiaji huyo (Kugeuka nyuma) upande ni lahaja-independent jukumu ngazi graph: ambaye mwingine katika catalog embeds jukumu hili haina mabadiliko na nafasi ya uteuzi wa lahaja mwenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each runner instance is provisioned as an ephemeral container using **DooD** (Docker-out-of-Docker — it mounts the host `docker.sock`). Isolation is keyed on the instance number, so parallel jobs never collide:"
msgstr "Kila kesi ya mkimbiaji hutolewa kama chombo cha ephemeral kutumia **Do ya** (Docker-off-ya-Docker - inaimarisha mwenyeji `docker.sock`). Isolation ni muhimu kwa idadi ya mfano, hivyo kazi sambamba kamwe kugongana:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each scenario MUST live in its own `test-*.js` module (e.g. `test-login-oidc.js`, `test-seaweedfs.js`). `playwright.spec.js` is the thin aggregator that `require()`s every scenario module, keeping each case atomic and individually inspectable. The runner globs every `*.js`, so no extra wiring is needed."
msgstr "Kila hali lazima iishi kwa yenyewe `test-*.js` Moduli ya moduli (ya g. `test-login-oidc.js`, Kwa hivyo, `test-seaweedfs.js`)... `playwright.spec.js` Je, huu ni msimu wa joto? `require()`Kila moduli ya hali, kuweka kila kesi ya atomiki na ya kibinafsi kukaguliwa. Mchezaji wa soka kila mmoja `*.js`, Kwa hiyo, hakuna ziada ya ziada inahitajika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Each script MUST be entered via `cli.administration.deploy.development exec --env KEY=VAL` (or an equivalent `docker exec -e …` invocation) so the host wrapper can inject the required environment. Each script MUST assert its required env-vars at the top with `: \"${VAR:?}\"` so missing context surfaces immediately. Each script MUST `cd \"${INFINITO_SRC_DIR}\"` before running anything so relative paths resolve against the bind-mounted repo. Each script SHOULD run `./scripts/docker/entry.sh true` for entry bootstrap before the deploy step."
msgstr "Kila barua lazima iwasilishwe kupitia `cli.administration.deploy.development exec --env KEY=VAL` (au kwa kiwango sawa. `docker exec -e …` Katika maombi) Kwa hiyo, mhifadhi anaweza kuingiza mazingira yanayotakiwa. Kila script lazima kudai env-vars yake required juu na `: \"${VAR:?}\"` Kwa hiyo, hali ya ukosefu wa mazingira inajitokeza mara moja. Kila script lazima kuwa `cd \"${INFINITO_SRC_DIR}\"` Kabla ya kupanda, mmea lazima uwe wa kutosha. Kila moja ya script lazima kukimbia `./scripts/docker/entry.sh true` Kuingia kwa bootstrap kabla ya hatua ya kupeleka."

