# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each service-account integration provisions a dedicated non-login identity holding only the upstream permissions the declared allowlist needs. The lookup resolves `mcp.credential.owner`, `source` and `key`; deployment fails when the resolved principal is missing, empty, more privileged than `auth_subject` declares, or shared with an unrelated provider."
msgstr "Kila ushirikiano wa akaunti ya huduma hutoa utambulisho wa kujitolea usio walogin wenye ruhusa tu ya upstream mahitaji yaliyotangazwa. Uamuzi wa kuangalia `mcp.credential.owner`, Kwa hivyo, `source` Aidha, na `key`; kupelekwa kushindwa wakati mkuu kutatuliwa ni kukosa, tupu, upendeleo zaidi kuliko `auth_subject` Inatangaza, au kushirikiana na mtoa huduma asiyehusiana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each settings change MUST be reviewed before it lands. Approval here is equivalent in blast radius to approving a `deny`-rule edit: the next tool call may run under new rules. Operators SHOULD diff the proposed change against the live file before approving and SHOULD decline any change that widens `allowWrite`, removes a `deny` entry, adds a broad `allow` wildcard, or registers a hook command."
msgstr "Mabadiliko yoyote ya ardhi yanapaswa kufanywa kabla ya ardhi. Njia hii ni sawa na radius ya mlipuko ili kuidhinisha `deny`hariri ya utawala: simu inayofuata ya chombo inaweza kukimbia chini ya sheria mpya. Wafanyakazi wanapaswa kusambaza mabadiliko yaliyopendekezwa dhidi ya faili ya kuishi kabla ya kuidhinisha na kupunguza mabadiliko yoyote ambayo huongeza `allowWrite`, Kuondoa A `deny` Kuingia, ongeza kwa upana `allow` Kujiandikisha au kujiandikisha kwa ajili ya bure."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each shim MUST resolve the repository root relative to its own location so it can run from any working directory, MUST forward arguments to the underlying CLI so `--dry-run` and similar flags keep working from the shell, and MUST exit non-zero on CLI failure so the workflow surfaces the error."
msgstr "Kila shim LAZIMA kutatua mizizi ya kuhifadhi jamaa na eneo lake mwenyewe ili iweze kukimbia kutoka kwa saraka yoyote ya kazi, LAZIMA kutoa hoja kwa CLI ya msingi. `--dry-run` Na bendera sawa zinaendelea kufanya kazi kutoka kwa shell, na LAZIMA kutoka bila sifuri kwenye kushindwa kwa CLI hivyo kazi ya kazi inakabiliwa na kosa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each stage entry below lists the criteria a role MUST satisfy to claim that stage. Promotion to the next stage is a deliberate human decision, not an automated transition. A role MAY only be tagged with a stage whose criteria are fully met; any drift MUST be corrected by either fixing the role or demoting the lifecycle key to the highest stage whose criteria still hold."
msgstr "Kila hatua ya kuingia hapa chini inaorodhesha vigezo ambavyo jukumu LAZIMA linatosheleza kudai hatua hiyo. Kuendeleza hatua inayofuata ni uamuzi wa kibinadamu wa makusudi, sio mpito wa automatiska. Jukumu inaweza tu kuwa tagged na hatua ambayo vigezo ni kikamilifu alikutana; drift yoyote lazima kurekebishwa kwa ama kurekebisha jukumu au demoting muhimu lifecycle kwa hatua ya juu ambao vigezo bado kushikilia."

