# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Elevate your collaboration with Nextcloud, a vibrant self-hosted cloud solution designed for dynamic file sharing, seamless communication, and effortless teamwork. Nextcloud offers a full suite of integrated tools (including LDAP and OIDC authentication, Redis caching, and automated plugin management via OCC) to empower a secure, extensible, and production-ready cloud environment."
msgstr "Kuongeza ushirikiano wako na Nextcloud, ufumbuzi wa wingu wa kujitegemea ulioundwa kwa kugawana faili ya nguvu, mawasiliano ya seamlessly, na kazi ya timu ya effortless. Nextcloud inatoa Suite kamili ya zana jumuishi (Uthibitishaji wa LDAP na OIDC Redis Usimamizi wa Plugin ya moja kwa moja kupitia OCC) kuwezesha mazingira salama, ya kusisimua, na ya uzalishaji-tayari."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Elevate your email marketing with Listmonk, a high-performance, self-hosted newsletter and mailing list manager featuring a modern, intuitive dashboard. Listmonk empowers you with advanced analytics, efficient subscriber segmentation, and streamlined campaign management, all configurable via a flexible TOML configuration file."
msgstr "Kuongeza masoko yako ya barua pepe na Listmonk, utendaji wa juu, jarida la kujitegemea na meneja wa orodha ya barua pepe akiwa na dashibodi ya kisasa, ya angavu. Listmonk inakuwezesha kwa uchambuzi wa juu, sehemu ya kujiandikisha kwa ufanisi, na usimamizi wa kampeni iliyoboreshwa, yote yanaweza kusanidi kupitia faili rahisi ya usanidi wa TOML."

