# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every `test()` body in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` MUST simulate the user flow the title promises and assert on a user-visible state. Stubs are forbidden:"
msgstr "Kila mmoja kila mmoja `test()` Ndani ya mwili `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` Lazima simulate mtumiaji mtiririko ahadi title na kudai juu ya hali user-visible. Kurasa zifuatazo zimeunganishwa na Jamii:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every `web-app-*` role MUST include a baseline scenario asserting that the canonical-domain front page emits a `Content-Security-Policy` response header. Roles whose surface is API-only or federation-only (no HTML output) MAY skip this and document the omission in the role's `README.md`."
msgstr "Kila mmoja kila mmoja `web-app-*` Jukumu LA LA LAZIMA ni pamoja na hali ya msingi inayodai kwamba ukurasa wa mbele wa uwanja wa canonical hutoa `Content-Security-Policy` Majibu ya kichwa. Sehemu ambayo uso wake ni APIMuungano au Muungano (Hakuna maudhui ya HTML) Unaweza kuruka hii na kuandika omission katika jukumu la `README.md`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every `web-app-*` role lands on the unified meta + dual-mode contract."
msgstr "Kila mmoja kila mmoja `web-app-*` Sehemu ya ardhi kwenye mkataba wa pamoja wa meta + dual-mode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every adapter enforces request size, response size, timeout, concurrency, pagination, result-row and stream-duration limits with explicit values in role metadata, and logs provider, consumer, tool name, credential subject, result status, duration and correlation identifier without logging credentials or payload bodies."
msgstr "Kila adapta inaimarisha ukubwa wa ombi, ukubwa wa majibu, muda, uwiano, pagination, kupungua kwa matokeo na mipaka ya kupungua kwa mkondo na maadili ya wazi katika metadata ya jukumu, na mtoa huduma wa magogo, mtumiaji, jina la chombo, somo la credential, hali ya matokeo, muda na kitambulisho cha uwiano bila hati za magogo au miili ya malipo."

