# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every agent MUST:"
msgstr "Kila mwanachama lazima:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every application role SHOULD follow the same shape: discovery on, the `OIDC.CLIENT.*` endpoints templated, the user identifier read from `OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME`, and the scopes limited to what the app actually consumes."
msgstr "Kila jukumu la maombi linapaswa kufuata sura sawa: ugunduzi, `OIDC.CLIENT.*` Mwisho wa templated, kitambulisho cha mtumiaji kusoma kutoka `OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME`, na upeo mdogo kwa kile ambacho programu hutumia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every application role corresponds to one Keycloak group whose path is hierarchical:"
msgstr "Kila sehemu ya maombi ni sawa na moja Keycloak Kundi ambalo njia yake ni ya kihierarkia:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every apt suite exists twice, once per upstream mirror. Nexus has no group repository type for `apt` (only maven, raw, docker, yum, npm, pypi, rubygems, go and friends), so the failover lives in the frontend: a request that the primary repo answers with `502`/`503`/`504` is re-run against the `-mirror` repo, which proxies a different host. `404` deliberately does not retry, because a missing file is missing on both mirrors and apt probes for missing files often. The frontend waits at most 8 s for a primary before it re-runs the request against the mirror; the `-mirror` locations keep the global 300 s."
msgstr "Kila safu ya apt iko mara mbili, mara moja kwa kioo cha juu. Nexus haina aina ya hifadhi ya kikundi `apt` (Maven tu, mbichi, docker, yum, npm, pypi, rubygems, kwenda na marafiki), hivyo kushindwa kuishi mbele: ombi kwamba msingi repo majibu na `502`Kwa hivyo`503`Kwa hivyo`504` Ni kinyume cha `-mirror` Repo, ambayo inatoa mwenyeji tofauti. `404` Kwa makusudi haijaribu tena, kwa sababu faili iliyopotea haipo kwenye vioo vyote na uchunguzi wa apt kwa faili zilizopotea mara nyingi. Upande wa mbele unaangalia zaidi 8 s kwa msingi kabla ya kurudia ombi dhidi ya kioo; `-mirror` Maeneo ya dunia yanaendelea 300 ya s."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every archive file is named `<padded-semver>-<release-date>.md`, where each numeric component of the semver is zero-padded to three digits and the date is the `YYYY-MM-DD` value parsed from the original entry's header. Padded names sort lexicographically in the same order as the underlying versions, so a directory listing is already in chronological order."
msgstr "Kila faili ya kumbukumbu ina jina lake. `<padded-semver>-<release-date>.md`, ambapo kila sehemu ya nambari ya semver ni sifuri-padded kwa tarakimu tatu na tarehe ni `YYYY-MM-DD` Thamani iliyotokana na kichwa cha kuingia awali. Majina yaliyochaguliwa yanaunda lexicographically kwa utaratibu sawa na matoleo ya msingi, hivyo orodha ya saraka tayari iko katika utaratibu wa nyakati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every axis is pinned, so the report is not about what was left open. It is about what each pin rests on: the measurement, the row's own failing combination, or the pool default. A pin from the pool default is a guess, and a green row under it answers a question nobody asked."
msgstr "Kila mhimili ni pinned, hivyo ripoti si kuhusu nini kushoto wazi. Ni kuhusu kile kila pin anakaa juu: kipimo, mchanganyiko wa kushindwa kwa mstari, au default bwawa. Pin kutoka kwa default ya bwawa ni nadhani, na mstari wa kijani chini yake hujibu swali ambalo hakuna mtu aliuliza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every call returns a flat dict with the following keys. Each key MAY be overridden from inventory by setting the matching `SYSTEM_EMAIL_<KEY>` variable (uppercase, with the `SYSTEM_EMAIL_` prefix)."
msgstr "Kila simu inarudi amri ya gorofa na funguo zifuatazo. Kila ufunguo unaweza kuwa overridden kutoka hesabu kwa kuweka vinavyolingana `SYSTEM_EMAIL_<KEY>` Tofauti ya kutofautiana (ya juu, pamoja na `SYSTEM_EMAIL_` Prefix ya)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every candidate row of the sweep, axes assigned, in global order."
msgstr "Kila mstari wa mgombea wa sweep, axes zilizowekwa, kwa utaratibu wa kimataifa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every cell carries both directions of one pair, row-to-column above column-to-row, because a bond is declared on the consumer's side and the two need not agree. Brightness is the bond: black for none, white for 1."
msgstr "Kila seli hubeba maelekezo yote mawili ya jozi moja, mstari-kwa-column juu ya safu-kwa-row, kwa sababu dhamana ni alitangaza upande wa watumiaji na wawili haja ya kukubaliana. Rangi ni nyeusi kwa ajili ya mtu yeyote, nyeupe kwa ajili ya 1..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every chunk of the sweep, priority blocks first."
msgstr "Kila kipande cha kufagia, vitalu vya kipaumbele kwanza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every client connection maps to exactly one provider group named `roles/<provider-application-id>/mcp`. The declarative user schema carries an application-scoped role form, so `mcp` can be granted for one application without granting it everywhere:"
msgstr "Kila kadi ya mawasiliano ya mteja kwa kikundi kimoja cha mtoa huduma `roles/<provider-application-id>/mcp`. Mpangilio wa mtumiaji wa declarative hubeba fomu ya jukumu la maombi, hivyo `mcp` Inaweza kutolewa kwa maombi moja bila kutoa kila mahali:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every collector is best-effort: a missing source must never abort the capture. ``INFINITO_RESCUE_DIAGNOSTICS_DIR`` and ``INFINITO_DNS53_SAMPLER_LOG`` are required and never defaulted here, so ``group_vars/all/05_paths.yml`` stays the one source. Prints one summary and ALWAYS exits 1 so a failure stays a failure."
msgstr "Kila mto ni bora kwa ajili ya uharibifu: chanzo missing lazima kamwe mimba kukamata. ``INFINITO_RESCUE_DIAGNOSTICS_DIR`` Aidha, na ``INFINITO_DNS53_SAMPLER_LOG`` kuwa ni lazima, na kamwe si lazima, hivyo ``group_vars/all/05_paths.yml`` Endelea chanzo kimoja. Kuweka muhtasari mmoja na daima kuondoka 1 Kwa hiyo kushindwa ni kushindwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every consumer mints its own key and runs the gateway contract"
msgstr "Kila mtumiaji anapiga ufunguo wake mwenyewe na anaendesha mkataba wa lango"

