# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every consumer speaks only the gateway `/v1`; the gateway is the single place backends are wired."
msgstr "Kila mtumiaji anaongea tu mlango `/v1`; Mlango wa mlango ni mpana sana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every declared backend has a `model_list` branch"
msgstr "Kila kitu kilichosemwa kina mwisho wake. `model_list` Ofisi ya tawi"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every declared distro id, in declaration order."
msgstr "Kila neno la siri, kwa amri ya tangazo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every deploy mode a role's primary entity may toggle. ``compose``/``swarm`` target stack roles (own container stack); ``host`` targets invokable roles that configure the host instead of shipping a stack."
msgstr "Kila mfumo wa kupeleka chombo cha msingi cha jukumu inaweza kuingiza. ``compose``Kwa hivyo``swarm`` Malengo ya stack (Vifaa vya stack); ``host`` malengo invokable majukumu ambayo configure jeshi badala ya meli stack."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every deploy opens with a `=== compose-deploy:` line listing the arguments it actually resolved. Read it instead of trusting the command you typed: rewriting `apps=` is where `disable=` and `full_cycle=` get lost, and the line shows what is missing before the play starts."
msgstr "Kila kitu kinaanza na A `=== compose-deploy:` Andika hoja ambazo kwa kweli zimetatuliwa. Soma badala ya kuamini amri uliyoandika: kuandika upya `apps=` Ni wapi ambapo `disable=` Aidha, na `full_cycle=` Kupata waliopotea, na mstari inaonyesha nini missing kabla ya kucheza kuanza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every discovered endpoint authenticates through a header. A provider that keys its session by URL segment instead cannot scope that segment per consumer or revoke it, so it is fronted by an adapter and the segment stays between the adapter and its upstream."
msgstr "Kila kitu kilichogunduliwa kinathibitisha kupitia kichwa. Mtoa huduma ambaye ana funguo kikao chake na sehemu ya URL badala yake hawezi kupanua sehemu hiyo kwa watumiaji au kuirudisha, kwa hivyo iko mbele na adapta na sehemu inakaa kati ya adapta na mto wake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every embodiable agent runs the admission checks"
msgstr "Kila wakala wa kuingizwa anaendesha ukaguzi wa kuingia"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every emoji used as a STRUCTURED marker across the project (complexity-matrix columns, lifecycle stages, deploy modes, boolean/state cells) is defined here exactly once, so a glyph means the same thing everywhere it appears. Emojis are unique: the module fails to import if two words share a glyph."
msgstr "Kila emoji iliyotumiwa kama alama imara katika mradi (Vipengele vya utata-matrix, hatua za mzunguko wa maisha, njia za kupeleka, seli za boolean / hali) Inafafanuliwa hapa mara moja, kwa hivyo glyph inamaanisha kitu kimoja kila mahali inaonekana. Emojis ni ya kipekee: moduli inashindwa kuingiza ikiwa maneno mawili yanashiriki glyph."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every env variable the spec reads MUST be exposed in the role's `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Names MUST match exactly."
msgstr "Kila env variable spec kusoma lazima wazi katika jukumu la `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Jina la mchezo lazima liwe sawa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every external CI trigger MUST route through one of the entry workflows. Each entry translates its event into a call to the orchestrator; the catalog of triggers and inputs lives in [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."
msgstr "Kila CI ya nje husababisha lazima njia kupitia moja ya kazi za kuingia. Kila kuingia hutafsiri tukio lake katika wito kwa orchestrator; katalogi ya kuchochea na pembejeo huishi katika [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every external test directory MUST contain `__init__.py` so repository-wide test structure checks keep passing."
msgstr "Kila idara ya ukaguzi lazima iwe na `__init__.py` Kwa hivyo uchunguzi wa muundo wa uchunguzi unaendelea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every failure is fixed at its root. A lint hit is resolved by deleting the offending construct, not by a `nocheck` marker, a loosened rule, or a target dropped from the gate — any suppression needs the operator's explicit approval and a stated reason."
msgstr "Kila kushindwa kunawekwa kwenye mizizi yake. Mgongano mkali unatatuliwa kwa kufuta ujenzi unaokosea, sio kwa `nocheck` Alama, kanuni iliyofunguliwa, au lengo lililopunguzwa kutoka lango - ukandamizaji wowote unahitaji idhini ya operator wazi na sababu iliyoelezwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every failure raises AnsibleError with an actionable message."
msgstr "Kila kushindwa huleta hasira kwa ujumbe unaoweza kutekelezwa."

