# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every input the run named *title* records, keyed by input name."
msgstr "Kila jina la mgombea *Kichwa cha kichwa* Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every input the source run was dispatched with, except the selection."
msgstr "Kila kipengele kilichochaguliwa kilichaguliwa, isipokuwa tu kwa uteuzi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every install is best-effort and per-command: cross-distro tools are often unavailable, and ``scripts/lint/packages.sh`` skips absent ones, so a failed candidate MUST NOT break the lint bootstrap. The validators are intentionally kept out of the install stamp's required-tool set so a non-Debian environment never loops trying to install a tool it cannot. This group is installed explicitly by the ``lint-packages`` make target (an explicit group bypasses the stamp), so the commands are provisioned every run rather than only on the first all-mode install."
msgstr "Kila ufungaji ni bora na kwa amri: zana za msalaba mara nyingi hazipatikani, na ``scripts/lint/packages.sh`` ruka wale kutokuwepo, hivyo mgombea kushindwa lazima kuvunja bootstrap lint. Wathibitishaji ni kwa makusudi kuweka nje ya ufungaji muhuri required-tool kuweka hivyo mazingira yasiyo ya Debian kamwe loops kujaribu kufunga chombo haiwezi. Kundi hili limeelezwa wazi na ``lint-packages`` Kufanya Malengo (Kundi la wazi linapita stampu), Kila kitu ni tayari kwa ajili ya mwanzo, lakini si kwa ajili yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every installable package is declared exactly once, in one of two places:"
msgstr "Kila pakiti ya ufungaji inatangazwa mara moja, katika moja ya maeneo mawili:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every invokable role in the tested lifecycle envelope, with its upstream homepage, an introduction video, the roles it integrates with, and a one-command local install."
msgstr "Kila jukumu lisilowezekana katika bahasha ya mzunguko wa maisha iliyojaribiwa, na ukurasa wake wa ukurasa wake wa upstream, video ya utangulizi, majukumu ambayo inaunganisha na, na kufunga moja ya amri ya ndani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every key MUST be the fully qualified form :func:`override_key` builds; a short form is rejected rather than guessed at, because the same short key names different credentials on different apps."
msgstr "Kila kipengele lazima kiwe na sifa kamili :func:`override_key` hujenga; fomu fupi inakataliwa badala ya kubahatisha, kwa sababu majina mafupi ya sifa tofauti kwenye programu tofauti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every line of the file named by ``ANSIBLE_LOG_PATH`` carries ``<ts> p=<pid> u=<user> n=<name> <LEVEL>|`` and a space in front of the message that also went to stdout. Left unstripped, that prefix defeats every line-anchored matcher a reader applies, so a reader that mixes an anchored match with an unanchored one silently sees an empty log instead of failing."
msgstr "Kila mstari wa faili uliotajwa na ``ANSIBLE_LOG_PATH`` Usafiri wa ``<ts> p=<pid> u=<user> n=<name> <LEVEL>|`` Na kwa upande wake Mbunge wa Jimbo la Ludewa Mhe. Left unstripped, kwamba prefix kushindwa kila mchezaji line-anchored msomaji inatumika, hivyo msomaji kwamba mchanganyiko mechi na unnchored moja kimya anaona logi tupu badala ya kushindwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every literal a rendered segment can start with, so any of them ends the value before it."
msgstr "Kila sehemu halisi iliyotolewa inaweza kuanza na, hivyo yoyote yao kuishia thamani kabla yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every matrix variant overrides the sample count to 1. At that setting the single sample is kept rather than discarded as cold, because what a CI round proves is that the measurement, the store and the re-render ran, not what the rate was on a shared runner."
msgstr "Kila aina ya matrix inasimamia hesabu ya sampuli 1. Wakati huo kuweka sampuli moja ni kuwekwa badala ya kuachwa kama baridi, kwa sababu nini CI pande zote inathibitisha ni kwamba kipimo, duka na re-render mbio, si nini kiwango alikuwa juu ya runner pamoja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every mode is read; there is no scope to narrow to. A run that failed in swarm and in compose comes back as two tokens for the same role."
msgstr "Kila aina inasoma; hakuna upeo wa kupungua. kukimbia ambayo alishindwa katika kundi na katika kutunga huja nyuma kama ishara mbili kwa jukumu moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Every model LiteLLM publishes, as ``{alias, params, context, traits}``."
msgstr "Kila mwandishi wa kitabu hicho, kama ``{alias, params, context, traits}``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every module here SHOULD expose a callable function for in-process use and a `__main__` shim so the same code path is reachable from shell orchestrators via `python -m utils.cleanup.<module>`."
msgstr "Kila moduli hapa inapaswa kufichua kazi inayoweza kuitwa kwa matumizi ya ndani ya usindikaji na `__main__` Shim hivyo njia hiyo ya msimbo inaweza kupatikana kutoka kwa waandaaji wa shell kupitia `python -m utils.cleanup.<module>`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every non-empty body line gets a ``- `` continuation prefix so rpm does not read a markdown ``*`` bullet at column 0 as a new changelog entry header (which makes ``rpmspec`` report ``bad date``). Blank lines stay blank. *footer_md* (the archived-releases notice) is folded into this entry's body for the same reason it is on the Debian side: trailing free text confuses the parser."
msgstr "Kila aina ya mwili usio na pumzi hupata ``- `` Endelea prefix hivyo rpm haina kusoma alama ``*`` Risasi kwenye kichwa 0 Jinsi ya kubadili kichwa cha kuingia (ambayo inafanya ``rpmspec`` Ripoti ya ``bad date``). Rangi ya bluu ni nyeupe. *footer_md* (Taarifa ya Usajili) Imewekwa ndani ya mwili wa kuingia kwa sababu hiyo iko upande wa Debian: kufuatilia maandishi ya bure huchanganya parser."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every non-empty line of the markdown body gets a two-space indent so Debian's parser accepts it: each change line MUST start with at least two spaces, otherwise dpkg treats it as a badly formatted line, loses the entry boundary and reports an empty maintainer. Blank lines stay blank."
msgstr "Kila mstari usio na usawa wa mwili wa markdown hupata nafasi mbili za indent hivyo parser ya Debian inakubali: kila mstari wa mabadiliko LAZIMA kuanza na angalau nafasi mbili, vinginevyo dpkg inaishughulikia kama mstari uliotengenezwa vibaya, hupoteza mpaka wa kuingia na ripoti mlinzi tupu. Rangi ya bluu ni nyeupe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every one of them needs the same four things before it can call into :mod:`utils.networks.render`: the resolved variables, the deployment mode, a service registry built from the merged applications, and closures over the ``config`` and ``database`` lookups. Building that once means a change to how the registry or the closures are obtained cannot reach one lookup and miss another."
msgstr "Kila mmoja wao anahitaji vitu vinne sawa kabla ya kuomba. :mod:`utils.networks.render`: vigezo kutatuliwa, hali ya kupelekwa, Usajili wa huduma kujengwa kutoka maombi iliunganishwa, na kufungwa juu ya ``config`` Aidha, na ``database`` ya macho. Kujenga kwamba mara moja ina maana mabadiliko ya jinsi Usajili au kufungwa ni kupatikana haiwezi kufikia moja lookup na miss mwingine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every other agent deployment in [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) keeps the agent kernel-isolated. This role is the deliberate inverse defined by [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) Decision #12 (embodied / dedicated-device mode): for a robot, the useful trust boundary is the **whole device**, because the agent's job is to drive that device's hardware (GPIO, I2C/SPI sensors, cameras, actuators, motors). A microVM around the agent would only get in the way of the very hardware it is meant to control."
msgstr "Wajumbe wote wa Kamati ya [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) Inaruhusu kernel-isolated. Hatua hii ni kinyume cha taratibu zilizowekwa na [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) Uamuzi wa #12 (Mfumo wa Uendeshaji / Uliotolewa)Kwa roboti, mpaka wa kuaminika ni **Vifaa vyote**Kwa sababu kazi ya wakala ni kuendesha vifaa vya kifaa hicho (GPIO, ya ya2C / SPI sensorer, kamera, actuators, motors)MicroVM karibu na wakala ingekuwa tu kupata njia ya vifaa vile ni maana ya kudhibiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every page carries a version switcher in its sidebar. Switching keeps the current page and falls back to the start page of a version that lacks it."
msgstr "Kila ukurasa hubeba swichi ya toleo katika sidebar yake. Kubadilisha huweka ukurasa wa sasa na kurudi kwenye ukurasa wa mwanzo wa toleo ambalo linakosa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every path either deploys on the assigned kind, reports the substitution, or fails. None of them substitutes in silence."
msgstr "Kila upande una njia yake au njia yake. Jibu lao pekee lilikuwa ni ukimya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every path that cannot route rejects the request with its reason instead of answering. The hook returns a string when the proxy has no router or when no served model can take the request, and the proxy turns that into a `RejectedRequestError` carrying the text. The alias's own `model_list` entry exists only so the name is listable and carries `mock_response: litellm.InternalServerError`, so reaching it at all raises. Both halves matter, because a router that silently served whatever was first would hide its own failure behind a plausible reply, and the alias exists precisely so callers do not have to know which model answered."
msgstr "Kila njia ambayo haiwezi kwenda inakataa ombi kwa sababu yake badala ya kujibu. Ndoano anarudi kamba wakati wakala hana router au wakati hakuna mfano aliwahi anaweza kuchukua ombi, na wakala anarudi kwamba katika `RejectedRequestError` utekelezaji wa maandishi hayo. Nyumba ya Ali `model_list` Kuingia kuna tu hivyo jina ni listable na hubeba `mock_response: litellm.InternalServerError`, Kwa hiyo, kwa hiyo, ni juu ya yote. Mambo yote mawili ya nusu, kwa sababu router ambayo ilitumikia kimya chochote ilikuwa ya kwanza ingeficha kushindwa kwake mwenyewe nyuma ya jibu la dhahiri, na alias ipo kwa usahihi hivyo waombaji hawana haja ya kujua ni mfano gani uliojibu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every per-tool module MUST expose the same surface so the dispatcher can call it uniformly:"
msgstr "Kila moduli ya kila mahali LAZIMA ionyeshe uso huo ili msafiri aweze kuiita kwa usawa:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every persona scenario MUST run the CSP injection assertion at least once on the role's canonical surface. When an injector service (`asset`, `cdn`, `css`, `javascript`, `simpleicons`, `matomo`) is enabled, the page's `Content-Security-Policy` header MUST list the injector's host. The assertion is centralised in [`personas/utils/csp.js`](../../../../../roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/personas/utils/csp.js) so every spec gets the check by default."
msgstr "Kila hali ya mtu LAZIMA kuendesha madai ya sindano ya CSP angalau mara moja juu ya uso wa canonical. Wakati wa huduma ya sindano (`asset`, Kwa hivyo, `cdn`, Kwa hivyo, `css`, Kwa hivyo, `javascript`, Kwa hivyo, `simpleicons`, Kwa hivyo, `matomo`) Imewezeshwa, ukurasa wa `Content-Security-Policy` Kiongozi lazima aandike orodha ya washindi. Madai hayo yaliwasilishwa katika [`personas/utils/csp.js`](../../../../../roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/personas/utils/csp.js) Kwa hiyo, kila mtu anapata kuangalia kwa default."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every plugin and mu-plugin is declared in ``meta/addons/`` under the unified addon contract. The OIDC and WP-Discourse runtime config lives in each addon’s ``config:`` block. Both install paths read those declarations: a ``required`` addon that fails to install stops the deploy, an optional one warns and is skipped."
msgstr "Kila Plugin na mu-plugin ni alitangaza katika ``meta/addons/`` chini ya Mkataba wa Muungano. Kamati ya OIDC na WP-Discourse Maisha ya config katika kila nyongeza ``config:`` kuzuia. Pande zote mbili zinasoma taarifa hizo: a ``required`` addon ambayo inashindwa kufunga kuacha kupeleka, mtu wa hiari anaonya na anaruka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every plugin and mu-plugin is declared in `meta/addons/` under the unified addon contract. The OIDC and WP-Discourse runtime config lives in each addon's `config:` block. Both install paths read those declarations: a `required` addon that fails to install stops the deploy, an optional one warns and is skipped."
msgstr "Kila Plugin na mu-plugin ni alitangaza katika `meta/addons/` chini ya Mkataba wa Muungano. Kamati ya OIDC na WP-Discourse Maisha ya config katika kila nyongeza `config:` kuzuia. Pande zote mbili zinasoma taarifa hizo: a `required` addon ambayo inashindwa kufunga kuacha kupeleka, mtu wa hiari anaonya na anaruka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every probe here targets the container's own loopback, so a request that a proxy picks up is wrong by definition -- the Wget probe has said so with ``--proxy=off`` since it was written. Both spellings come from here so the exec form and the shell form cannot drift: the shell form needs the wildcard quoted and the exec form needs it bare, which is exactly the kind of difference that rots when it is written out three times."
msgstr "Kila uchunguzi hapa malengo chombo mwenyewe kitanzi nyuma, hivyo ombi kwamba wakala kuchukua ni makosa kwa ufafanuzi - Wget uchunguzi alisema hivyo na ``--proxy=off`` tangu kuanzishwa kwake. Wote spellings kuja kutoka hapa hivyo fomu exec na fomu shell haiwezi drift: shell fomu inahitaji wildcard alinukuliwa na fomu exec inahitaji ni wazi, ambayo ni aina ya tofauti kwamba rots wakati ni imeandikwa nje mara tatu."

