# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every role with an `application_id` carries one role-local `mcp:` mapping in `meta/services.yml`. Discovery selects only a deployable classification with explicit `enabled: true` and `shared: true`; an audit-only mapping never becomes an endpoint:"
msgstr "Kila jukumu kwa ajili ya `application_id` Kuwa na sehemu ya ndani `mcp:` Mipango ya ndani `meta/services.yml`. Ugunduzi huchagua tu uainishaji unaoweza kutekelezwa na wazi `enabled: true` Aidha, na `shared: true`; Ufuatiliaji wa hesabu pekee hauwezi kuwa mwisho:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every row is assigned its deploy mode, tor state, distro, filesystem and CPU architecture by its position in that list (:mod:`utils.github.variant.axes`)."
msgstr "Kila mstari unapewa hali yake ya kupeleka, hali ya tor, distro, mfumo wa faili na usanifu wa CPU kwa nafasi yake katika orodha hiyo (:mod:`utils.github.variant.axes`)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every row of the CI matrix is one ``role#variant`` selection. Five axes are decided here, all as a deterministic rotation over the row's position in the *global* discovery order and the sweep number -- never at random, so a red job can be reproduced by re-running the same sweep, and so consecutive sweeps cover the combinations instead of sampling them:"
msgstr "Kila safu ya matrix ya CI ni moja ``role#variant`` uchaguzi. Tano axes ni kuamua hapa, wote kama mzunguko wa kuamua juu ya nafasi ya mstari katika *Kimataifa ya Kimataifa* Utaratibu wa ugunduzi na nambari ya kufagia - kamwe kwa nasibu, hivyo kazi nyekundu inaweza kuzalishwa kwa kurudia kufagia sawa, na sweeps mfululizo kufunika mchanganyiko badala ya sampuli yao:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every rule in `permissions.ask` assumes the operator reads the prompt and confirms the action matches intent. Rules in `ask` are NOT a hard barrier. They are a speed-bump that converts automatic execution into a deliberate decision."
msgstr "Kila utawala katika `permissions.ask` Inadhani operator anasoma haraka na kuthibitisha hatua mechi nia. Kanuni katika `ask` Sio kizuizi kikubwa. Wao ni chombo cha kasi ambacho hubadilisha utekelezaji wa moja kwa moja kuwa uamuzi wa makusudi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every runner instance is an ephemeral container that mounts its host's docker socket (DooD). For each CI job it starts a fresh Infinito DinD container with a unique subnet and volume, runs the job inside it, and tears it down; the runner then re-registers with GitHub as a fresh ephemeral runner."
msgstr "Kila tukio la mkimbiaji ni chombo cha ephemeral ambacho kinapanda socket ya mwenyeji wake (Do ya). Kwa kila kazi ya CI huanza chombo kipya cha Infinito DinD na subnet ya kipekee na kiasi, inaendesha kazi ndani yake, na machozi chini; mkimbiaji kisha anajiandikisha tena na GitHub kama mkimbiaji mpya wa ephemeral."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every runner instance is an ephemeral container that mounts its host’s docker socket (DooD). For each CI job it starts a fresh Infinito DinD container with a unique subnet and volume, runs the job inside it, and tears it down; the runner then re-registers with GitHub as a fresh ephemeral runner."
msgstr "Kila tukio la mkimbiaji ni chombo cha ephemeral ambacho kinapanda socket ya mwenyeji wake (Do ya). Kwa kila kazi ya CI huanza chombo kipya cha Infinito DinD na subnet ya kipekee na kiasi, inaendesha kazi ndani yake, na machozi chini; mkimbiaji kisha anajiandikisha tena na GitHub kama mkimbiaji mpya wa ephemeral."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every scenario MUST end with the browser in a clearly logged-out state."
msgstr "Kila hali lazima mwisho na browser katika hali wazi watumiaji-nje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every selected run is attempted before anything is reported; abandoning the rest on the first rejection would leave them burning runners. `HTTP 409` means the run already finished and is not a rejection at all. Any other rejection is logged as an `ERROR` line, but only a denied token fails the job — a rate limit or a run that vanished between listing and cancel is transient, and a red check for those is a red check nobody reads."
msgstr "Kila kukimbia kuchaguliwa ni jaribio kabla ya kitu chochote kinachoripotiwa; kuacha wengine juu ya kukataa kwanza kungewaacha wakimbiaji wa moto. `HTTP 409` Hii ina maana kwamba kukimbia tayari kumaliza na si kukataa kabisa. Aina nyingine yoyote ya kukataliwa inachukuliwa kama `ERROR` Mstari, lakini ishara tu iliyokataliwa inashindwa kazi - kikomo cha kiwango au kukimbia ambayo ilipotea kati ya orodha na kufuta ni ya muda mfupi, na hundi nyekundu kwa wale ni hundi nyekundu hakuna mtu anayesoma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every selection names every axis: role, variant, mode, onion state, distro and filesystem. Nothing is left to the rotation."
msgstr "Kila majina ya uteuzi kila mhimili: jukumu, lahaja, mode, hali ya onion, distro na mfumo wa faili. Hakuna kitu kilichoachwa kwenye mzunguko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every service-dependent step uses `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(...)`. Direct `process.env` reads of `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED` are forbidden."
msgstr "Kila hatua ya matumizi `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(...)`. Moja kwa moja `process.env` Kusoma kwa `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED` Wao ni marufuku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every shell invocation the agent makes: `make` targets, `git`/`gh`/`docker` calls, `grep`/`head`/`tail`/`wc`, Python test runners, log-capture pipelines, etc."
msgstr "Kila aina ya kazi ambayo mwajiri hufanya: `make` Malengo, `git`Kwa hivyo`gh`Kwa hivyo`docker` Wito wangu, `grep`Kwa hivyo`head`Kwa hivyo`tail`Kwa hivyo`wc`, wakimbiaji wa mtihani wa Python, mabomba ya logi-capture, nk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every spec MUST include the three persona scenarios below as its baseline. Additional scenarios (RBAC loops, peer-to-peer messaging, federation round-trips, CSP-deep-checks, …) MAY be added on top. Three personas exist in the deploy fixture: `guest` (no Keycloak account), `biber` (regular end-user), and `administrator` (operator/admin). The flow shape is identical across roles. Only the role-specific selectors and the post-login assertion change. Service-dependent steps MUST be guarded with [`skipUnlessServiceEnabled('<svc>')`](../../../../../roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/service-gating.js) so a deploy with `disable=<svc>` reports the affected step as `skipped: <NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false`, never `failed`."
msgstr "Kila spec LAZIMA ni pamoja na matukio matatu ya mtu chini kama msingi wake. Matukio ya ziada (RBAC loops, rika-kwa-peer ujumbe, shirikisho raundi, CSP-deep-checks, ...) Inaweza kuongezwa juu. Watu watatu wanaishi katika mfumo wa kuweka: `guest` (Hakuna cha Keycloak Akaunti ya akaunti)Kwa hivyo, `biber` (Mtumiaji wa mwisho)Aidha, na `administrator` (Mtumiaji:admin)Sura ya mtiririko ni sawa katika majukumu. Chagua tu wahusika maalum na mabadiliko ya madai ya baada. Hatua za ulinzi lazima zizingatiwe [`skipUnlessServiceEnabled('<svc>')`](../../../../../roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/service-gating.js) Kwa hiyo, pamoja na `disable=<svc>` Alisema hatua zilizochukuliwa kama `skipped: <NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false`, Hata hivyo, kamwe `failed`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Every spec MUST set `test.use({ ignoreHTTPSErrors: true })` at the top of the file because the test environment uses self-signed certificates. The central `playwright.config.js` does NOT set this globally. Per-spec opt-in is the contract."
msgstr "Kila kipengele lazima kuweka `test.use({ ignoreHTTPSErrors: true })` Juu ya faili kwa sababu mazingira ya mtihani hutumia vyeti vya kujitegemea. Katikati ya `playwright.config.js` Hili halifanyiki duniani kote. Chaguo la kuingia ni mkataba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every stack has its own domain below it (`INFINITO_DOMAIN`): the primary checkout is `main.infinito.test`, a worktree from `make worktree-up` is its branch lowercased with every character outside `a-z0-9_-` replaced by `-` (`feature/store-i18n` → `feature-store-i18n.infinito.test`). `linux.sh` routes each stack's domain to that checkout's `INFINITO_BIND_IP`, read from the `.env` of every `git worktree list` entry. Re-run `make network-dns-setup` after creating or removing a worktree."
msgstr "Kila kitu kina sehemu yake ya chini. (`INFINITO_DOMAIN`)“Uchunguzi wa msingi ni `main.infinito.test`, Moja ya kazi kutoka `make worktree-up` Je, mwili wake umeunganishwa na kila kitu? `a-z0-9_-` Kubadilishwa kwa `-` (`feature/store-i18n` kuwa `feature-store-i18n.infinito.test`)... `linux.sh` Njia ya kila uwanja wa stack kwa Checkout hiyo `INFINITO_BIND_IP`, Kusoma kutoka kwa `.env` Kwa kila mmoja `git worktree list` kuingia. Kugeuka `make network-dns-setup` Baada ya kujenga au kuondoa mfumo wa mizizi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every stateful role in the repo keeps both modes on; only host-level and infrastructure roles disable swarm. See [deployment-modes.md](../contributing/design/deployment-modes.md)."
msgstr "Kila jukumu la hali katika repo linaweka modes zote; tu ngazi ya jeshi na majukumu ya miundombinu Disable kundi. See ya [deployment-modes.md](../contributing/design/deployment-modes.md)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every sweep exercises both architectures across the catalogue instead of proving amd64 and claiming nothing, at no extra job count."
msgstr "Kila zoezi zoezi usanifu wote katika orodha badala ya kuthibitisha amd64 Hakuna kazi, hakuna kazi ya ziada."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every task that creates a new file."
msgstr "Kila kazi ambayo inaunda faili mpya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every task that inspects a file."
msgstr "Kila kazi ambayo inafungua faili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every task that modifies an existing file."
msgstr "Kila kazi ambayo inabadilisha faili iliyopo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every token of a space-separated ``whitelist``/``priority`` input."
msgstr "Kila sehemu iliyotengwa ``whitelist``Kwa hivyo``priority`` upatikanaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every version with its build status and progress"
