# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "For fork PRs, CI waits for privileged images built by the `pull_request_target` event before proceeding. For an untrusted fork that build runs from the safe base merge ref **without organization secrets** (only the per-job `GITHUB_TOKEN`); a maintainer-applied `🛡️ Trusted` label switches the build source to the PR head, unlocks the mirror credentials, and skips the wait — see [Trusted fork PRs](#trusted-fork-prs-)."
msgstr "Kwa ajili ya PRs fork, CI kusubiri kwa ajili ya picha upendeleo kujengwa na `pull_request_target` matukio kabla ya kuendelea. Kwa ajili ya ngome untrusted kwamba kujenga anaendesha kutoka msingi salama kuunganisha ref **Hakuna siri za shirika** (Kwa upande wa ajira `GITHUB_TOKEN`); Kuwa mtumishi `🛡️ Trusted` Lebo inachukua chanzo cha kujenga kwa kichwa cha PR, inafungua sifa za kioo, na inaruka kusubiri - angalia [Kuwa waaminifu kwa PRs](#trusted-fork-prs-)..."

