# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) and teach the bundled nginx to handle GCP Artifact Registry redirect URLs (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`). Currently `gcr.io` blob pulls are bypassed via `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` in [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), which is a workaround that disables caching for those registries. Long-term: rebase upstream's `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` rules to recognise the new redirect shape, ship the fix in our fork, point `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (or its image tag) at the fork, and drop the `NO_PROXY` bypass."
msgstr "Kwa ajili ya [rpardini /docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) na kufundisha nginx iliyofungwa kushughulikia GCP Artifact Registry kuelekeza URL (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`)Kwa sasa `gcr.io` Vipeperushi vya blob huondolewa kupitia `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` Ndani ya [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), Ni kazi ambayo inazuia caching kwa registries hizo. Mbadala majina: Rebase Upstream `proxy.conf` Kwa hivyo `sub_filter` sheria kutambua sura mpya ya kuelekeza, meli kurekebisha katika fork yetu, pointi `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (Au picha yake) katika ngazi ya juu na kuacha `NO_PROXY` ya kupita."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork `pull_request` runs always receive a read-only token (GitHub-enforced); the label never grants write tokens or secrets to the untrusted event."
msgstr "Kwa ajili ya `pull_request` Kila wakati huwa na ishara ya kusoma tu (GitHub-Kuimarishwa); Hakuna haja ya kuandika barua au nyaraka za uwongo."

