# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "GitHub Actions cannot generate a variable number of jobs, so the chunk blocks are written out in the orchestrator. `INFINITO_CI_MAX_CHUNKS` must equal how many exist there — `slots` plans a sweep against that key, and a sweep planned larger than the chain silently drops its tail. Declare one block more than `available` fills (`ceil(available / chunk size) + 1`): the split receives every declared block, so after a short priority chunk the regular rows still fill the rest of the budget. Blocks whose slice comes back empty skip themselves and cost nothing."
msgstr "Hatua za GitHub haziwezi kuzalisha idadi tofauti ya kazi, kwa hivyo vitalu vya chunk vimeandikwa katika orchestrator. `INFINITO_CI_MAX_CHUNKS` Lazima iwe sawa na idadi ya watu ambao wanaishi huko. `slots` Mipango sweep dhidi ya ufunguo huo, na sweep iliyopangwa kubwa kuliko mnyororo kimya matone mkia wake. Kujiandikisha kwa block zaidi ya moja `available` Watoto (`ceil(available / chunk size) + 1`)Mgawanyiko hupokea kila kizuizi kilichotangazwa, kwa hivyo baada ya kipaumbele kidogo, safu za kawaida bado zinajaza bajeti yote. Vikwazo ambao kipande huja nyuma tupu kuruka wenyewe na gharama yoyote."

