# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Ideal for developers and content creators, the role simplifies deploying a dedicated icon server. It automates container setup, configuration, and routing, ensuring reliable, quick access to icons. Easily integrate scalable icons into your projects without managing individual asset files."
msgstr "Bora kwa watengenezaji na waumbaji wa maudhui, jukumu linaongeza kupeleka seva ya icon ya kujitolea. Inaendesha usanidi wa chombo, usanidi, na uendeshaji, kuhakikisha upatikanaji wa kuaminika, wa haraka wa icons. Kwa urahisi kuunganisha icons scalable katika miradi yako bila kusimamia faili binafsi mali."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Idempotence 🔁"
msgstr "Kuwajibika 🔁"

