msgid "If IPv6 is active but misconfigured, Docker MAY attempt to pull over IPv6 and fail."
msgstr "Ikiwa IPV6 Inafanya kazi lakini haijaundwa, Docker anaweza kujaribu kuvuta IPv6 ya kushindwa."

