msgid "If `true`, skip TLS verification on outbound calls (for local CA)."
msgstr "Ikiwa ni `true`, ruka ukaguzi wa TLS kwenye simu za outbound (Kwa ajili ya CA)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a CI run is still progressing and the user has not asked you to change course, you MUST wait for it to finish before starting triage."
msgstr "Kama CI kukimbia bado inaendelea na mtumiaji hajakuomba kubadili kozi, lazima kusubiri kwa ajili yake kumaliza kabla ya kuanza triage."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a Keycloak user is not present in OpenLDAP, OpenCloud auto-provisions the user on first login using the `preferred_username` claim. To keep usernames stable across Nextcloud, OpenCloud, and OpenTalk, all three apps share the same `OIDC.CLIENT.REALM` and the same `LDAP.DN.OU.USERS` source."
msgstr "Kama kuna Keycloak Mtumiaji hayupo katika OpenLDAPKwa hivyo, OpenCloud auto-provisions mtumiaji juu ya kwanza login kutumia `preferred_username` madai hayo. Kuweka usernames imara katika NextcloudKwa hivyo, OpenCloudAidha, na OpenTalkProgramu zote tatu zinashiriki sawa `OIDC.CLIENT.REALM` Na kwa upande wa `LDAP.DN.OU.USERS` chanzo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a [Playwright](https://playwright.dev/) job fails, you MUST also download the Playwright assets, store them in `/tmp/`, and analyze them together with the logs."
msgstr "Kama kuna [Kucheza michezo](https://playwright.dev/) Kazi inashindwa, lazima pia kupakua mali Playwright, kuhifadhi yao katika `/tmp/`, na kuzichunguza kwa pamoja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a backup validation fails due to infrastructure problems (for example timeouts or a missing validation tool), the cleanup service exits with a non-zero status. This allows systemd OnFailure handlers or monitoring systems to react accordingly."
msgstr "Ikiwa uthibitisho wa chelezo unashindwa kutokana na matatizo ya miundombinu (Kwa mfano, wakati au chombo cha uthibitisho kilichopotea), Huduma ya kusafisha hutolewa na hali isiyo ya sifuri. Hii inaruhusu mifumo ya uendeshaji wa OnFailure au mifumo ya ufuatiliaji kujibu ipasavyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a brand-new deployment must pass the `biber` end-to-end scenario on its first run, either:"
msgstr "Ikiwa mfumo mpya wa uendeshaji unapaswa kuingia `biber` Katika hatua ya mwisho, pia:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a contributor needs to tighten network policy locally (e.g. running on an untrusted network), they SHOULD do so via `.claude/settings.local.json` rather than weakening the project-level defaults that other contributors depend on."
msgstr "Kama mchangiaji anahitaji kuimarisha sera ya mtandao ndani ya nchi (e.g. kukimbia kwenye mtandao usioaminika), Kwa kufanya hivyo, wanapaswa kufanya hivyo kupitia `.claude/settings.local.json` Badala ya kupunguza mapungufu ya kiwango cha mradi ambayo wachangiaji wengine hutegemea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a criterion is ambiguous, you MUST ask the user to clarify before proceeding."
msgstr "Kama kigezo ni ambiguous, lazima kuuliza mtumiaji kufafanua kabla ya kuendelea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a fully offline or air-gapped setup is required, the role can be extended to use a locally vendored installer script with a pinned checksum."
msgstr "Ikiwa usanidi kamili wa nje ya mtandao au uliopigwa hewa unahitajika, jukumu linaweza kupanuliwa ili kutumia script ya ndani ya muuzaji na hundi ya pinned."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a local deploy is still progressing and the user has not asked you to change course, you MUST wait for it to finish instead of interrupting it."
msgstr "Ikiwa uingizaji wa ndani bado unaendelea na mtumiaji hajakuomba kubadilisha kozi, unapaswa kusubiri ili kumaliza badala ya kuikatiza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a matching issue exists, you MUST add a comment via `gh issue comment <issue-number> --body-file <log-excerpt-file>` that contains the relevant log excerpt and links the full GitHub Actions run URL for every newly observed run."
msgstr "Ikiwa kuna suala linalolingana, unapaswa kuongeza maoni kupitia `gh issue comment <issue-number> --body-file <log-excerpt-file>` Hiyo ina sehemu muhimu ya logi na inaunganisha hatua kamili za GitHub kukimbia URL kwa kila kukimbia hivi karibuni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a new test is created or an existing test has been changed since the last test run, you MUST rerun it after every subsequent action until it passes."
msgstr "Ikiwa mtihani mpya umeundwa au mtihani uliopo umebadilishwa tangu jaribio la mwisho liende, lazima urekebishe baada ya kila hatua inayofuata mpaka lipita."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a push to GHCR fails with `denied: denied`:"
msgstr "Kama kuna kitu kinakosekana kwa CCM `denied: denied`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a reuse target aborts with \"inventory not found\", you MUST add `variant=<idx>` and re-run; do NOT work around the error by re-creating the unsuffixed folder by hand."
msgstr "Ikiwa ni pamoja na lengo la kutoa mimba kwa \"Orodha ya wasiopatikana\"Unahitaji kuongeza `variant=<idx>` Usiwe na haraka ya kufanya kazi, wala usilalamike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a role cannot answer those questions, it is probably doing too much."
msgstr "Ikiwa mtu hawezi kujibu maswali haya, basi anaweza kufanya mengi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a role uses another service around the application but the addon does not talk to that service directly, the service MUST stay in `meta/services.yml` and MUST NOT be listed in the addon's `bridges:`. Friendica's oauth2-proxy-backed `sso` service is such a front-door auth gate for `ldapauth`."
msgstr "Kama jukumu anatumia huduma nyingine karibu na programu lakini addon haina kuzungumza na huduma hiyo moja kwa moja, huduma lazima kukaa katika `meta/services.yml` Hakuna haja ya kuwa katika orodha ya `bridges:`. Ukumbi wa Friendica2Msaada wa dharura `sso` Huduma ni kama mlango wa mbele auth kwa ajili ya `ldapauth`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a service can be removed without rewriting the whole stack, the design is usually healthy. If removing one part breaks everything else, the boundaries are probably too weak."
msgstr "Kama huduma inaweza kuondolewa bila kuandika upya stack nzima, kubuni ni kawaida afya. Ikiwa kuondoa sehemu moja huvunja kila kitu kingine, mipaka inaweza kuwa dhaifu sana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a single role defines the same credential key in both a schema definition and a runtime value, the loader MUST stop and surface the collision instead of silently merging."
msgstr "Ikiwa jukumu moja linafafanua muhimu sawa katika ufafanuzi wa schema na thamani ya kukimbia, mzigo lazima kuacha na uso mgongano badala ya kuunganisha kimya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a vaulted key exists → reuse (idempotent, address stability is the contract)."
msgstr "Kama kuna kitu kinaitwa reuse (Mheshimiwa Spika, suala la mkataba ni)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a warning points to an intentional exception, make the exception explicit and keep the follow-up visible."
msgstr "Ikiwa tahadhari inaonyesha ubaguzi wa makusudi, fanya ubaguzi wazi na uendelee kufuatilia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If agent instructions change mid-conversation (AGENTS.md or any file referenced from it), the agent might not reload them automatically. Trigger a reload with:"
msgstr "Kama maelekezo ya wakala mabadiliko ya katikati ya mazungumzo (AGENTS.md au maelezo yoyote ya ziada kutoka kwa), Hata hivyo, mwajiriwa hawezi kuwasilisha nyaraka hizo moja kwa moja. Bonyeza Reload kwa:"

