# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Imported by the lint bootstrap, which runs on a bare interpreter before any dependency is installed, so this module stays on the standard library. It also stays inside its own package: the Dockerfile copies it into the image beside ``utils/__init__.py`` and ``utils/install/__init__.py`` and nothing else, so importing any other ``utils`` submodule raises ``ModuleNotFoundError`` in the layer that runs it. The requirements files it reads are this repository's own and hold one shape: a ``collections:`` list of ``- name:`` entries with an optional ``version:``. A line that does not match that shape leaves the entry unpinned, which the caller treats as unsatisfied and installs."
msgstr "Kuingizwa na bootstrap ya lint, ambayo inaendesha mkali mkali kabla ya utegemezi wowote imewekwa, kwa hivyo moduli hii inakaa kwenye maktaba ya kawaida. Pia hukaa ndani ya mfuko wake mwenyewe: Dockerfile nakala yake katika picha kando ``utils/__init__.py`` Aidha, na ``utils/install/__init__.py`` Hakuna kitu kingine, kwa hivyo ni muhimu kwa mtu mwingine. ``utils`` Uendelezaji wa ``ModuleNotFoundError`` katika ngazi ambayo inasimamia. Faili za mahitaji ambayo inasoma ni ya kuhifadhi hii mwenyewe na kushikilia sura moja: a ``collections:`` Orodha ya ``- name:`` Kuingia kwa hiari ``version:``. Mstari ambao haulingani na sura hiyo huacha kuingia bila kufungwa, ambayo mpiga simu hushughulikia kama unsatisfied na kufunga."

