# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inside a play the process boundary is the task: Ansible forks a fresh worker per task, so `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` starts empty in every worker. `get_merged_applications` therefore also accepts the play-scoped carrier fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (payload plus cache key, parked once by the constructor stage) and serves it when the key matches. See [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) for the contract."
msgstr "Ndani ya kucheza mpaka mchakato ni kazi: Ansible forks mfanyakazi mpya kwa kila kazi, hivyo `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` Kuanza kazi katika kila mfanyakazi. `get_merged_applications` Kwa hiyo pia inakubali ukweli wa carrier wa kucheza `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (Malipo pamoja na ufunguo wa cache, imesimamishwa mara moja na hatua ya ujenzi) Hii inatumika wakati wa mchezo wa msingi. See ya [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) kwa ajili ya mkataba."

