# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inside the local lane nothing is parallel. `iteration/compose.md` requires deploys to be serial, and a second deploy or a `make test` started next to a running one is the SIGKILL that costs the whole round."
msgstr "Ndani ya nyumba hakuna kitu ni sawa. `iteration/compose.md` Inahitaji vifaa kuwa serial, na matumizi ya pili au `make test` Kuanza karibu na kukimbia moja ni SIGKILL ambayo gharama pande zote."

