# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "It hooks `http_api_curl` rather than `http_request_args` because the args array cannot express a proxy: WordPress core's `WP_HTTP_Proxy` hardcodes `CURLPROXY_HTTP`, so SOCKS5 is reachable only on the raw cURL handle. Without it, libcurl refuses an `.onion` host at name resolution under [RFC 7686](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7686) — before `/etc/hosts`, `extra_hosts` or DNS is consulted — and the token exchange fails with cURL error 6, which WordPress surfaces as `wp-login.php?login-error=http_request_failed`."
msgstr "Ya ya hooks `http_api_curl` Badala yake badala ya `http_request_args` Kwa sababu safu ya args haiwezi kuonyesha wakala: WordPress msingi `WP_HTTP_Proxy` ya hardcodes `CURLPROXY_HTTP`, Hivyo basi,5 Ni tu juu ya njia ya asili. Bila ya hivyo, libcurl inakataa `.onion` Chagua jina la mwenyeji chini [RFC ya 7686](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7686) Kabla ya `/etc/hosts`, Kwa hivyo, `extra_hosts` au DNS inashauriwa - na kubadilishana ishara inashindwa na kosa la cURL 6ambayo WordPress ya juu kama `wp-login.php?login-error=http_request_failed`..."

