# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Leave `KEEP_NEWEST_PER` and `INCLUDE_PATHS` unset to cancel every matching run, as the lifecycle events do — a closed PR and a deleted branch have no run left that deserves to survive. A fallback also mirrors whatever gates its group: `global-ci-*` cancels on every ref except `main`, so the push job carries the same `github.ref_name != 'main'` guard, while `pr-ci-*` is declared `cancel-in-progress: true` unconditionally, so the pull request job is ungated too."
msgstr "Acha kuondoka `KEEP_NEWEST_PER` Aidha, na `INCLUDE_PATHS` Kuanza kufuta kila mbio inayolingana, kama matukio ya mzunguko wa maisha hufanya - PR imefungwa na tawi lililofutwa halijaachwa ambalo linastahili kuishi. Pia inaonyesha kila kitu kinachoingia kwenye kundi lake: `global-ci-*` Kuondolewa kwa kila kitu isipokuwa `main`, Kwa hiyo, kazi ya kuendesha gari ni sawa na `github.ref_name != 'main'` walinzi, wakati `pr-ci-*` Imetangazwa kuwa `cancel-in-progress: true` Bila masharti, kwa hivyo kazi ya maombi ya kuvuta pia inapendekezwa."

