# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Lint tests that enforce correct Ansible module usage and task-level invariants. Each test catches a class of silent or confusing failure that the runtime would otherwise tolerate or surface far from its cause."
msgstr "Jaribio la Lint ambalo linatekeleza matumizi sahihi ya moduli ya Ansible na invariants ya ngazi ya kazi. Kila mtihani upatikanaji wa darasa la kimya au kuchanganyikiwa kushindwa kwamba runtime vinginevyo kuvumilia au uso mbali na sababu yake."

