msgid "Many CLI tools walk the same `roles/<role>/<config|vars|meta>/...yml` files multiple times during a single invocation (dependency resolution, service resolution, role introspection, ...). Each direct `yaml.safe_load(path.read_text())` re-parses YAML and re-touches disk."
