# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Modules in `utils/roles/` MUST stay focused on data that originates from `roles/<role>/` (`meta/services.yml`, `meta/main.yml`, `vars/`, `defaults/`) or the runtime dictionary that mirrors those files (`applications`)."
msgstr "Modules katika `utils/roles/` Ni lazima kuzingatia data ambayo inatokana na `roles/<role>/` (`meta/services.yml`, Kwa hivyo, `meta/main.yml`, Kwa hivyo, `vars/`, Kwa hivyo, `defaults/`) Au kwa maneno mengine, kamusi inayochunguza faili hizo (`applications`)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Modules in `utils/roles/applications/` MUST provide reusable helpers for reading, resolving, and validating application configuration. Helpers MUST stay independent of Ansible plugin entrypoints so the same code can be imported from filter plugins, lookup plugins, and library modules."
msgstr "Modules katika `utils/roles/applications/` LAZIMA kutoa wasaidizi reusable kwa kusoma, kutatua, na kuthibitisha maombi Configuration. Wasaidizi lazima kukaa huru ya vituo vya kuingia Plugin ya Ansible ili msimbo huo huo unaweza kuingizwa kutoka kwa Plugins ya kuchuja, programu za kuangalia, na modules za maktaba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Modules in `utils/roles/applications/services/` MUST NOT take over wider application-config concerns that belong to the sibling `config` module (path-driven `applications.<id>.<dotted>` reads, schema validation)."
msgstr "Modules katika `utils/roles/applications/services/` Hapaswi kuchukua wasiwasi mkubwa wa usanidi wa maombi ambao ni wa ndugu `config` Moduli ya moduli (Njia ya kwenda `applications.<id>.<dotted>` Kusoma, uthibitisho wa schema)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Modules in `utils/roles/applications/services/` MUST limit themselves to the service-graph derived from `meta/services.yml`: registry construction, dependency resolution between provider and consumer roles, and database backend selection per application."
msgstr "Modules katika `utils/roles/applications/services/` Ni lazima kuwa na uwezo wa kuingia katika orodha ya huduma zinazotolewa na `meta/services.yml`: Ujenzi wa Usajili, azimio la utegemezi kati ya mtoa huduma na majukumu ya watumiaji, na uteuzi wa backend ya database kwa maombi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Modules in `utils/roles/validation/` MUST limit themselves to checking that role artefacts and their derived names obey the constraints documented in `docs/contributing/`: legal application identifiers, deployment-target invokability, container resource shape."
msgstr "Modules katika `utils/roles/validation/` LAZIMA kujidhibiti wenyewe ili kuangalia vifaa vya jukumu hilo na majina yao yaliyotokana yanatii vikwazo vilivyoandikwa katika `docs/contributing/`: vitambulisho vya maombi ya kisheria, uingizaji-target invokability, sura ya rasilimali ya chombo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
