# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "More robust Nix installer on Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora and CentOS systems: stale nixbld users from earlier installation attempts are cleaned up before the multi-user installer runs, and a long-standing crash on hosts where the nixbld group is absent has been resolved."
msgstr "Ufungaji imara zaidi wa Nix kwenye Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora na mifumo ya CentOS: watumiaji wa stale nixbld kutoka majaribio ya awali ya ufungaji wanasafishwa kabla ya ufungaji wa watumiaji wengi kukimbia, na ajali ya muda mrefu kwenye majeshi ambapo kikundi cha nixbld haipo imetatuliwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "More stable updates: pkgmgr execution is more robust, especially in non-interactive environments and virtual environments."
msgstr "Sasisho imara zaidi: utekelezaji wa pkgmgr ni imara zaidi, hasa katika mazingira yasiyo ya ndani na mazingira ya kawaida."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Most application roles use Docker Compose for the running services."
msgstr "Sehemu nyingi za matumizi Docker Compose kwa ajili ya huduma za uendeshaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Most declarations are narrower than :data:`DEFAULT_OK`, so this gate adds to the default instead of replacing it; narrowing it would escalate vhosts that answer perfectly well. Contract checking is a different question and belongs to ``sys-ctl-hlth-webserver``."
msgstr "Kauli nyingi ni fupi kuliko :data:`DEFAULT_OK`, hivyo lango hili linaongeza kwenye chaguo-msingi badala ya kuibadilisha; kuipunguza itazidisha vhosts ambazo zinajibu vizuri. Suala la mikataba ni suala jingine na ni la ``sys-ctl-hlth-webserver``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Most role names are global: ``roles: [administrator]`` means administrator everywhere it is declared. ``APPLICATION_SCOPED_ROLES`` are the exception. Those carry a distinct grant per application, so reading them from the unscoped list would hand a user every deployed application's copy at once. They come only from ``application_roles``::"
msgstr "Majina ya wahusika wengi ni ya kimataifa: ``roles: [administrator]`` Hii ina maana kuwa kiongozi popote alipo. ``APPLICATION_SCOPED_ROLES`` Ni ya kipekee. Wale hubeba ruzuku tofauti kwa maombi, kwa hivyo kuzisoma kutoka kwenye orodha isiyojulikana watampa mtumiaji nakala ya kila maombi yaliyotumiwa mara moja. Wanatoka tu kwa ``application_roles``:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
