msgstr "Kuhamishwa backend huduma-load maamuzi katika kujitolea kuangaliaup Plugin"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Moves an issue (with its history and attachments) into a different repository. The destination repo can be attacker-controlled, equivalent to data exfiltration of the issue's contents. Issue transfers must be a deliberate human action."
msgstr "Kutatua tatizo (pamoja na historia yake na ahadi zake) katika hifadhi tofauti. Repo ya marudio inaweza kudhibitiwa na mshambuliaji, sawa na utaftaji wa data wa yaliyomo ya suala hilo. Suala la uhamiaji linapaswa kuwa hatua ya kibinadamu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
