# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Neither strategy is chosen by hand. `services.litellm.router_strategy` derives from `services.jeff.enabled`: with the System One service deployed the gateway asks it, and without it there is nothing to ask, so the gateway falls to the strategy it can compute itself. Reading the service flag rather than `group_names` keeps one path from the deployment to the behaviour."
msgstr "Hata hivyo, hakuna uchaguzi kwa mkono. `services.litellm.router_strategy` Kutoka kwa `services.jeff.enabled`: Kwa kuwa System One Huduma iliyotumia lango inauliza, na bila hiyo hakuna kitu cha kuuliza, hivyo lango linaanguka kwa mkakati ambao unaweza kujihesabu. kusoma Katiba badala ya `group_names` Weka njia moja kutoka kwa kupelekwa kwa tabia."

