# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "On a Tor node the node dnsmasq resolves ``.onion`` through Tor's DNSPort and everything else through the clearnet upstream, which is what makes per-app proxy settings unnecessary. It is only reachable on the docker bridge address because docker discards loopback resolvers, and it is absent before docker itself is installed, hence the guard."
msgstr "Na adhabu juu ya mataifa, ``.onion`` Kwa njia ya DNSPort ya Tor na kila kitu kingine kupitia upstream ya wazi, ambayo ni nini hufanya mipangilio ya wakala wa programu ya programu isiyohitajika. Ni tu inayoweza kupatikana kwenye anwani ya daraja la docker kwa sababu docker huacha ufumbuzi wa kitanzi, na haipo kabla ya docker yenyewe imewekwa, hivyo walinzi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "On a long orchestrator sweep the concurrency group sometimes fails to reap its occupant: the occupant's run-level status sits on `queued` — the normal state of a run whose matrix jobs are still waiting for runners — and the newer run parks on `pending` behind it until someone cancels the sweep by hand. Whether `queued` is the cause or another symptom cannot be decided from outside GitHub; what is observable is that the group does not always reap. The API cancel does not depend on any of that, so [entry-cancel-superseded.yml](../../../.github/workflows/entry-cancel-superseded.yml) calls these helpers on every new commit as well. That workflow deliberately declares no concurrency group: the run holding a group cannot be the run that frees it."
msgstr "Katika orchestrator ya muda mrefu kufagia kundi la kukubaliana wakati mwingine inashindwa kuvuna occupant yake: hali ya occupant `queued` - hali ya kawaida ya kukimbia ambaye kazi za tumbo bado zinasubiri wapiganaji - na mbuga mpya za kukimbia `pending` Baada ya hapo, safisha mikono yako kwa sabuni. Licha ya kuwa `queued` Je, ni sababu au dalili nyingine haiwezi kuamua kutoka nje ya GitHub; kinachoonekana ni kwamba kikundi hakivuna kila wakati. Kwa kuwa API Kujiuzulu hakutegemei lolote kati ya hayo, kwa hiyo [entry-cancel-superseded.yml](../../../.github/workflows/entry-cancel-superseded.yml) Aidha, natoa wito kwa watumishi wote wapya wa Kazi hiyo ya kazi kwa makusudi inatangaza hakuna kikundi cha kukubaliana: kukimbia kufanya kikundi haiwezi kuwa kukimbia ambayo inaiachilia."

