# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One query per run, not one per deploy mode. Every row is a ``role#variant`` selection, so the row basis, the ranking and the budget cut all speak the same unit and the cut can select a subset of a role's variants. Which deploy mode a row actually runs in is decided afterwards by the rotation in ``utils.github.variant.bundles``; the query only decides which rows exist."
msgstr "Chagua moja kwa kila njia, sio moja kwa kila njia ya kupeleka. Kila mstari ni moja ya ``role#variant`` Uchaguzi, hivyo msingi wa mstari, cheo na bajeti ya kukata wote wanasema kitengo kimoja na kukata inaweza kuchagua sehemu ndogo ya tofauti za jukumu. Ambayo kuweka mode mstari kweli anaendesha katika ni kuamua baadaye kwa mzunguko katika ``utils.github.variant.bundles``; Ila ni wajibu kuhukumu kwa yaliyo moyoni."

