msgid "One selection token, taken apart."
msgstr "Chagua moja, chagua moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One service serves both block shapes, because the demands of the two overlap: a host install needs `/sbin/init` as the entrypoint and the cgroup mount to deploy systemd units, and it needs the daemon socket too, since a role without a compose template of its own still pulls in containerised dependencies. A containerised block needs that socket to nest its `docker run` one level below the machine, and a work directory mounted at the same absolute path on both sides so the bind sources it names resolve on the daemon. The union is the machine, and the block decides what it does with it."
msgstr "Huduma moja hutumikia maumbo yote ya kuzuia, kwa sababu mahitaji ya kuingiliana mawili: mahitaji ya ufungaji wa jeshi `/sbin/init` Kama kituo cha kuingia na mlima wa kikundi cha kupeleka vitengo vilivyopangwa, na inahitaji tundu la daemon pia, kwa kuwa jukumu bila template ya kuandika ya bado huvuta katika utegemezi wa vyombo. Mahitaji ya kuzuia chombo ambayo socket ili kiota chake `docker run` Ngazi moja chini ya mashine, na saraka ya kazi imewekwa kwa njia sawa kabisa kwa pande zote mbili ili vyanzo vya kumfunga vinatatua kwenye daemon. Umoja ni mashine, na block huamua nini inafanya na hiyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One sidecar per consuming application with a database-scoped read-only principal and only schema/SELECT/SHOW/DESCRIBE tools. Never a global server on the shared engine or the root credential."
msgstr "Sidecar moja kwa matumizi na database-scoped kusoma-tu kuu na tu schema/SELECT/SHOW/DESCRIBE vyombo vya habari. Kamwe seva ya kimataifa kwenye injini ya pamoja au msingi wa mizizi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One single-database dump inside a generation."
msgstr "Moja ya msingi wa data ndani ya kizazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One standard path lowers cognitive load."
msgstr "Njia moja ya kawaida hupunguza mzigo wa utambuzi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One sweep proves one architecture and claims nothing about the other, which is the defect 0001 was written against."
msgstr "Moja sweep inathibitisha usanifu mmoja na kudai chochote kuhusu mwingine, ambayo ni kasoro 0001 Imeandikwa dhidi yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One sweep proves one distribution and claims nothing about the other four, while reporting green."
msgstr "Kufagia moja inathibitisha usambazaji mmoja na kudai chochote kuhusu wengine wanne, wakati wa kuripoti kijani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One table per role is what makes the rules composable. A fragment replaces its own table and touches no other, so two roles on one host neither overwrite nor merge into each other, and a broken fragment fails alone instead of freezing everyone's rules."
msgstr "Sehemu moja kwa kila jukumu ni nini hufanya sheria ziwe rahisi. Kipande kinachukua nafasi ya meza yake mwenyewe na haigusa mwingine, kwa hivyo majukumu mawili kwa mwenyeji mmoja sio kuandika au kuunganisha ndani, na kipande kilichovunjika kinashindwa peke yake badala ya kufungia sheria za kila mtu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One table per role is what makes the rules composable. A fragment replaces its own table and touches no other, so two roles on one host neither overwrite nor merge into each other, and a broken fragment fails alone instead of freezing everyone’s rules."
msgstr "Sehemu moja kwa kila jukumu ni nini hufanya sheria ziwe rahisi. Kipande kinachukua nafasi ya meza yake mwenyewe na hakigusa mtu mwingine, kwa hivyo majukumu mawili kwa mwenyeji mmoja sio kuandika au kuunganisha ndani, na kipande kilichovunjika kinashindwa peke yake badala ya kufungia sheria za kila mtu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One translation per source, ``None`` where it was discarded, plus the counts that say which of the two reasons applied. The counts belong to this call: lanes share the client, so a field on the client would mix another catalog's numbers into this one's."
msgstr "Tafsiri moja kwa moja kutoka chanzo kimoja, ``None`` ambapo iliondolewa, pamoja na makosa ambayo yanasema ni ipi kati ya sababu mbili zilizotumika. Makosa ni ya simu hii: lanes kushiriki mteja, hivyo shamba juu ya mteja ingekuwa kuchanganya namba nyingine catalog katika hii moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One-level-deep entry under a cli/ directory."
msgstr "Kuingia kwa ngazi moja chini ya cli / saraka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One-liners such as a single `command:` or a short `shell:` pipeline MAY stay inline. The rule targets bodies that are themselves a program, not every shell call."
msgstr "Kwa mfano, wapo watu ambao `command:` au kwa kifupi `shell:` Mafuta ya nguruwe yanaweza kudumu. Kanuni malengo miili ambayo ni wenyewe mpango, si kila shell wito."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "One-shot containers (matomo bootstrap, erpnext configurator, shopware init). They exit 0 and must never be respawned."
