# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only a clean sweep of successes retires the suite. A shard that failed, was cancelled, timed out or skipped did not run through, and a run that holds no job for the suite at all never started it -- none of those is evidence the suite is good, so the retrigger keeps asking for it."
msgstr "Ni mafanikio ya pekee ambayo yanaondoa nafasi ya ushindi. Shadi ambayo ilishindwa, ilifutwa, kupitiwa au kuruka haikupita, na kukimbia ambayo haina kazi kwa Suite kamwe haikuanza - hakuna hata moja ya hizo ni ushahidi wa suite ni nzuri, hivyo retrigger anaendelea kuomba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only a message that is nothing but the name qualifies. Inside a sentence the name is protected by the span machinery in :mod:`utils.i18n.placeholders`, and the sentence around it still needs translating."
msgstr "Ni ujumbe tu ambao ni kitu lakini jina linastahili. Ndani ya sentensi, jina linahifadhiwa na mashine ya span katika :mod:`utils.i18n.placeholders`, Hata hivyo, tafsiri yake bado inahitaji tafsiri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only a role that declares nothing falls back on its shape: a stack role (ships a compose template) is offered ``compose`` and ``swarm``, anything else is offered ``host``."
msgstr "Jukumu tu ambalo linatangaza hakuna kurudi nyuma katika sura yake: jukumu la stack (Chombo cha kutengeneza template) zinazotolewa na ``compose`` Aidha, na ``swarm``, Kitu kingine chochote kinachotolewa ``host``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only delete packages whose name starts with `<prefix>/`"
msgstr "Tu kufuta faili ambayo jina lake huanza na `<prefix>/`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only enable WebSocket proxying (`ws.conf.j2`) for routes that actually require it, to avoid breaking buffering for standard HTTP."
msgstr "Tu kuwezesha WebSocket Wakala (`ws.conf.j2`) Kwa njia ambazo zinahitaji, ili kuepuka kuvunja buffering kwa HTTP ya kawaida."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only exact ``==`` pins are collected. A range or a VCS reference states an intent this cannot second-guess."
msgstr "Kuwa sahihi ``==`` Pins zinakusanywa. Aina au kumbukumbu ya VCS inasema nia hii haiwezi kuwa ya pili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only go back to `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<roles> full_cycle=true` if you have concrete evidence that the inventory or host stack is broken, or you intentionally need a fresh single-app baseline again."
msgstr "Tu kwenda nyuma `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<roles> full_cycle=true` Ikiwa una ushahidi halisi kwamba hesabu au stack ya mwenyeji imevunjwa, au unahitaji kwa makusudi msingi mpya wa programu moja tena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only literal `https://<host>` tokens count as external assets:"
msgstr "Moja kwa moja `https://<host>` Fedha za kigeni zinahesabiwa kama mali ya nje:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only one swarm cluster fits per worktree: the lab subnet is pinned to the worktree slot (`INFINITO_SWARM_LAB_SUBNET` in `scripts/system/worktree/up.sh`), so a second cluster in the same worktree fails at network creation with `invalid pool request: Pool overlaps`. `swarm-zombie` therefore reclaims whatever holds that subnet before it starts (`utils/clean/lab_subnet.sh`), so a cluster kept with `keep=true` survives only until the next swarm run in the same worktree. Inspect a kept cluster before starting the next run. Parallel clusters need separate worktrees (`make worktree-up`), which carry distinct lab octets and are left untouched by the reclaim; `make swarm-clean` is the deliberate exception that clears every worktree's clusters."
msgstr "Kundi moja tu la nzige linafaa kwa kila mti wa kazi: subnet ya maabara imewekwa kwenye yanayopangwa ya worktree (`INFINITO_SWARM_LAB_SUBNET` Ndani ya `scripts/system/worktree/up.sh`), hivyo nguzo ya pili katika kazi hiyo inashindwa katika uumbaji wa mtandao na `invalid pool request: Pool overlaps`... `swarm-zombie` Hivyo basi, ni lazima kila kitu kibadilike kabla ya kuanza. (`utils/clean/lab_subnet.sh`)Kwa hiyo, kundi la `keep=true` Huishi tu mpaka kundi la pili liende kwenye mti ule ule. Kutarajia kikundi kilichohifadhiwa kabla ya kuanza kukimbia ijayo. Vikundi vya Parallel vinahitaji kazi tofauti (`make worktree-up`)Na mwenye kuepushwa uchoyo wa nafsi yake, basi hao ndio wenye kufanikiwa. `make swarm-clean` Ni ubaguzi wa kimakusudi unaoweka wazi makundi yote ya kazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Only return to `mode=reinstall` when you have concrete evidence that the inventory or the host stack itself is broken (for example DNS or network failures during the deploy)."
msgstr "Kurudi tu `mode=reinstall` Ikiwa una ushahidi thabiti kwamba hesabu au stack ya mwenyeji yenyewe imevunjwa (DNS au makosa ya mtandao wakati wa kupeleka)..."

