msgstr "OpenClaw hutumia MCP. Kila sehemu ya seva iliyoshirikiwa ya MCP imegunduliwa kupitia ``MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS`` Imeandikwa katika muundo wa wakala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenClaw exposes no administrator-visible list of configured MCP servers, so the configured set is proven by a CLI test instead: [`files/test/test.sh`](./files/test/test.sh) probes the agent's `mcp` surface and fails when the exec itself fails or the output carries a `failed to start server` line. The Playwright spec covers the complementary case, that the gateway holding the MCP credentials refuses an unauthenticated caller."
msgstr "OpenClaw inaweka orodha isiyoonekana ya seva za MCP zilizopangwa, kwa hivyo seti iliyowekwa imethibitishwa na mtihani wa CLI badala yake: [`files/test/test.sh`](./files/test/test.sh) Uchunguzi wa Agent `mcp` ya juu na ya chini, ikiwa ni pamoja na kushindwa au kushindwa kwa `failed to start server` Mstari wa. spec ya Playwright inashughulikia kesi ya ziada, kwamba lango linaloshikilia sifa za MCP linakataa wito usio na maana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenClaw exposes no administrator-visible list of configured MCP servers, so the configured set is proven by a CLI test instead: ```files/test/test.sh`` <./files/test/test.sh>`__ probes the agent’s ``mcp`` surface and fails when the exec itself fails or the output carries a ``failed to start server`` line. The Playwright spec covers the complementary case, that the gateway holding the MCP credentials refuses an unauthenticated caller."
msgstr "OpenClaw inaweka orodha isiyoonekana ya seva za MCP zilizopangwa, kwa hivyo seti iliyowekwa imethibitishwa na mtihani wa CLI badala yake: ```files/test/test.sh`` <./files/test/test.sh>`__ probes the agent’s ``mcp`` surface and fails when the exec itself fails or the output carries a ``failed to start server`` Mstari wa. spec ya Playwright inashughulikia kesi ya ziada, kwamba lango linaloshikilia sifa za MCP linakataa wito usio na maana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenClaw's own CLI reference says so directly: `openclaw mcp serve` \"starts a stdio MCP server\" whose process \"the MCP client owns\". Every HTTP transport in that document belongs to the opposite direction, `openclaw mcp add --url --transport streamable-http`, which is OpenClaw acting as a client. Hermes is the same shape: both entry points, `mcp_serve.py` and `agent/transports/hermes_tools_mcp_server.py`, run the MCP SDK's stdio transport, the repository defines neither `run_streamable_http_async` nor `sse_app`, and the user-facing MCP guide describes only Hermes consuming external servers."
msgstr "Maelezo ya CLI ya OpenClaw inasema hivyo moja kwa moja: `openclaw mcp serve` \"Kuanzisha server ya MCP\" Mchakato ambao \"Kampuni ya MCP inamiliki\"Kila usafiri wa HTTP katika hati hiyo ni wa mwelekeo mwingine, `openclaw mcp add --url --transport streamable-http`, ambayo ni OpenClaw Kufanya kazi kama mteja. Hermes ni sura sawa: pointi zote mbili za kuingia, `mcp_serve.py` Aidha, na `agent/transports/hermes_tools_mcp_server.py`, kukimbia usafiri wa stdio ya MCP SDK, hifadhi haifafanua `run_streamable_http_async` Na wala hakuna cha `sse_app`, na mwongozo wa MCP unaotumia mtumiaji inaelezea Hermes tu kuteketeza seva za nje."

