# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenTalk authenticates users against the central Keycloak realm via OIDC and looks up users via the Keycloak admin Web API (`keycloak_webapi` backend). OpenLDAP feeds OpenTalk transitively through Keycloak's federation."
msgstr "OpenTalk inathibitisha watumiaji dhidi ya kuu Keycloak kupitia OIDC na kuangalia watumiaji kupitia Keycloak Mtandao wa admin API (`keycloak_webapi` Kurudi nyuma). Chakula cha OpenLDAP OpenTalk Usafiri kupitia Keycloakya Muungano."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenTalk authenticates users via OIDC and resolves invitee searches via `https://<keycloak>/admin/realms/<realm>/users?search=…`."
msgstr "OpenTalk inathibitisha watumiaji kupitia OIDC na kutatua utafutaji wa kukaribisha kupitia `https://<keycloak>/admin/realms/<realm>/users?search=…`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "OpenTalk does not open LDAP connections itself. It relies on Keycloak's LDAP federation (`svc-db-openldap` is mapped into the central Keycloak realm) and queries Keycloak's admin Web API for user lookups. This avoids dual-source-of-truth problems and keeps LDAP credentials away from the OpenTalk service account."
msgstr "OpenTalk haina kufungua uhusiano wa LDAP yenyewe. Inategemea juu ya KeycloakMuungano wa LDAP (`svc-db-openldap` Imewekwa kwenye Central Keycloak Mkoa wa) Maswali ya kuuliza KeycloakMtandao wa admin API kwa ajili ya kuangalia watumiaji. Hii inaepuka matatizo mawili ya chanzo cha ukweli na inaweka sifa za LDAP mbali na OpenTalk Akaunti ya huduma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
