# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operating-system package managers such as [apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) and [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) keep installed software in sync with their upstream distribution repositories. Each one ships with a different command surface but they all serve the same goal: refresh the index and upgrade every installed package on the host."
msgstr "Wasimamizi wa mfumo wa uendeshaji kama vile [Kuwa](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), Kwa hivyo, [wa](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) Aidha, na [ya ya](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) Weka programu iliyowekwa kwa kushirikiana na hazina zao za usambazaji wa upstream. Kila meli moja na uso tofauti wa amri lakini wote hutumikia lengo moja: burudisha index na kuboresha kila mfuko uliowekwa kwenye jeshi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
