# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux and Debian-based systems, this role ensures the presence of Node.js for use in Node-based applications or scripts. It serves as a foundational role for projects that depend on Node.js runtimes or utilities like Puppeteer."
msgstr "Imeboreshwa kwa mifumo ya msingi ya Archlinux na Debian, jukumu hili linahakikisha kuwepo kwa Node.js kwa ajili ya matumizi katika Node-msingi maombi au scripts. Ni wajibu wa msingi kwa miradi inayotegemea Node.js matumizi au huduma kama vile Puppeteer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux environments, this role provides a lightweight, reliable solution for serving static websites. It automatically configures NGINX to serve files from a predefined directory, sets up secure HTTPS connections, and includes support for `.well-known` paths required by ACME challenges."
msgstr "Imeboreshwa kwa mazingira ya Archlinux, jukumu hili hutoa suluhisho nyepesi, la kuaminika kwa kutumikia tovuti za tuli. Inasanidi moja kwa moja NGINX kutumikia faili kutoka kwa saraka iliyotanguliwa, inaweka uunganisho salama wa HTTPS, na inajumuisha msaada wa faili. `.well-known` Changamoto zinazohitajika na ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux environments, this role provides a lightweight, reliable solution for serving static websites. It automatically configures NGINX to serve files from a predefined directory, sets up secure HTTPS connections, and includes support for ``.well-known`` paths required by ACME challenges."
msgstr "Imeboreshwa kwa mazingira ya Archlinux, jukumu hili hutoa suluhisho nyepesi, la kuaminika kwa kutumikia tovuti za tuli. Inasanidi moja kwa moja NGINX kutumikia faili kutoka kwa saraka iliyotanguliwa, inaweka uunganisho salama wa HTTPS, na inajumuisha msaada wa faili. ``.well-known`` Changamoto zinazohitajika na ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux systems, this role installs the ``certbot-NGINX`` package, configures a dedicated ``systemd`` service for certificate renewal, and integrates with a ``sys-timer`` to schedule periodic renewals. After a renewal, NGINX is reloaded to apply the updated certificates immediately."
msgstr "Imeboreshwa kwa mifumo ya Archlinux, jukumu hili linaweka ``certbot-NGINX`` Mpango huo, unaunganisha ``systemd`` Huduma kwa ajili ya upya wa hati, na kuunganisha na ``sys-timer`` Kuandaa mipango ya muda. Baada ya upya, NGINX imepakiwa tena ili kutumia vyeti vilivyosasishwa mara moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux systems, this role installs the `certbot-NGINX` package, configures a dedicated `systemd` service for certificate renewal, and integrates with a `sys-timer` to schedule periodic renewals. After a renewal, NGINX is reloaded to apply the updated certificates immediately."
msgstr "Imeboreshwa kwa mifumo ya Archlinux, jukumu hili linaweka `certbot-NGINX` Mpango huo, unaunganisha `systemd` Huduma kwa ajili ya upya wa hati, na kuunganisha na `sys-timer` Kuandaa mipango ya muda. Baada ya upya, NGINX imepakiwa tena ili kutumia vyeti vilivyosasishwa mara moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux, this role configures NGINX to act as a lightweight and efficient file server. It ensures that files are served securely, with optional directory browsing enabled, and proper MIME type handling for standard web clients."
msgstr "Imeboreshwa kwa Archlinux, jukumu hili linasanidi NGINX kufanya kazi kama seva ya faili nyepesi na yenye ufanisi. Inahakikisha kwamba faili zinahudumiwa salama, na mipangilio ya saraka ya hiari imewezeshwa, na utunzaji sahihi wa aina ya MIME kwa wateja wa kawaida wa wavuti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux, this role creates the required directory structure, installs and configures the sys-ctl-hlth-check script, and integrates with the **sys-ctl-alm-telegram** role. It uses the **sys-timer** role to schedule regular checks based on your customizable `OnCalendar` setting."
msgstr "Imeboreshwa kwa Archlinux, jukumu hili linaunda muundo wa saraka unaohitajika, kufunga na kusanidi script ya sys-ctl-hlth-check, na inaunganisha na muundo wa saraka unaohitajika, **sys-ctl-alm-telegram** majukumu yake. Inatumia matumizi ya **sys-timer** Jukumu la kupanga hundi za kawaida kulingana na mipangilio yako ya customizable `OnCalendar` utekelezaji."

