msgid "Providers are narrowed to ``application_closure(deployment.whitelist)``, the same set ``sys-service-loader`` preloads from. Inventory membership, ``group_names`` and the raw whitelist all admit roles the run never deploys, and a client then carries an endpoint nothing is serving. In compose the closure covers everything present, so only swarm makes the difference visible."
