# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Provision a SAML client in Keycloak (extend `roles/web-app-keycloak`'s client-provisioning logic which currently only handles OIDC clients). Attribute mappers, SP-metadata import, signing certificate alignment."
msgstr "Kutoa huduma kwa wateja katika Keycloak (Urefu wa urefu `roles/web-app-keycloak`Mtazamo wa wateja ambao kwa sasa unashughulikia wateja wa OIDC). Kutimiza mappers, SP-metadata kuagiza, usajili wa cheti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Provision and activate"
msgstr "Usajili na Usajili"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Provision runner instances on the target host."
msgstr "Uwasilishaji wa matukio ya mkimbiaji kwenye mwenyeji wa lengo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Provision the node onion address into ``services.tor.node``."
msgstr "Kutoa anwani ya node kwenye ``services.tor.node``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning fills a missing credential and leaves an existing one alone. That keeps a redeploy stable, and it also means no deploy ever runs against a secret that moved: every pass reads the value the first pass wrote. Dropping the generated values and regenerating them between two deploy passes turns the second pass into a test of the update path, where each role has to push its new secret into the application and the database it already created."
msgstr "Kulisha kujaza ukosefu wa imani na kuacha moja iliyopo peke yake. Hiyo inaweka utulivu wa redeploy, na pia ina maana hakuna kupeleka daima anaendesha dhidi ya siri kwamba wakiongozwa: kila kupita kusoma thamani ya kwanza kupita aliandika. Kuondoa maadili yanayotokana na kuzalisha tena kati ya kupita kwa kupeleka mbili hugeuka kupita ya pili katika mtihani wa njia ya update, ambapo kila jukumu lina kushinikiza siri yake mpya katika programu na database ambayo tayari imeunda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning is best effort: a host that cannot reach PyPI must not fail the whole gate. scripts/lint/sql.sh skips loudly instead."
msgstr "Utoaji ni jitihada bora: mwenyeji ambaye hawezi kufikia PyPI haipaswi kushindwa lango lote. scripts/lint/sql.sh Badala yake, bonyeza kitufe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning is best effort: a host that cannot reach the npm registry must not fail the whole gate. scripts/lint/css.sh skips loudly instead."
msgstr "Utoaji ni jitihada bora: mwenyeji ambaye hawezi kufikia Usajili wa Npm haipaswi kushindwa lango lote. scripts/lint/css.sh Badala yake, bonyeza kitufe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning is best effort: a host without PHP, or one that cannot install it, must not fail the whole gate. scripts/lint/php.sh skips loudly instead."
msgstr "Utoaji ni jitihada bora: mwenyeji bila PHP, au moja ambayo haiwezi kufunga, haipaswi kushindwa lango lote. scripts/lint/php.sh Badala yake, bonyeza kitufe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning is best effort: a host without Ruby, or one that cannot install it, must not fail the whole gate. scripts/lint/ruby.sh skips loudly instead."
msgstr "Utoaji ni jitihada bora: mwenyeji bila Ruby, au mtu ambaye hawezi kufunga, haipaswi kushindwa lango lote. scripts/lint/ruby.sh Badala yake, bonyeza kitufe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning runs in ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml``: it copies the plugin into the code volume, runs ``admin/cli/upgrade.php``, enables ``enablewebservices``, appends ``mcp`` to ``webserviceprotocols``, creates the ``infinito_mcp`` external service, attaches the read-only functions, mints the permanent token and stores it under ``users.administrator.tokens['web-app-moodle']``."
msgstr "Utekelezaji unaendelea katika ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml``: Inapakia Plugin kwenye kiasi cha msimbo, inaendesha ``admin/cli/upgrade.php``, kuwezesha ``enablewebservices``, Mapendekezo ya ``mcp`` Kwa kuwa ``webserviceprotocols``, Kwa kuumba ``infinito_mcp`` Huduma ya nje, huunganisha kazi za kusoma tu, huingiza ishara ya kudumu na kuiweka chini ``users.administrator.tokens['web-app-moodle']``..."

