# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Pruning walks whatever edges the resolver reports; it never inspects `enabled` for the hard-vs-conditional distinction. A literal `enabled: true` dependency (e.g. `web-app-keycloak → svc-db-postgres`) is kept only while its declaring node stays reachable. If the declaring node is cut or orphaned and no surviving node pulls the dependency, it is pruned too."
msgstr "Pruning anatembea chochote makali ripoti resolver; kamwe ukaguzi `enabled` Kwa ajili ya tofauti ya kawaida-vs. Moja kwa moja `enabled: true` utegemezi wa utegemezi (ya g. `web-app-keycloak → svc-db-postgres`) Ni wakati huo tu ndipo ahadi yake itakapotimizwa. Ikiwa node ya kutangaza imekatwa au yatima na hakuna node ya kuishi huvuta utegemezi, pia hupogoa."

