msgstr "Bure kabisa na ya bure. Kila uchunguzi malengo kitanzi nyuma INSIDE chombo, hivyo inathibitisha kwamba chombo hiki mtumishi, si kwamba baadhi replica mahali fulani anafanya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Pure data in, pure data out, so the reporting is testable without an Ansible connection."
msgstr "Data safi katika, data safi nje, hivyo taarifa ni mtihani bila uhusiano Ansible."

