msgid "Run `make install-alias` to install the aliases into your shell config; afterwards open a new shell or `source ~/.bashrc`."
msgstr "Kuendesha gari `make install-alias` Kuweka aliases katika config yako ya shell; baadaye kufungua shell mpya au `source ~/.bashrc`..."

