# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the role's deployed backup unit against the live data."
msgstr "Tumia kitengo cha Backup cha jukumu dhidi ya data ya kuishi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential `backup-nfs-to-local` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (`rsync -a --delete`, with the shared `<state>/backup` root protected from deletion and never copied in). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Tumia script; kwanza inaanza kitengo cha Backup cha jukumu (Tofauti mpya `backup-nfs-to-local` kizazi cha usafirishaji wa moja kwa moja), Baada ya hapo, bonyeza kitufe cha kuingia kwenye lengo. (`rsync -a --delete`, Pamoja na kuwa pamoja `<state>/backup` Ulinzi kutoka kwa kufuta na kamwe kunakiliwa)... `--no-safety-backup` Kuruka kitengo kukimbia wakati lengo haina thamani ya kuokoa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume's mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (`rsync -a --delete`). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Tumia script; kwanza inaanza kitengo cha Backup cha jukumu (kizazi kipya cha baudolo ya kila kiasi na database), hutatua mlima wa kiasi na huangalia snapshot ndani yake (`rsync -a --delete`)... `--no-safety-backup` Kuruka kitengo kukimbia wakati lengo haina thamani ya kuokoa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential ``backup-nfs-to-local`` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (``rsync -a --delete``, with the shared ``<state>/backup`` root protected from deletion and never copied in). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Tumia script; kwanza inaanza kitengo cha Backup cha jukumu (Tofauti mpya ``backup-nfs-to-local`` kizazi cha usafirishaji wa moja kwa moja), Baada ya hapo, bonyeza kitufe cha kuingia kwenye lengo. (``rsync -a --delete``, Pamoja na kuwa pamoja ``<state>/backup`` Ulinzi kutoka kwa kufuta na kamwe kunakiliwa)... ``--no-safety-backup`` Kuruka kitengo kukimbia wakati lengo haina thamani ya kuokoa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume’s mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (``rsync -a --delete``). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Tumia script; kwanza inaanza kitengo cha Backup cha jukumu (kizazi kipya cha baudolo ya kila kiasi na database), hutatua mlima wa kiasi na huangalia snapshot ndani yake (``rsync -a --delete``)... ``--no-safety-backup`` Kuruka kitengo kukimbia wakati lengo haina thamani ya kuokoa."

