# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swap size is a **fixed constant**, not a \"free space minus buffer\" calculation. An earlier version took ~99 GB on a 145 GB root partition, leaving so little headroom that later Docker layer writes (Playwright test image pull) failed with `no space left on device`. A fixed cap is large enough to absorb the peertube spike and small enough that Docker layer writes keep succeeding throughout the 30+ min deploy."
msgstr "Ukubwa wa faili ni A **Kuwa endelevu**Sio ya A \"Nafasi ya bure ya nafasi ya minus buffer\" hesabu. Nakala ya awali ilichapishwa99 GB juu ya A 145 Sehemu ya mizizi ya GB, ikiacha chumba kidogo cha kichwa ambacho baadaye safu ya Docker inaandika (Picha ya majaribio ya Playwright) Kushindwa kwa `no space left on device`. Cap fasta ni kubwa ya kutosha kunyonya spike rikatube na ndogo ya kutosha kwamba Docker safu anaandika kuendelea kufanikiwa katika yote. 30+ Mgawanyiko."

