# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - `<stack>_<service_key>`, matching how Docker Swarm names every service and how `container service ps` accepts them. The stack name is derived from ``application_id`` via the ``get_entity_name`` filter, mirroring how ``docker stack deploy`` composes the stack name in ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."
msgstr "Hali ya hewa - `<stack>_<service_key>`, Kulinganisha jinsi Docker Swarm majina yote ya kazi na jinsi ya `container service ps` kuwakubali. Jina lake la kuzaliwa limetokana na ``application_id`` Kwa njia ya ``get_entity_name`` filter ing Angalia jinsi ``docker stack deploy`` Ingiza jina la kikundi katika ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - a shell subshell that resolves the running task's container ID at exec time, e.g. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Swarm names every service ``<stack>_<key>`` and accepts no prefix matching; the helper composes that name from STACK and SERVICE_KEY args. The subshell defers resolution to the moment of exec, avoiding the stale ID and parse-time-failure pitfalls of returning a resolved value at vars-resolution time."
msgstr "Mode Swarm - subshell ya shell ambayo inatatua ID ya chombo cha kazi ya kuendesha wakati wa exec, kwa mfano. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Majina ya watumishi wote ``<stack>_<key>`` Hakuna haja ya kutaja jina la mwenye kupokea maombi hayo. SERVICE_KEY ya dharura. Subshell defers azimio kwa wakati wa exec, kuepuka stale ID na parse-wakati kushindwa mitego ya kurudi thamani kutatuliwa katika muda vars-resolution."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - the same reference, prefixed with the in-cluster registry host:port (e.g. ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) when ``swarm.registry.host`` and ``swarm.registry.port`` are set. With no registry configured, swarm falls back to the un-prefixed form."
msgstr "Njia ya Swarm - kumbukumbu sawa, iliyowekwa na mwenyeji wa Usajili wa Ndani:port (ya g. ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) Wakati ambapo wakati ``swarm.registry.host`` Aidha, na ``swarm.registry.port`` zinaandaliwa. Na hakuna usajili configured, swarm kuanguka nyuma ya fomu un-prefixed."

