# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Thank you for contributing to a safe and inclusive Infinito.Nexus community!"
msgstr "Shukrani kwa ajili ya kuchangia katika usalama na umoja Infinito.Nexus Jumuiya ya Kimataifa!"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "That choice is wrong in two directions at once. A prompt that needs a large context window reaches a model that cannot hold it, which is how [`web-app-hermes`](../../roles/web-app-hermes/) answers HTTP 500 when the agent model declares fewer than 64000 tokens. And a one-line factual question reaches whatever the deploy happened to pick, which is usually the largest model available."
msgstr "Chaguo hili ni sahihi kwa njia mbili. Haraka ambayo inahitaji dirisha kubwa la muktadha hufikia mfano ambao hauwezi kushikilia, ambayo ni jinsi [`web-app-hermes`](../../roles/web-app-hermes/) Majibu ya HTTP 500 Wakati wa kufanya kazi kwa ufanisi zaidi kuliko 64000 ya sh. Na swali moja la kweli linafikia chochote matumizi yaliyotokea kuchukua, ambayo kwa kawaida ni mfano mkubwa unaopatikana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "That contract is wrong for one class of failure. When a value could not be measured and substituting one would be a guess, silence turns a loud stop into a wrong number nobody sees. Such a failure raises from here and every render layer re-raises it untouched."
msgstr "Mkataba huu ni mbaya kwa darasa moja la kushindwa. Wakati thamani haikuweza kupimwa na kuimarisha mtu itakuwa nadhani, ukimya hugeuka sauti kubwa katika idadi isiyo sahihi hakuna mtu anaona. Hii ina maana kwamba kila kitu kinafanywa kwa njia isiyo ya moja kwa moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "That file brings the client to its desired MCP state from scratch, so the same file serves the role's own run and this one. `tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_client_entrypoint.py` fails when a client role lacks it."
msgstr "Faili hiyo huleta mteja kwa hali yake ya MCP kutoka mwanzo, kwa hivyo faili hiyo hutumikia kukimbia kwa jukumu mwenyewe na hii. `tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_client_entrypoint.py` kushindwa kufanya kazi wakati mfanyakazi anashindwa kufanya hivyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "That file brings the client to its desired MCP state from scratch, so the same file serves the role’s own run and this one. ``tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_client_entrypoint.py`` fails when a client role lacks it."
msgstr "Faili hiyo huleta mteja kwa hali yake ya MCP kutoka mwanzo, kwa hivyo faili hiyo hutumikia kukimbia kwa jukumu mwenyewe na hii. ``tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_client_entrypoint.py`` kushindwa kufanya kazi wakati mfanyakazi anashindwa kufanya hivyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "That is also what a retrigger replays: `--failed` reads the glyphs off the failed job's title and writes them back as a token, so the row comes back in the mode, onion state, distribution and architecture it died on rather than on whatever the rotation would pick next. The architecture is replayed because it is the machine the job ran on, not a preference it could fall back from. The filesystem is deliberately left out. A title states the kind the matrix *assigned*, which a deploy is allowed to fall back from, so pinning it would both misstate what the job ran on and turn the kind into a demand, failing the retrigger on the very condition the fallback absorbs."
msgstr "Hii pia ni nini retrigger replays: `--failed` Kusoma glyphs mbali cheo cha kazi kushindwa na kuandika yao nyuma kama ishara, hivyo mstari huja nyuma katika mode, onion hali, usambazaji na usanifu alikufa badala ya chochote mzunguko ingekuwa pick ijayo. Usanifu ni replayed kwa sababu ni mashine kazi mbio juu, si upendeleo inaweza kuanguka nyuma kutoka. Mfumo wa faili umeondolewa kwa makusudi. Jina linaelezea aina ya matrix *Waliochaguliwa*, ambayo kupelekwa kuruhusiwa kuanguka nyuma kutoka, hivyo pinning itakuwa wote misstate nini kazi ran juu na kugeuka aina katika mahitaji, kushindwa retrigger juu ya hali hasa kuanguka inachukua."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "That is what stops the supervisor flow rather than effort. Flowise reaches an MCP server over the container network, and a stdio server has no address there: the client spawns and owns the process, so a shared endpoint two consumers could hold at once does not exist, and the deploy-time contract probe would consume the only session. Wrapping each agent in a stdio-to-HTTP bridge would put an unreviewed process on the platform's most privileged path — an agent with tool access — to work around a transport upstream has not shipped, which is the workaround this project refuses. Re-review when either upstream serves MCP over HTTP."
msgstr "Hiyo ndiyo inayozuia mtiririko wa usimamizi badala ya jitihada. Flowise hufikia seva ya MCP juu ya mtandao wa chombo, na seva ya stdio haina anwani huko: mazao ya mteja na inamiliki mchakato, kwa hivyo sehemu ya mwisho ya watumiaji wawili inaweza kushikilia mara moja haipo, na uchunguzi wa mkataba wa muda wa kupeleka utatumia kikao tu. Kuingiza kila wakala katika daraja la stdio-to-HTTP ingeweka mchakato usiopitiwa kwenye njia ya pekee ya jukwaa - wakala aliye na upatikanaji wa chombo - kufanya kazi karibu na mto wa usafiri haujasafirishwa, ambayo ni kazi ya mradi huu inakataa. Mapitio ya upya wakati upstream hutumikia MCP juu ya HTTP."

