# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The 2.7.0 image ships 23 tool categories, which are application names (``calendar``, ``files``, ``mail``, ``talk``, …) rather than operations: each bundles its read and its write tools, and the hub offers no setting that removes only the mutating ones. Enabling the ExApp writes ``true`` for every category absent from ``tool_status``, so the hub itself serves all of them, write tools included."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa 2.7.0 Picha ya meli 23 Aina za zana, ambazo ni majina ya maombi (``calendar``, Kwa hivyo, ``files``, Kwa hivyo, ``mail``, Kwa hivyo, ``talk``...) Badala ya shughuli: kila kifungu kinasoma na zana zake za kuandika, na kitovu haitoi kuweka ambayo huondoa tu wale wanaobadilisha. Kuwezesha ExApp Kuandika ``true`` kwa kila kundi la watu wasio na ``tool_status``, Kwa hiyo, kitovu yenyewe hutumikia wote, kuandika zana zilizojumuishwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The 2.7.0 image ships 23 tool categories, which are application names (`calendar`, `files`, `mail`, `talk`, …) rather than operations: each bundles its read and its write tools, and the hub offers no setting that removes only the mutating ones. Enabling the ExApp writes `true` for every category absent from `tool_status`, so the hub itself serves all of them, write tools included."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa 2.7.0 Picha ya meli 23 Aina za zana, ambazo ni majina ya maombi (`calendar`, Kwa hivyo, `files`, Kwa hivyo, `mail`, Kwa hivyo, `talk`...) Badala ya shughuli: kila kifungu kinasoma na zana zake za kuandika, na kitovu haitoi kuweka ambayo huondoa tu wale wanaobadilisha. Kuwezesha ExApp Kuandika `true` kwa kila kundi la watu wasio na `tool_status`, Kwa hiyo, kitovu yenyewe hutumikia wote, kuandika zana zilizojumuishwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The API has no authentication tier: it serves public repository data only, so SSO and logout are disabled and the Playwright persona scenarios are declared blocked for ``biber`` and ``administrator``."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa API haina kiwango cha uthibitishaji: hutumikia data ya uhifadhi wa umma tu, kwa hivyo SSO na logout ni walemavu na hali ya mtu wa Playwright inatangazwa imefungwa kwa ``biber`` Aidha, na ``administrator``..."

