# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC login entry points (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) are mandatory because they gate SSO login: when one of them is the selected flavor and the system hides the native login form, an un-installed OIDC app leaves the instance with no usable login path. Failing at install time surfaces the version-pin mismatch immediately rather than as a downstream login timeout in the Playwright e2e suite."
msgstr "Maelezo ya kuingia ya OIDC (`oidc_login`, Kwa hivyo, `sociallogin`, Kwa hivyo, `user_oidc`) ni lazima kwa sababu wao lango SSO login: wakati mmoja wao ni ladha kuchaguliwa na mfumo kujificha asili login fomu, un-installed OIDC programu majani mfano na hakuna usable kuingia njia. Kushindwa wakati wa kufunga uso wa toleo-pin mismatch mara moja badala ya kama muda wa kuingia chini katika Playwright e2ya Suite."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC role's `groups_claim` (JSON-pointer capable) names the claim holding the user's groups; those values resolve against identity groups of `type=external` via group aliases on the auth mount, which carry the policies."
msgstr "Jukumu la OIDC `groups_claim` (JSON-mwenye uwezo) majina ya madai kushikilia makundi ya mtumiaji; maadili hayo kutatua dhidi ya makundi ya utambulisho wa `type=external` Kupitia kikundi aliases juu ya mlima auth, ambayo kubeba sera."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC username claim is paired with the LDAP login attribute by design. See [ldap.md](ldap.md) for the LDAP-side rule."
msgstr "Jina la mtumiaji wa OIDC limeunganishwa na sifa ya kuingia ya LDAP kwa kubuni. See ya [ldap.md](ldap.md) Kwa upande wa utawala wa Dk."

