# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is parsed with a plain-string line parser instead of PyYAML: the env build runs during bootstrap (make install-system-python) before any Python dependency exists, so this module must stay stdlib-only. Only plain ``KEY: \"value\"`` entries can be read this way; a Jinja expression or a missing key is a hard error."
msgstr "SPOT ni parsed na mstari wazi-string badala ya PyYAML: env kujenga anaendesha wakati bootstrap (Mfumo wa kufunga-python) Kabla ya utegemezi wowote wa Python kuwepo, kwa hivyo moduli hii inapaswa kukaa stdlib pekee. Ni wazi kuwa ``KEY: \"value\"`` Viingilio vinaweza kusomwa kwa njia hii; usemi wa Jinja au ufunguo wa kukosa ni kosa ngumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
