msgstr "Mkutano wa SSE unafanyika kwa njia ya ushirikiano Redis safu channel, hivyo mkondo na ujumbe post inaweza ardhi juu ya replicas tofauti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SSO (``sociallogin``) and LDAP (``user_ldap``) login surfaces are covered by the OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (requirements 017/018)."
msgstr "Ya SSO (``sociallogin``) Kwa upande wa (``user_ldap``) Vipengele vya kuingia vinafunikwa na specs za OIDC /LDAP Playwright (Mahitaji ya Mahitaji 017Kwa hivyo018)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SSO (`sociallogin`) and LDAP (`user_ldap`) login surfaces are covered by the OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (requirements 017/018)."
