# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SSO back-channel pin, added automatically. On an onion deployment the OIDC endpoints handed to an application are public ``.onion`` authorities. That is right for the browser, which reaches them through Tor, but unroutable for the application's own server-side calls (code-to-token exchange, JWKS, userinfo): a container resolves ``.onion`` through Tor's resolver, not through DNS. Pinning the provider to a reachable address sends those calls over the local network to the proxy that already serves the vhost. Skipped unless the application has SSO enabled and the provider vhost is an ``.onion`` name, so it is a no-op on clearnet."
msgstr "SSO nyuma-channel pin, aliongeza moja kwa moja. Juu ya kupelekwa kwa onion vituo vya mwisho vya OIDC iliyotolewa kwa maombi ni umma ``.onion`` mamlaka. Hiyo ni sawa kwa kivinjari, ambacho kinawafikia kupitia Tor, lakini haifai kwa simu za upande wa seva za programu (Kubadilishana kwa kificho, JWKS, mtumiajiinfo): Mkutano wa dharura ``.onion`` Kwa njia ya skanning, sio kupitia DNS. Pinning mtoa huduma kwa anwani inayoweza kufikiwa hutuma simu hizo juu ya mtandao wa ndani kwa wakala ambao tayari hutumikia vhost. Skipped isipokuwa programu ina SSO kuwezeshwa na mtoa huduma vhost ni ``.onion`` Jina la kikoa ni sawa na jina la kikoa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Sphinx configuration, extensions and generators live in [web-app-docs](../../roles/web-app-docs/). Deploy that role to build and serve the site."
msgstr "Configuration Sphinx, upanuzi na jenereta kuishi katika [web-app-docs](../../roles/web-app-docs/). Tumia jukumu hilo kujenga na kutumikia tovuti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check emits warning annotations for HTTP `429`, `500`, and `503` (rate-limited or temporarily unavailable) via [`utils.annotations.message`](../../../../utils/annotations/message.py)."
msgstr "Ufuatiliaji wa URL hutoa annotations ya onyo kwa HTTP `429`, Kwa hivyo, `500`, Aidha, na `503` (Kiwango cha chini au cha muda usiojulikana) Kwa kupitia [`utils.annotations.message`](../../../../utils/annotations/message.py)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check skips template placeholders and reserved local or example hosts such as `localhost` and `*.example`."
msgstr "Ufuatiliaji wa URL unaruka wamiliki wa mahali pa template na kuhifadhiwa wenyeji au mfano kama vile `localhost` Aidha, na `*.example`..."

