# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [`container/`](container/) subtree holds the in-container halves invoked by the host wrappers and follows the same verb/scope layout; see [container/](container/README.md)."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa [`container/`](container/) Subtree inashikilia nusu ya ndani iliyoombwa na wrappers mwenyeji na hufuata mpangilio sawa wa kitenzi / scope; angalia [Vyombo vya habari/](container/README.md)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [alias](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/alias) repository is the RECOMMENDED way to define CLI shortcuts so frequently used commands do not have to be retyped. The effective repository is the `INFINITO_ALIAS_REPOSITORY` value in the generated `.env`."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa [alias alias](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/alias) Uhifadhi ni njia iliyokamilishwa ya kufafanua njia za mkato za CLI ambazo mara nyingi hutumiwa amri hazihitaji kurejeshwa. Ufanisi wa kuhifadhi ni `INFINITO_ALIAS_REPOSITORY` Thamani katika uzalishaji `.env`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [lint.md](testing/lint.md) page covers repository-wide code quality expectations such as diff quality, maintainability, and conventions."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa [lint.md](testing/lint.md) ukurasa inashughulikia repository-wide code quality matarajio kama vile diff quality, kudumisha, na mikataba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [per-role meta layout](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) already lists `addons`, `plugins`, and `modules` among the keys *inlined* under the primary service entity. This requirement promotes that concept to a first-class, per-file `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` topic (one file per addon, file root IS the addon spec), the same move requirement 011 made for `meta/info.yml` and requirement 008/009 made for other meta topics."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa [Kiwango cha meta](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) Tayari orodha ya `addons`, Kwa hivyo, `plugins`, Aidha, na `modules` Miongoni mwa funguo *Inline ya* chini ya Idara ya Utumishi wa Umma. Mahitaji haya yanakuza dhana hiyo kwa darasa la kwanza, kwa faili `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` Mada ya mada (Faili moja kwa addon, mizizi ya faili ni spec ya addon)Mahitaji ya hatua sawa 011 kufanywa kwa ajili ya `meta/info.yml` Mahitaji ya 008Kwa hivyo009 Kuundwa kwa mada nyingine za meta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `.onion` is a **deploy-time input**: a CLI helper mints the v3 key offline during inventory build, vaults it, and sets `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`. It must NOT be a runtime fact — `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` is consumed at build time (LDAP base, CA, applications cache). The role restores the minted key into the hidden-service volume before Tor starts."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `.onion` Kuwa A **Uwasilishaji wa muda**Msaidizi wa CLI Mnts V3 muhimu nje ya mtandao wakati wa hesabu kujenga, kuba, na kuweka `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`. Hii haipaswi kuwa ukweli wa muda mrefu - `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` Inatumiwa wakati wa kujenga (Msingi wa LDAP, CA, matumizi ya cache). Jukumu linarejesha ufunguo uliopunguzwa katika kiasi cha huduma ya siri kabla ya Tor kuanza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `@playwright/test` version pinned into the rendered `package.json` comes from `playwright.version` in `roles/test-e2e-playwright/meta/services.yml` via the `image_version` filter. That YAML value is the single source of truth for the Playwright version."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `@playwright/test` Tafsiri ya Qur’ani Tukufu `package.json` Kutoka kwa `playwright.version` Ndani ya `roles/test-e2e-playwright/meta/services.yml` Kwa njia ya `image_version` ya filter. Thamani ya YAML ni chanzo kimoja cha ukweli kwa toleo la Playwright."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `API.cloudflare.api_token` value (declared in `group_vars/all/18_api.yml`, read via `lookup('api', 'cloudflare.api_token')`) must contain a valid Cloudflare API Token.   This token is used for all DNS operations and ACME (SSL/TLS certificate) challenges that require access to your Cloudflare-managed domains."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `API.cloudflare.api_token` Thamani ya Thamani (Imetangazwa katika `group_vars/all/18_api.yml`, Soma kupitia `lookup('api', 'cloudflare.api_token')`) Lazima uwe na Cloudflare halali API kuwa. Ishara hii inatumika kwa shughuli zote za DNS na ACME. (Cheti cha SSL / TLS) Changamoto ambazo zinahitaji upatikanaji wa vikoa vyako vinavyosimamiwa na Cloudflare."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `Bash(*)` allow grants broad access to the `docker` CLI (alongside every other shell command) under the assumption that no production containers share the host. Non-mutating-image subcommands (`rm`, `kill`, `stop`, `system prune`, `volume rm`, `cp`) can disrupt or destroy container state. Under test-only usage, the blast radius is bounded to ephemeral state that can be recreated from the compose stack."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `Bash(*)` Kuwezesha upatikanaji mkubwa wa `docker` CLI (pamoja na kila mmoja wa viongozi wa) Chini ya dhana kwamba hakuna vyombo vya uzalishaji vinavyoshiriki mwenyeji. Picha za chini zisizo za picha (`rm`, Kwa hivyo, `kill`, Kwa hivyo, `stop`, Kwa hivyo, `system prune`, Kwa hivyo, `volume rm`, Kwa hivyo, `cp`) Inaweza kuharibu au kuharibu mfumo wa mizizi. Chini ya matumizi ya mtihani tu, radius ya mlipuko imefungwa kwa hali ya ephemeral ambayo inaweza kutengenezwa kutoka kwa stack ya kutunga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `Bash(*)` allow lets the agent run any Makefile target without prompting. The `Makefile` is checked into git and reviewed on every pull request, so targets themselves are trusted. Every action a target performs still runs inside the sandbox."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `Bash(*)` Ruhusu wakala kukimbia lengo lolote la Makefile bila kuchochea. Kwa kuwa `Makefile` Ni checked katika git na upya juu ya kila ombi kuvuta, hivyo malengo wenyewe ni kuaminiwa. Kila hatua ambayo lengo hufanya bado inaendesha ndani ya sanduku la mchanga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The `Corefile.tmpl` MUST be the source of truth. It is rendered to `Corefile` by [coredns.py](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/coredns.py), which substitutes its `${VAR}` placeholders in-process, using values from `.env` (generated from [default.env](../../default.env), overridable through the CLI's environment)."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `Corefile.tmpl` Lazima kuwa chanzo cha ukweli. Imetolewa kwa `Corefile` Kwa kuwa [coredns.py](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/coredns.py), ambaye anabadilisha msimamo wake `${VAR}` Wafanyabiashara wa ndani, kutumia thamani kutoka `.env` (zinazozalishwa kutoka [default.env](../../default.env), Kwa njia ya mazingira ya CLI)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ is an agent that runs GitHub Actions workflow jobs on your own infrastructure instead of GitHub-hosted machines."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ Ni wakala ambaye anaendesha kazi za kazi za GitHub Actions kwenye miundombinu yako mwenyewe badala ya mashine za GitHub."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `Makefile` is the human-facing command surface for the repo. It MUST expose stable targets that people and CI are meant to run directly."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `Makefile` Je, mwanadamu ni mwenye dhambi? Ni lazima kuweka malengo imara kwamba watu na CI ni maana ya kukimbia moja kwa moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `OIDC` tree is a lazy group_var: it resolves in the consuming role's context, so the issuer family-aligns to that consumer (clearnet page → clearnet issuer, onion page → onion issuer). Inventory overrides therefore live under `OIDC_OVERRIDE:` — an inventory-level `OIDC:` block would shadow the lazy resolution and is rejected by a constructor assert."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `OIDC` Mti huu ni wa kijani group_var: inatatua katika muktadha wa jukumu la kuteketeza, kwa hivyo suala la familia kwa mtumiaji huyo (Ukurasa wa clearnet issuer, ukurasa wa onion → onion issuer)· Kwa hiyo, uzalishaji wa mazao ya kilimo unapungua `OIDC_OVERRIDE:` - Kiwango cha hesabu `OIDC:` Kuzuia itakuwa kivuli azimio wavivu na ni kukataliwa na ujenzi kudai."

