msgid "The ``role#variant`` selection token of one query row."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa ``role#variant`` Chagua alama ya safu moja ya swala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``s3.configure`` grant is required since SeaweedFS 4.39: a server started without an ``-s3.config`` has zero identities, and ListBuckets then returns an empty list to the consumer's access key, so the consumer reads the bucket as missing even though it exists."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa ``s3.configure`` Fedha hizo zinahitajika tangu SeaweedFS 4.39: Mfumo wa kompyuta huanza bila ``-s3.config`` Ina vitambulisho vya sifuri, na ListBuckets kisha inarudi orodha tupu kwa ufunguo wa ufikiaji wa watumiaji, kwa hivyo mtumiaji anasoma ndoo kama haipo hata ingawa iko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``sys-front-inj-logout`` Ansible role automatically embeds a lightweight JavaScript snippet into your web application’s HTML responses. This script identifies logout links, buttons, forms, and other elements, overrides their target URLs, and ensures users are redirected to a central OIDC logout endpoint, providing a consistent single sign‑out experience."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa ``sys-front-inj-logout`` Jukumu linaloonekana moja kwa moja linaunda snippet nyepesi ya JavaScript katika majibu ya maombi yako ya HTML. script hii kubainisha viungo logiout, vifungo, fomu, na mambo mengine, overrides URL yao lengo, na kuhakikisha watumiaji ni itaelekezwa kwa katikati OIDC logi endpoint, kutoa thabiti ishara-nje uzoefu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``sys-svc-mail-smtp`` role configures a **local SMTP relay** using `Postfix <https://www.postfix.org/>`__, listening exclusively on ``localhost``."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa ``sys-svc-mail-smtp`` Utekelezaji wa A **Uwasilishaji wa SMTP** Matumizi ya kutumia `Postfix <https://www.postfix.org/>`__, Kusikiliza tu juu ya ``localhost``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``sys-svc-mail`` role acts as the **central mail orchestration layer** in the Infinito.Nexus stack."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa ``sys-svc-mail`` shughuli zake kama vile **Kituo cha Central Mail Orchestration** Katika Infinito.Nexus ya stack."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``tag_only=True`` kwarg returns the reference WITHOUT the swarm registry prefix. Use it when the ref must be interpolated inline against the upstream registry rather than the in-cluster mirror."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa ``tag_only=True`` Kwarg anarudi kumbukumbu bila usajili wa swarm prefix. Tumia wakati ref lazima iingilianishwe dhidi ya Usajili wa upstream badala ya kioo cha ndani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``want=`` kwarg is intentionally ignored: want-path is ALWAYS the first positional argument so callers can't accidentally pass it both ways."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa ``want=`` Kwarg inapuuzwa kwa makusudi: njia ya kutaka daima ni hoja ya kwanza ya msimamo ili wapiga simu hawawezi kuipitisha kwa njia zote mbili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `addons` key MUST be removed from the \"inlined under the primary entity\" set in [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) and documented as its own topic file."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `addons` Ni lazima kuondolewa katika \"Imewekwa chini ya mamlaka ya msingi\" Kuweka katika [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) Imeorodheshwa kama faili yake ya mada."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The `administrator` persona MUST drive at least one admin-only interaction (admin panel toggle, realm settings change, user-management surface, …). Specs supply this via the `adminInteraction` callback on `runAdminFlow(page, { adminInteraction })` under the same \"no generic default\" rule."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `administrator` Mtu lazima kuendesha angalau mwingiliano mmoja wa admin pekee (admin jopo toggle, mazingira ya eneo mabadiliko, user-usimamizi uso, ...)· Kusambaza taarifa hizo kupitia `adminInteraction` Callback juu ya `runAdminFlow(page, { adminInteraction })` Chini ya hali hiyo \"Hakuna kikomo cha default\" ya utawala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is **not** blocked: [tasks/04_admin.yml](./tasks/04_admin.yml) seeds a native OpenProject account whose password is the Keycloak administrator secret, so the journey runs in every variant. The `biber` persona is blocked only in the `sso: false` variants — OpenProject is seeded with the administrator alone, and `biber` is auto-provisioned exclusively through the oauth2-proxy trusted-header bridge onto the LDAP auth source, which those variants remove. Both flags are declared explicitly in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2)."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `administrator` Mtu ni **Sio ya** imefungwa: [tasks/04_admin.yml](./tasks/04_admin.yml) Mti wa asili OpenProject password ya mtu ambaye ni Keycloak Mheshimiwa Naibu Spika, kwa hiyo, barabara hii ipo katika kila Halmashauri. Kwa kuwa `biber` Mtu huyo anazuiliwa tu katika `sso: false` Tofauti ya - OpenProject kuwa pamoja na Rais wa Jamhuri ya Muungano, na `biber` Inatengenezwa kwa njia ya oauth2Daraja la kichwa cha kuaminika kwenye chanzo cha LDAP auth, ambayo anuwai hizo zinaondoa. Bendera zote mbili zimetangazwa wazi katika [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2)..."

