# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `dashboard` service in `meta/services.yml` is only a consumer tile pointing at MIG's canonical domain; it does not host MIG. The role's contract is fully carried by the reachability, canonical-domain and content-type scenarios in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, plus the guest persona. The path back to the generic personas is an authenticated MIG surface, which upstream does not have."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `dashboard` Huduma katika `meta/services.yml` Je, ni lini Serikali itaelekeza MIGuwanja wa kanoni; hauruhusiwi MIGMkataba wa jukumu hilo unachukuliwa kikamilifu na hali ya kufikia, ya uwanja wa kisheria na maudhui katika `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, zaidi ya mgeni. Njia ya kurudi kwa watu wa kawaida ni kuthibitishwa MIG ya juu, ambayo si ya juu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `default:` points at the central `API` block in [group_vars/all/18_api.yml](../../../../../group_vars/all/18_api.yml), so an operator fills the provider in one place while the role keeps the shape the value must have."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `default:` Maoni kwenye Central `API` block katika [group_vars/all/18_api.yml](../../../../../group_vars/all/18_api.yml), hivyo operator kujaza mtoa huduma katika sehemu moja wakati jukumu anaendelea sura thamani lazima kuwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
