# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `oidc` plugin (`pretix-oidc`, pinned to `2.3.1`) is pip-installed at image build time and delivers Keycloak/OIDC login. It auto-enables whenever the SSO partner role (`web-app-keycloak`) is co-deployed and stays off otherwise."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `oidc` Plugin ya Plugin (`pretix-oidc`, Kwa hiyo, ili `2.3.1`) ni pip-kuwekwa katika picha kujenga wakati na kutoa KeycloakBonyeza login. Inawezesha kila wakati jukumu la washirika wa SSO (`web-app-keycloak`) Inatumiwa na inaacha tofauti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `pre-commit` hooks are installed automatically by `make environment-bootstrap`. Per-machine overrides go into the process environment before invoking `make` (e.g. `export INFINITO_FOO=…`); `make dotenv` honors caller-set values via setdefault semantics."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `pre-commit` Wanunuzi wanawekwa moja kwa moja `make environment-bootstrap`.Mapitio ya mashine huingia katika mazingira ya mchakato kabla ya kuomba `make` (ya g. `export INFINITO_FOO=…`); `make dotenv` Inaheshimu maadili ya simu kwa njia ya setdefault semantics."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `pull_request` orchestrator then waits for and consumes those images."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `pull_request` Kwa hiyo, kampuni hiyo inasubiri na kutumia picha hizo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `rbac_group_path` lookup plugin is the only sanctioned producer of OIDC group paths in this repository. Tests in this directory MUST cover invariants that protect that contract: callsite shape, role declaration consistency, and the ban on inline `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` constructions introduced by requirement 005."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `rbac_group_path` Plugin ya kuangalia ni mtayarishaji pekee wa njia za kikundi cha OIDC katika hifadhi hii. Mtihani katika saraka hii LAZIMA kufunika invariants kwamba kulinda mkataba huo: sura ya simu, msimamo wa tamko la jukumu, na marufuku kwenye mstari `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` Ujenzi huo ambao ulitekelezwa kwa matakwa ya 005..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `redirect_uris` lookup generates `https://<domain>/*` per SSO consumer, which covers the UI and API callbacks but not a localhost one. Machine access goes through AppRole (Decision #2) instead. Documented as a limitation in the README."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `redirect_uris` Uzalishaji wa macho `https://<domain>/*` Kwa watumiaji wa SSO, ambayo inashughulikia UI na API Piga simu, lakini sio mwenyeji wa wavuti. Upatikanaji wa mashine kupitia AppRole (Uamuzi wa #2) Badala yake. Imechapishwa kama kizuizi katika README."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sandbox.autoAllowBashIfSandboxed: true` flag is retained as belt-and-suspenders. If `Bash(*)` were ever removed, the sandbox auto-allow would still cover the common shapes, but it is no longer the primary gate."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `sandbox.autoAllowBashIfSandboxed: true` Bendera ya Volta ya Juu inahesabiwa kama Bendera na Bendera. Ikiwa ni `Bash(*)` Walikuwa milele kuondolewa, sandbox auto-allow ingekuwa bado kufunika maumbo ya kawaida, lakini ni tena mlango wa msingi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sandbox.network` block governs outbound and local connectivity from inside the sandbox."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `sandbox.network` block inasimamia kuunganishwa nje na ndani kutoka ndani ya sandbox."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `scripts/` tree MUST contain executable shell entry points and shell helper files only."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `scripts/` Mti lazima uwe na pointi za kuingia kwa shell na faili za msaada wa shell tu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `security-codeql` job runs the CodeQL scan (catalogued in the `Security and linting` table of [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)). A failing scan MUST fail `code-quality-gate` and thereby block all downstream deploy, install, and environment tests."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `security-codeql` Jinsi ya kutumia CodeQL Scan (Imeandikwa katika `Security and linting` Orodha ya [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md))Jaribio la kushindwa lazima lishindwe `code-quality-gate` Na hivyo kuzuia wote chini ya mto kupeleka, kufunga, na vipimo vya mazingira."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sys-front-inj-logout` Ansible role automatically embeds a lightweight JavaScript snippet into your web application's HTML responses. This script identifies logout links, buttons, forms, and other elements, overrides their target URLs, and ensures users are redirected to a central OIDC logout endpoint, providing a consistent single sign‑out experience."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `sys-front-inj-logout` Jukumu linaloonekana moja kwa moja linaunda snippet nyepesi ya JavaScript katika majibu ya maombi yako ya HTML. script hii kubainisha viungo logiout, vifungo, fomu, na mambo mengine, overrides URL yao lengo, na kuhakikisha watumiaji ni itaelekezwa kwa katikati OIDC logi endpoint, kutoa thabiti ishara-nje uzoefu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sys-svc-mail-smtp` role configures a **local SMTP relay** using [Postfix](https://www.postfix.org/), listening exclusively on `localhost`.   It is designed to be used as a fallback when no central Mailu instance is available, enabling applications and system services to send email via `localhost:25` without additional configuration."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `sys-svc-mail-smtp` Utekelezaji wa A **Uwasilishaji wa SMTP** Matumizi ya kutumia [Posta ya Posta](https://www.postfix.org/), Kusikiliza tu juu ya `localhost`. Imeundwa kutumika kama kuanguka wakati hakuna katikati Mailu mfano inapatikana, kuwezesha maombi na huduma za mfumo wa kutuma barua pepe kupitia `localhost:25` bila mpangilio wa nyongeza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sys-svc-mail` role acts as the **central mail orchestration layer** in the Infinito.Nexus stack.   It wires together:"
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `sys-svc-mail` shughuli zake kama vile **Kituo cha Central Mail Orchestration** Katika Infinito.Nexus ya stack. Inaunganisha kwa pamoja:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `test-e2e-cli` framework runs `files/test/test.sh` sourcing variables from `templates/test.env.j2` after each deploy cycle. Check both the deploy output and the CLI test output before declaring a fix complete."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `test-e2e-cli` Mfumo wa Uendeshaji `files/test/test.sh` Mabadiliko ya Tabianchi kutoka `templates/test.env.j2` baada ya kila mzunguko wa hedhi. Angalia matokeo yote ya kupeleka na matokeo ya mtihani wa CLI kabla ya kutangaza kurekebisha kamili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `test-e2e-playwright` role MUST stage `files/playwright/` recursively (so `addons/` is included) and discover specs recursively."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `test-e2e-playwright` Hatua ya lazima `files/playwright/` Kurudishwa (Hivyo basi kwa `addons/` Imejumuishwa) na kuwa na uwezo wa kugundua mambo mapya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `test-e2e-playwright` role discovers Playwright-enabled roles through the presence of `templates/playwright.env.j2`. For each discovered role it:"
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `test-e2e-playwright` ya kutambua majukumu ya Playwright kupitia uwepo wa `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Kwa kila mtu aliyetambua jukumu lake:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `test-workspace` stage runs the workspace workflow listed in the `Infrastructure tests` table of [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `test-workspace` Hatua huendesha kazi ya nafasi ya kazi iliyoorodheshwa katika `Infrastructure tests` Orodha ya [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `test` job runs [call-test.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-test.yml): `make test` fans the unit, integration, lint and external suites out in parallel on the runner host. It MUST pass `code-quality-gate`."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `test` Kazi ya kuendesha [call-test.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-test.yml): `make test` mashabiki kitengo, ushirikiano, lint na suites nje sambamba na mwenyeji wa runner. Ni lazima kuwa na `code-quality-gate`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `tor` input decides what the onion axis is allowed to do at all:"
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `tor` Intuition huamua kile ambacho mhimili wa onion unaruhusiwa kufanya wakati wote:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `users` lookup is the ONLY supported runtime entry point for merged user configuration."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `users` lookup ni tu mkono wa runtime kuingia uhakika kwa ajili ya kuunganishwa user Configuration."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `utils/` tree MUST contain Python helper modules and helper packages only."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `utils/` Mti lazima uwe na modules za msaada wa Python na vifurushi vya msaada tu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `vars/main.yml` of the role MUST define the variables referenced in `args:` by reading them from `meta/services.yml` through the `lookup('config', ...)` filter. This keeps `meta/services.yml` as the single source of truth."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `vars/main.yml` ya majukumu yake ni lazima yaeleze vigezo vilivyotajwa katika `args:` Kwa kusoma kutoka kwao `meta/services.yml` Kwa njia ya `lookup('config', ...)` ya filter. Hii inaendelea `meta/services.yml` kama chanzo cha ukweli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `version:` MUST stay pinned to an exact Playwright version and distro pair such as `v1.59.1-noble`. You MUST NOT switch this to a mutable tag such as `latest`, because mutable upstream tags are more vulnerable to CDN propagation delays and make flaky CI failures much harder to reason about."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `version:` Lazima kukaa pinned na toleo halisi Playwright na jozi distro kama vile `v1.59.1-noble`. Huwezi kubadili hii katika siku za usoni kama vile `latest`, Kwa sababu vitambulisho vya upstream vinavyofaa ni hatari zaidi kwa ucheleweshaji wa usambazaji wa CDN na kufanya makosa ya flaky CI kuwa vigumu zaidi kwa sababu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `🛡️ Trusted` label flips the build source to the PR head and unlocks the Docker Hub credentials; without it the safe base merge ref is built with no organization secrets. Restrict who may set the label via repository label permissions / branch protection so only maintainers can grant it."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `🛡️ Trusted` Lebo inafungua chanzo cha kujenga kwa kichwa cha PR na kufungua sifa za Docker Hub; bila hiyo msingi salama wa kuunganisha ref umejengwa bila siri za shirika. Kizuizi ambacho kinaweza kuweka lebo kupitia ruhusa za lebo ya kuhifadhi / ulinzi wa tawi ili tu watunzaji wanaweza kuipa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `🧩 Subset` label must exist in the repository's label set and is applied through the PR labels UI. Both the `pull_request` and `pull_request_target` events carry a `labeled` trigger, so adding it starts a fresh run."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa `🧩 Subset` Lebo lazima ipo katika lebo ya kuhifadhi na inatumiwa kupitia lebo za PR UI. Wote wawili `pull_request` Aidha, na `pull_request_target` Matukio yanayohusisha `labeled` Kwa hiyo, ni muhimu, kwa hiyo, kuongeza, kuanza upya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The access token paired with `DOCKERHUB_USERNAME`."
msgstr "Upatikanaji wa mikopo hiyo kwa kushirikiana na `DOCKERHUB_USERNAME`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The action masks its own result: the fact is the whole rendered tree with every application's credentials, so it never reaches a log regardless of `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS`."
msgstr "Hatua inaficha matokeo yake mwenyewe: ukweli ni mti wote unaotolewa na sifa za kila maombi, kwa hivyo haufikii logi bila kujali `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The active window has a default retention of 7 entries. A higher count is fine for short bursts of releases, but the active changelog SHOULD stay short enough that scrolling it is cheap."
msgstr "Mlango wa kazi una uhifadhi wa default 7 kuingia. Hesabu ya juu ni faini kwa kupasuka kwa muda mfupi wa releases, lakini mabadiliko ya kazi SHOULD kukaa mfupi wa kutosha kwamba scrolling ni nafuu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The actual app deploy runs inside a **sealed throwaway Docker daemon** and is torn down on exit, so the host's own stack is never touched. Several runners can share one host (or coexist with other workloads) safely."
msgstr "App ya sasa yaingia ndani ya A **Kuondolewa kwa Docker Daemon** Na kwa upande mwingine, ni juu ya kukimbia, kwa hiyo hakuna haja ya kumwagilia mmea. Baadhi ya washiriki wanaweza kushiriki katika mwenyeji mmoja (au kujiunga na vyama vingine vya wafanyakazi) kwa usalama."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The adapter `digest` pins nothing. All ten `implementation: adapter` roles carry the identical placeholder `sha256:` followed by sixty-four zeros, the schema only checks that prefix, and the running image is resolved through `lookup('container_image', …)` instead. A lint that rejects the placeholder has to land together with real digests rather than before them."
msgstr "Adapta ya `digest` Hakuna cha kuficha. Wote kumi `implementation: adapter` Wachezaji wa timu hiyo wakiwa na jezi inayofanana `sha256:` ikifuatiwa na sifuri sitini na nne, schema tu hundi kwamba prefix, na picha mbio ni kutatuliwa kwa njia ya `lookup('container_image', …)` Badala yake. Na mwenye kuikiuka mipaka ya Allaah, basi amejidhulumu nafsi yake."

