# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The administrator journey is covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/auth.spec.js``, which drives the native form and the ``module=Login&action=logout`` sign-out. The same file owns the deny-probe proving biber cannot reach the admin surface — the provider-side assertion the persona helpers deliberately no longer duplicate. The path back to the generic personas is a Keycloak client for Matomo plus group-driven user provisioning."
msgstr "Safari ya rais imegubikwa na utata katika ``files/playwright/auth.spec.js``, ambayo inaongoza fomu ya asili na ``module=Login&action=logout`` Ishara ya nje. Faili hiyo inamiliki biber ya kukataa kuthibitisha haiwezi kufikia uso wa admin - upande wa mtoa huduma wanasema wasaidizi wa mtu kwa makusudi hawana tena duplicate. Njia ya kurudi kwa watu wa kawaida ni Keycloak Wateja kwa ajili ya Matomo Kuongeza kasi ya mtumiaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The administrator journey is covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``: the integrated OIDC path is proven at the STS ``AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity`` tier, and the LDAP variant additionally drives the Console form login and logout. The path back to the generic administrator persona is a Console build that surfaces the configured IdP on its login form."
msgstr "Safari ya rais imegubikwa na utata katika ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``: Njia ya OIDC iliyounganishwa imethibitishwa katika STS ``AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity`` tier, na lahaja ya LDAP pia inatoa fomu ya kuingia ya Console na logout. Njia ya kurudi kwa kiongozi wa kawaida persona ni kujenga Console ambayo inaunda IdP iliyowekwa kwenye fomu yake ya kuingia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The administrator journey is covered bespoke in `files/playwright/auth.spec.js`, which drives the native form and the `module=Login&action=logout` sign-out. The same file owns the deny-probe proving biber cannot reach the admin surface — the provider-side assertion the persona helpers deliberately no longer duplicate. The path back to the generic personas is a Keycloak client for Matomo plus group-driven user provisioning."
msgstr "Safari ya rais imegubikwa na utata katika `files/playwright/auth.spec.js`, ambayo inaongoza fomu ya asili na `module=Login&action=logout` Ishara ya nje. Faili hiyo inamiliki biber ya kukataa kuthibitisha haiwezi kufikia uso wa admin - upande wa mtoa huduma wanasema wasaidizi wa mtu kwa makusudi hawana tena duplicate. Njia ya kurudi kwa watu wa kawaida ni Keycloak Wateja kwa ajili ya Matomo Kuongeza kasi ya mtumiaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The administrator journey is covered bespoke in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`: the integrated OIDC path is proven at the STS `AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity` tier, and the LDAP variant additionally drives the Console form login and logout. The path back to the generic administrator persona is a Console build that surfaces the configured IdP on its login form."
