# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The advertised tool contract matches what the hub serves"
msgstr "Mkataba wa chombo cha kutangazwa unalingana na kile ambacho kitovu kinafanya kazi"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MAY bind listening sockets on `localhost` (e.g. `make compose-up`, `python -m http.server`, dev servers). Required for any local end-to-end testing."
msgstr "Waziri Mkuu Aweza Kumsikiliza Majaliwa `localhost` (ya g. `make compose-up`, Kwa hivyo, `python -m http.server`, Huduma ya Servers)• Kuhitajika kwa uchunguzi wowote wa mwisho hadi mwisho."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MAY write to the paths listed in `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite`. All other paths are read-only by default."
msgstr "Mwandishi anaweza kuandika kwa njia zilizoorodheshwa katika `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite`. Njia nyingine zote ni kusoma tu kwa default."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MUST NOT create any git commit until every Acceptance Criterion in this document is checked off (`- [x]`)."
msgstr "Wakala haipaswi kuunda ahadi yoyote ya git mpaka kila ukosoaji wa kukubalika katika waraka huu unachunguzwa. (`- [x]`)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MUST NOT interrupt work to ask about tier changes. Recommendations appear as a single line at the start of the next response after the threshold is crossed."
msgstr "Wakala haipaswi kuingilia kazi ya kuuliza juu ya mabadiliko ya tier. Mapendekezo yanaonekana kama mstari mmoja mwanzoni mwa jibu linalofuata baada ya kizingiti kuvuka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MUST NOT repeat this notice within the same conversation."
msgstr "Msemaji hapaswi kurudia taarifa hii katika mazungumzo hayo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MUST NOT run `git checkout`, `git switch`, or any other command that changes `HEAD`, stages files, or modifies the working tree. `git push` operates on refs by name and does not require `<branch>` to be checked out. The push goes to the local `origin` remote."
msgstr "Waziri Mkuu hapaswi kuongoza `git checkout`, Kwa hivyo, `git switch`, au kubadilisha kitu chochote. `HEAD`, hatua faili, au kubadilisha mti wa kazi. `git push` Kufanya kazi kwenye friji kwa jina na si lazima `<branch>` ili kuchunguzwa. Uhamiaji kuingia nchini `origin` mbali."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MUST execute this requirement **autonomously** once Proposed Decisions are confirmed. Open clarifications only when a decision is genuinely ambiguous and would otherwise block progress; default to the intent already captured in this document and proceed."
msgstr "Serikali inapaswa kutekeleza wajibu huu **Uhuru wa kujitegemea** Mara baada ya uamuzi kuthibitishwa. Open ufafanuzi tu wakati uamuzi ni kweli ambiguous na vinginevyo kuzuia maendeleo; default kwa nia tayari alitekwa katika hati hii na kuendelea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MUST execute this requirement **autonomously**. Open clarifications only when a decision is genuinely ambiguous and would otherwise block progress; default to the intent already captured in this document and proceed. Avoid back-and-forth questions on choices already resolved in [Confirmed Decisions](#confirmed-decisions)."
msgstr "Serikali inapaswa kutekeleza wajibu huu **Uhuru wa kujitegemea**wazi ufafanuzi tu wakati uamuzi ni kweli ambiguous na vinginevyo kuzuia maendeleo; default kwa nia tayari alitekwa katika hati hii na kuendelea. Epuka maswali ya nyuma na ya nyuma juu ya uchaguzi tayari umetatuliwa [Uamuzi uliothibitishwa](#confirmed-decisions)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent can do anything the granted devices allow. A GPIO or I2C grant means it can drive whatever is wired to those pins; a video grant means it can watch the room; a serial grant means it can talk to whatever sits on the bus. The allowlist is the entire boundary, which is why an empty one is refused and why the device must be dedicated, single-tenant and network-segmented."
msgstr "Wakala anaweza kufanya chochote ambacho vifaa vilivyotolewa vinaruhusu. GPIO au mimi2Ruzuku ya C inamaanisha inaweza kuendesha chochote kilichounganishwa na pini hizo; ruzuku ya video inamaanisha inaweza kuangalia chumba; ruzuku ya mfululizo inamaanisha inaweza kuzungumza na chochote kinachokaa kwenye basi. Orodha ya ruhusu ni mpaka mzima, ndiyo sababu tupu inakataliwa na kwa nini kifaa lazima kiwe cha kujitolea, kimoja na cha mtandao."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent holds no model credential: it calls `http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1`, and the broker relays the call to LiteLLM with the broker's own virtual key and the owner in the OpenAI `user` field, and logs a `relay` event with owner, platform, path and upstream status."
msgstr "Polisi hawana mfumo wa imani: wito `http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1`, na broker anapeana wito kwa LiteLLM na ufunguo wa broker mwenyewe na mmiliki katika OpenAI `user` Kwa upande wake, A `relay` tukio na mmiliki, jukwaa, njia na hali ya juu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent images run on arm64"
msgstr "Waandishi wa habari wakiwa kwenye mikono64"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent speaks the Anthropic Messages API, which the LiteLLM gateway serves alongside its OpenAI routes. The role writes ``~/.claude/settings.json`` with an ``env`` block carrying the gateway URL, the workstation’s key and the model aliases to use, so every request leaves the machine through the gateway and is accounted there."
msgstr "Ujumbe wa Anthropic APIBarabara ya lami ni barabara ya lami. Wajibu wa Kuandika ``~/.claude/settings.json`` Kwa kuwa ``env`` kuzuia kubeba URL ya lango, ufunguo wa kituo cha kazi na mfano unapungua kutumia, hivyo kila ombi linaacha mashine kupitia lango na inahesabiwa huko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent speaks the Anthropic Messages API, which the LiteLLM gateway serves alongside its OpenAI routes. The role writes `~/.claude/settings.json` with an `env` block carrying the gateway URL, the workstation's key and the model aliases to use, so every request leaves the machine through the gateway and is accounted there."
msgstr "Ujumbe wa Anthropic APIBarabara ya lami ni barabara ya lami. Wajibu wa Kuandika `~/.claude/settings.json` Kwa kuwa `env` kuzuia kubeba URL ya lango, ufunguo wa kituo cha kazi na mfano unapungua kutumia, hivyo kila ombi linaacha mashine kupitia lango na inahesabiwa huko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agents are real, self-hostable, open-source platforms, each deployed as its own role:"
msgstr "Wakala ni majukwaa halisi, ya kujitegemea, ya chanzo cha wazi, kila inayotumiwa kama jukumu lake mwenyewe:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The alias is served and is not read as a route without a backend"
msgstr "Alias ni kutumika na si kusoma kama njia bila nyuma"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The alias raises rather than serving a default"
msgstr "Watanzania badala ya kufanya kazi kwa mazoea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The alias routes rather than falling back, proven by the model that answers"
msgstr "Barabara ya Alias badala ya kuanguka nyuma, kuthibitishwa na mfano kwamba majibu"

