# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The app does not require sessions or queues (rarely safe)"
msgstr "Programu haihitaji vikao au foleni (Mara nyingi ni salama)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The app password never reaches a client. Clients present ``credentials.mcp_bearer`` to the sidecar; the sidecar presents the app password upstream. Revoking one does not revoke the other."
msgstr "Neno la siri la mtumiaji kamwe haliwezi kufikia mteja. Wateja wa sasa ``credentials.mcp_bearer`` Kwa upande wa gari; sidecar inatoa nywila ya programu upstream. Kukataa moja hakubadilishi nyingine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
