msgstr "Neno la siri la mtumiaji kamwe haliwezi kufikia mteja. Wateja wa sasa `credentials.mcp_bearer` Kwa upande wa gari; sidecar inatoa nywila ya programu upstream. Kukataa moja hakubadilishi nyingine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The app runs as a single Docker container and requires no database or backend setup, enabling secure and frictionless QR generation anywhere."
msgstr "Programu inaendesha kama chombo kimoja cha Docker na inahitaji hakuna database au usanidi wa nyuma, kuwezesha kizazi cha salama na kisicho na msuguano popote."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The app stack for `<role>` is still running."
msgstr "App ya bure kwa ajili ya `<role>` bado zinaendelea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The application loader (`utils/cache/applications.py`) reads every `meta/addons/<id>.yml` like the other file-rooted meta topics and **normalises the enable state**: `required: true` defaults to enabled, an optional addon defaults to disabled, and an explicit `enabled` value is preserved verbatim. No new repo-wide dictionary is introduced."
msgstr "Uwasilishaji wa maombi (`utils/cache/applications.py`) Soma kila mmoja `meta/addons/<id>.yml` Kama vile mada nyingine za meta zilizotokana na faili na **kuimarisha hali ya kuwezesha**: `required: true` defaults kuwezeshwa, chaguo la nyongeza kwa walemavu, na wazi `enabled` Thamani ya sarafu imehifadhiwa. Hakuna kamusi mpya ya kamusi elezo iliyotafsiriwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The application ships no logout control at `2026.6.16`, so the Playwright administrator persona is declared blocked."
msgstr "Maombi ya meli hakuna udhibiti wa logout katika `2026.6.16`, Kwa hivyo, msimamizi wa Playwright persona amezuiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The application ships no logout control at ``2026.6.16``, so the Playwright administrator persona is declared blocked."
msgstr "Maombi ya meli hakuna udhibiti wa logout katika ``2026.6.16``, Kwa hivyo, msimamizi wa Playwright persona amezuiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The application_id to match."
msgstr "Kwa kuwa application_id ya kucheza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The apps each variant round of *app* deploys."
msgstr "App za kila aina *App ya app* ya utekelezaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The appview is useful without the bridge; the bridge is useless without both endpoints. Separable lifecycle, separable failure domain."
msgstr "Mtazamo wa programu ni muhimu bila daraja; daraja ni bure bila pande zote mbili. Tofauti lifecycle, separable kushindwa uwanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The architecture is built around one simple idea: keep the parts small, explicit, and reusable, then combine them into a full stack only when a bundle needs them."
msgstr "Usanifu ni kujengwa karibu na wazo moja rahisi: kuweka sehemu ndogo, wazi, na reusable, kisha kuchanganya yao katika stack kamili tu wakati kifungu mahitaji yao."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The architecture is replayed like the distro rather than left to the rotation: it is the machine the job ran on, not a preference the deploy may fall back from, so the title states what it actually was."
msgstr "Usanifu ni replayed kama distro badala ya kushoto kwa mzunguko: ni mashine kazi mbio juu, si upendeleo kupelekwa inaweza kuanguka nyuma kutoka, hivyo cheo inaeleza nini ilikuwa kweli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The architecture is the one axis a deploy job cannot apply to itself: the distro is installed and the filesystem is built, but the CPU arrives with the runner. The matrix therefore carries the runner label with the row (`ubuntu-latest` for amd64, `ubuntu-24.04-arm` for arm64), `runs-on` reads it, and the job asserts `uname -m` against what it was assigned before deploying anything, so a label that stops resolving to arm64 hardware fails loudly instead of reporting an arm64 row green from an amd64 machine."
msgstr "Usanifu ni mhimili mmoja wa kazi ya kupeleka haiwezi kutumika yenyewe: distro imewekwa na mfumo wa faili umejengwa, lakini CPU inawasili na mkimbiaji. Kwa hiyo matrix hubeba lebo ya runner na mstari (`ubuntu-latest` kwa ajili ya amd64, Kwa hivyo, `ubuntu-24.04-arm` kwa mkono64), Kwa hivyo, `runs-on` kusoma, na kwamba kazi hiyo `uname -m` dhidi ya kile kilichopewa kabla ya kupeleka chochote, kwa hivyo lebo ambayo inaacha kutatua kwa mkono64 Vyombo vya habari vimeshindwa kutoa taarifa badala ya kutoa taarifa64 Rangi ya kijani kutoka amd64 mashine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The architectures one role's rows may draw from this run."
msgstr "Vipande vya safu moja ya jukumu inaweza kuteka kutoka kwa kukimbia hii."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The archive CLI is byte-idempotent. Re-running it on an already-processed tree leaves every file unchanged: CHANGELOG.md is rewritten only when its target content differs from disk, the per-release archive files are never overwritten, and the package changelogs are only rewritten when the regenerated content differs from disk. This makes it safe to run from a pre-commit hook, a release script, or by hand without keeping track of state."
msgstr "Nyaraka ya CLI ni ya kuaminika. Re-running juu ya mti tayari kusindika majani kila faili unchanged: CHANGELOG.md Inaandikwa tu wakati maudhui yake ya lengo yanatofautiana na disk, faili za faili za faili za faili za faili za kutolewa hazijawahi kuandikwa, na mabadiliko ya mfuko yanaandikwa tu wakati maudhui yaliyozalishwa upya yanatofautiana na disk. Hii inafanya kuwa salama kukimbia kutoka ndoano ya kabla, script ya kutolewa, au kwa mkono bila kufuatilia hali."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The argv list, proxy-free."
msgstr "Orodha ya argv, pro-free."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The artefacts (`*.sql.gz`, `*-files.tar`, `*-private-files.tar`) land under `/home/frappe/frappe-bench/sites/next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/private/backups/` inside the backend container."
msgstr "Sanaa ya Sanaa (`*.sql.gz`, Kwa hivyo, `*-files.tar`, Kwa hivyo, `*-private-files.tar`) Chini ya ardhi `/home/frappe/frappe-bench/sites/next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/private/backups/` Ndani ya sanduku la nyuma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The artefacts (``*.sql.gz``, ``*-files.tar``, ``*-private-files.tar``) land under ``/home/frappe/frappe-bench/sites/next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/private/backups/`` inside the backend container."
msgstr "Sanaa ya Sanaa (``*.sql.gz``, Kwa hivyo, ``*-files.tar``, Kwa hivyo, ``*-private-files.tar``) Chini ya ardhi ``/home/frappe/frappe-bench/sites/next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/private/backups/`` Ndani ya sanduku la nyuma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The asset host for the current deployment: the internal CDN origin when web-svc-cdn is deployed with flavor internal, else jsdelivr."
msgstr "Mwenyeji wa mali kwa kupelekwa sasa: asili ya ndani ya CDN wakati web-svc-cdn Inatumiwa na ladha ya ndani, jsdelivr nyingine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The audit MUST classify these as `db-extension` (out of scope), so a later sweep does not mistake them for app addons. If a future role mixes app addons and DB extensions under one key, the migration MUST split them by destination."
msgstr "Kamati hiyo itaainisha mambo haya kama `db-extension` (Nje ya wigo), hivyo sweep baadaye haina makosa yao kwa addons app. Ikiwa jukumu la baadaye linachanganya nyongeza za programu na upanuzi wa DB chini ya ufunguo mmoja, uhamiaji lazima ugawanye kwa marudio."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The audit is the role tree itself: every fact about a role's MCP surface lives in its own `meta/services.yml`, so a separate artifact would be a copy that can go stale. `grep -l '^mcp:' roles/*/meta/services.yml` enumerates the integrated roles."
msgstr "Ukaguzi ni mti wa jukumu yenyewe: kila ukweli kuhusu uso wa MCP wa jukumu huishi katika yake mwenyewe. `meta/services.yml`, Kwa hiyo, bandia tofauti itakuwa nakala ambayo inaweza kwenda stale. `grep -l '^mcp:' roles/*/meta/services.yml` kuzingatia majukumu ya Muungano."

