# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The branch-name matcher normally also requires the run's head repository to be the pull request's own. Two cases relax that: a run whose `head_repository` the API omits, and a pull request whose head fork has been deleted, where the event payload carries no head repository either. Both are matched on the branch name alone, because otherwise their runs would keep going forever — and neither field is something a contributor can influence. The ambiguity check above is what makes that safe: it runs whenever a head branch is known, with or without a repository, so a shared branch name still disables the matcher rather than cancelling the wrong pull request."
msgstr "Mchezaji wa jina la tawi kawaida pia inahitaji nafasi ya kichwa cha kukimbia kuwa ombi la kuvuta mwenyewe. Kuna mambo mawili ya kuzingatia: njia ambayo `head_repository` Kwa kuwa API Inaondoa, na ombi la kuvuta ambaye kichwa chake kimefutwa, ambapo malipo ya tukio hayana kumbukumbu ya kichwa pia. Wote wawili wanalingana kwa jina la tawi pekee, kwa sababu vinginevyo mbio zao zitaendelea milele - na hakuna shamba ni kitu ambacho mchangiaji anaweza kushawishi. Uhakiki wa ambiguity hapo juu ni nini kinachofanya kuwa salama: inaendesha wakati wowote tawi la kichwa linajulikana, na au bila kuhifadhi, kwa hivyo jina la tawi la pamoja bado linazuia mchezaji badala ya kufuta ombi la kuvuta vibaya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bridge activates only when `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` is truthy (derived from `lookup('sso', application_id, 'is_proxy_gated')`); otherwise the middleware is a transparent pass-through and the native password form still guards `/admin`."
msgstr "Mradi huu unatekelezwa tu wakati ambapo `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` Kuwa mkweli (inayotokana na `lookup('sso', application_id, 'is_proxy_gated')`)vinginevyo middleware ni uwazi kupita njia na asili password fomu bado walinzi `/admin`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bridge activates only when ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` is truthy (derived from ``lookup('sso', application_id, 'is_proxy_gated')``); otherwise the middleware is a transparent pass-through and the native password form still guards ``/admin``."
msgstr "Mradi huu unatekelezwa tu wakati ambapo ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` Kuwa mkweli (inayotokana na ``lookup('sso', application_id, 'is_proxy_gated')``)vinginevyo middleware ni uwazi kupita njia na asili password fomu bado walinzi ``/admin``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bridge declaration is one-directional metadata (this role depends on that service). It MUST NOT be used to auto-enable the other role; enablement stays driven by group membership and the existing `run_after` ordering."
msgstr "Azimio la daraja ni metadata moja kwa moja (Huduma hii inategemea huduma hii). Haipaswi kutumiwa kuwezesha jukumu lingine; uwezeshaji unakaa inayoendeshwa na uanachama wa kikundi na uliopo `run_after` kutoa amri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bridge ships as a **separate component** (own sidecar/role), not inside `web-app-atmo`, gated on `web-app-mobilizon in group_names`."
msgstr "Ndege za kivita kama A **Sehemu tofauti** (Rangi ya rangi / rangi), Sio ndani ya `web-app-atmo`, Kwa upande wa `web-app-mobilizon in group_names`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bridge's database password stays declared in [meta/secrets.yml](../../roles/web-app-matrix/meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:` and is referenced, never inlined. Each additional network (`whatsapp`, `signal`, `slack`, `facebook`, `instagram`) is its own `mechanism: bridge` addon."
msgstr "Neno la siri la database limehifadhiwa katika [meta/secrets.yml](../../roles/web-app-matrix/meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:` Hii ina maana, haijawahi kuonyeshwa. Kila mtandao mwingine (`whatsapp`, Kwa hivyo, `signal`, Kwa hivyo, `slack`, Kwa hivyo, `facebook`, Kwa hivyo, `instagram`) Ni yake mwenyewe `mechanism: bridge` ya addon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broader CI debugging workflow is documented in [ci.md](../../../contributing/actions/debugging/ci.md). You MUST NOT proceed with partial coverage."
msgstr "Kazi kubwa zaidi ya kusafisha ya CI imeorodheshwa katika [ci.md](../../../contributing/actions/debugging/ci.md). Haihitajiki kuendelea na matangazo ya sehemu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker MUST receive `X-Forwarded-User`, `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`, and `X-Forwarded-Email` from `oauth2-proxy`. On a user's first authenticated visit the broker calls the PDS `com.atproto.server.createAccount` endpoint with a synthesised app-password, encrypts that password with AES-256-GCM under a key from the project's credentials vault, and caches the ciphertext in the broker's in-process `sessionCache` keyed by Keycloak username. Subsequent visits decrypt the cached password in-broker, exchange it for a PDS session via `com.atproto.server.createSession`, and seed `localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]` so the social-app finds an authenticated session at boot. A broker restart drops the cache; the next SSO visit triggers a fresh `createAccount` and the previous app-password remains valid in PDS until rotated."
msgstr "Mchungaji lazima awe `X-Forwarded-User`, Kwa hivyo, `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`, Aidha, na `X-Forwarded-Email` Kutoka kwa `oauth2-proxy`. Katika ziara ya kwanza ya mtumiaji kuthibitishwa broker wito PDS `com.atproto.server.createAccount` Endpoint na nenosiri la awali, encrypts kwamba password na AES-256-GCM chini ya ufunguo kutoka kwa sifa za mradi wa kuba, na hufunga ciphertext katika mchakato wa broker `sessionCache` Imetolewa na Keycloak jina la mtumiaji. Ziara za kufuatilia zinaondoa nenosiri la cached katika-broker, kuibadilisha kwa kikao cha PDS kupitia `com.atproto.server.createSession`, na kwa milomo `localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]` Kwa hivyo programu ya kijamii hupata kikao cha kuthibitishwa kwenye boot. Broker kuanzisha upya hupunguza cache; ziara ya pili ya SSO husababisha mpya `createAccount` Na nywila ya awali ya programu inabaki halali katika PDS mpaka imebadilishwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker MUST receive ``X-Forwarded-User``, ``X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username``, and ``X-Forwarded-Email`` from ``oauth2-proxy``. On a user’s first authenticated visit the broker calls the PDS ``com.atproto.server.createAccount`` endpoint with a synthesised app-password, encrypts that password with AES-256-GCM under a key from the project’s credentials vault, and caches the ciphertext in the broker’s in-process ``sessionCache`` keyed by Keycloak username. Subsequent visits decrypt the cached password in-broker, exchange it for a PDS session via ``com.atproto.server.createSession``, and seed ``localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]`` so the social-app finds an authenticated session at boot. A broker restart drops the cache; the next SSO visit triggers a fresh ``createAccount`` and the previous app-password remains valid in PDS until rotated."
msgstr "Mchungaji lazima awe ``X-Forwarded-User``, Kwa hivyo, ``X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username``, Aidha, na ``X-Forwarded-Email`` Kutoka kwa ``oauth2-proxy``. Katika ziara ya kwanza ya mtumiaji kuthibitishwa broker wito PDS ``com.atproto.server.createAccount`` Endpoint na nenosiri la awali, encrypts kwamba password na AES-256-GCM chini ya ufunguo kutoka kwa sifa za mradi, na hufunga ciphertext katika mchakato wa broker ``sessionCache`` Imetolewa na Keycloak jina la mtumiaji. Ziara za kufuatilia zinaondoa nenosiri la cached katika-broker, kuibadilisha kwa kikao cha PDS kupitia ``com.atproto.server.createSession``, na kwa milomo ``localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]`` Kwa hivyo programu ya kijamii hupata kikao cha kuthibitishwa kwenye boot. Broker kuanzisha upya hupunguza cache; ziara ya pili ya SSO husababisha mpya ``createAccount`` Na nywila ya awali ya programu inabaki halali katika PDS mpaka imebadilishwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker forwards the request to the agent with the agent's own bearer key and streams the answer back unchanged."
msgstr "Broker hupeleka ombi kwa wakala na ufunguo wa mpokeaji wa wakala mwenyewe na mito jibu nyuma halijabadilika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker looks up the caller's agent for that platform by name. When none exists it creates one; when it is stopped it starts it; it then waits until the agent answers its health endpoint."
msgstr "Broker inaonekana wakala wa simu kwa jukwaa hilo kwa jina. Wakati hakuna ipo inajenga moja; wakati ni kusimamishwa ni kuanza; kisha kusubiri mpaka wakala kujibu mwisho wake wa afya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker reaches the container engine only through a filtered unix socket in a volume it shares with the socket proxy. The proxy serves no TCP port; in compose it also runs with `network_mode: none`, while a swarm task carries the stack's default overlay attachment. The proxy admits only the container, service, task, network, volume and image calls the broker makes, and refuses every other method and path, including exec and delete. The image, runtime, limits and mounts of an agent are fixed by the broker, never taken from the request."
msgstr "Broker anafikia injini ya chombo tu kwa njia ya soketi iliyochujwa ya Unix katika kiasi kinachoshiriki na wakala wa socket. Hakuna bandari ya TCP; katika kuunda pia inaendesha `network_mode: none`, Wakati kazi ya wadudu hubeba kifungo cha juu cha stack. Wakala anakubali tu chombo, huduma, kazi, mtandao, kiasi na picha wito broker hufanya, na anakataa kila njia nyingine na njia, ikiwa ni pamoja na exec na kufuta. Picha, runtime, mipaka na milima ya wakala ni fasta na broker, kamwe kuchukuliwa kutoka ombi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker rejects any request whose bearer is not the broker key, and any request without a user id header."
msgstr "Muuzaji anakataa ombi lolote ambalo mpokeaji wake sio ufunguo wa broker, na ombi lolote bila kichwa cha mtumiaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker resolves the caller's groups from Keycloak and refuses with HTTP 403 when the caller is not in the `agent-user` group of the requested platform."
msgstr "Kamati ya Bunge yajadili mapendekezo ya wajumbe kutoka Keycloak Kukataa kwa HTTP 403 Wakati wa maombi hakuna `agent-user` Kikundi cha jukwaa lililoombwa."

