# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The classic failure shape (`DNS [OK]`, `TCP [OK]`, `TLS [FAIL] TimeoutError after 8s`) is an __MTU mismatch__, not a TLS-layer bug. Small packets (TCP-SYN, DNS replies) survive; the larger TLS-ServerHello with the certificate chain is dropped silently because the path MTU is below the bridge MTU and ICMP-needs-frag is filtered upstream. When `auth.docker.io` is OK but `ghcr.io` / `registry-1.docker.io` time out, the chain-length difference between hosts (Cloudflare-fronted ≈ small chain, GitHub/AWS ≈ large chain) confirms MTU as the cause rather than a blanket TLS block."
msgstr "Tabia ya kushindwa classic (`DNS [OK]`, Kwa hivyo, `TCP [OK]`, Kwa hivyo, `TLS [FAIL] TimeoutError after 8s`) Ni wakati wa mismatch__, Si kwa ajili ya mchezo wa mpira wa miguu. Vipande vidogo (TCP-SYN Majibu ya DNS) Kuishi; Kubwa TLS-ServerHello na mlolongo wa cheti imeshuka kimya kwa sababu njia MTU ni chini ya daraja MTU na ICMP-needs-frag ni filtered upstream. Wakati ambapo wakati `auth.docker.io` Ni sawa lakini `ghcr.io` Kwa hivyo `registry-1.docker.io` Wakati wa kuondoka, tofauti ya urefu wa mnyororo kati ya majeshi (Cloudflare-mbele ≈ mnyororo mdogo, GitHub / AWS ≈ mnyororo mkubwa) Inathibitisha MTU kama sababu badala ya kuzuia blanketi TLS."

