# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The deployment renders one ``ADAPTER_CONTRACT`` JSON document per instance:"
msgstr "Muungano huu unamfanya mmoja ``ADAPTER_CONTRACT`` JSON kwa mfano:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The description MUST use `kebab-case` (lowercase words separated by hyphens) and SHOULD be short enough to read at a glance."
msgstr "Ufafanuzi unapaswa kutumika `kebab-case` (Maneno ya chini yaliyotenganishwa na hyphens) Inapaswa kuwa fupi ya kutosha kusoma kwa mtazamo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The description paragraph MUST be a single paragraph (no blank lines inside it)."
msgstr "Ibara ya Rasimu ya Katiba lazima iwe na sura moja (Hakuna mipaka ndani yake)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The design follows simple composition principles so environment state can be loaded safely and consistently without duplicating logic in many places. 🧱"
msgstr "Design ifuatavyo kanuni rahisi utungaji hivyo hali ya mazingira inaweza kubeba salama na mara kwa mara bila mantiki duplicating katika maeneo mengi. 🧱"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The destructive drill, sync pass only. It proves the backup is restorable rather than merely present — the property a backup exists for."
msgstr "Uvunjaji wa nguvu, sync hupita tu. Inathibitisha chelezo ni restorable badala ya sasa tu - mali chelezo ipo kwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The detection is line-based: the task block is the span between the nearest `- name:` (at indent N) above the offending line and the next top-level structural marker (`- name:` at indent <= N, or end of file). Within that span we look for any `when:` clause whose textual value names the compose-only boolean."
msgstr "Kugundua ni msingi wa mstari: kizuizi cha kazi ni span kati ya karibu `- name:` (Ndani ya N) Juu ya mstari wa makosa na alama ya ngazi ya juu ya muundo (`- name:` Kuingia <= N, au mwisho wa faili)Katika mfululizo huu tunatarajia `when:` Kifungu ambacho thamani yake ya maandishi huitwa boolean."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The dev compose stack has no inventory and caches exactly what the roles declare. A deployed host caches what its configuration says, which starts from the same declarations and lets the inventory correct or extend them::"
msgstr "Stack ya kutunga ya dev haina hesabu na caches hasa nini majukumu ya kutangaza. Sehemu iliyotumiwa ya mwenyeji inahifadhi kile usanidi wake unasema, ambayo huanza kutoka kwa matangazo sawa na inaruhusu hesabu kuwa sahihi au kupanua:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The dev-deploy CLI threads the variant index through three layers so a variant's `variants.yml` overlay reaches the credential subprocess."
msgstr "Deploy CLI hupunguza index ya lahaja kwa njia ya tabaka tatu ili lahaja ya `variants.yml` Inakua haraka sana kwa subprocess ya credential."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The development deploy CLI uses a **folder-per-round model** that splits cleanly between the init step (which materialises the inventories) and the deploy step (which iterates them):"
msgstr "Uendelezaji wa mfumo wa CLI hutumia A **Mfumo wa uendeshaji wa folder-per-round** Hii ni tofauti kati ya hatua ya ndani (Ambaye amekusanya hesabu za) Hatua ya utekelezaji (ambao unawafanya wawe):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-format
msgid "The device LUKS passphrase is prompted interactively on a terminal, or read from stdin when piped (`printf '%s' \"$pass\" | recover device ...`)."
msgstr "Kifaa LUKS passphrase ni wakiongozwa maingiliano kwenye terminal, au kusoma kutoka stdin wakati bomba (`printf '%s' \"$pass\" | recover device ...`)..."

