# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The drill owns the **lifecycle** and nothing else. Every restore is `python3 -m cli.administration.recover`, the same command an operator runs after a real loss, so the drill exercises that tool instead of a second implementation of it."
msgstr "Tembo mwenyewe ndiye **Maisha ya rafu** Hakuna kitu kingine. Marejeo ya kila kitu `python3 -m cli.administration.recover`, amri hiyo operator anaendesha baada ya hasara halisi, hivyo mazoezi ya drill kwamba chombo badala ya utekelezaji wa pili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The drill proves the `svc-bkp-*` chain forward through the DEPLOYED systemd units (nfs on the export host, volume + secrets on the manager when the app's include closure pulls those roles in, remote pull + device sync on the backup host) and every `recover.py` back (device -> local root -> NFS export, docker volume and host secrets into the live system paths), with marker files that must survive the whole loop: the matrix update pass boots the recovered stack and `verify_recovered_marker.sh` asserts the marker on the live volume. It reuses the round-1 stack instead of spinning a dedicated cluster, and skips cleanly when the app declares no NFS-flagged volume. The backup host is started by `routine/01_bootstrap.sh` (drill profile) and receives its two roles via `extend_inventory`; the pull trust (backup keypair) and the device mount/target/source come from `utils/tests/swarm/write/extras.py`, while `remote-2-local.backup_providers` is derived per round by `utils/tests/swarm/backup_repos.py` from the same placements `extend_inventory` turns into inventory groups, and reaches the deploy through the provisioner's host_vars merge."
msgstr "Spika alisisitiza kuwa `svc-bkp-*` Kuunganishwa kwa mfumo wa DEPLOYED (nfs juu ya mwenyeji wa nje, kiasi + siri juu ya meneja wakati programu ni pamoja na kufungwa huvuta majukumu hayo katika, kuvuta mbali + kifaa sync kwenye mwenyeji wa Backup) Na kwa kila `recover.py` Kurudi nyuma (Mfumo wa mizizi -> mizizi ya eneo NFS kuuza nje, kiasi cha docker na siri za mwenyeji katika njia za mfumo wa kuishi), na faili alama kwamba lazima kuishi kitanzi nzima: matrix update kupita boots stack kulipwa na `verify_recovered_marker.sh` Weka alama kwenye kiwango cha maisha. Inabadilisha mzunguko wa -1 stack badala ya kuzunguka nguzo ya kujitolea, na kuruka safi wakati programu inatangaza kiasi cha NFS-flagged. Huduma ya mwenyeji wa wavuti huanza na `routine/01_bootstrap.sh` (Maelezo ya mchezo) Kwa upande wake Bi. `extend_inventory`· Kujiamini (Backup ya Keypad) na mfumo wa mount/target/source Kutoka kwa `utils/tests/swarm/write/extras.py`, Hata hivyo, wakati `remote-2-local.backup_providers` Imetolewa kwa pande zote `utils/tests/swarm/backup_repos.py` kutoka kwenye maeneo hayo `extend_inventory` Kuingiza katika makundi ya hesabu, na kufikia kupelekwa kwa njia ya mpokeaji host_vars Kuunganisha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The drill runs whenever the app declares an NFS-flagged volume (`PRIMARY_NFS_VOLUME`); apps without one skip it, since there is nothing to prove a restore against."
msgstr "Mazoezi huendesha kila wakati programu inatangaza kiasi cha NFS-flagged (`PRIMARY_NFS_VOLUME`); programu bila kuruka moja, kwa sababu hakuna kitu cha kuthibitisha kurejesha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The dump recreates roles and databases, which an application role may not do, so the credentials are the instance's superuser rather than an app's."
msgstr "Dump recreates majukumu na databases, ambayo jukumu maombi inaweza kufanya, hivyo sifa ni mfano superuser badala ya programu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The edge map is built once at startup and kept in step with the writes this server performs, so a role file edited by hand elsewhere needs a restart."
msgstr "Ramani ya makali imejengwa mara moja wakati wa kuanza na kuwekwa hatua kwa kuandika seva hii hufanya, hivyo faili ya jukumu lililohaririwa na mkono mahali pengine inahitaji kuanza upya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
