# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The fact is not merely late, it is wrong while it is late. Facts are read before the daemon config is applied, so ``docker0`` still carries docker's own default; writing the pools then moves the bridge underneath it. A swarm node measured ``172.17.0.1`` in daemon.json against a live ``10.208.0.1``, which is why the declaration answers here and the fact never does."
msgstr "Ukweli sio tu kuchelewa, ni makosa wakati ni kuchelewa. Ukweli ni kusoma kabla ya config ya daemon kutumika, hivyo ``docker0`` Bado hubeba default ya docker mwenyewe; kuandika mabwawa kisha hatua daraja chini yake. Mkojo wa node ``172.17.0.1`` Ndani ya daemon.json dhidi ya kuishi ``10.208.0.1``, Hii ndiyo sababu ya ukweli na ukweli ambao kamwe haupatikani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The factors are `locality`, `cost`, `speed`, `caching` and `throughput`. `cost` is the expected bill for this request, input price times estimated input tokens plus output price times requested output, because ranking on the input price alone reads the cheaper half: an output token commonly costs several times an input one, and a short prompt with a long answer inverts the order the input price suggests. `caching` prefers a route that can reuse a cached prefix, which is the largest real saving for an agent with a stable system prompt. `throughput` reads the catalogued `tpm`, the only quota the catalog carries."
msgstr "Sababu ni kuwa `locality`, Kwa hivyo, `cost`, Kwa hivyo, `speed`, Kwa hivyo, `caching` Aidha, na `throughput`... `cost` ni muswada unaotarajiwa kwa ombi hili, nyakati za bei za pembejeo zinazokadiriwa ishara za pembejeo pamoja na nyakati za bei ya pato lililoombwa, kwa sababu cheo kwenye bei ya pembejeo peke yake kinasoma nusu ya bei nafuu: ishara ya pato kawaida hugharimu mara kadhaa pembejeo moja, na haraka fupi na jibu la muda mrefu husababisha utaratibu wa bei ya pembejeo inaonyesha. `caching` Inapendelea njia ambayo inaweza kutumia upya prefix ya cached, ambayo ni kuokoa kubwa zaidi kwa wakala na mfumo imara haraka. `throughput` Kusoma orodha ya `tpm`, Hiyo ndiyo orodha pekee ya klabu zinazoshiriki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The fallback Jinja string in the base `meta/services.yml` is the safety net for the case where neither variant overrides the flag and the operator still adds `web-app-discourse` to the inventory groups manually: the runtime `lookup('config', application_id, 'services.discourse.enabled')` then renders the conditional against the real `group_names` and the wp-discourse plugin install enables itself accordingly."
msgstr "Msingi wa Jinja katika msingi `meta/services.yml` Je, ni wavu wa usalama kwa kesi ambapo hakuna lahaja zaidi ya bendera na operator bado anaongeza `web-app-discourse` Vikundi vya hesabu kwa manually: Runtime `lookup('config', application_id, 'services.discourse.enabled')` na kisha kuchukua hatua za kisheria dhidi ya `group_names` Plugin ya wp-discourse inaruhusu yenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The fallback is not a default -- the value still comes from the single source, just read directly instead of through a generated ``.env``. It is what lets a CLI run outside ``scripts/meta/env/load.sh`` without either inventing a value or dying on a key the repository does declare."
msgstr "Kuanguka sio chaguo-msingi - thamani bado inatoka kwa chanzo kimoja, soma tu moja kwa moja badala ya kupitia yanayotokana. ``.env``. Ni kitu ambacho kinaifanya CCM kuwa nje ya ``scripts/meta/env/load.sh`` Bila ama kutunga thamani au kufa juu ya ufunguo hazina inatangaza."

