# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The fleet is deployed on **every** cluster node, but not as a ``docker stack`` service (``workload: node-local`` in ``meta/services.yml``): each runner needs the docker socket and the registered identity of exactly its node. The image is built once on the manager and distributed through the registry dependency (``svc-registry-docker``), the only part that runs as a swarm service."
msgstr "Meli hiyo ilipelekwa katika **Kila mmoja kila mmoja** ya Muungano, lakini si kama ``docker stack`` Huduma ya Huduma (``workload: node-local`` Ndani ya ``meta/services.yml``): Kila mkimbiaji anahitaji mkoba wa docker na utambulisho uliosajiliwa wa node yake. Picha ni kujengwa mara moja juu ya meneja na kusambazwa kwa njia ya Usajili utegemezi (``svc-registry-docker``)Hii ni sehemu pekee ambayo inatumika kama huduma ya dharura."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The fleet is deployed on **every** cluster node, but not as a `docker stack` service (`workload: node-local` in `meta/services.yml`): each runner needs the docker socket and the registered identity of exactly its node. The image is built once on the manager and distributed through the registry dependency (`svc-registry-docker`), the only part that runs as a swarm service."
msgstr "Meli hiyo ilipelekwa katika **Kila mmoja kila mmoja** ya Muungano, lakini si kama `docker stack` Huduma ya Huduma (`workload: node-local` Ndani ya `meta/services.yml`): Kila mkimbiaji anahitaji mkoba wa docker na utambulisho uliosajiliwa wa node yake. Picha ni kujengwa mara moja juu ya meneja na kusambazwa kwa njia ya Usajili utegemezi (`svc-registry-docker`)Hii ni sehemu pekee ambayo inatumika kama huduma ya dharura."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The floor keeps a short entry out: ``Situation`` becomes ``Lage`` and loses half its characters while saying the same thing. A passage past it that comes back halved has dropped a clause."
msgstr "Sehemu ya chini ya ardhi inachukua kuingia kwa muda mfupi: ``Situation`` kuwa inakuwa ``Lage`` na nusu ya wajumbe wa kamati hiyo wakati akitoa hotuba yake. Kifungu cha zamani ambacho huja nyuma nusu kimeacha kifungu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The focus here is not feature work, but control and safety: development workflows sometimes need a softer security posture, while cleanup paths must leave the system in a predictable state again. That makes this area less about convenience and more about trust, reversibility, and clear operational boundaries. 🔒"
msgstr "Lengo hapa sio kazi ya kipengele, lakini udhibiti na usalama: kazi za maendeleo wakati mwingine zinahitaji msimamo wa usalama laini, wakati njia za kusafisha lazima ziache mfumo katika hali ya kutabirika tena. Hiyo inafanya eneo hili kuwa chini kuhusu urahisi na zaidi kuhusu uaminifu, kubadilika, na mipaka ya wazi ya uendeshaji. 🔒"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The folder name represents the bundle identifier."
msgstr "Jina la folda inawakilisha kitambulisho cha kifungu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The following declare an LDAP block but legitimately do not expose a test-drivable LDAP login surface (consumer-side only, infrastructural, or already covered by their own service-level test). Closing each item is a NOOP unless a stale env key shows up."
msgstr "Ifuatayo inatangaza kizuizi cha LDAP lakini kwa halali haitoi uso wa kuingia kwa LDAP (upande wa watumiaji tu, infrastructural, au tayari kufunikwa na mtihani wao wa ngazi ya huduma). kufunga kila kitu ni NOOP isipokuwa stale env muhimu inaonyesha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The following directories are never readable, even if a task explicitly requests access:"
