msgstr "Majukumu yafuatayo haipaswi kuwa `BIBER_*` Katika kesi hii, safisha nywele zote na safisha kila kitu, na kisha safisha nywele zako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The following roles have an MCP surface confirmed from upstream or project-owned documentation at requirement creation time. Each row is an implementation candidate, not proof that the current role already exposes MCP."
msgstr "Majukumu yafuatayo yana uso wa MCP uliothibitishwa kutoka kwa upstream au nyaraka zinazomilikiwa na mradi wakati wa mahitaji ya uumbaji. Kila mstari ni mgombea wa utekelezaji, sio ushahidi kwamba jukumu la sasa linafunua MCP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The following roles have an upstream MCP path that this deployment cannot use. Each declares a `services.mcp` block carrying only `blocker`, `source_url` and `notes`, with `enabled` and `shared` false, so the role stays out of discovery while the audit still reports why it is not integrated:"
msgstr "Majukumu yafuatayo yana njia ya juu ya MCP ambayo kupelekwa hii haiwezi kutumia. Kila mmoja ahakikishe kuwa `services.mcp` Kuunganisha tu `blocker`, Kwa hivyo, `source_url` Aidha, na `notes`, Pamoja na `enabled` Aidha, na `shared` uongo, hivyo jukumu anakaa nje ya ugunduzi wakati ukaguzi bado ripoti kwa nini ni si jumuishi:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The format is the docker-compose `.env`-subset: flat `KEY=value` lines, `#` for comments, optional surrounding double/single quotes for values that contain whitespace or special characters. Anything more exotic (nested mappings, multiline values, variable expansion) is rejected so drift between the file and its consumers stays loud."
msgstr "Muundo ni muundo wa docker-compose `.env`Jamii:Waliozaliwa `KEY=value` Kwa maneno mengine, `#` Kwa maoni, hiari inayozunguka quotes mbili / moja kwa maadili ambayo yana Whitespace au wahusika maalum. kitu chochote zaidi ya kigeni (Ramani zilizowekwa, maadili ya multiline, upanuzi wa variable) Ni kukataliwa hivyo drift kati ya faili na watumiaji wake kukaa sauti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The former `roles/web-app-nextcloud/vars/plugins/sociallogin.yml` is deleted; the install/enable/configure tasks read `applications.web-app-nextcloud.addons.sociallogin.config` instead."
msgstr "Wa zamani wa `roles/web-app-nextcloud/vars/plugins/sociallogin.yml` Imeondolewa; install/enable/configure Majukumu ya kusoma `applications.web-app-nextcloud.addons.sociallogin.config` Badala yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The forward is per-variant: `meta/variants.yml` may drop the flag, and the role then loses the `HiddenServicePort` in that variant."
msgstr "Kuendeleza mwelekeo wa mbele: `meta/variants.yml` Anaweza kupeperusha bendera, na nafasi hiyo itapoteza `HiddenServicePort` katika tofauti hizo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The four served schemas are pinned in [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) and hashed into `tools.schema_sha256`; the adapter refuses to start when the two disagree."
msgstr "Vituo vinne vya kupigia kura vimefunguliwa katika [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) na kuingia katika `tools.schema_sha256`; Hata hivyo, mchezaji huyo alikataa kuanza wakati ambapo wawili hao hawakubaliani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The four served schemas are pinned in ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ and hashed into ``tools.schema_sha256``; the adapter refuses to start when the two disagree."
msgstr "Vituo vinne vya kupigia kura vimefunguliwa katika ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ and hashed into ``tools.schema_sha256``Hata hivyo, mchezaji huyo alikataa kuanza wakati ambapo wawili hao hawakubaliani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The front-page CSP + canonical-domain baseline is ungated and always runs."
msgstr "Ukurasa wa mbele wa CSP + msingi wa kikoa cha canonical ni ungated na daima inaendesha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full CSP test surface lives in the same module: `assertCspResponseHeader(response, label)` (returns the parsed directive map), `assertCspMetaParity(page, headerDirectives, label)` (verifies the optional `<meta http-equiv>` echo is a subset of the response header), `installCspViolationObserver(page)` + `readCspViolations(page)` (DOM-side `securitypolicyviolation` capture), `expectNoCspViolations(page, diagnostics, label)` (asserts neither the DOM stream nor `diagnostics.cspRelated` carries a violation), and the `EXPECTED_CSP_DIRECTIVES` constant. Specs MUST require these from `./personas`; inline copies are forbidden and caught at review."
msgstr "Uso kamili wa mtihani wa CSP huishi katika moduli moja: `assertCspResponseHeader(response, label)` (Rejea ramani ya maelekezo ya parsed)Kwa hivyo, `assertCspMetaParity(page, headerDirectives, label)` (kuthibitisha kuwa uamuzi wa `<meta http-equiv>` Echo ni sehemu ya kichwa cha majibu)Kwa hivyo, `installCspViolationObserver(page)` + + + + + + `readCspViolations(page)` (Ukumbi wa Dom `securitypolicyviolation` kukamata)Kwa hivyo, `expectNoCspViolations(page, diagnostics, label)` (Hakuna haja ya kuwa na baridi au baridi. `diagnostics.cspRelated` Kufanya makosa)Aidha, kwa kuwa `EXPECTED_CSP_DIRECTIVES` mara kwa mara. Watanzania wanahitaji hizi kutoka `./personas`; nakala za inline ni marufuku na kukamatwa katika ukaguzi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full branch name MUST follow one of the patterns below, depending on whether the change targets a specific role or is general:"
msgstr "Jina kamili la tawi LA LAZIMA kufuata moja ya mifumo hapa chini, kulingana na ikiwa mabadiliko yanalenga jukumu maalum au kwa ujumla:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full contributor guide is available at [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)."
msgstr "Mwongozo kamili wa wafadhili unapatikana katika [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full documentation portal is available at [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)."
msgstr "Orodha kamili ya nyaraka inapatikana katika [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full path string."
msgstr "Njia ya utumbo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gate is applied inside [push_ci_policy.sh](../../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/push_ci_policy.sh), which the `run-policy` job invokes. When `GITHUB_REF == refs/heads/main` and `CI_RUN_ON_MAIN != 'true'`, the job emits `should_run=false` and every downstream job is skipped."
msgstr "Mlango unafunguliwa ndani ya [push_ci_policy.sh](../../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/push_ci_policy.sh), ambayo `run-policy` maombi ya kazi. Wakati ambapo wakati `GITHUB_REF == refs/heads/main` Aidha, na `CI_RUN_ON_MAIN != 'true'`, Kazi ya kutoa `should_run=false` Kwa hiyo, kila kazi ya chini imeondolewa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway is therefore pinned on **variant 2** for every consumer that ships three variants, and left on variant 0 for the two-variant roles, whose round 2 falls back to it. One `make compose-deploy variant=2` run exercises eight of the nine confirmed roles. `web-app-nextcloud` is the exception: its AI surface has always lived on its own variant 7, alongside the other bridged partners it distributes across budget bins."
msgstr "Kwa hiyo mlango unafungwa **Tofauti ya 2** Kwa kila mtumiaji ambaye meli tatu tofauti na kushoto katika lahaja 0 Kwa upande wake Bi. 2 Rejea kwa hilo. Moja ya `make compose-deploy variant=2` Kamati hiyo imeainisha majukumu nane kati ya tisa yaliyopendekezwa. `web-app-nextcloud` Ni tofauti: uso wake wa AI daima umeishi katika lahaja zake mwenyewe. 7, pamoja na washirika wengine wa daraja ambao husambaza katika mifuko ya bajeti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway mints its virtual keys from the inventory it is deployed from, and a workstation is deployed from a different one. The key is therefore an operator-supplied credential on the workstation side: mint it on the server, then put it into the workstation inventory."
msgstr "Mlango wa lango unaunganisha funguo zake za kawaida kutoka kwa hesabu iliyotumwa kutoka, na kituo cha kazi kinatumika kutoka kwa moja tofauti. Funguo kwa hiyo ni credential ya operator kwenye upande wa kituo cha kazi: kuipunguza kwenye seva, kisha kuiweka kwenye hesabu ya kazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway publishes no `anthropic/*` model"
msgstr "Tovuti rasmi ya No `anthropic/*` Mfano wa Mfano"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway publishes no `openai/*` model, and the CLI test asserts their absence"
msgstr "Tovuti rasmi ya No `openai/*` Kamati hiyo, na Kamati ya Utendaji ya CCM imesisitiza kuwa hakuna"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway publishes no `openrouter/auto` model"
msgstr "Tovuti rasmi ya No `openrouter/auto` Mfano wa Mfano"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generated Root CA certificate can be injected into containers (e.g. via `sys-svc-compose-ca`) so that containers trust your internal TLS endpoints."
msgstr "Hati ya mizizi CA inaweza kuingizwa katika vyombo (Kwa njia ya `sys-svc-compose-ca`) Kwa hiyo vyombo hivyo vinaamini mwisho wako wa ndani wa TLS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generated Root CA certificate can be injected into containers (e.g. via ``sys-svc-compose-ca``) so that containers trust your internal TLS endpoints."
msgstr "Hati ya mizizi CA inaweza kuingizwa katika vyombo (Kwa njia ya ``sys-svc-compose-ca``) Kwa hiyo vyombo hivyo vinaamini mwisho wako wa ndani wa TLS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generated `.env` is the single effective configuration source for all tooling. `make dotenv` composes it from `default.env`, the environment handlers, and finally your personal `custom.env`."
msgstr "Uzalishaji wa `.env` Ni chanzo kimoja cha ufanisi wa usanidi kwa vifaa vyote. `make dotenv` Kueneza kutoka kwa `default.env`, mazingira, na hatimaye wananchi wenyewe `custom.env`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generation layout belongs to baudolo, which writes it, so the file names and subdirectory below are read from the generation's own manifest rather than restated here. Restating them would let a rename on its side leave the globs matching nothing, which reads as \"this generation holds no databases\" rather than as a failure."
msgstr "Mpangilio wa kizazi ni wa baudolo, ambayo inaandika, kwa hivyo majina ya faili na subdirectory hapa chini yanasomwa kutoka kwa wazi ya kizazi wenyewe badala ya kupumzika hapa. Kurejesha kwao kungeruhusu jina tena upande wake kuacha globs vinavyolingana na kitu, ambayo inasoma kama \"Jamii hii haina database\" badala ya kushindwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generator owns only the sections it can derive from metadata:"
msgstr "Jenereta inamiliki sehemu tu ambazo zinaweza kupata kutoka kwa metadata:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generic playwright biber and administrator personas are blocked via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Rule 11 explicit opt-out). Bluesky's social-app is a mobile-first SPA whose logout / account control sits behind a profile menu the auth-surface check cannot reach. The bespoke \"OIDC: oauth2-proxy + login-broker drop a Bluesky session into social-app via Keycloak (variant A+)\" test and its LDAP-variant counterpart in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` already verify both personas authenticate correctly (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt is present after the broker handoff). Once a stable selector for the social-app profile menu lands upstream, drop the opt-outs and let the persona helpers drive the dashboard → app → logout journey end-to-end."
msgstr "Watu wa kawaida wa playwright biber na msimamizi wamezuiwa kupitia `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` Aidha, na `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` Ndani ya `templates/playwright.env.j2` (ya 019 Utawala wa sheria 11 Uchaguzi wa wazi). Programu ya kijamii ya Bluesky ni SPA ya kwanza ya simu ambayo logi / udhibiti wa akaunti inakaa nyuma ya orodha ya wasifu hundi ya uso haiwezi kufikia. Kuwa bespoke \"Tag: oauth2-proxy + login-broker ya ya Bluesky Kuingia kwenye app ya kijamii kupitia Keycloak (Tofauti ya A +)\" ya Muungano na mwenzake wa Tanganyika katika `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` kuhakikisha kuwa watu hao wawili wanakuwa waadilifu (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt Hii ni baada ya mauzo ya broker)Mara baada ya kuchagua imara kwa orodha ya maelezo ya kijamii-programu ya orodha ya ardhi upstream, kuacha opt-outs na kuruhusu wasaidizi wa mtu kuendesha dashibodi → programu → safari ya mwisho-kwa-mwisho."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The goal of this deployment is to provide a production-ready, scalable WordPress instance with multisite capabilities and enhanced performance. By automating the custom image build and configuration processes via Docker Compose and Ansible, it minimizes manual intervention, reduces errors, and allows you to concentrate on building great content."
msgstr "Lengo la kupelekwa hii ni kutoa uzalishaji-tayari, scalable WordPress Mfano na uwezo wa multisite na utendaji kuimarishwa. Kwa kutengeneza picha ya desturi kujenga na michakato ya usanidi kupitia Docker Compose Na Ansible, hupunguza uingiliaji wa mwongozo, hupunguza makosa, na inakuwezesha kuzingatia kujenga maudhui mazuri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The goal of this role is to deliver a **hassle-free, production-ready reverse proxy** for self-hosted containers, suitable for homelabs and small-scale production workloads."
msgstr "Lengo la hatua hii ni kutoa **Has-free, uzalishaji-ready reverse wakala** Kwa vyombo vya kujitegemea, vinavyofaa kwa homelabs na kazi ndogo za uzalishaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The goal of this role is to provide a **single source of truth for theming** across your infrastructure."
msgstr "Lengo la hatua hii ni kutoa **Ni ukweli wa milele kwa ajili yao.** kupitia miundombinu yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The goal of this role is to provide a **single source of truth for theming** across your infrastructure.   It makes all applications feel like part of the same ecosystem, visually and functionally."
msgstr "Lengo la hatua hii ni kutoa **Ni ukweli wa milele kwa ajili yao.** kupitia miundombinu yake. Inafanya maombi yote kujisikia kama sehemu ya mazingira sawa, Visually na kazi."

