# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The journey is covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/test-sso-login.js``, which seeds the landing flag, clicks the GitLab-slot link, verifies the channel view, and signs out via ``/logout``; ``files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js`` adds the peer exchange. The path back to the generic personas is an SSO control whose accessible name matches the shared matcher."
msgstr "Safari hiyo imegubikwa na utata katika ``files/playwright/test-sso-login.js``, ambayo inapiga bendera ya kutua, bonyeza GitLab-slot kiungo, kuthibitisha mtazamo channel, na ishara nje kupitia ``/logout``; ``files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js`` Ongeza kiwango cha ubadilishaji. Njia ya kurudi kwa personas ya kawaida ni udhibiti wa SSO ambao jina lake la kupatikana linalingana na mchezaji wa pamoja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The journey is covered bespoke in `files/playwright/test-sso-login.js`, which seeds the landing flag, clicks the GitLab-slot link, verifies the channel view, and signs out via `/logout`; `files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js` adds the peer exchange. The path back to the generic personas is an SSO control whose accessible name matches the shared matcher."
msgstr "Safari hiyo imegubikwa na utata katika `files/playwright/test-sso-login.js`, ambayo inapiga bendera ya kutua, bonyeza GitLab-slot kiungo, kuthibitisha mtazamo channel, na ishara nje kupitia `/logout`; `files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js` Ongeza kiwango cha ubadilishaji. Njia ya kurudi kwa personas ya kawaida ni udhibiti wa SSO ambao jina lake la kupatikana linalingana na mchezaji wa pamoja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. [`files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`](./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js) drives it through Shopware's own selectors: an authenticated backend assertion, then logout through the user-actions toggle and back to the login form. `SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED` selects how it signs in — through the `a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button` provider link that AdminOpenAuth appends into `.sw-login__content` when SSO is on, through the native password form when it is off. The `guest` persona and the role-local reachability, TLS and HSTS assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Safari yenyewe haikuwa mbali. [`files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`](./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js) Akiwasilisha kupitia ShopwareWachaguaji wenyewe: madai ya backend kuthibitishwa, kisha ingia kupitia hatua za mtumiaji kuingiza na kurudi kwenye fomu ya kuingia. `SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED` Chagua jinsi ya kufanya hivyo - kwa kubonyeza hapa. `a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button` Msaada kwa ajili ya AdminOpenAuth kuingia `.sw-login__content` Wakati SSO iko, kupitia fomu ya nenosiri la asili wakati iko mbali. Kwa kuwa `guest` persona na ushiriki wa ndani, TLS na HSTS madai kukimbia bila masharti."

