msgstr "Jaribio la lint ambalo linashindwa wakati faili ya mahitaji inakaguliwa kabisa ([tests/lint/repository/documentation/test_requirements_completeness.py](../../../tests/lint/repository/documentation/test_requirements_completeness.py)) bado wanaishi hapa. Kwa sasa inafungua nyaraka za awali kutoka `pkgmgr.actions.archive`· Kuingia kwa kupitia kwa `dev` Nyongeza ya [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The list below was produced by grepping each `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` for `biber|BIBER`. A role appears under \"missing\" iff it has a Playwright spec, no biber references, AND its policy classification (next column) says one is expected. Each checkbox MUST be closed by reading the spec end to end, deciding whether the role is in scope, and then either adding the biber scenario (and the env keys) OR documenting in the commit message why the role is exempt and removing it from this list."
msgstr "Orodha hapa chini ilichapishwa kwa kubonyeza kila mmoja. `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` Kwa ajili ya `biber|BIBER`. Jukumu hili linaonekana chini ya \"missing\" iff ina spec ya Playwright, hakuna marejeleo ya biber, na uainishaji wake wa sera (Ukurasa unaofuata) Alisema kuwa mmoja wa Kila hundi lazima kufungwa kwa kusoma spec mwisho, kuamua kama jukumu ni katika upeo, na kisha ama kuongeza hali biber. (Kwa upande wake Meneja wa) Au kuandika katika ujumbe wa kujitolea kwa nini jukumu ni msamaha na kuiondoa kwenye orodha hii."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The list below was produced by grepping each role's `meta/services.yml` for an `ldap` block with `enabled` set to something other than `false`. Each checkbox MUST be closed by reading the spec end to end, deciding whether the role exposes a test-drivable LDAP auth surface, and then either adding the LDAP scenario OR documenting in the commit message why the role is exempt (e.g. the LDAP integration is consumer-side only, with no Playwright- reachable login UI)."
msgstr "Orodha iliyo hapa chini imetayarishwa kwa kila kipengele `meta/services.yml` Kwa ajili ya `ldap` block kwa ajili ya `enabled` Kuweka kitu kingine `false`. Kila checkbox lazima kufungwa kwa kusoma spec mwisho mwisho, kuamua kama jukumu kufichua mtihani-drivable LDAP uso auth, na kisha kuongeza hali LDAP au kuandika katika ujumbe wa kufanya kwa nini jukumu ni msamaha (e.g Ushirikiano wa LDAP ni upande wa watumiaji tu, bila kuingia kwa Playwright)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The list is cut into serial chunks with a hard boundary at the priority/regular seam (:mod:`cli.meta.ci.chunks`), sized by the run's job and queue budget (:mod:`cli.meta.ci.slots`)."
msgstr "Orodha ni kukatwa katika chunks mfululizo na mpaka mgumu katika kipaumbele / kawaida seam (:mod:`cli.meta.ci.chunks`), ukubwa kwa kazi ya kukimbia na bajeti ya foleni (:mod:`cli.meta.ci.slots`)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The list was held against the repository by three lints that parsed this section. They are gone, and the trade is deliberate: a lint that reads prose ties every role addition to an edit here, and the audit is a review record rather than a runtime registry. What they proved while they ran is worth keeping: the classification check named twenty-four roles whose audit entry contradicted their own metadata the first time it ran, nine of them shipping an adapter while the list still called them untried candidates. Without them, a role added later is absent here until someone notices."
msgstr "Orodha hiyo ilikuwa imeshikiliwa dhidi ya hifadhi ya watu watatu ambao walishiriki sehemu hii. Wamekwenda, na biashara ni ya makusudi: lint inayosoma mahusiano ya prose kila jukumu la kuongeza hariri hapa, na ukaguzi ni rekodi ya ukaguzi badala ya usajili wa muda. Kile walichothibitisha wakati wa mbio ni thamani ya kuweka: ukaguzi wa uainishaji ulipewa majukumu ishirini na nne ambayo kuingia kwa ukaguzi ulipingana na metadata yao wenyewe mara ya kwanza ilipokimbia, tisa kati yao hutoa adapta wakati orodha bado inawaita wagombea wasio na makazi. Bila wao, jukumu lililoongezwa baadaye halipo hapa hadi mtu atambue."

