msgstr "Miguu ya Kiongozi wa Hatua 2, Kwa hivyo, 4 Aidha, na 9 Tumia tu wakati programu ni pamoja na kufunga `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` Kwa hivyo `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`... `utils/tests/swarm/backup_repos.py` wa Kamati ya Hesabu za Serikali na Kamati ya `remote-2-local` Orodha ya mtoa huduma kutoka kwa kufungwa; programu bila majukumu hayo zinathibitisha mnyororo kupitia hazina ya nfs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The manifest document, or None when the generation carries none."
msgstr "Hati ya wazi, au hakuna wakati wa kizazi hakuna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The manual entry workflow (`entry-manual-steer.yml`) sets `cancel-in-progress: true` on its own group, and the orchestrator's group cancels for `workflow_dispatch` regardless of ref, so a manual sweep supersedes on both levels, `main` included."
msgstr "Mwongozo wa kuingia workflow (`entry-manual-steer.yml`) Kuweka `cancel-in-progress: true` kwa niaba ya chama chake, na kwa niaba ya Chama cha Mapinduzi kwa ajili ya `workflow_dispatch` Bila kujali ref, hivyo mwongozo sweep supersedes juu ya ngazi zote mbili, `main` ya pamoja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The map itself is generated, never tracked, so no second copy of a hostname can drift; ``utils.cache.render.render_artifacts`` writes it once the value-set is built."
msgstr "Ramani yenyewe inazalishwa, haijawahi kufuatilia, hivyo hakuna nakala ya pili ya jina la mwenyeji inaweza drift; ``utils.cache.render.render_artifacts`` Andika mara moja thamani ya kuweka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The marked row carries `instructions: <mode>` in the matrix JSON and a 📖 in its job title, between the variant number and the ⭐ of a priority row."
msgstr "Alama ya upinde wa mvua `instructions: <mode>` Ndani ya JSON na A 📖 Katika cheo chake cha kazi, kati ya idadi ya lahaja na the ya mstari wa kipaumbele."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The marker adds `web-app-docs` to that row's `apps`, so the documentation is deployed beside the role under test. Its own CLI test then reads the role's page, takes the Production block out of the rendered HTML, and runs it."
msgstr "Alama ya kuongeza `web-app-docs` Kwa mujibu wa Ibara hii `apps`, Kwa hiyo, nyaraka zinapelekwa kando ya jukumu lililo chini ya mtihani. Jaribio lake mwenyewe la CLI kisha linasoma ukurasa wa jukumu, inachukua kizuizi cha Uzalishaji nje ya HTML iliyotolewa, na inaendesha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The marker file carries the same name as the swarm drill's (`scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/routine/backup/base.sh`) — one name for one concept. The implementations stay apart on purpose: the swarm drill follows a single token across five hops on four machines from the controller, which has nothing in common with marking every subject of one host beyond the three lines that write a file and read it back."
msgstr "Faili ya alama hubeba jina sawa na drill ya kundi (`scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/routine/backup/base.sh`) Jina moja kwa dhana moja. Utekelezaji unakaa mbali kwa madhumuni: kuchimba kwa makundi hufuata ishara moja katika hops tano kwenye mashine nne kutoka kwa mtawala, ambayo haina kitu sawa na kuashiria kila somo la jeshi moja zaidi ya mistari mitatu ambayo huandika faili na kuisoma nyuma."

