# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The narrow case is what a deploy job actually sees, because the matrix hands every row exactly one kind. Reading that narrowness as a demand would turn every condition the applying step tolerates into a red row on every deploy: a loop device it could not claim, a pool another job still holds. The run's own input decides instead."
msgstr "Kesi nyembamba ni nini kazi ya kupeleka kweli anaona, kwa sababu mikono ya tumbo kila mstari hasa aina moja. Kusoma kuwa nyembamba kama mahitaji ingeweza kugeuka kila hali ya kutumia hatua kuvumilia katika mstari mwekundu juu ya kila kupeleka: kifaa kitanzi haikuweza kudai, bwawa kazi nyingine bado ana. Matokeo ya uchaguzi wenyewe ndiyo haya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
