msgstr "Ya baadaye `make compose-deploy mode=update apps=web-app-hugo` Atavuta picha, kuanzisha upya nginx, na kutumikia pato lililotolewa safi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The next stage in the pipeline MUST NOT execute when the previous stage classified the plugin as `incompatible`."
msgstr "Hatua inayofuata katika bomba haipaswi kutekeleza wakati hatua ya awali iliainisha Plugin kama `incompatible`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The nfs-server uses the userspace `nfs-ganesha` (`ganesha`) flavor in every runtime; `services.nfs-server.flavor` in `roles/svc-storage-nfs-server/meta/services.yml` is the SPOT, and `kernel` is a per-inventory override. Ganesha is packaged for the `Debian` and `RedHat` os families only. Kernel `nfsd` in a privileged DinD node is wedge-prone: the export can be present yet the controller mount returns ENOENT, and `exportfs` can stick in D-state. If a swarm step hangs at `Reload NFS exports` from a stuck kernel-NFS mount, you MUST recover with `make swarm-clean` on the host; see the NFS gotcha in [Roundtrip Loop](roundtrip.md). You MUST NOT fall back to a compose-only sweep while swarm is blocked."
msgstr "Nfs-server inatumia nafasi ya mtumiaji `nfs-ganesha` (`ganesha`) katika ngazi zote. `services.nfs-server.flavor` Ndani ya `roles/svc-storage-nfs-server/meta/services.yml` Je, ni lini barabara hiyo itajengwa, na `kernel` Hii ni moja ya dhana za juu. Ganesha achaguliwa kuwa rais `Debian` Aidha, na `RedHat` ya familia tu. Kernel ya `nfsd` Katika upendeleo DinD node ni wedge-prone: kuuza nje inaweza kuwa sasa lakini mlima mtawala anarudi ENOENT, na `exportfs` Inaweza kuwa katika hali ya D. Ikiwa hatua ya ukuaji itaanguka kwenye `Reload NFS exports` Kutoka kwenye mlima wa kernel-NFS, unahitaji kupona `make swarm-clean` Kwa upande wake Mkuu wa Mkoa wa Njombe, Dk. [Uwasilishaji wa Loop](roundtrip.md). Sio lazima kurudi kwenye kitambaa tu wakati wadudu imefungwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The nginx upstream map, the consumer compose override and the package managers' client configuration all follow from the ``cache:`` declarations in the roles' `meta/networks.yml`. None of them is tracked; this package regenerates them. Implementation lives in `utils.cache.render`."
msgstr "Ramani ya nginx upstream, matumizi ya kuandika override na usanidi wa mteja wa mfuko wote hufuata kutoka ``cache:`` katika majukumu yao” `meta/networks.yml`. Hakuna hata mmoja wao aliyeguswa; mfuko huu unawafufua. Utekelezaji wa maisha katika `utils.cache.render`..."

