msgstr "Amri hiyo katika `ORDERED_HANDLERS` Lazima uheshimu data ya faragha. Mfano: `infinito_container` Baada ya `passthrough` Kwa hiyo unaweza kusoma maelezo ya `INFINITO_DISTRO`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The order is a precondition, not a preference. `baudolo-restore --empty` pre-cleans the schema in one psql session and replays in the next; a booting consumer recreates it in between and the dump's own `CREATE TABLE` fails — which is how zammad turned this drill red with `relation \"ar_internal_metadata\" already exists`. The chain refuses the replay while a consumer runs, so a drill that got the order wrong would fail loudly instead of flaking."
msgstr "Amri ni utangulizi, si upendeleo. `baudolo-restore --empty` Kabla ya kusafisha schema katika kikao kimoja cha psql na replays katika ijayo; mtumiaji wa booting huijenga kati na dump mwenyewe `CREATE TABLE` Na hii ni njia ambayo Allaah Aliyetukuka Ameijaalia rangi hii kuwa ni `relation \"ar_internal_metadata\" already exists`. Mlolongo unakataa kucheza wakati mtumiaji anaendesha, hivyo drill kwamba got amri makosa itakuwa kushindwa kwa sauti badala ya flaking."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The order of those mocks is load-bearing and the router is not what reads it. `AI_AGENT_MODEL` takes `AI_MOCK_ALIASES | first`, so the mock declared first becomes the agent broker's model and its window becomes the context the broker gates platforms on. Declaring the 4096 mock first withheld `hermes`, whose `min_context` is 64000, and the broker's CLI test failed with the reason spelled out. The widest mock therefore leads. A sharper fix would be to have `AI_AGENT_MODEL` pick the mock with the largest declared context instead of the first one, which would make the order irrelevant."
msgstr "Hii ina maana kwamba maudhui haya ni ya kipekee, na wala si ya kuvutia. `AI_AGENT_MODEL` Kuchukua `AI_MOCK_ALIASES | first`, hivyo kejeli alitangaza kwanza inakuwa mfano wa wakala na dirisha lake inakuwa mazingira majukwaa broker milango juu. Uamuzi wa 4096 Kuondolewa kwa kwanza `hermes`, ambaye `min_context` Ilikuwa ni 64000, na jaribio la broker la CLI lilishindwa na sababu iliyoandikwa. Kwa hiyo, uongozi wa juu unaongoza. itakuwa na kiwango kikubwa zaidi cha `AI_AGENT_MODEL` Chagua kejeli na muktadha mkubwa uliotangazwa badala ya ule wa kwanza, ambao ungefanya amri hiyo kuwa na maana."

