msgstr "Bandari per-category safu kwamba mapendekezo kutoka na kwamba lint kuangalia utekelezaji kuishi kama moja `PORT_BANDS` Ramani ya [08Mtandao.yml](../../../../../group_vars/all/08_networks.yml). Wapendekezaji na lint huchukua entries mpya moja kwa moja, bila hatua ya pili ya usajili. See ya `cli contributing network ports suggest` Ndani ya [port.md](../../../tools/network/port.md)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The per-role complexity score, its ``dna`` cluster key and ``siblings``."
msgstr "Matokeo ya mtihani wa rangi, matokeo yake ``dna`` Msingi wa msingi na ``siblings``..."

