# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The persona scenarios MUST drive the journey from [Three personas, fixed flow](#three-personas-fixed-flow-) end to end. Per-service contract tests MUST exercise the [per-service assertion catalogue](#per-service-assertion-catalogue-) entry that matches their gated service. The [test_no_stub_tests.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_no_stub_tests.py) lint hard-fails the build when a stub is detected, so the rule is enforced automatically."
msgstr "Matukio ya mtu binafsi lazima kuendesha safari kutoka [Watu watatu wafariki, wafariki dunia](#three-personas-fixed-flow-) Mwisho wa mwisho. Majaribio ya mkataba wa huduma lazima yafanyike [Orodha ya maombi ya kazi](#per-service-assertion-catalogue-) Kuingia ambayo inalingana na huduma yao ya lango. Kwa kuwa [test_no_stub_tests.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_no_stub_tests.py) Lint ngumu kushindwa kujenga wakati stub ni wanaona, hivyo kanuni ni kutekelezwa moja kwa moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pin lives in ``[project.optional-dependencies].dev`` (one SPOT, Dependabot keeps it current). Host venvs, the lint container and CI all read that same pin, so a rule that is preview-gated in one release and stable in the next (e.g. ISC004, or S310 firing on ``urllib.request.Request``) cannot disagree across environments."
msgstr "Pindua huishi katika ``[project.optional-dependencies].dev`` (Kwa upande mwingine, Dependabot bado ni). Jeshi la venvs, chombo cha lint na CI wote husoma pin hiyo, kwa hivyo sheria ambayo inatangulia katika kutolewa moja na imara katika ijayo. (Kwa mfano, ISC004, Kwa mfano, S310 Risasi juu ya ``urllib.request.Request``) Hatuwezi kutokubaliana na mazingira."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pinned 6.7.8.2 predates the experimental native `/api/_mcp` server."
msgstr "Ya pinned 6.7.8.2 Uendelezaji wa majaribio ya asili `/api/_mcp` ya server."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pinned build is the amd64 AppImage, and the role refuses a host of another architecture rather than linking a binary that cannot run there."
msgstr "Msingi wa msingi ni amd64 Picha, na jukumu linakataa usanifu mwingine badala ya kuunganisha binary ambayo haiwezi kukimbia huko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pinned image runs on arm64"
msgstr "Image caption Picha hiyo ilipigwa kwenye mkono64"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pinned release is inference-only; an MCP-capable one may be selected only after source inspection proves per-server routes, exact tool allowlists and the credential lifecycle."
msgstr "Kutolewa kwa pinned ni tofauti tu; MCP-uwezo mmoja inaweza kuchaguliwa tu baada ya ukaguzi wa chanzo kuthibitisha njia za kila seva, vibali halisi vya chombo na mzunguko wa maisha."

