# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pipeline owns three responsibilities for one Nextcloud plugin (app):"
msgstr "Kamati ina majukumu matatu kwa mtu mmoja Nextcloud Plugin ya Plugin (App ya app):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The placement rule is per check. The catalog \"Position\" column uses these labels."
msgstr "Utawala wa uwekezaji ni kwa kuangalia. Orodha ya catalog \"Position\" . Tumia maandiko haya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plain image tag becomes a manifest list. Anything that inspects the tag expecting a single image manifest sees an index instead."
msgstr "Picha ya wazi inakuwa orodha wazi. Kila kitu ambacho hukagua tag kutarajia picha moja wazi anaona index badala yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plain-scalar rule is deliberately narrower than YAML's: a plain scalar must start with a letter, an underscore or a slash, and may then carry only ``[A-Za-z0-9_./+@:-]`` and spaces. That excludes every leading character PyYAML's implicit resolvers key off, so no accepted plain scalar can come back as an int, float, bool, timestamp or null."
msgstr "Utawala wa wazi ni mdogo kwa makusudi kuliko wa YAML: scalar wazi lazima kuanza na barua, kusisitiza au slash, na kisha inaweza kubeba tu ``[A-Za-z0-9_./+@:-]`` ya maeneo hayo. Hiyo inazuia kila tabia inayoongoza PyYAML ya implicit kutatua ufunguo mbali, hivyo hakuna scalar iliyokubaliwa wazi inaweza kurudi kama int, kuelea, bool, timestamp au null."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plan runs the same pipeline the deploy jobs discover through (``cli.meta.ci.matrix``), so what the table shows and what CI deploys cannot diverge. One row per ``role#variant`` candidate in global query order, with the chunk it falls into and the axes it was assigned."
msgstr "Mpango huo unaendesha bomba sawa na kazi za kupeleka zinagundua kupitia (``cli.meta.ci.matrix``), Kwa hivyo kile ambacho meza inaonyesha na kile ambacho GCS hutuma haiwezi kutofautiana. moja kwa moja ``role#variant`` Mgombea katika utaratibu wa swala la kimataifa, na chunk iko ndani na axes ilipewa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The platform already reserves a user key per role, so `hermes` and `openclaw` existed as accounts, non-privileged and each with its own mailbox, before either role claimed one. Claiming the key is what turns a reservation into an identity the agent may authenticate as, and gives the account its description."
msgstr "Mfumo wa sasa unahifadhi ufunguo wa mtumiaji kwa kila jukumu, hivyo `hermes` Aidha, na `openclaw` Kulikuwa kama akaunti, zisizo za halali na kila mmoja na sanduku lake la barua, kabla ya jukumu lolote alidai moja. Kudai ufunguo ni nini kinachogeuza reservation katika utambulisho wakala anaweza kuthibitisha kama, na kutoa akaunti maelezo yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The play used to consume a task file per group, generated at setup time. The order is derived from data that already lives in the roles, so it is resolved here instead and read through the `group_roles` lookup."
msgstr "Kucheza kutumika kutumia faili ya kazi kwa kila kikundi, yanayotokana wakati wa kuanzisha. Amri ni inayotokana na data kwamba tayari anaishi katika majukumu, hivyo ni kutatuliwa hapa badala ya kusoma kupitia `group_roles` ya macho."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The play's variable scope. Only the subset that `_stable_variables_signature` reads influences the key."
msgstr "Kiwango cha ubadilishaji wa mchezo. Ni hayo tu ambayo `_stable_variables_signature` Soma maoni ya msingi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The play-scoped carrier of the rendered applications payload: the fact name `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED`, `merged_applications_cache_key`, and the reader `get_merged_applications` consults before it renders."
msgstr "Carrier kucheza-scoped ya maombi iliyotolewa payload: jina la ukweli `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED`, Kwa hivyo, `merged_applications_cache_key`, Aidha, msomaji `get_merged_applications` Ushauri kabla ya kufanya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The play-scoped carrier: fact name, `merged_applications_cache_key`, and the reader that serves the carried payload."
msgstr "Jina la mchezo: jina la mchezo. `merged_applications_cache_key`, Kwa upande wake, Mbunge wa Jimbo la Ludewa Mhe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The playbook is designed for developers who require Docker in their local development environments. It simplifies the process of Docker installation and configuration, making it straightforward for developers to start containerizing their applications without the complexities often encountered in a server or production environment."
msgstr "Kitabu cha kucheza kimeundwa kwa watengenezaji ambao wanahitaji Docker katika mazingira yao ya maendeleo ya ndani. Inarahisisha mchakato wa ufungaji wa Docker na usanidi, na kuifanya iwe moja kwa moja kwa watengenezaji kuanza kontenaizing maombi yao bila complexities mara nyingi wamekutana katika mazingira ya seva au uzalishaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin answers ``initialize`` without credentials, because that call is capability negotiation and carries no data. Everything after it is guarded: an unauthenticated ``tools/list`` is refused and returns no tool inventory."
msgstr "Majibu ya Plugin ``initialize`` Bila sifa, kwa sababu wito huo ni uwezo wa mazungumzo na haina data. Baada ya yote, hakikisha kuwa unafuata. ``tools/list`` Imekataliwa na kurudi hakuna hesabu ya chombo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin answers `initialize` without credentials, because that call is capability negotiation and carries no data. Everything after it is guarded: an unauthenticated `tools/list` is refused and returns no tool inventory."
msgstr "Majibu ya Plugin `initialize` Bila sifa, kwa sababu wito huo ni uwezo wa mazungumzo na haina data. Baada ya yote, hakikisha kuwa unafuata. `tools/list` Imekataliwa na kurudi hakuna hesabu ya chombo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin lives in the `system` plugin group so it can intercept every request via `onAfterInitialise`. It MUST run BEFORE the Joomla local form-login plugin in the system event chain so the redirect short-circuits any local-account authentication attempt. System plugins are ordered alphabetically. `keycloak` ranks before `users`, which is the typical local-form gate."
msgstr "Plugin hii inaishi katika `system` Plugin hii inaweza kuzuia kila maombi kupitia `onAfterInitialise`. Ni lazima kufanya hivyo kabla ya Joomla Plugin ya fomu-login ya ndani katika mlolongo wa tukio la mfumo ili kuelekeza short-circuits jaribio lolote la uthibitishaji wa akaunti ya ndani. Programu-jalizi za mfumo zimeamriwa kwa alfabeti. `keycloak` Kabla ya `users`, Hii ni mlango wa kawaida wa nyumba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin needs to be manually activated in the admin interface. would be nice if this is automatized as well"
msgstr "Plugin inahitaji kuanzishwa kwa manually katika interface admin. Itakuwa nzuri ikiwa ni pamoja na gari"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin reads its runtime config from the Joomla container's environment, so the same plugin code works against any Keycloak realm without manual reconfiguration through the Joomla admin UI."
msgstr "Plugin inasoma config yake ya runtime kutoka Joomla Mazingira ya chombo, hivyo msimbo huo wa Plugin hufanya kazi dhidi ya yoyote Keycloak bila ya kuwa na mfumo wa reconfiguration kupitia Joomla Mkurugenzi wa UI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin trusts the Keycloak-issued ID token. The `jumbojett/openid-connect-php` library validates the JWT signature against the realm's JWKS, so the issuer URL MUST be reachable from the Joomla container at the time the user authenticates."
msgstr "Plugin hii inatoa uhakika KeycloakKitambulisho cha utambulisho. Kwa kuwa `jumbojett/openid-connect-php` Maktaba inathibitisha saini ya JWT dhidi ya JWKS ya eneo hilo, kwa hivyo URL ya mhalifu lazima ifikiwe kutoka kwa URL Joomla Wakati huo huo, mtumiaji anathibitisha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin's PHP dependencies (`jumbojett/openid-connect-php`) are vendored at deploy time inside the Joomla container. Composer is baked into the role's custom image by `roles/web-app-joomla/files/Dockerfile`. The role-side `tasks/08_oidc_plugin.yml` copies the plugin source into the container, runs `composer install --no-dev`, and installs the plugin via the Joomla CLI:"
msgstr "Msaada wa PHP wa Plugin (`jumbojett/openid-connect-php`) Washtakiwa wakiwa ndani ya muda Joomla vyombo vya dola. Mgawanyiko umeunganishwa katika picha ya desturi ya mhusika `roles/web-app-joomla/files/Dockerfile`• Nafasi ya `tasks/08_oidc_plugin.yml` Tumia chanzo cha Plugin kwenye chombo, anaendesha `composer install --no-dev`, Na kisha kuunganisha Plugin kupitia Plugin Joomla CLI:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The plugin's built-in fallback computed from `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`, the `web-app-mailu` group, the `no-reply` user, and related inputs."
msgstr "Msingi wa msingi wa Plugin umeundwa kutoka `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`, Kwa hiyo, `web-app-mailu` Kikundi hicho, ambacho `no-reply` mtumiaji na taarifa zinazohusiana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The point is to make the safe path the natural path."
msgstr "Lengo ni kufanya njia ya asili kuwa salama."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The point: an assistant with real reach into the home, but the agent runtime stays isolated and the Pi host stays untouched. Capabilities come through MCP tools, not host access."
msgstr "Jambo: Msaidizi aliye na ufikiaji halisi nyumbani, lakini wakala wa kukimbia anakaa peke yake na mwenyeji wa Pi anakaa bila kuguswa. Uwezo huja kupitia zana za MCP, sio upatikanaji wa mwenyeji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The policy `.hcl` templates are rendered to the host config directory and mounted at `/openbao/policies/`, deliberately **outside** `/openbao/config/`: the server parses every file in its config directory as server configuration, so a policy file there breaks startup."
msgstr "Sera ya `.hcl` templeti zinatolewa kwa saraka ya mwenyeji wa config na imewekwa kwenye `/openbao/policies/`, Kwa makusudi **nje ya** `/openbao/config/`: server parses kila faili katika saraka yake ya config kama usanidi wa seva, hivyo faili ya sera kuna mapumziko startup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pool's ``size`` bounds the slice docker hands the bridge, so the gateway is derived from that slice rather than from the enclosing supernet - they agree only while the pool starts on a slice boundary."
msgstr "Ukumbi wa pool ``size`` Inafunga docker kipande mikono daraja, hivyo lango ni inayotokana na kipande hicho badala ya kutoka supernet enclosing - wao kukubaliana tu wakati bwawa kuanza juu ya mpaka kipande."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The port is the single source of truth ``svc-net-tor services.tor.ports.local.socks``; only the host varies by caller context (loopback for host-network consumers, ``host.docker.internal`` for a bridged sibling container, ``0.0.0.0`` for the daemon bind)."
msgstr "Bandari ni chanzo kimoja cha ukweli ``svc-net-tor services.tor.ports.local.socks``; tu mwenyeji tofauti kwa muktadha wa simu (Kwa watumiaji wa mtandao wa mwenyeji, ``host.docker.internal`` kwa hisani ya RaiaMwema ``0.0.0.0`` kwa hisani ya RaiaMwema)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The post-login assertion MUST prove the session is real, in this order of preference: a user-menu or persona-name string visible in the DOM, a navigation element only rendered for authenticated users, a URL pattern unique to authenticated state. Stopping at a 2xx status code or a static text snippet that exists logged-out as well MUST NOT count as a session check."
msgstr "Uthibitisho wa post-login Lazima uthibitishe kikao ni halisi, kwa utaratibu huu wa upendeleo: kamba ya jina la mtumiaji au mtu inayoonekana katika DOM, kipengele cha urambazaji tu kilichotolewa kwa watumiaji waliothibitishwa, muundo wa URL wa kipekee kwa hali iliyothibitishwa. Kuacha kwenye A 2Msimbo wa hali ya xx au snippet ya maandishi ya tuli ambayo inapatikana kwa watumiaji na pia haipaswi kuhesabu kama ukaguzi wa kikao."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The prefixed form is byte-identical to the container's ``.Config.Image`` after deploy, so it can be matched against a running container exactly."
msgstr "Aina ya prefixed ni kwate-identical kwa chombo ``.Config.Image`` Baada ya kupeleka, hivyo inaweza kulinganishwa na chombo kinachoendesha hasa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary checkout's path, or ``repo_root`` when git cannot say."
msgstr "Njia ya kwanza ya kuangalia, au ``repo_root`` Wakati wa baridi huwezi kusema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary objective of this role is to provide a straightforward and efficient method for setting up Java, specifically JDK 11, on personal computers or development environments. This setup is essential for developers who work with Java or run applications that require the Java runtime environment."
msgstr "Lengo kuu la jukumu hili ni kutoa njia ya moja kwa moja na yenye ufanisi ya kuanzisha JavaKwa mfano, JDK 11, kwenye kompyuta binafsi au mazingira ya maendeleo. Hii ni muhimu kwa watengenezaji ambao wanafanya kazi Java au maombi ambayo yanahitaji Java mazingira ya muda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to automate the process of swapfile creation, ensuring that the system has sufficient swap space to handle memory-intensive tasks and maintain overall performance."
msgstr "Madhumuni ya msingi ya jukumu hili ni kuandaa mchakato wa uumbaji wa faili la kubadilishana, kuhakikisha kwamba mfumo una nafasi ya kutosha ya kubadilishana ili kushughulikia kazi kubwa za kumbukumbu na kudumisha utendaji wa jumla."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to configure WireGuard on a client by setting appropriate MTU values on network interfaces. This ensures a stable and optimized VPN connection."
msgstr "Madhumuni ya msingi ya jukumu hili ni kusanidi WireGuard juu ya mteja kwa kuweka maadili sahihi ya MTU kwenye interfaces za mtandao. Hii inahakikisha muunganisho wa VPN ulio imara na ulioboreshwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to enable proper routing and connectivity for a WireGuard client situated behind a firewall or NAT device. By adapting iptables rules, it ensures that the client can communicate effectively with external networks."
msgstr "Madhumuni ya msingi ya jukumu hili ni kuwezesha uendeshaji sahihi na kuunganishwa kwa mteja wa WireGuard iliyoko nyuma ya firewall au kifaa cha NAT. Kwa kurekebisha sheria za iptables, inahakikisha kwamba mteja anaweza kuwasiliana kwa ufanisi na mitandao ya nje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to enhance system performance by ensuring that Docker volumes are stored on the most appropriate storage medium, optimizing both speed and capacity."
msgstr "Lengo la msingi la jukumu hili ni kuongeza utendaji wa mfumo kwa kuhakikisha kwamba kiasi cha Docker kinahifadhiwa kwenye kati inayofaa ya kuhifadhi, kuboresha kasi na uwezo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to enhance the security of the system by ensuring that a valid SSH key is available for the [root user](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser). By automating the generation and output of the public key, it reduces manual intervention and helps maintain a secure configuration for administrative access."
msgstr "Lengo kuu la jukumu hili ni kuimarisha usalama wa mfumo kwa kuhakikisha kwamba ufunguo halali wa SSH unapatikana kwa ajili ya usalama wa mfumo. [Watumiaji wa](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser). Kwa kuunda kizazi na pato la ufunguo wa umma, inapunguza kuingilia kati kwa mwongozo na husaidia kudumisha usanidi salama wa upatikanaji wa utawala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to enhance the security of the system by ensuring that a valid SSH key is available for the `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__. By automating the generation and output of the public key, it reduces manual intervention and helps maintain a secure configuration for administrative access."
msgstr "Lengo kuu la jukumu hili ni kuimarisha usalama wa mfumo kwa kuhakikisha kwamba ufunguo halali wa SSH unapatikana kwa ajili ya usalama wa mfumo. `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__. Kwa kuunda kizazi na pato la ufunguo wa umma, inapunguza kuingilia kati kwa mwongozo na husaidia kudumisha usanidi salama wa upatikanaji wa utawala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to ensure that Docker-based services remain operational. By automatically monitoring container health, it enables administrators to react quickly to failures, reducing downtime and preventing unnoticed service degradation."
msgstr "Lengo kuu la jukumu hili ni kuhakikisha kuwa huduma za msingi za Docker zinaendelea kufanya kazi. Kwa kufuatilia moja kwa moja afya ya chombo, inawezesha watendaji kujibu haraka kwa kushindwa, kupunguza muda wa chini na kuzuia uharibifu wa huduma usioonekana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to ensure that all Docker Compose services are restarted consistently, resolving issues that may arise from partial restarts. This helps maintain overall service stability and minimizes downtime."
msgstr "Lengo la hatua hii ni kuhakikisha kuwa kila Docker Compose Huduma zinaanzishwa mara kwa mara, kutatua masuala ambayo yanaweza kutokea kutoka kwa kuanza kwa sehemu. Hii husaidia kudumisha utulivu wa jumla wa huduma na kupunguza muda wa kupungua."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to ensure that disk space remains within safe limits by automating cleanup tasks, thereby improving system performance and stability."
msgstr "Lengo kuu la jukumu hili ni kuhakikisha kwamba nafasi ya disk inabaki ndani ya mipaka salama kwa kuendesha kazi za kusafisha, na hivyo kuboresha utendaji wa mfumo na utulivu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to ensure that the target system has a reliable sudo configuration. By installing the [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) package and deploying a standard sudoers file, the role facilitates proper administrative access and minimizes potential security risks."
msgstr "Lengo kuu la jukumu hili ni kuhakikisha kuwa mfumo wa lengo una usanidi wa kuaminika wa sudo. Kwa kuanzisha [ya sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) Mfuko na kupeleka faili ya kawaida ya watendaji, jukumu linawezesha upatikanaji sahihi wa utawala na hupunguza hatari za usalama."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to ensure that the target system has a reliable sudo configuration. By installing the `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ package and deploying a standard sudoers file, the role facilitates proper administrative access and minimizes potential security risks."
msgstr "Lengo kuu la jukumu hili ni kuhakikisha kuwa mfumo wa lengo una usanidi wa kuaminika wa sudo. Kwa kuanzisha `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ Mfuko na kupeleka faili ya kawaida ya watendaji, jukumu linawezesha upatikanaji sahihi wa utawala na hupunguza hatari za usalama."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to guarantee that an SSH client is available on the system before executing any SSH-related operations, such as key generation, remote access, or automated provisioning."
msgstr "Madhumuni ya msingi ya jukumu hili ni kuhakikisha kwamba mteja wa SSH inapatikana kwenye mfumo kabla ya kutekeleza shughuli zozote zinazohusiana na SSH, kama vile kizazi muhimu, upatikanaji wa kijijini, au utoaji wa kiotomatiki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to maintain optimal backup storage by automatically removing outdated backup versions when disk usage exceeds a specified threshold."
msgstr "Madhumuni ya msingi ya jukumu hili ni kudumisha uhifadhi bora wa chelezo kwa kuondoa moja kwa moja matoleo ya chelezo ya zamani wakati matumizi ya diski yanazidi kizingiti maalum."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to maintain optimal performance of Btrfs file systems by automating balancing tasks, ensuring efficient storage allocation and performance."
msgstr "Madhumuni ya msingi ya jukumu hili ni kudumisha utendaji bora wa mifumo ya faili ya Btrfs kwa kuendesha kazi za kusawazisha, kuhakikisha ugawaji wa uhifadhi na utendaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to prevent storage bloat caused by unused Docker images, volumes, and build artifacts. Regular pruning ensures:"
msgstr "Lengo kuu la jukumu hili ni kuzuia uharibifu wa hifadhi unaosababishwa na picha zisizotumiwa za Docker, kiasi, na kujenga mabaki. Ufuatiliaji wa kawaida unahakikisha:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to provide a centralized mechanism for service failure notifications. By integrating with both the Telegram and Email notifier roles, it delivers reliable alerts through multiple channels, enhancing overall system observability and responsiveness."
msgstr "Lengo kuu la jukumu hili ni kutoa utaratibu wa kati wa taarifa za kushindwa kwa huduma. Kwa kuunganisha na majukumu yote ya Telegram na Barua pepe, hutoa tahadhari za kuaminika kupitia njia nyingi, kuimarisha ufuatiliaji wa mfumo wa jumla na mwitikio."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to provide a comprehensive solution for automated email notifications in a systemd environment. By integrating with msmtp and customizable templates, it delivers clear and timely alerts about service failures, thereby enhancing system reliability."
msgstr "Lengo kuu la jukumu hili ni kutoa suluhisho kamili kwa arifa za barua pepe za automatiska katika mazingira ya mfumo. Kwa kuunganisha na templates za msmtp na customizable, hutoa tahadhari wazi na wakati juu ya kushindwa kwa huduma, na hivyo kuimarisha uaminifu wa mfumo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to provide a reliable installation of the Python package manager, pip, ensuring that subsequent Python package installations can proceed without issues."
msgstr "Madhumuni ya msingi ya jukumu hili ni kutoa ufungaji wa kuaminika wa meneja wa mfuko wa Python, pip, kuhakikisha kwamba ufungaji wa mfuko wa Python unaofuata unaweza kuendelea bila maswala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to provide a reusable mechanism for scheduling recurring tasks on a system. By creating and managing a systemd timer unit, the role ensures that specified services are automatically started at defined intervals, enhancing system automation and reliability."
msgstr "Madhumuni ya msingi ya jukumu hili ni kutoa utaratibu unaoweza kutekelezwa kwa ratiba ya majukumu ya mara kwa mara kwenye mfumo. Kwa kuunda na kusimamia kitengo cha wakati wa mfumo, jukumu linahakikisha kuwa huduma maalum zinaanzishwa moja kwa moja kwa vipindi vinavyofafanuliwa, kuimarisha mfumo wa automatisering na kuaminika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to provide a robust solution for automated Telegram notifications in a systemd environment. By integrating with Telegram’s Bot API and using customizable message templates, it delivers clear and timely alerts about service failures, thereby enhancing system observability and reliability."
msgstr "Lengo la msingi la jukumu hili ni kutoa suluhisho imara kwa arifa za Telegram za automatiska katika mazingira ya mfumo. Kuunganisha na Bot ya Telegram API na kutumia templates za ujumbe wa customizable, hutoa tahadhari wazi na wakati juu ya kushindwa kwa huduma, na hivyo kuimarisha ufuatiliaji wa mfumo na kuaminika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to provide a secure and dedicated administrator account solely for running local administration tasks. This approach minimizes security risks associated with using the root account and enforces best practices in user privilege management."
msgstr "Lengo kuu la jukumu hili ni kutoa akaunti salama na ya kujitolea ya msimamizi tu kwa kuendesha kazi za utawala wa mitaa. Njia hii hupunguza hatari za usalama zinazohusiana na kutumia akaunti ya mizizi na kutekeleza mazoea bora katika usimamizi wa upendeleo wa mtumiaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to safeguard system stability during maintenance by preventing conflicts with running services. It ensures that maintenance operations proceed only when the environment is ready."
msgstr "Lengo kuu la jukumu hili ni kulinda utulivu wa mfumo wakati wa matengenezo kwa kuzuia migogoro na huduma za uendeshaji. Inahakikisha kwamba shughuli za matengenezo zinaendelea tu wakati mazingira ni tayari."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary purpose of this role is to set up and manage a Wireguard VPN configuration on the host. By automating package installation and configuration file deployment, it ensures that the VPN service is enabled with optimal network settings for secure connectivity."
msgstr "Lengo kuu la mradi huu ni kuanzisha na kusimamia Wireguard VPN Configuration juu ya mwenyeji. Kwa automating mfuko ufungaji na Configuration faili kupelekwa, ni kuhakikisha kwamba huduma VPN ni kuwezeshwa na mazingira bora ya mtandao kwa ajili ya kuunganishwa salama."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The primary service entry is the role entity name returned by `get_entity_name`."
msgstr "Kuingia kwa huduma ya msingi ni jina la chombo cha jukumu lililorejeshwa na `get_entity_name`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The private helpers (``_resolve_round_include`` and friends) are re-exported below because unit tests historically patch them under this package path. New tests SHOULD patch the submodule path directly (e.g. ``inventory.legacy_resolver._resolve_round_include``)."
msgstr "Msaada wa kibinafsi (``_resolve_round_include`` Marafiki na) Wanahamishwa tena chini kwa sababu vipimo vya kitengo kihistoria vinawafunga chini ya njia hii ya mfuko. Uchunguzi mpya unapaswa kuziba njia ya submodule moja kwa moja (ya g. ``inventory.legacy_resolver._resolve_round_include``)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The privileged `pull_request_target` build switches its **build source** from the base merge ref to the **raw PR head** (`head.repo.full_name` @ `head.sha`)."
msgstr "Mheshimiwa `pull_request_target` kujenga reli zake **Kujenga chanzo** Kutoka kwa msingi kuunganisha ref kwa **Kichwa cha PR** (`head.repo.full_name` @ ya `head.sha`)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The probe runs inside the systemd unit, not at deploy time, because the set of docker volumes changes between deploys and a volume added afterwards would be an empty stub inside a snapshot. It refuses unless all of the following hold for the docker data root reported by ``docker info``:"
msgstr "Uchunguzi unaendelea ndani ya kitengo cha mfumo, sio wakati wa kupeleka, kwa sababu seti ya mabadiliko ya kiasi cha docker kati ya kupeleka na kiasi kilichoongezwa baadaye itakuwa stub tupu ndani ya picha. Inakataa isipokuwa ikiwa yote yafuatayo yanashikilia mizizi ya data ya docker iliyoripotiwa na ``docker info``:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The probe runs inside the systemd unit, not at deploy time, because the set of docker volumes changes between deploys and a volume added afterwards would be an empty stub inside a snapshot. It refuses unless all of the following hold for the docker data root reported by `docker info`:"
msgstr "Uchunguzi unaendelea ndani ya kitengo cha mfumo, sio wakati wa kupeleka, kwa sababu seti ya mabadiliko ya kiasi cha docker kati ya kupeleka na kiasi kilichoongezwa baadaye itakuwa stub tupu ndani ya picha. Inakataa isipokuwa ikiwa yote yafuatayo yanashikilia mizizi ya data ya docker iliyoripotiwa na `docker info`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The probe therefore builds a **throwaway** btrfs on a loop device and puts a stub on `PATH` in place of the docker daemon. The host's real data root is never touched, and no state survives the run."
msgstr "Kwa hiyo, utafiti huu unajenga a **Kutoroka** btrfs juu ya kifaa kitanzi na kuweka stub juu ya `PATH` Kwa upande wa Docker daemon. Mizizi halisi ya data ya mwenyeji haijawahi kuguswa, na hakuna hali inayoishi kukimbia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The probe's own check was vacuous beside this: it compared a declared window against an estimated demand, both produced by this deployment, so it structurally could not observe a declaration the backend does not honour. It now also reads `usage.prompt_tokens` from the answer, the one number in the exchange that the backend produced."
msgstr "Uchunguzi wa uchunguzi wenyewe ulikuwa mgumu kando na hili: ulilinganisha dirisha lililotangazwa dhidi ya mahitaji yaliyokadiriwa, yote yaliyozalishwa na kupelekwa kwa hii, kwa hivyo kwa muundo haukuweza kuchunguza tamko ambalo backend haina heshima. Aidha, kwa sasa tunasoma `usage.prompt_tokens` Kutokana na jibu hilo, namba moja katika ubadilishaji ambayo ilizalisha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The probe; with prefixes it is wrapped so ``test`` renders CMD-SHELL."
msgstr "Kwa mfano, kabla ya kupanda mbegu, mbegu hupandwa. ``test`` Kufanya CMD-SHELL."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The producer [build_ldap_role_entries](../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/filter_plugins/build_ldap_role_entries.py) also emits a per-application `groupOfNames` container `cn=<application_id>,ou=roles,...` whose `member` attribute references every role group of that application, so an LDAP-only consumer can still navigate the hierarchy. Keycloak does not rely on those containers; it reconstructs `/roles/<application_id>/<role_name>` via per-application mappers (see below)."
msgstr "Mtayarishaji wa [build_ldap_role_entries](../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/filter_plugins/build_ldap_role_entries.py) Aidha, matumizi ya `groupOfNames` Chombo cha kuhifadhi `cn=<application_id>,ou=roles,...` Ambaye ni nani ambaye `member` Inataja kila kikundi cha jukumu la programu hiyo, kwa hivyo watumiaji wa LDAP pekee wanaweza kuendelea na uongozi. Keycloak haitegemei vyombo hivyo; inajenga upya `/roles/<application_id>/<role_name>` Kwa kutumia mappers (Tazama hapa chini)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The production-safe path MUST follow Mattermost's documented Agents and MCP deployment guidance."
msgstr "Njia salama ya uzalishaji ni lazima MattermostViongozi wa CCM na viongozi wa CCM."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The project tree's full path list (one walk per process) and per-file UTF-8 contents (`read_text`). Used by lint/integration tests and CLI tools that scan the repo."
msgstr "Orodha kamili ya njia ya mti (Hatua moja kwa mchakato) kwa hisani ya RaiaMwema8 Maudhui ya maudhui (`read_text`)Kutumiwa na majaribio ya lint / kuingizwa na zana za CLI ambazo hupima repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The project's environment is owned by a single generator, not scattered across shell modules. Every variable is documented INLINE next to its definition with a one-line `# ...` comment above the key. This page is just a map of where to look."
msgstr "Mazingira ya mradi ni inayomilikiwa na jenereta moja, si kutawanyika katika modules shell. Kila variable ni kumbukumbu INLINE karibu na ufafanuzi wake na mstari mmoja. `# ...` Maoni juu ya msingi. Ukurasa huu ni ramani ya mahali pa kuangalia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The project-owned plugin is unaudited: endpoint, transport, auth and tool scope are unverified in source."
msgstr "Plugin inayomilikiwa na mradi haijakataliwa: mwisho, usafiri, auth na upeo wa chombo ni unverified katika chanzo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The project-owned server passes ownership, licence, pinning and read-only default, but its HTTP transport serves one session per process, which upstream asserts in `src/test/transport.test.ts` at `v0.3.1`; the deploy probe alone would leave it restart-required."
msgstr "Seva inayomilikiwa na mradi hupita umiliki, leseni, pinning na kusoma-tu default, lakini usafiri wake wa HTTP hutumikia kikao kimoja kwa mchakato, ambayo upstream inasema katika `src/test/transport.test.ts` Wakati wa `v0.3.1`; Kwa hiyo, ni lazima tu atafute njia ya kumfanya aondoke haraka."

