# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The protection rules enforced on `main` are documented in [branch.md](../../tools/github/branch/security.md)."
msgstr "Sheria za ulinzi zinatekelezwa kwa `main` Imeandikwa katika [branch.md](../../tools/github/branch/security.md)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The provider credential is whatever ``mcp.credential`` declares: ``owner`` names the principal, ``source`` where its secret lives (``token_store`` or the role's own ``credentials``), ``key`` the entry. No provider inherits the administrator's token."
msgstr "Kwa upande wa waumini, chochote ``mcp.credential`` Kwa mujibu wa: ``owner`` Majina ya Waziri Mkuu, ``source`` Ambapo maisha yake ya siri (``token_store`` au majukumu yake mwenyewe ``credentials``), Kwa hivyo, ``key`` ya kuingia. Hakuna mtoa huduma anayerithi ishara ya msimamizi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The provision CLI parses the JSON and forwards the per-app index as `--variant <N>` to each `infinito administration inventory credentials` subprocess call."
msgstr "Utoaji wa CLI unalinganisha JSON na unawasilisha index ya kila programu kama `--variant <N>` Kwa kila mmoja `infinito administration inventory credentials` Simu ya subprocess."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The proxy config used to grow a loop per source, so the rule for \"how is this alias called\" lived in four places that drifted apart: the LM Studio branch published no context window although its README promised one, and a mock needed a fifth branch. Here the sources meet once, the template renders one loop, and every shape is a unit test instead of a rendered fixture."
msgstr "Wakala config kutumika kukua kitanzi kwa chanzo, hivyo utawala kwa \"Jinsi ya kutumia jina la Alias\" yamegawanyika katika sehemu kuu nne ambazo ni:- LM Studio Tawi halikuchapisha dirisha la muktadha ingawa README iliahidi moja, na kejeli ilihitaji tawi la tano. Hapa vyanzo hukutana mara moja, template hutoa kitanzi kimoja, na kila sura ni mtihani wa kitengo badala ya fixture iliyotolewa."

