# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The published image is multi-arch, but only `linux/amd64` has been exercised."
msgstr "Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi, lakini `linux/amd64` imekuwa ikitumiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this folder is to keep domain logic in one predictable place so different plugins, helpers, and automation paths can rely on the same behavior. Rather than being tied to one feature, the code here supports the broader shape of how domains are interpreted, normalized, collected, and reused across the project. 🧭"
msgstr "Kusudi la folda hii ni kuweka mantiki ya kikoa katika sehemu moja ya kutabirika ili Plugins tofauti, wasaidizi, na njia za automatisering zinaweza kutegemea tabia hiyo. Badala ya kuunganishwa na kipengele kimoja, msimbo hapa unaunga mkono sura pana ya jinsi vikoa vinavyotafsiriwa, kurekebishwa, kukusanywa, na kutumika tena katika mradi. 🧭"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the configuration of cloud-integrated user directories by ensuring that common folders like `Downloads`, `Music`, and `Workspaces` are transparently redirected into a centralized cloud structure. This makes it easier to maintain sys-bkp-friendly, cloud-ready setups for homelab and professional workflows."
msgstr "Kusudi la jukumu hili ni kuendesha usanidi wa saraka za mtumiaji zilizounganishwa na wingu kwa kuhakikisha kwamba folda za kawaida kama `Downloads`, Kwa hivyo, `Music`, Aidha, na `Workspaces` Wao ni wazi itaelekezwa katika muundo wa wingu kuu. Hii inafanya iwe rahisi kudumisha mipangilio ya sys-bkp-friendly, ya tayari ya wingu kwa kazi za nyumbani na za kitaaluma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the configuration of cloud-integrated user directories by ensuring that common folders like ``Downloads``, ``Music``, and ``Workspaces`` are transparently redirected into a centralized cloud structure. This makes it easier to maintain sys-bkp-friendly, cloud-ready setups for homelab and professional workflows."
msgstr "Kusudi la jukumu hili ni kuendesha usanidi wa saraka za mtumiaji zilizounganishwa na wingu kwa kuhakikisha kwamba folda za kawaida kama ``Downloads``, Kwa hivyo, ``Music``, Aidha, na ``Workspaces`` Wao ni wazi itaelekezwa katika muundo wa wingu kuu. Hii inafanya iwe rahisi kudumisha mipangilio ya sys-bkp-friendly, ya tayari ya wingu kwa kazi za nyumbani na za kitaaluma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the deployment of a full-featured RetroArch environment, reducing manual setup and improving reproducibility across gaming setups."
msgstr "Lengo la jukumu hili ni kuimarisha utekelezaji wa ahadi RetroArch Mazingira, kupunguza usanidi wa mwongozo na kuboresha ufanisi katika mipangilio ya michezo ya kubahatisha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the installation and configuration of Git for personal computers. By leveraging a custom git-configurator, it sets up essential Git settings such as merge options, rebase preferences, user information, and GPG signing, ensuring a consistent environment for version control operations."
msgstr "Lengo la jukumu hili ni kuunda ufungaji na usanidi wa Git kompyuta binafsi. Kwa kuongeza git-configurator ya desturi, inaweka muhimu Git Mipangilio kama vile kuunganisha chaguzi, mapendekezo ya msingi, habari ya mtumiaji, na kusainiwa kwa GPG, kuhakikisha mazingira thabiti kwa shughuli za udhibiti wa toleo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The purpose of this role is to automate the installation and configuration of LibreOffice along with its language support on personal computers. This ensures that users have a consistent and fully functional office suite environment across their systems."
msgstr "Lengo la jukumu hili ni kuunda ufungaji na usanidi wa LibreOffice Msaada wa lugha katika kompyuta binafsi. Hii inahakikisha kwamba watumiaji wana mazingira thabiti na ya kazi ya ofisi katika mifumo yao."

