msgid "The purpose of tthis role is to simplify the deployment and management of a personal or professional portfolio. By focusing on usability and a clean presentation, the role helps you:"
msgstr "Kusudi la jukumu hili ni kurahisisha kupelekwa na usimamizi wa kwingineko ya kibinafsi au ya kitaaluma. Kwa kuzingatia usability na uwasilishaji safi, jukumu linakusaidia:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The push entry synchronizes the current repository's `main` branch from the configured source repository before CI policy and deploy discovery run. The default source is `infinito-nexus/core`, and `CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY` MAY override or disable the sync as documented in [configuration.md](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md). This sync **force-overwrites** the local `main`, so on a synced repository you MUST NOT work directly in `main`; use a `feature/**`, `fix/**`, or `hotfix/**` branch and treat `main` as a read-only mirror."
msgstr "Kuingia kwa kushinikiza kunaunganisha kumbukumbu ya sasa `main` Tawi kutoka kwa hifadhi ya chanzo iliyowekwa kabla ya sera ya CI na ugunduzi wa kupeleka. Chanzo cha kushindwa ni `infinito-nexus/core`, Aidha, na `CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY` Inaweza kuharibu au kuzima sync kama ilivyoandikwa katika [configuration.md](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md). Hii ya sync **Waandishi wa nguvu** Wilaya ya `main`Kwa hiyo, kwenye hifadhi iliyounganishwa haipaswi kufanya kazi moja kwa moja katika `main`Matumizi ya A `feature/**`, Kwa hivyo, `fix/**`, Kwa hivyo, au `hotfix/**` Taasisi na Kushughulikia `main` Ni kama kioo cha kusoma tu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The qualifier in parentheses is OPTIONAL. Use it only when two workflows share the same category and subject."
msgstr "Njia ya uzazi wa mpango ni sawa. Tumia tu wakati kazi mbili zinashiriki kikundi kimoja na somo."

