# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result MUST be visually appealing and pleasant for humans to look at."
msgstr "Matokeo lazima yawe ya kupendeza na ya kupendeza kwa wanadamu kuangalia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result MUST feel like one coherent brand theme, not a collection of unrelated overrides."
msgstr "Matokeo lazima kujisikia kama moja coherent brand mandhari, si mkusanyiko wa overrides unrelated."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result feeds the web-svc-mirror privacy proxy: the mirror's nginx vhost whitelists exactly these hosts as proxy upstreams, and the body-filter rewrite maps `https://<host>/...` to `<mirror>/<host>/...` in served HTML."
msgstr "Matokeo yake ni kwamba web-svc-mirror wakala faragha: kioo nginx vhost whitelists hasa majeshi haya kama upstreams wakala, na mwili-filter kuandika upya ramani `https://<host>/...` Kwa kuwa `<mirror>/<host>/...` Kwa kutumia HTML."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result is a complete, reproducible domain rollout in a single playbook task."
msgstr "Matokeo yake ni full, reproducible domain rollout katika kazi moja ya playbook."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result is canonical_domains_map(applications, DOMAIN_PRIMARY). Per-app domain declarations live in `applications.<app>.domains` (canonical/aliases) and flow through the regular applications-merge pipeline."
msgstr "Matokeo yake ni canonical_domains_map(maombi, DOMAIN_PRIMARY). Matangazo ya Domain Per-app kuishi katika `applications.<app>.domains` (Uwezo wa Ugavi / Aases) Tumia kwa njia ya bomba la mafuta ya kawaida."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result is immutable and one source message is masked once per target language, so the same string arrives dozens of times per run."
msgstr "Matokeo yake hayabadiliki na ujumbe mmoja wa chanzo umefunikwa mara moja kwa lugha ya lengo, kwa hivyo kamba hiyo inafika mara kadhaa kwa kukimbia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result is stored on the stack host and rendered back into `model_info.traits.speed` on the same deploy, so the gateway restarts once with the numbers it just produced. A re-measured rate that moved less than 10% keeps its stored value, because no two runs measure the same machine and an unclamped result would restart the gateway for nothing. A model the measurement could not reach keeps its stored rate rather than losing it, so one bad minute does not unrank a model against its peers."
msgstr "Matokeo yake ni kuhifadhiwa kwenye stack na kurejeshwa katika `model_info.traits.speed` kwenye kupelekwa sawa, hivyo lango linaanza tena mara moja na idadi ambayo ilizalisha tu. kiwango cha chini ambacho kimepungua kuliko 10Asilimia huhifadhi thamani yake iliyohifadhiwa, kwa sababu hakuna njia mbili zinazopima mashine moja na matokeo yasiyopigwa yanaweza kuanzisha tena lango la kitu. Mfano kipimo hakuweza kufikia inaweka kiwango chake kuhifadhiwa badala ya kupoteza, hivyo dakika moja mbaya haina unrank mfano dhidi ya wenzao."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The resulting snippets cover every shared provider in the variant's closure, so the deploy stage finds the required `applications.<provider>.secrets.credentials` block in the inventory and `lookup('config', '<provider>', 'secrets.credentials.<key>')` succeeds."
msgstr "Snippets inayosababisha hufunika kila mtoa huduma aliyeshirikiwa katika kufungwa kwa lahaja, kwa hivyo hatua ya kupeleka hupata inayohitajika `applications.<provider>.secrets.credentials` katika mfumo wa hesabu na `lookup('config', '<provider>', 'secrets.credentials.<key>')` kufanikiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The resume offset a retrigger computes names a `role#variant` and carries no axes, because every axis rotates with the sweep number and a retrigger receives a fresh one."
msgstr "Jina la akaunti ni retrigger. `role#variant` Hakuna haja ya kuwa na wasiwasi juu ya kila kitu, kwa sababu kila kitu kinabadilika na kuwa kipya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The returned token names a place in the ranking, so it carries no axes, and neither does the membership test behind it (:func:`proven_rows`): the source run recorded its combinations under its own sweep number and the retrigger gets a fresh one, so comparing them row by row is the only comparison that survives the rotation."
msgstr "Jina lake la kuzaliwa lilikuwa na maana ya jina lake, na wala jina lake halikutajwa. (:func:`proven_rows`): chanzo kukimbia kumbukumbu mchanganyiko wake chini ya idadi yake sweep na retrigger anapata mpya, hivyo kulinganisha yao mstari kwa mstari ni kulinganisha tu kwamba kuishi mzunguko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The reusable generator logic lives in `utils/domains/list.py`"
msgstr "Jenereta ya kisasa ya jenereta inaishi katika `utils/domains/list.py`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The reverse closure is fail-safe: any seed that is not modellable in the resolver (no `application_id` and not referenced by any role's `run_after`) MUST trigger a fall-back to a full deploy, as MUST any resolver runtime error. The closure MUST NOT silently shrink the deploy matrix on partial information. The variant narrowing follows the same rule: a role reached only through a `run_after` edge (which the round closure does not follow) keeps every variant, and so does a seed role itself, whose own files changed."
msgstr "Kufungwa kwa nyuma ni kushindwa salama: mbegu yoyote ambayo haiwezi kutumika katika suluhisho (Hakuna cha `application_id` bila ya kutaja majukumu yoyote ya `run_after`) Lazima kusababisha kuanguka nyuma kwa kupelekwa kamili, kama lazima kosa lolote la kukimbia wakati wa kutatua. Kufungwa haipaswi kupunguza kimya tumbo la kupeleka kwenye habari ya sehemu. Tofauti nyembamba ifuatavyo utawala huo: jukumu kufikiwa tu kupitia `run_after` Kwa hiyo (Ni nani asiyefuata utaratibu wa) Inaweka kila aina, na hivyo ina jukumu la mbegu yenyewe, ambayo faili zake zimebadilika."

