# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a minimal custom image on top of the official Confluence image, prepares persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Configuration is driven by variables (image, version, volumes, domains, OIDC). JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to avoid `Xms > Xmx`."
msgstr "Jukumu linajenga picha ndogo ya desturi juu ya rasmi Confluence Picha, huandaa kiasi cha kuendelea, na hufunua programu nyuma ya wakala wako wa nyuma. Muundo unaongozwa na variables (Picha, toleo, wingi, vikoa, OIDC). JVM rundo sizing ni auto-kutokana na RAM mwenyeji na caps salama ili kuepuka `Xms > Xmx`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a minimal custom image on top of the official Confluence image, prepares persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Configuration is driven by variables (image, version, volumes, domains, OIDC). JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to avoid ``Xms > Xmx``."
msgstr "Jukumu linajenga picha ndogo ya desturi juu ya rasmi Confluence Picha, huandaa kiasi cha kuendelea, na hufunua programu nyuma ya wakala wako wa nyuma. Muundo unaongozwa na variables (Picha, toleo, wingi, vikoa, OIDC). JVM rundo sizing ni auto-kutokana na RAM mwenyeji na caps salama ili kuepuka ``Xms > Xmx``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role checks whether ``pip`` from ``ansible_python_interpreter`` supports ``--break-system-packages`` and only uses it (plus ``PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1``) when available. This keeps the role compatible with older ``pip`` versions (e.g., some CentOS/RHEL systems)."
msgstr "Kamati hiyo itachunguza iwapo ``pip`` Kutoka kwa ``ansible_python_interpreter`` Msaada wa Msaada ``--break-system-packages`` Kwa kutumia tu (Zaidi ya ``PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1``) ikiwa inapatikana. Hii inafanya kazi kwa kushirikiana na wazee ``pip`` Tafsiri za Tafsiri (Kwa mfano, mifumo ya CentOS / RHEL)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role checks whether `pip` from `ansible_python_interpreter` supports `--break-system-packages` and only uses it (plus `PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1`) when available. This keeps the role compatible with older `pip` versions (e.g., some CentOS/RHEL systems)."
msgstr "Kamati hiyo itachunguza iwapo `pip` Kutoka kwa `ansible_python_interpreter` Msaada wa Msaada `--break-system-packages` Kwa kutumia tu (Zaidi ya `PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1`) ikiwa inapatikana. Hii inafanya kazi kwa kushirikiana na wazee `pip` Tafsiri za Tafsiri (Kwa mfano, mifumo ya CentOS / RHEL)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role configures a systemd service and timer which executes the CSP crawler periodically against all NGINX domains."
msgstr "Jukumu linasanidi huduma ya mfumo na timer ambayo inafanya crawler ya CSP mara kwa mara dhidi ya vikoa vyote vya NGINX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role configures and deploys a containerized PhpMyAdmin instance using Docker Compose. It optionally integrates with a central database and uses dynamic Ansible variables to support flexible deployments in both production and homelab environments."
msgstr "Jukumu linaundwa na kuingiza chombo PhpMyAdmin Kwa kutumia mfano Docker ComposeInaunganisha kwa database kuu na hutumia vigezo vya nguvu vya Ansible kusaidia kupelekwa kwa urahisi katika mazingira ya uzalishaji na homelab."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role declares no volume: a kernel that executes code a chat wrote gets a fresh filesystem on every restart. A consumer reaches it as ``http://jupyter:8888`` once it declares ``jupyter`` in its own ``meta/services.yml`` with ``enabled`` and ``shared`` set. ``web-app-openwebui`` ships that flag and sends ``CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter`` with it."
msgstr "Jukumu hilo linatangaza hakuna kiasi: kernel inayotekeleza msimbo wa kuzungumza inapokea mfumo mpya wa faili kwenye kila upya. Mtumiaji anafikia kama ``http://jupyter:8888`` Mara baada ya kutangaza ``jupyter`` Kwa upande wake mwenyewe ``meta/services.yml`` Pamoja na ``enabled`` Aidha, na ``shared`` kuwa. ``web-app-openwebui`` meli hiyo ambayo imebeba bendera hiyo na ``CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter`` pamoja na hayo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role declares no volume: a kernel that executes code a chat wrote gets a fresh filesystem on every restart. A consumer reaches it as `http://jupyter:8888` once it declares `jupyter` in its own `meta/services.yml` with `enabled` and `shared` set. `web-app-openwebui` ships that flag and sends `CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter` with it."
msgstr "Jukumu hilo linatangaza hakuna kiasi: kernel inayotekeleza msimbo wa kuzungumza inapokea mfumo mpya wa faili kwenye kila upya. Mtumiaji anafikia kama `http://jupyter:8888` Mara baada ya kutangaza `jupyter` Kwa upande wake mwenyewe `meta/services.yml` Pamoja na `enabled` Aidha, na `shared` kuwa. `web-app-openwebui` meli hiyo ambayo imebeba bendera hiyo na `CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter` pamoja na hayo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys a single ``registry:2`` instance in pull-through proxy mode on its inventory group’s host. Because the group typically holds exactly one host (the swarm manager), ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` resolves to ``compose`` for the role; multi-host fan-out for the cache itself is out of scope for v1."
msgstr "Mradi huo unaunganisha moja ``registry:2`` Mfano katika hali ya wakala wa kuvuta kwenye jeshi la kikundi cha hesabu. Kwa sababu kawaida huwa na mwenyeji mmoja (Mkurugenzi wa kitengo cha), Kwa hivyo, ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` Uamuzi wa ``compose`` kwa jukumu; mashabiki wengi wa mwenyeji kwa cache yenyewe ni nje ya upeo wa v1..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys a single `registry:2` instance in pull-through proxy mode on its inventory group's host. Because the group typically holds exactly one host (the swarm manager), `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` resolves to `compose` for the role; multi-host fan-out for the cache itself is out of scope for v1."
msgstr "Mradi huo unaunganisha moja `registry:2` Mfano katika hali ya wakala wa kuvuta kwenye mwenyeji wa kikundi cha hesabu. Kwa sababu kawaida huwa na mwenyeji mmoja (Mkurugenzi wa kitengo cha), Kwa hivyo, `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` Uamuzi wa `compose` kwa jukumu; mashabiki wengi wa mwenyeji kwa cache yenyewe ni nje ya upeo wa v1..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys end-to-end on the project's reference distribution and is covered by **at least** a smoke-level Playwright spec, but neither the deploy nor the spec depth is considered production-grade."
msgstr "Kazi inachukua mwisho-kwa-mwisho kwenye usambazaji wa kumbukumbu ya mradi na imefunikwa na **Kwa uchache** spec kiwango cha Playwright, lakini si kupeleka wala kina spec ni kuchukuliwa uzalishaji-daraja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys the frontend and owns the templates and their tuning; the dev compose stack has no inventory to render them with and comes through here instead. Every value still has one home: the hosts and repositories come from the ``cache:`` declarations, the nginx tuning from the role's ``vars/main.yml``, and only the backend address differs, because the dev stack reaches Nexus over a compose network alias while the role reaches it by its configured container."
msgstr "Jukumu linaweka mbele na kumiliki templates na tuning yao; stack ya kuandika ya kubuni haina hesabu ya kuwapa na inakuja hapa badala yake. Kila thamani bado ina nyumba moja: majeshi na kumbukumbu huja kutoka ``cache:`` Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi. ... ``vars/main.yml``, na anwani tu ya nyuma hutofautiana, kwa sababu stack ya dev hufikia Nexus juu ya mtandao wa kutunga wakati jukumu linafikia kwa chombo chake kilichoundwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys the single Semaphore container (with its embedded task runner) and wires it into the platform via `SEMAPHORE_*` environment variables. The setup wizard is bypassed by seeding the initial admin from rendered secrets, so a fresh deploy lands directly on the Semaphore login page. When SSO is enabled, the Keycloak `administrator` is created at deploy time as an external Semaphore admin via `semaphore user add --admin --external`; the OIDC callback matches it by email and signs the operator in as a Semaphore admin."
msgstr "Kampuni ya Semaphore pekee (pamoja na kazi yake ya kuongoza) na kuiwasilisha kwenye jukwaa kupitia `SEMAPHORE_*` mabadiliko ya mazingira. Mchawi wa kuanzisha ni bypassed kwa seeding admin wa awali kutoka siri zinazotolewa, hivyo mpya kupeleka ardhi moja kwa moja kwenye ukurasa Semaphore login. Kama kuna uwezekano, Keycloak `administrator` Imeundwa wakati wa kupeleka kama msimamizi wa nje wa Semaphore kupitia `semaphore user add --admin --external`; Simu ya OIDC inafanana na barua pepe na ishara operator katika kama admin Semaphore."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys the single Semaphore container (with its embedded task runner) and wires it into the platform via ``SEMAPHORE_*`` environment variables. The setup wizard is bypassed by seeding the initial admin from rendered secrets, so a fresh deploy lands directly on the Semaphore login page. When SSO is enabled, the Keycloak ``administrator`` is created at deploy time as an external Semaphore admin via ``semaphore user add --admin --external``; the OIDC callback matches it by email and signs the operator in as a Semaphore admin."
msgstr "Kampuni ya Semaphore pekee (pamoja na kazi yake ya kuongoza) na kuiwasilisha kwenye jukwaa kupitia ``SEMAPHORE_*`` mabadiliko ya mazingira. Mchawi wa kuanzisha ni bypassed kwa seeding admin wa awali kutoka siri zinazotolewa, hivyo mpya kupeleka ardhi moja kwa moja kwenye ukurasa Semaphore login. Kama kuna uwezekano, Keycloak ``administrator`` Imeundwa wakati wa kupeleka kama msimamizi wa nje wa Semaphore kupitia ``semaphore user add --admin --external``; Simu ya OIDC inafanana na barua pepe na ishara operator katika kama admin Semaphore."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys two containers on its inventory group's host: the repository manager and its nginx frontend. Both run in compose mode on the manager, like the sibling [svc-registry-cache](../svc-registry-cache/README.md)."
msgstr "Jukumu linaweka vyombo viwili kwenye jeshi lake la kikundi cha hesabu: meneja wa hazina na mbele yake ya nginx. Wote wawili wanaendesha mtindo wa kutunga kwenye meneja, kama vile sibling [svc-registry-cache](../svc-registry-cache/README.md)..."

