# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role directory name is the `application_id`. For example `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` is exposed as `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` as `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, and so on."
msgstr "Jina la kiongozi huyo ni `application_id`. Kwa mfano `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` Imetolewa kama `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, Kwa hivyo, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` Kama vile `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, Ndio, na kadhalika."

