# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role includes a custom ``auth_oauth_https`` addon that fixes OAuth redirect URIs when running behind a reverse proxy with TLS termination. The standard ``auth_oauth`` module may incorrectly generate HTTP redirect URIs. This addon overrides the behavior to use the ``web.base.url`` system parameter, ensuring HTTPS is always used."
msgstr "Sehemu hii inajumuisha desturi ``auth_oauth_https`` addon kwamba fixes OAuth redirect URIs wakati mbio nyuma ya wakala reverse na TLS kukomesha. Kiwango cha ``auth_oauth`` Moduli inaweza kuzalisha vibaya URIs ya HTTP. Hii inaimarisha tabia ya kutumia ``web.base.url`` Mfumo wa parameter, kuhakikisha HTTPS hutumiwa kila wakati."

