# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a health check script along with a ``systemd`` service and timer to run these checks at scheduled intervals."
msgstr "Makala hii inahusu mfumo wa kuangalia afya pamoja na ``systemd`` Huduma na muda wa kuendesha hundi hizi katika vipindi uliopangwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a health check script along with a `systemd` service and timer to run these checks at scheduled intervals.   If unhealthy or failed containers are detected, the configured failure notifier (via `sys-ctl-alm-compose`) is triggered."
msgstr "Makala hii inahusu mfumo wa kuangalia afya pamoja na `systemd` Huduma na muda wa kuendesha hundi hizi katika vipindi uliopangwa. Ikiwa vyombo vya afya visivyo na afya au vilivyoshindwa vinatambuliwa, kushindwa kwa ufanisi (Kwa kupitia `sys-ctl-alm-compose`) ya kuanzishwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a script and a ``systemd`` service with a timer to periodically scan for leftover anonymous volumes."
msgstr "Kamati hiyo imeunda Kamati ya Utendaji na ``systemd`` Huduma na timer mara kwa mara Scan kwa kiasi cha leftover kisichojulikana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a script and a `systemd` service with a timer to periodically scan for leftover anonymous volumes.   This helps prevent wasted disk space and leftover resources from old deployments."
msgstr "Kamati hiyo imeunda Kamati ya Utendaji na `systemd` Huduma na timer mara kwa mara Scan kwa kiasi cha leftover kisichojulikana. Hii husaidia kuzuia nafasi ya disk iliyopotea na rasilimali za kushoto kutoka kwa kupelekwa kwa zamani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a systemd unit that snapshots each configured source directory into `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`, hard-linked against the previous generation. Optional sources are skipped when absent (the CA in Let's Encrypt mode, ACME/certbot in self-signed mode). The generation joins the same backup tree the pull and device roles consume, so it flows to the backup host and the encrypted device automatically."
msgstr "Jukumu linaweka kitengo cha mfumo ambacho hupima kila saraka ya chanzo kilichoundwa katika `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`· Kuunganishwa kwa nguvu dhidi ya kizazi cha zamani. Vyanzo vya hiari huondolewa wakati wa kutokuwepo (CA katika Let's Encrypt mode, ACME / certbot katika mode binafsi saini). Kizazi kinajiunga na mti mmoja wa chelezo wa kuvuta na majukumu ya kifaa hutumia, kwa hivyo hutiririka kwa mwenyeji wa chelezo na kifaa kilichofichwa moja kwa moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a systemd unit that snapshots each configured source directory into ``<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>``, hard-linked against the previous generation. Optional sources are skipped when absent (the CA in Let’s Encrypt mode, ACME/certbot in self-signed mode). The generation joins the same backup tree the pull and device roles consume, so it flows to the backup host and the encrypted device automatically."
msgstr "Jukumu linaweka kitengo cha mfumo ambacho hupima kila saraka ya chanzo kilichoundwa katika ``<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>``· Kuunganishwa kwa nguvu dhidi ya kizazi cha zamani. Vyanzo vya hiari huondolewa wakati wa kutokuwepo (CA katika Let's Encrypt mode, ACME / certbot katika mode binafsi saini). Kizazi kinajiunga na mti mmoja wa chelezo wa kuvuta na majukumu ya kifaa hutumia, kwa hivyo hutiririka kwa mwenyeji wa chelezo na kifaa kilichofichwa moja kwa moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs the `@openai/codex` npm package and, when the workstation also runs [`svc-ai-litellm`](../svc-ai-litellm/), writes a provider profile that sends every completion to the gateway over the loopback address the engine publishes it on. Nothing leaves the machine: the gateway answers on `127.0.0.1`, so the workstation's virtual key never crosses a network."
msgstr "Kamati hiyo imeainisha kuwa `@openai/codex` Npm mfuko na, wakati worktation pia anaendesha [`svc-ai-litellm`](../svc-ai-litellm/), anaandika maelezo ya mtoa huduma ambayo hutuma kila kukamilika kwa lango juu ya anwani ya kitanzi cha nyuma injini inachapisha. Hakuna kitu kinachoacha mashine: majibu ya lango `127.0.0.1`, Kwa hiyo, ufunguo wa kawaida wa worktation haujawahi kuvuka mtandao."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs the ``@openai/codex`` npm package and, when the workstation also runs ```svc-ai-litellm`` <../svc-ai-litellm/>`__, writes a provider profile that sends every completion to the gateway over the loopback address the engine publishes it on. Nothing leaves the machine: the gateway answers on ``127.0.0.1``, so the workstation’s virtual key never crosses a network."
msgstr "Kamati hiyo imeainisha kuwa ``@openai/codex`` Npm mfuko na, wakati worktation pia anaendesha ```svc-ai-litellm`` <../svc-ai-litellm/>`__, writes a provider profile that sends every completion to the gateway over the loopback address the engine publishes it on. Nothing leaves the machine: the gateway answers on ``127.0.0.1``Kwa hiyo, ufunguo wa kawaida wa worktation haujawahi kuvuka mtandao."

