msgstr "Jukumu la kufunga pinned upstream AppImage na kuiweka kwenye ``PATH``. Upstream ishara mali yake na muhimu Tauri updater na kuchapisha hakuna digest, hivyo jukumu pins sha256 Kuchukuliwa kutoka kwa kujengwa yenyewe na download ni kuthibitishwa dhidi yake. Mali iliyojengwa upya au iliyobadilishwa inashindwa kupeleka badala ya imewekwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role is a critical component in a secure backup scheme. By isolating backup operations to a dedicated user, it minimizes the risk of unauthorized actions. The role configures the SSH environment so that only specific, allowed commands can be executed, and it sets up passwordless sudo rights for rsync, ensuring smooth and secure backup operations."
msgstr "Jukumu ni sehemu muhimu katika mpango salama wa Backup. Kwa kuhamisha shughuli za chelezo kwa mtumiaji aliyejitolea, hupunguza hatari ya vitendo visivyoidhinishwa. Jukumu linasanidi mazingira ya SSH ili tu maalum, amri zilizoruhusiwa zinaweza kutekelezwa, na inaweka haki za sudo zisizo na nenosiri kwa rsync, kuhakikisha shughuli za salama na salama."

