# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role renders ``settings.yml`` from the deployment’s own secret key and mounts it read-only. ``formats`` carries ``json`` next to ``html``, because a machine consumer gets HTTP 403 on the JSON endpoint otherwise, and the rate limiter is off since the only clients are platform services on the container network."
msgstr "Wajibu wa kutoa ``settings.yml`` Kutoka kwa ufunguo wa siri wa kupelekwa na inasoma tu. ``formats`` Usafiri wa ``json`` Baada ya ``html``, Kwa sababu mtumiaji wa mashine anapata HTTP 403 kwenye mwisho wa JSON vinginevyo, na kikomo cha kiwango ni mbali kwa sababu wateja pekee ni huduma za jukwaa kwenye mtandao wa chombo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role renders `settings.yml` from the deployment's own secret key and mounts it read-only. `formats` carries `json` next to `html`, because a machine consumer gets HTTP 403 on the JSON endpoint otherwise, and the rate limiter is off since the only clients are platform services on the container network."
msgstr "Wajibu wa kutoa `settings.yml` Kutoka kwa ufunguo wa siri wa kupelekwa na inasoma tu. `formats` Usafiri wa `json` Baada ya `html`, Kwa sababu mtumiaji wa mashine anapata HTTP 403 kwenye mwisho wa JSON vinginevyo, na kikomo cha kiwango ni mbali kwa sababu wateja pekee ni huduma za jukwaa kwenye mtandao wa chombo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role runs the `-full` image, which carries the OCR and language packs, and serves it on port 9998 inside the container network only. No port is published and no proxy entry is created."
msgstr "Jukumu la kuongoza `-full` Picha, ambayo hubeba pakiti za OCR na lugha, na hutumikia kwenye bandari 9998 Ndani ya chombo cha habari tu. Hakuna bandari iliyochapishwa na hakuna kuingia kwa wakala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
