# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The run this builds differs from a retrigger: a retrigger replays what a run already judged, this one asks about rows nobody has judged yet or whose verdict is still disputed. It therefore states its axes instead of carrying them over."
msgstr "Kukimbia hii hujenga tofauti na retrigger: retrigger replayer replays nini kukimbia tayari hukumu, hii moja anauliza kuhusu safu hakuna mtu amehukumu bado au ambaye hukumu ni bado utata. Kwa hiyo, badala ya kufanya hivyo, inawaumiza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The run's 256-job cap is the second ceiling. `slots` counts every non-deploy job the orchestrator chain spawns, subtracts the worst `entry-*.yml` overhead, and what remains is `available` — the rows one sweep may deploy across all its chunks. Rows beyond that roll into the next sweep, which starts reading the regular line at an offset (`cli.meta.ci.chunks`), so consecutive sweeps walk the whole list instead of re-testing the same head forever."
msgstr "Barabara ya 256Nafasi ya kazi ni daraja la pili. `slots` Inahesabu kila kazi isiyo ya kazi ya orchestrator spawns, hutoa mbaya zaidi `entry-*.yml` juu, na kile ambacho bado `available` - safu moja sweep inaweza kupeleka katika chunks zake zote. Rows zaidi ya kwamba roll katika sweep ijayo, ambayo huanza kusoma mstari wa kawaida katika mwanzo (`cli.meta.ci.chunks`), hivyo sweeps mfululizo kutembea orodha nzima badala ya retesting kichwa sawa milele."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The runnable journey lives in ``files/playwright/test-login-biber.js``, which first grants biber the KIX user group over the Keycloak Admin API and then drives ``runKixLoginLogoutFlow`` through both stages to the universal logout. The path back to the generic persona is a KIX build that accepts the proxy’s trusted headers instead of demanding its own login."
msgstr "Safari ya kuelekea katika ``files/playwright/test-login-biber.js``, Kwanza, ambayo inatoa biber KIX Watumiaji juu ya Keycloak Usimamizi wa API Baada ya kuendesha ``runKixLoginLogoutFlow`` Kwa njia ya hatua zote mbili kwa logout ya ulimwengu. Njia ya kurudi kwa mtu wa kawaida ni KIX kujenga kwamba anapokea wakala kuaminiwa headers badala ya kudai kuingia yake mwenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The runnable journey lives in `files/playwright/test-login-biber.js`, which first grants biber the KIX user group over the Keycloak Admin API and then drives `runKixLoginLogoutFlow` through both stages to the universal logout. The path back to the generic persona is a KIX build that accepts the proxy's trusted headers instead of demanding its own login."
msgstr "Safari ya kuelekea katika `files/playwright/test-login-biber.js`, Kwanza, ambayo inatoa biber KIX Watumiaji juu ya Keycloak Usimamizi wa API Baada ya kuendesha `runKixLoginLogoutFlow` Kwa njia ya hatua zote mbili kwa logout ya ulimwengu. Njia ya kurudi kwa mtu wa kawaida ni KIX Kujenga hiyo inakubali viongozi wa kuaminika wa wakala badala ya kudai kuingia kwake mwenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The runner is intentionally test-agnostic at runtime: it executes only tests provided by application roles."
