# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The runner keeps Playwright traces, screenshots, and videos for every test only when the resolved environment variable `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP` evaluates to `true` (case-insensitive). Any other value, including unset or empty, keeps artefacts only when a test fails."
msgstr "Mkimbiaji anaendelea kufuatilia Playwright, viwambo vya skrini, na video kwa kila mtihani tu wakati mazingira yaliyochaguliwa `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP` Tathmini ya `true` (Uchunguzi wa kesi). Thamani nyingine yoyote, ikiwa ni pamoja na unset au tupu, inaweka vifaa tu wakati jaribio linashindwa."

