# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The runner's `infinito` service receives:"
msgstr "Mchezaji wa Runner `infinito` Huduma inapokea:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The safety of this design comes entirely from **confinement of the device**, not from confinement of the agent: the machine is dedicated to Hermes, single-tenant, network-segmented, and physically separate from shared infrastructure. `svc-ai-robot` is the role that provisions that device and deploys Hermes on it in privileged mode. It builds on the [`web-app-hermes`](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) role rather than reimplementing the agent."
msgstr "Usalama wa mfumo huu unatokana na **Ulinzi wa mfumo**, si kutokana na kushikiliwa kwa wakala: mashine ni wakfu kwa Hermes, moja-tenant, mtandao-segmented, na kimwili tofauti na miundombinu ya pamoja. `svc-ai-robot` Ni jukumu ambalo linaweka kifaa hicho na kupeleka Hermes juu yake katika hali ya upendeleo. Inajenga juu ya [`web-app-hermes`](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) majukumu yake badala ya kumwajibisha mtendaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same as JSON"
msgstr "Kama ilivyo kwa JSON"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same command as one shell string, so a prefix can compose with it."
msgstr "Ni sawa na kamba moja ya shell, hivyo prefix inaweza kutunga nayo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same mapping."
msgstr "Ramani sawa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same reachability problem exists without Tor wherever the host resolves through a listener of its own on loopback, which is how the simulated cluster nodes are wired. Handing containers the declared clearnet address there was what a literal bridge address in the inventory used to paper over, and that literal went stale the moment the daemon's address pool moved the bridge off Docker's default."
msgstr "Tatizo hilo la ufikiaji lipo bila Tor popote ambapo mwenyeji anatatua kupitia msikilizaji wake mwenyewe kwenye kitanzi, ambayo ni jinsi nodes za nguzo zilizounganishwa zinaunganishwa. Kupeana vyombo anwani ya wazi ya wazi kulikuwa na anwani halisi ya daraja katika hesabu iliyotumiwa kuandika juu, na kwamba halisi ilikwenda kimya wakati bwawa la anwani la daemon lilihamisha daraja mbali na default ya Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same selections with every axis dropped, one entry per role."
msgstr "Uchaguzi sawa na kila mhimili imeshuka, kuingia moja kwa kila jukumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same shape serves the repository-root file, which holds the shared collection any role and any inventory bundle may install from, and a role's own file, which holds what only that role installs."
msgstr "Sura hiyo hutumikia faili ya mizizi ya hifadhi, ambayo ina mkusanyiko wa pamoja wa jukumu lolote na kifungu chochote cha hesabu kinaweza kufunga kutoka, na faili ya jukumu lenyewe, ambayo inashikilia nini tu jukumu hilo linafunga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same string `.env` carries as ``INFINITO_CACHE_UPSTREAMS``, so the role's bootstrap task and the dev stack provision Nexus from one rendering. `utils.cache.records` owns the format."
msgstr "Mstari huo `.env` kuwa kama ``INFINITO_CACHE_UPSTREAMS``, Kwa hiyo, jukumu la bootstrap na mpango wa stack stack Nexus kutoka kwa utoaji mmoja. `utils.cache.records` kuwa na muundo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox (`allowWrite`, `denyRead`, `allowedDomains`, see [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)) bounds every write, every read, and every outbound connection. `deny` rules block destructive patterns unconditionally; `ask` rules force operator review on every mutating `gh`/`docker`/`git commit`/`Skill(update-config*)` invocation. The wildcard does **not** loosen any existing guardrail; it only drops the per-shape workarounds."
msgstr "Sanduku la sandbox (`allowWrite`, Kwa hivyo, `denyRead`, Kwa hivyo, `allowedDomains`, kuona kuwa [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)) Kila kitu kinaandikwa, kila kitu kinaandikwa, na kila kitu kinaunganishwa. `deny` sheria kuzuia mifumo ya uharibifu bila masharti; `ask` Sheria ya nguvu operator mapitio juu ya kila kubadilika `gh`Kwa hivyo`docker`Kwa hivyo`git commit`Kwa hivyo`Skill(update-config*)` ya maombi. Wildcard hufanya hivyo **Sio ya** Kwa hivyo, safisha kila kitu kilicho tayari; safisha tu kwa sabuni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox `denyRead: ~/.gnupg` rule blocks GPG access by design; agent commands must never touch private key material. This env override removes the resulting signing failure without weakening the credential-path protection. Agent-authored commits land unsigned; the `Co-Authored-By` trailer documents authorship."
msgstr "Sanduku la sandbox `denyRead: ~/.gnupg` Utawala vitalu GPG upatikanaji na kubuni; wakala amri lazima kamwe kugusa vifaa binafsi muhimu. Hii env override huondoa kushindwa kwa kutia saini bila kudhoofisha ulinzi wa njia ya imani. Nchi ambayo haijasajiliwa; `Co-Authored-By` Nyaraka za trailer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox can connect to any Unix-domain socket on the host. Required so commands like `docker`, `systemctl`, and language servers continue to work; these all communicate over Unix sockets (e.g. `/var/run/docker.sock`)."
msgstr "Sanduku la mchanga linaweza kuungana na soketi yoyote ya Unix kwenye mwenyeji. Anahitaji ushauri kama huo `docker`, Kwa hivyo, `systemctl`, na seva za lugha zinaendelea kufanya kazi; hizi zote zinawasiliana juu ya soketi za Unix (ya g. `/var/run/docker.sock`)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox cannot be escaped through the host daemon"
msgstr "Sanduku la mchanga haliwezi kutoroka kupitia daemon mwenyeji"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox has `sandbox.network.allowAllUnixSockets: true` so that normal workflow tools (`docker`, `systemctl`, language servers) continue to work. Any command that reaches `/var/run/docker.sock` can request a container with `-v /:/host --privileged`, which the Docker daemon executes as root and mounts the host filesystem. The sandbox's `allowWrite` does NOT protect against this path because Docker is a trusted service on the other end of the socket."
msgstr "Klabu ya Sandbox ina `sandbox.network.allowAllUnixSockets: true` Vifaa vya kawaida vya kazi (`docker`, Kwa hivyo, `systemctl`, server ya lugha) kuendelea kufanya kazi. Na amri hiyo inatekelezwa. `/var/run/docker.sock` Unaweza kuomba chombo kwa `-v /:/host --privileged`, ambayo Docker daemon inafanya kama mizizi na inafungua mfumo wa faili wa mwenyeji. Sanduku la sandbox `allowWrite` Je, si kulinda dhidi ya njia hii kwa sababu Docker ni huduma kuaminiwa katika mwisho mwingine wa soketi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The sandbox is activated unconditionally via `\"sandbox\": { \"enabled\": true }`. This means filesystem and network restrictions below are enforced **at every session**, not only when the operator manually switches into sandbox permission mode. The OS-level sandbox is the source of truth for what commands may read, write, and reach over the network; the `allow`/`ask`/`deny` permission lists remain in force as a second line of defence for policy concerns the OS cannot express (e.g. requiring confirmation before publishing a commit)."
msgstr "Mfuko wa Hifadhi ya Taifa ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Taifa ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Taifa ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Taifa ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Ingingingingingingingi imefunguliwa kwa njia isiyo na Mipaka `\"sandbox\": { \"enabled\": true }`. Hii inamaanisha mfumo wa faili na vikwazo vya mtandao chini ya kutekelezwa **Katika kila mkutano**Si tu wakati operator manually switches katika hali ya kibali sandbox. Kwa mujibu wa Qur’ani Tukufu, Qur’ani Tukufu ina haki ya kusoma na kuandika; `allow`Kwa hivyo`ask`Kwa hivyo`deny` Orodha ya ruhusa inabaki katika nguvu kama mstari wa pili wa ulinzi kwa masuala ya sera ambayo OS haiwezi kuonyesha. (e.g. kuomba uthibitisho kabla ya kuchapisha ahadi)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox's `denyRead` list (`~/.gnupg`, `~/.kube`, `~/.aws`, `~/.config/gcloud`) is the primary mechanism that prevents the agent from reading host credentials. Every credential store an operator uses on the host is assumed to be covered, **with the documented exception of `~/.ssh`** (see Assumption 10)."
msgstr "Sanduku la sandbox `denyRead` Orodha ya orodha (`~/.gnupg`, Kwa hivyo, `~/.kube`, Kwa hivyo, `~/.aws`, Kwa hivyo, `~/.config/gcloud`) Ni utaratibu wa msingi ambao unazuia wakala kusoma hati za jeshi. Kila duka la uaminifu ambalo mwendeshaji hutumia kwenye mwenyeji hufikiriwa kufunikwa, **Kwa mujibu wa taarifa iliyotolewa na `~/.ssh`** (Angalia matumizi 10)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scan is cached behind a fresh list, because one source message is scanned once per target language and callers may sort or trim the result."
msgstr "Skanning ni cached nyuma ya orodha mpya, kwa sababu moja chanzo ujumbe ni scanned mara moja kwa lengo lugha na wapiga simu inaweza kutatua au kupunguza matokeo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scheduled `🔄 Update versions` pipeline (version bumps and PR open/refresh)."
