# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The script first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential generation of the live material), then mirrors each present subtree back to its fixed system path (`rsync -a --delete`): `secrets` into `/var/lib/infinito/secrets`, `ca` into `/etc/<domain>/ca`, `acme` into `/etc/letsencrypt`, `certbot` into `/etc/certbot`. `--no-safety-backup` skips the pre-recover unit run. The `node` subtree (ssh host keys + machine-id) is restored only with `--restore-node-identity`, because overwriting the running machine-id / ssh host keys changes the host's identity mid-flight — do it on a fresh host after total loss."
msgstr "Nakala ya kwanza inaanza kitengo cha Backup cha jukumu (Kizazi kipya cha vifaa vya kuishi), Kisha kila mtu aangalie njia yake ya asili. (`rsync -a --delete`): `secrets` Ndani ya `/var/lib/infinito/secrets`, Kwa hivyo, `ca` Ndani ya `/etc/<domain>/ca`, Kwa hivyo, `acme` Ndani ya `/etc/letsencrypt`, Kwa hivyo, `certbot` Ndani ya `/etc/certbot`... `--no-safety-backup` Bonyeza kitufe cha Recover. Kwa kuwa `node` Chini ya (Ssh mwenyeji funguo + mashine-id) Kurudishwa kwa pekee `--restore-node-identity`, kwa sababu ya kuandika funguo za mwenyeji wa mashine ya kukimbia / ssh hubadilisha utambulisho wa mwenyeji katikati ya mwangaza - fanya hivyo kwa mwenyeji mpya baada ya kupoteza jumla."

