# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). Pixelfed's login id is the account e-mail rather than the Keycloak username, and the artisan-bootstrapped administrator name is reserved, so pixelfed's first-time OIDC registration cannot mint it either. `biber` additionally needs his Keycloak e-mail rewritten to a resolvable domain through the Keycloak admin API before the first OIDC login, because pixelfed's `dns,spoof` validator rejects `.example` addresses. Both setups live in [files/playwright/_shared.js](./files/playwright/_shared.js) and drive the dedicated login specs in `files/playwright/`."
msgstr "Kwa pamoja `biber` Aidha, na `administrator` Wafanyakazi wa mashirika ya misaada wakamatwa [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). Kuingia kwa Pixelfed ni barua pepe ya akaunti badala ya barua pepe Keycloak Jina la mtumiaji, na jina la msimamizi aliyepigwa la artisan limehifadhiwa, kwa hivyo usajili wa OIDC wa mara ya kwanza hauwezi kuipunguza pia. `biber` Aidha, anahitaji Keycloak e-mail rewritten kwa domain resolvable kupitia Keycloak Usimamizi wa admin API Kabla ya kuingia kwa OIDC, kwa sababu pixelfed `dns,spoof` Ushahidi wa kukataa `.example` anwani. Wote wawili wanaishi katika [files/playwright/_shared.js](./files/playwright/_shared.js) na kutoa huduma za kielektroniki katika `files/playwright/`..."

