# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. As soon as an IAM source is wired, the role sets `GITEA__service__DISABLE_REGISTRATION` (`templates/env.j2`, driven by `GITEA_IAM_ENABLED` in `vars/main.yml`), and `tasks/setup/oidc.yml` registers only the auth source — never a Gitea user — so a Keycloak identity without a pre-linked Gitea account is bounced back to `/user/login`. The opt-out lapses once the deploy provisions (or auto-links) Gitea accounts for the persona identities."
msgstr "Kwa pamoja `biber` Aidha, na `administrator` Safari za mtu binafsi zimepangwa kupitia `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` Kwa hivyo `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` Ndani ya `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mara tu chanzo cha IAM ni wired, jukumu seti `GITEA__service__DISABLE_REGISTRATION` (`templates/env.j2`, Kwa kuongozwa na `GITEA_IAM_ENABLED` Ndani ya `vars/main.yml`), Aidha, na `tasks/setup/oidc.yml` Kujiandikisha tu chanzo cha auth - kamwe Gitea Mtumiaji:A Keycloak Uhusiano usio na uhusiano wa awali Gitea Akaunti imefunguliwa tena `/user/login`.Kuondoa vikwazo mara baada ya utekelezaji wa masharti (Kuwa na Auto-Link) Gitea Inahusu utambulisho wa mtu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Fider's SSO entry is a two-step modal: the header \"Sign in\" button only opens the provider dialog, and a second click on \"Continue with … SSO\" performs the Keycloak redirect, whereas the shared helper clicks exactly once and never reaches the IdP. Both journeys are covered end-to-end by this role's own `fider: admin sso login` and `fider: biber sso login as regular user` scenarios in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`; the opt-out lapses once the shared helper learns Fider's modal."
msgstr "Kwa pamoja `biber` Aidha, na `administrator` Safari za mtu binafsi zimepangwa kupitia `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` Kwa hivyo `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` Ndani ya `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Kuingia kwa Fider ni modal ya hatua mbili: kichwa \"Ingia katika kuingia\" kifungo tu kufungua mtoa mazungumzo, na click ya pili juu ya \"Endelea ... Endelea\" Kufanya hivyo Keycloak Redirect, wakati msaidizi wa pamoja anabofya mara moja na kamwe hufikia IdP. Safari zote mbili zimefunikwa mwisho hadi mwisho kwa jukumu hili mwenyewe. `fider: admin sso login` Aidha, na `fider: biber sso login as regular user` Matukio katika `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`← Previous Story Baada ya mfanyakazi wa kawaida kujifunza Fiderya modal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Flowise has no in-app OIDC adapter: SSO is an oauth2-proxy sidecar (`services.sso.flavor: oauth2`), and behind that gate Flowise still presents its own sign-in form for the single instance account seeded from `FLOWISE_USERNAME` / `FLOWISE_PASSWORD` in `templates/env.j2`. `biber` has no Flowise identity at all, and the shared helpers only drive Keycloak forms while `services.sso` is enabled, so neither persona can reach an authenticated Flowise surface; the OIDC gate itself is covered by `files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js`."
msgstr "Kwa pamoja `biber` Aidha, na `administrator` Safari za mtu binafsi zimepangwa kupitia `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` Kwa hivyo `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` Ndani ya `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Flowise haina adapta ya OIDC: SSO ni oauth2Mafuta ya sidecar (`services.sso.flavor: oauth2`), Nyuma ya mlango huo Flowise Hata hivyo akaunti yake imezuiliwa kwa muda usiojulikana. `FLOWISE_USERNAME` Kwa hivyo `FLOWISE_PASSWORD` Ndani ya `templates/env.j2`... `biber` Hakuwa na Flowise kwa ujumla, na wasaidizi wa pamoja wanaendesha Keycloak Baadhi ya wakati `services.sso` Ni rahisi, kwa hivyo hakuna mtu anayeweza kufikia uhakika. Flowise Mlango wa mlango ni wazi kwa ajili ya kuogelea. `files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Joomla's site template ships no login/logout module, and `plg_system_keycloak` exposes sign-out only as the route `index.php?option=keycloak&task=logout` (`files/joomla-oidc-plugin/plg_system_keycloak/src/Extension/Keycloak.php`, `handleLogout`) rather than as a rendered control, so the persona's mandatory in-app logout click has no target and navigating a logout URL directly is forbidden by the contract. The OIDC handshake itself, the LDAP variant and the `/administrator?fallback=local` hatch are covered by `files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js`, `test-ldap-login.js` and `test-oidc-fallback.js`."
msgstr "Kwa pamoja `biber` Aidha, na `administrator` Safari za mtu binafsi zimepangwa kupitia `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` Kwa hivyo `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` Ndani ya `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Template ya tovuti ya Joomla haina moduli ya kuingia /logout, na `plg_system_keycloak` Huonyesha ishara tu kama njia `index.php?option=keycloak&task=logout` (`files/joomla-oidc-plugin/plg_system_keycloak/src/Extension/Keycloak.php`, Kwa hivyo, `handleLogout`) Badala ya kama udhibiti unaotolewa, kwa hivyo bonyeza ya lazima ya kuingia kwenye programu haina lengo na kusafirisha URL ya kuingia moja kwa moja ni marufuku na mkataba. OIDC handshake yenyewe, tofauti ya LDAP na `/administrator?fallback=local` Harufu hufunikwa na `files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js`, Kwa hivyo, `test-ldap-login.js` Aidha, na `test-oidc-fallback.js`..."

