# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The title renders these as glyphs, so recovering one means translating a symbol back into a value; the log holds the word the operator picked. Reading it there keeps the retrigger honest even if the title's marker changes shape."
msgstr "Kichwa hufanya haya kama glyphs, hivyo kupona moja ina maana ya kutafsiri ishara nyuma katika thamani; logi ina neno ambalo operator alichukua. Kusoma kuna anaendelea retrigger uaminifu hata kama alama ya kichwa mabadiliko sura."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The title's priority segment is the cross-check, not the source: it proves a priority line existed even when truncation mangled it, so an empty log read is a broken reader -- expired logs, a moved Inputs block, an inlined orchestrator -- rather than a run dispatched without one."
msgstr "Sehemu ya kipaumbele ya kichwa ni msalaba-check, si chanzo: inathibitisha mstari wa kipaumbele kuwepo hata wakati truncation mangled yake, hivyo logi tupu kusoma ni msomaji kuvunjwa - kumbukumbu za muda mrefu, kizuizi cha Inputs kilichohamishwa, orchestrator inlined - badala ya kukimbia kutumwa bila moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The token as an operator would have written it, for error messages."
msgstr "Kwa mfano, barua pepe kama hiyo ilitumwa kwa barua pepe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The token can name a row this ranking no longer has -- the role was removed, a variant was dropped, the filters moved. The start is then the first row the source run got green, which lies inside the same window and so never falls behind it. A run with nothing green and an unresolvable token leaves no anchor at all and starts at the head."
msgstr "Ishara inaweza kutaja mstari wa cheo hiki tena - jukumu liliondolewa, lahaja ilipungua, filters zilihamishwa. Kuanza ni mstari wa kwanza chanzo kukimbia got kijani, ambayo iko ndani ya dirisha moja na hivyo kamwe kuanguka nyuma yake. kukimbia bila kitu cha kijani na ishara isiyo na ufumbuzi majani hakuna nanga wakati wote na kuanza katika kichwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The token each entry carries is the one the deployment issued, not the signed-in caller's own, so reaching an MCP tool server is a grant separate from signing in. The env renders `config.access_grants: []`, which `has_connection_access` reads as administrator-only, and [`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) then narrows each entry to the serving role's `mcp` RBAC group."
msgstr "Ishara kila kuingia hubeba ni moja ya kupelekwa iliyotolewa, sio simu iliyosainiwa mwenyewe, kwa hivyo kufikia seva ya chombo cha MCP ni ruzuku tofauti na kusaini. Wageni waalikwa `config.access_grants: []`, ambayo `has_connection_access` kama kiongozi, na [`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) Hivyo basi, kila mmoja atimize wajibu wake katika `mcp` Kikundi cha RBAC."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The token each entry carries is the one the deployment issued, not the signed-in caller’s own, so reaching an MCP tool server is a grant separate from signing in. The env renders ``config.access_grants: []``, which ``has_connection_access`` reads as administrator-only, and ```tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` <./tasks/utils/mcp.yml>`__ then narrows each entry to the serving role’s ``mcp`` RBAC group."
msgstr "Ishara kila kuingia hubeba ni moja ya kupelekwa iliyotolewa, sio simu iliyosainiwa mwenyewe, kwa hivyo kufikia seva ya chombo cha MCP ni ruzuku tofauti na kusaini. Wageni waalikwa ``config.access_grants: []``, ambayo ``has_connection_access`` kama kiongozi, na ```tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` <./tasks/utils/mcp.yml>`__ then narrows each entry to the serving role’s ``mcp`` Kikundi cha RBAC."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The token lifetime is bounded to one hour, and a new token is minted on every workflow run."
msgstr "Maisha ya ishara ni amefungwa kwa saa moja, na ishara mpya ni minted juu ya kila kukimbia kazi."

