# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The trigger is **group membership**, not a per-role flag."
msgstr "Trigger ya ni ya **Muungano wa**Bendera ya Volta ya Juu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The trigger validates on its own before it dispatches, and refuses the whole run when a token cannot deploy on this branch. That refusal is not about deploy minutes: `call-orchestrator.yml` runs the same check as its first job and every other job needs it, so a bad token never reaches a chunk. It reaches the branch's concurrency group, which `entry-manual-steer.yml` declares with `cancel-in-progress`, so the doomed dispatch cancels the run currently in flight before failing its own validation."
msgstr "Kuchochea huthibitisha mwenyewe kabla ya kutuma, na kukataa kukimbia wote wakati ishara haiwezi kupeleka kwenye tawi hili. Kukataa hii sio juu ya kutumia dakika: `call-orchestrator.yml` Huendesha hundi sawa kama kazi yake ya kwanza na kila kazi nyingine inahitaji, hivyo ishara mbaya kamwe kufikia chunk. ya kujiunga na Chama cha Mapinduzi, ambacho `entry-manual-steer.yml` Alisema kuwa pamoja na `cancel-in-progress`, Kwa hivyo, dispatch iliyoharibika inafuta kukimbia sasa katika ndege kabla ya kushindwa uhalali wake mwenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The trivial static passthroughs live in two collector files: `passthrough.py` (always emitted) and `gha_passthrough.py` (emitted only when `ctx.on_gha` is true)."
msgstr "Passthroughs ndogo tuli kuishi katika faili mbili mtoza: `passthrough.py` (Kuwa tayari) Aidha, na `gha_passthrough.py` (Isipokuwa pale ambapo `ctx.on_gha` Ni kweli kuwa)..."

