msgstr "Mbili, na baada ya hapo ni wazi ``/`` Kwa lengo la upstream iliyoonyeshwa kama njia kamili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The two inputs a retrigger decides itself rather than carrying over."
msgstr "Pande zote mbili zinaamua badala ya kuchukua hatua."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The two lanes run at the same time because they run on different machines. The CI run is remote; the local loop is this host."
msgstr "Njia zote mbili zinaendesha kwa wakati mmoja kwa sababu zinaendesha kwenye mashine tofauti. Safari ya CI ni mbali; kitanzi cha ndani ni mwenyeji huu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The two measured inputs resolve in a fixed order: an inventory override (`RESOURCE_HOST_CPUS_OVERRIDE` / `RESOURCE_HOST_MEM_MB_OVERRIDE`), then the host's own hardware facts, then a probe of the machine this plugin runs on. The probe only applies to a target reached over the local connection, because a lookup executes on the Ansible controller: probing for a remote host would report the controller's hardware. That case raises and names the override to set."
msgstr "Pembejeo mbili kipimo kutatua katika utaratibu fasta: hesabu override (`RESOURCE_HOST_CPUS_OVERRIDE` Kwa hivyo `RESOURCE_HOST_MEM_MB_OVERRIDE`), Kisha ukweli wa vifaa vya mwenyeji mwenyewe, kisha uchunguzi wa mashine hii Plugin inaendesha. Uchunguzi unatumika tu kwa lengo lililofikiwa juu ya uunganisho wa ndani, kwa sababu uchunguzi unatekeleza kwenye mtawala wa Ansible: kujaribu mwenyeji wa mbali kunaweza kuripoti vifaa vya mtawala. Hii ina maana kwamba jina la kikoa na jina la kikoa limehifadhiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The two mutual-exclusion guards (*tests/integration/iam/oauth2_oidc/test_mutual_exclusive.py*, *test_acl_mutual_exclusive.py*) — obsolete under the single-block schema."
msgstr "Walinzi wawili wa Muungano (*tests/integration/iam/oauth2_oidc/test_mutual_exclusive.py*Kwa hivyo, *test_acl_mutual_exclusive.py*) - Imewekwa chini ya mpango wa kuzuia moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The unified `# noqa` / `# nocheck` syntax that suppresses individual checks across the infinito-nexus test suite."
msgstr "Umoja wa `# noqa` Kwa hivyo `# nocheck` syntax ambayo inakandamiza hundi za mtu binafsi katika chumba cha mtihani wa infinito-nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The unified schema supports:"
msgstr "Mpango wa Umoja unaunga mkono:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The universal-logout service ([web-svc-logout](../../../../../roles/web-svc-logout/)), when attached to a deployment, injects JavaScript that auto-detects every logout control across the role tree and rewrites it to redirect through Keycloak's end-session endpoint. Persona scenarios therefore do NOT branch on whether universal-logout is active: they always click the role's own logout button. The injected JS handles the redirect when active, the click clears the local session when not, and the post-click assertion (`assertUnauthenticatedLanding`) is identical in both cases."
msgstr "Huduma ya Universallogout ([web-svc-logout](../../../../../roles/web-svc-logout/)), wakati masharti ya kupelekwa, insha JavaScript kwamba auto-detects kila udhibiti wa logout katika mti jukumu na kuandika upya kwa njia ya KeycloakMwisho wa tathmini. Matukio ya Persona kwa hiyo hayana tawi la ikiwa fomu ya jumla inafanya kazi: daima bonyeza kifungo cha logiout cha jukumu. JS iliyoingizwa hushughulikia upya wakati wa kazi, bonyeza hufungua kikao cha ndani wakati sio, na madai ya baada ya bonyeza (`assertUnauthenticatedLanding`) Ni sawa katika kesi zote mbili."

