# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The value a row draws from *pool* this sweep: a plain rotation over the row's global position, so consecutive rows spread across the pool and consecutive sweeps move every row on to the next value."
msgstr "Thamani ya hisa ni kuanzia *Ukumbi wa pool* sweep hii: mzunguko wazi juu ya nafasi ya kimataifa ya mstari, hivyo safu mfululizo kuenea katika bwawa na sweeps mfululizo hoja kila mstari kwa thamani ijayo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The value as it now stands in the file, or \"\" when it was removed."
msgstr "Thamani yake kama ilivyo sasa, au \"\" baada ya kuondolewa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The value can be adjusted or overridden via inventory, group vars, or host vars if needed."
msgstr "Thamani inaweza kubadilishwa au kuzidiwa kupitia hesabu, vars ya kikundi, au vars ya jeshi ikiwa inahitajika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The value is always double-quoted in the output. That makes the emit safe for YAML edge cases like `restart: no` (bare `no` would otherwise parse as a boolean) without burdening the caller with quoting rules."
msgstr "Thamani ni mara mbili ya thamani ya bidhaa. Hii inafanya kuwa salama kwa kesi za makali ya YAML kama `restart: no` (Licha ya `no` Vinginevyo itakuwa kama boolean) bila ya kumwajibisha mtu kwa kufuata sheria."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The value must mirror how the backed-up group is keyed. `all` treats every matched run as one instance — correct for `global-ci-<repo>-<ref_name>`, which spans both `entry-push-latest.yml` and `entry-manual-steer.yml`, so a push must be able to reap a manual sweep. `event` keeps one instance per event name — correct for `pr-ci-<repo>-<event_name>-pr-<number>`. Grouping any finer than the real key spares a run the group would have reaped: per-workflow grouping leaves the manual sweep alive, because it is the newest run of its own workflow."
msgstr "Thamani lazima ionyeshe jinsi kikundi cha msaada kinavyowekwa. `all` Kushughulikia kila mechi inayochezwa kama tukio moja - sahihi kwa `global-ci-<repo>-<ref_name>`, ambayo yanaunganisha pande zote mbili `entry-push-latest.yml` Aidha, na `entry-manual-steer.yml`, Kwa hivyo, kushinikiza lazima iweze kupata sweep ya mwongozo. `event` Chagua jina moja kwa kila tukio - sahihi `pr-ci-<repo>-<event_name>-pr-<number>`.Kukusanya faini yoyote kuliko vipuri muhimu vya kuendesha kikundi hicho ingekuwa imevuna: kikundi cha mtiririko wa kazi kinaacha kufagia mwongozo hai, kwa sababu ni kukimbia mpya zaidi ya kazi yake mwenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The value name, or None when no allowed value cleared *minimum*. None is a real answer: the measurement cannot carry a pin, and the caller leaves that axis to the rotation instead of guessing it."
msgstr "Jina la thamani, au hakuna wakati hakuna thamani iliyoruhusiwa *Kiwango cha chini cha chini*Hakuna jibu halisi: kipimo hakiwezi kubeba pin, na mpiga simu huacha mhimili huo kwenye mzunguko badala ya kuikisia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The values one axis may draw from this run."
msgstr "Thamani ya mhimili mmoja inaweza kutoka kwenye mzunguko huu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The variant of *app* that carries the replay, and the mode it runs in."
msgstr "Tofauti ya *App ya app* Hii ni njia ya kurudi, na ni njia ya kuingia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The variant only affects inventory generation; the Ansible deploy itself reads `applications.<app>` overrides from the variant-resolved inventory and MUST NOT consult variant data at runtime."
msgstr "Tofauti huathiri tu kizazi cha hesabu; matumizi ya Ansible yenyewe inasoma `applications.<app>` Overrides kutoka hesabu lahaja-resolved na LAZIMA si kushauriana data lahaja wakati wa kukimbia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The variant override is baked as a real boolean into the inventory, so the shared-service auto-include picks it up at build time. Variant 0 therefore pulls `web-app-discourse` into the include set. Variant 1 does not."
msgstr "Aina ya override imeoka kama boolean halisi katika hesabu, kwa hivyo auto-huduma ya pamoja inajumuisha inachukua wakati wa kujenga. Tofauti ya 0 Kwa hiyo, `web-app-discourse` Ndani ya utaratibu. Tofauti ya 1 Sivyo hivyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The variant that enables the fewest services, as the matrix writes it; the lowest index wins a tie, and ``''`` means none qualifies."
msgstr "Tofauti ambayo inawezesha huduma chache zaidi, kama matrix anaandika; index ya chini inashinda tie, na ``''`` Hakuna maana ya kuwa na sifa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The verb folder name expresses the deploy intent. The script name expresses the scope."
msgstr "Jina la folda ya kitenzi linaonyesha kusudi la kupeleka. Jina la script linaelezea upeo."

