msgstr "Kamati hiyo imetambuliwa na ``domains.canonical`` muhimu ambayo inamiliki uwanja huo, ambayo ni muhimu ``server.status_codes`` matumizi. Kikoa ambacho sio cha kanoni, au ufunguo ambao hautangaza chochote, kinarudi kwa kutangazwa ``default``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The vocabulary a package plan is written in."
msgstr "Kwa maneno mengine, mpango wa mfuko unaandikwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The volume repo contributes a database step after its file steps: the dumps have to land once the volumes are back and while the consumers are still down, which is where the caller has them."
msgstr "Repo ya kiasi huchangia hatua ya database baada ya hatua zake za faili: dumps zinapaswa kutua mara baada ya kiasi ni nyuma na wakati watumiaji bado ni chini, ambayo ni ambapo simu ina yao."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The warning MUST name the role, the addon id, and the failing step so the operator can act without reading raw task output."
msgstr "Onyo LA LA LAZIMA kutaja jukumu, kitambulisho cha kuongeza, na hatua ya kushindwa ili mwendeshaji anaweza kutenda bila kusoma pato la kazi ghafi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The wget half stays proxy-aware on purpose: busybox wget rejects ``--proxy=off``, and this flavor exists for images where which tool ships is unknown, so hardening it there would break the very case it covers."
msgstr "Nusu ya wget inakaa wakala-kujua kwa madhumuni: busybox wget inakataa ``--proxy=off``, na ladha hii ipo kwa ajili ya picha ambapo meli chombo haijulikani, hivyo kufanya hivyo kuna kuvunja kesi hiyo inashughulikia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The wildcard in the namespace slot collapses 21 mutating verbs across `gh issue/pr/release/repo/ruleset/run/cache/gist/label/project/…` into a single rule per verb. Future namespaces that ship the same verb (e.g. a hypothetical `gh discussion lock`) are caught automatically. Explicit per-namespace lists rot as the `gh` CLI grows."
msgstr "Wildcard katika nafasi ya jina huanguka 21 Kubadilisha vitenzi kwa njia zote `gh issue/pr/release/repo/ruleset/run/cache/gist/label/project/…` Kwa mujibu wa Kanuni ya Maadili. Majina ya baadaye ambayo meli kitenzi sawa (Kwa mfano, dhana ya `gh discussion lock`) zinatolewa moja kwa moja. Orodha ya majina ya maeneo ya wazi kama `gh` ya kukua."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The window's start is the floor: with nothing green behind it the answer is the start itself, never the head. Walking back to the head is what made every retrigger redeploy the whole stretch its predecessors had already proven."
msgstr "Mwanzo wa dirisha ni sakafu: bila chochote kijani nyuma yake jibu ni mwanzo yenyewe, kamwe kichwa. Kutembea nyuma ya kichwa ni nini alifanya kila retrigger redeploy nzima kunyoosha watangulizi wake alikuwa tayari kuthibitika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
