# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The workaround used here is the **GitLab OAuth2 provider** (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*`), which is generic enough to work with any OIDC-compatible identity provider including Keycloak. This provides true SSO: user accounts are automatically created in Mattermost on first login."
msgstr "Kazi iliyoainishwa hapa ni **GitLab Ottumwa2 Mtoa huduma** (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*`), ambayo ni ya kawaida ya kutosha kufanya kazi na mtoa huduma yeyote wa utambulisho wa OIDC ikiwa ni pamoja na KeycloakHii hutoa SSO ya kweli: akaunti za watumiaji zinaundwa moja kwa moja Mattermost Ingia kwanza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The workaround used here is the **GitLab OAuth2 provider** (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*``), which is generic enough to work with any OIDC-compatible identity provider including Keycloak. This provides true SSO: user accounts are automatically created in Mattermost on first login."
msgstr "Kazi iliyoainishwa hapa ni **GitLab Ottumwa2 Mtoa huduma** (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*``), ambayo ni ya kawaida ya kutosha kufanya kazi na mtoa huduma yeyote wa utambulisho wa OIDC ikiwa ni pamoja na KeycloakHii hutoa SSO ya kweli: akaunti za watumiaji zinaundwa moja kwa moja Mattermost Ingia kwanza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The workflow-driven jobs additionally require the `BOT_APP_CLIENT_ID` and `BOT_APP_PRIVATE_KEY` repository secrets, see [secrets.md](secrets.md). Without those secrets, runs fail at the token-minting step and no PR is opened."
msgstr "Kazi za kazi zinazoendeshwa na kazi pia zinahitaji `BOT_APP_CLIENT_ID` Aidha, na `BOT_APP_PRIVATE_KEY` Maelezo ya ziada, angalia [secrets.md](secrets.md). Bila siri hizo, anaendesha kushindwa katika ishara-minting hatua na hakuna PR ni kufunguliwa."

