# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "There is consequently no auth chain for the persona helpers to drive and no admin surface to assert against. The opt-out is permanent, not a rollout gap."
msgstr "Kwa hiyo hakuna mlolongo wa auth kwa wasaidizi wa mtu kuendesha gari na hakuna sura ya admin kudai dhidi. Chaguo la kujiondoa ni la kudumu, sio pengo la rollout."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "There is no standalone `make` target for Playwright. Tests run as part of local deploy flows (e.g. `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=web-app-matomo full_cycle=true`). For spec-only iteration after the first successful deploy, see [Playwright Spec Loop](../../../agents/action/iteration/playwright.md)."
msgstr "Hakuna usajili `make` Malengo ya Playwright. Majaribio yanaendeshwa kama sehemu ya mtiririko wa kupeleka ndani (ya g. `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=web-app-matomo full_cycle=true`). Kwa ajili ya iteration spec-tu baada ya kupeleka mafanikio ya kwanza, kuona [Maelezo ya mchezo Spec Loop](../../../agents/action/iteration/playwright.md)..."

