msgstr "Hizi ni kushindwa kupelekwa-orchestration, si kushindwa playwright-parity, na hivyo walicheleweshwa kwa kifungu cha kutoroka uhuru (Req ya req 019)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These are desktop GNOME Shell extensions with no in-app web surface to drive, so they are exempt from the Playwright requirement (requirement 026, Decision 11)."
