# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These operations pause and require explicit operator approval before executing, even when sandboxed."
msgstr "Shughuli hizi pause na zinahitaji wazi operator kibali kabla ya kutekeleza, hata wakati sandboxed."

# translated-by: libretranslate
