# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role configures NGINX to perform 301 redirects from one domain to another. It handles SSL certificate retrieval for the source domains and sets up the NGINX configuration to redirect to the specified target domains."
msgstr "Kazi hii ya ajabu inasanidi NGINX kufanya 301 Badilisha kutoka kwa kikoa kimoja hadi kingine. Inashughulikia usajili wa cheti cha SSL kwa vikoa vya chanzo na inaweka usanidi wa NGINX kuelekeza tena kwenye vikoa maalum vya lengo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role configures the OpenSSH daemon (``sshd``) by deploying a templated ``sshd_config`` file. It applies secure, best-practice settings to harden remote access and reduce the risk of misconfiguration or lockout. Settings include disabling root login, enforcing public-key authentication, and setting appropriate logging levels."
msgstr "Makala hii inahusu OpenSSH daemon (``sshd``) Kwa kutumia template ``sshd_config`` ya faili. Inatumika mipangilio salama, bora ya mazoezi ya ugumu wa upatikanaji wa kijijini na kupunguza hatari ya kusanidi vibaya au kufunga. Mipangilio ni pamoja na kuzuia kuingia kwa mizizi, kutekeleza uthibitishaji wa ufunguo wa umma, na kuweka viwango sahihi vya magogo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role configures the OpenSSH daemon (`sshd`) by deploying a templated `sshd_config` file. It applies secure, best-practice settings to harden remote access and reduce the risk of misconfiguration or lockout. Settings include disabling root login, enforcing public-key authentication, and setting appropriate logging levels."
msgstr "Makala hii inahusu OpenSSH daemon (`sshd`) Kwa kutumia template `sshd_config` ya faili. Inatumika mipangilio salama, bora ya mazoezi ya ugumu wa upatikanaji wa kijijini na kupunguza hatari ya kusanidi vibaya au kufunga. Mipangilio ni pamoja na kuzuia kuingia kwa mizizi, kutekeleza uthibitishaji wa ufunguo wa umma, na kuweka viwango sahihi vya magogo."

