# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys [BigBlueButton](https://bigbluebutton.org/) using Docker Compose. It includes support for Greenlight, OIDC, LDAP, TURN/STUN, health checks, and a modular `.env` setup. This role is ideal for educational institutions and teams requiring a self-hosted video conferencing solution."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linajumuisha [BigBlueButton](https://bigbluebutton.org/) Matumizi ya kutumia Docker ComposeInajumuisha msaada wa Greenlight, OIDC, LDAP, TURN / STUN, hundi za afya, na modular `.env` ya kuanzishwa. Jukumu hili ni bora kwa taasisi za elimu na timu zinazohitaji ufumbuzi wa mkutano wa video wa kujitegemea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys [PhpMyAdmin](https://www.phpmyadmin.net/) in a secure Docker environment, complete with optional OAuth2 proxy support. It enables seamless management of MariaDB/MySQL databases via a web-app-based interface."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linajumuisha [PhpMyAdmin](https://www.phpmyadmin.net/) Katika mazingira salama ya Docker, kamili na OAuth ya hiari2 Msaada wa proxy. Huwezesha usimamizi usio na mipaka MariaDBDatabases za MySQL kupitia interface ya mtandao-programu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys `BigBlueButton <https://bigbluebutton.org/>`__ using Docker Compose. It includes support for Greenlight, OIDC, LDAP, TURN/STUN, health checks, and a modular ``.env`` setup. This role is ideal for educational institutions and teams requiring a self-hosted video conferencing solution. > 🔧 **Note**: The database layer should be decoupled in a future release to improve modularity and integration. >"
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linajumuisha `BigBlueButton <https://bigbluebutton.org/>`__ Matumizi ya kutumia Docker ComposeInajumuisha msaada wa Greenlight, OIDC, LDAP, TURN / STUN, hundi za afya, na modular ``.env`` ya kuanzishwa. Jukumu hili ni bora kwa taasisi za elimu na timu zinazohitaji ufumbuzi wa mkutano wa video wa kujitegemea. 🔧 **Taarifa ya**: safu ya database inapaswa kupunguzwa katika kutolewa baadaye ili kuboresha modularity na ushirikiano."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys `PhpMyAdmin <https://www.phpmyadmin.net/>`__ in a secure Docker environment, complete with optional OAuth2 proxy support. It enables seamless management of MariaDB/MySQL databases via a web-app-based interface."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linajumuisha `PhpMyAdmin <https://www.phpmyadmin.net/>`__ Katika mazingira salama ya Docker, kamili na OAuth ya hiari2 Msaada wa proxy. Huwezesha usimamizi usio na mipaka MariaDBDatabases za MySQL kupitia interface ya mtandao-programu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys a central recursive/forwarding DNSSEC resolver (Unbound) in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It runs as a trivial single-service stack with a static IP on its own network, so consumer stacks can point their ``dns:`` at it instead of embedding their own resolver."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la Ansible linapeleka suluhisho la kati / la mbele la DNSSEC (Unbound) Ndani ya chombo cha Docker kwa kutumia Docker ComposeInaendesha kama stack ndogo ya huduma moja na IP ya tuli kwenye mtandao wake mwenyewe, hivyo stacks za watumiaji zinaweza kuonyesha yao. ``dns:`` Badala yake, badala ya kujiwasilisha wenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys a central recursive/forwarding DNSSEC resolver (Unbound) in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It runs as a trivial single-service stack with a static IP on its own network, so consumer stacks can point their `dns:` at it instead of embedding their own resolver."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la Ansible linapeleka suluhisho la kati / la mbele la DNSSEC (Unbound) Ndani ya chombo cha Docker kwa kutumia Docker ComposeInaendesha kama stack ndogo ya huduma moja na IP ya tuli kwenye mtandao wake mwenyewe, hivyo stacks za watumiaji zinaweza kuonyesha yao. `dns:` Badala yake, badala ya kujiwasilisha wenyewe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a PostgreSQL database in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed to simplify database administration by automating the creation of networks, containers, and essential database tasks (such as database and user creation) for a secure and high-performance environment."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la kipekee linaweka na kuunda a PostgreSQL Database katika chombo cha Docker kwa kutumia Docker ComposeImeundwa ili kurahisisha utawala wa database kwa kuunda uumbaji wa mitandao, vyombo, na kazi muhimu za database. (kama vile database na uumbaji wa mtumiaji) mazingira salama na ya uhakika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a Qdrant vector database in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It runs Qdrant as a central, pinned engine that many application roles share over the cross-stack network, keeping the consumer roles stateless and NFS-shareable in swarm."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la kipekee linaweka na kuunda a Qdrant Database ya vector katika chombo cha Docker kwa kutumia Docker ComposeInaendelea Qdrant Kama injini ya kati, iliyopigwa ambayo majukumu mengi ya maombi yanashiriki juu ya mtandao wa msalaba, kuweka majukumu ya watumiaji wasio na utaifa na NFS inayoweza kushiriki katika makundi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a central Elasticsearch search engine in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed to simplify search administration by automating the creation of networks, containers, and per-consumer index namespaces (a role and user scoped to `<entity>-*` indices) for a secure and high-performance environment."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linaweka na kusanidi katikati Elasticsearch Injini ya utafutaji katika chombo cha Docker kutumia Docker ComposeImeundwa ili kurahisisha usimamizi wa utafutaji kwa automating uumbaji wa mitandao, vyombo, na kwa watumiaji index namespaces. (kwa mtumiaji na mtumiaji aliyesajiliwa kwa `<entity>-*` Ushahidi) mazingira salama na ya uhakika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a central Elasticsearch search engine in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed to simplify search administration by automating the creation of networks, containers, and per-consumer index namespaces (a role and user scoped to ``<entity>-*`` indices) for a secure and high-performance environment."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linaweka na kusanidi katikati Elasticsearch Injini ya utafutaji katika chombo cha Docker kutumia Docker ComposeImeundwa ili kurahisisha usimamizi wa utafutaji kwa automating uumbaji wa mitandao, vyombo, na kwa watumiaji index namespaces. (kwa mtumiaji na mtumiaji aliyesajiliwa kwa ``<entity>-*`` Ushahidi) mazingira salama na ya uhakika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a central Typesense search engine in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed as a central engine: many application roles share one pinned Typesense stack instead of each embedding its own sidecar, keeping the application roles stateless, unpinned and NFS-shareable in swarm."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linaweka na kusanidi katikati Typesense Injini ya utafutaji katika chombo cha Docker kutumia Docker ComposeImeundwa kama injini kuu: majukumu mengi ya maombi yanashiriki moja pinned Typesense stack badala ya kila embedding sidecar yake mwenyewe, kuweka majukumu ya maombi stateless, unpinned na NFS-pamoja katika kundi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and manages a containerized [Simple Icons](https://simpleicons.org/) server, providing easy access to over 2,000 SVG and PNG icons for use in web projects, documentation, and branding."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linaweka na kusimamia chombo [Simple Icons](https://simpleicons.org/) server, kutoa upatikanaji rahisi juu ya 2,000 SVG na PNG icons kwa ajili ya matumizi katika miradi ya mtandao, nyaraka, na branding."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and manages a containerized `Simple Icons <https://simpleicons.org/>`__ server, providing easy access to over 2,000 SVG and PNG icons for use in web projects, documentation, and branding."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linaweka na kusimamia chombo `Simple Icons <https://simpleicons.org/>`__ server, kutoa upatikanaji rahisi juu ya 2,000 SVG na PNG icons kwa ajili ya matumizi katika miradi ya mtandao, nyaraka, na branding."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys the ONLYOFFICE Document Server in Docker to provide real-time, in-browser editing for documents, spreadsheets, and presentations. It automates the setup of the Document Server container, NGINX reverse proxy configuration, network isolation via Docker networks, and environment variable management for secure integration with Nextcloud or other WOPI-compatible platforms."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la Ansible linapeleka Server ya Hati ya ONLYOFFICE huko Docker kutoa muda halisi, uhariri wa wakati wa barua kwa nyaraka, spreadsheets, na mawasilisho. Inaendesha usanidi wa chombo cha Hati ya Server, usanidi wa wakala wa NGINX reverse, kutengwa kwa mtandao kupitia mitandao ya Docker, na usimamizi wa mazingira wa kutofautiana kwa ushirikiano salama na Nextcloud au majukwaa mengine yanayoingiliana ya WOPI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
