# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that [.profile](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts) is sourced in both [Bash](https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/) and [Zsh](https://www.zsh.org/) environments. It enables consistent environment variable loading across different login shells by linking shell-specific profile files (`.bash_profile`, `.zprofile`) to a centralized `.profile`."
msgstr "Jukumu hili muhimu linahakikisha kwamba [Taarifa ya](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts) Chanzo cha yote mawili [Bashungwa](https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/) Aidha, na [ya ya](https://www.zsh.org/) mazingira. Inawezesha upakiaji wa mazingira ya kutofautiana katika shell tofauti za kuingia kwa kuunganisha faili za wasifu maalum za shell (`.bash_profile`, Kwa hivyo, `.zprofile`) Kuwa centralized `.profile`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that `.profile <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts>`__ is sourced in both `Bash <https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/>`__ and `Zsh <https://www.zsh.org/>`__ environments. It enables consistent environment variable loading across different login shells by linking shell-specific profile files (``.bash_profile``, ``.zprofile``) to a centralized ``.profile``."
msgstr "Jukumu hili muhimu linahakikisha kwamba `.profile <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts>`__ Chanzo cha yote mawili `Bash <https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/>`__ Aidha, na `Zsh <https://www.zsh.org/>`__ mazingira. Inawezesha upakiaji wa mazingira ya kutofautiana katika shell tofauti za kuingia kwa kuunganisha faili za wasifu maalum za shell (``.bash_profile``, Kwa hivyo, ``.zprofile``) Kuwa centralized ``.profile``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that the target host’s system hostname is set to the inventory hostname."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la Ansible linahakikisha kuwa jina la mwenyeji wa mfumo wa mwenyeji wa lengo linawekwa kwa jina la kumbukumbu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures the ``doli`` (dotlinker) CLI is installed (via ``pkgmgr``) and applies dotlinker mappings provided by the calling role."
msgstr "Jukumu hili muhimu linahakikisha kuwa ``doli`` (ya dotlinker) CLI imewekwa (Kwa kupitia ``pkgmgr``) Tumia ramani za dotlinker zinazotolewa na jukumu la wito."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures the `doli` (dotlinker) CLI is installed (via `pkgmgr`) and applies dotlinker mappings provided by the calling role."
