# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role extracts the project version from the local ``pyproject.toml`` (using ``playbook_dir``) and writes it as a system-wide environment variable into ``/etc/environment`` on the managed host."
msgstr "Sehemu hii ya ajabu inaondoa toleo la mradi kutoka kwa eneo ``pyproject.toml`` (Matumizi ya kutumia ``playbook_dir``) na kufanya hivyo kama mfumo wa mazingira unaobadilika ``/etc/environment`` kwa niaba ya Mkurugenzi Mtendaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role extracts the project version from the local `pyproject.toml` (using `playbook_dir`) and writes it as a system-wide environment variable into `/etc/environment` on the managed host."
msgstr "Sehemu hii ya ajabu inaondoa toleo la mradi kutoka kwa eneo `pyproject.toml` (Matumizi ya kutumia `playbook_dir`) na kufanya hivyo kama mfumo wa mazingira unaobadilika `/etc/environment` kwa niaba ya Mkurugenzi Mtendaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role facilitates the deployment of a MariaDB server using Docker. It is designed to ensure ease of installation and configuration, with the flexibility to adapt to different environments."
msgstr "Hatua hii inarahisisha utekelezaji wa MariaDB Mtumiaji wa Docker. Imeundwa ili kuhakikisha urahisi wa ufungaji na usanidi, na kubadilika kwa kukabiliana na mazingira tofauti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role guarantees that a target resolves the `*.localhost` names it serves, without going through DNS."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linahakikisha kuwa lengo linatatua `*.localhost` Jina hili hutumika bila kupitia DNS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role guarantees that a target resolves the ``*.localhost`` names it serves, without going through DNS."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linahakikisha kuwa lengo linatatua ``*.localhost`` Jina hili hutumika bila kupitia DNS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects a custom JavaScript snippet into all HTML responses served by NGINX. It leverages NGINX’s ``sub_filter`` to seamlessly insert your application-specific script just before the closing ``</head>`` tag, ensuring that your code runs on every page load, which is useful for global feature flags, analytics, or UI enhancements."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaloonekana linaingiza snippet ya desturi ya JavaScript katika majibu yote ya HTML yanayotumiwa na NGINX. Inaongeza kasi ya NGINX ``sub_filter`` Ili kuingiza script yako maalum ya maombi kabla ya kufunga ``</head>`` tag, kuhakikisha kwamba msimbo wako anaendesha juu ya kila ukurasa mzigo, ambayo ni muhimu kwa bendera ya kimataifa kipengele, analytics, au UI nyongeza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects a custom JavaScript snippet into all HTML responses served by NGINX. It leverages NGINX’s `sub_filter` to seamlessly insert your application-specific script just before the closing `</head>` tag, ensuring that your code runs on every page load, which is useful for global feature flags, analytics, or UI enhancements."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaloonekana linaingiza snippet ya desturi ya JavaScript katika majibu yote ya HTML yanayotumiwa na NGINX. Inaongeza kasi ya NGINX `sub_filter` Ili kuingiza script yako maalum ya maombi kabla ya kufunga `</head>` tag, kuhakikisha kwamba msimbo wako anaendesha juu ya kila ukurasa mzigo, ambayo ni muhimu kwa bendera ya kimataifa kipengele, analytics, au UI nyongeza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects a small JavaScript snippet into your HTML responses that enables parent pages to get notified whenever the iframe’s location changes and forces external links to open in a new tab."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la Ansible linaingiza snippet ndogo ya JavaScript katika majibu yako ya HTML ambayo inawezesha kurasa za mzazi kupata taarifa wakati wowote mabadiliko ya eneo la iframe na huwezesha viungo vya nje kufungua katika tab mpya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs **fakeroot** for the current Linux distribution. Fakeroot enables non-privileged users to simulate root-level file manipulations, making it ideal for building packages or performing file operations that normally require root permissions."
msgstr "Kazi hii ya ajabu inatekelezwa **bandia** kwa ajili ya usambazaji wa Linux. Fakeroot inawezesha watumiaji wasio na sifa kuiga uharibifu wa faili ya ngazi ya mizizi, na kuifanya kuwa bora kwa ajili ya kujenga vifurushi au kufanya shughuli za faili ambazo kwa kawaida zinahitaji ruhusa za mizizi."

