# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs npm and optionally runs ``npm ci`` within a given project directory. It is intended to streamline dependency installation for Node.js applications."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la Ansible linaweka npm na anaendesha kwa hiari ``npm ci`` Ndani ya mfumo wa usimamizi wa mradi. Lengo ni kuboresha miundombinu ya umwagiliaji kwa ajili ya Node.js maombi."

