# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a **robust, reusable Git pull utility** for system automation. It performs shallow clones or updates of Git repositories and optionally **pins the working tree to a specific tag** (e.g. `stable`) in a detached HEAD state."
msgstr "Kazi hii ya ajabu inatoa **Kuwa na nguvu, reusable Git Matumizi ya** Mfumo wa automatisering. Inafanya clones ya kina au updates ya Git Ukusanyaji na chaguzi **Weka mti wa kazi kwa tag maalum** (ya g. `stable`) katika hali mbaya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a **robust, reusable Git pull utility** for system automation. It performs shallow clones or updates of Git repositories and optionally **pins the working tree to a specific tag** (e.g. ``stable``) in a detached HEAD state."
msgstr "Kazi hii ya ajabu inatoa **Kuwa na nguvu, reusable Git Matumizi ya** Mfumo wa automatisering. Inafanya clones ya kina au updates ya Git Ukusanyaji na chaguzi **Weka mti wa kazi kwa tag maalum** (ya g.``stable``) katika hali mbaya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a central RabbitMQ message broker that many roles share. It runs the broker inside a Docker container and isolates each consumer with its own virtual host and user, making it suitable for production or local development."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linaweka msingi wa RabbitMQ Broker ujumbe kwamba majukumu mengi kushiriki. Inaendesha broker ndani ya chombo cha Docker na huharibu kila mtumiaji na mwenyeji wake mwenyewe wa kawaida na mtumiaji, na kuifanya iwe sahihi kwa uzalishaji au maendeleo ya ndani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a generic, reusable Playwright end-to-end (E2E) test runner for the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la Ansible hutoa mwisho wa Playwright wa mwisho-kwa-mwisho (ya ya ya2ya ya ya) Mtihani kwa ajili ya Infinito.Nexus mazingira."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provisions a centralized database system in your Docker Compose environment. It supports both MariaDB and PostgreSQL, providing a robust, scalable, and low-maintenance database solution. Whether you're consolidating your application's data or creating a dedicated central storage, this role simplifies setup and integration."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la kushangaza linaweka mfumo wa database wa kati katika mfumo wako Docker Compose mazingira. Wote wawili wanaunga mkono MariaDB Aidha, na PostgreSQL, kutoa ufumbuzi imara, scalable, na chini ya makao database ufumbuzi. Ikiwa unaboresha data ya programu yako au kuunda hifadhi ya kati ya kujitolea, jukumu hili linaongeza usanidi na ushirikiano."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provisions a centralized database system in your Docker Compose environment. It supports both MariaDB and PostgreSQL, providing a robust, scalable, and low-maintenance database solution. Whether you’re consolidating your application’s data or creating a dedicated central storage, this role simplifies setup and integration."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la kushangaza linaweka mfumo wa database wa kati katika mfumo wako Docker Compose mazingira. Wote wawili wanaunga mkono MariaDB Aidha, na PostgreSQL, kutoa ufumbuzi imara, scalable, na chini ya makao database ufumbuzi. Ikiwa unaunganisha data ya programu yako au kuunda hifadhi ya kati ya kujitolea, jukumu hili linaongeza usanidi na ushirikiano."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role removes NGINX configuration files and revokes and deletes Certbot certificates for domains marked as deprecated."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweza kuondoa faili za usanidi wa NGINX na kufuta na kufuta Certbot Vyeti vya domains alama kama deprecated."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role runs Memcached as a central engine dependency, mirroring the central-database pattern (``svc-db-postgres``). A consumer reaches it either embedded (a sidecar inside its own stack, ``shared: false``) or from this central pinned stack (``shared: true``)."
msgstr "Kazi hii ya ajabu inatekelezwa Memcached Kama utegemezi wa injini ya kati, kuzingatia muundo wa msingi wa data (``svc-db-postgres``). Mtumiaji anafikia au anafikia (ndani ya mwili wake, ``shared: false``) Au kutoka kwa safu hii ya msingi (``shared: true``)..."

