# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Docker deployment uses Ansible automation to set up Snipe‑IT along with necessary services such as a MariaDB database, an optional OAuth2 proxy for additional security, and a reverse proxy configuration. The system is built for reliable asset management in various environments."
msgstr "Operesheni hii ya Docker inatumia automatisering ya Ansible kuanzisha Snipe‑IT pamoja na huduma muhimu kama vile MariaDB database, OAuth ya hiari2 Wakala wa usalama wa ziada, na usanidi wa wakala wa reverse. Mfumo huu umeundwa kwa usimamizi wa mali ya kuaminika katika mazingira mbalimbali."

