# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This automated Docker Compose deployment streamlines the process by building a custom WordPress image (which includes tools like msmtp for email delivery) and configuring the necessary PHP settings, ensuring that your WordPress site is secure, scalable, and always up to date."
msgstr "Hii ni moja kwa moja Docker Compose Utekelezaji wa mradi huo kwa kujenga miundombinu ya WordPress Picha ya picha (ambayo inajumuisha zana kama msmtp kwa utoaji wa barua pepe) Kusimamia mipangilio ya PHP muhimu, kuhakikisha kwamba WordPress Tovuti ni salama, scalable, na daima hadi sasa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This avoids ABI and SONAME mismatches on rolling or less frequently rebuilt distributions."
msgstr "Hii inaepuka ABI na SONAME mismatches juu ya rolling au chini ya mara kwa mara upya usambazaji."

