# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This containerized YOURLS solution is built on robust Docker Compose and Ansible automation. It simplifies the deployment process by integrating with centralized MariaDB management and providing pre‑configured health checks and environment settings. Whether you're looking to quickly generate memorable links or need detailed analytics, this deployment supports your digital strategy seamlessly."
msgstr "Mashine hii ya YOURLS Suluhisho limetengenezwa kwa nguvu Docker Compose automatisering ya moja kwa moja. Inarahisisha mchakato wa kupelekwa kwa kuunganisha na centralized MariaDB Usimamizi na kutoa ukaguzi wa afya ulioandaliwa kabla na mazingira ya mazingira. Kama wewe ni kuangalia kwa haraka kuzalisha viungo kukumbukwa au haja ya uchambuzi wa kina, kupelekwa hii inasaidia mkakati wako digital seamlessly."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This containerized YOURLS solution is built on robust Docker Compose and Ansible automation. It simplifies the deployment process by integrating with centralized MariaDB management and providing pre‑configured health checks and environment settings. Whether you’re looking to quickly generate memorable links or need detailed analytics, this deployment supports your digital strategy seamlessly."
msgstr "Mashine hii ya YOURLS Suluhisho limetengenezwa kwa nguvu Docker Compose automatisering ya moja kwa moja. Inarahisisha mchakato wa kupelekwa kwa kuunganisha na centralized MariaDB Usimamizi na kutoa ukaguzi wa afya ulioandaliwa kabla na mazingira ya mazingira. Kama wewe ni kuangalia kwa haraka kuzalisha viungo kukumbukwa au haja ya uchambuzi wa kina, kupelekwa hii inasaidia mkakati wako digital seamlessly."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This decision is **load-bearing**: openresty owns the `sys-front-inj-*` Lua body-rewriting pipeline (CSP-meta stripping, Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout snippet injection). Migrating to Traefik in v1 would silently drop that pipeline — it has no equivalent in Traefik without a non-trivial Yaegi-plugin port. Traefik migration is tracked as a Future Extension once edge-HA becomes worth the porting effort."
msgstr "Uamuzi huu ni **Uwasilishaji**: the the `sys-front-inj-*` Mradi wa ujenzi wa bomba la mafuta (CSP-meta ya kuondoa, Matomo CSS / JavaScript / JavaScript Dashboard Uingizaji wa Snippet). Kuingia kwa Traefik katika V1 Ingekuwa kimya kuacha bomba hilo - haina sawa katika Traefik bila bandari ya Yaegi-plugin. Uhamiaji wa Traefik unafuatiliwa kama Upanuzi wa Baadaye mara moja makali-HA inakuwa na thamani ya jitihada za bandari."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This declares two variants. Variant 0 pins every dynamic service-key from `meta/services.yml` to `enabled: true, shared: true` so the maximum-footprint baseline is explicit. Variant 1 keeps the same dynamic flags on and additionally flips Multisite on against three canonical domains."
msgstr "Hii inaonyesha tofauti mbili. Tofauti ya 0 Kila aina ya huduma ya msingi kutoka `meta/services.yml` Kwa kuwa `enabled: true, shared: true` Msingi wa msingi wa msingi wa msingi ni wazi. Tofauti ya 1 Inaweka bendera sawa za nguvu juu na kuongeza flips Multisite dhidi ya vikoa vitatu vya kanoni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This deployment simplifies LDAP management by presenting a modern web interface that lets you search, modify, and manage directory entries easily. It supports integration with external LDAP servers and works seamlessly behind a reverse proxy, allowing administrators to focus on core directory tasks rather than deployment intricacies."
msgstr "Kupelekwa hii inarahisisha usimamizi wa LDAP kwa kuwasilisha interface ya kisasa ya wavuti ambayo inakuwezesha kutafuta, kurekebisha, na kusimamia viingilio vya saraka kwa urahisi. Inasaidia ushirikiano na seva za nje za LDAP na hufanya kazi bila kizuizi nyuma ya wakala wa nyuma, kuruhusu watendaji kuzingatia majukumu ya saraka ya msingi badala ya kuingia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST NOT host application logic that belongs to an Ansible role."
msgstr "Saraka hii haipaswi kuwa mwenyeji wa mantiki ya maombi ambayo ni ya jukumu la kudumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST NOT host host-side tooling. Scripts that run on the developer or CI host belong under their workflow-specific path (for example `scripts/tests/`, `scripts/image/`, `scripts/meta/`)."
msgstr "Orodha hii haipaswi kuwa mwenyeji wa chombo cha mwenyeji. Maandishi ambayo yanaendeshwa kwa msanidi programu au mwenyeji wa CI ni chini ya njia yao maalum ya kazi (Kwa mfano, kwa `scripts/tests/`, Kwa hivyo, `scripts/image/`, Kwa hivyo, `scripts/meta/`)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST contain only files consumed by the `coredns` compose service."
msgstr "Orodha hii lazima iwe na faili tu zinazotumiwa na `coredns` Huduma ya kutengeneza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST contain only scripts that execute inside the `infinito` container, either as the container entrypoint, as a Docker `HEALTHCHECK`, or as a `systemd` unit hook."
msgstr "Kitabu hiki lazima kiwe na maandiko tu yanayotekeleza ndani ya `infinito` chombo, ama kama chombo cha kuingia, kama Docker `HEALTHCHECK`, Kwa mfano, kama a `systemd` Muungano wa Tanganyika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains Ansible collection requirement files used by the installation logic."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina faili za mahitaji ya mkusanyiko unaotumiwa na mantiki ya ufungaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains Jinja2 templates for different NGINX `location` blocks, each designed to proxy and optimize different types of web traffic. These templates are used by the `sys-svc-proxy` role to modularize and standardize reverse proxy configuration across a wide variety of applications."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina jina la Jinja2 Templates kwa NGINX tofauti `location` vitalu, kila iliyoundwa kwa wakala na kuongeza aina tofauti za trafiki ya wavuti. Template hii hutumiwa na `sys-svc-proxy` jukumu la modularize na standardize reverse wakala Configuration katika mbalimbali ya maombi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains Pull Request-specific resolver scripts used by the PR workflow."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina Pull Maombi maalum ya kutatua scripts zinazotumiwa na kazi ya PR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains action-oriented runbooks for agent work. Its scope is how agents should develop, debug, test, refactor, commit, and handle pull requests while staying aligned with repository policy."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina vitabu vya uendeshaji vinavyoelekezwa kwa kazi ya wakala. Upeo wake ni jinsi mawakala wanapaswa kuendeleza, debug, mtihani, refactor, kufanya, na kushughulikia maombi ya kuvuta wakati wa kukaa sawa na sera ya kuhifadhi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains administrator-facing configuration references for Infinito.Nexus. Its scope is the global and per-application settings operators adjust through inventory, group vars, and application overrides."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una marejeleo ya usanidi wa msimamizi Infinito.Nexus. Upeo wake ni waendeshaji wa mazingira ya kimataifa na kwa kurudia kurekebisha kupitia hesabu, vars ya kikundi, na overrides ya maombi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains administrator-facing operational guides for Infinito.Nexus. Its scope is CLI installation, inventory creation, and deploy and redeploy flows for running environments."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una mwongozo wa uendeshaji wa uendeshaji unaoongozwa na msimamizi Infinito.Nexus. Upeo wake ni ufungaji wa CLI, uumbaji wa hesabu, na kupeleka na mtiririko wa redeploy kwa mazingira ya kuendesha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains agent guidance for `group_vars` files. Its scope is how automated changes should handle shared application inventory data, lookup overrides, and related variable definitions."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una mwongozo wa wakala `group_vars` nyaraka. Upeo wake ni jinsi mabadiliko ya automatiska yanapaswa kushughulikia data ya hesabu ya maombi ya pamoja, overrides ya kuangalia, na ufafanuzi wa kutofautiana kuhusiana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains agent guidance for role-local implementation files. Its scope is CSS, JavaScript, Playwright, and other role-specific files that require consistent behavior during automated edits."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina mwongozo wa wakala kwa faili za utekelezaji wa ndani. Upeo wake ni CSS, JavaScript, Playwright, na faili nyingine maalum za jukumu ambazo zinahitaji tabia thabiti wakati wa hariri za automatiska."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains all deployable bundles for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina vifurushi vyote vinavyoweza kutumika kwa Infinito.Nexus..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains automation scripts used across the project."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina scripts za automatisering zinazotumiwa katika mradi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for GitHub Container Registry usage. Its scope is authentication, cleanup, and other GHCR-specific operational concerns in the repository."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una mwongozo wa wachangiaji kwa matumizi ya Usajili wa GitHub Container. Upeo wake ni uthibitishaji, usafi, na wasiwasi mwingine wa uendeshaji maalum wa GHCR katika hifadhi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for GitHub governance and repository controls. Its scope is branch protection, repository settings, GitHub Actions workflows and variables, and other platform rules that affect contributions."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina mwongozo wa wachangiaji kwa utawala wa GitHub na udhibiti wa kuhifadhi. Upeo wake ni ulinzi wa tawi, mipangilio ya kuhifadhi, kazi za kazi za GitHub Actions na vigezo, na sheria nyingine za jukwaa zinazoathiri michango."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for Infinito.Nexus shared services. Its scope is the model that defines how shared services are declared, discovered, loaded, injected, and consumed, plus the per-service contracts that role authors and consumers MUST follow."
msgstr "Kamati hii inatoa mwongozo kwa Infinito.Nexus huduma za pamoja. Upeo wake ni mfano unaofafanua jinsi huduma za pamoja zinavyotangazwa, kugunduliwa, kubeba, kuingizwa, na kutumiwa, pamoja na mikataba ya huduma ya kila siku ambayo waandishi wa jukumu na watumiaji lazima kufuata."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for automated tests. Its scope is how lint, unit, integration, regression, and Playwright coverage should be structured, selected, and validated."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una mwongozo wa wachangiaji kwa majaribio ya automatiska. Upeo wake ni jinsi lint, kitengo, ushirikiano, regression, na chanjo ya Playwright inapaswa kuwa muundo, kuchaguliwa, na kuthibitishwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for code design and implementation. Its scope is architecture, service wiring, coding principles, exceptions, and the boundaries that shape maintainable changes."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una mwongozo wa wachangiaji wa kubuni na utekelezaji wa kanuni. Upeo wake ni usanifu, wiring huduma, kanuni coding, isipokuwa, na mipaka ambayo sura mabadiliko kudumisha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for container image artefacts. Its scope is how images are declared, discovered, mirrored, and maintained across the repository and CI flow."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina mwongozo wa wachangiaji wa picha za chombo. Mawanda yake ni jinsi picha zinavyotangazwa, kugunduliwa, kuonekana, na kuhifadhiwa katika hifadhi na mtiririko wa CI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for local environments. Its scope is setup, supported operating systems, variables, and resource constraints for running the project safely on a workstation."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una mwongozo wa wachangiaji kwa mazingira ya ndani. Upeo wake ni kuanzisha, mifumo ya uendeshaji wa mkono, vigezo, na vikwazo vya rasilimali kwa kuendesha mradi kwa usalama kwenye kituo cha kazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for project tools. Its scope is how repository-standard tools should be used, when they apply, and where they fit into the wider workflow."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una mwongozo wa wachangiaji kwa zana za mradi. Upeo wake ni jinsi zana za kawaida za kuhifadhi zinapaswa kutumika, wakati zinatumika, na ambapo zinafaa katika kazi pana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for team collaboration, communication, and organisational processes. Its scope is how contributors communicate, document their work, and apply agile principles across the project lifecycle."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina mwongozo wa wachangiaji kwa ushirikiano wa timu, mawasiliano, na michakato ya shirika. Upeo wake ni jinsi wachangiaji wanavyowasiliana, kuandika kazi yao, na kutumia kanuni za agile katika maisha ya mradi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for Ansible lookup plugins under [plugins/lookup/](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/). Its scope is how the project exposes merged configuration data to runtime consumers without materializing repository-wide facts."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina sheria za wachangiaji wa Plugins ya Ansible ya kuangalia chini [Plugins / maoni](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/). Upeo wake ni jinsi mradi unavyofunua data ya usanidi iliyounganishwa kwa watumiaji wa runtime bila kuingiza ukweli wa kuhifadhi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for Git-managed artefacts and CI/CD pipeline conventions. Its scope is how branches, commits, pull requests, the CI/CD pipeline, and the maintainer's fork-based remote layout MUST be structured and used in this repository."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una kanuni za wachangiaji GitMikataba ya ujenzi wa bomba la CI / CD. Upeo wake ni jinsi matawi, hufanya, kuvuta maombi, bomba la CI / CD, na mpangilio wa kijijini wa msingi wa mpangaji lazima iwe muundo na kutumika katika hazina hii."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for `README.md` files stored inside documentation directories. Its scope is purpose, scope, and navigation behavior for docs-scoped READMEs."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una kanuni za wachangiaji `README.md` Faili zilizohifadhiwa ndani ya nyaraka za nyaraka. Upeo wake ni kusudi, upeo, na tabia ya urambazaji kwa READMEs zilizo na docs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for files under [plugins/](../../../../../plugins/). Its scope is how Ansible plugin sources MUST be structured so that runtime consumers, tests, and documentation stay aligned."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina sheria za wachangiaji wa faili chini [Plugins / Plugins](../../../../../plugins/). Upeo wake ni jinsi vyanzo vya Plugin vinavyopatikana LAZIMA iwe muundo ili watumiaji wa runtime, vipimo, na nyaraka zibaki sawa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for project artefacts. Its scope is how repository-managed files and generated delivery artefacts should be documented, structured, and maintained."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina sheria za wachangiaji wa vifaa vya mradi. Upeo wake ni jinsi faili zilizosimamiwa na hazina na vifaa vya utoaji vilivyozalishwa vinapaswa kuwa kumbukumbu, muundo, na kuhifadhiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for role-local files. Its scope is how key artefacts inside roles should be written so generated behavior, documentation, and frontend overrides stay consistent."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina sheria za wachangiaji wa faili za sehemu. Upeo wake ni jinsi sanaa muhimu ndani ya majukumu inapaswa kuandikwa kwa hivyo tabia iliyozalishwa, nyaraka, na overrides ya mbele hukaa thabiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for specific repository file types. Its scope is authoring expectations for human-facing files whose structure and meaning must stay consistent across the project."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina sheria za wachangiaji kwa aina maalum za faili za kuhifadhi. Upeo wake ni kuandika matarajio kwa faili za kibinadamu ambazo muundo na maana lazima zibaki thabiti katika mradi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor workflow guidance. Its scope is branch strategy, commits, testing, local deploys, CI, review, pull requests, releases, and the end-to-end path from local change to merged contribution."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una mwongozo wa kazi ya wachangiaji. Upeo wake ni mkakati wa tawi, hufanya, kupima, kupeleka ndani, CI, ukaguzi, maombi ya kuvuta, releases, na njia ya mwisho hadi mwisho kutoka kwa mabadiliko ya ndani ili kuchangia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor-facing repository rules and workflows. Its scope is how humans and agents set up the environment, write documentation, communicate, define requirements, and contribute safely through the project lifecycle."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina sheria za uhifadhi wa wachangiaji na workflows. Mawanda yake ni jinsi wanadamu na mawakala wanavyoweka mazingira, kuandika nyaraka, kuwasiliana, kufafanua mahitaji, na kuchangia salama kupitia mzunguko wa maisha ya mradi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains custom **Ansible filter plugins** used within the Infinito.Nexus project."
msgstr "Kamati hii ina utaratibu wa **Plugins ya filter** kutumika ndani ya Infinito.Nexus mradi huo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains custom **Ansible lookup plugins** used within the Infinito.Nexus project."
msgstr "Kamati hii ina utaratibu wa **Plugins ya kuangalia** kutumika ndani ya Infinito.Nexus mradi huo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains debugging guidance for contributor workflows. Its scope is how to investigate failures in CI, networking, and related development loops."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una maelekezo ya kufuta kwa ajili ya kazi za wachangiaji. Upeo wake ni jinsi ya kuchunguza kushindwa katika CI, mitandao, na maendeleo yanayohusiana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains default variable definition files for the `svc-db-mariadb` Ansible role. It centralizes all configurable values related to MariaDB deployment and can be adjusted without modifying task logic."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina faili za ufafanuzi wa kutofautiana kwa default `svc-db-mariadb` nafasi ya ajabu. Inaunganisha maadili yote yanayohusiana na MariaDB Kupelekwa na inaweza kubadilishwa bila kubadilisha mantiki ya kazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains documentation for contributors working alongside AI coding agents in this project. It covers shared agent guidelines that apply regardless of the AI tool used, as well as tool-specific permission references and security rationale for each supported agent."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina nyaraka kwa wachangiaji wanaofanya kazi pamoja na mawakala wa coding wa AI katika mradi huu. Inashughulikia miongozo ya wakala wa pamoja ambayo inatumika bila kujali chombo cha AI kilichotumiwa, pamoja na marejeleo maalum ya ruhusa ya chombo na sababu ya usalama kwa kila wakala aliyesaidiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains file-scoped guidance for automated edits. Its scope is machine-readable rules that apply when an agent modifies specific repository file types or configuration areas."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina faili-scoped mwongozo kwa hariri automatiska. Upeo wake ni sheria za kusomwa kwa mashine ambazo zinatumika wakati wakala anarekebisha aina maalum za faili za kuhifadhi au maeneo ya usanidi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains gating helpers that decide whether a tagged commit is eligible for release. The current gate enforces that the version-tag commit is contained in `origin/main`, so version tags pushed from feature branches cannot trigger a release. Helpers MUST be invoked from release-related workflows only and MUST NOT be treated as a substitute for branch protection; the gate is an additional check on top of, not a replacement for, the repository's branch-protection rules."
msgstr "Directory hii ina gating wasaidizi kwamba kuamua kama ahadi tagged ni haki ya kutolewa. Mlango wa sasa unasisitiza kwamba ahadi ya toleo-tag iko katika `origin/main`, hivyo vitambulisho toleo kusukuma kutoka matawi kipengele haiwezi kusababisha kutolewa. Wasaidiaji lazima waombewe kutokana na kazi za kutolewa tu na LAZIMA isichukuliwe kama mbadala wa ulinzi wa tawi; lango ni hundi ya ziada juu ya, sio badala ya, sheria za ulinzi wa tawi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains generic wait and polling scripts used by workflow automation."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina maandishi ya kusubiri ya generic na kupiga kura inayotumiwa na automatisering ya kazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains helper scripts and binaries that are installed on the host to provide **container-related runtime functionality** for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina maandiko ya msaada na binaries ambayo imewekwa kwenye mwenyeji kutoa **Shughuli za uendeshaji zinazohusiana na chombo** Kwa ajili ya Infinito.Nexus..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains helpers invoked from workflows that listen on `pull_request_target`, `push`, and `delete`. The helpers call the GitHub Actions API to cancel runs made obsolete by a closed PR, a deleted branch, or a newer commit on the same PR or branch. Helpers MUST NOT be called from workflows that have not received one of those events, because cancelling unrelated runs would mask real failures and waste accumulated work."
msgstr "Idara hii ina wasaidizi wanaotakiwa kutoka kwa kazi zinazosikiliza `pull_request_target`, Kwa hivyo, `push`, Aidha, na `delete`. Watumiaji wa mtandao wa GitHub Actions API kufuta anaendesha kufanywa kizamani na PR imefungwa, tawi lililofutwa, au ahadi mpya kwenye PR sawa au tawi. Wasaidizi hawapaswi kuitwa kutoka kwa kazi ambazo hazijapokea moja ya matukio hayo, kwa sababu kufuta kukimbia kusikohusiana kunaweza kufunika kushindwa halisi na kazi ya taka iliyokusanywa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains helpers that mutate persistent on-host state during purge flows."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina wasaidizi wanaobadilisha hali ya mwenyeji wakati wa mtiririko wa kusafisha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains host-level helpers: disk-space reclamation and reporting, swap-file enlargement, Docker-daemon cleanup, and post-failure diagnostic dumps. Helpers MUST be invoked from workflow `run:` blocks under [`.github/workflows/`](../../../.github/workflows/) and MUST NOT be called from application code, Ansible roles, or any runtime path outside CI. They assume a GitHub-hosted Ubuntu runner and modify host-kernel state (mount points, swap, Docker storage) that does not exist inside the `infinito` container."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina wasaidizi wa ngazi ya mwenyeji: uwekaji wa nafasi ya disk na taarifa, upanuzi wa faili ya kubadilishana, kusafisha Docker-daemon, na dumps za uchunguzi baada ya kushindwa. Waombaji wanapaswa kuomba kwa ajili ya kazi `run:` Vituo vya chini [`.github/workflows/`](../../../.github/workflows/) Na haipaswi kuitwa kutoka kwa msimbo wa maombi, majukumu ya kudumu, au njia yoyote ya kukimbia nje ya CI. Wanachukua GitHub-hosted Ubuntu runner na kurekebisha hali ya mwenyeji (Mlima pointi, swap, Docker kuhifadhi) Hali hii haipo ndani ya `infinito` vyombo vya dola."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains language-specific coding guidance. Its scope is conventions that only apply to particular implementation languages when the general code rules need narrower detail."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una mwongozo maalum wa kuandika lugha. Upeo wake ni mikataba ambayo inatumika tu kwa lugha fulani za utekelezaji wakati sheria za kanuni za jumla zinahitaji maelezo mafupi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains machine-readable guidance for AI agents working in this repository. Its scope is agent behavior, required workflows, and specialized instruction files that extend [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for automated execution."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina mwongozo unaosoma mashine kwa mawakala wa AI wanaofanya kazi katika hazina hii. Upeo wake ni tabia ya wakala, kazi zinazohitajika, na faili maalum za maelekezo ambazo zinapanua [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) utekelezaji wa moja kwa moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains meta-level guidance for agent behavior. Its scope is purpose, ethics, help paths, communication style, and other repository-wide framing for automated contributors."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina mwongozo wa ngazi ya meta kwa tabia ya wakala. Upeo wake ni kusudi, maadili, njia za kusaidia, mtindo wa mawasiliano, na uundaji mwingine wa hazina kwa wachangiaji wa kiotomatiki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains operational documentation for the Nextcloud role in Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Idara hii ina nyaraka za kazi kwa ajili ya Nextcloud Wajibu katika Infinito.Nexus..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific environment setup guidance. Its scope is operating-system differences that affect local development and execution."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una mwongozo maalum wa mazingira ya jukwaa. Upeo wake ni tofauti za mfumo wa uendeshaji ambazo zinaathiri maendeleo ya ndani na utekelezaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific scripts for enabling systemd in environments where it is not active by default. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina script maalum ya jukwaa kwa kuwezesha mfumo katika mazingira ambapo haifanyi kazi kwa default. Kwa ajili ya index ya kufanya lengo kwamba wito wasaidizi hawa, kuona [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)..."

