# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains project requirements documents. Its scope is user stories and acceptance criteria that define what the project must do and that guide agent-assisted implementation."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina nyaraka za mahitaji ya mradi. Upeo wake ni hadithi za watumiaji na vigezo vya kukubalika vinavyoelezea mradi lazima ufanye na utekelezaji wa wakala wa kuongoza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains project-specific Ansible modules used by Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina moduli maalum za mradi zinazotumiwa na Infinito.Nexus..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains pure resolvers that read repository state (git history, role metadata, version tags, input environment variables) and emit resolved values either via `$GITHUB_OUTPUT` or stdout. Resolvers MUST be idempotent and MUST NOT mutate repository or registry state beyond writing to `$GITHUB_OUTPUT`. The covered concerns are diff-driven app whitelist resolution, the `🧩 Subset` label dispatch (`pr_affected_roles.sh`, which picks between the PR-body subset and the diff resolver), release-tag detection, app discovery for the deploy matrix, and change detection that gates the update pipeline."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina suluhisho safi ambazo zinasoma hali ya kuhifadhi (Historia ya git, metadata ya jukumu, vitambulisho vya toleo, mabadiliko ya mazingira ya pembejeo) kutoa fedha zilizotengwa kwa njia ya `$GITHUB_OUTPUT` au kwa hisani ya RaiaMwema Wasuluhishi lazima wawe na uwezo na hawapaswi kubadilisha uhifadhi au hali ya Usajili zaidi ya kuandika `$GITHUB_OUTPUT`Matatizo yaliyofunikwa ni ufumbuzi wa programu ya whitelist inayoendeshwa, `🧩 Subset` Usajili wa jina (`pr_affected_roles.sh`, ambayo inachukua kati ya subset PR-mwili na diff kutatua), ugunduzi wa chanjo ya kutolewa, ugunduzi wa programu kwa tumbo la kupeleka, na mabadiliko ya kutambua kwamba milango ya bomba la update."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains repository-specific resolvers used across workflows and shell helpers."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina ufumbuzi maalum wa uhifadhi unaotumiwa katika kazi za kazi na wasaidizi wa shell."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains resolver scripts for detecting missing derived artifacts and release metadata."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina maandiko ya kutatua kwa ajili ya kuchunguza mabaki yaliyopotea na metadata ya kutolewa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts for managing TLS/PKI concerns in the Infinito Nexus development environment. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina scripts za kusimamia masuala ya TLS / PKI katika mazingira ya maendeleo ya Infinito Nexus. Kwa ajili ya index ya kufanya lengo kwamba wito wasaidizi hawa, kuona [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts for managing systemd across different platforms and environments used in Infinito Nexus development. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina scripts kwa ajili ya kusimamia mfumo katika majukwaa mbalimbali na mazingira kutumika katika maendeleo Infinito Nexus. Kwa ajili ya index ya kufanya lengo kwamba wito wasaidizi hawa, kuona [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts related to the image lifecycle used by the project."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina maandiko yanayohusiana na maisha ya picha inayotumiwa na mradi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts that install and bootstrap host-side tooling used by the project."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina scripts kwamba kufunga na bootstrap mwenyeji wa upande tooling kutumika na mradi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts that resolve metadata and derived values used by the project."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina maandiko ambayo kutatua metadata na maadili inayotokana na mradi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts that run repository lint checks."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina scripts kwamba kukimbia repository lint hundi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains security guidance for Infinito.Nexus users and administrators. Its scope is operational security expectations, reporting paths, and role-specific hardening advice."
msgstr "Mwongozo huu una mwongozo wa usalama. Infinito.Nexus watumiaji na watendaji. Upeo wake ni matarajio ya usalama wa uendeshaji, njia za kuripoti, na ushauri maalum wa ugumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains shared Python helpers used by custom modules and plugins."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina kushirikiana Python wasaidizi kutumika na modules desturi na Plugins."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains shell helpers that synchronize repository refs before later workflow jobs derive CI scope from git history."
msgstr "Directory hii ina shell wasaidizi kwamba synchronize repository refs kabla ya baadaye kazi za kazi hupata wigo CI kutoka historia ya git."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the AppArmor-facing maintenance layer for the local and CI development experience."
msgstr "Saraka hii ina safu ya matengenezo ya AppArmor kwa uzoefu wa maendeleo ya ndani na ya CI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the [Ansible](https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_variables.html) `group_vars` applied to every host in the inventory. It holds the shared baseline that every role and every host-specific var can build on top of."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina orodha ya [Kuwa makini](https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_variables.html) `group_vars` Inatumiwa kwa kila mwenyeji katika hesabu. Inashikilia msingi wa pamoja kwamba kila jukumu na kila var maalum ya mwenyeji inaweza kujenga juu ya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the helpers invoked by [cron-update.yml](../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) to bump pinned upstream versions and open a pull request once per day. The helpers are thin wrappers: the image-version and repository-ref bumpers delegate to Python CLIs under [cli/contributing/](../../../cli/contributing/) that scan `roles/*/meta/services.yml` and rewrite version pins in place; the PR-open helper commits, force-pushes the update branch, and creates or refreshes the PR via `gh`. Helpers MUST NOT be called from workflows other than `🔄 Update versions`; the `CI_ENABLE_AUTO_UPDATES` gate is enforced once, at the workflow's job level, and bypassing it from another caller would create PRs even when auto-updates are intentionally disabled."
msgstr "Kamati hii ina wajumbe walioteuliwa na [cron-update.yml](../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) Kusonga pinned upstream matoleo na kufungua ombi kuvuta mara moja kwa siku. Wasaidizi ni wrappers nyembamba: picha-version na repository-ref bumpers mjumbe kwa Python CLIs chini [cli / ushirikiano](../../../cli/contributing/) Hii ya scan `roles/*/meta/services.yml` na kuandika upya pini za toleo mahali; Msaidizi wa wazi wa PR hufanya, kuimarisha tawi la update, na kuunda au kuburudisha PR kupitia `gh`. Waombaji hawapaswi kuitwa kutoka kwa kazi nyingine isipokuwa `🔄 Update versions`; Kwa kuwa `CI_ENABLE_AUTO_UPDATES` lango ni kutekelezwa mara moja, katika ngazi ya kazi ya kazi, na bypassing ni kutoka kwa mpiga simu mwingine ingekuwa kujenga PRs hata wakati auto-updates ni makusudi walemavu."

