# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the shell helpers that [entry-pr-translate.yml](../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-translate.yml) calls: resolving the languages LibreTranslate supports into the job matrix, merging the source strings of the `core` and `docs` domains into `locale/`, and machine-translating one language per runner."
msgstr "Kamati hii ina wajumbe ambao [entry-pr-translate.yml](../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-translate.yml) Wito: Kushughulikia lugha LibreTranslate Msaada katika matrix kazi, kuunganisha kamba chanzo cha `core` Aidha, na `docs` Mambo ya Ndani `locale/`, Kuhamisha lugha moja kwa kila mkimbiaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains variable definition files for the `svc-db-mariadb` Ansible role. It centralizes all configurable values related to MariaDB deployment and can be adjusted without modifying task logic."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina faili za ufafanuzi wa kutofautiana kwa `svc-db-mariadb` nafasi ya ajabu. Inaunganisha maadili yote yanayohusiana na MariaDB Kupelekwa na inaweza kubadilishwa bila kubadilisha mantiki ya kazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains workstation bundle skeletons."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina viungo vya kazi vya mifupa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory documents GitHub Actions in this repository."
msgstr "Orodha hii ina nyaraka za GitHub Actions katika kumbukumbu hii."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory documents how agents MUST debug failures during agent work. Its scope covers three independent workflows: local deploys (debugged from live local output and local logs), GitHub Actions / CI run failures (fully automated triage that fetches logs and artefacts itself via `gh`), and ad-hoc inspection of log files manually placed in the repository workdir by the operator."
msgstr "Saraka hii nyaraka jinsi mawakala lazima debug kushindwa wakati wa kazi wakala. Upeo wake unahusisha kazi tatu za kujitegemea: vituo vya ndani (Kuondolewa kutoka kwa pato la ndani na magogo ya ndani), Hatua za GitHub / CI zinashindwa (Triage automatiska ambayo huchota magogo na vifaa yenyewe kupitia `gh`), na ukaguzi wa ad-hoc wa faili za logi zilizowekwa kwa manually katika workdir ya kuhifadhi na operator."

