# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds host and system cleanup helpers. For container-local cleanup helpers, see [../../container/purge/README.md](../../container/purge/README.md). For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
