# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This is an accepted trade-off, not an oversight. Moodle offers no allowlist, so a single internal host cannot be permitted without unblocking the range it sits in. The cost is that any account holding a URL-fetching capability, such as ``block/rss_client:myaddinstance`` or a ``repository/url`` instance, can make the server issue requests to sibling containers. Grant those capabilities only to roles you trust with that reach, or keep the upstream blocklist and accept that SSO login and the AI surface do not work."
msgstr "Hii ni biashara iliyokubaliwa, sio uangalizi. Moodle haitoi ruhusu, kwa hivyo mwenyeji mmoja wa ndani hawezi kuruhusiwa bila kufungua safu ambayo inakaa. Gharama ni kwamba akaunti yoyote inayoshikilia uwezo wa kufikia URL, kama vile ``block/rss_client:myaddinstance`` au ya a ``repository/url`` Kwa mfano, inaweza kufanya maombi ya suala la seva ya kuunganisha vyombo. Kutoa uwezo huo tu kwa majukumu unayoamini na kufikia hiyo, au kuweka orodha ya blocklist ya juu na kukubali kwamba SSO login na uso wa AI haifanyi kazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This is an accepted trade-off, not an oversight. Moodle offers no allowlist, so a single internal host cannot be permitted without unblocking the range it sits in. The cost is that any account holding a URL-fetching capability, such as `block/rss_client:myaddinstance` or a `repository/url` instance, can make the server issue requests to sibling containers. Grant those capabilities only to roles you trust with that reach, or keep the upstream blocklist and accept that SSO login and the AI surface do not work."
msgstr "Hii ni biashara iliyokubaliwa, sio uangalizi. Moodle haitoi ruhusu, kwa hivyo mwenyeji mmoja wa ndani hawezi kuruhusiwa bila kufungua safu ambayo inakaa. Gharama ni kwamba akaunti yoyote inayoshikilia uwezo wa kufikia URL, kama vile `block/rss_client:myaddinstance` au ya a `repository/url` Kwa mfano, inaweza kufanya maombi ya suala la seva ya kuunganisha vyombo. Kutoa uwezo huo tu kwa majukumu unayoamini na kufikia hiyo, au kuweka orodha ya blocklist ya juu na kukubali kwamba SSO login na uso wa AI haifanyi kazi."

