msgid "This is the mechanism that lets variants control whether a shared service is pulled in: a variant override pins `services.<service>.{enabled,shared}` to a literal boolean; the round's include resolution reads the variant-merged services map; the provider role's group materialises in (or drops out of) the inventory accordingly."
msgstr "Hii ni utaratibu kwamba lets variants kudhibiti kama huduma pamoja ni vunjwa katika: lahaja pins override `services.<service>.{enabled,shared}` kwa boolean halisi; azimio la pande zote ni pamoja na azimio linasoma ramani ya huduma za lahaja; kikundi cha jukumu la mtoa huduma katika (au kuondoka kwenye) hesabu kwa njia hiyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This is the one clause that carries a hard guarantee, so it is enforced rather than asserted. In compose the agent role reads the runtime the container actually received and refuses the deploy when it is `runc`. In swarm the node reads its own default runtime and refuses the sandbox label while that is still `runc`, because the label is what routes sandboxed services to it. A lint additionally refuses a privileged container, a host network, pid, ipc or user namespace, and a host docker socket in any role that declares the sandbox, since any one of those hands the workload back to the host and cancels the runtime."
msgstr "Hii ni kifungu kimoja ambacho kina dhamana ngumu, kwa hivyo inatekelezwa badala ya kudai. Katika kuandika jukumu la wakala linasoma wakati wa kukimbia chombo kilipokea na kukataa kupeleka wakati ni `runc`. Katika kundi node inasoma runtime yake mwenyewe default na anakataa studio sandbox wakati huo bado ni `runc`, kwa sababu studio ni nini njia sandboxed huduma yake. Lint pia anakataa chombo cha upendeleo, mtandao wa mwenyeji, pid, ipc au jina la mtumiaji, na soketi ya docker ya mwenyeji katika jukumu lolote ambalo linatangaza sanduku la mchanga, kwani yeyote kati ya wale anayefanya kazi anarudisha kwa mwenyeji na anafuta wakati wa kukimbia."

