msgstr "Hii inaweka ratiba kuu inayoweza kusomwa kama muhtasari wa ngazi ya juu na inazuia ujumbe muhimu kutoka kuzikwa katika majadiliano ya nyuma na kuendelea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This lookup is the single sanctioned way to derive the Keycloak group path that an application role maps to. It replaces the scattered `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` idiom so the per-application OU hierarchy has one authoritative producer."
msgstr "Njia hii ni njia pekee ya kupata Keycloak Njia ya kikundi ambayo ramani ya jukumu la programu. Inabadilisha muundo wa mizizi `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` Lugha kwa hivyo uongozi wa OU una mtayarishaji mmoja wa mamlaka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This major release migrates every role to the new meta/ layout with explicit per-role networks, ports, run_after, and info.yml metadata, introduces a variant-aware matrix-deploy planner, ships a process-wide YAML / file / registry caching stack, promotes 13+ apps from alpha to beta, and adds a lint corpus that pins the new conventions in CI."
msgstr "Toleo hili kubwa huhamia kila jukumu kwa meta mpya / mpangilio na mitandao ya wazi ya kila rangi, bandari, run_after, Aidha, na info.yml Metadata, inaanzisha mpango wa programu ya matrix-kujua, meli mchakato mzima wa YAML / faili / Usajili wa caching stack, inakuza 13+ programu kutoka alpha kwa beta, na anaongeza corpus lint kwamba pins mikataba mpya katika CI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This makes Home Assistant a natural [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) **MCP server role** and the concrete backend for the isolated-home-assistant scenario in [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md): the agent stays kernel-isolated and reaches the home only through this MCP surface, never through host access. Home Assistant runs natively on `arm64`/Raspberry Pi, so it co-locates with the Pi agent story."
msgstr "Hii inafanya Home Assistant Asili ya [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) **Majukumu ya seva ya MCP** kwa ajili ya kusaidia katika hali ya usafi wa nyumba katika [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md): Wakala anakaa kernel-isolated na hufikia nyumbani tu kupitia uso huu wa MCP, kamwe kupitia upatikanaji wa mwenyeji. Home »Unlabelled » Waziri Mkuu afanya ziara ya kikazi `arm64`/Raspberry Pi, kwa hivyo inashirikiana na hadithi ya wakala wa Pi."

