msgid "This means:"
msgstr "Hii inamaanisha:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This minor release adds Mattermost deployment support, improves release image automation, and hardens CI, Ansible plugin handling, and application deployment reliability across the stack."
msgstr "Taarifa hii ndogo inaongeza Mattermost Msaada wa kupelekwa, inaboresha automatisering ya picha ya kutolewa, na hufanya ngumu CI, utunzaji wa Plugin ya Ansible, na uaminifu wa kupelekwa kwa maombi katika stack."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This minor release improves cross-distro package handling, hardens CI reliability, fixes Ansible compatibility issues, and adds clearer contributor and local test workflows."
msgstr "Toleo hili ndogo linaboresha utunzaji wa mfuko wa msalaba, kuimarisha uaminifu wa CI, hurekebisha masuala ya utangamano wa Ansible, na huongeza mchangiaji wazi na kazi za mtihani wa ndani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This module exposes a single cached `load_yaml(path)` so each absolute path is parsed at most once per Python process. `dump_yaml` writes through and evicts the cached entry. `invalidate(path)` is the explicit escape hatch when a caller knows a file was changed externally."
msgstr "Moduli hii inaonyesha cached moja `load_yaml(path)` Kwa hivyo kila njia kamili inashirikiwa mara moja kwa mchakato wa Python. `dump_yaml` Andika na urekebishe kuingia kwa cached. `invalidate(path)` Je, ni hatch ya kutoroka wazi wakati mpiga simu anajua faili ilibadilishwa nje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This module finds those declarations, indexes them by id and resolves one for a target distribution. The declaration shape itself lives in :mod:`utils.packages.schema`."
msgstr "Moduli hii inapata matangazo hayo, inaorodhesha kwa id na inatatua moja kwa usambazaji wa lengo. Taarifa yenyewe inaishi katika :mod:`utils.packages.schema`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This module is intentionally ansible-free and dependency-light so it can be imported from the lint layer, the external test layer, and the update automation without dragging deploy-time machinery in."
msgstr "Moduli hii ni kwa makusudi ansible-bure na utegemezi-light hivyo inaweza kuwa nje kutoka safu lint, nje mtihani safu, na automatisering update bila dragging kupeleka-time mashine katika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This module is the single source of truth for role-level dependencies: the paths inside a role directory, the role types each path may legitimately appear under, the mandatory shape of those paths, and the ``marker`` entries that drive role-type detection itself. Both lint tests and the role-type predicate live downstream of this file:"
msgstr "Moduli hii ni chanzo kimoja cha ukweli kwa utegemezi wa ngazi ya jukumu: njia ndani ya saraka ya jukumu, aina za jukumu kila njia zinaweza kuonekana kwa halali, sura ya lazima ya njia hizo, na ``marker`` Kuingia ambayo gari-aina ya kutambua yenyewe. Majaribio yote ya lint na aina ya jukumu hutangulia chini ya mfumo wa faili hii:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This module is the single source of truth for that rule. The Keycloak realm group builder, the LDAP role entry builder and the Open WebUI group reconciler all resolve membership through it, so the three paths cannot drift."
msgstr "Mfumo huu ni chanzo kimoja cha ukweli kwa kanuni hii. Kwa kuwa Keycloak Ujenzi wa kikundi cha ulimwengu, mjenzi wa jukumu la LDAP na Open WebUI kundi kupatanisha wote kutatua uanachama kupitia hiyo, hivyo njia tatu hawezi drift."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This module owns the file's location and the tree-walking primitives. Consumers MUST resolve the path through :func:`categories_file` rather than spelling it themselves, so a future move touches one line."
msgstr "Moduli hii inamiliki eneo la faili na kanuni za kutembea miti. Wananchi watakiwa kufuata njia :func:`categories_file` Badala ya kuandika mwenyewe, hatua ya baadaye inagusa mstari mmoja."

