# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This playbook is tailored for users who need a powerful and flexible spell-checking tool on their systems. Hunspell is particularly popular among writers, editors, and developers who work with text in various languages. By automating the installation of Hunspell and its language-specific packages, this playbook simplifies the setup process, allowing users to quickly get up and running with an advanced spell-checking tool."
msgstr "Kitabu hiki cha kucheza kinafaa kwa watumiaji ambao wanahitaji zana yenye nguvu na rahisi ya kuangalia spell kwenye mifumo yao. Hunspell ni maarufu sana kati ya waandishi, wahariri, na watengenezaji ambao wanafanya kazi na maandishi katika lugha mbalimbali. kwa ajili ya ujenzi wa miundombinu ya Hunspell Na paket zake maalum za lugha, kitabu hiki cha kucheza kinarahisisha mchakato wa kuanzisha, kuruhusu watumiaji kupata haraka na kukimbia na chombo cha juu cha kuangalia spell."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This playbook, ``dsk-docker``, is part of a larger collection housed within the ``infinito`` repository. It is specifically tailored for setting up Docker and Docker Compose on personal computers (PCs) used for development purposes. The primary goal is to facilitate a development environment on individual workstations rather than configuring servers for hosting or distributing Docker images."
msgstr "Kitabu hiki, ``dsk-docker``, ni sehemu ya mkusanyiko mkubwa ulio ndani ya ``infinito`` ya kuhifadhi. Ni hasa iliyoundwa kwa ajili ya kuanzisha Docker na Docker Compose kwenye kompyuta binafsi (wa PC) kutumika kwa malengo ya maendeleo. Lengo la msingi ni kuwezesha mazingira ya maendeleo kwenye vituo vya kazi binafsi badala ya kusanidi seva za mwenyeji au kusambaza picha za Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
