# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This purges the app's containers + volumes + Ansible-managed state on the host, then re-deploys. Use it once, then return to `mode=update` without `purge=true`. Do NOT loop with `purge=true`; if the failure survives a single purge it is not a state issue."
msgstr "Hii husafisha vyombo vya programu + volumes + hali inayosimamiwa na Ansible kwenye mwenyeji, kisha kurudia tena. Tumia mara moja, kisha uirudie tena `mode=update` Bila ya `purge=true`. Usiwe na wasiwasi `purge=true`Kama kushindwa kuishi moja purge ni si suala la serikali."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release delivers a major stability and reliability upgrade across the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem. It focuses on **deterministic deployments**, **robust TLS/CA handling**, **mirror-aware inventories**, and **CI/CD resilience**, while standardizing Docker service configuration across roles."
msgstr "Toleo hili hutoa utulivu mkubwa na uboreshaji wa kuaminika kote Infinito.Nexus mazingira. Inasisitiza juu ya **Mipango ya utekelezaji**Kwa hivyo, **Utekelezaji wa TLS/CA**Kwa hivyo, **Uvumbuzi wa macho**Aidha, na **Ufuatiliaji wa CD / CD**, wakati standardizing Docker huduma Configuration katika majukumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release ensures that commits carrying a version tag trigger the full distro test matrix by detecting tags pointing at the current commit, while regular commits continue to run on a single random distro."
msgstr "Toleo hili linahakikisha kwamba hufanya kubeba tag ya toleo husababisha tumbo kamili la jaribio la distro kwa kuchunguza vitambulisho vinavyoonyesha ahadi ya sasa, wakati wa kawaida unaendelea kukimbia kwenye distro moja ya random."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release expands the application portfolio with new civic, ERP, feedback, and observability roles, replaces legacy generated runtime data with lookup-driven configuration and service loading, broadens Playwright end-to-end coverage across the stack, and hardens CI, local development, and deployment reliability."
msgstr "Toleo hili linapanua kwingineko ya maombi na kazi mpya za kiraia, ERP, maoni, na majukumu ya ufuatiliaji, inachukua nafasi ya data ya urithi yanayotokana na data ya muda na usanidi na upakiaji wa huduma, kupanua chanjo ya mwisho-kwa-mwisho kwenye stack, na ngumu CI, maendeleo ya ndani, na uaminifu wa kupelekwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release focuses on improving Matomo installation stability, aligning base images, and introducing automated CI image cleanup. **Improvements**"
msgstr "Hatua hii inalenga katika kuboresha Matomo utulivu wa ufungaji, kuunganisha picha za msingi, na kuanzisha kusafisha picha ya CI ya automatiska. **Uboreshaji wa**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release improves CI and developer tooling robustness by fixing hardlink-related errors, stabilizing workflow triggers, resolving type-checking import cycles, and hardening cleanup and teardown logic across the CLI and templating utilities."
msgstr "Toleo hili linaboresha CI na msanidi programu kutumia nguvu kwa kurekebisha makosa yanayohusiana na hardlink, kuimarisha mitambo ya kazi, kutatua mzunguko wa ukaguzi wa aina, na kusafisha na kufuta mantiki katika CLI na kutafakari huduma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release lands the matrix-deploy hardening pass, an interactive console for the CLI, the bundles workflow, a per-consumer Postgres builder, a shared Playwright persona library across every web role, a SPOT env pipeline under the `INFINITO_` namespace, and a new education-suite bundle (openwebui + mailu) alongside the KIX Service Management role."
msgstr "Toleo hili linazunguka kupitisha ngumu ya matrix, console ya maingiliano kwa CLI, kazi ya vifungu, mjenzi wa Postgres ya kila mtumiaji, maktaba ya pamoja ya Playwright persona katika kila jukumu la wavuti, bomba la env la SPOT chini ya ujenzi wa Postgres ya mtumiaji, maktaba ya mtu wa Playwright ya pamoja ya Playwright katika kila jukumu la wavuti, bomba la env la env chini ya bomba la SPOT `INFINITO_` Jinaspace, na mfuko mpya wa elimu (Mtandao wa Openwebui + mailu) Pamoja na KIX majukumu ya usimamizi wa huduma."

