# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement extends [025 - MCP Role Integration](025-mcp-role-integration.md). Requirement 025 defines the initial MCP metadata and the first Open WebUI integration; this requirement drives the exhaustive role audit, the proxy and workflow-adapter contract, client reconciliation, and the conditions under which the remaining roles may be integrated."
msgstr "Mahitaji haya yanaongezeka [025 Ushirikiano wa MCP](025-mcp-role-integration.md). Mahitaji ya 025 Inafafanua metadata ya awali ya MCP na ya kwanza Open WebUI Ushirikiano; mahitaji haya hutoa ukaguzi wa jukumu kamili, wakala na mkataba wa kazi-adapter, upatanisho wa mteja, na masharti ambayo majukumu yaliyosalia yanaweza kuunganishwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement moves the core roles that render translated text onto the catalogs of [037 - Gettext Catalogs with LibreTranslate Autotranslation](037-gettext-catalogs-libretranslate.md) and opens the API of [038 - web-svc-api](README.md#archive) to browser consumers. The consumer repositories change afterwards and are not part of this requirement."
msgstr "Mahitaji haya hufanya majukumu ya msingi ambayo hutoa maandishi yaliyotafsiriwa kwenye orodha za orodha za [037 Orodha ya barua pepe na LibreTranslate Uhamisho wa Auto](037-gettext-catalogs-libretranslate.md) na kufungua mlango wa API Kwa upande wa [038 - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - web-svc-api](README.md#archive) watumiaji wa browser. Hifadhi za watumiaji hubadilika baadaye na sio sehemu ya mahitaji haya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This restore path also restarts `docker.service` and then calls `make network-refresh`, so the running Infinito development stack is recreated when one is active and the restored setting reaches fresh container network namespaces."
msgstr "Njia hii ya kurejesha tena `docker.service` Baada ya maombi `make network-refresh`, hivyo mbio Infinito maendeleo stack ni recreated wakati mmoja ni kazi na mazingira kurejeshwa kufikia mpya chombo mtandao namespaces."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role **does not ship the installer script** and therefore requires network access during installation."
msgstr "Jukumu hili **Je, si kwenda nje ya script?** Hii inahitaji upatikanaji wa mtandao wakati wa ufungaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role adapts iptables rules to enable proper connectivity for a WireGuard client running behind a NAT or firewall. It ensures that traffic is forwarded correctly by applying necessary masquerading rules."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linabadilisha sheria za iptables ili kuwezesha kuunganishwa sahihi kwa mteja wa WireGuard anayeendesha nyuma ya NAT au firewall. Inahakikisha kwamba trafiki inapelekwa kwa usahihi kwa kutumia sheria muhimu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role addresses a common issue on Linux laptops: closing the lid while docked or plugged in leads to unintended sleep or hibernation. It installs the necessary hibernation tools and updates `/etc/systemd/logind.conf` to:"
msgstr "Jukumu hili linashughulikia suala la kawaida kwenye laptops za Linux: kufunga lid wakati imewekwa au imeunganishwa inaongoza kwa usingizi usiotarajiwa au hibernation. Inasanidi zana muhimu za hibernation na sasisho `/etc/systemd/logind.conf` kuwa:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role addresses a common issue on Linux laptops: closing the lid while docked or plugged in leads to unintended sleep or hibernation. It installs the necessary hibernation tools and updates ``/etc/systemd/logind.conf`` to:"
