# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role aggregates essential GNOME desktop roles (including caffeine, extensions, and terminal) for a complete GNOME environment on Linux."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha majukumu muhimu ya desktop ya GNOME (ikiwa ni pamoja na caffeine, upanuzi, na terminal) Kwa mazingira kamili ya GNOME kwenye Linux."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role aggregates various GNOME desktop components to ensure a cohesive and fully functional GNOME environment on Arch Linux. It includes the installation and configuration of several sub-roles:"
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha sehemu mbalimbali za desktop za GNOME ili kuhakikisha mazingira ya ushirikiano na kikamilifu ya GNOME kwenye Arch Linux. Ni pamoja na ufungaji na Configuration ya mbalimbali ndogo:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role asserts that the mount, source, and target configuration values are present, deploys the rsync-driver script, and installs a systemd mount unit plus a oneshot service. The oneshot service is triggered automatically when the configured mount path appears, so the only operator action is to physically plug the device in."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linasisitiza kwamba mlima, chanzo, na maadili ya usanidi wa lengo yapo, hupeleka script ya rsync-driver, na husanidi kitengo cha mlima kilichopangwa pamoja na huduma moja. Huduma ya oneshot husababishwa moja kwa moja wakati njia ya mlima iliyowekwa inaonekana, kwa hivyo hatua pekee ya operator ni kuziba kifaa ndani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the cleanup of old backups by executing a Python script that deletes outdated backup versions based on disk usage thresholds. It ensures that backup storage does not exceed a defined usage percentage."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linazuia kusafisha backups za zamani kwa kutekeleza script ya Python ambayo inafuta matoleo ya zamani ya chelezo kulingana na vizingiti vya matumizi ya disk. Inahakikisha kwamba uhifadhi wa chelezo hauzidi asilimia ya matumizi iliyoelezwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the creation of a swapfile on the target system by cloning a swapfile creation script from a Git repository and executing it with the specified swapfile size."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaendesha uumbaji wa swapfile kwenye mfumo wa lengo kwa cloning script ya uumbaji wa faili kutoka kwa script ya kubadilishana Git Kuweka na kutekeleza kwa kiwango maalum cha kubadilishana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment and configuration of a complete, production-ready Taiga stack using Docker Compose. It ensures integration with common infrastructure tools such as NGINX, PostgreSQL, and RabbitMQ, while optionally enabling OpenID Connect authentication for enterprise-grade SSO."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linasababisha kupelekwa na usanidi wa tayari kamili, uzalishaji Taiga Matumizi ya Docker ComposeInahakikisha ushirikiano na zana za kawaida za miundombinu kama NGINX, PostgreSQLAidha, na RabbitMQWakati wa kuwezesha uthibitishaji wa OpenID Connect kwa SSO ya daraja la biashara."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment of Kevin's Package Manager by:"
msgstr "Jukumu hili linazuia kupelekwa kwa Meneja wa Package wa Kevin kwa:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment of Kevin’s Package Manager by:"
msgstr "Jukumu hili linazuia kupelekwa kwa Meneja wa Package wa Kevin kwa:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment of Odoo in a containerized Docker environment with PostgreSQL database integration, OIDC/LDAP authentication support, and full Infinito.Nexus stack integration including reverse proxy, CSP configuration, and centralized identity management."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linasababisha kupelekwa kwa Odoo katika mazingira ya Docker iliyo na kontena na PostgreSQL Ushirikiano wa database, msaada wa uthibitisho wa OIDC /LDAP, na kamili Infinito.Nexus Ushirikiano wa stack ikiwa ni pamoja na wakala wa reverse, usanidi wa CSP, na usimamizi wa utambulisho wa kati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of Jrnl using the ``community.general.pacman`` module for systems that support the Pacman package manager, ensuring that Jrnl is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Mradi huu unakamilisha ujenzi wa Jrnl Kwa kutumia ``community.general.pacman`` Mfumo ambao unaunga mkono Meneja wa Mfuko wa Pacman, kuhakikisha kwamba Jrnl Imewekwa na imewekwa hadi sasa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of Jrnl using the `community.general.pacman` module for systems that support the Pacman package manager, ensuring that Jrnl is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Mradi huu unakamilisha ujenzi wa Jrnl Kwa kutumia `community.general.pacman` Mfumo ambao unaunga mkono Meneja wa Mfuko wa Pacman, kuhakikisha kwamba Jrnl Imewekwa na imewekwa hadi sasa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of fakeroot via the OS package manager, ensuring that users can simulate superuser operations without requiring elevated privileges."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaendesha ufungaji wa fakeroot kupitia Meneja wa mfuko wa OS, kuhakikisha kwamba watumiaji wanaweza kuiga shughuli za superuser bila kuhitaji upendeleo mkubwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of micro, a CLI text editor, on Pacman‑based systems. It uses the ``community.general.pacman`` module to ensure the editor is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linasimamia ufungaji wa micro, mhariri wa maandishi ya CLI, kwenye mifumo ya msingi ya Pacman. Inatumia matumizi ya ``community.general.pacman`` moduli kuhakikisha mhariri imewekwa na hadi sasa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of micro, a CLI text editor, on Pacman‑based systems. It uses the `community.general.pacman` module to ensure the editor is installed and up to date."
