# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of neovim, a CLI text editor, on Pacman‑based systems. It uses the ``community.general.pacman`` module to ensure the editor is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linasimamia ufungaji wa neovim, mhariri wa maandishi wa CLI, kwenye mifumo ya msingi ya Pacman. Inatumia matumizi ya ``community.general.pacman`` moduli kuhakikisha mhariri imewekwa na hadi sasa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
