# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the management and balancing of Btrfs file systems. It clones the latest version of the [auto-btrfs-balancer](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git) repository and configures a systemd service and timer to run the balancing script automatically."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linasimamia usimamizi na kusawazisha mifumo ya faili ya Btrfs. Inaunganisha toleo la karibuni la [Udhibiti wa auto-btrfs](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git) kuhifadhi na configures mfumo wa huduma na timer kuendesha kusawazisha script moja kwa moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the management and balancing of Btrfs file systems. It clones the latest version of the `auto-btrfs-balancer <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git>`__ repository and configures a systemd service and timer to run the balancing script automatically."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linasimamia usimamizi na kusawazisha mifumo ya faili ya Btrfs. Inaunganisha toleo la karibuni la `auto-btrfs-balancer <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git>`__ kuhifadhi na configures mfumo wa huduma na timer kuendesha kusawazisha script moja kwa moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the process of setting up and running the Infinito.Nexus presentation in a Docker container, ensuring a reproducible and isolated environment for displaying the content."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaendesha mchakato wa kuanzisha na kuendesha Infinito.Nexus Uwasilishaji katika chombo cha Docker, kuhakikisha mazingira mazuri na ya pekee kwa kuonyesha maudhui."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the removal of orphaned Docker volumes that consume unnecessary disk space. It is especially useful in backup, CI/CD, or maintenance routines."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linasababisha kuondolewa kwa kiasi cha Docker yatima ambacho hutumia nafasi ya disk isiyohitajika. Ni muhimu hasa katika Backup, CI / CD, au utaratibu wa matengenezo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the restart process for Docker Compose instances within a specified directory. It deploys a Python script that checks for the presence of compose.yml files and restarts the associated services. A hard restart is applied for certain directories if needed."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaendesha mchakato wa kuanzisha upya Docker Compose Ndani ya utaratibu maalum. Inatumia script ya Python ambayo inaangalia uwepo wa compose.yml Kuweka upya na kurejesha huduma zinazohusiana. Rejesha ngumu inatumika kwa saraka fulani ikiwa inahitajika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the retrieval of [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) SSL/TLS certificates using [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/) for domains served via NGINX. It supports both single-domain and wildcard certificates, and can use either the DNS or webroot ACME challenge methods."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linakamilisha ukombozi wa [Kwa hiyo, hebu tufungue](https://letsencrypt.org/) Vyeti vya SSL / TLS kutumia [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/) Kwa ajili ya maeneo yanayotumiwa kupitia NGINX. Inasaidia vyeti vya kikoa kimoja na wildcard, na inaweza kutumia DNS au njia za changamoto za ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the retrieval of `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ SSL/TLS certificates using `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__ for domains served via NGINX. It supports both single-domain and wildcard certificates, and can use either the DNS or webroot ACME challenge methods."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linakamilisha ukombozi wa `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ Vyeti vya SSL / TLS kutumia `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__ Kwa ajili ya maeneo yanayotumiwa kupitia NGINX. Inasaidia vyeti vya kikoa kimoja na wildcard, na inaweza kutumia DNS au njia za changamoto za ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the setup of an automatic [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) certificate renewal system for NGINX using [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/). It ensures that SSL/TLS certificates are renewed seamlessly in the background and that NGINX reloads automatically after successful renewals."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaendesha usanidi wa moja kwa moja [Kwa hiyo, hebu tufungue](https://letsencrypt.org/) Mfumo wa upya wa hati kwa NGINX kwa kutumia [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/). Inahakikisha kwamba vyeti vya SSL / TLS vinafanywa upya bila kushonwa nyuma na kwamba NGINX inapakia moja kwa moja baada ya upyaji wa mafanikio."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the setup of an automatic `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ certificate renewal system for NGINX using `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__. It ensures that SSL/TLS certificates are renewed seamlessly in the background and that NGINX reloads automatically after successful renewals."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaendesha usanidi wa moja kwa moja `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ Mfumo wa upya wa hati kwa NGINX kwa kutumia `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__. Inahakikisha kwamba vyeti vya SSL / TLS vinafanywa upya bila kushonwa nyuma na kwamba NGINX inapakia moja kwa moja baada ya upyaji wa mafanikio."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bakes the upstream release artefact into a small ``nginx:alpine`` image and supports **multiple walls per deployment**: every entry under ```meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`` <meta/services.yml>`__ materializes as its own path under ``https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/`` with its own baked-in ``wall-config.json``. The root ``/`` shows a link list of all configured walls."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linachanganya sanaa ya kutolewa ya juu katika ndogo ``nginx:alpine`` Picha na Msaada **mbalimbali kwa ajili ya utekelezaji**• Kila kuingia chini ```meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`` <meta/services.yml>`__ materializes as its own path under ``https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/`` with its own baked-in ``wall-config.json``. The root ``/`` Inaonyesha orodha ya kiungo cha kuta zote zilizopangwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bakes the upstream release artefact into a small `nginx:alpine` image and supports **multiple walls per deployment**: every entry under [`meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`](meta/services.yml) materializes as its own path under `https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/` with its own baked-in `wall-config.json`. The root `/` shows a link list of all configured walls."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linachanganya sanaa ya kutolewa ya juu katika ndogo `nginx:alpine` Picha na Msaada **mbalimbali kwa ajili ya utekelezaji**• Kila kuingia chini [`meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`](meta/services.yml) kuwa kama njia yake mwenyewe `https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/` Kwa upande wake Balozi wa `wall-config.json`. Chanzo cha `/` Inaonyesha orodha ya kiungo cha kuta zote zilizopangwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps **per-domain NGINX configuration**: it requests TLS certificates, applies global modifiers, deploys a ready-made vHost file, and can optionally lock down access via OAuth2."
msgstr "Sehemu hii ya bootstraps **Muundo wa NGINX**Inaomba vyeti vya TLS, inatumika modifiers za kimataifa, inapeleka faili ya vHost iliyoandaliwa tayari, na inaweza kuzuia ufikiaji kupitia OAuth2..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps and manages a Docker Swarm cluster across the hosts in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node``. The manager is the single host in ``svc-swarm-manager``; every other group member joins as a worker. Membership is expressed via group membership only, never via duplicated lists in ``group_vars``. Inventory node labels are pushed to the cluster after the join phase."
msgstr "Kazi hii ya usimamizi na usimamizi wa Docker Swarm Kundi la wapiganaji katika kundi la Ansible ``svc-swarm-node``“Mkurugenzi ni mtumishi pekee katika ``svc-swarm-manager``; Kila mwanachama wa kikundi anajiunga kama mfanyakazi. Uanachama unaonyeshwa kupitia uanachama wa kikundi tu, kamwe kupitia orodha za duplicate katika ``group_vars``. Lebo za node za uvumbuzi zinasukumwa kwenye nguzo baada ya awamu ya kujiunga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps and manages a Docker Swarm cluster across the hosts in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node`. The manager is the single host in `svc-swarm-manager`; every other group member joins as a worker. Membership is expressed via group membership only, never via duplicated lists in `group_vars`. Inventory node labels are pushed to the cluster after the join phase."
msgstr "Kazi hii ya usimamizi na usimamizi wa Docker Swarm Kundi la wapiganaji katika kundi la Ansible `svc-swarm-node`“Mkurugenzi ni mtumishi pekee katika `svc-swarm-manager`; Kila mwanachama wa kikundi anajiunga kama mfanyakazi. Uanachama unaonyeshwa kupitia uanachama wa kikundi tu, kamwe kupitia orodha za duplicate katika `group_vars`. Lebo za node za uvumbuzi zinasukumwa kwenye nguzo baada ya awamu ya kujiunga."

