# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Moodle's site administrator is created by `install_database.php` in `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` and realigned on every pass, both from the `administrator` user, so the native form and the identity provider carry one secret. In the SSO variant `tasks/04_oidc.yml` sets `alternateloginurl` so `/login/index.php` bounces to the OIDC plugin and rewrites every `mdl_user` row to `auth='oidc'`, so no form accepts either secret; the SSO-off variants in `meta/variants.yml` have no OIDC chain to substitute. One env file is rendered per role, not per variant, so the flag has to hold for the worst case."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linatangazwa `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` Ndani ya `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mkurugenzi wa Halmashauri ya Wilaya ya Mkuranga ameteuliwa na `install_database.php` Ndani ya `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` Na katika kila hatua ya kazi, `administrator` Mtumiaji, hivyo fomu ya asili na mtoa utambulisho hubeba siri moja. Katika kesi ya SSO `tasks/04_oidc.yml` Kuweka `alternateloginurl` Hivyo basi kwa `/login/index.php` Nenda kwenye Plugin ya OIDC na urekebishe kila kitu. `mdl_user` Ramana ya `auth='oidc'`, Kwa hivyo, hakuna fomu inayokubali siri yoyote; tofauti za SSO-off katika `meta/variants.yml` Huna haja ya kuwa na akaunti ya OIDC. Faili moja ya env hutolewa kwa jukumu, sio kwa lahaja, kwa hivyo bendera inapaswa kushikilia kesi mbaya zaidi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX sits behind an oauth2-proxy whose `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` in `meta/services.yml` admits only `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` and `roles/web-app-kix/user`; biber belongs to neither, so the proxy denies him before KIX renders anything. Past the proxy KIX is a two-stage login: the SPA still presents its own agent form at `/auth` that binds against LDAP, and the shared persona helper has no second stage after the Keycloak round-trip."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linatangazwa `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` Ndani ya `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX nyuma ya oauth2Kwa mfano, mtu ambaye `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` Ndani ya `meta/services.yml` Kukubaliana tu `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` Aidha, na `roles/web-app-kix/user`; Na wala si hivyo tu, bali hata kabla ya hapo. KIX kufanya chochote. Kabla ya Agent KIX ni kuingia kwa hatua mbili: SPA bado inatoa fomu yake ya wakala katika `/auth` Hiyo inafunga dhidi ya LDAP, na msaidizi wa pamoja hana hatua ya pili baada ya Keycloak Safari ya pande zote."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for the same mechanism. Mattermost Team Edition ships no native OIDC provider, so the role piggybacks Keycloak onto the GitLab OAuth slot (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*`` in ``templates/env.j2``); the resulting entry point is ``a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']``, relabelled “SSO with Infinito.Nexus” by ``templates/javascript.js.j2``, which the shared helper’s name-based login matcher does not recognise. Mattermost v11+ also serves a ``/landing`` interstitial to unauthenticated visitors that only clears once ``localStorage.__landingPageSeen__`` is seeded before navigation, and the shared helper has no init-script hook to do that."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linatangazwa ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` Aidha, na ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` Ndani ya ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` kwa mfumo huo. Toleo la Timu ya Mattermost meli hakuna mtoa huduma wa asili wa OIDC, hivyo jukumu la piggybacks Keycloak Juu ya GitLab Ukumbi wa slot (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*`` Ndani ya ``templates/env.j2``); Matokeo ya kuingia ni ``a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']``^ Tnn., “kwa pamoja Infinito.Nexus“Kwa ``templates/javascript.js.j2``, ambayo mchezaji wa kiungo cha kiungo cha kiungo cha kiungo cha kiungo cha kiungo cha kiungo hawezi kutambua. Mambo ya V11Aidha, A ``/landing`` Kuingiliana na wageni wasio na uzoefu ambao hufungua mara moja tu ``localStorage.__landingPageSeen__`` Kabla ya kupanda, mbegu zinahifadhiwa, na hakuna haja ya kumwagilia."

