# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for two different reasons. The MinIO Console version pinned here never renders an SSO button — ``/api/v1/login`` answers ``redirectRules: null`` however the identity provider is registered server-side — so there is no in-page OIDC entry point for the shared helper to click. Biber is blocked because the only MinIO policy the role creates is the administrator RBAC group path (``MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME`` in ``vars/main.yml``, attached in ``tasks/02_ldap.yml``) and MinIO has no self-service signup, so biber maps to no policy and has no authenticated surface at either tier."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linatangazwa ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` Aidha, na ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` Ndani ya ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` kwa sababu mbili tofauti. Kwa kuwa MinIO Toleo la Console lililowekwa hapa halifanyi kifungo cha SSO - ``/api/v1/login`` Majibu ya majibu ``redirectRules: null`` Hata hivyo mtoa huduma wa utambulisho amesajiliwa upande wa seva - kwa hivyo hakuna uhakika wa kuingia kwenye ukurasa wa OIDC kwa msaidizi aliyeshirikiwa kubonyeza. Biber apigwa faini kwa kuwa pekee yake MinIO Jukumu la sera ni njia ya kiongozi wa RBAC (``MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME`` Ndani ya ``vars/main.yml``, Kuunganishwa katika ``tasks/02_ldap.yml``) Aidha, na MinIO Haina ishara ya huduma ya kibinafsi, hivyo ramani za biber hakuna sera na haina uso uliothibitishwa kwa kiwango chochote."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for two different reasons. The wiki’s bureaucrat and sysop is a local account created by ``maintenance/run.php createAndPromote`` in ``tasks/04_admin.yml`` with ``MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD`` — the role-local ``credentials.administrator_password``, not the Keycloak secret the persona helper carries in ``ADMIN_PASSWORD``. ``$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin`` is false, so no native form accepts that password anyway, and ``$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName`` lands the Keycloak identity on a separate, e-mail-named wiki account that holds no sysop rights."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linatangazwa ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` Aidha, na ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` Ndani ya ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` kwa sababu mbili tofauti. ukiritimba wa wiki na sysop ni akaunti ya ndani iliyoundwa na ``maintenance/run.php createAndPromote`` Ndani ya ``tasks/04_admin.yml`` Pamoja na ``MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD`` Majukumu ya Ndani ``credentials.administrator_password``, Hapana, si ya kwamba Keycloak Afisa wa polisi akamatwa kwa kuingia ndani ``ADMIN_PASSWORD``... ``$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin`` Ni uongo, hivyo hakuna fomu ya asili inakubali password hiyo anyway, na ``$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName`` Ardhi ya Keycloak Utambulisho kwenye akaunti tofauti, ya barua pepe ya wiki ambayo haina haki za sysop."

