# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares no addons (it ships no ``meta/addons/`` directory). Mattermost **Team Edition** manages plugin install and enablement at runtime; there is no declarative per-plugin install path in this role. Plugins are operator-managed. The named volumes ``plugins`` and ``client-plugins`` declared in ``meta/volumes.yml`` are node-local derived copies that every replica extracts for itself from the image’s prepackaged bundles; an uploaded bundle persists in the file store, not in them. No addon bridges any in-repo service."
msgstr "Hii ina maana kwamba hakuna nyongeza (Hakuna meli ya ``meta/addons/`` Mwongozo wa Mwongozo). Kwa kiasi kikubwa **Orodha ya timu** Inasimamia ufungaji wa Plugin na kuwezesha wakati wa kukimbia; hakuna njia ya kufunga kwa kila-plugin katika jukumu hili. Plugins zinasimamiwa na operator. Majina ya kiasi ``plugins`` Aidha, na ``client-plugins`` Imetangazwa katika ``meta/volumes.yml`` ni nakala za node-local zilizopatikana ambazo kila nakala ya replica yenyewe kutoka kwa vifungu vya picha vilivyoandaliwa; kifungu kilichopakiwa kinaendelea kwenye duka la faili, sio ndani yake. Hakuna addon bridges huduma yoyote ya ndani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares no addons (it ships no `meta/addons/` directory). Mattermost **Team Edition** manages plugin install and enablement at runtime; there is no declarative per-plugin install path in this role. Plugins are operator-managed. The named volumes `plugins` and `client-plugins` declared in `meta/volumes.yml` are node-local derived copies that every replica extracts for itself from the image's prepackaged bundles; an uploaded bundle persists in the file store, not in them. No addon bridges any in-repo service."
msgstr "Hii ina maana kwamba hakuna nyongeza (Hakuna meli ya `meta/addons/` Mwongozo wa Mwongozo). Kwa kiasi kikubwa **Orodha ya timu** Inasimamia ufungaji wa Plugin na kuwezesha wakati wa kukimbia; hakuna njia ya kufunga kwa kila-plugin katika jukumu hili. Plugins zinasimamiwa na operator. Majina ya kiasi `plugins` Aidha, na `client-plugins` Imetangazwa katika `meta/volumes.yml` ni nakala za node-local zilizopatikana ambazo kila nakala ya replica yenyewe kutoka kwa vifungu vya picha vilivyoandaliwa; kifungu kilichopakiwa kinaendelea kwenye duka la faili, sio ndani yake. Hakuna addon bridges huduma yoyote ya ndani."

