# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Fider as part of the Infinito.Nexus stack using a single Docker Compose container backed by PostgreSQL. It configures SSO via Keycloak automatically on first deploy, optional email notifications via Mailu, and HTTPS via NGINX reverse proxy."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Fider Kama sehemu ya Infinito.Nexus Tumia kwa kutumia moja Docker Compose Muungano unaoongozwa na PostgreSQLInaunganisha SSO kupitia Keycloak moja kwa moja kwenye kupeleka kwanza, arifa za barua pepe za hiari kupitia MailuHTTPS kupitia wakala wa NGINX reverse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Friendica using Docker, managing the Friendica application container alongside a central MariaDB instance. It provides tools for full resets, manual and automatic database reinitialization, email and general configuration debugging, and autoinstall processes, all to ensure your Friendica installation remains reliable and easy to maintain."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Friendica Kutumia Docker, Usimamizi Friendica Hifadhi ya Hifadhi ya Pamoja Pamoja na Central MariaDB kwa mfano. Ni hutoa zana kwa ajili ya makao kamili, mwongozo na moja kwa moja database reinitialization, barua pepe na jumla Configuration debugging, na michakato autoinstall, wote ili kuhakikisha yako Friendica Ufungaji bado ni wa kuaminika na rahisi kudumisha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Funkwhale using Docker. It orchestrates multiple services (including the API, Frontend, Celery Worker, Celery Beat, and Typesense) integrating with centralized PostgreSQL and Redis services for a fully containerized music sharing experience."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Funkwhale Kwa kutumia Docker. Inaunganisha huduma nyingi (Ikiwa ni pamoja na APImbele, mfanyakazi wa Celery, Celery Beat, na Typesense) Kuunganisha Centralized PostgreSQL Aidha, na Redis Huduma kwa ajili ya full containerized muziki kugawana uzoefu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys FusionDirectory on Docker Compose against the project's central `svc-db-openldap` server. The OIDC variant gates the FusionDirectory web UI through `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar for SSO; the LDAP variant relies on the same FusionDirectory binding to `svc-db-openldap` as its primary auth path. RBAC follows the LDAP group model that FusionDirectory already understands natively, so no glue layer is required for authorisation mapping."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa FusionDirectory Juu ya Docker Compose Kwa upande wake Mkuu wa Mradi `svc-db-openldap` ya server. Tofauti ya OIDC yafungua milango FusionDirectory Mtandao wa UI kupitia `web-app-keycloak`SSO-proxy sidecar kwa SSO; lahaja ya LDAP inategemea sawa FusionDirectory Kuwajibika kwa `svc-db-openldap` njia yake ya msingi. RPF yazindua mfumo wa EFD Group ambao ni FusionDirectory Tayari anaelewa asili, hivyo hakuna safu ya gundi inahitajika kwa ramani ya idhini."

# translated-by: libretranslate
