# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Joomla on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Joomla image that bakes in Composer for runtime extension builds, runs the Joomla CLI installer with the role's database, and installs the in-role `plg_system_keycloak` plugin so the site speaks OIDC against Keycloak with RBAC group mapping. A matrix-deploy variant flips the role to LDAP via Joomla's core LDAP authentication plugin instead."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Joomla Juu ya Docker ComposeInajenga tabia ya Joomla picha kwamba bakes katika Composer kwa ajili ya upanuzi runtime hujenga, anaendesha Joomla CLI installer na database ya jukumu, na kufunga in-role `plg_system_keycloak` Plugin kwa hiyo tovuti inazungumza OIDC dhidi ya Keycloak Kwa mujibu wa ratiba ya timu ya RBAC. Tofauti ya matrix-deploy hupunguza jukumu la LDAP kupitia JoomlaPlugin ya msingi ya LDAP ya uthibitishaji badala yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Joomla on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Joomla image that bakes in Composer for runtime extension builds, runs the Joomla CLI installer with the role’s database, and installs the in-role ``plg_system_keycloak`` plugin so the site speaks OIDC against Keycloak with RBAC group mapping. A matrix-deploy variant flips the role to LDAP via Joomla’s core LDAP authentication plugin instead."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Joomla Juu ya Docker ComposeInajenga tabia ya Joomla picha kwamba bakes katika Composer kwa ajili ya upanuzi runtime hujenga, anaendesha Joomla CLI installer na database ya jukumu, na kufunga in-role ``plg_system_keycloak`` Plugin kwa hiyo tovuti inazungumza OIDC dhidi ya Keycloak Kwa mujibu wa ratiba ya timu ya RBAC. Tofauti ya matrix-deploy hupunguza jukumu la LDAP kupitia JoomlaPlugin ya uthibitishaji wa LDAP badala yake."

