# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Keycloak in a Docker environment, integrating it with a PostgreSQL database and enabling operation behind a reverse proxy such as NGINX. It manages container orchestration and configuration via Docker Compose and environment variable templates, ensuring a secure and scalable identity management solution."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Keycloak katika mazingira magumu, kwa kushirikiana na PostgreSQL database na kuwezesha operesheni nyuma ya wakala reverse kama NGINX. Inasimamia orchestra ya chombo na usanidi kupitia Docker Compose na templates za mazingira ya kutofautiana, kuhakikisha ufumbuzi wa usimamizi wa utambulisho salama na hatari."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys LAM in a Docker environment and integrates it with an NGINX reverse proxy to provide secure access. It leverages environment variable templates to configure LDAP connection settings and administrative credentials, ensuring a smooth and customizable installation of LDAP Account Manager."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa LAM Katika mazingira ya Docker na inaunganisha na wakala wa nyuma wa NGINX ili kutoa upatikanaji salama. Inatumia templates za kutofautiana za mazingira ili kusanidi mipangilio ya uunganisho wa LDAP na sifa za utawala, kuhakikisha ufungaji wa laini na customizable wa Meneja wa Akaunti ya LDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys LM Studio as a headless model server in a single container, in both Docker Compose and Docker Swarm deployments. The server listens on port 1234 on the internal container network and is not published through the reverse proxy, while downloaded models and server settings persist in a dedicated volume. The role downloads its declared models at deploy time and the LiteLLM Gateway publishes them under the same aliases Ollama uses, so a consumer asks for one model name and reaches whichever backend the deployment provides."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa LM Studio Kama server isiyo na kichwa katika chombo kimoja, katika wote wawili Docker Compose Aidha, na Docker Swarm utekelezaji. Mtumiaji anatazama kwenye bandari 1234 kwenye mtandao wa ndani wa chombo na haukuchapishwa kupitia wakala wa nyuma, wakati mifano iliyopakuliwa na mipangilio ya seva inaendelea kwa kiasi cha kujitolea. Kamati hiyo imeainisha mikakati yake ya muda na LiteLLM Gateway Kuchapisha chini ya hali sawa Ollama Matumizi, hivyo mtumiaji anauliza kwa jina moja la mfano na kufikia yoyote backend kupelekwa hutoa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Listmonk using Docker, ensuring a robust and scalable setup for your newsletter management needs. Listmonk’s architecture supports a dedicated PostgreSQL database and integration with an NGINX reverse proxy for secure access. To configure and manage your instance, use the provided configuration files:"
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Listmonk Kutumia Docker, kuhakikisha kuanzisha imara na scalable kwa mahitaji yako ya usimamizi wa jarida. Mfumo wa Listmonk unaunga mkono kujitolea PostgreSQL database na ushirikiano na NGINX reverse wakala kwa upatikanaji salama. Ili kusanidi na kusimamia kesi yako, tumia faili za usanidi zinazotolewa:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys LiteLLM as a shared gateway container in Compose and Swarm deployments, backed by the central PostgreSQL service. The gateway is headless: it binds its HTTP port on the container host and claims no domain of its own, and the browser-facing surface is published separately by the LiteLLM Admin UI. It renders the model list from the interchangeable local backends available on the host, Ollama and LM Studio, and adds the OpenAI, Anthropic and OpenRouter entries whose API key is configured. Once the gateway is up, it provisions one virtual key per consuming application through the gateway admin API."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linatumia LiteLLM kama chombo cha lango la pamoja katika kupelekwa kwa Compose na Swarm, kinachoungwa mkono na kituo cha kati. PostgreSQL huduma. Mlango hauna kichwa: hufunga bandari yake ya HTTP kwenye mwenyeji wa chombo na inadai hakuna kikoa chake mwenyewe, na uso wa kivinjari unachapishwa tofauti na mwenyeji wa chombo. LiteLLM Admin UIInatoa orodha ya mfano kutoka kwa backends za mitaa zinazobadilishana zinazopatikana kwenye mwenyeji, Ollama Aidha, na LM Studiona kuongeza kasi ya ukusanyaji wa mapato na matumizi yake. API Msingi umewekwa. Mara baada ya lango ni juu, hutoa ufunguo mmoja wa virtual kwa matumizi kupitia admin lango API..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Mastodon using Docker, streamlining the installation and configuration of a full-featured social networking platform. Mastodon is built to support federation across multiple instances, offering robust content moderation, real-time updates, and flexible API integrations. Its advanced architecture includes separate services for the web frontend, streaming API, and background job processing, ensuring high performance and scalability for large communities."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Mastodon Kutumia Docker, kuboresha ufungaji na usanidi wa jukwaa kamili la mitandao ya kijamii. Mastodon ni kujengwa kwa msaada wa shirikisho katika matukio mbalimbali, kutoa ufanisi wa maudhui, updates halisi wakati, na rahisi API ushirikiano. Usanifu wake wa juu ni pamoja na huduma tofauti kwa frontend ya wavuti, Streaming API, na usindikaji wa kazi ya background, kuhakikisha utendaji wa juu na scalability kwa jamii kubwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Matomo using Docker, automating the setup of your analytics platform along with its underlying database. With support for health checks, persistent storage for configuration and data, and integration with an NGINX reverse proxy, Matomo is configured to provide reliable and scalable analytics for your digital presence."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Matomo Kutumia Docker, kuunda usanidi wa jukwaa lako la uchambuzi pamoja na database yake ya msingi. Kwa msaada wa hundi za afya, hifadhi inayoendelea ya usanidi na data, na ushirikiano na wakala wa reverse wa NGINX, Matomo Imeundwa kutoa analytics ya kuaminika na ya scalable kwa uwepo wako wa digital."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys MediaWiki using Docker, automating the setup of your wiki instance along with its underlying MariaDB database. It handles generating the essential configuration file (LocalSettings.php) from a seeded template and integrates with an NGINX reverse proxy for secure, efficient web access."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa MediaWiki Kutumia Docker, automating usanidi wa tukio lako la wiki pamoja na msingi wake MariaDB ya database. Inashughulikia kuunda faili muhimu ya usanidi (LocalSettings.php) kutoka kwa template iliyopandwa na inaunganisha wakala wa nyuma wa NGINX kwa upatikanaji salama wa wavuti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Mobilizon using Docker, automating the setup of your event management platform along with its underlying database. With support for health checks, persistent storage for uploads and configuration, and seamless integration with an NGINX reverse proxy, Mobilizon is configured to provide reliable and scalable event hosting for your community."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Mobilizon Kutumia Docker, automating kuanzisha jukwaa la usimamizi wa tukio lako pamoja na database yake ya msingi. Kwa msaada wa hundi za afya, hifadhi inayoendelea ya kupakia na usanidi, na ushirikiano usio na mshono na wakala wa reverse wa NGINX, Mobilizon Imeundwa ili kutoa mwenyeji wa tukio la kuaminika na la scalable kwa jamii yako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Moodle using Docker, automating the setup of both the Moodle application and its underlying MariaDB database. It integrates with an NGINX reverse proxy to ensure secure and efficient web access and uses persistent storage to safeguard your data and configuration."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Moodle Kutumia Docker, kuunda muundo wa wote wawili Moodle utekelezaji na msingi wake MariaDB ya database. Inaunganisha na wakala wa reverse wa NGINX ili kuhakikisha upatikanaji salama na ufanisi wa wavuti na hutumia hifadhi inayoendelea kulinda data yako na usanidi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Ollama as a local model server using Docker Compose. It integrates with Open WebUI for chat and Flowise for AI workflow automation, and configures local model caching so models can be reused across sessions or run fully offline."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Ollama Mfano wa mfumo wa uendeshaji wa seva kwa kutumia Docker ComposeInaunganisha na Open WebUI Kwa ajili ya chat na Flowise Kwa automatisering ya kazi ya AI, na husanidi caching ya mfano wa ndani ili mifano inaweza kutumika tena katika vikao au kukimbia kikamilifu nje ya mtandao."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenBao as an Infinito.Nexus application at ``openbao.<domain>``, behind the platform’s HTTPS reverse proxy. Humans sign in through Keycloak with OIDC and receive exactly the privileges their RBAC group grants; machines authenticate separately through AppRole. State lives in OpenBao’s own raft store on a persistent volume, and a static seal auto-unseals the node on every restart so no operator has to intervene after a redeploy."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa OpenBao Kwa kuwa Infinito.Nexus Maombi katika ``openbao.<domain>``, Nyuma ya wakala wa nyuma wa HTTPS. binadamu kuingia katika Keycloak na OIDC na kupokea upendeleo wao wa kikundi cha RBAC; mashine zinathibitisha tofauti kupitia AppRole. Hali ya maisha nchini humo OpenBaoDuka la raft mwenyewe kwenye kiasi kinachoendelea, na muhuri wa tuli wa auto-unseals node kwenye kila upyaji hivyo hakuna mwendeshaji anapaswa kuingilia kati baada ya redeploy."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenBao as an Infinito.Nexus application at `openbao.<domain>`, behind the platform's HTTPS reverse proxy. Humans sign in through Keycloak with OIDC and receive exactly the privileges their RBAC group grants; machines authenticate separately through AppRole. State lives in OpenBao's own raft store on a persistent volume, and a static seal auto-unseals the node on every restart so no operator has to intervene after a redeploy."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa OpenBao Kwa kuwa Infinito.Nexus Maombi katika `openbao.<domain>`, Nyuma ya wakala wa nyuma wa HTTPS wa jukwaa. binadamu kuingia katika Keycloak na OIDC na kupokea upendeleo wao wa kikundi cha RBAC; mashine zinathibitisha tofauti kupitia AppRole. Hali ya maisha nchini humo OpenBao's mwenyewe raft kuhifadhi juu ya kiasi kuendelea, na tuli muhuri auto-unseals node juu ya kila kuanzisha upya hivyo hakuna operator ina kuingilia kati baada ya redeploy."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenClaw as a gateway container behind the reverse proxy on its own canonical domain. Its compose service is pinned to the isolating runtime that the Kata & gVisor role selects for the host, its gateway configuration file is rendered from the role, and its state directory is kept in a persistent volume. Access is fronted by an OAuth2 proxy with Keycloak sign-in when Keycloak is part of the deployment."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa OpenClaw Kama chombo cha lango nyuma ya wakala wa reverse kwenye uwanja wake wa Canonical. Huduma yake ya kutunga ni imefungwa kwa muda wa isolating kwamba Kata & gVisor Jukumu linachagua mwenyeji, faili yake ya usanidi wa lango hutolewa kutoka kwa jukumu, na saraka yake ya hali imehifadhiwa kwa kiasi kinachoendelea. Upatikanaji ni mbele kwa OAuth2 Wakala pamoja na Keycloak Kuingia wakati Keycloak ni sehemu ya utekelezaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenCloud using Docker Compose in single-binary mode and exposes it under ``open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` through the central reverse proxy. It wires the deployment to the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC, sources users and groups from the central ``svc-db-openldap`` directory, and runs side by side with ``web-app-nextcloud`` so both file platforms can coexist on the same host. For identity wiring details see `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ and `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa OpenCloud Matumizi ya kutumia Docker Compose katika hali ya kawaida na kuweka chini ``open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` Kwa upande wake Meneja wa Interserver Bw. Inafungua njia ya kuingia kwenye akaunti Keycloak kupitia OIDC, vyanzo vya watumiaji na vikundi kutoka katikati ``svc-db-openldap`` kwa upande wake, na kwa upande wa ``web-app-nextcloud`` Kwa hivyo majukwaa yote mawili ya faili yanaweza kuishi kwenye mwenyeji mmoja. Maelezo ya utambulisho wa wiring `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ Aidha, na `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenCloud using Docker Compose in single-binary mode and exposes it under `open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` through the central reverse proxy. It wires the deployment to the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC, sources users and groups from the central `svc-db-openldap` directory, and runs side by side with `web-app-nextcloud` so both file platforms can coexist on the same host. For identity wiring details see [IAM.md](docs/IAM.md) and [LDAP.md](docs/LDAP.md)."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa OpenCloud Matumizi ya kutumia Docker Compose katika hali ya kawaida na kuweka chini `open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` Kwa upande wake Meneja wa Interserver Bw. Inafungua njia ya kuingia kwenye akaunti Keycloak kupitia OIDC, vyanzo vya watumiaji na vikundi kutoka katikati `svc-db-openldap` kwa upande wake, na kwa upande wa `web-app-nextcloud` Kwa hivyo majukwaa yote mawili ya faili yanaweza kuishi kwenye mwenyeji mmoja. Maelezo ya utambulisho wa wiring [IAM.md](docs/IAM.md) Aidha, na [LDAP.md](docs/LDAP.md)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Pi-hole as a containerized service within the Infinito.Nexus platform. Access is protected by OAuth2/Keycloak SSO, with RBAC enforced via OpenLDAP group membership."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweka Pi-hole kama huduma ya kontena ndani ya Infinito.Nexus ya jukwaa. Ulinzi wa OAuth2Kwa hivyoKeycloak kwa kushirikiana na RBAC kupitia OpenLDAP Kikundi cha ushirika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Pretix using Docker, automating the installation, configuration, and management of your Pretix server. It integrates with an external PostgreSQL database, Redis for caching and sessions, and an NGINX reverse proxy. The role supports advanced features such as global CSS injection, Matomo analytics, OIDC authentication, and centralized logout, making it a powerful and customizable solution within the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Pretix Kutumia Docker, automating ufungaji, usanidi, na usimamizi wa yako Pretix ya server. Inaunganisha na mtu wa nje PostgreSQL ya database, Redis Kwa ajili ya caching na vikao, na NGINX reverse wakala. Kazi inasaidia vipengele vya juu kama vile sindano ya kimataifa ya CSS, Matomo Uchanganuzi, Uthibitishaji wa OIDC, na logout ya kati, na kuifanya kuwa suluhisho la nguvu na la customizable ndani ya Infinito.Nexus mazingira."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Prometheus as part of the Infinito.Nexus stack using Docker Compose. It exposes the Prometheus web UI at ``prometheus.<domain>`` and protects it with SSO via Keycloak using oauth2-proxy. Universal logout is integrated for session termination."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Prometheus Kama sehemu ya Infinito.Nexus Matumizi ya Docker ComposeInabainisha kuwa Prometheus Mtandao wa UI ``prometheus.<domain>`` na kuwalinda dhidi ya ujangili. Keycloak Matumizi ya oauth2ya oksijeni. Universal logout ni jumuishi kwa ajili ya kumaliza kikao."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Prometheus as part of the Infinito.Nexus stack using Docker Compose. It exposes the Prometheus web UI at `prometheus.<domain>` and protects it with SSO via Keycloak using oauth2-proxy. Universal logout is integrated for session termination."
msgstr "Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Prometheus Kama sehemu ya Infinito.Nexus Matumizi ya Docker ComposeInabainisha kuwa Prometheus Mtandao wa UI `prometheus.<domain>` na kuwalinda dhidi ya ujangili. Keycloak Matumizi ya oauth2ya oksijeni. Universal logout ni jumuishi kwa ajili ya kumaliza kikao."

