# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys a centralized global stylesheet that overrides the default theming of web applications served via NGINX. It's optimized to run only once per deployment and generates a **cache-busting version number** based on file modification timestamps.   It includes support for **dark mode**, **custom fonts**, and **extensive Bootstrap and UI component overrides**."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweka stylesheet ya kimataifa ya kati ambayo inashinda utaftaji wa default wa programu za wavuti zinazotumiwa kupitia NGINX. Ni optimized kuendesha mara moja tu kwa kila kupelekwa na kuzalisha **Idadi ya Hifadhi ya Hifadhi** Kwa msingi wa mabadiliko ya faili timestamps. Aliongeza kuwa msaada wa **Njia ya Dark Mode**Kwa hivyo, **Fonti za kawaida**Aidha, na **Ukubwa wa Bootrap na UI Sehemu ya Overrides**..."

