# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys a self-hosted Bluesky stack on Docker Compose. It runs the official PDS container as the user-data layer, builds the upstream `@bluesky-social/social-app` web client as the user-facing UI, and adds an in-role login-broker sidecar that gates the web client through Keycloak via `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar. The broker auto-provisions PDS accounts for incoming OIDC users, holds the synthesised app-password AES-256-GCM-encrypted in a process-local cache, and drops a usable PDS session into the social-app's local storage so end users never see the synthesised credential."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha kujitolea Bluesky Juu ya stack Docker ComposeInaendesha chombo rasmi cha PDS kama safu ya data ya mtumiaji, hujenga upstream `@bluesky-social/social-app` Mteja wa wavuti kama UI inayoingiliana na mtumiaji, na anaongeza gari la ndani la kuingilia kuingilia ambalo linafungua mteja wa wavuti kupitia Keycloak Kwa kupitia `web-app-keycloak`Kwa upande mwingine, SSO-proxy. broker auto-provisions PDS akaunti kwa watumiaji zinazoingia OIDC, ana awali-password AES-password256-GCM-imefichwa katika cache ya ndani ya mchakato, na inaacha kikao cha PDS kinachoweza kutumika katika hifadhi ya ndani ya programu ya kijamii hivyo watumiaji wa mwisho hawaoni credential ya awali."

