# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys and configures the Roulette Wheel application using Docker Compose. It pulls the latest source code from a Git repository, builds a Docker image from a configurable Node.js base, and starts the application on a user-defined local HTTP port."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha na kuandaa Roulette Wheel Maombi kwa kutumia Docker Compose- Inaondoa msimbo wa chanzo cha hivi karibuni kutoka kwa A Git Hifadhi, hujenga picha ya Docker kutoka kwa configurable Node.js msingi, na kuanza maombi kwenye bandari ya mtumiaji-defined HTTP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys ejabberd on Docker Compose with the project's standard role-meta wiring. It binds ejabberd's `auth_method` to `svc-db-openldap` so XMPP clients authenticate against the project's central LDAP. The OIDC variant additionally loads `mod_oauth2_client` so a Keycloak-issued bearer token can be exchanged for an ejabberd session, but most XMPP clients still rely on SCRAM-SHA-256 over LDAP, which remains the interoperable default."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajitokeza katika Docker Compose Kwa upande wake Meneja wa mradi huo Bw. Inaunganisha ejabberd `auth_method` Kwa kuwa `svc-db-openldap` Hivyo basi kwa XMPP Wateja huthibitisha dhidi ya LDAP kuu ya mradi. Tofauti ya OIDC kuongeza mizigo `mod_oauth2_client` Kwa hivyo A Keycloak- Alama ya mchuuzi inaweza kubadilishwa kwa kikao cha kumwagilia, lakini zaidi XMPP Wananchi waendelea kunufaika na mradi wa SCRAM-SHA256 Kwa upande mwingine, LNG, ambayo bado ni default."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys ejabberd on Docker Compose with the project’s standard role-meta wiring. It binds ejabberd’s ``auth_method`` to ``svc-db-openldap`` so XMPP clients authenticate against the project’s central LDAP. The OIDC variant additionally loads ``mod_oauth2_client`` so a Keycloak-issued bearer token can be exchanged for an ejabberd session, but most XMPP clients still rely on SCRAM-SHA-256 over LDAP, which remains the interoperable default."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajitokeza katika Docker Compose kwa kutumia mfumo wa kawaida wa uendeshaji wa mradi. Inaunganisha ejabberd ``auth_method`` Kwa kuwa ``svc-db-openldap`` Hivyo basi kwa XMPP Wateja huthibitisha dhidi ya LDAP kuu ya mradi. Tofauti ya OIDC kuongeza mizigo ``mod_oauth2_client`` Kwa hivyo A Keycloak- Alama ya mchuuzi inaweza kubadilishwa kwa kikao cha kumwagilia, lakini zaidi XMPP Wananchi waendelea kunufaika na mradi wa SCRAM-SHA256 Kwa upande mwingine, LNG, ambayo bado ni default."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys n8n Community Edition using the upstream ``docker.n8n.io/n8nio/n8n`` image backed by a PostgreSQL database (consumed from the central ``svc-db-postgres`` via ``sys-stk-full``). Authentication is handled by an **oauth2-proxy** sidecar (Keycloak OIDC) in V1, or left to n8n’s own user-management UI in V2. n8n Community Edition does not support LDAP — it is gated behind n8n’s Enterprise license (``ldap.controller.ee.js`` is not registered in CE) — so no LDAP variant is offered. Credentials stored inside n8n are encrypted at rest with a stable ``N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY``."
msgstr "Mradi huu unatekelezwa n8Toleo la Jumuiya kwa kutumia Upstream ``docker.n8n.io/n8nio/n8n`` Picha zote na A PostgreSQL Database ya database (Kuchukuliwa kutoka Central ``svc-db-postgres`` Kwa kupitia ``sys-stk-full``). Uthibitisho unachukuliwa kwa mwaka **ya ya2ya ya okt** Upande wa nyuma (Keycloak OIDC) Ndani ya V1, Kwa upande wake, N8Usimamizi wa mtumiaji mwenyewe katika V2ya8Toleo la Jumuiya haliunga mkono LDAP - imefungwa nyuma ya n8Leseni ya Biashara ya N (``ldap.controller.ee.js`` Hakuna ada ya kuingia kwenye akaunti) Kwa hivyo, hakuna tofauti ya VPN inayotolewa. Waliozaliwa ndani ya n8N ni encrypted katika kupumzika na imara ``N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY``..."

