# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the OpenTalk stack using Docker Compose and exposes the web frontend at ``open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` through the central reverse proxy. It runs the Rust controller, the LiveKit WebRTC media server, the React web frontend, a dedicated Redis, a dedicated MinIO bucket for controller assets, a RabbitMQ broker, and the OpenTalk recorder for meeting MP4 archives. The deployment integrates with the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC and reuses ``svc-db-postgres`` and ``web-svc-coturn`` for relational data and STUN/TURN. For identity wiring details see `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ and `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha OpenTalk Matumizi ya Docker Compose na kufungua ukurasa wa mbele ``open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` Kwa upande wake Meneja wa Interserver Bw. Inaendesha mtawala wa Rust, seva ya vyombo vya habari vya LiveKit WebRTC, frontend ya mtandao wa React, kujitolea RedisMoja ya kujitolea MinIO kwa ajili ya matumizi ya fedha za kigeni, a RabbitMQ broker, na kwamba OpenTalk Mkutano wa wabunge4 ya nyaraka. Muungano unaunganisha pamoja Keycloak Kupitia kwa OIDC na matumizi ``svc-db-postgres`` Aidha, na ``web-svc-coturn`` Kwa data ya uhusiano na STUN/TURN. Maelezo ya utambulisho wa wiring `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ Aidha, na `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__..."

