# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role does NOT configure OIDC against ``web-app-keycloak``, LDAP against ``svc-db-openldap``, or any role-claim / LDAP-group RBAC mapping. Bridgy Fed authenticates users via their fediverse or atproto credentials at the source platform, not via local accounts. There is no local user table to bind an external IdP to, and no in-app authorisation tier to map a Keycloak role or LDAP group onto. Placing Bridgy Fed behind ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’s SSO-proxy sidecar would break inbound federation traffic and MUST NOT be done. This SSO and RBAC exception is documented per `lifecycle.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md>`__."
msgstr "Hatua hii haidhibitiwi na OIDC ``web-app-keycloak``, dhidi ya ``svc-db-openldap``, au alama yoyote ya jukumu / LDAP-kundi RBAC ramani. Kwa hiyo Fed inathibitisha watumiaji kupitia sifa zao za fediverse au atproto kwenye jukwaa la chanzo, sio kupitia akaunti za mitaa. Hakuna meza ya mtumiaji wa ndani kumfunga IdP ya nje, na hakuna kiwango cha idhini ya programu ya ramani Keycloak chama au chama cha upinzani. Kuweka Bridgy Fed Nyuma ya nyuma ``web-app-keycloak``SSO-proxy sidecar itavunja trafiki ya shirikisho la ndani na haipaswi kufanyika. Taarifa hii ya SSO na RBAC imechapishwa kwa `lifecycle.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md>`__..."

