# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs an NFS server in one of two flavors, the distro kernel server or userspace nfs-ganesha, selected per deployment. Both export the swarm state path to the resolved addresses of the ``svc-swarm-node`` group and to an additional CIDR allow-list; ganesha also exports the export base and squashes root there. Export options come from ``vars/main.yml`` for the kernel flavor and from the ganesha configuration template for ganesha. NFS server HA, Kerberos integration, and client-side mounting are out of scope; client mounts are handled by ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweka seva ya NFS katika moja ya ladha mbili, seva ya distro kernel au userspace nfs-ganesha, iliyochaguliwa kwa kupelekwa. Wote wawili wanauza njia ya serikali ya kundi kwa anwani zilizotatuliwa za ``svc-swarm-node`` Kikundi na kwa orodha ya ziada ya CIDR; ganesha pia inauza nje ya msingi wa kuuza nje na mizizi ya squashes huko. Chaguzi za nje zinatokana na ``vars/main.yml`` Kwa ladha ya kernel na kutoka kwa template ya usanidi wa ganesha kwa ganesha. Seva ya NFS HA, ushirikiano wa Kerberos, na kuongezeka kwa upande wa mteja ni nje ya upeo; mlima wa mteja hushughulikiwa na ``svc-storage-nfs-client``..."

