msgid "This role installs and applies dotlinker (doli) mappings (generic role)."
msgstr "Kazi hii inafungua na kutumia dotlinker (ya doll) Mipango ya (Majukumu ya kawaida)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures Git on the target system using the Pacman package manager (via the community.general.pacman module). In addition, it configures Git for the user by installing a custom git configuration using the [git-configurator](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator) tool. The role ensures that Git is installed and that the configuration tasks are run only once per host."
msgstr "Mfumo huu unaunganisha na kusanidi Git juu ya mfumo wa lengo kutumia Meneja wa Mfuko wa Pacman (Kwa njia ya community.general.pacman Moduli ya moduli). Aidha, imebainisha kuwa Git kwa mtumiaji kwa kufunga desturi git Configuration kutumia [Ufuatiliaji wa GPS](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator) ya matumizi. Jukumu hili linahakikisha kuwa Git Imewekwa na kwamba kazi za usanidi zinaendeshwa mara moja tu kwa kila mwenyeji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures Git on the target system using the Pacman package manager (via the community.general.pacman module). In addition, it configures Git for the user by installing a custom git configuration using the `git-configurator <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator>`__ tool. The role ensures that Git is installed and that the configuration tasks are run only once per host."
msgstr "Mfumo huu unaunganisha na kusanidi Git juu ya mfumo wa lengo kutumia Meneja wa Mfuko wa Pacman (Kwa njia ya community.general.pacman Moduli ya moduli). Aidha, imebainisha kuwa Git kwa mtumiaji kwa kufunga desturi git Configuration kutumia `git-configurator <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator>`__ ya matumizi. Jukumu hili linahakikisha kuwa Git Imewekwa na kwamba kazi za usanidi zinaendeshwa mara moja tu kwa kila mwenyeji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures Nginx HTTP and stream modules with performance-tuned defaults."
msgstr "Jukumu hili hufunga na husanidi mipangilio ya Nginx HTTP na moduli za mkondo na default za utendaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures VirtualBox and its kernel modules on Pacman-based systems, including extension packs and user group setup."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linasanidi VirtualBox na modules zake za kernel kwenye mifumo ya msingi ya Pacman, ikiwa ni pamoja na pakiti za upanuzi na usanidi wa kikundi cha mtumiaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending email notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the ``{{ system_service_id }}`` service and configures email parameters and templates using msmtp."
msgstr "Jukumu hili hufunga na husanidi vipengele muhimu vya kutuma arifa za barua pepe kupitia mfumo wakati huduma inaposhindwa. Aliongeza kuwa ``{{ system_service_id }}`` Huduma na usanidi vigezo vya barua pepe na templates kutumia msmtp."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending email notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the `{{ system_service_id }}` service and configures email parameters and templates using msmtp."
msgstr "Jukumu hili hufunga na husanidi vipengele muhimu vya kutuma arifa za barua pepe kupitia mfumo wakati huduma inaposhindwa. Aliongeza kuwa `{{ system_service_id }}` Huduma na usanidi vigezo vya barua pepe na templates kutumia msmtp."

