# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and maintains the Docker service, including Docker Compose, on Linux systems."
msgstr "Kazi hii inaimarisha na kudumisha huduma ya Docker, ikiwa ni pamoja na Docker Composekwenye mifumo ya Linux."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and maintains the Docker service, including Docker Compose, on Linux systems.   It is part of the [Infinito.Nexus Project](https://s.infinito.nexus/code), maintained and developed by [Kevin Veen-Birkenbach](https://www.veen.world/)."
msgstr "Kazi hii inaimarisha na kudumisha huduma ya Docker, ikiwa ni pamoja na Docker Composekwenye mifumo ya Linux. Ni sehemu ya [Infinito.Nexus Mradi wa Mradi](https://s.infinito.nexus/code), Imeandaliwa na kuendelezwa na [Kevin Veen-Birkenbach](https://www.veen.world/)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and runs the **cleanback** tool to automatically detect and remove **failed Docker backups**."
msgstr "Mradi huu unasimamia na kuendesha **Usafi wa nyuma** Chombo cha kugundua na kuondoa moja kwa moja **Msaada wa Docker**..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs caffeine-ng and configures it to autostart for preventing screen sleep on GNOME."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweka kafeini-ng na husanidi autostart kwa kuzuia usingizi wa skrini kwenye GNOME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs distro-specific equivalents of core build tooling so systems are ready for compiling software from source. After deploying this role, all common build dependencies are available on the system."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweka usawa maalum wa msingi wa kujenga vifaa hivyo mifumo iko tayari kwa kutengeneza programu kutoka chanzo. Baada ya kupeleka jukumu hili, utegemezi wote wa kawaida wa kujenga unapatikana kwenye mfumo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs or upgrades a Python package **system-wide** using the system ``pip`` (``python3 -m pip``). It is intended for CLI tools that should be available globally (e.g., maintenance utilities)."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweka au kuboresha mfuko wa Python **Mfumo wa jumla** Kwa kutumia mfumo ``pip`` (``python3 -m pip``). Inalenga zana za CLI ambazo zinapaswa kupatikana duniani kote. (Kwa mfano, huduma za kuhifadhi)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs or upgrades a Python package **system-wide** using the system `pip` (`python3 -m pip`). It is intended for CLI tools that should be available globally (e.g., maintenance utilities)."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweka au kuboresha mfuko wa Python **Mfumo wa jumla** Kwa kutumia mfumo `pip` (`python3 -m pip`). Inalenga zana za CLI ambazo zinapaswa kupatikana duniani kote. (Kwa mfano, huduma za kuhifadhi)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the CopyQ clipboard manager on Pacman-based systems (e.g. Arch Linux) and ensures it is started automatically for the current user."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha CopyQ Meneja wa clipboard juu ya mifumo ya Pacman (Maoni kwenye Arch Linux) Na kuhakikisha kwamba ni kuanza moja kwa moja kwa mtumiaji wa sasa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the CopyQ clipboard manager on Pacman-based systems (e.g. Arch Linux) and ensures it is started automatically for the current user."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha CopyQ Meneja wa clipboard juu ya mifumo ya Pacman (Maoni kwenye Arch Linux) Na kuhakikisha kwamba ni kuanza moja kwa moja kwa mtumiaji wa sasa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the KeePassXC desktop application on Pacman-based workstations through the system package manager. It is intended for personal-workstation roles in the desktop tier and does not configure databases, browser integrations, or autofill helpers."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha KeePassXC Maombi ya desktop kwenye vituo vya kazi vya msingi vya Pacman kupitia meneja wa mfuko wa mfumo. Ni lengo la majukumu ya kazi ya kibinafsi katika kiwango cha desktop na haisanishi database, ushirikiano wa kivinjari, au wasaidizi wa autofill."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the Nix package manager in a **secure, reproducible, and idempotent** way across multiple Linux distributions."
msgstr "Hatua hii inaimarisha usimamizi wa mfuko wa Nix katika **Kuwa salama na kucheza kwa uangalifu!** Kwa njia nyingi za usambazaji wa Linux."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the Nix package manager via pacman on Arch x86_64 or via the official installer with SHA256 verification."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweka meneja wa mfuko wa Nix kupitia pacman kwenye Arch x86_64 au kupitia kwa Mkurugenzi Mtendaji wa Halmashauri ya256 ukaguzi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the OBS Studio desktop application on Pacman-based workstations through the system package manager. It targets the desktop tier and does not configure scenes, capture devices, or streaming profiles."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha OBS Studio Maombi ya desktop kwenye vituo vya kazi vya msingi vya Pacman kupitia meneja wa mfuko wa mfumo. Inalenga kiwango cha desktop na haisanishi matukio, vifaa vya kukamata, au maelezo ya kusambaza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the SSH client packages required to enable secure remote access and key-based authentication on Linux systems. It ensures that the appropriate SSH client is installed depending on the target distribution and that the installation is executed only once."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweka vifurushi vya mteja wa SSH vinavyohitajika ili kuwezesha upatikanaji salama wa kijijini na uthibitishaji muhimu kwenye mifumo ya Linux. Inahakikisha kwamba mteja sahihi wa SSH imewekwa kulingana na usambazaji wa lengo na kwamba ufungaji unafanywa mara moja tu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [python-pip](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha [Pilipili ya nguruwe](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) mfumo wa malengo. Inahakikisha kuwa meneja wa mfuko wa pip inapatikana kwa kufunga vifurushi vya Python."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from `/etc/sudoers.d`."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha [ya sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) mfuko na kupeleka default sudoers faili ili kuhakikisha usalama na thabiti upendeleo kupanda kwenye mfumo lengo. Inatumia faili iliyosimamiwa ambayo inafuata mazoea bora na inajumuisha maagizo ya kusoma faili za kushuka kutoka kwenye faili. `/etc/sudoers.d`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the ``baudolo`` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via ``tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml``, which they include conditionally once ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` is in ``group_names``."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha ``baudolo`` CLI, inaweka mti wa salama wa mwenyeji, inapeleka huduma ya mfumo ambayo inaendesha kukimbia kwa mara kwa mara, na ina waya utegemezi wa kurudia-kushindwa kwa hivyo picha za sehemu hazihifadhiwa. Database seeding kwa programu binafsi ni mchango na majukumu ya watumiaji kupitia ``tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml``, ambayo kwa kawaida huhusisha mara moja ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` Ndani ya ``group_names``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `baudolo` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via `tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml`, which they include conditionally once `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` is in `group_names`."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha `baudolo` CLI, inaweka mti wa salama wa mwenyeji, inapeleka huduma ya mfumo ambayo inaendesha kukimbia kwa mara kwa mara, na ina waya utegemezi wa kurudia-kushindwa kwa hivyo picha za sehemu hazihifadhiwa. Database seeding kwa programu binafsi ni mchango na majukumu ya watumiaji kupitia `tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml`, ambayo kwa kawaida huhusisha mara moja `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` Ndani ya `group_names`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ mfumo wa malengo. Inahakikisha kuwa meneja wa mfuko wa pip inapatikana kwa kufunga vifurushi vya Python."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from ``/etc/sudoers.d``."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ mfuko na kupeleka default sudoers faili ili kuhakikisha usalama na thabiti upendeleo kupanda kwenye mfumo lengo. Inatumia faili iliyosimamiwa ambayo inafuata mazoea bora na inajumuisha maagizo ya kusoma faili za kushuka kutoka kwenye faili. ``/etc/sudoers.d``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via [sys-lock](../sys-lock/). The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) to keep the snapshot tree bounded and [user-backup](../user-backup/) so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweka script ya chelezo na huduma ya mfumo ambayo inaiweka kwenye ratiba iliyowekwa (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), na kutangaza mapambano dhidi ya makundi yote ya udanganyifu kupitia [sys-lock](../sys-lock/). Njia ya chanzo ni msingi wa usafirishaji wa NFS uliotatuliwa kutoka kwa [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) Huduma za SPOT; kupeleka jukumu kwenye mwenyeji anayehudumia usafirishaji. Kazi ya [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) Ili kuhifadhi mbegu za mbegu zilizopandwa, [user-backup](../user-backup/) Kwa hiyo, wakulima wanaweza kupanda mbegu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__. The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ to keep the snapshot tree bounded and `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweka script ya chelezo na huduma ya mfumo ambayo inaiweka kwenye ratiba iliyowekwa (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), na kutangaza mapambano dhidi ya makundi yote ya udanganyifu kupitia `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__. Njia ya chanzo ni msingi wa usafirishaji wa NFS uliotatuliwa kutoka kwa `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ Huduma za SPOT; kupeleka jukumu kwenye mwenyeji anayehudumia usafirishaji. Kazi ya `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ Ili kuhifadhi mbegu za mbegu zilizopandwa, `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ Kwa hiyo, wakulima wanaweza kupanda mbegu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node`` and probe-mounts the configured ``storage.nfs.server`` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweka vifurushi vya mteja wa NFS vinavyofaa kwa kila mwenyeji katika kikundi cha Ansible ``svc-swarm-node`` na kwa milomo ya wajeni, ``storage.nfs.server`` na msingi wa uzalishaji kutoka svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml Bonyeza hapa ili kuthibitisha ufanisi na ufanisi wakati wa kupeleka. Docker halisi kiasi milima hutokea baadaye, inaendeshwa na injini ya Docker katika kuanza chombo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node` and probe-mounts the configured `storage.nfs.server` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaweka vifurushi vya mteja wa NFS vinavyofaa kwa kila mwenyeji katika kikundi cha Ansible `svc-swarm-node` na kwa milomo ya wajeni, `storage.nfs.server` na msingi wa uzalishaji kutoka svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml Bonyeza hapa ili kuthibitisha ufanisi na ufanisi wakati wa kupeleka. Docker halisi kiasi milima hutokea baadaye, inaendeshwa na injini ya Docker katika kuanza chombo."

