msgid "This role optimizes storage allocation for Docker volumes by migrating volumes between SSD (rapid storage) and HDD (mass storage) based on container image types. It creates symbolic links to maintain consistent storage paths after migration."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaongeza ugawaji wa hifadhi kwa kiasi cha Docker kwa kiasi cha kuhamia kati ya SSD (Uhifadhi wa haraka) Kwa upande wa HDD (Hifadhi ya kuhifadhi) Kwa kuzingatia aina za picha za chombo. Inaunda viungo vya mfano ili kudumisha njia thabiti za kuhifadhi baada ya uhamiaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role owns the ``css`` service flag and declares ``web-svc-cdn`` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes. Consumer roles gate CSS-dependent surfaces on ``'web-svc-css' in group_names`` via their own ``meta/services.yml``. The role’s canonical domain 301-redirects to the CDN’s canonical domain so health probes against the CSS hostname return a valid response."
msgstr "Jukumu hili ni la ``css`` Bendera ya Taifa na kutangaza ``web-svc-cdn`` Kama upstream ambayo hutumikia CSS halisi. Watumiaji majukumu ya lango CSS-dependent nyuso juu ya ``'web-svc-css' in group_names`` Kwa njia yao wenyewe ``meta/services.yml``. Uwanja wa Canonical 301Inaelekeza kwenye uwanja wa kanuni wa CDN ili uchunguzi wa afya dhidi ya jina la mwenyeji wa CSS kurudi jibu sahihi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role owns the `css` service flag and declares `web-svc-cdn` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes. Consumer roles gate CSS-dependent surfaces on `'web-svc-css' in group_names` via their own `meta/services.yml`. The role's canonical domain 301-redirects to the CDN's canonical domain so health probes against the CSS hostname return a valid response."
msgstr "Jukumu hili ni la `css` Bendera ya Taifa na kutangaza `web-svc-cdn` Kama upstream ambayo hutumikia CSS halisi. Watumiaji majukumu ya lango CSS-dependent nyuso juu ya `'web-svc-css' in group_names` Kwa njia yao wenyewe `meta/services.yml`. Uwanja wa Canonical 301Inaelekeza kwenye uwanja wa kanuni wa CDN ili uchunguzi wa afya dhidi ya jina la mwenyeji wa CSS kurudi jibu sahihi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role performs a complete cleanup of Docker resources by invoking a systemd-managed script. It removes unused Docker images, stopped containers, networks, build cache, and anonymous volumes. The cleanup is fully automated and can run on a schedule or be triggered manually."
msgstr "Jukumu hili hufanya usafi kamili wa rasilimali za Docker kwa kutumia script iliyosimamiwa na mfumo. Inaondoa picha zisizotumiwa za Docker, kuzuia vyombo, mitandao, kujenga cache, na idadi isiyojulikana. Kusafisha ni kikamilifu automatiska na inaweza kukimbia kwenye ratiba au kuwa yalisababisha manually."

