# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a complete Nextcloud deployment using Docker Compose. It automates the setup of the Nextcloud application along with its underlying MariaDB database and configures the system for secure public access via an NGINX reverse proxy. The deployment includes automated configuration merging into ``config.php``, health check routines, and integrated support for backup and recovery operations."
msgstr "Sehemu hii inatoa jumla ya Nextcloud Matumizi ya Docker Compose· Inasimamia ujenzi wa Nextcloud utekelezaji pamoja na msingi wake MariaDB database na configure mfumo kwa ajili ya upatikanaji salama wa umma kupitia NGINX reverse wakala. Uunganisho wa moja kwa moja unajumuisha kuunganisha katika ``config.php``, afya hundi routines, na msaada jumuishi kwa ajili ya Backup na uokoaji shughuli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
