# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Those three ask whether the application is *served* over the self-signed CA. An application that only *calls* one has no domain of its own and would be skipped, so a service may declare ``ca_client: true`` and be answered on the deployment's TLS mode alone. Without it such a container verifies against an empty trust store and fails every outbound call at the TLS handshake."
msgstr "Watu hao watatu wanahoji iwapo maombi hayo *Kutumikia* kwa hisani ya RaiaMwema. Maombi ambayo tu *Wito wa wito* Mtu hana uwanja wake mwenyewe na ataruka, hivyo huduma inaweza kutangaza. ``ca_client: true`` Na jibu kwa njia ya kupelekwa kwa TLS pekee. Bila hiyo chombo kinathibitisha dhidi ya duka tupu la uaminifu na inashindwa kila simu ya nje kwenye mikono ya TLS."

