# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Three settings keys in `vars/main.yml` are silent no-ops on v6.2.0: `security.enable_captcha`, `security.captcha_key` and `security.captcha_secret`. The live `settings` table carries a single `security.captcha` object (`{\"altcha\": {…}, \"hcaptcha\": {\"key\", \"secret\", \"enabled\"}}`), so all three `UPDATE`s match zero rows and neither `ON_ERROR_STOP` nor the reaper notices. hCaptcha has therefore never been active, which also makes the `HCAPTCHA_SERVICE_ENABLED` rationale in `templates/playwright.env.j2` describe protection that is not there. Rewrite the three keys as one object, then decide whether a captcha on the public subscription form is wanted at all."
msgstr "Vipengele vitatu muhimu katika `vars/main.yml` Kuwa kimya juu ya v6.2.0: `security.enable_captcha`, Kwa hivyo, `security.captcha_key` Aidha, na `security.captcha_secret`. Maisha ya `settings` Bodi ya Mikopo yapandisha kodi moja `security.captcha` Mradi wa (`{\"altcha\": {…}, \"hcaptcha\": {\"key\", \"secret\", \"enabled\"}}`), Wote watatu `UPDATE`Mchezo wa soka na wala `ON_ERROR_STOP` wala kuwa na taarifa za uongo. Kwa hiyo, CCM haijawahi kufanya kazi, ambayo pia inafanya `HCAPTCHA_SERVICE_ENABLED` Ufafanuzi katika `templates/playwright.env.j2` na kutoa ulinzi ambao haukuwepo. Andika funguo tatu kama kitu kimoja, kisha uamue ikiwa captcha kwenye fomu ya usajili wa umma inahitajika kabisa."

