# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two controls stack. The actuating tools are named in ``tools.mutating``, and ``mutating_tools_enabled: false`` withholds them from every client’s include list, so an agent is offered ``GetDateTime``, ``GetLiveContext`` and ``todo_get_items`` only. Entity exposure bounds those: only entities exposed to Assist are reachable, and the role exposes none. Setting ``mutating_tools_enabled: true`` offers the actuating tools as well; entity exposure then decides what they can reach."
msgstr "Mbili za udhibiti. Majina ya wahusika yanatajwa katika ``tools.mutating``, Aidha, na ``mutating_tools_enabled: false`` Kila mteja ana orodha ya wateja, hivyo wakala hutolewa ``GetDateTime``, Kwa hivyo, ``GetLiveContext`` Aidha, na ``todo_get_items`` ya pekee. Ufichuzi wa ushawishi unafunga wale: vyombo tu vilivyofunuliwa kwa Msaada vinaweza kufikiwa, na jukumu hilo halionyeshi chochote. Kuweka ``mutating_tools_enabled: true`` Inatoa zana za kutenda pia; mfiduo wa chombo kisha huamua kile wanaweza kufikia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two controls stack. The actuating tools are named in `tools.mutating`, and `mutating_tools_enabled: false` withholds them from every client's include list, so an agent is offered `GetDateTime`, `GetLiveContext` and `todo_get_items` only. Entity exposure bounds those: only entities exposed to Assist are reachable, and the role exposes none. Setting `mutating_tools_enabled: true` offers the actuating tools as well; entity exposure then decides what they can reach."
msgstr "Mbili za udhibiti. Majina ya wahusika yanatajwa katika `tools.mutating`, Aidha, na `mutating_tools_enabled: false` Kila mteja ana orodha ya wateja, hivyo wakala hutolewa `GetDateTime`, Kwa hivyo, `GetLiveContext` Aidha, na `todo_get_items` ya pekee. Ufichuzi wa ushawishi unafunga wale: vyombo tu vilivyofunuliwa kwa Msaada vinaweza kufikiwa, na jukumu hilo halionyeshi chochote. Kuweka `mutating_tools_enabled: true` Inatoa zana za kutenda pia; mfiduo wa chombo kisha huamua kile wanaweza kufikia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two credentials, in two directions."
msgstr "Sifa mbili, kwa njia mbili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two decisions are worth naming. The rate is `concurrent_requests` requests per second with an equal burst and `nodelay`, rather than an eighth declared limit: a client allowed N calls in flight, each bounded by `timeout_seconds`, cannot sustain more than N/s unless every call returns instantly, so the rate is derived from the contract instead of being a number invented per role and drifting from it. And a refusal answers `429` rather than nginx's default `503`, because a client that should back off must not read the refusal as an outage. The location strips a trailing slash from the declared path so a request to the path without it cannot walk past the limits."
msgstr "Maamuzi mawili yanastahili kutajwa. Kiwango cha `concurrent_requests` Maombi kwa sekunde kwa kupasuka sawa na `nodelay`, badala ya nane alitangaza kikomo: mteja kuruhusiwa N wito katika ndege, kila amefungwa na `timeout_seconds`, haiwezi kuendeleza zaidi ya N / s isipokuwa kila simu inarudi mara moja, hivyo kiwango ni inayotokana na mkataba badala ya kuwa idadi zuliwa kwa jukumu na drifting kutoka hiyo. Majibu ya kukataa `429` Badala ya makosa ya nginx `503`, Kwa sababu mteja ambaye anapaswa kurudi nyuma haipaswi kusoma kukataa kama outage. Eneo linavua slash ya kufuatilia kutoka njia iliyotangazwa hivyo ombi la njia bila haiwezi kutembea nyuma ya mipaka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two discovery queries, keeping today's filter semantics: the priority line is queried on its own whitelist so priority roles run even when the diff-derived whitelist would not have selected them, and the regular line is queried on the effective whitelist with the priority rows withdrawn. Concatenated, they are the sweep's ordered candidate list. Both lists are selection tokens (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`): what a token pins narrows the row, what it leaves open the line decides as it always did."
msgstr "Maswali mawili ya ugunduzi, kuweka semantics ya kuchuja ya leo: mstari wa kipaumbele umewekwa kwenye majukumu yake ya kipaumbele ya kukimbia hata wakati orodha ya whitelist iliyosababishwa haikuwachagua, na mstari wa kawaida umewekwa kwenye orodha ya ufanisi na safu za kipaumbele zilizoondolewa. Kwa bahati mbaya, ni orodha ya wagombea waliochaguliwa. Orodha zote mbili ni ishara za uteuzi (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`): pins ishara nyembamba mstari, nini majani wazi mstari anaamua kama daima alifanya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two distinct meanings of \"bridge\" MUST NOT be conflated:"
msgstr "Maana mbili tofauti \"bridge\" Haipaswi kuchanganywa:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two further properties of the environment shaped the reconciliation design. Open WebUI stores tool servers in its own configuration and answers every later read with them, so a client that adopts that answer as the desired state leaves a newly declared provider registered nowhere and a rotated bearer registered stale, in both cases without a failure. And [`roles/web-app-openwebui/templates/env.j2`](../../../roles/web-app-openwebui/templates/env.j2) sets `ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false`, so API changes to environment-backed connection state are runtime state that has to be reconciled after every container restart."
msgstr "Mali nyingine mbili za mazingira ziliunda mpango wa maridhiano. Fungua WebUI huhifadhi seva za zana katika usanidi wake mwenyewe na hujibu kila baada ya kusoma nao, hivyo mteja anayekubali jibu hilo kama hali inayotaka huacha mtoa huduma mpya aliyesajiliwa mahali popote na mchuuzi aliyesajiliwa stale, katika kesi zote bila kushindwa. Na kwa kuwa [`roles/web-app-openwebui/templates/env.j2`](../../../roles/web-app-openwebui/templates/env.j2) Kuweka `ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false`, Kwa hivyo, kwa API Mabadiliko ya hali ya uunganisho unaoungwa mkono na mazingira ni hali ya muda ambayo inapaswa kuunganishwa baada ya kila chombo kuanza upya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two helpers, both pure: `_resolve_variant_payloads` picks the variant payload for each app in a round's include set, and `_bake_overrides` merges those payloads under `applications:` inside the `--vars` JSON the inventory provision step consumes. Caller-supplied `extra_vars` always win over the variant bake — that's the documented \"user vars always win\" rule."
msgstr "Wote wawili ni washirika wa kweli: `_resolve_variant_payloads` Chagua malipo ya lahaja kwa kila programu katika pande zote ni pamoja na kuweka, na `_bake_overrides` Kuratibu malipo hayo chini ya `applications:` Ndani ya `--vars` JSON hatua ya utoaji wa hesabu hutumia. Simu ya Mkono `extra_vars` Daima kushinda juu ya tofauti bake - hiyo ni kumbukumbu \"Wachezaji daima kushinda\" ya utawala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two host- and swarm-level facts constrain the design and are settled below: swarm's stack deploy drops the compose `runtime:` key, so the runtime has to become a node-wide default, and every deploy path in this repository runs inside a privileged container, so a hypervisor-backed runtime cannot be exercised here at all."
msgstr "Mambo mawili ya mwenyeji na ya ngazi ya makundi yanazuia kubuni na ni makazi chini: stack ya kundi la kuweka matone ya kutunga `runtime:` ufunguo, hivyo muda wa kukimbia unapaswa kuwa default kabisa, na kila njia ya kupeleka katika hifadhi hii inaendesha ndani ya chombo cha upendeleo, hivyo muda wa kukimbia unaoungwa mkono na hypervisor hauwezi kutekelezwa hapa kabisa."

