# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upgrade candidates MUST share the same depth (1 to 5 components) AND the same flavor as the current tag, so that ``5.4.5-php8.3-apache`` never silently bumps to ``5.4.6-php8.4-apache`` (different runtime) or to ``5.4.6`` (different depth). Everything that is not the number folds into the flavor: the leading channel, the trailing suffix and the patch letter. That is what keeps ``main-v1.77.7-stable`` away from ``main-v1.77.7-nightly``, ``stable-9646`` away from a bare ``9646``, and ``2.4.0p32`` ordering against ``2.4.0p33`` rather than against the four-component ``2.4.0.32``. Only the patch number joins the ordering key, so ``p9`` sorts below ``p10``."
msgstr "Wagombea wa ngazi ya juu wanapaswa kushiriki katika kiwango sawa (1 Kwa kuwa 5 Sehemu za sehemu) ya kisasa kama ilivyo kwa sasa, hivyo ``5.4.5-php8.3-apache`` Kamwe usiingie kwenye mtego ``5.4.6-php8.4-apache`` (Aina tofauti za kukimbia) au kwa ajili ya ``5.4.6`` (tofauti ya)Kila kitu ambacho sio idadi ya sahani katika ladha: channel inayoongoza, kipaza sauti cha kufuatilia na barua ya kiraka. Hiki ndicho ambacho kinaendelea ``main-v1.77.7-stable`` mbali kutoka ``main-v1.77.7-nightly``, Kwa hivyo, ``stable-9646`` mbali kutoka kwenye ``9646``, Aidha, na ``2.4.0p32`` Amri dhidi ya ``2.4.0p33`` na cherehani nne peke yake, tayari watu wanne wanakuwa wamepata ajira na ``2.4.0.32``. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . tu . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . ``p9`` Bonyeza hapa chini ``p10``..."

