# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "WHY IT BITES: `test-e2e-cli` runs in the destructor stage (`tasks/stages/03_destructor.yml`), i.e. after EVERY role of the play. A deploy that still carries the five providers therefore pays for matomo, dashboard and prometheus BEFORE the CLI test you are waiting for even starts. Dropping `disable=` does not only cost resources, it delays the evidence."
