# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Walk a (possibly nested) credentials schema and emit one vault block per scalar leaf into ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse into nested CommentedMaps so each leaf becomes its own vault-encrypted entry instead of being collapsed via ``str(dict)`` into a Python-repr blob (the regression that broke run 26428080957 jobs 77797371397 and 77797371442 for web-app-espocrm and web-app-listmonk)."
msgstr "Kwenda kwa moja (Inawezekana kuwa) Hati miliki ya schema na kutoa block moja ya vault kwa jani la scalar ``dest_node``« NEC yatoa maelekezo (ya g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) Recurse katika Maps ya Maoni yaliyohifadhiwa ili kila jani liwe kuingia kwake mwenyewe badala ya kuanguka kupitia ``str(dict)`` Ndani ya Python-repr blob (Mapinduzi ambayo yamegeuka kuwa 26428080957 Kazi ya ajira 77797371397 Aidha, na 77797371442 Kwa ajili ya web-app-espocrm Aidha, na web-app-listmonk)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Walk every `roles/*/meta/server.yml` and collect occupied CIDRs from `networks.local.subnet`."
msgstr "Kwenda kwa kila mmoja `roles/*/meta/server.yml` na kuchukua hatua za kinidhamu kutoka kwa `networks.local.subnet`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Walk every `roles/*/meta/services.yml` and collect ints under `<entity>.ports.<scope>.<category>` (across ALL entities and ALL roles)."
msgstr "Kwenda kwa kila mmoja `roles/*/meta/services.yml` Kukusanya taarifa za ndani `<entity>.ports.<scope>.<category>` (katika ngazi zote na majukumu yote)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Walk the inventory directory and collect every ``applications:`` block keyed by its source file path."
msgstr "Nenda kwenye orodha ya orodha na kukusanya kila ``applications:`` Imefungwa na njia yake ya chanzo cha faili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Walk the role tree to collect occupied ports and subnets."
msgstr "Kutembea mti jukumu kukusanya bandari ulichukua na subnets."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Walks the given directory, parses every ``playwright-junit.xml`` it finds, and prints a markdown table with one row per test case (app, test title, status, message) to stdout. The output is designed to be appended to ``$GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY``."
msgstr "Nenda kwenye orodha, chagua kila mmoja ``playwright-junit.xml`` Inapata, na kuchapisha meza ya alama na mstari mmoja kwa kesi ya mtihani (Programu, kichwa cha mtihani, hadhi, ujumbe) ya stdout. Mradi huo unatarajiwa kutekelezwa kwa ``$GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY``..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Walks the same edges the constructor's role set is built from, so a whitelist-scoped deploy and the full-inventory deploy agree on what a role depends on. The traversal itself lives in ``utils/roles/applications/in_group_deps``; this only exposes it to Ansible."
msgstr "Hutembea makali sawa ya jukumu la mjenzi linajengwa kutoka, kwa hivyo kupelekwa kwa whitelist-scoped na kupelekwa kwa uvumbuzi kamili kukubaliana juu ya jukumu linalotegemea. Maisha yenyewe yamo katika ``utils/roles/applications/in_group_deps``; Hii inadhihirisha tu kuwa ni dhaifu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Walks up from ``start`` (default: current working directory) until a ``.env`` is found; returns ``None`` if none exists in any parent."
msgstr "Kutoka juu kwenda juu ``start`` (default: saraka ya sasa ya kazi) Kabla ya ``.env`` kuwa; kuwarudisha ``None`` Ikiwa hakuna mtu yeyote katika familia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Walks up to ``limit`` recent runs because the very latest run on a branch is often a lint-only or skipped event with no deploy matrix."
msgstr "Kwenda juu ``limit`` Hivi karibuni anaendesha kwa sababu kukimbia hivi karibuni kwenye tawi mara nyingi ni tukio la lint tu au lililoruka bila tumbo la kupeleka."

