# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When ``tor_node`` is set (svc-net-tor deployed) and the URL's host is the ``primary_domain`` or a subdomain of it, swap that suffix for ``tor_node`` and force the ``http`` scheme (onion services are plaintext-only). Anything else — empty inputs, a host not under ``primary_domain``, an unparseable value — is returned unchanged, so the filter is a safe no-op on clearnet."
msgstr "Wakati ambapo wakati ``tor_node`` Kuwa tayari (svc-net-tor Waliopelekwa) Na mwenyeji wa URL ni ``primary_domain`` au kuadhimisha na kuvuka kutoka utoto kuingia utu uzima. ``tor_node`` Kwa nguvu ya ``http`` Mpango wa Mpango (Huduma za onion ni wazitext pekee)Chochote kingine - pembejeo tupu, mwenyeji si chini ya ``primary_domain``, thamani isiyoweza kulinganishwa - inarudi bila kubadilika, kwa hivyo chujio ni salama hakuna-op kwenye clearnet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When ``version`` is unset (no services value, no override), the lookup returns the bare ``<image>`` (unpinned) and emits a ``display.warning`` so the operator notices the unpinned reference without aborting the play."
msgstr "Wakati ambapo wakati ``version`` Kuwa unset (Hakuna thamani ya huduma, hakuna ziada)← Kuangalia nyuma ya pazia ``<image>`` (bila mpangilio) Kwa kuongeza A ``display.warning`` Hivyo operator anaona kumbukumbu unpinned bila kutoa mimba kucheza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `cli create role` scaffolds a new role, it prompts for `--clients N` and calls `cli contributing network address suggest --clients N --count 1` to fill in `meta/server.yml.networks.local.subnet` automatically. The contributor MAY override the suggestion interactively. See [port.md](port.md) for the matching ports flow."
msgstr "Wakati ambapo wakati `cli create role` kuwa na jukumu jipya, jambo ambalo linapelekea `--clients N` Kuwa wito `cli contributing network address suggest --clients N --count 1` Ili kujaza katika `meta/server.yml.networks.local.subnet` moja kwa moja. Mchangiaji anaweza kupitisha pendekezo hilo kwa ushirikiano. See ya [port.md](port.md) kwa ajili ya ujenzi wa bandari."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `cli create role` scaffolds a new role, it prompts for required port categories per service entity and calls `cli contributing network ports suggest --scope <…> --category <…> --count 1` per slot to fill in the entity's `ports` map. The contributor MAY override either suggestion interactively. See [address.md](address.md) for the matching subnet flow."
msgstr "Wakati ambapo wakati `cli create role` scaffolds jukumu jipya, inahimiza makundi ya bandari zinazohitajika kwa chombo cha huduma na wito `cli contributing network ports suggest --scope <…> --category <…> --count 1` kwa ajili ya kukamilisha ujenzi wa kituo hicho `ports` Ramani ya. Mchangiaji anaweza kuongeza maoni yoyote kwa ushirikiano. See ya [address.md](address.md) kwa ajili ya uzalishaji wa subnet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `container` is given, `log_path` is interpreted as a path INSIDE that container and read via `docker exec tail`. When `container` is None, `log_path` is read directly from the host filesystem."
msgstr "Wakati ambapo wakati `container` Kuwa tayari. `log_path` Inatafsiriwa kama njia ya ndani ya chombo hicho na kusoma kupitia `docker exec tail`. Wakati gani `container` Hakuna hata mmoja, `log_path` Inasomwa moja kwa moja kutoka kwa mfumo wa faili wa mwenyeji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `default:` is present, the credential generator MUST NOT generate a new value via `algorithm:`. It writes the literal `default:` string verbatim."
