# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT add a make target, script, or role task whose purpose is to generate, render, merge, or rewrite such a file."
msgstr "Haupaswi kuongeza lengo, script, au kazi ya jukumu ambalo lengo lake ni kuzalisha, kutoa, kuunganisha, au kuandika upya faili hiyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT add a target unless a human operator or CI should run it directly."
msgstr "Lazima si kuongeza lengo isipokuwa operator binadamu au CI lazima kukimbia moja kwa moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT add emojis to `docs/agents/` files, but workflow `name:` fields are not agent files and MUST use emojis."
msgstr "Hakuna haja ya kuongeza emojis `docs/agents/` kazi, lakini kazi ya `name:` Maeneo sio faili za wakala na lazima kutumia emojis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT add emojis to headlines in `docs/agents/` files, as these are machine-readable instruction files where emojis interfere with parsing."
msgstr "Huwezi kuongeza emoji kwenye vichwa vya habari `docs/agents/` Faili, kama hizi ni faili za mafunzo ya mashine-kusoma ambapo emojis kuingilia kati na parsing."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT add new `set_fact` variables that shadow or wrap existing `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_*` variables."
msgstr "Hakuna haja ya kuongeza mpya `set_fact` Aina ya kivuli au wrap zilizopo `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_*` mbalimbali."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT add regression tests that only verify that code, YAML, Jinja, or other source text is still present."
msgstr "Haupaswi kuongeza vipimo vya regression ambavyo vinathibitisha tu kwamba msimbo, YAML, Jinja, au maandishi mengine ya chanzo bado yapo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT assume that Act should be used automatically for workflow work. If the user agrees with the proposal, you SHOULD use `make act-workflow` for the iteration loop."
msgstr "Haupaswi kudhani kwamba Sheria inapaswa kutumika moja kwa moja kwa kazi ya kazi. Ikiwa mtumiaji anakubaliana na pendekezo, unapaswa kutumia `make act-workflow` kwa hisani ya RaiaMwema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT break a single sentence across multiple lines in `.md` files. Each sentence MUST stay on one logical line so readers see the full statement at once and reflowable Markdown viewers do not introduce stray line breaks. A new line in the source MUST mean a new sentence, a new paragraph, or a structural element (heading, list item, table row, fenced block); never a soft wrap inside one sentence."
msgstr "Huwezi kuvunja sentensi moja katika mistari mingi `.md` nyaraka. Kila sentensi LAZIMA kukaa kwenye mstari mmoja wa mantiki ili wasomaji kuona taarifa kamili kwa mara moja na watazamaji wa Markdown wanaobadilika hawaanzi mapumziko ya mstari wa kupotea. Mstari mpya katika chanzo lazima maana sentensi mpya, aya mpya, au kipengele cha muundo (kichwa, orodha kipengee, mstari meza, fenced block); Kamwe usiingie kwenye mtego wa nyoka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT close or skip a criterion that has not been explicitly verified, even if the implementation looks complete."
msgstr "Haupaswi kufunga au kuruka kipimo ambacho hakijathibitishwa wazi, hata kama utekelezaji unaonekana kamili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT commit automatically without explicit confirmation from the user. You MUST ask before committing."
msgstr "Lazima si kufanya moja kwa moja bila uthibitisho wazi kutoka kwa mtumiaji. Unapaswa kuuliza kabla ya kufanya kazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT commit during an active iteration, because a live deploy makes the pre-commit hook stash the files it reads. If a commit is unavoidable, you MUST pass `--no-verify`."
msgstr "Haupaswi kufanya wakati wa iteration ya kazi, kwa sababu kupeleka kuishi hufanya ndoano ya kabla ya kuweka stash faili inasoma. Kama huna uwezo wa kufanya hivyo, basi ni lazima `--no-verify`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT commit log files to the repository."
msgstr "Huna haja ya kufanya faili za kumbukumbu kwenye kumbukumbu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT create `group_vars/all/04_users.yml` or any similar generated users dictionary."
msgstr "Huwezi kuwaumba `group_vars/all/04_users.yml` au aina nyingine yoyote ya watumiaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT create `group_vars/all/05_applications.yml` or any similar generated applications dictionary."
msgstr "Huwezi kuwaumba `group_vars/all/05_applications.yml` au aina yoyote ya maombi yanayowasilishwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT debug from screenshots alone. Use raw logs."
msgstr "Huna haja ya kufuta kutoka kwa skrini tu. Tumia vifaa vya chuma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT delete the main branch"
msgstr "Si lazima kuacha kazi ya msingi"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT enter the inner loop unless all of the following hold:"
msgstr "Haupaswi kuingia kwenye kitanzi cha ndani isipokuwa yote yafuatayo yanashikilia:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT explicitly declare a documentation page as \"the SPOT\", \"Single Point of Truth\", or any equivalent self-label. SPOT status is conferred by readers cross-linking to the page from elsewhere, not by the page asserting it about itself. Describe the subject directly instead."
msgstr "Si lazima kueleza wazi ukurasa wa nyaraka kama \"Ukumbi wa\"Kwa hivyo, \"Sehemu moja ya ukweli\"au kitu kingine chochote cha kujivunia. Hali ya SPOT hutolewa na wasomaji wanaounganisha ukurasa kutoka mahali pengine, sio kwa ukurasa unaodai kuhusu yenyewe. Eleza suala moja kwa moja badala yake."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT fall back to `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` unless the reuse path has concrete evidence of a broken inventory or host stack, per [Compose Loop](compose.md)."
msgstr "Sio lazima kurudi nyuma `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` isipokuwa njia ya kutumia upya ina ushahidi halisi wa hesabu iliyovunjika au stack ya mwenyeji, kwa [Uwasilishaji wa Loop](compose.md)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT filter applications inside the lookup. The lookup returns the full set; filtering by enabled or allowed apps stays a caller concern (for example [applications_current_play.py](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/applications_current_play.py))."
msgstr "Huna haja ya kuchuja maombi ndani ya dirisha. Kuangalia inarudi seti kamili; kuchuja kwa kuwezesha au kuruhusu programu hukaa wasiwasi wa simu (Kwa mfano, kwa [applications_current_play.py](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/applications_current_play.py))..."

