msgstr "Lazima kuangalia matokeo na ukaguzi wa moja kwa moja katika programu ya kuendesha, si tu kwa kusoma faili JavaScript."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST choose the matching Pull Request template before you write a PR description."
msgstr "Unapaswa kuchagua template inayolingana ya Kuomba kabla ya kuandika maelezo ya PR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST classify each failure into one of two buckets:"
msgstr "Unapaswa kuainisha kila kushindwa katika moja ya ndoo mbili:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "You MUST cluster the downloaded logs by their shared failing task via `python -m cli.meta.ci.logs.analyze /tmp/logs/<child-run-id>`, then for each cluster you MUST perform static analysis of the repository code, the job logs, the downloaded artefacts, and any relevant external code until you are at least 99% certain of the root cause before you change anything. If the error class is a Playwright failure, you MUST follow [Playwright Failures](#playwright-failures) for the asset analysis before continuing."
msgstr "Lazima kuunganisha magogo yaliyopakuliwa kwa kazi yao ya kushindwa kwa pamoja kupitia `python -m cli.meta.ci.logs.analyze /tmp/logs/<child-run-id>`, Kisha kwa kila kikundi lazima ufanye uchambuzi wa tuli wa msimbo wa kuhifadhi, kumbukumbu za kazi, sanaa zilizopakuliwa, na msimbo wowote wa nje unaofaa hadi uwe angalau. 99Asilimia fulani ya sababu za msingi kabla ya kubadili chochote. Kama kosa ni kushindwa kucheza, unapaswa kufuata [Kushindwa kwa Playwright](#playwright-failures) Uchambuzi wa mali kabla ya kuendelea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST combine the matching `--color-XX-*` and `--color-rgb-XX-*` tokens in a way that is both meaningful and aesthetically coherent so semantic mappings, surfaces, gradients, borders, and overlays work together as one design system."
msgstr "Unahitaji kuunganisha kuunganisha `--color-XX-*` Aidha, na `--color-rgb-XX-*` Ishara kwa njia ambayo ni ya maana na aesthetically coherent hivyo semantic ramani, nyuso, gradients, mipaka, na overlays kazi pamoja kama mfumo mmoja wa kubuni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST commit only after all required checks pass."
msgstr "Unapaswa kufanya tu baada ya ukaguzi wote unaohitajika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST compare the implemented behavior against the rendered UI so missing hooks, duplicate handlers, broken selectors, and unexpected side effects become visible."
msgstr "Lazima kulinganisha tabia ya kutekelezwa dhidi ya ndoano zilizoachwa za UI, washughulikiaji wa duplicate, wateule waliovunjika, na athari za upande zisizotarajiwa zinaonekana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "You MUST consume tunable runtime parameters via strict substitution `${VAR:?Run 'make dotenv' to generate the .env single source of truth}`; the default lives in [default.env](../../../../default.env). Inline `${VAR:-default}` forms are forbidden and enforced by [test_no_default_substitutions.py](../../../../tests/integration/infrastructure/compose/test_no_default_substitutions.py)."
msgstr "Unapaswa kutumia vigezo vya kukimbia vinavyowezekana kupitia substitution kali `${VAR:?Run 'make dotenv' to generate the .env single source of truth}`; Kushindwa kuishi katika [default.env](../../../../default.env). Mtandao wa Inline `${VAR:-default}` Sheria hizo zimetungwa na kutekelezwa na [test_no_default_substitutions.py](../../../../tests/integration/infrastructure/compose/test_no_default_substitutions.py)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST cross-link from the implementing PR template back to the requirement file."
msgstr "Unapaswa kuunganisha kutoka kwa kutekeleza template ya PR nyuma kwenye faili ya mahitaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST cross-link from the requirement to any PR or issue that implements it."
msgstr "Unapaswa kuvuka kiungo kutoka kwa mahitaji kwa PR yoyote au suala ambalo linatekeleza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST debug from the live local output and local logs."
msgstr "Unapaswa kuondokana na uzalishaji wa ndani na magogo ya ndani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST declare each external value as a Docker `ARG` without a default value so the build always requires the value to be passed explicitly."
msgstr "Unapaswa kutangaza kila thamani ya nje kama Docker `ARG` Bila thamani default hivyo kujenga daima inahitaji thamani kupita wazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST define `APP_BASE_URL` consistent with the Entry Point rules in the contrib SPOT, in particular the dashboard routing rule when `services.dashboard.enabled` is set."
msgstr "Unapaswa kufafanua `APP_BASE_URL` sanjari na sheria za Entry Point katika eneo la uchafu, hasa kanuni ya uendeshaji wa dashibodi wakati `services.dashboard.enabled` kuwa imewekwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST describe only the current state of the subject. You MUST NOT carry historical context, migration notes, or comparisons to former implementations into documentation. Phrases such as \"this replaces X\", \"previously X did Y\", \"formerly known as X\", \"the legacy X\", or \"after the refactor\" MUST NOT appear in documentation. Readers arrive in the present and need to know how the subject works now, not how it used to work. Historical context belongs in commit messages, pull request descriptions, and changelogs, where it is anchored to a point in time and ages gracefully. Documentation that carries history rots as soon as the next refactor lands."
msgstr "Unapaswa tu kuelezea hali ya sasa ya suala hili. Haupaswi kubeba muktadha wa kihistoria, maelezo ya uhamiaji, au kulinganisha na utekelezaji wa zamani katika nyaraka. Mifano kama \"Hii inabadilisha X\"Kwa hivyo, \"Kabla ya X\"Kwa hivyo, \"Kabla ya kuwa X\"Kwa hivyo, \"Urithi wa X\"Kwa hivyo, au \"Baada ya uzinduzi\" Haikubaliki katika nyaraka. Wasomaji wanawasili sasa na wanahitaji kujua jinsi somo linafanya kazi sasa, sio jinsi ilivyofanya kazi. Muktadha wa kihistoria ni katika ujumbe wa kufanya, kuvuta maelezo ya ombi, na mabadiliko, ambapo imewekwa kwa hatua katika muda na umri kwa neema. Hati ambayo hubeba historia huoza mara moja kama ardhi inayofuata."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "You MUST determine the comparison branch automatically when possible (the PR base branch from `gh pr view --json baseRefName`, or the configured upstream from `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref @{u}`). If neither is available, you MUST ask the operator which branch to compare against before proceeding."
msgstr "Unapaswa kuamua tawi la kulinganisha moja kwa moja ikiwa inawezekana. (Ofisi ya Mkuu wa Mkoa kutoka `gh pr view --json baseRefName`, au kuadhimisha na kuvuka kutoka utoto kuingia utu uzima. `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref @{u}`). Kama hakuna inapatikana, lazima kuuliza operator ambayo tawi kulinganisha dhidi ya kabla ya kuendelea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST determine whether each failure is specific to the current branch or also reproduces elsewhere:"
msgstr "Unapaswa kuamua kama kila kushindwa ni maalum kwa tawi la sasa au pia huzaa mahali pengine:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST disable UI fields that are authored by OIDC or LDAP so users do not edit values locally that are managed by the identity provider or directory."
msgstr "Lazima kuzima mashamba ya UI ambayo yameandikwa na OIDC au LDAP ili watumiaji hawa hariri maadili ya ndani ambayo yanasimamiwa na mtoa huduma wa utambulisho au saraka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST document every new env var by adding the row below AND committing a one-line `# ...` comment above its key in [default.env](../../../../default.env)."
msgstr "Lazima hati kila env var mpya kwa kuongeza mstari chini na kufanya mstari mmoja `# ...` Maoni juu ya msingi wake katika [default.env](../../../../default.env)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST document in the test file why the check is external and what live dependency it contacts."
msgstr "Lazima hati katika faili ya mtihani kwa nini hundi ni nje na utegemezi wa kuishi unawasiliana."

