# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Logout terminates the OpenBao session and integrates with the `logout` service when enabled. *The integration half is done and verified: the deploy activates the logout proxy for the openbao vhost, injects the universal-logout code with its CSP hash, and includes openbao in `LOGOUT_DOMAINS`. The termination half is **not** asserted, and an attempt to assert it surfaced a finding now recorded in the README — navigating to `/ui/vault/logout` leaves the session intact (the UI returns to `/ui/vault/secrets`, since the Ember app restores its token from browser storage). Proving termination needs the UI's own logout control driven from an authenticated session, which the persona blocks make awkward; the assertion was reverted rather than left failing.*"
msgstr "[ ] Lowassa kumaliza muda wake wa OpenBao Mkutano huo na kushirikiana na `logout` huduma wakati wa kujifungua. *Nusu ya ushirikiano imefanywa na kuthibitishwa: kupeleka inaamsha wakala wa logout kwa vhost ya openbao, inaingiza msimbo wa simu ya ulimwengu na hash yake ya CSP, na inajumuisha openbao katika `LOGOUT_DOMAINS`. nusu ya mwisho ni **Sio ya** na kuahidi kuwa misamaha ya kodi itawekwa kwenye akaunti maalumu. `/ui/vault/logout` Mkutano huo ulihudhuriwa na (Umoja wa Ulaya warejea nyumbani `/ui/vault/secrets`, Tangu programu ya Ember inarejesha ishara yake kutoka kwa uhifadhi wa kivinjari). Kuthibitisha kusitisha inahitaji udhibiti wa uingizaji wa UI mwenyewe unaotokana na kikao kilichothibitishwa, ambacho kizuizi cha persona hufanya vibaya; madai hayo yalirudishwa badala ya kushindwa.*"

