msgstr "[ ] `README.md` nyaraka picha + sera ya bump, njia ya auth + pango ya mteja wake (Online michezo dhidi ya wote), uamuzi wa usimamizi wa vyombo vya habari, transcoding, na kubuni isiyo ya nje-DB."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` and the cookie hash/encryption secrets are generated once and persisted in the role's secret store (idempotent across redeploys)."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` na siri cookies hash / encryption ni yanayotokana mara moja na kuendelea katika kuhifadhi siri ya jukumu (Kuunganishwa kwa Redeploys)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seed a break-glass local admin (dedicated `breakglass` login + dedicated email, no collision with the SSO/LDAP identities) in **every** variant; no setup wizard is presented on first load. Its form login is reachable only when LDAP is disabled (Semaphore forces LDAP-only form auth otherwise)."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, Kwa hivyo, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, Kwa hivyo, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, Kwa hivyo, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` Jinsi ya kufanya Break-glass local admin (Kujitolea kwa kujitolea `breakglass` Ingia + barua pepe iliyojitolea, hakuna mgongano na vitambulisho vya SSO /LDAP) Ndani ya **Kila mmoja kila mmoja** Mchawi hayupo hivyo. Mfumo wake wa kuingia unapatikana tu wakati LDAP imezimwa. (Semaphore vikosi LDAP fomu tu auth vinginevyo)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT=postgres` plus `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB` are wired; when `services.postgres.shared=true` the role consumes the central `svc-db-postgres` (no per-role engine), else `sys-svc-rdbms` templates a per-role Postgres."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT=postgres` Zaidi ya `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB` wakati wa kujifungua; wakati `services.postgres.shared=true` Kamati hiyo inatekeleza mkakati wa `svc-db-postgres` (Hakuna Engine), Zaidi ya hayo, `sys-svc-rdbms` Kwa mfano, templates za postgres."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` is rendered as valid JSON (`keycloak` provider: `display_name`, `provider_url`=realm issuer, `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`)."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` Kama ilivyo kwa JSON (`keycloak` Mtumiaji: `display_name`, Kwa hivyo, `provider_url`Kwa kweli, `client_id`, Kwa hivyo, `client_secret`, Kwa hivyo, `redirect_url`)..."

