msgstr "[Wakala wa Hermes](roles/web-app-hermes/), Kwa hivyo, [Keycloak](roles/web-app-keycloak/), Kwa hivyo, [LiteLLM Gateway](roles/svc-ai-litellm/), Kwa hivyo, [OpenClaw](roles/web-app-openclaw/)"

