msgid "[Home Assistant](https://www.home-assistant.io/) is an open-source home automation platform that connects smart-home devices from many vendors behind a single local interface. It keeps device state, dashboards, and automation rules on the machine that runs it, and exposes them through a web interface, a REST API, and a built-in MCP server."
msgstr "[Msaidizi wa nyumbani](https://www.home-assistant.io/) Ni jukwaa la automatisering nyumbani la chanzo wazi ambalo linaunganisha vifaa vya smart-nyumbani kutoka kwa wachuuzi wengi nyuma ya interface moja ya ndani. Inaweka hali ya kifaa, dashibodi, na sheria za automatisering kwenye mashine inayoendesha, na inawaweka kupitia interface ya wavuti, REST APIna mfumo wa kompyuta wa MCP."

