msgid "[OpenBao](https://openbao.org/) is an identity-based secrets and encryption manager governed by the Linux Foundation. It stores application credentials, API keys, service and database credentials, automation and agent identities, short-lived tokens and encryption keys behind a policy engine, and can act as an internal certificate authority."
msgstr "[Fungua kinywa](https://openbao.org/) Ni siri za utambulisho na meneja wa encryption anayesimamiwa na Linux Foundation. Kuwasilisha nyaraka za maombi, API funguo, huduma na sifa za database, utambulisho wa automatisering na wakala, ishara za muda mfupi na funguo za encryption nyuma ya injini ya sera, na inaweza kutenda kama mamlaka ya hati ya ndani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
