msgstr "[Fungua kinywa](https://openbao.org/) Ni ngome ya Linux-Foundation inayomilikiwa na HashiCorp Vault: siri za utambulisho na meneja wa encryption na duka la KV, injini ya PKI, mbinu za kuziba auth na UI ya mtandao iliyojengwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/) is an open-source personal AI agent that runs on hardware you control. It ships a gateway process with a browser Control UI next to its CLI and TUI, keeps persistent memory and a workspace on disk, and performs browser and filesystem tasks inside its own sandbox."
msgstr "[Ufunguzi wa Akaunti](https://openclaw.ai/) Ni wakala wa AI ya kibinafsi ya chanzo wazi ambayo inaendesha kwenye vifaa unavyodhibiti. Inasafirisha mchakato wa lango na udhibiti wa kivinjari UI karibu na CLI yake na TUI, inaendelea kumbukumbu inayoendelea na nafasi ya kazi kwenye disk, na hufanya kazi za kivinjari na mfumo wa faili ndani ya sanduku lake la mchanga."

