# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admits only the Prometheus administrator RBAC group through the oauth2-proxy gate, so the `biber` persona is denied before it ever reaches a Prometheus page: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. That denial is not lost coverage — this role's own spec asserts it for every consumer, together with the admin reach and scrape-target parity checks. The `administrator` persona is blocked only when `services.sso.enabled` is false: without the co-deployed Keycloak there is no proxy in front of Prometheus, hence no login round-trip and no logout control to drive. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) kukubali tu kwamba Prometheus Mkurugenzi wa RBAC kupitia Oauth2Mlango wa mlango, hivyo `biber` Mtu hukataa kabla ya kufika. Prometheus Ukurasa: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Alisema kuwa `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. Kukataa hiyo sio kupoteza chanjo - specifikationer ya jukumu hili inathibitisha kwa kila mtumiaji, pamoja na admin kufikia na ukaguzi wa usawa wa lengo. Kwa kuwa `administrator` Mtu huyo anazuiliwa tu wakati `services.sso.enabled` Ni uongo, bila ya ushirikiano Keycloak Hakuna mtu aliye mbele ya PrometheusKwa hiyo, hakuna kuingia round-trip na hakuna udhibiti wa logout kuendesha. Kwa kuwa `guest` Mtu na madai ya msingi ya kufikia yanaendeshwa bila masharti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admits only the `web-app-lam` administrator RBAC group to the oauth2-proxy (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`), and `biber` carries an empty role list in the development inventory. The proxy denies `biber` before LAM is ever reached, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) kukubali tu kwamba `web-app-lam` Mkurugenzi wa RBAC kwa Oauth2ya ya okt (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`)Aidha, na `biber` Ina orodha ya nafasi tupu katika hesabu ya maendeleo. Wakala wakanusha `biber` Kabla ya kabla ya LAM Je, ni wakati wa kufikia? [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Alisema kuwa `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) declares no `sso` service, so this role is never registered as a Keycloak client. Its only HTTP surface is the anonymous logout conductor and the `/logout` endpoints proxied by [`templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2`](./templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2) — there is no login form, no account and no session to end. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The service's real coverage is per consumer: [`files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) parameterises the injected logout JS over `roles_with_service('logout')`."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) Alisema kuwa hakuna `sso` huduma, hivyo jukumu hili halijawahi kusajiliwa kama Keycloak wateja. Uso wake pekee wa HTTP ni conductor isiyojulikana ya logout na `/logout` Miradi iliyotekelezwa kwa [`templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2`](./templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2) Hakuna fomu ya kuingia, hakuna akaunti na hakuna kikao cha mwisho. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Hivyo basi, `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` Aidha, na `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Ufikiaji halisi wa huduma ni kwa watumiaji: [`files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) Kuunganisha logout iliyoingizwa JS juu `roles_with_service('logout')`..."

