# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[atmo.rsvp](https://atmo.rsvp) is an open-source, AT-Protocol-native event platform. Its defining property is that **events live on the user's account, not on the app**: an event is a `community.lexicon.calendar.event` record and an RSVP is a `community.lexicon.calendar.rsvp` record, both stored in the user's Personal Data Server (PDS) repo. The atmo app itself is \"just a view\" (an appview/aggregator) over those records, so RSVPs and events are portable across any app on the open social web."
msgstr "[atmo.rsvp](https://atmo.rsvp) Ni chanzo cha wazi, jukwaa la tukio la AT-Protocol-native. Sifa yake kuu ni kwamba **Matukio ya kuishi kwenye akaunti ya mtumiaji, si kwenye programu**Tukio ni moja ya `community.lexicon.calendar.event` Kwa mujibu wa R&B ni kuwa `community.lexicon.calendar.rsvp` Rekodi, zote zimehifadhiwa katika Data ya kibinafsi ya mtumiaji (PDS) kuwa repo. App ya WhatsApp yenyewe ni \"Maoni tu\" (Maoni / maoni) juu ya kumbukumbu hizo, hivyo RSSs na matukio ni portable katika programu yoyote kwenye mtandao wa kijamii wazi."

