# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[pr.sh](../../../../../scripts/github/update/open/pr.sh) reads `APP_SLUG` from the environment and resolves the App's bot user via `gh api /users/<slug>[bot]`. The resolved login and numeric user ID are written into `git config user.name` and `git config user.email` in the `<id>+<slug>[bot]@users.noreply.github.com` form that GitHub accepts for verified commits. When `APP_SLUG` is unset, the script falls back to the `github-actions[bot]` identity. That branch is reached only when the script is invoked outside the workflow, for example a local smoke test where the caller has set `GH_TOKEN` to something other than an App token."
msgstr "[pr.sh](../../../../../scripts/github/update/open/pr.sh) Kusoma kwa `APP_SLUG` kutoka kwa mazingira na kutatua mtumiaji wa bot ya App kupitia `gh api /users/<slug>[bot]`. Kitambulisho cha mtumiaji na nambari ya mtumiaji imeandikwa katika `git config user.name` Aidha, na `git config user.email` Katika `<id>+<slug>[bot]@users.noreply.github.com` Fomu ambayo GitHub inakubali kwa ahadi zilizothibitishwa. Wakati ambapo wakati `APP_SLUG` Baada ya yote, script inarudi. `github-actions[bot]` utambulisho. Tawi hilo linafikiwa tu wakati script inatumiwa nje ya kazi, kwa mfano mtihani wa moshi wa ndani ambapo mpiga simu ameweka `GH_TOKEN` Kitu kingine isipokuwa App App."

